window.PMPBANK = [{"qa":"توثق دراسة الجدوى احتياجات العمل وتحليل التكلفة والعائد الذي يبرر المشروع. أي مما يلي يصف بشكل أفضل مسؤولية مدير المشروع ضمن دراسة الجدوى للمشروع.","oa":["قد يقدم مدير المشروع توصيات للحفاظ على حالة عمل المشروع متوافقة مع أهداف وغايات المنظمة","إجراء تغييرات على دراسة الجدوى إذا لزم الأمر","قم بتحديث دراسة الجدوى في نهاية كل مرحلة","تطوير دراسة الجدوى للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":1,"q":"Which of the following best describes the project manager’s responsibility within the project feasibility study, which documents the business needs and the cost-benefit analysis that justifies the project?","t":"S","o":["The project manager may make recommendations to keep the project business case in alignment with the goals and objectives of the organization.","Making changes on the business case if necessary","Update the business case at the end of each phase","Development of the project business case"],"c":[0],"f":"A very important exam question:\nThe project manager does not update or modify business documents because they are not project documents; however, the project manager may provide recommendations to maintain their status.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Project Management Framework","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":112}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي سيكون نتيجة اجتماع تخطيط التكرار","oa":["قائمة بأولويات بنود سجل أعمال المنتج","هدف التكرار على النحو المتفق عليه من قبل مالك المنتج وأعضاء الفريق","الزيادات في المنتج","مربع أدوات التكرار مع لوحة العمل ومستودع التعليمات البرمجية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":2,"q":"Which of the following would be a result of a sprint planning meeting","t":"S","o":["A prioritized list of backlog items","A sprint goal as agreed upon by the product owner and the team members","An increment of the product","A sprint toolbox with the storyboard, code repository."],"c":[1],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nA sprint goal includes a description of what the product owner and the team have agreed to accomplish during the sprint. \n\nA sprint goal is among the artifacts produced during the sprint planning meeting. \n\nThe product owner then presents the updated backlog items during the sprint planning meeting. \n\nAgile Practice Guide - First Edition, Page(s) 154","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":113}},{"qa":"يمتلك مدير المشروع بالفعل فهمًا جيدًا لتوقعات المعنيين  في المشروع. ما هو الإجراء الذي يجب أن يتخذه مدير المشروع بعد ذلك للتخطيط الفعال للمشروع","oa":["تقييم الكفاءات المطلوبة مقابل توافر الموارد","تحديد ميزانية المشروع ومصادر التمويل","اكتشف الاحتياجات وقسمها إلى متطلبات","قم بإجراء اجتماع الأنطلاق مع الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":3,"q":"A project manager already has a good understanding of the expectations of the project stakeholders. What action should the project manager take next to effectively plan the project.","t":"S","o":["Assess required competencies against resource availability.","Determine the project budget and funding sources.","Discover needs and decomposes them into requirements","Conduct a kick-off meeting with the team."],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nWe can ask the question with another way to be easy, what is the next process after developing the project charter and identify stakeholders?..... The answer is to collect requirements..... The project’s success is directly influenced by active stakeholder involvement in the discovery and decomposition of needs into the project and product requirements and by the care taken in determining, documenting, and managing the requirements of the product, service, or result of the project.\n\n \n In project planning, after identifying stakeholders and resources, the PM should focus on collecting requirements. This involves determining what stakeholders need and breaking those needs into actionable requirements to define project scope and guide all future planning activities.\n \n\n🔑 Keywords\n\nRequirements Gathering – Stakeholders – Scope – Planning\n\n📚 PMI References \n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Ed: Section 5.2 – Collect Requirements (p.137–143)\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Ed: Planning Domain – Requirements Management\n \n \n PMBOK 6th edition Page, 140.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Scope","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":114}},{"qa":"في أي من أنواع العقود التالية يتحمل المشتري أقصى مخاطر التكلفة","oa":["التكلفة بالإضافة إلى رسوم الحوافز","استرداد التكلفة","المواد والوقت","السعر الثابت"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":4,"q":"In which of the following types of contracts does the buyer have the maximum cost risk","t":"S","o":["Cost Plus Incentive Fee","Cost Reimbursable","Time and Material","Fixed Price"],"c":[1],"f":"Domain : Business Environment \n\nIn a cost-reimbursable type of contract, the buyer has the maximum risk because the total cost of the project remains unknown. This is usually used when the buyer is not able to come up with a complete contract statement of work and has limited understanding.\n\n🔑 Keywords \n\nProcurement – Contract Risk – Buyer/Seller Risk – Cost Contract\n\n📚 PMI References \n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Ed: Section 12.1.3.2 – Contract Types (p.471–474)\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Ed: Procurement Models & Tailoring – Business Domain","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":115}},{"qa":"أرسل المشتري العرض إلى البائعين المحتملين. بعد بضعة أيام ، لدى بعض البائعين المحتملين أسئلة حول الشروط والأحكام. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، للتأكد من أن جميع البائعين لديهم فهم واضح ومشترك ، ما الذي يجب عليك فعله","oa":["عقد اجتماع واحد لواحد مع البائعين","إرسال توضيح للبائعين عبر البريد الإلكتروني","السماح لكل مورد بتقديم مستند توضيحات خاص به بشكل منفصل.","مؤتمر مقدمي العروض"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":5,"q":"A buyer sent the proposal (RFP) to the potential vendors. After a few days, some potential vendors have questions about the terms and conditions. As a project manager, to ensure that all vendors have a clear and common understanding, what should you do?","t":"S","o":["Conduct one- to-one meeting with vendors.","Send a clarification to the vendors via email.","Allow each vendor to submit their own clarification document separately.","Conduct a bidder conferences"],"c":[3],"f":"Domain : Business Environment \n\nAfter receiving a request for proposal (RFP) and prior to proposal submittal , some potential vendors have questions about the terms and conditions. SO the project manager should conduct a Bidder conference (also called contractor conferences, vendor conferences, and pre-bid conferences) this meeting between the buyer and prospective sellers prior to proposal submittal. They are used to ensure that all prospective bidders have a clear and common understanding of the procurement and no bidders receive preferential treatment. \n\n🔑 Keywords \n\nProcurement – RFP – Bidder Conference – Vendor Selection\n\n📚 PMI References\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Ed: Section 12.2.2.2 – Bidder Conferences (p.479)\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Ed: Procurement Practices – Tailoring Guidance\n \n \n PMBOK 6th edition page, 477.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":116}},{"qa":"يتم تعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع تطوير برمجيات رشيق لمؤسسة مصرفية كبيرة. مع بدء المشروع للتو ، تعرف مدير المشروع على أساليب القرصنة الجديدة التي تشكل تهديدًا محتملاً للامتثال التنظيمي للمشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك","oa":["تقديم طلب تغيير لتحديث خطة إدارة المخاطر","إرسال طلب تغيير لتحديث تقرير المخاطر","تحليل عواقب عدم الامتثال","مراجعة المخاطر خلال المشروع بأثر رجعي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":6,"q":"A project manager is assigned to an agile software development project for a large banking corporation. With the project just getting underway, the project manager has learned about new hacking tactics that present a potential threat to regulatory compliance for the project. What should the project manager do next.","t":"S","o":["Submit a change request to update the risk management plan.","Submit a change request to update the risk report","Analyze the consequences of non-compliance","Review the risks during the project retrospective"],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam \n\nAgile practitioners often view compliance as unnecessary overhead that does not deliver value to the customer. Therefore, the project manager may consider 'minimizing' resources (time, money, team members) allocated for compliance. However, to understand the appropriate amount of resources to invest in compliance activities, the project manager should first analyze the consequences of non-compliance.\n\n🔑 Keywords :\n\nAgile – Risk Report – Non-compliance – Team Behavior\n \n\n📚 PMI References \n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Ed: Section 11.7 – Monitor Risks (p.453–459)\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Ed: Delivery & Team Performance Domain (Agile Behavior Guidance)","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Governance","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":117}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لمشروع يكون لأعضاء الفريق فيه هيكل تقارير مزدوج. بالإضافة إلى تقديم التقارير إليك ، فإنهم أيضًا يقدمون تقاريرهم إلى مديرهم الوظيفي. أيضًا ، من المتوقع أن يقوم أعضاء الفريق بعمل المشروع جنبًا إلى جنب مع عمل القسم. أنت تعمل في أي شكل من أشكال التنظيم","oa":["وظيفي","معقد","مصفوفي","مبني على المشاريع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":7,"q":"You are the Project Manager of a project in which team members have a dual reporting structure. In addition to reporting to you, they also report to their functional manager. Also, the team members are expected to do the project work along with department work. You are working in which form of organization.","t":"S","o":["Functional","Complex","Matrix","Projectized"],"c":[2],"f":"These are the characteristics of a matrix organization where team members have dual reporting structure, and the teams work in their respective functional areas while performing project work. It simply denotes keeping the project team in the vicinity. Please refer to PMBOK® Guide - Sixth Edition, page 47.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":118}},{"qa":"يستخدم فريق رشيق لوحة كانبان لتتبع عملهم. أي مما يلي يعتبر مثالاً على العمل قيد التقدم","oa":["قصص المستخدم التي تنتظر الاختيار من قبل الفريق","قصص المستخدم التي تم اختبارها بالكامل وإصدارها في بيئة الإنتاج","قصص المستخدم المنشورة التي تحتوي على تعليمات برمجية تم دمجها بالفعل","قصص المستخدمين التي تحتوي على  تعليمات برمجية  في انتظار ملاحظات العملاء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":8,"q":"An agile team is using a Kanban board to track their work. Which of the following is considered an example of WIP","t":"S","o":["User stories that are awaiting selection by the team","User stories that have been fully tested and released to production","Deployed user stories that contain code that has already been integrated","User stories that contain code that is waiting for customer feedback"],"c":[3],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nIn Agile, and specifically in Kanban, Work In Progress (WIP) includes any item that has been started but not yet finished. This includes coding, testing, review, or feedback states. Items waiting for feedback are actively in progress and are still occupying team bandwidth and system flow.\n\nUser stories that contain code that is waiting for customer feedback are considered WIP. A user story awaiting feedback implies that work has begun on the story but has yet to be completed and deployed; therefore, it is still considered WIP .\n\n📚 Official References \n\n✅ PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n\n \n 📖 Section 6.6 – Control Schedule (focus on progress tracking)\n \n \n 📖 Agile Practice Guide (Annex to PMBOK 6):\n  → Chapter 5: \"Delivering in an Agile Environment\" – WIP limits and Kanban use (pages 58–61)\n \n\n✅ PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n\n \n 📖 Delivery Performance Domain\n  → Page 28–31 – Discusses flow-based work and WIP limits\n \n \n 📖 Tailoring Considerations for Agile: Transparency and flow\n \n\n✅ Agile Practice Guide (1st Edition):\n\n \n 📖 Chapter 5 – Kanban boards and WIP management (p. 58–60)\n \n \n 📖 Appendix X3 – Agile Practices Glossary (WIP and Flow)","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":119}},{"qa":"انتهى فريقك من تحديد المخاطر لمشروعك ويقوم الآن بتحليل جودة بيانات المخاطر. ماذا سوف نفعل بعد","oa":["تطبيق مصفوفة الاحتمالات والأثر","إنشاء خطة استجابة","تشغيل محاكاة مونت كارلو","إجراء تحليل الاحتياطي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":9,"q":"Your team has finished identifying risks for your project and is now analyzing the quality of risk data. What should be done next.","t":"S","o":["Applying a probability and impact matrix","Creating a response plan","Running a Monte Carlo simulation","Conducting a reserve analysis"],"c":[0],"f":"After identifying the risks and assessing the quality of risk data the project team should discuss the probability and impact of the identified risks, and assign a priority level using a probability and impact matrix – a technique used in the Perform Qualitative Analysis process. By completing this step, the project team can determine which of the identified risks have the highest priority and require further analysis and action.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":120}},{"qa":"في مؤسستك ، قام فريق إدارة المشروع بالتعاقد من الباطن مع شركة خدمات. تسمى عملية التأكد من أن أداء شركة الخدمة هذه يلبي المتطلبات التعاقدية","oa":["مراقبة المشتريات","خطة إدارة الخطر","إغلاق المشتريات","خطة إدارة المشتريات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":10,"q":"In your organization, a project management team has subcontracted work to a service company. The process of ensuring that this service company's performance meets contractual requirements is called","t":"S","o":["Control Procurements","Risk Management Plan","Close Procurements","Plan Procurement Management"],"c":[0],"f":"Control procurements is the process of managing procurement relationships, monitoring contract performance, and making changes and/or corrections as needed.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":121}},{"qa":"يقوم مشروع رشيق بالعمل على التكرار الخامس من أصل عشرة تكرارات . بعد مراجعة التكرار الأخيرة ، الفريق يتلقى ملاحظات من قسم الأمن حول اللوائح التي يتم بها المشروع يجب ان يتوافق مع المتطلبات . ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["اسأل أصحاب المصلحة عن أولوية هذه اللائحة","اطلب من مالك المنتج تضمين المتطلبات في سجل أعمال المنتج","اطلب من أعضاء الفريق تضمين المتطلبات في التكرار التالي","اسأل قسم الأمن للحصول على تفاصيل حول اللوائح","اطلب من أعضاء الفريق تحليل تأثير تضمين هذه اللائحة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":11,"q":"An agile project is running its fifth iteration out of ten. After the last iteration review, the team members receive feedback from the security department about regulations with which the project must comply with requirements. Which two actions should the project manager take? (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Ask the stakeholders about the priority of this regulation","Ask the product owner to include the requirements in the product backlog","Ask the team members to include the requirements in the next iteration","Ask the security department for details about regulations","Ask the team members to analyze the impact of including this regulation"],"c":[3,4],"f":"1- Ask the security department for details about regulations.\n\n \n\n2-Ask the team members to analyze the impact of including this regulation","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":122}},{"qa":"أثناء المراجعة والعمل على سجل أعمال المنتج، من المسؤول عن تمثيل مصالح المعنيين، مع ضمان أن تكون قيمة العمل منجزة","oa":["سكرام ماستر","مالك المنتج","الفريق","الممول"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":12,"q":"While reviewing and working on the product backlog, who is responsible to represent the interests of the stakeholders, and ensures the value of the work completed","t":"S","o":["Scrum Master","Product owner","The Team","Sponsor"],"c":[1],"f":"The Product Owner is responsible for maximizing the value of the product resulting from work of the Development Team. How this is done may vary widely across organizations, Scrum Teams, and individuals.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":123}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بإخطار الجهة الراعية للمشروع بأن استراتيجية التخفيف من المخاطر الرئيسية لم تنجح. يذكر الراعي أنه تم تنفيذ نفس الاستجابة للمخاطر قبل بضعة أشهر في مشروع مماثل بنفس النتيجة. كيف أمكن تفادي هذا الوضع","oa":["يجب أن يكون مدير المشروع قد بحث في مخزن الدروس المستفادة للمعرفة المكتسبة خلال المشاريع السابقة المماثلة","يجب أن يكون مدير المشروع قد بحث في سجل الدروس المستفادة للمعرفة المكتسبة خلال المشاريع السابقة المماثلة","كان ينبغي لمدير المشروع أن يطبق استراتيجية التجنب والاستجابة للمخاطر لأن المخاطر شوهدت من قبل في المشاريع السابقة","لا يمكن لمدير المشروع تجنب هذا الموقف لأنه من المستحيل تحديد فعالية الاستجابة للمخاطر مسبقًا"],"rat":null,"fa":"في هذه الحالة ، تم تنفيذ الاستجابة للمخاطر ووجد أنها غير فعالة للمشروع الحالي. كما اتضح ، تم تطبيق نفس الاستجابة للمخاطر خلال مشروع سابق مماثل وشهدت نفس النتيجة. لا يكفي اختيار استراتيجية الاستجابة للمخاطر ؛ يحتاج مدير المشروع أيضًا إلى التحقق من صحة الاستراتيجية من خلال التحدث مع الخبراء ، والبحث في البيانات التاريخية ، والبحث عن مشاريع مماثلة ، ومراجعة الدروس المستفادة ، وما إلى ذلك. في حين أنه من غير الممكن ، بدقة كاملة ، تحديد فعالية الاستجابة للمخاطر مسبقًا ، التجربة الماضية هي أفضل دليل. من المرجح أن يؤدي عدم مراعاة الدروس المستفادة من الماضي إلى تكرار نفس الأخطاء. يجب استيعاب المعرفة المكتسبة من المشاريع السابقة في مستودع الدروس المستفادة ، وقد تكون مراجعة المعلومات الموجودة في مستودع الدروس المستفادة قد حالت دون اختيار نفس الاستجابة للمخاطر الفاشلة للمشروع الحالي","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":13,"q":"A project manager notifies the project sponsor that the mitigation strategy for a major risk did not work. The sponsor states that the same risk response was implemented a few months ago on a similar project with the same result. How might this situation have been avoided","t":"S","o":["The project manager should have researched the lessons learned repository for knowledge gained throughout similar past projects","The project manager should have researched the lessons learned register for knowledge gained throughout similar past projects","The project manager should have applied the avoidance risk response strategy because the risk had been seen before in past projects","The project manager could not have avoided this situation since it is impossible to determine in advance the effectiveness of a risk response"],"c":[0],"f":"In this situation, a risk response was implemented and found to be ineffective for the current project. As it turns out, the same risk response was applied during a similar past project and experienced the same result. It is not enough to select a risk response strategy; the project manager also needs to validate the strategy by talking with experts, researching historical data, looking for analogous projects, reviewing lessons learned, etc. While it is not possible, with complete accuracy, to determine in advance the effectiveness of a risk response, past experience is the best guide. Failing to take into account the lessons learned from the past will likely lead to a repetition of the same mistakes. Knowledge gained from past projects should be captured in the lessons learned repository, and reviewing the information in the lessons learned repository might have prevented the same failed risk response from being selected for the current project.","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":124}},{"qa":"أثناء مرحلة التنفيذ ، يحدد مدير المشروع نشاطًا جديدًا للمشروع لن يؤثر على تاريخ انتهاء المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك","oa":["قم بتحديث سجل التغيير وتحديث خط الأساس للجدول الزمني","قم بتحديث خط الأساس للجدول وابدأ العمل على المهمة الجديدة على الفور","اطلب من الراعي الموافقة على النشاط الجديد.","قم بإنشاء طلب تغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":14,"q":"During the implementation phase, the project manager identifies a new project activity that will not affect the project end date. What should the project manager do next.","t":"S","o":["Update the change log and update the schedule baseline","Update the schedule baseline and Begin working on the new task immediately","Ask the sponsor to approve the new activity.","Create a change request."],"c":[3],"f":"Although the new project activity does not affect the end date of the project, but it may affect the scope baseline and the other project constraints, therefore the project manager should submit the change request first and take approval from CCB","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":125}},{"qa":"يتم إنهاء المشروع مبكرًا ، ويرسل مدير المشروع تقرير المشروع النهائي إلى المعنيين. يهتم المدير المالي بفهم التأثير ويطلب نسخة من التقرير. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع","oa":["قم بمراجعة خطة مشاركة المعنيين والتصرف وفقًا لذلك","لا ترسل التقرير لأن المشروع تم إنهاؤه قبل الأوان.","إرسال التقرير إلى المدير المالي.","تحقق من خطة إدارة الاتصالات وتصرف وفقًا لذلك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":15,"q":"A project is terminated early, and the project manager sends the final project report to relevant stakeholders. A finance manager is interested in understanding the impact and requests a copy of the report. What should the project manager do.","t":"S","o":["Review the stakeholder engagement plan and act accordingly.","Don’t send the report since the project was prematurely terminated.","Send the report to the finance manager.","Check the communication management plan and act accordingly."],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should Check the communication management plan and act accordingly because it contains Stakeholder communication requirements and Persons or groups who will receive the information.PMBOK 377.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":126}},{"qa":"أثناء اجتماع تخطيط التكرار، يبدو أن حجم العمل اللازم للوفاء بالعناصر التي يطلبها مالك المنتج أكبر من قدرة فريق التطوير. أي عمل أكثر منطقية","oa":["يطالب مالك المنتج بأن يعمل فريق التطوير لوقت إضافي لهذا التكرار فقط ، بشرط ألا يحدث ذلك مرة أخرى","يتعاون فريق التطوير و مالك المنتج  بهدف إزالة العناصر أو تعديلها.","قم بإلغاء التكرار","زيادة عدد التكرارات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":16,"q":"During the Sprint Planning Meeting, the amount of work necessary for fulfilling the items requested by the Product Owner seems greater than the Development Team's capacity. Which action makes more sense","t":"S","o":["The Product Owner demands that the Development Team work overtime just for this Sprint, provided this doesn't happen again.","The Development Team and Product Owner collaborate, with a view to removing or modifying items.","Cancel the Sprint.","Increasing the number of Sprints."],"c":[1],"f":"The Development Team and Product Owner collaborate, with a view to removing or modifying items.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":127}},{"qa":"بصفتك مدير مشروع ، أي من العمليات التالية مسؤولة عن التحقق من أن مخرجات المشروع جاهزة للفحص والقبول من قبل العميل","oa":["التحقق من النطاق","توجية وإدارة عمل المشروع","إدارة الجودة","التحكم في الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":17,"q":"As a project manager, which of the following processes is responsible for verifying that the project deliverables are ready for inspection and acceptance by the customer","t":"S","o":["Validate scope","Direct and Manage Project Work","Manage Quality","Control Quality"],"c":[3],"f":"A goal of the Control Quality process is to determine the correctness of deliverables. The results of performing the Control Quality process are verified deliverables that become an input to the Validate Scope process for formalized acceptance. PMBOK 6th edition, page, 305","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":128}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع كبير لتكنولوجيا المعلومات. يريد فريق أجايل الخاص بك تطوير معايير الجودة لمشروع ما. كيف يجب أن تدرب الفريق","oa":["أبلغ الفريق أن اختبار قبول المستخدم مطلوب للتأكد من أن مالك المنتج يقبل الحل.","الإصرار على تنفيذ التطوير المستند إلى الاختبار جنبًا إلى جنب مع الاختبار الآلي","تأكد من تقديم تعريف تم المنفذ عندما يوافق مالك المنتج على استيفاء جميع معايير القبول لقصة المستخدم.","حدد الأداة والتقنيات المناسبة للمشروع وتأكد من إجراء الاختبار مبكرًا وباستمرار."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":18,"q":"You are the project manager of a large IT project. Your Agile team wants to develop quality standards for a project. How should you coach the team","t":"S","o":["Inform the team that user acceptance testing is required to ensure that the product owner accepts the solution.","Insist that test-driven development is implemented along with automated testing.","Ensure that the definition of done DOD is provided when the product owner agrees that all acceptance criteria have been met for the user story.","Determine the tool and techniques suitable for the project and ensure that testing is done early and continuously."],"c":[2],"f":"Definition of Done is A team's checklist of all the criteria required to be met so that a deliverable can be considered ready for customer use. if the team wants to develop quality standards, the project manager should ensure that the definition of done DOD is provided when the product owner agrees that all acceptance criteria have been met for the user story.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":129}},{"qa":"أنت تستخدم منهجية تحسب مقدار التعويم على مسارات مختلفة في الرسم التخطيطي للشبكة لتحديد الحد الأدنى لمدة المشروع. ما الأداة أو التقنية التي تستخدمها.","oa":["طريقة المسار الحرج","تقدير حدودي","تقدير ثلاثي النقاط","طريقة السلسلة الحرجة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":19,"q":"You are using a methodology that calculates the amount of float on various paths in the network diagram to determine the minimum project duration. What tool or technique are you using.","t":"S","o":["Critical path method","Parametric estimating","Three-point estimating","Critical chain method"],"c":[0],"f":"The critical path method is used to estimate the minimum project duration and determine the amount of schedule flexibility on the logical network paths within the schedule model. A critical path is normally characterized by zero total floats on the critical path. [PMBOK 6th edition, Page 210].","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":130}},{"qa":"فريق رشيق مكلف بتطوير روبوت. يريد مدير المشروع التأكد من التصميم قبل بناء الروبوت الفعلي، يتلقى الفريق ملاحظات مبكرة حول المتطلبات ويعدل التصميم وفقًا لذلك. أي مما يلي يجب على مدير المشروع استخدامه لتحقيق هذا الهدف","oa":["نماذج أولية","مراجعة التصميم","حالة الأعمال","قوائم المراجعة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":20,"q":"An agile team is tasked with the development of a robot. The project manager wants to ensure that before the actual robot is built, the team receives early feedback on requirements and adapts the design accordingly. Which of the following should the project manager use to achieve that goal","t":"S","o":["Prototyping","Design review","Business case","Checklists"],"c":[0],"f":"Prototyping supports the concept of progressive elaboration in iterative cycles, such as those used on agile projects described in the scenario. When enough feedback cycles have been performed, the requirements obtained from the prototype are sufficiently complete to move to the design or build phase. PMBOk 6th edition Page, 147","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":131}},{"qa":"خلال اجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي ، حدد فريق أجايل مشكلة متكررة تسببت في تأخير دورة التطوير ، وبالتالي زيادة تكلفة المنتج. ما هي الأداة أو التقنية المحددة التي يجب أن يستخدمها أعضاء الفريق للوصول إلى السبب الجذري للمشكلة","oa":["تحليل السبب الجذري","خرائط تدفق القيمة","تكلفة التأخير","5 لماذا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":21,"q":"During a retrospective meeting, an agile team identified a recurring problem that has been causing a delay in their development cycle, consequently increasing the cost of the product. What specific tool or technique should the team members use to get to the root cause of the problem","t":"S","o":["Root causes analysis","Value Stream Mapping","Cost of delay","Five Whys"],"c":[3],"f":"The 'five whys' technique is commonly used by agile teams to get to the root cause of a problem.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":132}},{"qa":"انتاج البرامج أكثر من التوثيق الشامل ؟ هي واحدة من قيم بيان رشيقة الرئيسية. أي من نهج رشيقة التالية يساعد في تحقيق هذه القيمة","oa":["أجتماعات الوقفات اليومية","توثيقات المشروع والفريق","قياسات الأجايل","العروض التوضيحية والمراجعات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":22,"q":"Working software over comprehensive documentation? is one of the key Agile Manifesto values. Which of the following Agile approaches helps in achieving this value","t":"S","o":["Daily standups","Chartering the project and the team","Agile measurements","Demonstrations and reviews"],"c":[3],"f":"Agile teams use prototypes, demonstrations and reviews to understand and refine project scope which enables rapid delivery of a working product.\n[Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 97]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":133}},{"qa":"في نهاية التكرار ، يرفض مالك المنتج عناصر العمل التي تم تطويرها ويقدم ملاحظات. ما الذي يجب على فريق أجايل فعله لتجنب هذا الموقف في المستقبل؟","oa":["قم بجدولة جلسات تنقيح متكررة مع مالك المنتج لتوضيح معايير القبول","وثق ملاحظات مالكي المنتج في الجلسة بأثر رجعي","تأكد من حضور مالك المنتج لقاءات الوقوف اليومية لفهم الحالة الحالية","تأكد من أن مالك المنتج جزء من أنشطة فريق أجايل اليومية ويقدم ملاحظات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":23,"q":"At the end of an iteration, the product owner rejects the work items developed and provides feedback. What should an agile team do to avoid this situation in the future","t":"S","o":["Schedule frequent backlog refinement sessions with the product owner to clarify acceptance criteria","Document the product owners’ feedback in the retrospective session.","Ensure the product owner attends daily standups to understand the current status","Ensure the product owner is part of daily agile team activities and provides feedback."],"c":[1],"f":"The agile team should document the product owners’ feedback in the retrospective session. Retrospectives occur after every iteration and at the end of every project. Conducting a retrospective encourages the team to review what went well and what could have been done better. This assessment includes the work on the product, but also the processes, team dynamics, and other areas that influence the effectiveness of the team.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":134}},{"qa":"أي من شروط أجايل التالية تعني شرطًا متفقًا عليه ، عند استيفائه ، يعني اكتمال الميزة","oa":["تعريف تم","قيود القبول","حالة اختبار","قيود ثلاثية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":24,"q":"Which of the following Agile terms means an agreed-upon condition, when satisfied, means a feature is complete","t":"S","o":["Definition of done","Acceptance constraints","Test case","Triple constraints"],"c":[0],"f":"Definition of done (DoD) is a checklist of all the criteria required to be met so that a deliverable can be considered ready for customer use. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 151]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":135}},{"qa":".بدأ التكرار قبل يومين. لم يصل الفريق إلى توافق في الآراء بشأن كيفية معالجة ميزة المنتج قيد الإنشاء. كمدير للمشروع، ماذا يجب أن تفعل","oa":["زيادة سرعة الفريق","تقليل العمل قيد التقدم وزيادة الإنتاجية","زيادة العمل قيد التقدم والإنتاجية","تقليل العمل قيد التقدم والإنتاجية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":25,"q":"The sprint began two days ago. The team did not reach a consensus on how to address a feature of a product under construction. As a project manager, what should you do","t":"S","o":["Increase Team Velocity","Decrease WIP and increase Throughput","Increase WIP and Throughput","Decrease WIP and Throughput"],"c":[1],"f":"Very Important Question in Real Exam \n\nWhen a team cannot reach agreement and work is stalled, the best agile practice is to limit Work in Progress (WIP).\nThis allows the team to focus on fewer items, collaborate better, resolve blockers, and increase flow efficiency and throughput.\n \n\n📚 References \n\n \n PMBOK 6 (Agile Practice Guide)\n  → p. 58–61: \"Limiting Work in Progress\"\n  → p. 67: \"Improving flow and reducing delays\"\n \n \n PMBOK 7\n  → Delivery Performance Domain – Flow-based metrics (velocity, WIP, throughput)","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":136}},{"qa":"ما هو مفهوم الأجايل المستخدم لتمكين الفريق لاتخاذ القرارات والبقاء المسؤولية","oa":["التفكير المرن","التنظيم الذاتي","التنمية المستدامة","ادارة الأداء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":26,"q":"What agile concept is used to empower the team to make decisions and stay accountable","t":"S","o":["Lean Thinking","Self-Organization","Incremental development","Performance Management"],"c":[1],"f":"Self-organizing Teams: ** Not command and control. ** Responsibility delegated to the team. ** The team must be organized to deliver what is expected. ** The focus is on the overall team goal. ** Empower the team to make decisions and stay accountable.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":137}},{"qa":"يجب أن يقوم مستخدمو سكروم بشكل متكرر بمراجعة القطع الأثرية لـ سكروم والتقدم نحو هدف التكرار لاكتشاف الفروق غير المرغوب فيها. أي ركن من أركان سكرم يمثل هذا","oa":["الشفافية","الأسبرنت","الفحص","التكيف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":27,"q":"Scrum users must frequently review Scrum artifacts and progress toward a Sprint Goal to detect undesirable variances. Which pillar of Scrum does this represent","t":"S","o":["Transparency","Sprint","Inspection","Adaptation"],"c":[2],"f":"Scrum has 3 Pillars.\n\n1- Transparency Significant aspects of the process must be visible to those responsible for the outcome. Transparency requires those aspects be defined by a common standard so observers share a common understanding of what is being seen. For example: A common language referring to the process must be shared by all participants; and, Those performing the work and those inspecting the resulting increment must share a common definition of \"Done\".\n\n2- Inspection Scrum users must frequently inspect Scrum artifacts and progress toward a Sprint Goal to detect undesirable variances. Their inspection should not be so frequent that inspection gets in the way of the work. Inspections are most beneficial when diligently performed by skilled inspectors at the point of work. \n\n3- Adaptation If an inspector determines that one or more aspects of a process deviate outside acceptable limits and that the resulting product will be unacceptable, the process or the material being processed must be adjusted. An adjustment must be made as soon as possible to minimize further deviation.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":138}},{"qa":"أكمل فريق رشيق 9 قصص من أصل 10 للتكرار . خلال أجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي ، أشار عدد قليل من أعضاء الفريق إلى أنهم انتهوا من جميع قصصهم. ومع ذلك ، فشل أحد أعضاء الفريق في إنهاء القصة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل القائد الرشيق","oa":["اقترح أن يقوم الفريق بتعيين القصص في بداية التكرار بناءً على نقاط القوة لكل شخص لتحقيق أقصى قدر من الأداء","اطلب من الفريق معالجة هذا في التخطيط للتكرار التالي بدلاً من أجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي","أكد للفريق أن كل عضو مسؤول عن قصته ، لكن الفريق مسؤول بشكل جماعي عن إنهاء التكرار","اعمل مع مالك المنتج لإزالة القصة من التكرار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":28,"q":"An agile team has completed 9 out of 10 stories for the sprint. During the retrospective, a few team members pointed out that they finished all of their stories. However, one team member failed to finish a story. What should the agile leader do","t":"S","o":["Suggest that the team assign stories at the beginning of the sprint based on each person's strengths to maximize performance","Ask the team to address this at the next sprint planning instead of at the retrospective","Emphasize to the team that each member is responsible for their story, but the team is collectively responsible for finishing the sprint","Work with the product owner to remove the story from the sprint"],"c":[2],"f":"Emphasize to the team that each member is responsible for their story, but the team is collectively responsible for finishing the sprint","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":139}},{"qa":"في مراجعة التكرار لمشروع رشيق ، يتلقى الفريق تعليقات من أصحاب المصلحة يمكن أن تؤدي إلى تغيير في المنتج. ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["اسأل أصحاب المصلحة عن أولوية هذا التغيير","اطلب من الراعي الموافقة على طلب التغيير","اطلب من أعضاء الفريق تضمين التغيير في التكرار التالي","اطلب من أعضاء الفريق تحليل تأثير هذا التغيير","اطلب من مالك المنتج مراجعة سجل أعمال المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":29,"q":"In the iteration review of an agile project, the team receives feedback from the stakeholders that could result in a change in the product. What two actions should the project manager take? (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Ask the stakeholders about the priority of this change","Ask the sponsor to approve the change request","Ask the team members to include the change in the next iteration","Ask the team members to analyze the impact of this change","Ask the product owner to review the product backlog"],"c":[0,4],"f":"1- Ask the product owner to review the product backlog\n\n2- Ask the stakeholders about the priority of this change","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":140}},{"qa":"بدأ المشروع منذ 11 شهرًا وهو حاليًا قيد التكرار 12 من 15. وقد أدى الفريق أداءً جيدًا وأكمل جميع الإنجازات في الوقت المحدد. ومع ذلك ، بدأ بعض أعضاء الفريق في الشكوى من طول المشروع ، مما يخلق خطرًا على قلة الأداء في هذه المرحلة الحرجة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع كقائد خادم للتخفيف من هذه المخاطر؟","oa":["اتصل بالمدير الوظيفي للتأكد من أن تحفيز الفريق يظل مرتفعًا حتى نهاية المشروع","قم بتطبيق ضوابط إضافية على مخرجات المشروع لضمان تحقيق جميع المعالم في الوقت المحدد","اجتمع مع الفريق لتعزيز مسؤولياتهم والعواقب إذا لم تكتمل مخرجات المشروع في الوقت المحدد","حدد موعدًا لحدث جماعي مع راعي المشروع لتسليط الضوء على أهمية المشروع وتقدير عمل الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":30,"q":"A project started 11 months ago and is currently on iteration 12 of 15. The team has performed well and completed all deliverables on time. However, some team members are starting to complain about the length of the project, creating a risk for lack of performance at this critical stage. What should the project manager do as a servant leader to mitigate this risk","t":"S","o":["Contact the functional manager to ensure that team motivation remains high until the end of the project.","Apply additional controls to the project deliverables to ensure that all milestones are achieved on time.","Meet with the team to reinforce their responsibilities and the consequences if the project deliverables are not completed on time.","Schedule a team event with the project sponsor to highlight the importance of the project and recognize the work of the team."],"c":[3],"f":"Schedule a team event with the project sponsor to highlight the importance of the project and recognize the work of the team.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":141}},{"qa":"يقود مدير مشروع تطوير تطبيق مصرفي عبر الهاتف المحمول باستخدام نهج مختلط. يعقد الفريق اجتماعات يومية كل صباح يوم عمل. بسبب مشكلة غير متوقعة ، يتعين على 50٪ من الفريق العمل من المنزل. وجهت إدارة البنك الفريق إلى عدم القيام بمواقف شخصية يومية. يشتكي العديد من أعضاء الفريق من هذا الأمر ، قائلين إن هناك نقصًا في مشاركة المعلومات بين الفريق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع","oa":["اطلب من الإدارة العليا الإذن بعقد اجتماع شخصي للفريق مرة واحدة كل أسبوع","قم بتأجيل الوقفات اليومية واطلب من أعضاء الفريق تحديث مدير المشروع يوميًا عبر الرسائل","إجراء وقفات افتراضية يومية كل صباح يوم عمل واستخدم أدوات التعاون لإدارة تحديثات المشروع","تفويض السلطة لأعضاء الفريق واطلب منهم تقديم تقارير الحالة الأسبوعية بدلاً من ذلك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":31,"q":"A project manager is leading the development of a mobile banking application using hybrid approach. The team has been holding daily standup meetings each workday morning. Due to an unexpected issue 50 % of the team has to work from home. The bank’s management directed the team not to have in –person daily standups. Various team members are complaining about this, stating that there is a lack of information sharing among the team. What should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Ask senior management for permission to hold in –person team meeting once each week","Postpone the daily standups and ask the team members to update the project manager daily via messaging.","Hold virtual daily standups each workday morning and use collaboration tools to manage project updates","Delegate authority to the team members and ask them to submit weekly status reports instead"],"c":[2],"f":"Daily standup meetings are required even if the team is not located in one geographical area","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":142}},{"qa":"بغض النظر عن حجم وتعقيد المشروع ، أي مما يلي يوفر منصة لفريق أجايل للتعرف على عملياته وتحسينها وتكييفها؟","oa":["سباقات السرعة","القائد الخادم","التقيمات بأثر رجعي","مالك المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":32,"q":"Regardless of the size and complexity of a project, which of the following provides a platform to an Agile team to learn about, improve, and adapt its processes","t":"S","o":["Sprints","Servant-leader","Retrospectives","Product owner"],"c":[2],"f":"Retrospectives allow Agile teams to learn about, improve, and adapt their processes. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 50]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":143}},{"qa":"طُلب من مدير المشروع تقديم إشارة إلى الوقت المتبقي في مشروع رشيق. ما هي الأدوات التي يمكن استخدامها لتوفير هذه المعلومات؟","oa":["تحليل وثيقة متطلبات العمل","مخطط الأحتراق/ الأنهيار (التوقف)","نقاط القصة لقصص المستخدم المتبقي","مخطط باريتو"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":33,"q":"A project manager was asked to provide an indication of the time remaining on an agile project. What tools can be used to provide this information?","t":"S","o":["Analysis of the business requirements document","A release burndown chart","Story points for the remaining user stories","Pareto chart"],"c":[1],"f":"A burndown chart is a simple tool that tracks a team’s work progress against the amount of time remaining to complete the work. The chart shows the ideal rate of effort needed to reach work completion by a set date. Using a burndown chart helps you:\n\nCommunicate progress\nTrack remaining work\nPlan for future events\nReach work completion on time","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":144}},{"qa":"نظرًا للتعقيد وعدد المتطلبات ، فأنت بحاجة إلى شخص ما ليوفر التوجيه التوجيهي وتحديد أولويات المتطلبات. من الناحية المثالية ، يجب أن يعمل هذا الدور مع فريق المشروع وتقديم ملاحظات المنتج ، وتحديد الاتجاه للوظيفة التالية التي سيتم تسليمها. في الاجايل ، يسمى هذا الدور","oa":["القائد الخادم","مالك المنتج","سكرام ماستر","فريق متعدد المهارات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":34,"q":"Due to the complexity and the number of requirements, you need someone to provide the guiding direction and requirements prioritization. Ideally, this role should work with the project team and provide product feedback, and set direction on the next piece of functionality to be delivered. In Agile, this role is called","t":"S","o":["Servant leader","Product owner","Scrum master","Cross -functional team member"],"c":[1],"f":"The product owner is responsible for guiding the direction of the product. Product owners rank the work based on its business value. Product owners work with their teams by providing product feedback and setting direction on the next piece of functionality to be delivered. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 41]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":145}},{"qa":"في مشروع رشيق ، يجد مدير المشروع أن أعضاء الفريق يشاركون في عدة مشاريع مختلفة بسبب قيود الميزانية. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ماذا يجب أن تفعل؟","oa":["تبادل الأفكار مع أعضاء الفريق حول كيفية تنفيذ مشاريع متعددة ضمن الميزانية المحددة","اطلب من راعي المشروع تحديد الأولويات وإذا لزم الأمر ، قم بتخصيص ميزانية إضافية حتى يتمكن الفريق من العمل في مشروع واحد","اطلب من أعضاء الفريق أن يتوزعوا بالتساوي عبر المشاريع حتى لا تحدث أخطاء ضمن الميزانية الحالية","قدم خطة حوافز حتى يعمل أعضاء الفريق لساعات غير محسوبة أكثر في مشاريع متعددة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":35,"q":"In an agile project, the project manager finds that the team members are involved in several Different projects due to budget constraints. As a project manager, what should you do.","t":"S","o":["Brainstorm with the team members on how they can deliver on multiple projects within the given budget","Request the project sponsor prioritize and if necessary, allocate additional budget so the team can work on a single project","Instruct the team members to spread evenly across projects so mistakes will not occur within the current budget","Provide an incentive plan so the team members will work more unaccounted hours on multiple projects"],"c":[1],"f":"The agile team should work on a single project. SO the project manager should Request the project sponsor to prioritize and if necessary, allocate additional budget so the team can work on a single project.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":146}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي عبارة عن هيكل تنظيمي يركز على تدفق القيمة للعملاء من خلال تقديم منتجات أو خدمات معينة؟","oa":["قيمة الأعمال","نموذج كانو","مخطط باريتو","تدفق القيمة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":36,"q":"Which of the following is an organizational construct that focuses on the flow of value to customers through the delivery of specific products or services","t":"S","o":["Business Value","Kano Model","Pareto Chart","Value Stream"],"c":[3],"f":"Value Stream is an organizational construct that focuses on the flow of value to customers through the delivery of specific products or services. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 154]","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":147}},{"qa":"يقدر أعضاء فريق الأجايل المدة التي سيستغرقها تطوير ميزات لتطبيق جديد دون القلق بشأن الدقة. يشعر عضو الفريق الجديد بالقلق من أن نقص التخطيط الآن قد يتسبب في مشاكل في الجدولة لاحقًا. ما هي أفضل نصيحة يمكن للممارس الرشيق أن يقدمها لعضو الفريق الجديد بشأن الحجم الرشيق وتقدير مدة المشروع؟","oa":["يتم تحديد مدة المشروع باستخدام تقدير من أسفل إلى أعلى من خلال إضافة مدة المهام التي تضم قصص المستخدم","بمجرد إنشاء السرعة، سيتحدد إجمالي عدد نقاط القصة  المنقسمة حسب السرعة على مدة المشروع","يمكن تحديد مدة المشروع عن طريق إضافة عدد نقاط القصة التي أكملها الفريق في كل تكرار","لتحديد مدة المشروع، يجب حساب السرعة قبل بدء التكرار الأول"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":37,"q":"Agile team members are estimating how long it would take to develop features for a new application without being overly concerned about accuracy. A new team member is concerned that a lack of planning now would cause scheduling problems later on. What is the best advice that the agile practitioner can give to this new team member on agile sizing and estimating the project duration","t":"S","o":["Project duration is determined using bottom-up estimating by adding up the duration of the tasks comprising the user stories","Once the velocity is established, the total amount of story points divided by velocity will determine the project duration","The project duration can be determined by adding the number of story points completed by the team in each iteration.","To determine the project duration , velocity should be calculated prior to the start of the first iteration."],"c":[1],"f":"Hint: In Agile, project duration cannot be accurately estimated up front. Rather, it can be derived from observing the team performance and knowing the total amount of story points. \"The duration of a project is not estimated as much as it is derived by taking the total number of story points and dividing it by the velocity of the team.\" Velocity can be roughly estimated at the beginning of the project if the project uses the same team, same (or similar) technologies, and other team and project attributes that are same or similar to the previously completed projects. If the velocity cannot be estimated based on those factors, it should be observed during the first two to three iterations. Once the velocity is established and the total amount of the story points is known, this amount can be divided by the current team's velocity to arrive at how many iterations it will take for the team to complete the project work. Iterations are time-boxed intervals, for example, two weeks. Knowing the number of the iterations, the team will be able to tell how long the project will take. For example, with ten 2-week iterations, the project duration will be 20 weeks. . Velocity is usually known after the team has run a few iterations (typically two to three). Dividing the total amount of story points by velocity would result in the number of iterations required to complete the project. With a time-boxed iteration length (for example 2 weeks), an estimated project duration can then be calculated.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":148}},{"qa":"متى ينتهي التكرار ؟","oa":["عندما تحقق جميع العناصر الموجودة في سجل أعمال المنتج تعريف تم","عندما يقرر مالك المنتج انتهاء التكرار","عندما ينفد الوقت المحدد المخصص لـ للتكرار","عند اكتمال جميع المهام في سجل أعمال المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":38,"q":"When is a sprint finished?","t":"S","o":["When all the items in the Product Backlog achieve the Definition of Done.","When the Product Owner determines that the Sprint is finished.","When the fixed time allocated to the Sprint runs out.","When all tasks in the Sprint Backlog are complete."],"c":[2],"f":"When the fixed time allocated to the Sprint runs out.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Scope","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":149}},{"qa":"أي من الطرق التالية توفر إرشادات حول استخدام سجل أعمال المنتج ، وتخطيط التكرار  ، والاجتماع اليومي ، ومراجعة التكرار، وجلسات التقييم بأثر رجعي","oa":["السباق / الأسبرنت","كانبان","سكروم","أكس بي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":39,"q":"Which of the following methods provides guidance on the use of a product backlog, sprint planning, daily scrum, sprint review and sprint retrospective sessions.","t":"S","o":["Sprint","Kanban","Scrum","XP"],"c":[2],"f":"The scrum method provides guidance on the use of a product backlog, a product owner, scrum master, and a cross-functional development team, including sprint planning, daily scrum, sprint review and sprint retrospective sessions. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 31]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":150}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":40,"q":"You are currently managing a complex project that requires a lot of knowledge work. You want some sort of visual management system that can help you visualize the flow of work, make impediments easily visible, and allow flow to be managed by adjusting the work-in-process limits. Which of the following tools can help you in this regard","t":"S","o":["Product backlog","Kanban board","Sprint retrospective","5S"],"c":[1],"f":"A Kanban board provides a means to visualize the flow of work, make impediments easily visible, and allow flow to be managed by adjusting the work-in-process limits. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 31]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1"},{"qa":"أي من مفاهيم Agile التالية يعني \"أصغر تسليم ممكن يلبي متطلبات العملاء.","oa":["قصة المستخدم","الملحم","الحد الأدنى للمنتج قابل للتطبيق","سمة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":41,"q":"Which of the following Agile concepts implies “smallest possible deliverable that meets customer requirements.","t":"S","o":["User story","Epic","Minimum viable product","Theme"],"c":[2],"f":"A minimum viable product (MVP) is a product or a project outcome that contains sufficient features to satisfy project stakeholders. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 23]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":151}},{"qa":"على الرغم من أن الفريق قدم الميزات المطلوبة ، إلا أنهم واجهوا العديد من المشكلات والصراعات أثناء التكرار. كان أعضاء الفريق مستائين من هذه التجربة ويظهرون الآن نقصًا في الحافز بسبب ما حدث. ما الذي يمكن أن يفعله مدير المشروع للمساعدة في زيادة تحفيز الفريق ومشاركته في المشروع","oa":["مراجعة إجراءات تخطيط التكرار مع أعضاء فريق المشروع","قم بإعداد اجتماعات فردية مع أعضاء فريق المشروع","مراجعة تقدم التكرار مع أعضاء فريق المشروع","قم بإجراء اجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي مع أعضاء فريق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":42,"q":"Although the team delivered the required features, they encountered several issues and conflicts during the sprint. Team members were upset about this experience and are now showing a lack of motivation due to what has occurred. What can the project manager do to help increase the team’s motivation and engagement with the project","t":"S","o":["Review sprint planning procedures with the project team members","Set up one-on-one meetings with the project team members","Review sprint progress with the project team members","Perform a sprint retrospective with the project team members"],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword ( Team encountered several issues and conflicts during the sprint) The correct answer is: Perform a sprint retrospective with the project team members. In order to determine the cause of an issue, it is appropriate to engage the team in determining what could be causing the issue. Discussing with the team during the iteration retrospective is an appropriate way to look for causes and remedies. An iteration retrospective is an excellent venue for discussing both what is and isn't working.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":152}},{"qa":"يتفاوض الفريق على الالتزام مع مالك المنتج أثناء اجتماع تخطيط التكرار. حدد الخطوات التي تشكل جزءًا من تخطيط التكرار: (حدد اثنين)","oa":["يعطي الفريق الأولوية لبنود سجل أعمال المنتج ويناقش ما يمكن تسليمه كزيادات.","يحدد سكرام ماستر أهداف التخطيط ووضع الأهداف الوظيفية للتكرار","الفريق يراجع سجل أعمال المنتج ، أحدث زيادات للمنتج، والقدرة المتوقعة والأداء السابق لفريق التطوير","يساعد مالك المنتج في توضيح عناصرسجل أعمال المنتج المحددة وإجراء المفاضلات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":43,"q":"The team is negotiating the commitment with a product owner during the Sprint planning meeting. Identify the steps that are part of the Sprint Planning: (select two)","t":"M","o":["Team prioritizes the backlog items and discusses what can be delivered as an increment.","Scrum master defines the Sprint goals and set the objectives for the Sprint.","Team review the backlog, latest product Increment, projected capacity and past performance of the Development Team","The product owner helps to clarify the selected product backlog items and make trade-offs."],"c":[2,3],"f":"1- Team prioritizes the backlog items and discusses what can be delivered as an increment.\n\n2- Team review the backlog, latest product Increment, projected capacity and past performance of the Development Team.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":153}},{"qa":"يستخدم مدير المشروع نهجًا مختلطًا لتسليم المشروع. تم تحديد حجم فريق التطوير ولكن لم يتم تزويده بالموارد الكاملة بعد. يعمل مدير المشروع على تحديد الجدول الزمني للمشروع. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمعالجة مسألة توفر المطور","oa":["اطلب من الراعي تقديم تاريخ الانتهاء المطلوب لأنشطة المشروع وإكمال الجدول الزمني","اسأل مدير الموارد عندما يكون المقاول الجديد متاحًا للبدء وتغيير تاريخ التسليم لجدول المشروع","نظّم جلسة تخطيط مع فريق التطوير واستخدم تقديراتهم لإكمال الجدول","استخدم حكم الخبراء لتقدير جميع المهام وإكمال الجدول الزمني في الوقت المخصص"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":44,"q":"A project manager is using a hybrid approach for project delivery. The development team was sized but is not yet fully resourced. The project manager is working on defining the project schedule. What should the project manager do to address the issue of developer availability?","t":"S","o":["Ask the sponsor to provide the desired completion date for project activities and complete the schedule.","Ask the resource manager when the new contractor is available to start and change the delivery date for the project schedule.","Organize a planning session with the development team and use their estimations to complete the schedule.","Use expert judgment to estimate all of the tasks and complete the schedule in the allocated time."],"c":[2],"f":"Organize a planning session with the development team and use their estimations to complete the schedule.\n\nThe activities should be estimated by the team who are working on the task based on their velocity to be more accurate and reliable.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":154}},{"qa":"ما هي بعض أهداف إدارة اجتماعات التقييم بأثر رجعي؟ (إختر إثنين.)","oa":["توفير وصول أصحاب المصلحة إلى الفريق","الدروس المستفادة وفرص التحسين","خطط طرقًا لزيادة الجودة والفعالية","احصل على ردود الفعل على المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":45,"q":"What are some objectives of running a Retrospective? (Choose two.)","t":"M","o":["Provide the stakeholders access to the team.","Lessons learned and opportunities for improvement","Plan ways to increase quality and effectiveness.","Get feedback on the product."],"c":[1,2],"f":"The objectives of running a Retrospective is Lessons learned and opportunities for improvement and Plan ways to increase quality and effectiveness.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":155}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع من ذوي الخبرة يدير مشروعًا رشيقًا بملايين الدولارات. يقوم مدير المشروع بإبلاغ الفريق بالقواعد الأساسية ، ولكن بعد 12 تكرارًا ، يبدأ مدير المشروع في ملاحظة أن بعض أعضاء الفريق لا يتبعون القواعد الأساسية.\nما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً لضمان التزام الفريق بالقواعد الأساسية","oa":["حدد موعدًا لعقد اجتماع مع فريق المشروع لتعزيز القواعد الأساسية.","قم بإخطار راعي المشروع بهذا السلوك واطلب منه اتخاذ إجراء تأديبي","اتصل بالموارد البشرية لطلب إرسال خطاب تحذير مكتوب إلى أعضاء الفريق الذين لا يتبعون القواعد الأساسية","اطلب من المدير الوظيفي استبدال أعضاء الفريق الذين لا يتبعون القواعد الأساسية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":46,"q":"An experienced project manager is managing a multi-million dollar agile project. The project manager communicates the ground rules to the team but after 12 iterations, the project manager starts noticing that some team members are not following the ground rules. What should the project manager do first to ensure team adherence to the ground rules.","t":"S","o":["Schedule a meeting with the project team to reinforce the ground rules.","Notify the project sponsor about this behavior and ask the sponsor to take disciplinary action","Contact human resources to request a written warning letter be sent to team members not following the ground rules","Ask the functional manager to replace team members not following the ground rules"],"c":[0],"f":"Before replacing team members or escalate this situation, the project manager should schedule a meeting with the project team to reinforce the ground rules.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":156}},{"qa":"ماذا يجب أن يذكر سكروم ماستر في اجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي التالي إذا قال صاحب المنتج أن آخر أجتماع تقييم بأثر رجعي  فشل في تقديم قيمة إلى المشروع","oa":["توفير التكلفة أثناء التكرار","المشاكل التي تم حلها","طريقة الاتصال أثناء التكرار","المشاكل التي نشأت"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":47,"q":"What should the scrum master mention at the next retrospective if the product owner said that the last sprint failed to deliver value to the project.","t":"S","o":["Cost Saving during the sprint","Issues which were solved","The way of communication during the sprint","Issues that arose"],"c":[3],"f":"Issues which come and happen during that sprint needs to be discussed and present on the table during the retrospective meeting. .","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":157}},{"qa":"خلال منتصف عملية التكرار ، يريد أحد أصحاب المصلحة تأخير تاريخ اكتمال التكرار بحيث يمكن إكمال الميزات التي طلبها. كيف يجب أن يستجيب الفريق","oa":["استمر في العمل بوتيرة مستدامة ولا تطيل التكرار","ساعات العمل الاضافيه في المشروع","تأخير تاريخ اكتمال التكرار","اجلب مطورين إضافيين إلى الفريق لهذا التكرار فقط"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":48,"q":"During the middle of the iteration process, a stakeholder wants to delay the iteration's completion date so that the features they requested can be implemented. How should the team respond?","t":"S","o":["Continue working at their sustainable pace and not extend the iteration.","Work extra hours on the project","Delay the iteration completion date","Bring additional developers on the team for this iteration only."],"c":[0],"f":"The team works within a fixed iteration length and must not extend it. The team must also maintain a sustainable pace. (Agile Practice Guide – 1st Edition, p. 9)","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":158}},{"qa":"خلال الاجتماع اليومي للاجتماع، يتخذ بعض أعضاء الفريق مكالمات على جوالهم. وجود قواعد عامة انه لا توجد هواتف محمولة أثناء أجتماع الوقوف اليومي يمكن أن تعزز فعالية أجتماع الوقوف اليومية، الذي يجب أن يخلق هذه القواعد العامة وتنفيذها","oa":["مالك المنتج","سكرام ماستر","الممول","الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":49,"q":"During the daily stand-up meeting some of the team members are frequently taking calls on their mobile. Having a ground rule of no mobile phones during daily stand-up can enhance effectiveness of daily stand-up, who should create and enforce this rule","t":"S","o":["Product owner","Scrum Master","Sponsor","The Team"],"c":[3],"f":"Team is responsible for managing and putting the ground rules, which they agreed on it.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":159}},{"qa":"أكمل فريق سكروم أول تكرار له لمشروع مهم. يشير مخطط الحرق إلى أن المشروع متأخر عن الجدول الزمني. أي أثنين من الإجراءات التي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذها لإدارة المعوقات وتحسين سرعة الفريق","oa":["انقل العناصر عالية التعقيد إلى آخر التكرارات","تمكين التعلم لاتخاذ قرارات لإزالة العوائق","قم بتعيين العناصر ذات التعقيد العالي مع كبار المطورين","ابحث عن العمليات التي تسبب الاختناقات وتبطئ من سرعة الفريق","اعمل مع الفريق لإزالة العوائق في أسرع وقت ممكن"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":50,"q":"A Scrum team has completed Its first iteration for an important project. A burndown chart indicates that the project is behind schedule. Which two actions should the project manager take to manage Impediments and improve the team’s velocity","t":"M","o":["Move the items with high complexity to the last iterations","Empower the learn to make decisions to remove impediments","Assign the items with high complexity lo senior developers","Look for processes that cause bottlenecks and slow down the team's agility","Work with the team to remove impediments as quickly as possible"],"c":[3,4],"f":"1- Look for processes that cause bottlenecks and slow down the team's agility\n\n2- Work with the team to remove impediments as quickly as possible","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":160}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع في بيئة هجينة باستخدام كلٍ من أطر العمل الشلال والأجايل مما يسبب بعض الالتباس حول من يفعل ماذا طوال المشروع. ما الذي يمكن أن يفعله مدير المشروع للمساعدة في إزالة الالتباس؟","oa":["قم بدعوة راعي المشروع إلى الاجتماع الافتتاحي للمشروع","أرسل بريدًا إلكترونيًا إلى فريق المشروع لتوضيح المسؤول عما ينشأ","تطوير خطة إدارة الموارد من خلال تحديد الأدوار والمسؤوليات.","تفصيل الأدوار والمسؤوليات في ميثاق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":51,"q":"A project manager is working in a hybrid environment using both waterfall and agile frameworks Which causes some confusion about who does what throughout the project. What can the project manager do to help clear the confusion?","t":"S","o":["Invite the project sponsor to the project kick-off meeting","Send out an email to the project team to clarify who is responsible for what as it arises","Develop the resource management plan by defining the roles and responsibilities.","Detail the roles and responsibilities in the project charter."],"c":[2],"f":"CORRECT ANSWER IS :\n\nDevelop the resource management plan by defining the roles and responsibilities.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":161}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق رشيق بتطوير منتج للعميل. في التكرارات القليلة الماضية ، أمضى أعضاء الفريق ساعات إضافية في إنشاء وثائق المنتج ومراجعة العقود مع العميل. كيف يمكن قضاء وقت الفريق بشكل أفضل","oa":["بناء مميزات حسب خطة إدارة المشروع الأولية","وضع الوظائف حسب طلب الجهة الراعية للمشروع","الإبلاغ عن الساعات الإضافية في أدوات الشركة الخاصة بالوقت والحضور","خلق تسليمات متزايدة في المنتج والعمل مع صاحب المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":52,"q":"An agile team is developing a product for a customer. In the last few iterations, the team members spent extra hours creating product documentation and reviewing the contracts with the customer. How would the team's time been better spent.","t":"S","o":["Building features according to the initial project management plan","Developing functionality as requested by the project sponsor","Reporting the extra hours in the company's time and attendance tools","Creating the product increment and working with the product owner"],"c":[3],"f":"Creating the product increment and working with the product owner : is the best answer among the choices given, as it represents value to the customer and is aligned with the Agile Manifesto values of creating working software and collaborating with the customer (or with the product owner who is the voice of the customer).","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":162}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":53,"q":"In Agile communities, people with expertise in one domain, less-developed skills in associated areas and good collaboration skills are known as","t":"S","o":["U-shaped people","H-shaped people","T-shaped people","I-shaped people"],"c":[2],"f":"In Agile communities, people with expertise in one domain, less-developed skills in associated areas and good collaboration skills are known as T-shaped people. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 42]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3"},{"qa":"الاستجابة للتغيير في متابعة الخطة هي واحدة من قيم بيان أجايل الرئيسية. أي من نهج الأجايل التالية يساعد في تحقيق هذه القيمة","oa":["لوحات كانبان","القائد خادم","فرق التنظيم الذاتي","تحسين سجل أعمال المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":54,"q":"Responding to change over following a plan” is one of the key Agile Manifesto values. Which of the following Agile approaches helps in achieving this value","t":"S","o":["Kanban boards","Servant-leader","Self-organizing teams","Backlog refinement"],"c":[3],"f":"Backlog refinement allows the product owner to change project priorities in line with evolving business needs. This changes the focus from following a predefined plan to responding to change. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 97]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":163}},{"qa":"فريق رشيق يقيس نقاط قصة دون إكمال الميزة أو القصة الفعلية. ما هي المشكلة مع هذا النهج؟","oa":["انخفاض سرعة الفريق","زيادة وقت الاستجابة","انتهاك مبادئ الأجايل","الاستخدام غير الفعال لـ لوحة كانبان"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":55,"q":"An Agile team measures story points without completing the actual feature or story. What is the problem with this approach","t":"S","o":["Decrease of team’s velocity.","Increased response time.","Violation of Agile Principles","Ineffective use of a Kanban board"],"c":[2],"f":"Measuring story points is not the same as measuring completed stories or features. Some teams attempt to measure story points without completing the actual feature or story. When teams measure only story points, they measure capacity not finished work which violates the Agile Principle of “the primary measure of progress is working software”. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 66]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":164}},{"qa":"أنهى فريق رشيق الترميز للتكرار الحالي. أي مما يلي هو اجتماع مستمر لتحسين العملية سيحضره الفريق الآن","oa":["اجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي","اجتماع ادارة المنتج","اجتماع التخطيط للتكرار","إجتماع التخطيط للأصدار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":56,"q":"An agile team finished coding for the current iteration. Which of the following is a continuous process improvement ceremony that the team will now attend","t":"S","o":["Iteration retrospective meeting","Product demonstration meeting","Iteration Planning meeting","Release Planning meeting"],"c":[0],"f":"The iteration retrospective meeting is an example of a continuous process improvement ceremony on an agile project.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":165}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع بإشراك فريق تطوير في بلد آخر لتطوير البرمجيات. أثناء مراجعات التقدم ، حدد مدير المشروع تأخيرات في تاريخ الإنجاز بسبب إعادة العمل نظرًا لوجود تفسيرات مختلفة لاحتياجات العميل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تصعيد إلى اللجنة التوجيهية للمشروع واطلب وقتًا إضافيًا","قم بإعداد اجتماع مع أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين لتوضيح المتطلبات","السفر إلى مكتب فريق التطوير لدفع الجدول الزمني","قم بإنشاء نماذج أولية مع فريق التطوير لتأكيد المتطلبات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":57,"q":"A project team is engaging a development team in another country to develop software. During progress reviews, the project manager identified completion date delays due to rework because there were different interpretations of the client’s needs. What should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Escalate to the project steering committee and request additional time","Set up a meeting with key stakeholders to clarify requirements","Travel to the development team's office to push the schedule","Create prototypes with the development team to confirm requirements"],"c":[1],"f":"Set up a meeting with key stakeholders to clarify requirements","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":166}},{"qa":"كان أحد الممارسين المرنين يشرح الاختلافات والتشابهات بين نهج إدارة المشاريع التقليدية والأجايل لمدير كبير. بعد المحادثة ، أدرك الممارس أنه أخطأ في ذكر نقطة مهمة واحدة. أي من النقاط التالية من المحتمل أن تكون","oa":["تسمح كل من الأساليب التقليدية والأجايل بالتغييرات في جميع أنحاء المشروع","الكثير من التخطيط في المشاريع الرشيقة يؤدي إلى مخاطر","كل من الأساليب التقليدية والأجايل مدفوعة بالقيمة","طرق الأجايل كـ أسكرام تكرارية و ليست تزايدية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":58,"q":"An agile practitioner was explaining the differences and similarities between agile and traditional project management approaches to a senior manager. After the conversation, the practitioner realized that she had misstated one important point. Which of the following points would that likely be","t":"S","o":["Both traditional and agile methods allow for changes throughout the project","Too much Planning on agile projects introduce risks","Both traditional and agile methods are value driven","Scrum Agile methods are iteration and non- increment"],"c":[3],"f":"Agile methods are iterative and incremental. Agile delivers in increments to focus on the important features first and to deliver these features to the customer sooner. Saying that agile methods are 'non-incremental' is wrong. Therefore, this answer choice represents the point that the practitioner had misstated.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":167}},{"qa":"يعمل فريق أجايل حاليا حاليا على مشروع تخصيص ونشر مشروع ايه ار بي معقد. يواجه الفريق حاليا مشكلة في نشر مجموعة ميزات لأن القسم المرسل الية  ليس جاهزا بعد للتغيير. أي من سكرام المسؤول عن إزالة هذا العائق؟","oa":["مالك المنتج","فريق التطوير","سكرام ماستر","محلل الأعمال"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":59,"q":"An Agile team is currently working on a complex ERP customization and deployment project. The team is currently facing an issue with deploying a couple of features as the recipient department is not yet ready for the changeover. Which Scrum role is responsible for removing this impediment","t":"S","o":["Product Owner","Development team","Scrum Master","Business Analyst"],"c":[2],"f":"The scrum master is responsible for ensuring the Scrum process is upheld and works to ensure the Scrum team adheres to the practices and rules as well as coaches the team on removing impediments. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 101]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":168}},{"qa":"يطلب أحد أصحاب المعنيين الرئيسيين (العميل) من فريق المشروع تضمين مهام جديدة في سجل أعمال المنتج والبدء في تحليل الطلبات الجديدة. يتوقع العميل النتائج في أقرب وقت ممكن ويضغط على الفريق لحضور اجتماعات غير حرجة. الفريق محبط من هذا الموقف. كيف يجب أن يتعامل مدير المشروع مع هذا الموقف؟","oa":["فهم وجهة نظر العميل وتقديم التوجيه بشأن العقليات الرشيقة.","دعوة فريق داخلي بأثر رجعي وإنشاء خطة عمل للتحسين","العمل مع الفريق لتلقي توجيهات العملاء وتحسين العملية.","اطلب من العميل العمل مع مالك المنتج لتحديد أولويات جميع الطلبات."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":60,"q":"A key customer stakeholder asks the project team to include new tasks in the backlog and begin analyzing new requests. The customer expects results as soon as possible and pressures the team to attend noncritical meetings. The team is frustrated by this situation . How should the project manager approach this situation","t":"S","o":["Understand the customer's perspective and provide mentoring on agile mindsets.","Call for an internal team retrospective and create an improvement action plan.","Work with the team to receive customer directions and improve the process.","Ask the customer to work with the product owner to prioritize all requests."],"c":[3],"f":"One of the tasks of the agile project manager is that he acts as a servant leader and removes obstacles that confront the team and prevent it from concentrating on executing the tasks. In this scenario , one of these obstacles is the customer's requests for unimportant meetings , so the project manager must direct the customer to work with the product owner and prioritize his requests.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":169}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":61,"q":"The on-demand scheduling approach used in agile environments is based on the theory-of-constraints and pull-based scheduling concepts from lean manufacturing to limit a team’s work in progress. This is also called","t":"S","o":["5S","Andon","Gemba","Kanban"],"c":[3],"f":"The on-demand scheduling approach used in agile environments is based on the theory-of-constraints and pull-based scheduling concepts from lean manufacturing to limit a team’s work in progress. This is also called Kanban system.\nKanban Board is Pull System and Visual management to identify the status of Requirements.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1"},{"qa":"إن مشروع إطلاق منتج جديد في مرحلة أولية للغاية وتتطور المتطلبات بسبب المنافسة الشديدة في السوق ، يرغب العميل في إطلاق المنتج مع الحفاظ على مرونة النطاق. يعتزم فريق المشروع بدء العمل بناءً على توقعات مشروع مماثل تم تسليمه العام الماضي. ما نهج المشروع الذي يناسب السيناريو؟","oa":["قم بتنفيذه كمشروع تنبؤي","قم بتنفيذه باستخدام نفس نهج المشروع المرجعي","قم بتنفيذه كمشروع سكرم","تنفيذه كمشروع مع بوابات المرحلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":62,"q":"A project for a new product launch is in a very initial stage and the requirements are evolving Due to stiff competition in the market, the customer would like to launch the product keeping the scope flexible. The project team intends to start the work based on the forecast of a similar project delivered last year Which project approach suits the scenario","t":"S","o":["Execute it as a predictive project","Execute it using the same approach as the reference project","Execute it as a Scrum project","Execute it as a project with stage gates"],"c":[2],"f":"Because the requirements are evolving and the customer would like to launch the product keeping the scope flexible. SO the team should Execute it as a Scrum project. Note: Scrum is one of the most popular agile methods.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":170}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لمشروع مهم. تأخر المشروع بسبب الكم الهائل من التغييرات الرئيسية المطلوبة من قبل مختلف أصحاب المصلحة في مراحل مختلفة من المشروع. إذا استمر المشروع على نفس المسار ، فسوف يستهلك ضعف الوقت والميزانية المخططة.\nما الإجراءان اللذان يمكن لمدير المشروع اتخاذه ليكون أكثر فعالية من حيث التكلفة؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["قم بإجراء تحليل أصحاب المصلحة","اعتماد نهج تدريجي","تحديث خطة إدارة المشروع مع الجدول الزمني الجديد","الاستفادة من العمل بين أعضاء الفريق","عزز تواصل الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":63,"q":"You are a project manager for an important project. The project is delayed due to the high amount of major changes requested by different stakeholders at different stages of the project. If the project continues on the same path, it will consume twice the time and budget planned. What two actions can the project manager take to be more cost-effective? (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Conduct a stakeholder analysis","Adopt an incremental approach","Update the project management plan with the new timeline","Leverage work between team members","Reinforce team communication"],"c":[0,1],"f":"Keyword ( high amount of major changes requested by different stakeholders ) SO the incremental approach is best for this project. Also, the project manager should conduct a stakeholder analysis to identify: The interests of all stakeholders, who may affect or be affected by the project. Groups that should be encouraged to participate in different stages of the project. Ways to reduce potential negative impacts and manage negative stakeholders.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":171}},{"qa":"كان فريق أجايل يكافح لمواكبة الوتيرة المخطط لها ، والتي تؤدي في كثير من الأحيان إلى فشل التكرار. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع للمساعدة في تجنب هذا الموقف في المستقبل","oa":["قم بالتبديل إلى نهج كانبان ، وتنفيذ الميزات على أساس من يأتي أولاً يخدم أولاً ، وتعزيز وتيرة مستدامة","اطلب من راعي المشروع الموافقة على العمل الإضافي لتعويض نقص الأداء أثناء تعديل الخطة","استبدل أعضاء الفريق المبتدئين بأعضاء أكثر خبرة وناقش نطاق المشروع لتعويض فجوة الميزانية","راجع سرعة الفريق على مدار آخر تكرار واضبط الخطة وفقًا لذلك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":64,"q":"An agile team has been struggling to keep up with the planned pace, which is frequently resulting in sprint failures What should the project manager do to help avoid this situation in the future","t":"S","o":["Switch to a Kanban approach, implementing features on a first-come, first-serve basis, fostering a sustainable pace","Ask the project sponsor to approve overtime to compensate for the lack of performance while adjusting the plan","Replace junior team members with more experienced ones and negotiate the project scope to compensate for the budget gap","Review the velocity of the team over the last several sprints and adjust the plan accordingly"],"c":[3],"f":"Review the velocity of the team over the last several sprints and adjust the plan accordingly","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":172}},{"qa":"الأشخاص على شكل حرف T هم أكثر ملاءمة لفرق أجايل من الأشخاص الذين يتخذون شكل حرف I. كل ما يلي هو فوائد وجود أشخاص على شكل حرف T في الفريق باستثناء","oa":["هذا يزيل خطر من المشروع","هذا يساعد في تشكيل فرق أصغر","هذا يسمح للفرق بالتنظيم الذاتي","هذا يساعد في إنشاء فريق متعدد المهارات ."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":65,"q":"T-shaped people are more suitable for Agile teams than I-shaped people. All of the following are benefits of having T-shaped people on the team EXCEPT","t":"S","o":["This removes the risk from the project.","This helps in forming smaller teams.","This allows teams to self-organize.","This helps in creating a cross-functional team."],"c":[0],"f":"In Agile communities, people with expertise in one domain, less-developed skills in associated areas and good collaboration skills are known as T-shaped people. For Agile projects, it is preferred to have a team of self-organizing, T-shaped, cross-functional team generalists. However, having T-shaped people doesn’t remove the project risk. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 42]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":173}},{"qa":"أثناء التكرار الثالث لمشروع ما ، يصبح النشاط المخطط له أكثر تعقيدًا. يجب تسليم العمل في أقصر وقت ممكن. ما هو النهج الذي يجب استخدامه في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["عضو الفريق يجلب الشركات الصغيرة والمتوسطة لمساعدتهم","يجب أن يطلب الفريق الدعم من أعضاء الفريق الخارجيين","يجب على مالك المنتج إزالة الأنشطة المعقدة من تراكم المنتج","يعمل أعضاء الفريق متعدد الوظائف معًا لإكمال النشاط"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":66,"q":"During a project’s third iteration, a planned activity becomes more complex. The work should be delivered in the shortest time possible. What approach should be used in this situation","t":"S","o":["The team member brings SMEs to help them.","The team should request support from external team members.","The product owner should remove the complex activities from the product backlog.","The cross-functional team members work together to complete the activity."],"c":[3],"f":"Cross-functional teams consist of team members with all the skills necessary to produce a working product. In software development, cross-functional teams are typically comprised of designers, developers, testers, and any other required roles. The cross-functional development teams consist of professionals who deliver potentially releasable product on a regular cadence. Cross-functional teams are critical because they can deliver finished work in the shortest possible time, with higher quality, without external dependencies.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":174}},{"qa":"فيما يتعلق بالمشاريع التقليدية، عادة ما يتم إنشاء لوحة تحكم التغيير عادة لطلبات تغيير الطلبات. من المسؤول عن تفويض التغييرات في مشروع رشيق؟","oa":["مالك المنتج","فريق أجايل","سكرام ماستر","المستخدمين النهائيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":67,"q":"On traditional projects, a change control board is usually established to authorize change requests. Who is responsible to authorize changes on an Agile project.","t":"S","o":["Product owner","Agile team","Scrum master","End users"],"c":[0],"f":"Product owners have the ultimate responsibility of the project success. They prioritize the project backlog and authorize change requests on an Agile project.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":175}},{"qa":"لقد طلبت من ناشر طباعة بعض مبادئ رشيقة على الملصقات. عندما تم تسليم الملصقات، اكتشفت أن بعضها لم يكن لديه مبادئ رشيقة غير صحيحة مطبوعة عليها. أي من الملصقات التالية لديها مبدأ رشيق غير صحيح مطبوع عليه؟","oa":["التركيز على التميز التقني","التسليم المستمر للبرامج القيمة","تخطط بشكل متحفظ وتقديم بقوة","عمل البرنامج هو المقياس الأساسي للتقدم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":68,"q":"You have asked a publisher to print some Agile principles on posters. When the posters were delivered, you found out that some of them had incorrect Agile principles printed on them. Which of the following posters has an incorrect Agile principle printed on it","t":"S","o":["Focus on technical excellence","Continuous delivery of valuable software","Plan conservatively and deliver aggressively","Working software is the primary measure of progress"],"c":[2],"f":"Plan conservatively and deliver aggressively is not a valid Agile principle. The rest of the choices are all valid Agile principles. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 9]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":176}},{"qa":"يخطط فريق رشيق للأدوات التي سيستخدمونها في المشروع. يتناقش أعضاء الفريق حول كيفية إظهار العمل الجاري. من بين الخيارات التالية ، ما الأداة التي من المرجح أن يختاروها","oa":["هيكل تجزئة العمل","خريطة طريق المنتج","لوحة المهام","قائمة قصص المستخدم المتراكمة\nUse Story backlog"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":69,"q":"An agile team is planning for tools they will use for the project. The team members are debating how they should show what work is in progress. Of the following options, which tool are they most likely to select","t":"S","o":["WBS","Product Roadmap","task board","Use Story backlog"],"c":[2],"f":"Of the options presented, the best tool to show work in progress is a task board. The user story backlog shows what work is still remaining to be done on the project. The product roadmap shows when work is planned to be completed. Work breakdown structures are not commonly used on agile projects. \n \n\nVery Important Question In Real Exam \n\nIn agile environments (like Scrum or Kanban), the Task Board (or Kanban board) is the primary tool to visualize what tasks are To Do, In Progress, or Done. It provides transparency and enables the team to manage work-in-progress effectively.\n\n🔑 Keywords: Agile – Task Board – WIP – Visualization – Transparency\n\n📚 PMBOK 6: Agile Practice Guide p. 58\n📚 PMBOK 7: Delivery Performance Domain – Agile Tools & Techniques","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":177}},{"qa":"انضم عضو جديد في الفريق إلى فريق أجايل الخاص بك. سأل لك لماذا نستخدم موسكو. أجبته أنها تستخدم ل","oa":["تخطيط المخاطر والحساب","تحجيم القصة","القيام بتقدير عبء العمل","ترتيب الأولويات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":70,"q":"A new team member joined your agile team. He asked you what we use MOSCOW for. You answer him it is used for","t":"S","o":["Risk planning and calculation","Sizing the story","Doing workload estimation","Prioritization"],"c":[3],"f":"MoSCoW prioritization, also known as the MoSCoW method or MoSCoW analysis, is a popular prioritization technique for managing requirements. ... The acronym, MoSCoW, stands for 4 different categories of initiatives: must-haves, should-haves, could-haves, and will not have at this time.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":178}},{"qa":"يقوم عضو رئيسي في الفريق بإبلاغ مدير المشروع بأنه قد تم قبوله في برنامج درجة الماجستير. يوضح عضو الفريق أن الفصل الدراسي الأول لبرنامج الماجستير سيتزامن مع المرحلة الأخيرة من المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من أعضاء الفريق إبلاغ الموارد البشرية  حول تسجيلهم في برنامج الماجستير","اطلب من عضو الفريق تفويض بعض مهامهم إلى زميل آخر خلال المرحلة الأخيرة من المشروع","اقترح على أعضاء الفريق تأجيل تسجيلهم في برنامج الماجستير حتى اكتمال المشروع","تقييم مدى التزام أعضاء الفريق ببرنامج الماجستير وتأثيره على أداء المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":"يتعين على مدير المشروع أن يبدأ دائمًا بتقييم الوضع بشكل موضوعي.\nهنا، يجب تحليل مدى تأثير التزام عضو الفريق ببرنامج الماجستير على جدول المشروع وتسليماته.\nوبناءً على هذا التقييم، يمكن اتخاذ قرارات مثل إعادة توزيع المهام أو تعديل الموارد.\n\n📚 PMI References | المراجع المعتمدة:\n\n\n\t\n\tPMBOK® 6th Edition:\n\t 📖 Section 9.4 – Manage Team\n\t 📖 Section 6.6 – Control Schedule\n\t\n\t\n\tPMBOK® 7th Edition:\n\t 📖 Team Performance Domain\n\t 📖 Tailoring guidance for resource adaptability\n\t\n\t\n\tAgile Practice Guide:\n\t 📖 p. 42–45 – Adaptive team structure and flexibility\n\t 📖 p. 57 – Respect for people and sustainable pace","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":71,"q":"A key team member informs the project manager that they have been accepted to a master’s degree program. The team member explains that the first semester of the master’s program will coincide with the last phase of the project. What should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Ask the team member to inform human resources(HR) about their enrollment in the master's program","Ask the team member to delegate some of their tasks to another colleague during the last phase of the project","Suggest the team member postpone their enrollment in the master's program until the project is completed","Assess the team member's commitment to the master's program and its impact on project performance"],"c":[3],"f":"A professional project manager always starts by assessing the situation objectively.\nIn this case, the PM should analyze the team member’s availability, workload, and impact on the project schedule and deliverables.\nBased on that assessment, the PM may later reallocate tasks, adjust resources, or negotiate commitments.\n\n📚 PMI References\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n  📖 Section 9.4 – Manage Team\n  📖 Section 6.6 – Control Schedule\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n  📖 Team Performance Domain\n  📖 Tailoring guidance for resource adaptability\n \n \n Agile Practice Guide:\n  📖 p. 42–45 – Adaptive team structure and flexibility\n  📖 p. 57 – Respect for people and sustainable pace","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Schedule","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":179}},{"qa":"التقى مدير المشروع بفريق المشروع أسبوعيا لتقييم تقدم المشروع. ومع ذلك ، يطلب الراعي فحص أداء المشروع يوميًا. لا يوافق أعضاء الفريق الرئيسيون على هذا المطلب ويقولون إنهم لا يملكون الوقت الكافي للذهاب إلى الاجتماعات اليومية لأنهم على مستوى تنفيذي.\n\nما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["تقييم قدرة كل عضو في الفريق على حضور الاجتماعات اليومية شخصيًا أو افتراضيًا وتقليل وقت كل اجتماع","قم بمراجعة خطة إدارة الاتصالات وإرسال طلب التغيير إذا لزم الأمر","تفاوض مع أعضاء الفريق الرئيسيين لإرسال تقرير يومي ودع الراعي يعرف أن تكلفة المشروع سترتفع","يوصي الراعي بمراجعة أداء المشروع مرة واحدة في الأسبوع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":72,"q":"A project manager met with the project team weekly to evaluate the project’s progress. However, the sponsor requests that project performance be checked daily. The key team members disagree with this requirement and argue that they do not have enough time to go to daily meetings because they are at an executive level. \n\nWhat should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Evaluate the capacity of each team member to attend daily meetings in person or virtually and reduce the time of each meeting","Review the communications management plan and submit a change request if required","Negotiate with the key team members to send a daily report and let the sponsor know that the project cost will increase","Recommend to the sponsor that performance of the project be reviewed once per week"],"c":[1],"f":"When there's a conflict between communication expectations of stakeholders (e.g., sponsor vs. team), the first step is to review the communications management plan. This ensures that communication frequency, format, and channels align with stakeholder needs and project constraints. If the plan doesn't cover such changes, the PM may submit a change request.\n\n📚 References\n\n \n PMBOK® Guide 6th Edition\n 🔹 Section 10.1 – Plan Communications Management\n 🔹 Section 4.3 – Direct and Manage Project Work\n 🔹 Section 4.6 – Perform Integrated Change Control (p. 115–118)\n \n \n PMBOK® Guide 7th Edition\n 🔹 Communication Tailoring Considerations\n 🔹 Stakeholder Engagement Domain","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":180}},{"qa":"أنت تدير بعض المشاريع ويطلب منك الراعي تقديم أرقام مؤشر اداء التكلفة و مؤشر اداء حتي الأكتمال لها. لقد قدمت مؤشر اداء التكلفة  = 1 للمشروع أ  ، مؤشر اداء التكلفة = 1.2 للمشروع ب ، مؤشر الأداء حتي الأكتمال = 0.9 للمشروع ج  و مؤشر اداء حتي الأكتمال = 1.2 للمشروع د. ما المشروع الذي تعتقد أن الراعي قد ينتهي بناءً على هذه البيانات؟","oa":["مشروع ب","مشروع أ","مشروع  د","مشروع ج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":73,"q":"You are managing a few projects and the sponsor asks you to submit CPI and TCPI numbers for them. You provided CPI = 1 for project A, CPI = 1.2 for project B, TCPI = 0.9 for project C and TCPI = 1.2 for project D. Which project do you think the sponsor might terminate based on this data","t":"S","o":["Project B","Project A","Project D","Project C"],"c":[2],"f":"Project D has a TCPI of 1.2, a higher TCPI indicates a higher ask rate for the CPI in the future which is not good and Harder to complete. All other projects are in good shape.[PMBOK 6th edition, Page 267]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":181}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع كبير لتكنولوجيا المعلومات. أثناء مرحلة التنفيذ ، تقوم بتوقيع عقد لاستئجار خادم إضافي من شركة محلية بسبب احتمال فشل الخادم الرئيسي بسبب انقطاع التيار الكهربائي المستمر في المنطقة المحلية. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ما هي الإستراتيجية التي تستخدمها؟","oa":["التحويل","التصعيد","التخفيف","التجنب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":74,"q":"You are the project manager of a large IT project. During the implementation phase, you sign a contract to rent an additional server from a local company because of the possibility that the main server may fail due to constant, local-area electrical outages. As a project manager, what strategy are you using","t":"S","o":["Transfer","Escalate","Mitigate","Avoid"],"c":[2],"f":"In risk mitigation, the action is taken to reduce the probability of occurrence and/or impact of a threat. the project manager wants to reduce the probability and impact by renting the generator.[PMBOK 6th edition, Page443 ]","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":182}},{"qa":"إذا أراد مدير المشروع التأكد من أن العمل المنجز والمنتج الذي يتم إنشاؤه لا ينحرف عن قيمة العمل المحددة. ما الذي يجب أن يوليه مدير المشروع اهتمامًا خاصًا لتحقيق هذا الهدف؟","oa":["مقابلة المطورين وفريق مراقبة الجودة على الفور لضمان تلبية معايير الجودة.","إجراء عمليات تدقيق الجودة وتحليل الفشل","مراجعة وتحديث خطة إدارة المتطلبات","الاستعانة بمصادر خارجية لأنشطة إدارة الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":75,"q":"If the project manager wants to ensure that the work carried out and the product being created do not deviate from the prescribed business value. What should the project manager pay special attention to in order to achieve this goal","t":"S","o":["Immediately meet with the developers and quality control team to ensure that the quality standards are met.","Carrying out quality audits and failure analyses","Update the quality management plan","Outsourcing the quality management activities"],"c":[0],"f":"To ensure that the work aligns with the intended business value, the PM must ensure that quality standards are being applied effectively and immediately.\nThe best way to do that is through direct interaction with the team responsible for delivery and quality assurance. This proactive engagement helps in early detection of misalignment or quality issues.\n\n🔑 Keywords | الكلمات المفتاحية:\n\n \n Business Value\n \n \n Quality Standards\n \n \n Quality Assurance\n \n \n Team Engagement\n \n \n Stakeholder Expectations\n \n\n | PMI References:\n\n \n PMBOK 6th Edition:\n  📖 Section 8.2 – Manage Quality\n  📖 Section 5.5 – Validate Scope (Business value alignment)\n \n \n PMBOK 7th Edition:\n  📖 Value Delivery System\n  📖 Delivery Performance Domain – Quality and Value Alignment\n \n \n Agile Practice Guide:\n  📖 p. 29–30 – Collaboration and value delivery\n  📖 p. 91 – Quality built-in principles","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":183}},{"qa":"ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع مراعاتهما أثناء إطلاق فريق افتراضي جديد؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["تحديد أنواع وكميات الموارد المطلوبة لكل حزمة عمل أو نشاط","قم بتعيين أفضل الموارد داخل المنظمة لتكون جزءًا من الفريق الافتراضي","قم بتقييم نقاط القوة والضعف لدى مدير المشروع كقائد افتراضي للفريق لتحديد المزالق التي يمكن تجنبها","حدد في البداية كيف سيتم رصد التقدم وأفضل الوسائل لإبلاغ التقدم","تحقق مما إذا كان أعضاء الفريق في أكثر من فريق ولا يمكن تخصيص الوقت الكافي لهذا الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":76,"q":"Which two actions should a project manager consider while launching a new virtual team? (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Identify the types and quantities of resources required for each work package or activity","Recruit the best resources within the organization to be part of the virtual team","Evaluate the project manager's own strengths and weaknesses as a virtual team leader to identify avoidable pitfalls","Establish in the beginning, how progress will be monitored and the best means for communicating progress","Verify if team members are on more than one team and cannot devote enough time to this team"],"c":[3,4],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\n1. ✅ In virtual teams, clear expectations for monitoring progress and communication methods (email, video calls, dashboards, etc.) are critical from day one.\n\n2. ✅ Many virtual team members are part of multiple projects. Ensuring that they have enough capacity is crucial for scheduling and team performance.\n\nSo The Correct Answer \n\n1- Establish in the beginning, how progress will be monitored and the best means for communicating progress.\n\n2- Verify if team members are on more than one team and cannot devote enough time to this team.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":184}},{"qa":"أثناء عملية الإغلاق ، يتعلم مدير المشروع أن أحد المخرجات لا يلبي توقعات العملاء. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع المضي قدما؟","oa":["اطلب من العميل إصدار طلب تغيير بالمعلومات لتحليلها وتقديم حل","قابل العميل للتوصل إلى اتفاق حول نطاق التسليم الذي يرضي الطرفين","راجع متطلبات التسليم ، وتحقق من معايير موافقة العميل ، وتابع وفقًا لذلك","تواصل مع راعي المشروع واطلب المساعدة في التفاوض بشأن إغلاق المشروع مع العميل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":77,"q":"During the closing process, the project manager learns that one deliverable is not meeting customer expectations. How should the project manager proceed","t":"S","o":["Ask the customer to issue a change request with the information to analyze and provide a solution","Meet with the customer to reach agreement on the scope of the deliverable that will satisfy both parties","Review the deliverable requirements, check the customer approval criteria, and proceed accordingly","Contact the project sponsor and ask for help in negotiating the closing of the project with the customer"],"c":[1],"f":"In the closing phase, the goal is to obtain formal acceptance. If the customer expresses dissatisfaction, the PM should negotiate directly to align expectations and agree on what would satisfy both sides. This maintains the relationship and integrity of project closure.\n\n📚 المراجع | References:\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n  📖 Section 5.5 – Validate Scope\n  📖 Section 4.7 – Close Project or Phase\n  📖 Section 13.3 – Manage Stakeholder Engagement\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n  📖 Delivery Performance Domain – Outcomes & Acceptance\n  📖 Tailoring Considerations for Closing & Value Realization","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":185}},{"qa":"أثناء مرحلة التنفيذ ، تريد مقارنة خط الأساس بالنتائج الفعلية وتحديد ما إذا كان التباين ضمن مبلغ الحد أو ما إذا كان الإجراء التصحيحي أو الوقائي مناسبًا. \n\nأي من الأساليب التالية يمكن أن تساعدك؟","oa":["تقسيم","مخطط التحكم","تحليل الاتجاه","تحليل التباين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":78,"q":"During the implementation phase, you want to compare the baseline to the actual results and determine if the variance is within the threshold amount or if corrective or preventive action is appropriate. \n\nWhich of the following techniques can help you","t":"S","o":["Decomposition","Control chart","Trend analysis","Variance Analysis"],"c":[3],"f":"Variance analysis is used to compare the baseline to the actual results and determine if the variance is within the threshold amount or if corrective or preventive action is appropriate. [PMBOK 6th edition, Page170 ]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":186}},{"qa":"قاد مدير المشروع تنفيذ مشروع الفواتير الإلكترونية الذي اكتمل للتو\nأبلغ المدير المالي أن الفريق اكتشف ثلاث فواتير بها أخطاء\nما الوثيقتان اللتان يجب على مدير المشروع تحديثهما في أسرع وقت ممكن؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["سجل المخاطر","سجل المشكلة","سجل تراكم المنتج","سجل التغيير","سجل أصحاب المصلحة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":79,"q":"A project manager led the implementation of an electronic invoicing project that has just been completed. The financial manager communicated that the team discovered three invoices with errors. Which two documents should the project manager update as soon as possible? (Choose two).","t":"M","o":["Risk register","Issue log","Backlog register","Change log","Stakeholder register"],"c":[0,1],"f":"The project manager should update the issue log to record the errors and update the risk register because may be impact the project completion date","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":187}},{"qa":"أخبر البائع مدير المشروع أنه أكمل النطاق بنجاح ويطلب الموافقة.\nماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع استجابة لهذا الطلب؟","oa":["الحصول على الموافقة من راعي المشروع","قم بتحديث خطة إدارة المشروع ووضع علامة على الإنجاز على أنه مكتمل","اطلب من البائع التحقق من صحة الاتفاقية لأية انحرافات.","قم بإعداد اجتماع مع أصحاب المصلحة للتحقق من صحة النتائج وتأكيد قبولها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":80,"q":"The vendor told the project manager that they completed the scope successfully and is asking for approval. What should the project manager do in response to this request","t":"S","o":["Obtain approval from the project sponsor.","Update the project management plan and mark the milestone as completed","Ask the vendor to validate the agreement for any deviations.","Set up a meeting with stakeholders to validate and confirm acceptance of the deliverables"],"c":[3],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nWhen a vendor claims the scope is complete, the PM should verify the deliverables with key stakeholders and obtain formal acceptance. This is part of the Validate Scope and Close Procurement processes.\n\n📚 | PMI References:\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition\n  📖 Section 5.5 – Validate Scope\n  📖 Section 12.3 – Control Procurements\n  📖 Section 4.7 – Close Project or Phase\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition\n  📖 Delivery Domain – Acceptance Criteria and Closure\n  📖 Tailoring for Supplier Collaboration","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":188}},{"qa":"تم تفويض مدير المشروع لبدء المشروع ويدرك أن فريقًا فعالًا وعالي الأداء مطلوب لإنهاء المشروع بنجاح. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["ضع معايير الأداء والاتجاه","حدد الأعضاء لمهاراتهم أو إمكاناتهم","حدد نطاق المشروع وحدد أهدافًا واضحة للفريق","عقد اجتماعات انطلاق مبكرة واجتماعات أسبوعية منتظمة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":81,"q":"A project manager has been authorized to begin a project and realizes that an effective high-performing team is needed to finish the project successfully. What should the project manager do next","t":"S","o":["Set performance standards and direction","Select members for their skill or potential","Establish the project scope and set clear team objectives","Hold early kick-off meetings and regular weekly meetings"],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nTo build a high-performing team, the project manager must first define the project scope and team goals.\nThis provides a shared vision, helps define needed roles and skills, and aligns the team toward a common purpose.\n\n📚 PMI References:\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n  📖 Section 9.1 – Plan Resource Management\n  📖 Section 5.3 – Define Scope\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n  📖 Team Performance Domain\n  📖 Value Delivery – Initial Planning & Goal Clarity","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Scope","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":189}},{"qa":"أدت إعادة الهيكلة الداخلية من قبل العميل إلى استبدال بعض أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["وزع ملخصًا للوضع الحالي للمشروع على أصحاب المصلحة الجدد","مراجعة وتنفيذ خطة إدارة الاتصالات.","مراجعة وتحديث خطة إشراك أصحاب المصلحة","عقد اجتماع افتتاحي آخر مع أصحاب المصلحة الجدد لإعادة إنشاء خط الأساس للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":"نتيجة لاستبدال بعض أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين ، يجب على مدير المشروع مراجعة وتحديث خطة إشراك أصحاب المصلحة. يتم تحديث خطة إشراك أصحاب المصلحة بانتظام لتعكس التغييرات في مجتمع أصحاب المصلحة. تشمل المواقف المحفزة النموذجية التي تتطلب تحديثات للخطة ما يلي: عندما تكون هناك تغييرات في الهيكل التنظيمي أو داخل الصناعة وعندما يصبح أفراد أو مجموعات جديدة أصحاب مصلحة ، لم يعد أصحاب المصلحة الحاليون جزءًا من مجتمع أصحاب المصلحة ، أو أهمية أصحاب المصلحة المعينين يتغير نجاح المشروع.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":82,"q":"Internal restructuring by the customer has resulted in the replacement of some key stakeholders. What should the project manager do first","t":"S","o":["Distribute a summary of the project’s current status to the new stakeholders.","Review and execute the communication management plan.","Review and update the stakeholder engagement plan.","Hold another kick-off meeting with the new stakeholders to re-establish the project baseline."],"c":[2],"f":"As a result of the replacement of some key stakeholders, the project manager should Review and update the stakeholder engagement plan. The stakeholder engagement plan is updated regularly to reflect changes to the stakeholder community. Typical trigger situations requiring updates to the plan include:: When there are changes to the organization structure or within the industry and When new individuals or groups become stakeholders, current stakeholders are no longer part of the stakeholder community, or the importance of particular stakeholders to the project’s success changes. PMBOK 6th edition Page, 518","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":190}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع مسؤول عن مشروع مهم لشركتك. في مشروعك ، هناك خلافات فنية متكررة بين أعضاء الفريق والقائد. ما هي تقنية إدارة الصراع التي يجب أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع لحل هذا؟","oa":["التعاون / حل المشكلة","السحب / التجنب","القوة / التوجية","حل وسط / تسوية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":83,"q":"You are a project manager who is in charge of an important project for your company. In your project, there are frequent technical disagreements among team members and the lead. What conflict management technique should the project manager use to resolve this","t":"S","o":["Collaborate /problem solve","Withdraw/avoid","Force/direct","Compromise/reconcile"],"c":[0],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nKeyword ( frequent technical disagreements ) so the project manager should solve the proplem to reach to consensus. Collaborate/problem solve. Incorporating multiple viewpoints and insights from differing perspectives;requires a cooperative attitude and open dialogue that typically leads to consensus and commitment. This approach can result in a win-win situation.\nPMBOK 6th edition page, 349.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":191}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع حيث تكون الميزانية محدودة للغاية. تكبد تكاليف إضافية ليس خيارا. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لإدارة هذا الوضع؟","oa":["اطلب من موارد المشروع إنهاء مهامهم في وقت أقل مما كان مخططًا له في الأصل","راقب ميزانية المشروع باستمرار وتوقع أي مشاكل إن أمكن","اطلب من قسم المحاسبة إعادة توجيه جميع نفقات المشروع إلى البريد الإلكتروني لمدير المشروع","قم بتقديم طلب تغيير لجعل العميل قابل للفوترة عن جميع التكاليف الإضافية التي تكبدها للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":84,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to a project where the budget is very tight. Incurring extra costs is not an option. What should the project manager do to manage this situation","t":"S","o":["Ask the project resources to finish their assignments in less time than originally planned","Monitor the budget for the project continually and anticipate any issues if possible","Ask the accounting department to forward all project expenses to the project manager's email","File a change request to make the customer billable for all extra costs incurred for the project"],"c":[1],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nIn a project with tight budget constraints, the project manager must apply cost control techniques, including continual budget monitoring, forecasting, and early risk identification.\nThis proactive management ensures financial discipline and prevents deviations.\n\n📚 PMI References:\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n  📖 Section 7.4 – Control Costs\n  📖 Section 11.6 – Monitor Risks\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n  📖 Measurement Performance Domain\n  📖 Tailoring Considerations – Budget Constraints","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":192}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لمشروع مهم. بسبب مشكلة فنية مع المورد الفرعي ، هناك تأخير محتمل في التسليم. للبقاء في الموعد المحدد ، اقترح البائع استبدال مكون المورد الفرعي بجزء مشابه يختلف عن الجزء المنصوص عليه في مواصفات المشروع. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ماذا يجب أن تفعل بعد ذلك؟","oa":["قم بإرشاد البائع لاستخدام الجزء المتوافق مع مواصفات المشروع وتحديث الجدول","استشر خبيرًا في الموضوع  لمعرفة ما إذا كان التغيير المقترح مقبولاً","قبول الاستبدال المقترح من أجل الحفاظ على أنشطة الشراء في المسار الصحيح","الإصرار على استخدام المكون حسب مواصفات المشروع والشحن الجوي للمعدات لتخفيف التأخير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":85,"q":"You are a project manager for an important project. due to a technical issue with the sub-supplier, there is a potential delay in delivery. To stay on schedule, the vendor proposed replacing the sub- supplier’s component with a similar part that is different from the one that is stipulated in the project specifications. As a project manager, what should you do next.","t":"S","o":["Instruct the vendor to use the part that is compliant with the project specifications and update the schedule","Consult with a subject matter expert (SME) to see if the proposed change is acceptable","Accept the proposed replacement in order to keep procurement activities on track","Insist on using the component per the project specifications and air freight the equipment to mitigate the delay"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword ( What should you do next ) The project manager should Consult with a subject matter expert (SME) to see if the proposed change is acceptable or not then he can take the Right decision. If the proposed change is not acceptable, so the project manager should Instruct the vendor to use the part that is compliant with the project specifications.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":193}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع كبير لمؤسستك. لقد أبلغت مؤخرًا أن مؤشر اداء الجدولة للمشروع هو 0.85 وأن مؤشر اداء التكلفة هو 1.17. تريد التركيز على أن المشروع تحت السيطرة في مراجعة حالة المشروع التالية. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع الإبلاغ عن حالة المشروع لأصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين","oa":["استخدم مخطط باريتو ومخطط لماذا- لماذا لتوضيح أن المشروع تحت السيطرة","أبلغ عن أن المشروع متأخر عن الجدول الزمني ولكن يمكن إضافة مورد متمرس إضافي للبقاء ضمن الجدول الزمني والحفاظ على الميزانية","الإبلاغ عن أن المشروع لا يتم تتبعه كما هو متوقع ، لكنه لا يزال تحت السيطرة","قم بإعداد عرض تقديمي مفصل لأصحاب المصلحة بشأن القيمة المكتسبة ، بما في ذلك كيفية حسابها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":86,"q":"You are the project manager of a large project for your organization. You have recently reported that the project’s SPI is 0.85 and the CPI is 1.17. You want to focus that the project is under control in the next project status review. How should the project manager report the project status to key stakeholders","t":"S","o":["Use Pareto chart and why- why diagram to demonstrate that the project is under control","Report that the project is behind schedule but that an additional experienced resource can be added to stay within schedule and maintain the budget","Report that the project is not tracking as expected, but is still under control","Prepare a detailed presentation for stakeholders on earned value, including how it’s calculated"],"c":[1],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nThe project's SPI is 0.85 and the CPI is 1.17. SO the project is behind schedule and under budget. The project manager should report that the project is behind schedule but that an additional experienced resource can be added to stay within schedule and maintain the budget. 0.85","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":195}},{"qa":"أنت مخول لك الموافقة على النفقات فوق 15000 دولار. خلال الأسابيع القليلة الماضية، كنت تتفاوض على شروط وتسعير عقد مع البائع، وتريد الاحتفاظ بالتكاليف منخفضة قدر الإمكان. لقد كانت هذه عملية تفاوض صعبة للغاية. يشير الزميل إلى أن تخبر البائع أنه لا يمكنك الموافقة إلا على النفقات التي تقل عن 10000 دولار كوسيلة للحفاظ على السعر منخفض. ماذا تفعل؟","oa":["وضع موعد نهائي في إكمال التفاوض","أخبر البائع أنك مخول فقط بالموافقة على النفقات بمبلغ 10،000 دولار","اسأل عن التحكيم الملزم","لا تتبع نصيحة الزميل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":87,"q":"You are authorized to approve expenditures above $15,000. For the last several weeks, you have been negotiating the terms and pricing of a contract with a vendor, and you want to keep costs as low as possible. This has been an exceedingly difficult negotiation process. A colleague suggests you tell the vendor you can only approve expenses below $10,000 as a way to keep the price low. What do you do?","t":"S","o":["Put a deadline on the negotiation completion","Tell the vendor you are only authorized to approve expenses under $10,000","Ask for binding arbitration","Do not follow the colleague's advice"],"c":[3],"f":"Do not follow your colleague's advice. Providing false or misleading information for any reason is a violation of the PMI Code of Ethics.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Governance","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":196}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ، يعلم مدير المشروع أن المدير الوظيفي لعضو الفريق يعتقد أنه لا ينبغي له تنفيذ مهمة معينة. ما هي الوثيقة التي يجب على مدير المشروع مراجعتها لحل هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["مخطط الادوار والمسئوليات (مسؤول وخاضع للمساءلة والتشاور والإعلام)","هيكل تجزئة العمل","الهيكل التنظيمي","خطة إدارة الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":"راسي مفيدًا لضمان وضوح أدوار ومسؤوليات أعضاء الفريق ، لا سيما عندما يتكون الفريق من موارد داخلية وخارجية","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":88,"q":"During project execution, a project manager learns that a team member’s functional manager believes they shouldn’t execute a certain task. What document should the project manager review to resolve this","t":"S","o":["RACI (responsible, accountable, consult, and inform) chart","Work breakdown structure (WBS)","Organizational chart","Resource management plan"],"c":[0],"f":"The RACI chart is useful for ensuring team members' roles and responsibilities are clear, especially when the team consists of internal and external resources.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":197}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ، يغادر أحد أعضاء الفريق عالي الأداء. بعد هذه الخسارة ، يتم إجراء تدقيق جودة مخطط يشير إلى عدم تلبية معايير جودة منتج العمل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك","oa":["ضغط زمن الجدول Crashing","إنشاء مخطط السبب والنتيجة","قم بإجراء تحليل احتياطي لأداء العمل","استشر خطة إدارة الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":89,"q":"During project execution, a high-performing team member leaves. Following this loss, a planned quality audit is conducted that indicates the work product’s quality standards are unmet. What should the project manager do next","t":"S","o":["Crash the schedule","Create a cause and effect diagram","Perform a reserve analysis of the work performance","Consult the resource management plan"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword ( Following this loss ) may be the issue not only related to the leaving of the team member. Since the work product’s quality standards are unmet , the project manager should FIRST Create a cause and effect diagram to identify the main or root cause of the problem.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":198}},{"qa":"تلقى مورد الفريق ذو المهارات العالية عرض عمل وسيغادر المشروع قريبًا. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع للحفاظ على أداء المشروع أثناء إعداد عضو جديد في الفريق؟","oa":["اعرض التدريب المتقاطع والتوجيه لعضو الفريق الجديد","مشاركة مستندات المشروع مع عضو الفريق الجديد","تحفيز عضو الفريق الجديد على الأداء","قم بتسجيل المخاطر في سجل المخاطر والعمل مع عضو الفريق الجديد لتخفيفها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":90,"q":"A highly skilled team resource received a job offer and is leaving the project soon. What should the project manager do to maintain project performance while a new team member is being onboarded","t":"S","o":["Offer to cross-train and mentoring to the new team member","Share project documents with the new team member","Motivate the new team member to perform","Log a risk in the risk register and work with the new team member to mitigate it"],"c":[0],"f":"Offer to cross-train and mentoring to the new team member","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":199}},{"qa":"تلقى مدير المشروع مؤخرًا موافقة تمويل لبرنامج تدريبي لفريق المشروع بأكمله ، لكنه لم يحدد بعد الدورة التدريبية الأكثر فعالية. قدم أحد أعضاء الفريق طلب تدريب متخصص مطلوب للمشروع. كيف يجب أن يتعامل مدير المشروع مع هذا الطلب؟","oa":["رفض الطلب لأنه لا يؤثر على تسليم المشروع","الموافقة على طلب التدريب المتخصص","التحقق من صحة ما إذا كان التدريب ضمن النطاق والميزانية","أرسل طلب التغيير هذا إلى لوحة التحكم في التغيير  للموافقة عليها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":91,"q":"The project manager has recently received funding approval for a training program for the entire project team but has not yet defined the most effective training course. One team member submitted a request for specialized training that is required for the project. How should the project manager handle this request","t":"S","o":["Reject the request as it does not impact the project deliverables","Approve the request for the specialized training","Validate if the training is within scope and budget.","Send this change request to the change control board (CCB) for approval."],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\n \n\nBefore approving or rejecting the request, the project manager must validate that the training:\n\n \n Is within the approved scope\n \n \n Fits the training budget\n \n \n Is aligned with project objectives\n \n\nThis step ensures responsible use of project funds and alignment with the project’s performance needs.\n\n📚 PMI References :\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n 📖 Section 9.3 – Develop Team\n 📖 Section 4.3 – Direct and Manage Project Work\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n 📖 Team Performance Domain\n 📖 Performance Enablers – Enable individual development","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":200}},{"qa":"يقوم عضو الفريق في منظمة مختلطة بإبلاغ مدير المشروع بطريقة جديدة لتنفيذ نشاط بمدة أقصر. لم يستخدم مدير المشروع العملية الجديدة من قبل ، لكن أحد أعضاء الفريق الموثوق به يوضح أن تجربته السابقة مع العملية تؤكد فعالية العملية الجديدة. ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["تقييم الأثر وتنفيذ هذه العملية الجديدة","قم بتأجيل القرار حتى التكرار التالي","تحديث الجدول الزمني للمشروع","تحديث هيكل تجزئة العمل","قم بإشراك المدير الوظيفي لعضو الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":92,"q":"A team member in a hybrid organization informs the project manager of a new way to execute an activity with a shorter duration. The project manager has not used the new process before, but a trusted team member explains that their previous experience with the process validates the efficacy of the new process. Which two actions should the project manager take? (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Assess the impact and implement this new process.","Postpone the decision until the next sprint","Update the project schedule.","Update the work breakdown structure (WBS)","Involve the team member's functional manager."],"c":[0,2],"f":"Assess the impact and implement this new process\n\nUpdate the project schedule.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":201}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ، يقوم صاحب المخاطر بمراقبة معدل السرعة الحرج لمحرك الطاقة لإطلاق استراتيجية الاستجابة للمخاطر المحددة في النهاية. أثناء مرحلة عملية تحليل وإدارة المخاطر ، تم تحديد أن محرك الطاقة له الخصائص التالية 1600 دورة في الدقيقة (معدل في الدقيقة) – توقف عن العمل وتعطل النظام 1.500 دورة في الدقيقة (معدل لكل دقيقة) – يحذر من الحد الأقصى للمعدل مسموح بـ (معدل لكل دقيقة) – يقلل من القوة والفرامل للمحرك أي من العبارات التالية صحيح","oa":["تعد 1.600 دورة في الدقيقة هو حدث يطلق استراتيجية استجابة. 1500 دورة في الدقيقة هي مشكلة مشروع و 1400 دورة في الدقيقة من مخاطر المشروع.","تعد 1600 دورة في الدقيقة هي مشكلة في المشروع ؛ 1500 دورة في الدقيقة هي مخاطر المشروع ؛ و 1400 دورة في الدقيقة هو حدث يطلق استراتيجية استجابة","تعد 1600 دورة في الدقيقة هي مشكلة مشروع ، 1500 دورة في الدقيقة هي حدث يطلق استراتيجية استجابة و 1400 دورة في الدقيقة هي مخاطر المشروع","تعد 1600 دورة في الدقيقة من مخاطر المشروع ، و 1500 دورة في الدقيقة هي حدث يطلق استراتيجية استجابة و 1400 دورة في الدقيقة هي مشكلة مشروع."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":93,"q":"During project execution, the risk owner is monitoring the critical speed rate of a power engine to eventually trigger the defined risk-response strategy. During the risk analysis and management process phase, it was defined that the power engine has the following characteristics 1,600 rpm (rate-per-minute) -> stops working and crashes the system 1.500 rpm (rate-per-minute) -> warns of max rate allowed 1.400pm (rate-per-minute) -> reduces the power and brakes the engine Which of the following statements is correct","t":"S","o":["1.600 rpm is an event that triggers a response strategy. 1,500 rpm is a project issue and 1,400 rpm is a project risk.","1600 rpm is a project issue; 1,500 rpm is a project risk; and 1,400 rpm is an event that triggers a response strategy","1,600 rpm is a project issue, 1,500 rpm is an event that triggers a response strategy and 1,400 rpm is a project risk","1,600 rpm is a project risk, 1,500 rpm is an event that triggers a response strategy and 1,400 rpm is a project issue."],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n1,600 rpm (rate-per-minute) -> stops working and crashes the system so 1600 rpm is a project issue. 1.500 rpm (rate-per-minute) -> warns of max rate allowed so 1,500 rpm is an event that triggers a response strategy. 1.400pm (rate-per-minute) -> reduces the power and brakes the engine so 1,400 rpm is is a project risk","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":202}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع تدير مشروع بناء. يتأثر جدول المشروع سلبًا بسبب أداء أحد أعضاء الفريق. إذا اقترب موعد تسليم المشروع ، فماذا يجب أن تفعل كمدير للمشروع؟","oa":["إرشاد عضو الفريق","اكتساب موارد أكثر مهارة","قم بإزالة عضو الفريق من المشروع","قم بجدولة جلسات تدريبية لعضو الفريق لتحسين أدائه"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":94,"q":"You are a project manager managing a construction project. The project schedule is negatively impacted due to one team member’s performance. If the project’s deliverables due date are approaching, what should you do as a project manager","t":"S","o":["Mentor the team member","Acquiring a more skilled resource.","Remove the team member from the project.","Schedule training sessions for the team member to optimize his performance."],"c":[0],"f":"Mentor the team member is the best option and will be the first action to do. Schedule training sessions for the team member will take more time and the project is impacted negatively.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":203}},{"qa":"يفضل المعنيين في بعض الصناعات التعامل مع المبرمجين ومحللي النظام بشكل مباشر ، متجاوزين مديري المشاريع. هذا يعقد إدارة الموارد في المشاريع كيف ينبغي لمدير المشروع حل هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["اقتراح تنفيذ نظام معلومات إدارة مشروع جديد","استضف حدثًا لبناء الفريق لتطوير تماسك الفريق وتحسين التواصل","قم بتعزيز لاعتماد خطة إدارة الاتصالات مع فريق المشروع","طلب لقاء مع الإدارة العليا لتصعيد الموقف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":95,"q":"Stakeholders in some industries prefer to deal with programmers and system analysts directly, bypassing project managers. This complicates managing resources on projects How should a project manager solve this issue","t":"S","o":["Propose implementing a new project management information system (PMIS).","Host a team-building event to develop team cohesion and improve communication","Promote the adoption of the communications management plan with the project team.","Request a meeting with senior management to escalate the situation."],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nWhen stakeholders bypass the PM, it undermines governance and can lead to misaligned work.\nReinforcing the communications management plan ensures the right flow of information and supports authority structure.\n\n📚 PMI References\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n 📖 Section 10.1 – Plan Communications Management\n 📖 Section 13.3 – Manage Stakeholder Engagement\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n 📖 Stakeholder Performance Domain\n 📖 Communication as a Core Principle","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":204}},{"qa":"تدير شركة مشروعًا للقضاء على قناة مبيعات كانت غير مربحة على مدار السنوات الثلاث الماضية. إن أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين من منطقة أخرى ، والذي لديه روابط قديمة بقناة المبيعات تلك ، يعترض على المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["تقييم تأثير أصحاب المصلحة والمشاركة بشكل صحيح","وضع استراتيجية اتصالات محددة لـ أصحاب المصلحة","استخدم المهارات الشخصية لاكتساب مشاركة أصحاب المصلحة","تصعيد مشكلة أصحاب المصلحة إلى راعي المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":96,"q":"A company is running a project to eliminate a sales channel that has been unprofitable for the past 3 years. A key stakeholder from another area, who has legacy ties to that sales channel, objects to the project. What should the project manager do in this situation","t":"S","o":["Assess the impact of the stakeholder and engage properly","Develop a specific communications strategy for this stakeholder","Use interpersonal skills to gain stakeholder engagement","Escalate the stakeholder issue to the project sponsor"],"c":[0],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nTo resolve stakeholder resistance, the PM must begin with a stakeholder analysis. \n\nThis ensures communication and engagement strategies are aligned with the stakeholder’s influence, interest, and concerns.\n\n📚 PMI References \n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n  📖 Section 13.1 – Identify Stakeholders\n  📖 Section 13.2 – Plan Stakeholder Engagement\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n  📖 Stakeholder Performance Domain\n  📖 Principle: “Engage stakeholders proactively and respectfully”","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":205}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع بشكل أساسي على تنفيذ المشاريع. اعتمادًا على التسليم ، يكون مدير المشروع قادرًا على تقدير الجدول الزمني بناءً على المشاريع السابقة. يتلقى مدير المشروع الآن مشروعًا مختلفًا عن مشاريع التنفيذ السابقة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["استخدم حكم الخبراء لتقدير الجدول الزمني ثم اضبط الجدول مع تقدم المشروع","اسأل مكتب إدارة المشروع  عن موعد اكتمال المشروع واستخدم هذا التاريخ كجدول زمني للمشروع","قم بتقسيم المشروع إلى مهام أصغر وتقدير مدد الأنشطة","ارجع إلى المشروع السابق الذي عملوا عليه وأسس التقدير على ذلك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":97,"q":"A project manager primarily works on implementation projects. Depending on the deliverable, the project manager is able to estimate the timeline based on previous projects. The project manager now receives a project that is different from the previous implementation projects. What should the project manager do next","t":"S","o":["Use expert judgment to estimate the schedule and then adjust the schedule as the project progresses","Ask the project management office (PMO) by when the project can be completed and use that date as the project timeline","Break down the project into smaller tasks and estimate the durations of the activities.","Refer to the previous project they worked on and base the estimate on that"],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nFor a new or unfamiliar project, using bottom-up estimation by breaking work into tasks and estimating each is the most accurate and defensible method.\n\n📚 PMI References \n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n  📖 Section 6.4 – Estimate Activity Durations\n  📖 Section 6.5 – Develop Schedule\n  📖 Section 6.4.2.5 – Bottom-Up Estimating\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n  📖 Delivery Performance Domain\n  📖 Measurement and Planning Tailoring Considerations","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":206}},{"qa":"خلال تنفيذ المشروع، بدأ الفريق في إظهار سلوكيات سلبية، وأصبح غير متحمس وغير منتج.\nما الإجراء الذي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه لتحسين أداء الفريق؟","oa":["تصعيد الأداء الضعيف للمديرين الوظيفيين","تحديث خطة إشراك أصحاب المصلحة","قم بإجراء جلسة تحليل السبب الجذري","تحديد وتحليل مقاييس الأداء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":98,"q":"During the course of a project, the team develops negative group behaviors and becomes unmotivated and unproductive. What should the project manager do to improve the project team’s performance","t":"S","o":["Escalate poor performance to functional managers","Update the stakeholder engagement plan","Conduct a root cause analysis session","Define and analyze performance metrics"],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nRoot cause analysis is a best practice for diagnosing team dysfunction before reacting. It allows a tailored, effective solution that rebuilds team dynamics and restores motivation.\n\n📚 PMI References \n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition:\n  📖 Section 9.4 – Manage Team\n  📖 Section 13.3 – Manage Stakeholder Engagement\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition:\n  📖 Team Performance Domain\n  📖 Performance Enablers – Resolve team issues collaboratively","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":207}},{"qa":"عاد الرئيس التنفيذي لشركة للتو من مؤتمر حول استخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي ويرغب في أن يقوم مدير المشروع بتنفيذ هذه التكنولوجيا في المنظمة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً","oa":["ابدأ في وضع دراسة الجدوى","ابدأ بنقاط القوة والضعف والفرص والتهديدات","إشراك أصحاب المصلحة وتخصيص الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":99,"q":"A company’s CEO has just returned from a conference on the use of artificial intelligence AI and would like the project manager to implement this technology in the organization. What should the project manager do first","t":"S","o":["Start developing a business case","Start a strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, and threats. SWOT.","Engage stakeholders and allocate resources"],"c":[1],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nSWOT analysis. This technique examines the project from each of the strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, and threats (SWOT) perspectives. For risk identification, it is used to increase the breadth of identified risks by including internally generated risks. The technique starts with the identification of strengths and weaknesses of the organization, focusing on either the project, organization, or the business area in general. SWOT analysis then identifies any opportunities for the project that may arise from strengths, and any threats resulting from weaknesses. The analysis also examines the degree to which organizational strengths may offset threats and determines if weaknesses might hinder opportunities.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Artificial Intelligence","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":208}},{"qa":"شركة لديها الكثير من الخبرة في المشاريع التنبؤية. يحاول مكتب إدارة المشاريع  تنفيذ أدوات تكرارية ضمن إطار عمل إدارة المشروع ، وقد طُلب من مدير المشروع استخدام هذه الأدوات في مشروعهم الحالي. بعد التنفيذ الناجح للأدوات التكرارية ، يطلب مكتب إدارة المشروع من مدير المشروع تحديد الفوائد التي جلبتها هذه الأدوات إلى المشروع\nماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحديد البيانات المراد رصدها خلال المشروع وكذلك الأداء والأهداف المتوقعة","قم بتحديث خطة إدارة الاتصالات للنظر في اجتماعات مراجعة الأداء مع أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع","قم بإجراء مراجعات مع أصحاب المصلحة لمناقشة الفوائد المحتملة التي قد تعود على المشروع بالمقاربة","إعداد وتقديم تقرير حالة إلى اللجنة التوجيهية لتحديث مراقبة الأداء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":100,"q":"A company has a lot of experience with predictive projects The project management office (PMO) has been trying to implement iterative tools within the project management framework, and the project manager has been asked to use these tools in their current project. After the successful implementation of the iterative tools, the PMO asks the project manager to determine the benefits these tools brought to the project. What should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Determine the data to be monitored during the project as well as the expected performance and targets.","Update the communications management plan to consider performance review meetings with the project stakeholders","Conduct reviews with stakeholders to discuss the potential benefits the approach may have to the project","Prepare and submit a status report to the steering committee to update performance monitoring"],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nThe PMO is asking the project manager to evaluate the benefits of the iterative tools used. The most effective and inclusive way to do that is by reviewing the project with the stakeholders (including team members, sponsor, end users) to:\n\n \n Gather feedback on what worked well\n \n \n Identify improvements in flexibility, response time, team performance\n \n \n Discuss measurable value compared to previous predictive-only projects\n \n\nThis aligns with benefits realization management practices.\n\n📚 (PMI):\n\n \n PMBOK® Guide – 6th Edition\n  📖 Section 1.2.6 – Benefits Management Plan\n  📖 Section 4.6 – Monitor and Control Project Work\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition\n  📖 Performance Domains – Measurement, Delivery, Stakeholders","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":209}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع مختلط. يحتاج مدير المشروع إلى التأكد من تعاون جميع أعضاء الفريق وإدراكهم للتغييرات المستمرة في المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع","oa":["أرسل رسائل بريد إلكتروني يومية تتضمن حالة المشروع وقوائم المهام إلى جميع أعضاء الفريق","تشجيع التعاون على أساس يومي ، وتسهيل قنوات الاتصال المختلفة","اجتمع يوميًا مع فريق المشروع وقم بتضمين تقرير شهري عن المخاطر والمشاكل","قم بتوزيع رسالة إخبارية عن المشروع تتضمن أي تغييرات في المشروع ومعلومات المشروع المطلوبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":101,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to a hybrid project. The project manager needs to ensure all team members are collaborating and are aware of the project’s ongoing changes. What should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Send out daily emails with the project status and task lists to all team members","Encourage collaboration on a daily basis, facilitating different communication channels","Meet daily with the project team and include a monthly report on the risks and issues","Distribute a project newsletter that includes any project changes and required project information"],"c":[1],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nIn a hybrid project, communication is critical because the project involves both structured predictive planning and adaptive agile elements.\nTo maintain alignment:\n\n \n Daily collaboration ensures real-time awareness of changes.\n \n \n Multiple communication channels (chat tools, video, standups, dashboards) support diverse teams across models.\n \n \n This creates a transparent environment and keeps everyone aligned with evolving priorities.\n \n\n📌 This approach follows PMI Agile Practice Guide and PMBOK 7's Team Performance Domain.\n\n📚 PMI References:\n\n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition\n  📖 Team Performance Domain\n  📖 Communication and Collaboration Principles\n \n \n PMI Agile Practice Guide\n  📖 Section 4 – Tailoring Agile and Hybrid Environments\n  📖 Section 5.3 – Communication in Agile Teams","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":210}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع جديد لمشروع بيئي. بعد مراجعة خطة المشروع ، يلاحظ مدير المشروع أن متطلبات الصحة والسلامة لم تتم معالجتها بشكل صحيح. هذا مصدر قلق خطير ، ويريد مدير المشروع إصلاح هذه المشكلة على الفور. لماذا هذا الوضع إشكالية","oa":["مدير المشروع ملزم بالامتثال للمتطلبات التنظيمية لموقع المشروع","من الضروري استيفاء مقاييس الأداء المحددة","يجب أن يتبع مدير المشروع أصول العملية التنظيمية لصاحب العمل","يمكن أن تؤدي حوادث الإصابات أو الخسائر إلى تأخير إنجازات المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":102,"q":"A new project manager has been assigned to an environmental project. After reviewing the project plan, the project manager notices that health and safety requirements have not been properly addressed. This is a serious concern, and the project manager wants to fix this issue immediately. Why is this situation problematic","t":"S","o":["The project manager is obligated to comply with the project location's regulatory requirements","It is imperative that established performance metrics are met.","The project manager must follow their employer's organizational process assets (OPAs).","Injury or loss incidents could delay project deliverables."],"c":[0],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam \n\nThis situation is problematic because health and safety regulations are not optional—they are mandatory legal requirements.\nIf the project plan overlooks them:\n\n \n The project could be shut down by authorities.\n \n \n The organization may face legal liabilities, penalties, or accidents.\n \n \n It reflects poor risk management and governance.\n \n\nPMI emphasizes that compliance with environmental, legal, and safety standards is a fundamental responsibility of the project manager, especially in environmental projects.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Governance","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":211}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي يتطلب الجزء الأكبر من أنشطة التخطيط المقدمة مقدما، ثم تنفيذ المشروع في تمريرة واحدة","oa":["دورة الحياة التكرارية","دورة الحياة التزايدية","دورة حياة الأجايل","دورة الحياة التنبؤية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":103,"q":"Which of the following requires the bulk of planning activities to be conducted upfront and then executing the project in a single pass","t":"S","o":["Iterative life cycle","Incremental life cycle","Agile life cycle","Predictive life cycle"],"c":[3],"f":"Predictive life cycle, also known as the traditional approach, requires the bulk of the planning to happen upfront and then executing the project in a single pass. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 17]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":212}},{"qa":"يدعو مدير المشروع الرئيس التنفيذي للشركة والراعي وأعضاء الفريق وممثل العميل الخارجي إلى اجتماع لمراجعة خطة إدارة المشروع. يبدأ مدير المشروع في تقديم الميزانية لكن الرئيس التنفيذي يطلب فجأة إنهاء الاجتماع. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذا الموقف","oa":["مراجعة خطة إدارة التكلفة مع المشاركين الداخليين والمدير التنفيذي قبل دعوة ممثل العميل الخارجي إلى الاجتماع","أجرى تحليل السبب الجذري مع ممثل العميل الخارجي ووثق النتائج في سجل الدروس المستفادة","أرسل شرائح العرض التقديمي إلى المشاركين الداخليين أولاً ثم إلى ممثل العميل الخارجي قبل الاجتماع","مراجعة خطة إدارة الاتصالات قبل دعوة ممثل العميل الخارجي إلى الاجتماع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":104,"q":"The project manager invites the company CEO, sponsor, team members, and external client representative to a meeting to review the project management plan. The project manager starts presenting the budget but the CEO suddenly asks to end the meeting. What should the project manager have done to avoid this situation?","t":"S","o":["Reviewed the cost management plan with internal participants and CEO prior to inviting an external client representative to the meeting","Performed a root cause analysis with the external client representative and documented the findings in the lessons learned register","Sent the presentation slides to internal participants first and then to the external client representative prior to the meeting","Reviewed the communications management plan before inviting an external client representative to the meeting"],"c":[3],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nThis situation reflects a communication planning failure. The CEO likely expected the budget to be reviewed internally first before it was shown to the client.\nBy reviewing the communications management plan, the project manager would have:\n\n \n Identified the proper flow of information\n \n \n Scheduled sensitive content (like cost) for internal review before external sharing\n \n \n Prevented reputational or trust damage\n \n\nThis aligns with PMI’s emphasis on managing stakeholder expectations and tailoring communication strategies.\n\n📚 PMI References \n\n \n PMBOK® Guide – Sixth Edition\n  📖 Section 10.1 – Plan Communications Management\n  📖 Section 13.2 – Plan Stakeholder Engagement\n \n \n PMBOK® Guide – Seventh Edition\n  📖 Communication and Stakeholder Principles","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":213}},{"qa":"في مشروع مختلط ، يواجه فريق المشروع الكثير من العقبات والحواجز من بعض أصحاب المصلحة. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ما الذي يجب عليك فعله لتحسين أداء المشروع","oa":["تمكين أعضاء الفريق من إزالة العقبات والحواجز","اطلب من أصحاب المصلحة التواصل مع مدير المشروع وليس مباشرة مع الفريق","أضف أدوات حظر إلى سجل المشكلات وخطة إدارة المخاطر","معالجة وإزالة العقبات والحواجز للفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":105,"q":"In a hybrid project, a project team is facing a lot of obstacles and blockers from some stakeholders. As a project manager, what should you do to improve project performance","t":"S","o":["Empower the team members to remove obstacles and blockers","Ask stakeholders to communicate with the project manager and not directly with the team","Add blockers to the issue log and risk management plan","Address and remove obstacles and blockers for the team"],"c":[3],"f":"As the project manager, you need to demonstrate the type of leadership that facilitates collaboration among the team and stakeholders, manages conflict, removes obstacles, and supports the team's performance. Removing distraction, randomization, and other confusion enables the project team to be more effective and efficient. Project managers can take on most of the burden of addressing and removing impediments so the team can do their best work on the project to achieve its desired objectives.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":214}},{"qa":"لقد تم تعيينك كمدير مشروع لمشروع برمجي. قبل إنشاء منتجك ، قررت إنشاء نموذج أولي لضمان قبوله لأصحاب المصلحة. هذا مثال على","oa":["تجنب الخطر","تخفيف المخاطر","قبول الخطر","تحويل المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":106,"q":"You have been assigned as a project manager to a software project. Before creating your product, you decided to create a prototype to ensure that it is acceptable to stakeholders. This is an example of","t":"S","o":["Risk avoidance","Risk mitigation","Risk acceptance","Risk Transference"],"c":[1],"f":"In risk mitigation, action is taken to reduce the probability of occurrence and/or impact of a threat. Early mitigation action is often more effective than trying to repair the damage after the threat has occurred. Adopting less complex processes, conducting more tests, or choosing a more stable seller are examples of mitigation actions. Mitigation may involve prototype development to reduce the risk of scaling up from a bench-scale model of a process or product.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":215}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع بمراجعة وثائق المتطلبات التي يكونون مسؤولين عن العمل عليها. ما هي عناصر المشروع التي يمكنهم الرجوع إليها لمعرفة العلاقة بين المتطلبات وأهداف العمل والمشروع؟","oa":["مصفوفة تتبع المتطلبات","خطة إدارة النطاق","مخطط RACI","ميثاق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":107,"q":"The project team is reviewing the requirements documentation that they are responsible for working on. Which project artifact can they reference to see the connection between the requirements and the business and project objectives","t":"S","o":["Requirements traceability matrix","Scope management plan","RACI Chart","Project charter"],"c":[0],"f":"The requirements traceability matrix is a grid that links product requirements from their origin to the deliverables that satisfy them. The implementation of a requirements traceability matrix helps ensure that each requirement adds business value by linking it to the business and project objectives.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":216}},{"qa":"يستخدم مشروع هجين للانتقال من النظام الحالي إلى نظام جديد ومحسن. الخطة هي نقل النظام على مراحل. ومع ذلك ، يشكو فريق العمليات من أنهم غير مستعدين لبدء دعم النظام الجديد.\nكيف يجب أن يتعامل مدير المشروع بفعالية مع هذا الموقف؟","oa":["قم بإعداد وثائق مفصلة لمشاركتها مع فريق العمليات أثناء إغلاق المشروع","أنشئ سجل الدروس المستفادة ليشمل تدريب فريق العمليات للمشاريع المستقبلية","قم بتغيير خطة إدارة المشروع لإضافة مرحلة نهائية لتسليم المنتج إلى فريق العمليات","قم بتضمين جلسات نقل المعرفة بين فرق المشروع والعمليات في كل مرحلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":108,"q":"A hybrid project is used to transit from a current system to a new and enhanced system. The plan is to transit the system in stages. However, the operations team is complaining that they are not ready to start supporting the new system. How should the project manager effectively approach this situation","t":"S","o":["Prepare detailed documentation to be shared with the operations team during project closure","Create lessons learned register to include operations team training for future projects","Change the project management plan to add a final stage for product handoff to the operations team.","Include knowledge transfer sessions between the project and operations teams at every stage"],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword (The plan is to transit the system in stages )\n\nSO the project manager can Include knowledge transfer sessions between the project and operations teams at every stage to effectively approach this situation","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":217}},{"qa":"لقد تلقيت دعوة من زميلك لحضور أحد الاجتماعات الاحتياطية الخاصة بالمشروع. لاحظت أن الفريق لديه مخطط كبير على الحائط ، مقسم إلى أقسام مثل 'جاهز' و 'قيد التطوير' و 'قيد الاختبار' و 'مكتمل'. ما الأداة التي يستخدمونها","oa":["الرسم البياني المحترق","مخطط الأحتراق","لوحة كانبان","غرفة الحرب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":109,"q":"You have been invited by your colleague to attend one of the project standup meetings. You notice that the team has got a big chart on a wall, divided into sections such as “Ready”, “In Development”, “Being Tested”, and “Completed”. What tool are they using","t":"S","o":["Burnup chart","Burndown chart","Kanban board","War room"],"c":[2],"f":"This is an example of Kanban board. A Kanban board provides a means to visualize the flow of work, make impediments easily visible, and allow flow to be managed by adjusting the work in process limits. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 31]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":218}},{"qa":"يكافح مدير المشروع لفريق افتراضي لتتبع التقدم والإنتاجية لأن الفريق منتشر في عدة مناطق زمنية. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتحسين الاتصال","oa":["إنشاء بوابة لتبادل المعلومات","إنشاء وتحديث سجل القضية.","تحديث سجل الدروس المستفادة.","قم بإعداد لوحة كانبان"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":110,"q":"The project manager for a virtual team is struggling to track progress and productivity because the team is spread out over several time zones. What should the project manager do to enhance communication","t":"S","o":["Establish an information-sharing portal.","Create and update the issue log.","Update the lessons learned register.","Set up a Kanban board ."],"c":[0],"f":"Communication technology is important in addressing the team development issues in colocated and virtual teams. It helps build a harmonious environment for the collocated team and a better understanding for the virtual team, especially those working in different time zones. Examples of communication technology that may be used are: Shared portal. A shared repository for information sharing (e.g., website, collaboration software or intranet) is effective for virtual project teams.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":219}},{"qa":"إن إنشاء خطة تقدير بأوقات محددة للمكافآت يضمن أن يتم الاعتراف ولا يتم نسيانه. عادة ما يكون هذا جزءًا من","oa":["خطة إدارة شركة الموارد البشرية","خطة إدارة الموارد","خطة إشراك أصحاب المصلحة","خطة إدارة الاتصالات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":111,"q":"Creating a recognition plan with established times for rewards ensures that recognition takes place and is not forgotten. This is usually part of the.","t":"S","o":["HR Company Management plan","Resource Management Plan","Stakeholder engagement plan","Communications Management Plan"],"c":[1],"f":"The plan for rewards and recognition is part of the Resource Management plan. The recognition and rewards are developed as part of the Plan Resource Management process.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":220}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق الأمان بإخطار مدير المشروع بتغيير في إجراءات الأمان. يستخدم مدير المشروع عملية التحكم في التغيير لتحديث خطة إدارة المشروع. بعد رؤية التغيير ، يشتكي أحد أصحاب المصلحة من أنه لم يكن ضروريًا لأن المشروع قد اكتمل تقريبًا. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع","oa":["قم بإنشاء طلب تغيير لعكس التغيير حتى يتم التوصل إلى توافق في الآراء.","تجاهل مخاوف أصحاب المصلحة واتبع الإجراءات الجديدة.","إقناع أصحاب المصلحة بالفوائد الناتجة عن التغيير.","أضف خطرًا إلى سجل المخاطر لتتبع تأثير خلاف أصحاب المصلحة."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":112,"q":"A security team notifies a project manager of a change in security procedures. The project manager uses the change control process to update the project management plan. After seeing the change, a stakeholder complains that it was unnecessary because the project is almost complete. What should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Create a change request to reverse the change until a consensus is reached.","Ignore the stakeholder’s concern and follow the new procedures.","Convince the stakeholder of the benefits resulting from the change.","Add a risk to the risk register to track the impact of stakeholder disagreement."],"c":[2],"f":"The project manager used the change control process to update the project management plan because its a very important change and necessary for the project. The project manager with the team member have evaluated the impact of this change on project constraints and then approved by the CCB. SO he should Convince the stakeholder of the benefits resulting from the change.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":221}},{"qa":"يتغيب أحد أعضاء الفريق عن اجتماع المشروع دون الموافقة عليه وقد تمت معاقبته على النحو المحدد في القواعد الأساسية. يصر عضو الفريق هذا ، بالإضافة إلى أعضاء الفريق الآخرين ، على أن هذه هي المرة الأولى التي يرون فيها هذه القاعدة المتعلقة بالمشروع ولا يوافقون على العقوبة. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذا الموقف","oa":["استخدم أسلوب القيادة الكاريزمية","تأكد من أن أعضاء الفريق يدعمون جميع القرارات بشكل كامل","تأكد من تطوير ميثاق الفريق من قبل أعضاء الفريق","توزيع ميثاق المشروع على جميع أعضاء الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":113,"q":"A team member misses a project meeting without it being approved and has been penalized as defined in the ground rules. This team member, as well as other team members, insist that it is the first time they have seen this rule regarding the project and they do not agree with the penalty What should the project manager have done to avoid this situation","t":"S","o":["Used a charismatic leadership style","Ensured the team members are fully supportive of all decisions","Ensured the team charter was developed by the team members","Distributed the project charter to all team members"],"c":[2],"f":"The correct answer is : Ensured the team charter was developed by the team members. The team charter is a document that enables the team to establish its values, agreements, and practices as it performs its work together. Ideally the charter should be produced by the team, or at least with the team’s active participation.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":222}},{"qa":"يرى بعض زملائك في إدارة المشروع أن مهارات استخدام برامج القيادة وإدارة المشاريع هي بعض المهارات المهمة التي يجب أن يتمتع بها مدير المشروع. حسب مثلث المواهب لمعهد إدارة المشاريع . أي مما يلي يعكس جميع كفاءات مدير المشروع","oa":["المعرفة والأداء والشخصية","إدارة المشاريع وإدارة الأفراد والأعمال والاستراتيجية","إدارة المشاريع الفنية والقيادة والاستراتيجية وإدارة الأعمال","الخبرة الإدارية ، الخبرة العملية ، الخبرة في المجال"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":114,"q":"Some of your project management peers are of the opinion that leadership and project management software usage skills are some of the important skills a project manager should have. As per PMI Talent Triangle. which of the below reflects all the competencies of a project manager","t":"S","o":["Knowledge, performance, personality","Project management, people management, Business and strategy","Technical project management, leadership , strategic and business management","Management experience, process expertise, domain experience"],"c":[2],"f":"This is the correct answer as per PMI Talent Triangle.\n\nTechnical project management, leadership , strategic and business management","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":223}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي سيتطلب على الأرجح طلب تغيير معتمد قبل التمكن من استيعاب التغيير؟ (اختر ثلاثة)","oa":["يتجاوز المشروع الميزانية ، ويحتاج خط الأساس للتكلفة إلى المراجعة ليعكس الواقع","تم تقديم اقتراح للتغيير من نهج تنبؤي إلى نهج تطوير مختلط.","يجب أن تنعكس الحالة المنقحة للعديد من المهام في جدول المشروع.","أوصى أحد كبار التنفيذيين بتحديث وصف دورة حياة المشروع ليشمل مرحلة إضافية.","تم للتو تحديد صاحب مصلحة جديد ويحتاج إلى إضافته إلى سجل أصحاب المصلحة."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":115,"q":"Which of the following will most likely require an approved change request before the change can be accommodated? (Choose Three)","t":"M","o":["The project is running well over budget, and the cost baseline needs to be revised to reflect reality.","A suggestion has been made to change from predictive to a hybrid development approach.","The revised status of several tasks needs to be reflected in the project schedule.","A senior executive has recommended updating the project life cycle description to include an additional phase.","A new stakeholder has just been identified and needs to be added to the stakeholder register."],"c":[0,1,3],"f":"A suggestion has been made to change from predictive to a hybrid development approach.\n A senior executive has recommended updating the project life cycle description to include an additional phase.\n The project is running well over budget, and the cost baseline needs to be revised to reflect reality.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":224}},{"qa":"في مشروعك ، يسلم المورد المعدات التي لا تلبي متطلبات العملاء. بعد التحقيق ، قررت أن المورد أساء فهم المتطلبات ووضع افتراضات غير صحيحة دون توضيحها مع العميل. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ما نوع طرق الاتصال التي كان يجب عليك استخدامها لتجنب ذلك","oa":["دفع التواصل","الاتصال اليدوي","سحب التواصل","التواصل التفاعلي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":116,"q":"In your project, a supplier delivers equipment that fails to meet customer requirements. after the investigation, you determined that the supplier misunderstood the requirements and make incorrect assumptions without clarifying them with the customer. As a project manager, what type of communication methods should you have used to avoid this","t":"S","o":["Push communication","Manual communication","Pull communication","Interactive communication"],"c":[3],"f":"( Interactive communication ) is The best communication methods can be using to avoid the supplier misunderstood the requirements with the customer.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":225}},{"qa":"زادت نفقات مشروعك في الربع الأخير بسبب المساحة المكتبية المطلوبة للموظفين ,وبسبب سفر بعض الفريق. ماذا يمكنك أن تفعل من منظور تخطيط إدارة الموارد لمعالجة هذا","oa":["خطط لدمج بيئة فريق افتراضية ، إذا لم تكن قد فعلت ذلك بالفعل","استخدام مؤتمرات الفيديو والاجتماعات على شبكة الإنترنت","إحضار جميع أعضاء فريق المشروع للعمل من مكان واحد","تقليل تكاليف السفر والمعدات المكتبية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":117,"q":"Your project expense has increased in the last quarter due to the required office space for personnel and some of their travel. What can you do from a resource management planning perspective to address this","t":"S","o":["Plan to incorporate a virtual team environment, if not done already","Use video conferencing and web based meetings","Bring all project team members to work from one location","Reduce the travel and office equipment cost"],"c":[0],"f":"Virtual team environment helps to move forward with projects that would have been canceled due to travel expenses, and save expenses of the office and physical equipment for employees. In this arrangement, project team members need not work face to face, and facilities like video conferencing may be used.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":226}},{"qa":"يبدأ مدير المشروع مشروعًا باستخدام نهج مختلط. قرر العميل إجراء تغيير كبير في تصميم المشروع. تمت الموافقة على هذا التغيير. يرفض قائد فريق البرنامج الذي من المفترض أن يطور البرنامج الالتزام بمواعيد التسليم ، مدعيا أنهم يعملون باستخدام نهج رشيق ولا يمكنهم الالتزام بتاريخ التسليم النهائي. يعتمد فريق الأجهزة على هذا البرنامج لتطوير الجزء الخاص بهم من المنتج. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ماذا يجب أن تفعل","oa":["قم بتصعيد هذا إلى الإدارة العليا واطلب المساعدة لحل المشكلة","فرض مواعيد التسليم على قائد فريق البرنامج وإخطار المدير الوظيفي بالموقف","اطلب من قائد فريق البرنامج استخدام نهج تنبؤي والالتزام بتاريخ التسليم","تحديث سجل المخاطر بهذه المخاطر ومراقبتها حسب خطة إدارة المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":118,"q":"A project manager is starting a project using a hybrid approach. The customer decided on a major change for the project design. This change was approved. The software team leader who is supposed to develop the software refuses to commit to delivery dates, claiming that they work using an agile approach and cannot commit to the final delivery date. The hardware team depends on this software to develop their part of the product. As a project manager, what should you do","t":"S","o":["Escalate this to higher management and ask for help to resolve the issue.","Impose the delivery dates on the software team leader and notify the functional manager about the situation.","Ask the software team leader to use a predictive approach and commit to the delivery date.","Update the risk register with this risk and monitor it according to the risk management plan."],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword ( using a hybrid approach ) .. hybrid approach is a combination of predictive, iterative, incremental, and/or agile. The project manager should ask the software team leader to use a predictive approach and commit to the delivery date. and can follow agile to develop The hardware.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":227}},{"qa":"لقد بدأ برنامج جدولة المشروع للتو في العمل مع مشروعك وأصدر تقارير معيبة لدورتي المحاسبة الماضيتين. أنت الآن تتحقق من سياسات شركتك قبل الانتقال  إلى الخطوة التالية بالإجراءات التصحيحية. في أي عملية أنت الآن","oa":["التحقق من النطاق","التحكم بالنطاق","أداء تدقيق الجودة","إدارة الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":119,"q":"Your project scheduler has just started working with your project and has produced defective reports for the past two accounting cycles. You are now checking your company policies before moving to the next step with the corrective actions. In which process are you now","t":"S","o":["Validate Scope","Control Scope","Perform Quality Audit","Manage Quality"],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword ( checking your company policies ) its - Audit technique- is a structured, independent process used to determine if project activities comply with organizational and project policies, processes, and procedures.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":228}},{"qa":"هناك خلاف بين أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع يجعل مدير المشروع يواجه صعوبة في الحصول على الموافقة على متطلبات المشروع. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ما الذي يجب عليك فعله أولاً لتسهيل الموافقة على متطلبات المشروع","oa":["قم بإجراء تحليل أصحاب المصلحة","راجع ميثاق المشروع","تحديد مصدر الخلاف","أنشطة بناء الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":120,"q":"There is disagreement among the project stakeholders makes the project manager having difficulty obtaining approval of the project requirements. As a project manager, what should you do first to facilitate the approval of project requirements","t":"S","o":["Conduct a stakeholder analysis","Review the project charter","Identify the source of the disagreement","Team building Activities"],"c":[2],"f":"The project manager should first identify the source of the disagreement to facilitate the approval of project requirements","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":229}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في مشروع مهم لمؤسستك. طلب منك راعي مشروعك إنهاء المشروع في أقرب وقت ممكن. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، لتحفيز فريق مشروعك ، أي مما يلي سوف تستخدمه","oa":["التدريب","أعد جدولة الخطوط الأساسية لإنهاء المشروع مبكرًا","أداء وضمان الجودة","نظام التقدير والمكافآت"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":121,"q":"You are a project manager in a critical project for your organization. Your project sponsor has asked you to finish the project early as soon as possible. As a project manager, to motivate your project team, which of the following will you use","t":"S","o":["Training","Reschedule baselines to finish the project early","Perform quality assurance","Recognition and rewards system"],"c":[3],"f":"Very important question in real exam\n\nAs a project manager, to motivate your project team to finish the project early, you should conduct the recognition and rewards system.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":230}},{"qa":"طلب راعي المشروع مؤخرًا أن يبدأ البائع في العمل نحو تبني نهج مختلط. استجابةً لذلك ، قام البائع بتعيين مدير مشروع من ذوي الخبرة في أجايل للمشروع ما الذي يحتاج مدير المشروع إلى القيام به لجعل الفريق يعمل بطريقة تعاونية","oa":["خصص الوقت لتوجيه الفريق","حدد أي ثغرات في التدريب","اطلب مكتب إدارة المشروع  لفريق من الموجهين","قم بتحديث سجل المشكلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":122,"q":"The project sponsor recently requested that a vendor begins working toward adopting a hybrid approach. In response, the vendor hired a project manager experienced in agile for the project. What does that project manager need to do to make the team work in a collaborative way.","t":"S","o":["Allocate time to mentor the team","Identify any training gaps","Request the project management office (PMO) for a team of mentors","Update the issue log"],"c":[0],"f":"Allocate time to mentor the team . A type of leadership style used in agile and other types of projects which encourages the self-definition, self-discovery, and self-awareness of team members by listening, coaching, and providing an environment that allows them to grow.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":231}},{"qa":"تتبع الشركة نهجًا تنبؤيًا وتنتظر دائمًا اكتمال المرحلة السابقة قبل تقييم جودة منتجاتها. تم تعيين مدير مشروع جديد لديه خبرة في الأساليب المختلطة للمساعدة في زيادة كفاءة عملية إدارة الجودة في الشركة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع الجديد لمعالجة تحسينات العملية","oa":["مناقشة تحسين العملية مع مكتب إدارة المشروع  يؤدي إلى تحديث إطار عمل تسليم المشروع","افهم سياق العملية وترابطها من أعضاء الفريق ثم حدد التحسينات","حدد قاعدة أساسية للامتثال لمعايير الجودة واطلب من أعضاء الفريق تطبيقها","تواصل مع العملية كما هي. وانتظر حتى المرحلة التالية لاقتراح أي تحسينات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":123,"q":"A company has been following a predictive approach and always waits for the preceding phase to be completed before evaluating the quality of its products. A new project manager with experience in hybrid approaches has been assigned to help increase the efficiency of the company’s quality management process. What should the new project manager do to address the process improvements","t":"S","o":["Discuss the process improvement with the project management office (PMO) lead to update the project delivery framework","Understand the context and interdependencies of the process from the team members and then define improvements","Define a ground-rule to comply with the quality standard and ask the team members to apply it.","Continue with the process as is. and wait until the next phase to suggest any improvements"],"c":[1],"f":"As a new project manager, you should first meet with the team and discuss the current status and how processes are being implemented before suggesting any new modifications and then define improvements","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":232}},{"qa":"ستة فرق أجايل تعمل معًا على منتج. عندما تم دمج جميع الفرق على مستوى المنتج ، تمت ملاحظة العديد من مشكلات التكامل. تم رفض التقدم الإجمالي في إصدار المنتج ولن يكون المحتوى قادرًا على الإنجاز. ما الذي كان يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع بشكل مختلف","oa":["أجرى مجموعة من الــ سكرام (ميتا سكرام/ سكروم الشاملة) على أساس منتظم لمساعدة الفرق على إزالة العوائق","قم بإجراء جلسة عبر الإنترنت حول مفهوم التكامل لتعليم الفرق","تشكيل فريق مراقبة الجودة لاختبار جميع العناصر الواردة من كل فريق في نهاية كل تكرار","ضمان التكامل المتكرر والمستمر للعمل للحصول على التغذية الراجعة المبكرة والتعلم المستمر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":124,"q":"Six agile teams working together on a product. When all of the teams integrated at the product level, many integration issues were observed. The overall product release progress declined and the content will not be able to be accomplished. What should the project manager have done differently","t":"S","o":["Performed a scrum of scrum on a regular basis to help the teams remove impediments","Conduct an online session on the integration concept to teach the teams","Formed a quality control team to test all items coming from each team at the end of each iteration","Ensured frequent and continuous integration of work to obtain early feedback and continuous learning"],"c":[0],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nScrum of Scrums (SoS), also known as “meta Scrum,” is a technique used when two or more Scrum teams consisting of three to nine members each need to coordinate their work instead of one large Scrum team. A representative from each team attends a meeting with the other team representative(s), potentially daily but typically two to three times a week. The daily meeting is conducted similar to the daily standup in Scrum where the representative reports completed work, next set of work, any current impediments, and potential upcoming impediments that might block the other team(s). The goal is to ensure the teams are coordinating work and removing impediments to optimize the efficiency of all the teams. Agile Practice guide page, 111","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":233}},{"qa":"تتبع الشركة نهجًا تنبؤيًا وتنتظر دائمًا اكتمال المرحلة السابقة قبل تقييم جودة منتجاتها. تم تعيين مدير مشروع جديد لديه خبرة في الأساليب المختلطة للمساعدة في زيادة كفاءة عملية إدارة الجودة في الشركة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع الجديد لمعالجة تحسينات العملية","oa":["حدد قاعدة أساسية للامتثال لمعايير الجودة واطلب من أعضاء الفريق تطبيقها","افهم سياق العملية وترابطها من أعضاء الفريق ثم حدد التحسينات","تواصل مع العملية كما هي. وانتظر حتى المرحلة التالية لاقتراح أي تحسينات","مناقشة تحسين العملية مع مكتب إدارة المشروع  يؤدي إلى تحديث إطار عمل تسليم المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":125,"q":"A company has been following a predictive approach and always waits for the preceding phase to be completed before evaluating the quality of its products. A new project manager with experience in hybrid approaches has been assigned to help increase the efficiency of the company’s quality management process. What should the new project manager do to address the process improvements","t":"S","o":["Define a ground-rule to comply with the quality standard and ask the team members to apply it","Understand the context and interdependencies of the process from the team members and then define improvements","Continue with the process as is. and wait until the next phase to suggest any improvements","Discuss the process improvement with the project management office (PMO) lead to update the project delivery framework"],"c":[1],"f":"As a new project manager, you should first meet with the team and discuss the current status and how processes are being implemented before suggesting any new modifications and then define improvements","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":232}},{"qa":"أنفقت شركة معمارية قدرًا كبيرًا من الوقت والجهد في إنشاء التصميم والمخططات للمبنى. كان عليهم شراء المواد وتوظيف مستشارين وعملوا في هذا المشروع لمدة ستة أشهر. لقد أرسلوا جميع فواتير الأموال التي أنفقوها على العمل ، بالإضافة إلى فاتورة برسوم قدرها 5000 دولار. ما هو نوع العقد هذا","oa":["سعر ثابت مع تعديلات الأسعار الاقتصادية","الوقت والمواد","التكلفة مع حوافز","التكلفة القابلة للأسترداد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":126,"q":"An architectural firm has spent a great deal of time and effort creating the design and blueprints for the building. They had to purchase materials and hire consultants and have been working on this project for six months. They have submitted all the invoices for the money they have spent on the work, as well as an invoice for the fee of $5,000. What type of contract was this","t":"S","o":["Fixed price with economic price adjustments (FPEPA)","Time and materials","Cost-plus incentive fee (CPIF)","Cost-reimbursable"],"c":[3],"f":"This example of Cost plus fixed fee (CPFF). The seller is reimbursed for all allowable costs for performing the contract work and receives a fixed-fee payment calculated as a percentage of the initial estimated project costs.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":235}},{"qa":"ستتحول منظمة كبيرة من بيئة تنبؤية إلى منهجيات رشيقة. في حالته الحالية ، يتم تقسيم العمل في المنظمة إلى اقسام إدارية منعزلة ، وأفضل وصف للموظفين كمساهمين متخصصين. ما هي أفضل استراتيجية لهذا التحول السريع","oa":["تقديم بعض التقنيات الرشيقة لمشروع كبير ومعقد","حدد موعدًا ثابتًا لجميع المشاريع للانتقال من تنبؤي إلى رشيق","استخدم دورات الحياة الهجينة كاستراتيجية انتقالية من تنبؤي إلى رشيق","صمم المشاريع بحيث يكون النطاق ثابتًا مع تغير الوقت والتكلفة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":127,"q":"A large organization will transform from a predictive environment to agile methodologies. In its current state, the work in the organization is decomposed into departmental silos, and the employees are best described as specialized contributors. What is the best strategy for this agile transformation","t":"S","o":["Introduce some agile techniques to a large and complex project","Establish a fixed date for all projects to transition from predictive to agile","Use hybrid life cycles as a transition strategy from predictive to agile","Tailor projects so that the scope is fixed with time and cost being variable"],"c":[2],"f":"A large and complex organization will likely require a gradual approach to transition from predictive to agile methodologies. Incorporating elements of agile within the existing predictive framework will allow for the gradual adoption and acceptance of agile methods","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":236}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع هو المسؤول عن مشروع مهم ، ويطلب العميل التغييرات على أساس مستمر. نفذ مدير المشروع طلبات التغيير دون توثيق طلبات التغيير لإرضاء العميل. أدرك مدير المشروع أن مشروعه تجاوز التكاليف. ما الذي كان يمكن أن يفعله مدير المشروع لمنع تجاوز التكاليف","oa":["خطة إدارة الجدول","خطة إدارة المشروع","خطة إدارة التكلفة","خطة إدارة التغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":128,"q":"A project manager is in charge of an important project, and the customer requests changes on a continuous basis. The project manager implemented the change requests without documenting the change requests to satisfy the customer. The project manager realized that his project exceeded costs. What could have been done by the project manager to prevent cost overruns","t":"S","o":["Schedule management plan","Project management plan","Cost management plan","Change management plan"],"c":[3],"f":"The correct answer is (change management plan), which provides guidance for managing the change control process and documentation of a formal change control board. If the project manager implements change requests without analyzing the impact of changes on time, cost and quality, it will increase risks in the project and lead to increased costs (cost overruns).","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":237}},{"qa":"بدأ للتو مدير مشروع يعمل مع شركة مالية تتجنب المخاطرة مشروعًا جديدًا. يشعر راعي المشروع بالقلق الشديد من أن المشروع قد يتجاوز الميزانية ويتطلع إلى مدير المشروع للتأكيد على أن هذا لن يحدث. من أجل التخفيف من مخاوف الراعي ، ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع","oa":["قم بتشغيل محاكاة مونت كارلو","استخدم تحليل البيانات التاريخية","إنشاء مصفوفة الاحتمالات والتأثير","قم بإجراء تحليل لنقاط القوة والضعف والفرص والتهديدات (سوات)"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":129,"q":"A project manager working with a risk-averse financial firm has just started a new project. The project sponsor is extremely concerned that the project may run over budget and is looking to the project manager for confirmation that this won’t happen. In order to alleviate the sponsor’s concerns, what should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Run a Monte Carlo simulation","Use historical data analysis","Create the probability and impact matrix.","Perform a strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, and threats (SWOT) analysis"],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should first identify the risks, update the risk register then analyze the risks... SWOT analysis is one of the tools and techniques in identifying the risk process to identify the strengths and weaknesses of the organization, focusing on the project, organization, or business area in general. The SWOT analysis then identifies any project opportunities that may arise from strengths and any threats arising from weaknesses. The analysis also examines the degree to which organizational strengths may offset threats and determines whether weaknesses may hinder opportunities","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":238}},{"qa":"نظرًا للتطور التكنولوجي الحديث ، يلزم إجراء تغيير كبير في تصميم المنتج. سيتطلب هذا التغيير زيادة بنسبة 50 في المائة في ميزانية المشروع. يقوم مدير المشروع بإعداد تقرير مفصل وإرساله بالبريد الإلكتروني إلى راعي المشروع ، ويقر الراعي باستلام التقرير. ماذا يجب أن يفعل بن بعد ذلك","oa":["قم بتحديث خطة إدارة المشروع","تحديث الجدول الزمني للمشروع","انتظر الموافقة الرسمية على الميزانية الجديدة","قم بتحديث أساس التكلفة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":130,"q":"Due to a recent technological development, a significant change in the product design is required. This change would require a 50 percent increase in the project budget. The project manager prepares a detailed report and emails it to the project sponsor, and the sponsor acknowledges the receipt of the report. What should Ben do next","t":"S","o":["Update the Project management plan","Update the project schedule","Wait for the formal approval of the new budget","Update the Cost Baseline"],"c":[2],"f":"","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":239}},{"qa":"لقد قمت بإرسال أساس التكلفة إلى الراعي. بعد المراجعة ، يخبرك الراعي أن المبلغ الذي قدرته لشهر معين هو أكثر من الأموال التي يمكن للراعي صرفها لك لهذا الشهر. ماذا تعتقد أن الراعي سوف ينصحك بعد ذلك","oa":["لتقليل تقديرات التكلفة للأنشطة لذلك الشهر","لتحفيز فريق المشروع على القيام بعمل ذلك الشهر دون دفع كامل مقابل ذلك","لإعادة جدولة العمل ذلك الشهر","لإزالة بعض نطاق العمل لذلك الشهر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":131,"q":"You have submitted the cost baseline to the sponsor. After a review, the sponsor tells you that the amount you have estimated for a certain month is more than the funds the sponsor can disburse you for that month. What do you think the sponsor will advise you next","t":"S","o":["To reduce the cost estimates of the activities for that month","To motivate the project team do the work of that month without being fully paid for it","To reschedule the work of that month","To remove some of the work scope for that month"],"c":[2],"f":"Rescheduling work for the period where funds are lower than estimated will be required in this situation","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":240}},{"qa":"أنت تدير مشروع بناء معقد وتطلب جدولاً مدته خمس سنوات لهذا المشروع. على الرغم من جلسات العصف الذهني المتعددة مع فريق المشروع ، إلا أنك تكافح لتقديم تفاصيل خطة إدارة المشروع. يؤدي هذا إلى تأخير الحصول على الموافقات على خطة إدارة المشروع. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ما الذي كان يجب عليك فعله لتجنب هذا الموقف","oa":["الاستعانة بخبير في الموضوع لتطوير الجدول الزمني المفصل.","تستخدم تقنية تخطيط الموجة المتدحرجة لتخطيط النشاط.","إنشاء مخطط جانت عالي المستوى لتمثيل الحدث الرئيسي فقط.","تقنيات التقسيم المستخدمة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":132,"q":"You are managing a complex construction project and you request a five-year schedule for this project. Although multiple brainstorming sessions with your project team, you struggle to provide detail for the project management plan. This causes a delay in obtaining the project management plan approvals. As a project manager, what should you have done to avoid this situation","t":"S","o":["Used subject matter expert to develop the detailed schedule.","Used the rolling wave planning technique for activity planning.","Created a high level Gantt chart to represent the milestone only.","Used decomposition techniques."],"c":[1],"f":"Rolling wave planning is an iterative planning technique in which the work to be accomplished in the near term is planned in detail, while work further in the future is planned at a higher level. During early strategic planning when information is less defined, work packages may be decomposed to the known level of detail. As more is known about the upcoming events in the near term, work packages can be decomposed into activities.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":241}},{"qa":"ما هي العوائق الثلاثة التالية التي يجب على سكرام ماستر الانتباه إليها؟ اختر ثلاثة","oa":["نقص في تمكين الفريق وعدم القدرة على التنظيم الذاتي","أحد أعضاء الفريق يتحدث عن قصة مستخدم ليست موجودة على لوحة سكرم","يتحدث أحد أعضاء الفريق عن قصة مستخدم موجودة على لوحة سكرم","تقنية تمنع القدرات الرشيقة","مراجعة سجل اعمال المنتج في الاجتماعات الاحتياطية اليومية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":133,"q":"Which three of the following are impediments the scrum master should pay attention to? Choose three","t":"M","o":["A lack of team empowerment and an inability to self-organize.","A team member talking about a user story that is not on the scrum board","A team member is talking about a user story that is on the scrum board.","A technology that blocks agile capabilities","A review of the backlog at daily standup meetings."],"c":[0,1,3],"f":"The impediments are Actions that slow down or hinder progress. The Three impediments are: \n\n1- A lack of team empowerment and an inability to self-organize. \n\n2- A technology that blocks agile capabilities. \n\n3-A team member talking about a user story that is not on the scrum board.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":242}},{"qa":"في وقت مبكر من إنشاء المشروع ، يقضي مدير المشروع الوقت في البحث عن البيانات التاريخية التي قد تكون مفيدة في التخطيط للمشروع الجديد. إنها تبحث عن أمثلة لوثائق المشروع في مشاريع مماثلة تم إكمالها والتي قد تتمكن من استخدامها كقوالب للمشروع الجديد. كما أنها تبحث عن معلومات حول العمليات والإجراءات المعمول بها والتي ستساعد المشروع على العمل بسلاسة أكبر. ما هو المصطلح المستخدم لتعريف هذه","oa":["العوامل البيئية للمؤسسة","أصول العمليات التنظيمية","إستعادي للأحداث","التطور التدريجي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":134,"q":"Early in the establishment of the project, the project manager spends time looking for historical data that might be helpful in planning the new project. She is looking for examples of project documents in similar projects that have been completed that she might be able to use as templates for the new project. She is also looking for information about established processes and procedures that will help the project run more smoothly. What is the term used to define these","t":"S","o":["Enterprise environmental factors (EEFs)","Organizational process assets (OPAs).","Retrospective","Progressive elaboration"],"c":[1],"f":"templates, processes, and procedures are an example of Organizational process assets (OPAs).","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":243}},{"qa":"متى يمكن إنهاء العقد","oa":["يحدث إنهاء العقد عند اكتمال العقد وقبوله","في نهاية المشروع فقط ، ما لم يتم إنهاء المشروع مبكرًا","في نهاية المشروع فقط","متى يتم اختيار البائع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":135,"q":"When can the contract closeout occur","t":"S","o":["Whenever a contract is completed and accepted","At the end of a project only, unless the project is terminated early","At the end of a project only","Whenever a seller is selected"],"c":[0],"f":"Whenever a contract is completed and accepted","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":244}},{"qa":"تفضل العديد من المنظمات العقود ذات السعر الثابت لأن مخاطر المشتري يتم تقليلها من خلال هذه العقود. ومع ذلك ، لتقليل مخاطر البائع إلى الحد الأدنى ، أي مما يلي يعد أمرًا ضروريًا لعقد السعر الثابت","oa":["يجب على المشتري تحديد عدد الموارد التي سيتم استخدامها للشراء بدقة.","يجب على المشتري تحديد سعر العقد بدقة.","يجب على المشتري أن يحدد بدقة الخدمة أو المنتج الذي سيتم شراؤه.","يجب على المشتري تحديد وقت استكمال العقد بدقة."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":136,"q":"Many organizations favor fixed-price contracts because the buyer's risk is minimized by such contracts. However, to minimize the seller's risk, which of the following is crucial for a fixed price contract","t":"S","o":["The buyer must precisely specify the number of resources to be used for procurement.","The buyer must precisely specify the price of the contract.","The buyer must precisely specify the service or product to be procured.","The buyer must precisely specify the time for the contract."],"c":[2],"f":"In a fixed-price contract, the buyer must precisely specify the product or service to be procured. Any changes in the contract may involve additional cost to the buyer. Therefore, buyers must be careful while preparing the statement of work.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":245}},{"qa":"لديك عقد لبناء مصنع في كوالالمبور. ومع ذلك ، فأنت لست معتادًا على قوانين البناء في كوالالمبور أو ماليزيا ، لذلك تقوم بمراجعة جميع قوانين البناء الخاصة بهم قبل 'تحويل مجرفة.' هذا مثال على","oa":["بدء المشروع","رقابة جودة","تاكيد الجودة","تخطيط الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":137,"q":"You have a contract to build a manufacturing plant in Kuala Lumpur. However, you are not familiar with the building codes in Kuala Lumpur or Malaysia, so you are reviewing all their building codes prior to turning a shovelful of earth.? This is an example of","t":"S","o":["Project initiation","Quality control","Quality assurance","Quality planning"],"c":[3],"f":"All types of quality plans, such as building codes, OSHA guidelines, ISO 9000, or company quality plans are examples of Enterprise Environmental Factors and Organizational Process Assets which are inputs to the Plan Quality Management process.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":246}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":138,"q":"You have recently joined an organization as the Marketing Manager. You have been told that a new product has just been created and you will need to get it into market within the next month. This is means press released , TV,Radio , Internet and Newspaper adverts, abig launch , withat least one local celebrity.you request a meeting with a project manager for advice on initiating the project ,butyou are told the organization doesn't have a Project Manager , it Just has a part time Project Coordinator . What is the organizational structure of the organization","t":"S","o":["PMO","Balanced Matrix","Project -Oriented","Strong Matrix"],"c":[1],"f":"","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 2"},{"qa":"أنت تدير مشروعًا لشركتك بإنشاء مجمع مكاتب في بلد آخر. اكتملت الأعمال الإنشائية في اثنين من المباني ، وتلك المباني جاهزة للانتقال إليها. ومع ذلك ، يخبرك مشرف البناء أنه يجب عليك دفع رسوم إلى وكالة حكومية محلية لإصدار تصريح إشغال لأي بناء جديد في هذا البلد. ماذا عليك ان تفعل","oa":["دفع الرسوم","لا تدفع الرسوم","أبلغ أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع أنه طُلب منك دفع رشوة","اسأل قسمك القانوني إذا كان هذا قانونيًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":139,"q":"You are managing a project for your company constructing an office complex in another country. The construction work on two of the buildings is complete, and those buildings are ready for move-in. However, the construction supervisor informs you that you must pay a fee to a local government agency to issue an occupancy permit for any new construction in that country. What should you do?","t":"S","o":["Pay the fee","Do not pay the fee","Notify project stakeholders that you have been asked to pay a bribr","Ask your legal department if this is legal"],"c":[0],"f":"Pay the fee to the local agency. Because it is a standard fee for a permit that is required of all new construction, it is not a bribe.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":247}},{"qa":"أنت تدير فريق مشروع يتم توزيعه عبر مواقع عالمية. أنت تتواصل عبر البريد الإلكتروني يوميًا ولديك مكالمة حالة عبر الهاتف مرة واحدة في الأسبوع. أي من العبارات التالية صحيحة","oa":["تعتبر الفرق البعيدة عبئًا على المشروع ويجب تجنبها قدر الأمكان","لا يمكن لمستقبلات الاتصال في الموقع البعيد التقاط الإشارات غير اللفظية وهذا يؤدي إلى خسارة معينة في الاتصال. أنت بحاجة إلى عامل هذا في التخطيط الخاص بك","لا يمكن أن يتم إرسال تقارير الحالة وتخصيص العمل بشكل فعال عبر البريد الإلكتروني. خطط لتحقيق كفاءة بنسبة 50 في المائة للفريق الموجود عن بُعد.","خطط لمكالمات الحالة الهاتفية كل يوم وتابع كل اتصال عبر البريد الإلكتروني بمكالمة هاتفية لمناقشة ما إذا كان الفريق البعيد قد فهم تخصيص المهام"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":140,"q":"You are managing a project team that is distributed across global locations. You communicate by email daily and have a status call by telephone once a week. Which of the following statements is valid?","t":"S","o":["Remote teams are an overhead on the project and should be avoided as far as possible.","The receivers of communication at the remote location cannot pick up nonverbal cues and this results in a certain loss in communication. You need to factor this in your planning.","The communication of status reports and work allocation can never be done effectively via email. Plan for 50 percent efficiency for the remotely located team.","Plan telephonic status calls every day and follow up every email communication with a telephone call to discuss whether the remote team has understood the task allocation."],"c":[1],"f":"Nonverbal cues represent a significant part of communication. In the absence of this element, as project manager, you may need to take further actions to ensure that communications are being properly understood by the remote team. Consider options such as team building to improve team cohesiveness and videoconferences on a regular basis. The other options are invalid since they quote invalid inferences. [PMBOK® Guide 6th Edition, Page 384]","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":248}},{"qa":"قدم مدير وظيفي في مؤسستك مؤخرًا شكوى ضد مدير مشروع مبتدئ بخصوص شهادته في إدارة المشروع. يدعي المدير الوظيفي أن شهادة PMP التي يطالب بها مدير المشروع المبتدئ غير صالحة وتحتاج إلى التحقق منها. ماذا يجب أن يكون ردك كمدير مشروع أول","oa":["اطلب من مدير المشروع تقديم دليل للحصول على شهادة محترف إدارة المشاريع","تقديم تقرير لمعهد إدارة المشاريع","أوقف مدير المشروع المبتدئ","اطلب من مديرك الوظيفي تقديم دليل على حجته"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":141,"q":"A functional manager in your organization has recently filed a complaint against a junior project manager regarding his project management certification. The functional manager claims that the PMP certification claimed by the junior project manager is invalid and needs to be checked. What should be your response as a senior project manager","t":"S","o":["Ask your project manager to provide evidence for his/her PMP certification","Report to PMI","Suspend the junior project manager","Ask your functional manager to provide evidence for his argument"],"c":[3],"f":"One of the mandatory standards in the PMI Code of Ethics and Professional Conduct is respect. A project manager must listen to others’ points of view and understand them. However, before asking the junior project manager for evidence of his or her PMP certification, you must ask your functional manager to provide evidence to support his or her allegations. You can suspend the junior project manager or report him or her to PMI if there is sufficient evidence of his or her guilt.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":249}},{"qa":"يعمل عدد من الفرق على تطوير نظام مؤسسة باستخدام نهج رشيق لتطوير المنتجات. أي مما يلي يعتبر عنصر خطر رئيسي لمثل هذا المشروع المعقد الذي يتم تنفيذه في بيئة رشيقة","oa":["عدد التبعيات المترابطة بين الميزات التي طورتها فرق مختلفة","تحديد النطاق والتجميد مبكرًا خلال مرحلة التخطيط","التركيز على الجدول الزمني للتحكم في إدارة المخاطر","عدد وحجم الفرق التي تقوم بتطوير الميزات الأكبر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":142,"q":"A number of teams are developing an enterprise system using the agile approach for product development. Which of the following is a major risk item for such a complex project being performed in an agile environment.","t":"S","o":["Number of interconnected dependencies between the features developed by different teams.","Scope definition and freezing early during the planning phase.","Emphasis on schedule control over risk management","Number and size of teams developing the larger features."],"c":[0],"f":"In adaptive life cycles, when multiple teams are concurrently developing a large number of features, the interconnected dependencies between the features become a major risk item. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 177]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":250}},{"qa":"ظهر تعارض بين عضوين من فريقك ، وبدأت التعارضات في التأثير على فريق المشروع بأكمله. معنويات الفريق أصبحت متدنية. كمدير للمشروع ، ما يجب عليك فعله؟","oa":["أطلب من اعضاء الفريق حل الصراع بانفسهم","تصعيد المشكلة لقسم الموارد البشرية","التدخل لحل المشكلة على الفور","لا تفعل شئ"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":143,"q":"A conflict appeared between two members of your team , and the conflicts began to affect to the entire project team . The team's morale has become low . As project manager , whar should you do ?","t":"S","o":["As the team members to solve the conflict by them selves .","Escalate the problem to HR department","Interfering for solving the problem immediately","Do nothing"],"c":[2],"f":"Internal conflicts affect team morale. This represents negative Risk and threat to the success of the project, so the project manager must intervene to solve the problem immediately","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":251}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لشركة ستيكو . يأتي إليك اثنان من أعضاء الفريق في نزاع بشأن من سيقوم بأداء مهمة معينة والإبلاغ عنها. لحل النزاع ، ما المستند الذي ستشير إليه؟","oa":["مصفوفة مسؤول وخاضع للمساءلة والتشاور والإبلاغ (RACI).","ممول المشروع","سجل المعنيين","المدير الوظيفي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":144,"q":"You are project manager for Steco company . Two team members come to you with a dispute regarding who will perform and report the status of a particular task. To resolve the conflict , which document will you refer to?","t":"S","o":["Responsible , accountable , consult , and inform ( RACI) matrix.","Project Sponsor","Stakeholder register","Functional manager"],"c":[0],"f":"RAM or RACI Connection between work packages or activities and team members","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":252}},{"qa":"يريد مدير المشروع الحصول على المعلومات المتعلقة بالأدوار والمسؤوليات والإفراج ، واحتياجات التدريب ، وتقويم الموارد ، والاعتراف ، والمكافآت. أي من الوثائق التالية سيكون الأنسب","oa":["سجل المشكلة","مهام فريق المشروع","خطة إدارة الموارد","خطة إدارة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":145,"q":"The project manager wants to capture information related to roles and responsibilities and release , training needs , resource calendar , recognition , and rewards . Which of the dollowing documents would be most appropriate.","t":"S","o":["Issue log","Project Team Assignments","Resource Management Plan","Project Management Plan"],"c":[2],"f":"Resources Management Plan\nIdentifying, documenting, project roles, responsibilities, and reporting relationships, as well as creating the staffing management plan and training needs , resource calendar , recognition , and rewards.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":253}},{"qa":"إدارة الاستطلاعات والمقابلات والتقييمات ومجموعات التركيز داخل فريق المشروع الخاص بك وإنشاء تقييم أداء الفريق مع ملاحظات حول مهاراتهم وكفاءاتهم ومعدل دورانهم والترابط. ثم تقوم بتقييم الأداء العام للفريق. كيف ستستخدم هذا التقرير الآن؟","oa":["تقدير تكلفة تحسين أداء الفريق.","تحديد التدريب أوالتدريب مع مدرب متخصص  أو توجيهًا أو تغييرات أخرى مطلوبة لتحسين أداء الفري","القيام بإجراء تغييرات على أعضاء الفريق ذوي الأداء الضعيف.","تقدير الجدول الزمني للمشروع بناءً على أداء الفريق."],"rat":null,"fa":"يتم استخدام تقييم أداء الفريق لتحديد استراتيجيات وإجراءات تحسين الأداء. على الرغم من أن هذا قد يشمل في وقت ما تغيير أعضاء الفريق ، أو مراجعة التأثير على جدول المشروع أو تقدير تكاليف التدريب ، فإن الخطوة الأولى هي تحديد الإجراءات التي يجب اتخاذها على وجه التحديد فيما يتعلق بتحسين أداء الفريق. أيضًا ، لا يمكن تغيير أعضاء الفريق دون منحهم الفرصة للتحسين أولاً.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":146,"q":"Your administer surveys , interviews , assessments and focus groups within your project team and create a team performance assessment with observations on their skills , competencies , turnover rate and cohensiveness. You then evaluate the team's overall performance . How will you use this report now?","t":"S","o":["Estimate the cost of improving the team's performance.","Identify specific training , coaching , mentoring or other changes required to improve the team's performance.","Make changes to the team members who are performing poorly.","Estimate project schedule based on the team's performance."],"c":[1],"f":"The team performance assessment is used to identify performance improvement strategies and actions. Though at some point this may include changing team members, or reviewing impact to project schedule or estimating training costs , the first step is to identify actions to be undertaken specifically with respect to team performance improvement. Also, team members cannot be changed without giving them the opportunity to improve first.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":254}},{"qa":"لقد جاء إليك اثنان من أعضاء فريقك بسبب اختلاف في الرأي بينهما. ما هي أفضل طريقة لحل هذا الموقف","oa":["عندما يتراجع أحدهم بسبب الإحباط","رفض عقد اجتماع لحل هذا الموقف.","من خلال فهم احتياجات كلاهما وتوجيههما نحو حل ناجح ورضاهما الكامل.","عندما يكون أحدهم مرنًا جدًا لقبول رأي الشخص الآخر أمامك."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":147,"q":"Two of your team members have come to you due to a difference of opinion between them . What is the best way to resolve this situation.","t":"S","o":["When one of them backs out due to frustration","Refuse conducting meeting to resolve this situation.","By understanding the needs of both and guiding them towards successful resolution and their full satisfaction.","When one of them is very flexible to accept the other person's opinion in front of you."],"c":[2],"f":"The best way is understanding the needs of both and guiding them towards successful resolution and their full satisfaction.(Collaboration Strategy)","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":255}},{"qa":"أنت تخطط لموارد المشروع وقمت بإنشاء جدول يوضح الأدوار الفردية للمهام المختلفة في المشروع. أي نوع من التمثيل يسمى هذا ، من منظور تخطيط الموارد؟","oa":["هيكل تجزئة المخاطر","هيكل تجزئة تنظيمي","مخطط تنظيمي للمشروع","مخطط راسي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":148,"q":"You are planning for project resources and have created a table showing indvidual roles for various tasks in the project. What sort of representation is this called , from a resource planning perspective?","t":"S","o":["RBS","An OBS","A project organization chart","A RACI chart"],"c":[3],"f":"RACI Chart ( atype of Responsibility Assignment Matrix(RAM))\nR---- Responsible\nA---- Accountable\nC------ Consult\nI------- Inform","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":256}},{"qa":"يتأخر العميل باستمرار في الحصول على الموافقات على وثائق التصميم. أثار جورج ، مدير المشروع ، الموضوع في الماضي ، لكن ممارسة الموافقة المؤجلة لم تتغير. كان جورج يوثق التأخيرات. ما هي تقنية حل النزاع التي يتبعها؟","oa":["الأنسحاب","التعاون / حل المشكلة","التلطيف","الأجبار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":149,"q":"A customer has been consistently late with approvals on design documentation. George , the project manager , has raised the subject in the past , but the practice of delayed approval has not changed. George has been documenting the delays. Which conflict resolution technique is he following?","t":"S","o":["Withdrawal","Collaboration / Solve Problem","Smoothing","Forcing"],"c":[0],"f":"Avoidance / Withdrawal is strategic technique since project manager document the delays isnoy an attempt to solve the problem.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":257}},{"qa":"أعضاء فريق المشروع في نزاع ليسوا متعاونين ويختلفون في الرأي حول البنية. أي من المراحل التالية من تطوير الفريق هم فيها الآن؟","oa":["التشكيل","الأداء","الانسجام","العصف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":150,"q":"The project team members are in conflict are not collaborative and differ in opinion on the architecture. Which of the following phases of Team Development are they in now?","t":"S","o":["Forming","Performing","Norming","Storming"],"c":[3],"f":"Storming Stage : Team member argue and are not openly collaborative Storming","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":258}},{"qa":"لقد قدمت منتجًا فريدًا وقابل للتحقق لعملائك للحصول على موافقتهم. قد تسمح لك الموافقة على هذا المنتج بالانتقال إلى المرحلة التالية. يُعرف هذا المنتج الفريد والقابل للتحقق أيضًا باسم","oa":["التسليم","مشروع","خطة","محفظة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":151,"q":"You have presented a unique and verifiable product to your customers for their approval. Approval of this product may allow you to move on to your next phase. This unique and verifiable product is also known as","t":"S","o":["A deliverable","A project","A plan","A portfolio"],"c":[0],"f":"A unique and verifiable product produced in each phase or at the end of the project is known as a deliverable. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 4]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":259}},{"qa":"قام محلل المخاطر بإعداد الرسم البياني التالي لمشروعك. ما هي أداة إدارة المخاطر هذه؟","oa":["هيكل تجزئة المخاطر","مخطط باريتو","الرسم البياني","مخطط ترنادوا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":152,"q":"A risk analyst has produced the following chart for your project. Which risk management tool is this?","t":"S","o":["RBS","Pareto Chart","Histogram","Tornado diagram"],"c":[3],"f":"This is an example of a tornado diagram which is a typical display of sensitivity analysis. The tornado diagram presents the calculated correlation coefficients for each element of the quantitative risk analysis model that can influence the project outcome ordered by descending strength of correlation. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, page 434]","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":260}},{"qa":"لا يمكن تحديد نطاق العمل في المشروع بشكل واضح. كان هناك أيضًا احتمال قوي بأن النطاق سيتغير أثناء سير المشروع. ما نوع العقد الذي يناسب هذا النوع من المواقف؟","oa":["السعر الثابت مع عقد تعديل السعر الاقتصادي","عقد استرداد التكاليف","عقد بسعر ثابت","عقد تحفيزي بسعر ثابت"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":153,"q":"The scope of work in a project could not be clearly defined. There was also a strong possibility that the scope would change during the course of the project. Which type of contract would suit this type of situation?","t":"S","o":["Fixed-price with economic price adjustment contract","Cost-reimbursable contract","Fixed-price contract","Fixed-price incentive contract"],"c":[1],"f":"A cost-reimbursable contract gives the project flexibility to redirect a seller whenever the scope of work cannot be precisely determined at the start of the project and needs to be altered, or when high risks may exist in the effort.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":261}},{"qa":"يقدم مدير المشروع تحديثات حالة شهرية لأصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين. بعد كل اجتماع لتحديث الحالة ، يجب أن تكون نسخة من العرض التقديمي ومتعقب الإجراءات المحدث وتعليقات أصحاب المصلحة","oa":["أرسل بالبريد الإلكتروني إلى راعي المشروع","أرسل بالبريد الإلكتروني إلى جميع المشاركين في الاجتماع","تحديث لنظام معلومات إدارة المشروع","تمت الإضافة إلى مجلد المشروع كأصل عملية تنظيمية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":154,"q":"A project manager gives monthly status updates to the key stakeholders. After every status update meeting, a copy of the presentation, the updated action tracker, and the stakeholder feedback must be:","t":"S","o":["Emailed to the project sponsor","Emailed to all the participants of the meeting","Updated to the project management information system","Added to the project folder as an organizational process asset"],"c":[3],"f":"All of the choices are actions that can be performed next. However, emailing the mentioned documents to the stakeholders and the project sponsor depends on their needs and the communication management plan requirements. Further, updating the project management information system is conditional on the availability of the system. Hence, these three actions may or may not be done. However, adding a copy of these documents to the project folder is an absolute must for the project manager. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 388]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":262}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":155,"q":"You have been recently hired as a PMO Expert in an organization that has historically delivered projects under functional managers. You were able to gather necessary resources to establish a central PMO in the organization and now you have shifted your attention on standardizing project management processes. Historically the organization has stressed quality control processes instead of scope validation processes. You now have a stiff challenge to convince the senior leadership that scope validation is equally important. Why must the Validate Scope process be completed in a project?","t":"S","o":["To determine whether the scope is at the correct complexity level","To obtain scope documents from recent similar projects for benchmarking","To determine whether the scope is at the correct complexity level","To obtain formal acceptance of deliverables by the customer or sponsor"],"c":[3],"f":"Validate Scope is the process of formalizing acceptance of the completed project deliverables by the customer or sponsor of the project. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 163]","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2"},{"qa":"تريد التعاقد من الباطن على عدد من حزم العمل في مشروع البناء الخاص بك ودعت عددًا من المقاولين من الباطن لتقديم مقترحاتهم. لقد ذكرت صراحة نيتك في التفاوض على عقد ثابت السعر مع المقاول من الباطن المحدد. أنت الآن تتفاوض مع أكبر ثلاثة مقاولين من الباطن ولكنك غير قادر على التفاوض على سعر معقول. ما الذي يجب عليك فعله لحل هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["ضع في اعتبارك عقد التكلفة الإضافية بدلاً من ذلك","تقليل نطاق المشروع ليناسب ميزانيتك.","اذهب لجولة طلب عرض فني ثانية.","ناقش بصراحة مخاوف المقاولين من الباطن معهم."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":156,"q":"You want to subcontract a number of work packages on your construction project and have invited a number of subcontractors to submit their proposals. You have explicitly mentioned your intention to negotiate a firm fixed-price contract with the selected subcontractor. You are now negotiating with the top three subcontractors but are unable to negotiate a reasonable price. What you should do to resolve this issue?","t":"S","o":["Consider a cost-plus contract instead.","Reduce the project scope to suit your budget.","Go for a second RFP round.","Openly discuss subcontractors’ concerns with them."],"c":[3],"f":"Openly discuss subcontractors’ concerns with them. Try to understand why they are inflating prices and what risks they think can harm them in this project. Only when you will successfully address their concerns, can you reach mutual agreements.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":263}},{"qa":"إبراهيم محمد سعيد يعمل حاليًا لدى ABC Contractors كمدير مراقبة الجودة لمشروع إنشاء مسار للسكك الحديدية. منحت شركة السكك الحديدية الوطنية عقد البناء هذا الذي يزيد عن التكلفة إلى ABC Contractors قبل بضعة أشهر. كشرط تعاقدي ، يجب على ABC Contractors تقديم كل تسليم مكتمل لقبول العميل. بمراجعة بيانات المشروع ، وجد إبراهيم أن معدل رفض التقديم الحالي هو 22 بالمائة. يقوم بإجراء تحليل السبب الجذري ويقدم النتائج التي توصل إليها جنبًا إلى جنب مع توصيات تحسين عملية البناء إلى مدير المشروع. في هذا السيناريو ، يعد تقرير إبراهيم مثالاً على:","oa":["معلومات أداء العمل","ملاحظات أولية","بيانات أداء العمل","تقرير مراقبة العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":157,"q":"Ibrahim Mohamed Saeed is currently working for ABC Contractors as a quality control manager for a railway track construction project. National Railways awarded this cost-plus construction contract to ABC Contractors a few months ago. As a contractual requirement, ABC Contractors has to submit each completed deliverable for client acceptance. Reviewing project data, Ibrahim found that the current submission rejection rate is 22 percent. He conducts a root cause analysis and submits his findings along with construction process improvement recommendations to the project director. In this scenario, Ibrahim’s report is an example of:","t":"S","o":["Work performance information","Raw observations","Work performance data","Work control report"],"c":[0],"f":"The data on rejections is the project performance data. Ibrahim analyzed it and converted it into work performance information, i.e. reasons for rejections and recommendations.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":264}},{"qa":"نصح إياد ، عضو فريق مشروع آخر ، إبراهيم بأنه قلق من أن وثيقة المتطلبات النهائية الصادرة عن مدير المشروع تحرف عن عمد المتطلبات التي تم جمعها. ذكر إياد أن العديد من المتطلبات التي تم تضمينها لم يكن لها سوى عدد كبير من المؤيدين. تحدد منهجية إدارة المشاريع المؤسسية أن دعم التعددية هو الحد الأدنى لمستوى الدعم للمتطلبات. ماذا يجب أن يفعل إبراهيم؟","oa":["قم بإخطار راعي المشروع بوجود تناقض واقترح مراجعة المتطلبات الرسمية.","ناقش المشكلة مع مدير مشروع آخر.","قم بإبلاغ مدير المشروع إلى مديره. يجب أن يدعم المتطلبات أكثر من 50 بالمائة من الفريق.","لا تفعل شيئا. تسمح منهجية الشركة باتخاذ القرارات بالأغلبية وليس بالأغلبية. يعتمد قرار التعددية على أكبر كتلة من المؤيدين ، حتى لو لم تكن تلك الكتلة هي الأغلبية."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":158,"q":"Eyad, a member of another project team, advised Ibrahim that he was concerned the final requirements document released by the project manager intentionally misrepresented the requirements gathered. Eyad stated that many requirements included had only a plurality of supporters. Corporate project management methodology specifies that plurality support is the minimum level of support for requirements. What should Ibrahim do?","t":"S","o":["Notify the project sponsor there is a discrepancy and suggest a formal requirements review.","Discuss the issue with another project manager.","Report the project manager to his or her manager. Requirements must be supported by more than 50 percent of the team.","Do nothing. The corporate methodology permits decisions to be made by a plurality, rather than a majority. A plurality decision is based on the largest block of supporters, even if that block is not a majority."],"c":[3],"f":"There is no wrongdoing in this scenario, so no action is required of Bader. Using a plurality to determine requirements is consistent with the company's project management methodology. PMI's code of ethics requires project managers to follow all policies, rules, and regulations.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":265}},{"qa":"لقد نجحت مؤخرًا في اجتياز اختبار محترف إدارة المشاريع. يتابع الآخرون داخل المنظمة التي تعمل بها الحصول على الشهادة وطلبوا مساعدتك. لقد طلبوا منك تزويدهم بقائمة مفصلة بالأسئلة التي طرحتها في الامتحان. ما هو مسار العمل الأول الذي يجب عليك اتخاذه؟","oa":["قدم لزملائك في العمل قائمة بجميع الأسئلة التي تتذكرها من الاختبار","افترض أنك لا تتذكر أي من الأسئلة","الإبلاغ عن الانتهاك إلى معهد إدارة المشاريع","أشر إلى أنه لا يمكنك الكشف عن الأسئلة التي رأيتها في الامتحان"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":159,"q":"You have recently been successful in passing the Project Management Professional exam. Others within the organization you work for are also pursuing the certification and have sought your assistance. They have requested that you provide them with a detailed list of the questions that you had on the exam. What is the FIRST course of action you should take?","t":"S","o":["Offer your coworkers a listing of all the questions you recall from the exam","Pretend you do not recall any of the questions","Report the violation to the PMI","Indicate that you cannot disclose questions you saw on the exam"],"c":[3],"f":"The first course of action is to indicate that you cannot disclose questions you saw on the exam. PMI requires the candidates and those seeking certification to maintain and respect the confidentiality of the contents of the PMP examination. The PMI code of conduct mandates respecting copyrights of others. [PMI Code of Ethics and Professional Conduct].","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":266}},{"qa":"الطلاء على السيارات الغريبة التي يتم تصنيعها في مصنعك يتصاعد بعد حوالي عام من التطبيق. ما هي أفضل أداة يستخدمها فريقك للعثور على الأسباب المحتملة لتقشير الطلاء؟","oa":["مخطط مبعثر","مخطط إيشيكاوا","الفحص","مخطط التحكم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":160,"q":"The paint on the exotic cars that are manufactured in your plant is bubbling about a year after application. What would be the best tool for your team to use to find potential causes of the peeling paint?","t":"S","o":["Scatter diagram","Ishikawa Diagram","Inspection","Control Chart"],"c":[1],"f":"All the choices are tools and techniques in quality control; however, the best choice would be the Ishikawa or cause-and-effect diagram. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 293]","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":267}},{"qa":"يلعب أحد كبار أعضاء الفريق ، وهو الأفضل أداءً في مشروعك ، الأغاني المفضلة. حصل عدد قليل من أعضاء الفريق الآخرين الذين يعملون عن كثب مع عضو الفريق هذا على تقارير تقييم جيدة بشكل استثنائي في الماضي ، على الرغم من أنهم ربما لم يكونوا مستحقين لها. بصفتك مدير المشروع ، ماذا تحتاج أن تفعل بنشاط؟","oa":["اطلب من جميع أعضاء فريقك الذين يثمنون أعضاء الفريق الآخرين أن يكونوا ليبراليين في تقييماتهم. سيساعد هذا في التعويض عن التقييمات التي يقوم بها عضو الفريق الأول.","تجاهل الأمر لأنك ستفقد بخلاف ذلك أحد كبار أعضاء الفريق الذي يعد مفتاحًا لمشروعك.","تأكد من أن عضو الفريق الأول لا يستطيع تقييم أي شخص.","تحدث إلى عضو الفريق الأول واطلب منه إجراء التقييمات بشكل عادل ، وفقًا لإرشادات التقييم."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":161,"q":"One of the senior team members, who is the best performer in your project, plays favorites. A few of the other team members who work closely with this team member have gotten exceptionally good appraisal reports in the past, even though they may not have deserved them. As the project manager, what do you need to actively do?","t":"S","o":["Ask all the members of your team who are appraisers of other team members to be liberal in their appraisals. This will help compensate for the appraisals the senior team member does.","Ignore the matter since you would otherwise lose a senior team member who is key to your project.","Ensure that the senior team member does not get to appraise anybody.","Speak to the senior team member and ask him or her to do appraisals fairly, in accordance with the appraisal guidelines."],"c":[3],"f":"As project manager, you need to speak to the senior team member and ask for all appraisals to be done in an objective manner. The other options are incorrect. Ignoring the matter will not help solve it. The other two options are likewise impractical.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":268}},{"qa":"أنت تقوم بتحويل نظام تدفق العمل من يدوي الي نظام اتوماتيكي. يجب أن يتكامل النظام مع بعض الأنظمة القديمة التي تفتقر إلى التوثيق. يتردد فريق المشروع في مراجعة وتحرير مصدر الكود الخاص بالنظام القديم لأن النظام قيد العمل بالفعل. لم يتم النظر في هذه المخاطرة من قبل وكان من المفترض أنك لن تواجه أية مشكلات أثناء عملية الدمج. ما الذي يجب عمله الآن؟","oa":["تفريغ المشروع","تقييم مفصل للمخاطر","قبول المخاطر","طلب تغيير جديد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":162,"q":"You are automating a manual business workflow. The system has to integrate with some legacy system which lacks documentation. The project team is hesitant in reviewing and editing the source code of this legacy system as the system is already in production. This risk was never considered earlier and it was assumed that you will face no issues during the integration. What needs to be done now?","t":"S","o":["Descoping of the project","A detailed risk assessment","Acceptance of the risk","A new change request"],"c":[1],"f":"A major assumption was made earlier. Now once the risk has been identified, this needs to be analyzed in detail and an appropriate response strategy needs to be planned. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, page 439]","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":269}},{"qa":"مشروعك يتجاوز الميزانية قليلاً. لقد ذكرت ذلك لمدير مشروع آخر ، والذي يقترح عليك تحويل بعض نفقات مشروعك المباشرة إلى تكاليف غير مباشرة لا يتم تحميلها على ميزانية مشروعك. ماذا تفعل؟","oa":["استخدم احتياطيات المشروع ولا تحول نفقات المشروع المباشرة","أعد تقدير المشروع","تتبع المشروع بسرعة","افحص نفقات المشروع لمعرفة ما إذا كان بإمكانك سحب أي نفقات غير مباشرة من مشروعك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":163,"q":"Your project is running slightly over budget. You mention this to another project manager, who suggests you shift some of your direct project expenses to indirect costs that are not charged to your project budget. What do you do?","t":"S","o":["Use project reserves and do not shift direct project expenses","Re estimate the project","Fast track the project","Examine project expenses to see whether you can take any indirect expenses off your project"],"c":[0],"f":"You should use your project reserves to cover the budget overruns. Project managers are required to disclose accurate and truthful information about their projects. Masking an expense or otherwise using a half-truth to cover a budget overrun is a violation of the PMI Code. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, page 254 & PMI Code of Ethics and Professional Conduct]","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":270}},{"qa":"أي من الترتيبات التالية يسمح للمشتري بأقل قدر من المرونة لتغيير نطاق الأعمال المتعاقد عليه؟","oa":["ترتيبات السعر الثابت.","عدم تجاوز الوقت وترتيب المواد.","خيار الإلغاء المبكر.","خيار النطاق الديناميكي."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":164,"q":"Which of the following arrangements allows least flexibility to the buyer to alter the contracted scope of works?","t":"S","o":["Fixed-price arrangements.","Not-to-exceed time and materials arrangement.","Early cancellation option.","Dynamic scope option."],"c":[0],"f":"A not-to-exceed time and materials allows replacing original scope with new scope. The dynamic scope option allows scope adjustments at specified points in the project. The early cancellation option allows termination halfway through the project. The fixed-price arrangement is the least flexible option. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 78]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":271}},{"qa":"خلال مناقشة مع قسم الجودة ، تم إخبار ديف ، مدير المشروع ، أنه كما هو مطبق على المشاريع ، فإن مصطلحي \"الوقاية\" و \"التفتيش\" مترادفان. ومع ذلك ، فإن فهمه للمصطلحات مختلف. ماذا ستعلق على هذا الموقف؟","oa":["مدير المشروع مخطئ. كل من التفتيش والوقاية يدوران حول إبعاد الأخطاء عن العملية. يتم استخدامها في سياقات مختلفة.","مدير المشروع مخطئ. يدور كل من الفحص والوقاية حول إبقاء الأخطاء بعيدًا عن أيدي العميل. يتم استخدامها في سياقات مختلفة.","مدير المشروع على صواب. المنع هو إبعاد الأخطاء عن العملية ؛ الفحص يدور حول إبقاء الأخطاء بعيدًا عن أيدي العميل.","مدير المشروع على صواب. التفتيش هو إبعاد الأخطاء عن العملية ؛ المنع هو إبعاد الأخطاء عن أيدي العميل."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":165,"q":"During a discussion with the quality department, Dave, a project manager, was told that as applied to projects, the terms “prevention” and “inspection” are synonymous. However, his understanding of the terms is different. What would you comment on this situation?","t":"S","o":["The project manager is wrong. Both inspection and prevention are about keeping errors out of the process. They are used in different contexts.","The project manager is wrong. Both inspection and prevention are about keeping errors out of the customer's hands. They are used in different contexts.","The project manager is correct. Prevention is about keeping errors out of the process; inspection is about keeping errors out of the customer's hands.","The project manager is correct. Inspection is about keeping errors out of the process; prevention is about keeping errors out of the customer's hands."],"c":[2],"f":"The project manager is correct. Prevention is about keeping errors out of the process, whereas inspection is about keeping errors out of the hands of the customer. This is an important distinction, which the project management team needs to be aware of. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 274]","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":272}},{"qa":"حصلت مؤسستك على عقد من قبل شركة نفط أمريكية كبرى لبناء 500 منزل على الطراز الأمريكي و 10 مباني مكاتب في بلد شرق أوسطي حتى يشعر موظفوها الأمريكيون بأنهم في وطنهم عند العمل في الخارج. هناك نقص في القوى العاملة في هذا البلد الماهرة في البناء على غرار الولايات المتحدة. لا يمكنك اصطحاب طاقم البناء بأكمله من الولايات المتحدة إلى الموقع لهذا المشروع بأكمله بسبب قيود التكلفة. أي مما يلي هو الأقل موصى به؟","oa":["ضع في اعتبارك تدريب القوى العاملة المحلية.","قم بإحضار كبار مديري الإنشاءات من الولايات المتحدة وتوظيف بقية الطاقم من السوق المحلية.","ضع في اعتبارك أخذ الطاقم لبناء عدد قليل من المنازل والمباني النموذجية.","الاستعانة بمصادر خارجية للمشروع لمقاولين من الباطن محليين وجعل البناء على غرار الولايات المتحدة جزءًا من التزاماتهم التعاقدية."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":166,"q":"Your organization has been awarded a contract by a major US oil company to build 500 US-style houses and 10 office buildings in a Middle Eastern country so that its American employees feel more like home when working abroad. There is a lack of workforce in this country skilled in US-styled construction. You cannot take the entire construction crew from the US to the site for this entire project due to cost constraints. Which of the following is LEAST recommended?","t":"S","o":["Consider training the local workforce.","Bring the senior construction managers from the US and hire the rest of the crew from the local market.","Consider taking the crew to build a few model houses and buildings.","Outsource the project to local subcontractors and make US-style construction part of their contractual obligations."],"c":[3],"f":"If there is a shortage of a specific skill in the market, you need to determine ways you can meet the requirement. You cannot shrug the responsibility off your shoulders by outsourcing the project to multiple subcontractors and making US-style construction part of their contractual obligations, especially when you know that the local market is not skilled in US-style construction. [PMI Code of Ethics and Professional Conduct]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Artificial Intelligence","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":273}},{"qa":"يعد \"تعاون العملاء أهم من التفاوض على العقد\" أحد القيم الرئيسية لبيان أجايل . أي من الأساليب المرنة التالية يساعد في تحقيق هذه القيمة","oa":["قياسات رشيقة","إعداد الأعمال المتأخرة","تنقيح سجل أعمال المنتج","الوقفات اليومية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":167,"q":"“Customer collaboration over contract negotiation” is one of the key Agile Manifesto values. Which of the following Agile approaches helps in achieving this value?","t":"S","o":["Agile measurements","Backlog preparation","Backlog refinement","Daily standups"],"c":[0],"f":"Agile measurements measure value delivered to the customer rather than how the project is performing against project baselines. This shifts the focus from the contract to the customer. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 97]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":274}},{"qa":"ذهب صديقك إلى مؤتمر حيث سمع مصطلح \"متابعة الشمس\" عملية التنمية. ماذا يعني ذالك؟","oa":["الفرق مخصصة للمشروع 365 يومًا في السنة.","يبدأ الفريق العمل ببطء في الصباح ويصل إلى نقطة الذروة بحلول الظهيرة.","العمل الجماعي فقط خلال ساعات العمل ولا يسمح بالعمل الإضافي.","يتم تسليم العمل في نهاية كل يوم من موقع إلى آخر."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":168,"q":"Your friend went to a conference where he heard the term “follow-the-sun” development process. What does that mean?","t":"S","o":["Teams are dedicated to the project 365 days a year.","Team begins the work slowly in the morning and reaches a peak point by the noon.","Teamwork only during working hours and no overtime is allowed.","Work is handed off at the end of every day from one site to the next."],"c":[3],"f":"A follow-the-sun development process is one where work is handed off at the end of every day from one site to the next, many time zones away in order to speed up product development. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 44]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":275}},{"qa":"أي من المصطلحات التالية يشير إلى التكلفة المؤجلة للعمل الذي لم يتم إنجازه في مرحلة سابقة من دورة حياة المنتج؟","oa":["تكلفة الفرصة","التكلفة الغارقة","صافي القيمة الحالية","الدين الفني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":169,"q":"Which of the following terms refers to the deferred cost of work not done at an earlier point in the product life cycle?","t":"S","o":["Opportunity cost","Sunk cost","Net present value","Technical debt"],"c":[3],"f":"Technical debt refers to the deferred cost of work not done at an earlier point in the product life cycle. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 154]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":276}},{"qa":"يتم إنتاج تقارير الأداء أثناء عملية مراقبة المشتريات من خلال تقييم بيانات أداء العمل وفقًا لمتطلبات الاتفاقية. أي مما يلي هو الهدف الأساسي لإنتاج مثل هذه التقارير؟","oa":["يعد تقرير الأداء ممارسة جيدة لإدارة المشروع ويجب تنفيذه في جميع المشاريع.","يتم إنتاج تقارير الأداء بحيث يمكن إضافتها إلى قاعدة بيانات الدروس المستفادة ، وقد يستفيد المشروع المستقبلي.","تزويد الإدارة بمعلومات حول مدى فعالية البائع في تحقيق الأهداف التعاقدية.","توثق تقارير الأداء تحليل مدير المشروع ولا تتطلب مشاركة المورد."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":170,"q":"Performance reports are produced during the Control Procurements process by evaluating work performance data against the agreement requirements. Which of the following is the prime objective of producing such reports?","t":"S","o":["Performance reporting is a good project management practice and must be carried out on all projects.","Performance reports are produced so they can be added to lessons-learned database, and the future project might benefit.","Providing management with information about how effectively the seller is achieving the contractual objectives.","Performance reports document the analysis of the project manager and does not require supplier's participation."],"c":[2],"f":"All of the choices are valid but the question is asking for the prime/main reason for conducting this exercise. The prime objective of this exercise is to provide management with information about how effectively the sellers are achieving the contractual objectives and obligations. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 499]","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":277}},{"qa":"يمثل هيكل تجزئة العمل جميع أعمال المنتج والمشروع. يجب أن يتدحرج إجمالي العمل في المستويات الأدنى إلى المستويات الأعلى بحيث لا يتم ترك أي شيء ولا يتم تنفيذ أي عمل إضافي. هذا المبدأ هو أيضًا","oa":["100٪ القاعدة","قانون باريتو","القاعدة الأساسية","80/20 القاعدة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":171,"q":"The WBS represents all product and project work. The total work at the lowest levels should roll up to the higher levels so that nothing is left out and no extra work is performed. This principle is also the:","t":"S","o":["100 percent rule","Pareto's rule","Ground rule","80/20 rule"],"c":[0],"f":"The WBS represents all product and project work. The total work at the lowest levels should roll up to the higher levels so that nothing is omitted and no extra work is performed. This principle is also called the 100% rule. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 161]","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":279}},{"qa":"وفقًا لمبادئ أجايل ، كل ما يلي هو عوامل مهمة يجب مراعاتها عند تشكيل فريق أجايل باستثناء","oa":["بيئة العمل","RACI فريق مسئول - محاسب - يستشار - أبلاغ","مستوى التحفيز","مستوى الثقة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":172,"q":"According to the Agile principles, all of the following are important factors to be considered when forming an Agile team EXCEPT","t":"S","o":["Office environment","Team RACI","Motivation level","Trust level"],"c":[1],"f":"Build projects around motivated individuals. Give them the environment and support they need and trust them to get the job done. Agile teams are supposed to be self-organizing and to work as a unit, developing a team RACI doesn’t support this view. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 9]","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":280}},{"qa":"يتقدم فريق أجايل بشكل أبطأ قليلاً مما كان مخططًا له في بداية التكرار. أي من مقاييس أجايل التالية سوف يؤثر هذا؟","oa":["نقاط القصة","المدة الفعلية","الوقت المثالي","السرعة الاتجاهية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":173,"q":"An Agile team is progressing a little slower than what was planned at the start of the iteration. Which of the following Agile metrics will this effect?","t":"S","o":["Story points","Actual duration","Ideal time","Velocity"],"c":[3],"f":"Story points and ideal time are sizing/estimating metrics; these do not change with actual performance. Velocity, however, would get reduced if the team is delivering fewer story points than planned. Actual duration is an absolute number you get at the end of an activity, it can be different than the planned duration, but the final value doesn’t change. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 61]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":281}},{"qa":"تدير المنظمات الكبيرة عادة مجموعة واسعة من المشاريع ؛ من المشاريع الصغيرة إلى المبادرات الكبيرة التي تتطلب التزامات طويلة الأجل. أي من العوامل التالية يمكن استخدامه في توسيع نطاق مثل هذه المشاريع","oa":["حجم الفريق والتوزيع الجغرافي والامتثال التنظيمي.","حجم الفريق والتوزيع الجغرافي والامتثال التنظيمي والتعقيد التنظيمي.","حجم الفريق ، والتوزيع الجغرافي ، والامتثال التنظيمي ، والتعقيد التنظيمي ، والتعقيد التقني ، وتوافر الأموال.","حجم الفريق والتوزيع الجغرافي والامتثال التنظيمي والتعقيد التنظيمي والتعقيد التقني."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":174,"q":"Large organizations typically manage a wide range of projects; from small projects to large initiatives requiring long-term commitments. Which of the following factors can be used in scaling such projects:","t":"S","o":["Team size, geographical distribution and regulatory compliance.","Team size, geographical distribution, regulatory compliance and organizational complexity.","Team size, geographical distribution, regulatory compliance, complexity, technical complexity, and funds availability.","Team size, geographical distribution, regulatory compliance, complexity and technical complexity."],"c":[3],"f":"In large organizations, there may be a mixture of small projects and large initiatives requiring long-term commitments to manage these programs using scaling factors such as team size, geographical distribution, regulatory compliance, organizational complexity, and technical complexity. Funds availability is a constraint applicable to all projects. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 178]","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":282}},{"qa":"بدأ أحد المعنيين في المشروع طلب التغيير ، والذي تم توثيقه بعد ذلك في نظام التحكم في التغيير. من سيكون مسؤولاً عادةً عن الموافقة على طلب التغيير أو رفضه؟","oa":["سلطة داخل فريق إدارة المشروع أو منظمة خارجية","الراعي","مدير المشروع","صاحب المصلحة الذي رفع طلب التغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":175,"q":"One of the stakeholders of a project initiated a change request, which was then documented in the change control system. Who would typically be responsible for approving or rejecting the change request?","t":"S","o":["An authority within the project management team or external organization","The sponsor","The project manager","The stakeholder who raised the change request"],"c":[1],"f":"Typically, some authority within the project management team or an external organization would approve or reject the change request. However, on many projects the project manager is given authority to approve certain types of change requests. [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 115]","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":283}},{"qa":"يقع مدير المشروع في منتصف مشروع رشيق يتألف من 100 قصة مستخدم مقسمة إلى خمسة تكرارات. تبلغ قيمة كل قصة مستخدم 50 دولارًا. الإنفاق الفعلي هو 2000 دولار وتم تسليم 50 قصة مستخدم. كيف هو أداء المشروع","oa":["المشروع تحت الميزانية ومع الجدول الجدولي","المشروع فوق الميزانية وتحت الجدول الزمني","المشروع مع الميزانية والجدول الزمني","المشروع تحت الميزانية وخلف الجدول الجدولي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":176,"q":"A Project manager is in the middle of an agile project comprised of 100 user stories broken down into five iterations . Each user story is worth 50$ . The actual expenditure is 2,000$ and 50 user stories have been delivered. How is the project performing.","t":"S","o":["The project is under budget and on schedule","The project is over budget and behind schedule","The project is on budget and on schedule","The project is under budget and behind schedule"],"c":[0],"f":"EV = 50*50 = 2500 , AC = 2000 \n\nCV =EV-AC= 2500-2000 = + 500 so The project is under budget \n \n\n The Project is the middle = 1/2 *100 = 50 user stories \n\nPV = 50*50 = 2500\nSV= EV-PV = 2500-2500 = 0 so The project is on the schedule .","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":284}},{"qa":"يوجد صراع بين عضوين حول كيفية إتمام مهمة ما. لم يتم تصعيد النزاع إلى مدير المشروع ولا يوجد تأثير على المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع","oa":["اطلب من المديرين الفنيين المشاركة وتسهيل الحل","ساعد في تسهيل حل مرض للنزاع","اسمح لأعضاء فريق المشروع بإيجاد حل لصراعاتهم","إعادة تخصيص كلا الموارد لمشاريع مختلفة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":177,"q":"There is a conflict between two members on how they complete a task. The conflict is not yet escalated to the project manager and there is no impact to the project . What should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Ask the functional managers to get involved and facilitate a resolution","Help facilitate a satisfactory conflict resolution","Allow the project team members to find a resolution to their conflict","Reassign both resources to different projects"],"c":[2],"f":"Since the conflict is not yet escalated to the project manager and there is no impact to the project, the project manager should allow the project team members to find a resolution to their conflict","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":285}},{"qa":"ما هو الفرق بين دورة الحياة التنبؤية ودورة الحياة التكيفية","oa":["دورة الحياة التنبؤية مدفوعة بالخطة ؛ دورة الحياة التكيفية مدفوعة بالتغير","دورة الحياة التنبؤية توقعات  لإكمال المشروع ؛ دورة الحياة التكيفية استكمال المشروع عندما تنفد الأموال","دورة الحياة التكيفية مدفوعة بالخطة ؛ دورة الحياة التنبؤية مدفوعة بالتغير","يتبع التوقع نفس النمط لكل تكرار وتغير دورة الحياة التكيفية نهجها بناءً على نمو أداء نتائج المشروع."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":178,"q":"What is difference between a predictive lifecycle and an adaptive lifecycle","t":"S","o":["Predictive lifecycle is plan-driven; adaptive lifecycle is change- driven","Predictive lifecycle forecasts project completion; adaptive lifecycle completes the project when the money runs out","Adaptive lifecycle is plan-driven; Predictive lifecycle is change- driven","The predictive follows the same pattern for each iteration and the adaptive lifecycle changes its approach based upon performance growth of the project results."],"c":[0],"f":"Predictive lifecycle is plan-driven; adaptive lifecycle is change- driven","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":286}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع يعمل في إدارة المخاطر وإنشاء سجل للمخاطر. يسجل سجل المخاطر تفاصيل جميع المخاطر المحددة في بداية وأثناء عمر المشروع. ما الأداة أو التقنية التي يجب على مدير المشروع استخدامها لإنشاء قائمة بجميع مخاطر المشروع المحتملة","oa":["مصفوفة الاحتمالات والأثر","مونتي كارلو","مخطط تورنادو","العصف الذهني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":179,"q":"The project manager works in risk management and creating a risk register. The risk register records details of all the risks identified at the beginning and during the life of the project. What tool or technique should the project manager use to generate a list of all possible project risks","t":"S","o":["Probability and impact matrix","Monte Carlo","Tornado diagram","Brainstorming"],"c":[3],"f":"Brainstorming is a data-gathering technique that can be used for identify risk process and The goal of brainstorming is to obtain a comprehensive list of individual project risks and sources of overall project risk. PMBOK 6th edition page, 414","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":287}},{"qa":"يبدأ مدير المشروع مشروعًا جديدًا وقد حدد فرصة لاستخدام الأدوات التكرارية. يهتم أحد كبار المديرين بهذا الإطار المعدل لأنه جديد على الشركة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً","oa":["تنظيم جلسات فردية مع المعنيين لبناء الوعي والثقة في الإطار الجديد","إرسال الوثائق إلى المدير الأول حول مزايا الإطار الجديد","ابحث عن تدريب خارجي على الإطار الجديد للقضاء على مخاطر انخفاض مشاركة أصحاب المصلحة.","تصعيد مخاوف المدير الأول إلى راعي المشروع وتوزيع حالة الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":180,"q":"A project manager is starting a new project and has identified an opportunity to use the iterative tools. One of the senior managers is concerned about this modified framework as it is new to the company. What should the project manager do first.","t":"S","o":["Organize individual sessions with the stakeholders to build awareness and trust in the new framework.","Send documentation to the senior manager about the advantages of the new framework.","Look for external training on the new framework to eliminate the risk of low engagement from stakeholders.","Escalate the senior manager's concern to the project sponsor and distribute the status ti the team."],"c":[0],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam \n\nProject Manager should Organize individual sessions with the stakeholders to build awareness and trust in the new framework.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":288}},{"qa":"يجب أن يكون لدى مدير المشروع الماهر ما يلزم لتحديد مناهج إدارة المشروع المناسبة (التقليدية مقابل الرشيقة) وتصميم الأدوات والتقنيات والأساليب لكل مشروع. ماذا تسمى هذه المهارات","oa":["مهارات الإدارة الفنية للمشروع","مهارات شخصية","مهارات الإدارة الإستراتيجية وإدارة الأعمال","مهارات القيادة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":181,"q":"A skilled project manager should have the necessary to identify appropriate project management approaches ( traditional vs . Agile ) and tailor the tools , techniques , and methods for each project. What are these skills called","t":"S","o":["Technical project management skills","Interpersonal Skills","Strategic and business management skills","Leadership skills"],"c":[0],"f":"identify appropriate project management approaches are example of Technical project management skills","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":289}},{"qa":"أي من الأحداث الرئيسية التالية يحددها إطار عمل سكروم؟","oa":["اجتماع التخطيط للتكرار ,اجتماع سكروم اليومي ,اجتماع المراجعة للتكرار , اجتماع كانبان","اجتماع التخطيط للتكرار ,اجتماع سكروم اليومي ,اجتماع المراجعة للتكرار , اجتماع تقييم بإثر رجعي للتكرار ,اجتماع مراجعة منتصف الأسبرنت","اجتماع التخطيط للتكرار ,اجتماع سكروم اليومي ,اجتماع المراجعة للتكرار , اجتماع أكس بي","اجتماع التخطيط للتكرار ,اجتماع سكروم اليومي ,اجتماع المراجعة للتكرار , اجتماع تقييم بإثر رجعي للتكرار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":182,"q":"Which of the following main events are defined by the scrum framework?","t":"S","o":["Sprint planning meeting , Daily scrum meeting , Sprint Review and Kanban meeting.","Sprint planning meeting , Daily scrum meeting , Sprint Review and Sprint retrospective meeting and Mid-sprint status review meeting.","Sprint planning meeting , Daily scrum meeting , Sprint Review and XP meeting.","Sprint planning meeting , Daily scrum meeting , Sprint Review and Sprint retrospective meeting."],"c":[3],"f":"The main events are defined by the scrum framework (Sprint planning meeting , Daily scrum meeting , Sprint Review and Sprint retrospective meeting)","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":290}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي ليس قطعة أثرية نموذجية لإطار سكروم","oa":["سجل أعمال المنتج الخاص بالتكرار","مخرج التكرار / الزيادات","مخطط باريتوا","سجل أعمال المنتج (تراكم المنتج)"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":183,"q":"Which of the following is not a typical artifact of the scrum framework","t":"S","o":["Sprint backlog","Incremental","Pareto Chart","Product backlog"],"c":[2],"f":"Typical artifacts of the Scrum framework\n1-Product backlog\n2-Sprint backlog\n3- Incremental","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":291}},{"qa":"أنت سكرم ماستر  يقود فريق مشروع رشيق كان يلبي باستمرار الأهداف المحددة لكل تكرار. ومع ذلك ، تشعر أن أحد أعضاء الفريق أقل إنتاجية من الآخرين. ما هو نهج التغذية الراجعة الأنسب لك لاتخاذه في هذا الموقف","oa":["اسمح لأعضاء فريق المشروع بمعالجة المشكلة إذا رأوا ذلك ضروريًا","من التكرار التالي فصاعدًا ، قم بتعيين أسهل قصص المستخدم لعضو الفريق.","قم باستدعاء  عضو الفريق صاحب الإنتاجية لاجتماع التقيم باثر رجعي (الرجعية ) القادمة","وجه عضو الفريق ضعيف الأداء للعمل لساعات إضافية لسد الفجوة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":184,"q":"You are a scrum master leading an agile project team that has been consistently meeting the goals set for each iteration. However , you feel that one team member is less productive than the others . What is the most appropriate feedback approach for you to take in this situation","t":"S","o":["Allow the project team members to address the issue if they deem necessary","From the next iteration onward , assign the team member the easiest user stories.","Call out the team member's low productivity at the upcoming iteration retrospective","Direct the underperforming team member to work extra hours to bridge the gap"],"c":[0],"f":"Scrum Master should encourage the development team to be self- organizing and self-managing so Agile team should collaborate to complete the work and the role of Scram Master is empower the development team to solve their problems themselves first and work as a team and help team member to improve his performance","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":292}},{"qa":"يعلمك أحد قادة فريقك أن أحد أعضاء الفريق ينتقده باستمرار بشأن تخصيص المهام. يؤكد قائد الفريق أيضًا أن عضو الفريق هذا مسؤول أيضًا عن تأخير العديد من المهام ، مما يؤدي إلى التأخير في الجدول الزمني للمشروع. ما الإجراء الذي يجب عليك اتخاذه كمدير مشروع؟","oa":["وجه قائد فريقك لإصدار مذكرة","استبدال عضو الفريق","عقد اجتماع مع الراعي وقائد الفريق وعضو الفريق","اقترب من عضو الفريق وافهم وجهة نظره"],"rat":null,"fa":"يجب على مدير المشروع إدارة مثل هذا النزاع عن طريق الاقتراب مباشرة من عضو الفريق الذي تسبب في هذا النزاع.  يجب أن يكون مدير المشروع مسؤولاً ويظهر الاحترام. يجب عليه أو عليها الاستماع إلى وجهات نظر الآخرين ، والسعي لفهمها قبل اتخاذ القرار. لا يعد استبدال عضو الفريق أو إصدار مذكرة إجراء مناسبًا. إن إشراك الراعي في قضايا الفريق ليس إجراءً مناسبًا أيضًا ، ما لم تكن المشكلات خارجة عن سيطرة مدير المشروع.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":185,"q":"One of your team leaders informs you that a team member criticizes him constantly about the allocation of tasks. The team leader also asserts that this team member is also responsible for the delay of many tasks, leading to delays in the project schedule. What action should you take as a project manager?","t":"S","o":["Direct your team leader to issue a memo","Replace the team member","Conduct a meeting with the sponsor, team leader, and the team member","Approach the team member and understand his point of view"],"c":[3],"f":"A project manager should manage such a conflict by directly approaching the team member who caused the conflict. According to the PMI Code of Ethics and Professional Conduct, a project manager must be responsible and show respect. He or she must listen to others’ viewpoints, seeking to understand them before making a decision. Neither replacing the team member nor issuing a memo is an appropriate action. Involving the sponsor in team issues is not an appropriate action either, unless the issues are beyond the project manager’s control. [PMBOK® Guide 6th Edition, Page 348]","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":293}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي هو أحد التحديات الرئيسية التي تواجهها منظمة بدأت فقط في استخدام نهج رشيقة","oa":["يؤدي تجنب تعدد المهام إلى عدم الكفاءة","يمكن النظر إلى المناهج الرشيقة على أنها مدفوعة بالخطة","يمكن اعتبار الوقفات اليومية على أنها أنشطة تستغرق وقتًا طويلاً","تتضمن النماذج الأولية التكرارية إعادة صياغة يمكن عرضها بشكل سلبي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":186,"q":"Which of the following is one of the major challenges faced by an organization just beginning to use Agile approaches","t":"S","o":["Avoidance of multi tasking introduce inefficiency","Agile approaches could be viewed as plan-driven.","Daily standup could be viewed as time intensive activities","Iterative prototypes involve rework that could be viewed negatively"],"c":[3],"f":"Agile approaches are not plan-driven and multi-tasking is inefficient due to waste involved with task-switching. These are plain facts. Daily standups are short team meetings and are not time-intensive. One of the major problems faced by organizations new to Agile is rework related to prototyping and could be viewed negatively in the beginning. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 73]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":294}},{"qa":"تعاقد المشتري مع بائع لتطوير جهاز جديد. ليس لدى المشتري متطلبات واضحة مقدمًا ، ولذلك طلب من البائع تطوير الجهاز باستخدام أجايل. يقوم البائع بتفكيكها وفقًا للعقد ، لكن المشتري غير راضٍ عن النتيجة. ما هي قيمة بيان أجايل الذي لم يتم تطبيقه بشكل مناسب على الأرجح؟","oa":["الأفراد والتفاعلات على العمليات والأدوات","يجب على رجال الأعمال والمطورين العمل معًا","البرمجة الزوجية على التكامل المستمر","تعاون العملاء أكثر من التفاوض على العقد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":187,"q":"A vendor has been contracted by a buyer to develop a new device . The buyer does not have clear requirements upfront and , therefore , requested that the vendor develop the device using agile. The vendor delibers as per the contract , but the buyer is not satisfied with the outcome. Which Agile manifesto's value was most likely not approptiately applied?","t":"S","o":["Individuals and interactions over processes and tools","Business people and developers must work together","Pair programming over continuous integration","Customer collaboration over contract negotiations."],"c":[3],"f":"In the scenario , however , the customer does not have detailed requirements upfront and requests that the vendor develops the device using agile methods . Collaboration over negotiations would be more beneficial for both parties.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":295}},{"qa":"لقد تم تعيينك كخبير رشيق لمؤسسة تمر بمرحلة انتقالية من النهج التنبئي إلى النهج الرشيق في إدارة المشروع. شرعت المنظمة مؤخرًا في رحلة أجايل . أي مما يلي ليس من الخصائص الملائمة للتغيير للمؤسسات التي بدأت في استخدام نهج أجايل","oa":["التزام الإدارة التنفيذية","ركز على الميزانيات قصيرة المدى والمقاييس مقابل الأهداف طويلة المدى","نضج إدارة المواهب والقدرات","وجود أقسام منعزلة عن بعضها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":188,"q":"You have been hired as an agile expert for an organization that is in the transition phase from predictive to the agile approach in project management. The organization has recently embarked upon the Agile journey . Which of the following is not a change - friendly characteristics for organizations beginning to use Agile approaches","t":"S","o":["Executive management's commitment","Focus on short -term budgeting and metrics versus long -term goals","Talent management maturity and capabilities","Existence of department silos"],"c":[3],"f":"If the organization is decomposed into department silos , that prevents accelerated delivery and doesn't encourage forming across- functional teams . The rest of the choices are desirable attributes . [ Agile Practice Guide . 1st edition , pages 73,74]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":296}},{"qa":"لا ينهي أحد أعضاء فريق مشروعك مهامه في الوقت المحدد. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ماذا يجب أن تفعل بعد ذلك؟","oa":["تسريح  عضو الفريق","قم بإجراء اجتماع فردي مع عضو الفريق","قم بجدولة جلسات تدريبية لعضو الفريق لتحسين أدائه","الأجتماع مع أعضاء فريق المشروع وتقييم الأثر على المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":189,"q":"One of your project team members doesn't finish his tasks on time . As a project manager, what should you do next ?","t":"S","o":["Release a team member","Conduct one-on-one meeting with the team member","Schedule training sessions for the team member to optimize his performance","Meeting with the project team members and evaluate the impact on the project"],"c":[1],"f":"The first step is to Conduct one-on-one meeting with the team member to understand why he leaves the site early and why he does not finish his tasks on time","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":297}},{"qa":"بصفتك مدير مشروع ، فأنت تقود مشروع تطوير برمجيات كنتيجة للملاحظة والمحادثة ، لاحظت أن بعض أعضاء الفريق بحاجة إلى تحسين مهاراتهم. ما الذى ينبغى عليك فعله اولاً","oa":["تحديث خط الأساس للتكلفة","راجع خطة إدارة الموارد","اكتساب أعضاء جدد","تحديث سجل المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":190,"q":"As a project manager , you are leading a software development project as a result of observation and conversation , you notice some of the team members need to improve their skills . What should you do first","t":"S","o":["update cost baseline","Review the resource management plan","acquire new members","update risk register"],"c":[1],"f":"The correct answer is Review the resource management plan .\nResource management plan include (Training strategies and Mehods for developing the project team. [PMBOK 6th edition , page 319]","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":298}},{"qa":"الوعي بالظروف هو مهارة شخصية أساسية لجميع مديري المشاريع الفعالين ويعني معرفة ما يجري من حولك والقدرة على تحويل تركيزك بسرعة. ما هي المهارة الأخرى التي يتم استخدامها غالبًا جنبًا إلى جنب مع الوعي بالموقف حيث يتعين عليك أنت مدير المشروع أن تكون مقنعًا في التعبير عن وجهة نظرك وموقفك حتى يتفاعل فريق المشروع وأصحاب المصلحة بسرعة مع تغيير أولويات المشروع ؟","oa":["التأثير","التفاوض","القيادة","إدارة النزاعات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":191,"q":"Situational awareness is a key interpersonal skill for all effective project managers and means knowing what is going on around you and being able to quickly switch your focus. What another skill is often used in conjunction with situatioanl awareness where you the project manager , have to be persuasive in expressing your point and position in order for your project team and stakeholders to react quickly to changing project priorities?","t":"S","o":["influencing","negotiation","Leadership","conflict management"],"c":[0],"f":"Influencing is an interpersonal skill that involves awareness of , and consideration for the various perspectives in any situation. It helps you gather relevant and critical information in order to address changing project priorities and resolve unexpected project challenges . It is often used in conjunction with the situational awareness interpersonal tool [PMBOK 6th edition, Page 350]","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":299}},{"qa":"مشروعك معقد للغاية وبسبب تغير النطاق ، فأنت بحاجة إلى أضافة بعض الخبراء ، وهو ما لم تفكر فيه من قبل. تطلب من شركتك تزويدك ببعض الخبراء للعمل كاستشاري. على الرغم من أن شركتك وفرت لك هؤلاء الخبراء ، إلا أنهم موجودون في موقع جغرافي مختلف. في هذه الحالة ، كيف ستحصل على مدخلاتهم؟","oa":["اطلب من الإدارة إحضارها إليك","قم بتعيين أعضاء جدد بنفس المهارات","اختر من بين الموظفين الحاليين","أنشئ فريقًا افتراضيًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":192,"q":"Your project is very complex and due to a scope change , you need a few additional experts , which you did not think of earlier . You request that your company provide you with some experts for consultancy work . Although your company has provided you with those experts , they are located in a different geographical location. In this situation , how will you get their input?","t":"S","o":["Ask management to bring them to you","Recruit new members with same skills","choose from current employees","Create a virtual team"],"c":[3],"f":"If your experts are located in different geographical locations and you need their input , you will create a virtual team including all these experts [PMBOK 6th edition, Page 333]","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":300}},{"qa":"غالبًا ما يختلف اثنان من أعضاء الفريق في مشروعك. أنت بحاجة إلى طريقة لحل النزاع توفر حلاً طويل المدى. قررت استخدام أي من الأساليب التالية","oa":["التضحية / التوافق","التعاون / حل المشكلة","السلاسة / التسوية","الأنسحاب / التجنب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":193,"q":"Two team members on your project often disagree . You need a conflict resolution method that provides a long - term resolution. You decide to use which one of the following approaches","t":"S","o":["Compromise","Problem solving","Smoothing","Withdrawal"],"c":[1],"f":"Problem solving / Collabotation is long -term resolution while incorporating multiple viewpoint and insights from differing perspectives. This strategy can result in a win -win situation","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":301}},{"qa":"أثناء وجودك في أحد الاجتماعات الأولى لمشروعك الجديد الذي تم تكليفك به مبكرًا ، كان اثنان من أعضاء الفريق يناقشون أفكارًا جديدة يعتقد كل منهم أنها صحيحة ورأيهم هو الأفضل للمشروع. لم تتفاعل أو تقطع المناقشة ، كما تعلم أن هذا نقاش عادي في هذه المرحلة ، وهو؟","oa":["الانسجام","الأنهاء","العصف","التنفيذ"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":194,"q":"While you are in one of the first meetings for your new project that you have been assigned to early, two team memebrs were discussing new ideas that each one thinks is correct and their opinion is the best for the project . You didn't interact or cut the discussion , as you know this is a normal discussion in this phase , which is?","t":"S","o":["Norming","Adjourning","Storming","Performing"],"c":[2],"f":"Storming Phase ----- Team members argue and are not openly collaborative while each one thinks is correct and their opinion is the best for the project.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":302}},{"qa":"يريد مدير المشروع تعيين عضو آخر في الفريق ليحل محل المهندس المعماري الذي استقال. ما هي الوثيقة التي يجب أن تلتقط هذا التغيير","oa":["مصفوفة تعيين المسؤوليات (RAM)","خطة إدارة المشروع","أصول العملية التنظيمية","القواعد الأساسية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":195,"q":"A project manager wants to recruit another team member to replace an architect who resigned . What document should capture this change .","t":"S","o":["Responsibility assignment matrix ( RAM )","Project management plan","Organizational Process Assets","Ground rule"],"c":[0],"f":"Responsibility assignment matrixs ( RAM ) are used to designare roles , responsibilities and levels of authority for specific activities.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":303}},{"qa":"بدأ أعضاء فريق مشروعك للتو العمل معًا ويقومون الآن بتعديل عاداتهم وسلوكياتهم في العمل لدعم بعضهم البعض. ما هي مراحل سلم تكمان التي دخل فيها فريقك للتو وبمجرد انتهاء المرحلة الحالية ، ما هي المرحلة التالية؟","oa":["المرحلة الحالية هي التشكيل والمرحلة التالية هي الأنسجام","المرحلة الحالية هي التشكيل والمرحلة التالية هي العصف","المرحلة الحالية هي التنفيذ والمرحلة التالية هي الأنتهاء","المرحلة الحالية هي الأنسجام والمرحلة التالية هي التنفيذ"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":196,"q":"Your project team members have just started to work together and are now adjusting their work habits and behaviors to support each other. Which stages of the Tuckman ladder has your team just enterned and once the current stage ends , what is the next stage?","t":"S","o":["The current stage is Forming and the next stage is Norming","The current stage is Forming and the next stage is Storming","The current stage is Performing and the next stage is Adjourning","The current stage is Norming and the next stage is Performing"],"c":[3],"f":"The current stage is Norming and the next stage is Performing","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":304}},{"qa":"أثناء المشروع الذي يؤثر على المنظمة بأكملها ، يبدو أن لدى بعض مجموعات المعنيين توقعات منخفضة للمنتج. ونتيجة لذلك ، فإنهم لا يؤدون كما هو متوقع. هذا قد يعرض أهداف المشروع للخطر. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من راعي المشروع التدخل وتحفيز المعنيين ذوي الأداء الضعيف","إرسال طلب التغيير","اتبع خطة مشاركة المعنيين","التحدث مع المعنيين  الذين يعانون من مشاكل لزيادة أدائهم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":197,"q":"During a project that affects the entire organization, some groups of stakeholders appear to have low product expectations. As a result, they are not performing as expected . This may put project objectives at risk . What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Ask the project sponsor to intervene and motivate the under performing stakeholders.","Submit a change request","Follow the stakeholder engagement plan","اطلب من راعي المشروع التدخل وتحفيز أصحاب المصلحة ذوي الأداء الضعيف."],"c":[2],"f":"Keywords ( Stakeholders appear to have low product expectations) ------- The stakeholder engagement plan is a component of the project management plan that identifies the strategies and actions required to promote the productive involvement of stakeholders in decision making and execution. It can be formal or informal and highly detailed or broadly framed, based on the needs of the project and the expectations of stakeholders. The stakeholder engagement plan may include but is not limited to specific strategies or approaches for engaging with individuals or groups of stakeholders. PMBOK 6th page ,522","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":305}},{"qa":"لطالما استخدمت الشركة نهجًا تنبئيًا لإدارة المشروع ، ولكن الآن يريد مكتب إدارة المشروع دمج بعض أفضل الممارسات المرنة لتحقيق إيرادات مبكرة. مدير المشروع على وشك البدء في التخطيط للمشروع الجديد ويخشى أن فريق المشروع غير مجهز للعمل في بيئة هجينة. ما هو أفضل مسار عمل لمدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحقق من مستودع الدروس المستفادة للحصول على أفضل الممارسات المرنة","طلب التدريب من مكتب إدارة المشاريع (PMO)","تمكين الفريق للتنظيم الذاتي ودراسة أفضل الممارسات الرشيقة","أضف مخاطر المهارات الرشيقة غير الكافية إلى سجل المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":198,"q":"A company has always utilized a predictive approach to project management, but now the project management office wants to incorporate some agile best practices to generate earlier revenue realization.\nThe project manager is about to begin planning for the new project and is concerned that the project team is not equipped to work in a hybrid environment. What is the project manager's best course of action?","t":"S","o":["Check the lessons learned repository for agile best practices","Request the training from the project management office (PMO)","Empower the team to self-organized and study agile best practices","Add the risk of the team's inadequate agile skills to the risk register"],"c":[1],"f":"The PMO will typically provide project managers with resources to improve productivity. In this case , the PMO may or may not have internal resources with the necessary knowledge to provide agile training . However , the PMO should be able to provide guidance and external resources, if needed , to train the project team on agile best practices.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":306}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع مسؤول عن إدارة مشروع بناء كبير بقيمة 4 مليارات دولار أمريكي. تشارك فرق مختلفة من دول مختلفة في هذا المشروع وتحتاج الفرق إلى العمل بشكل متماسك وسلس من أجل نجاح المشروع. تعتمد مهمة أحد أعضاء الفريق بشكل كبير على مهمة أعضاء الفريق الآخرين. أي مما يلي مهم للنجاح الشامل لتكامل المشروع؟","oa":["تعريف مفصل لحزم العمل","إدارة التغيير","خطة إدارة الاتصالات","الالتزام بقواعد السلوك المهني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":199,"q":"A project manager is in charge of managing a large construction project of 4 billion USD. Various teams from different countries are involved in this project and the teams need to work cohesively and seamlessly for the success of the project . The task of one team member is highly dependent on that of other team members.\nWhich of the following is important for the overall success of project integration?","t":"S","o":["Detailed definition of the work packages","Change management","Communications management plan","Adherence of professional code of conduct"],"c":[2],"f":"Communication management plan is vital for the success of project integration.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":307}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لحل مشاكل خدمة العملاء في مركز اتصال شركتك. خلال مرحلة التنفيذ ، تم اكتشاف العديد من عيوب الجودة ، مما تسبب في قلق العملاء. ترغب في إنشاء مخطط يوضح تكرار المشكلات والأسباب التي بها أكبر عدد من العيوب. ما الأداة التي تعرض العيوب بالحجم من الأكبر إلى الأقل؟","oa":["مخطط إيشيكاوا","مخطط التدفق","مخطط باريتو","مخططات المصفوفة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":200,"q":"You are the project manager of a project to solve customer service problems in your company's call center.\nDuring the execution phase , several quality defects have been discovered , causing customer concern . You would like to create a chart showing the frequency of problems and the causes that have the largest number of defects . Which tool shows defects by volume from greatest to least?","t":"S","o":["Ishikawa Diagram","Flowchart","Pareto Chart","Matrix diagrams"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword ( greatest to least) A pareto chart is specific type of histogram that ranks causes or issues by their overall influence . A Pareto Chart assists in prioritizing corrective actions as the issues with the greatest impact are displayed in order.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":308}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":201,"q":"The risk breakdown structure (RBS) helps the project team consider the full range of sources from which individual project risks that may arise. The second level of RBS include Regulatory and Legislation. In which category are these risk included?","t":"S","o":["External Risk","Technical Risk","Internal Risk","Management Risk"],"c":[0],"f":"","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP-Exam 4"},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":202,"q":"As a project manager , you know the importance of risk management. You always try to include risk management as an agenda item in your status meetings. Some of your project team members complain that discussing risk management issues in status meetings is a waste of time because none of the risks identified on the project so far have actually occurred. What should you do in this situation ?","t":"S","o":["Call a meeting with your project sponsor and project management team to discuss potential training requirements for your project team members .","Talk to your team members about the importance of risk management .","Agree with your team members and let them know no more time will be spent on discussing risks in the project status meetings unless required in the future.","Call a meeting with your project sponsor and project management team to discuss potential training requirements for your project team members ."],"c":[1],"f":"Project risk management should be an agenda item at periodic status meetings. The amount of time required for that item will vary depending on the risks that have been identified, their priority, and difficulty of planning an appropriate response. But completely avoiding discussion on project risks is not adisable. Organizations should be committed to addressing risks proactively throughout the project life cycle.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP-Exam 4"},{"qa":"لقد تم تعيينك للتو كمدير مشروع لمشروع جاري في مؤسستك. لقد اكتشفت أنه لا يوجد ميثاق مشروع يصف مسؤوليات وصلاحيات مدير المشروع. عندما تحدثت الي راعي مشروعك حول هذة الأمر، أخبرك أن مؤسستك قد نفذت العديد من المشاريع في الماضي دون استخدام ميثاق مشروع. ماذا ستفعل","oa":["ناقش الحاجة إلى وجود ميثاق مشروع مع الراعي","عقد اجتماع بدء المشروع وإبلاغ الجميع أن المشروع قد بدأ","قم بإنشاء ميثاق المشروع وإبلاغ أعضاء فريق المشروع لضمان الفهم المشترك للنتائج الرئيسية وأدوارهم ومسؤولياتهم","قم بإنشاء مسودة ميثاق المشروع وأرسله إلى مشرفك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":203,"q":"You have just been assigned as the project manager for an ongoing project in your organization . You have discovered there is no project charter that describes the responsibilities and authorities of the project manager. When you talked to your project sonsor about this issue , he told you that your organization has executed many projects in the past without ever using a project charter. What will you do","t":"S","o":["Discuss the need to have a project charter with the sponsor","Conduct the project kick-off meeting and inform everyone that the project has started","Create the project charter and inform project team members to ensure common understanding of the key deliverables and their roles and responsibilities","Create a draft project charter and submit to your supervisor"],"c":[0],"f":"The project charter establishes a partnership between the performing and requesting organizations. Projects are initiated by an entity external to the project such as a sponsor , program , or project management office , or portfolio governing body chairperson or authorized representative. The project initiator or sponsor is responsible for approval ans issue the charter and can take the help of the prospect project manager to develop it [PMBOK 6th edition , Page 77]","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":309}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في مشروع تكنولوجيا المعلومات. تبدأ أنت وأصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين في إجراء تحليل فوائد المشروع. بسبب الحلول التي لم يتم تحديدها ، أبلغك مهندس من قسم آخر بوجود أنظمة متأثرة. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ماذا يجب أن تفعل؟","oa":["راجع تحليل فوائد المشروع للنظر في التأثير الإضافي","توثيق المشكلة في سجل الإشكالات","تحديد جميع أصحاب المصلحة","تحديث سجل المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":204,"q":"You are a project manager in an IT project . You and key stakeholders start conducting a project benefit analysis . Because of the solutions that have not been identified, an engineer from another department has informed you that there are affected systems. As a project manager , what should you do ?","t":"S","o":["Review the project benefit analysis to consider the additional impact","Document the issue in the issue log","Identify all stakeholders","Update the risk register"],"c":[1],"f":"Issue log is a project document used to identify and monitor issues that occur in the project. The issue log can be updated with any new issues found during the project and described in the scenario because of the solutions that have not been identified causing the system are affected","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":310}},{"qa":"ينتقل فريق التسويق إلى استخدام الأساليب الهجينة لمشاريعهم. مدير التسويق ليس على دراية بالمنهجيات الهجينة. ويحتاج مدير المشروع إلى دعم المدير لأن مدير التسويق هو أحد أصحاب المصلحة (المعنيين) الرئيسيين. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع للحصول على الدعم؟","oa":["أرشاد /توجية مدير التسويق على المنهجيات الهجينة","اطلب من أعضاء فريق التسويق تدريب المدير","تدريب فريق التسويق وإبقاء المدير على اطلاع","اطلب من مدير التسويق المشاركة في الاجتماعات اليومية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":205,"q":"The marketing team is transferring to using hybrid approaches for their projects . The marketing director is not knowledgeable about hybrid methodologies. And the project manageer needs the director's support as the marketing director is a key stakeholder. What should the project manager do to obtain the support?","t":"S","o":["Mentor the marketing director on hybrid approaches","Ask the marketing team members to coach the director","Train the marketing team and keep the director informed","Ask the marketing director to participate in daily meetings"],"c":[0],"f":"Marketing director is a key stakeholder who has high power , high interest the project manager should follow strategy manage closely with him and project manager should mentor the marketing director on hybrid approaches.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":311}},{"qa":"يقوم مشروع رشيق بتشغيل أنشطة لتحديد الحد الأدنى من المنتجات القابلة للتطبيق. أثناء الجلسة ، يحدد مدير المشروع بعض اللوائح الإلزامية ، ولكن لا يوجد إجماع على تضمين هذه اللوائح في الحد الأدنى من المنتجات القابلة للتطبيق لأنه إذا كان من الممكن تمديد مدة المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من راعي المشروع إضافة المزيد من الوقت إلى المشروع","توجيه المشاركين بضرورة التركيز فقط على وظائف المنتج","تدريب الفريق على اللوائح الجديدة التي تطلبها الإدارة","احصل على التزام من الفريق بتضمين جميع اللوائح المطلوبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":206,"q":"An agile project is running activities to define the minimum viable product . During the session , the project manager identifies some mandatory regulations , but there is no consensus to include these regulations in the minimum viable product because if may extend the duration of the project. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Ask the project sponsor to add more time to the project","Share with the participants the need to focus only on product functionality","Train the team on the new regulations are requested by management","Get commitment from the team to include all of the required regulations"],"c":[3],"f":"In order to determine a usable product for the customer in each increment , the core value must be understood . Based on the essential value sought by the project , the bare minimum of how the value can be realized is established . As there are mandatory regualtions that must be included ,the project manager should Get commitment from the team to include all of the required regulations","ap":"agile","dm":"business","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":312}},{"qa":"في مشروع مختلط ، أصدر العميل عقدًا يحدد التسليمات لكل ربع سنة. يريد العميل أن يُظهر لأصحاب المصلحة نتيجة ملموسة في الربع الأول ويريد نقل المرحلة الثانية إلى الربع الأول. يشرح مدير المشروع للعميل أنه ليس من الممكن تحقيقه ما لم يتم تغيير متطلبات المرحلة الثانية. ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه؟ اختر اثنين","oa":["أخبر العميل أن نقل المرحلة الرئيسية له تأثير كبير جدًا على تكلفة المشروع.","اقنع العميل بترك الأنجاز الثاني في مكانه وعدم تغييره","تصعيد المشكلة للإدارة العليا لحل المشكلة واقتراح خطة","اسأل العميل عن أولوياته فيما يتعلق بمتطلبات المرحلة الثانية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":207,"q":"In a hybrid project, the customer has issued a contract that specifies the deliverables for each quarter. The customer wants to show their stakeholders a tangible outcome in the first quarter and wants to move the second milestone to the first quarter. The project manager explains to the customer that it is not feasible unless the requirements for the second milestone are changed. Which two actions should the project manger take? Chosse two","t":"M","o":["Tell the customer that moving the milestone has a very high impact on the cost of the project.","Convince the customer to leave the second milestone in place and not change it","Escalate the issue to upper management to resolve the problem and suggest a plan","Ask the customer for their priorities regarding the requirements for the second milestone"],"c":[1,3],"f":"Keyword (The project manager explains to the customer that it is not feasible unless the requirements for the second milestone are changed). so the two actions should the project manger take \n\n Ask the customer for their priorities regarding the requirements for the second milestone\n \n Convince the customer to leave the second milestone in place and not change it","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":313}},{"qa":"يقترح فريق المشروع على مدير المشروع أنه لا يوجد سبب لأداء مراقبة الجودة لأن مهام المشروع بسيطة للغاية ، ويدرك مدير المشروع أن إزالة خطة إدارة الجودة من المشروع سيساعد أيضًا في توفير المال ، وهو أمر مهم بالنسبة لـ عميل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من العميل أن يأمر بإجراء تدقيق خارجي للجودة بعد الانتهاء من تسليم المشروع ، وخفض ميزانية المشروع","تطوير خطة إدارة الجودة ، حيث أن الجودة لا تقل أهمية عن إدارة التكلفة والجدول الزمني","احصل على تأكيد من الإدارة بأن عضو الفريق لديه خبرة كافية لإنشاء برامج بدون مراقبة الجودة","سجل بدء المشروع بدون خطة إدارة الجودة كمخاطر ، وخصص مدخرات الميزانية للاحتياطي الإداري"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":208,"q":"The project team suggests to the project manager that there is no reason to perform quality control since the project tasks are very simple, The project manager understands that removing the quality management plan from the project will also help to save money, which is important to the customer. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Ask the customer to order an external quality audit after accepting the project deliverable , and decrease the budget of the project","Develop the quality management plan , as quality is as equally importance as cost and schedule management","Get confirmation from management that the team member has enough experience to build software without quality control","Register starting the project without a quality management plan as a risk , and allocate the budget savings to the management reserve"],"c":[1],"f":"The quality management plan cannot be ignored, as it is considered as important as any other plan in the project, where the success of the project depends on the integration of plans and the inclusion of all necessary plans such as the quality management plan, cost, scope, resources, risks, procurement, stakeholders, communications and schedule, and including them in a project management plan","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":314}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع تدير مشروعًا معقدًا بدرجة عالية من عدم اليقين. يتم تقديم طلب لتطبيق طريقة لقياس جودة المخرجات. باستخدام نهج هجين ، ما هي التقنيات التي يمكن استخدامها لتحقيق هذه الأهداف؟","oa":["العمل المزدوج وطريقة دور العميل","مراجعات سكرم ماستر  وطريقة كانبان للجودة","سكرم اليومي وتقييمات الجودة لمالك المنتج","التكرارات المقيدة بالوقت وأجتماعات المراجعة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":209,"q":"You are a project manager managing a complex project with a high level of uncertainty . A request is made to implemet a method to measure the quality of the deliverables.\nUsing a hybrid approach , what techniques can be used to achieve this goals ?","t":"S","o":["Paired work and the customer role method","Scrum master reviews and the quality Kanban method","Daily scrum and product owner quality assessments","Time-boxing iterations and review meetings"],"c":[3],"f":"The Best Option (Time-boxing iterations and review meetings) since the project manager use a hybrid approach and the project is complex.\nTime-boxing to address with a high level of uncertainty\nReview meeting to measure the quality of the deliverables","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":315}},{"qa":"يريد أحد أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين أن يفهم متى قد تصبح المخاطر مشكلة محتملة. ما هي القطع الأثرية التي يجب على مدير المشروع مشاركتها مع أصحاب المصلحة","oa":["سجل الأشكالات","خطة إدارة المشروع","خطة إدارة الخطر","سجل المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":210,"q":"A key stakeholders wants to understand when the risk may potentially become an issue. What artifact should the project manager share with the stakeholders","t":"S","o":["Issue log","Project management plan","Risk management plan","Risk register"],"c":[3],"f":"A Risk Register is a document you use to record:\n\n \n All of your organisation’s identified risks\n \n \n The likelihood and consequences of a risk occurring,\n \n \n The actions you are undertaking to reduce those risks \n \n \n Who is responsible for managing them.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":316}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في شركة. الراعي داعم في الاستفادة من الأساليب الرشيقة. يفكر مدير المشروع في كيفية طرح نهج رشيق ومشاركة الألعاب من كل من أعضاء فريق المشروع وأصحاب المصلحة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["حدد أدوات البرامج الرشيقة المطلوبة لدعم التسليم السريع داخل المؤسسة","تحديد كيفية تحويل المنظمة باستخدام تقنيات رشيقة ، بما في ذلك التدريب التنظيمي والاتصالات","ابدأ بمشروع تجريبي من ذو تعقيد مناسب ووفر تدريبًا رشيقًا لأولئك المتأثرين","حدد مشروعًا تنبئيًا حاليًا ، وحدد النهج ، وقم بتوفير تدريب رشيق لتنفيذ ما تبقى من المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":"إذا أراد مدير المشروع تحويل المنظمة لاستخدام نهج رشيق ، فيجب عليه أولاً البدء بمشروع تجريبي ذي تعقيد مناسب وتوفير تدريب رشيق لأولئك المتأثرين","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":211,"q":"You are a project manager of a company. The sponsor is supportive in leveraging agile approaches. The project manager s contemplating how to roll out the agile approach and gam buy-in from both project team members and stakeholders.What should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Determine which agile software tools will be required to support agile delivery within the organization","Determine how to transform the organization using agile techniques , including organizational training and communications","Start with a pilot project of appropriate complexity and provide agile training to those who are impacted","Select a current predictive project, define the approach , and provide agile training to execute the remainder of the project"],"c":[2],"f":"If project manager want to transform the organization to use an agile approach he should first Start with a pilot project of appropriate complexity and provide agile training to those who are impacted","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":317}},{"qa":"خلال مرحلة تنفيذ مشروع بناء ، أفلس مورد رئيسي ولا يمكنه توفير المواد المتعاقد عليها. قد تؤثر هذه المشكلة على الجدول الزمني للمشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["قم بتحديث الجدول الزمني لتضمين التأخير","قم بتحديث سجل المشكلة واعمل على تقليل التأثير","التصعيد لفريق الإدارة للموافقة على التأخير","أضافة الخطر والتأخير إلى سجل المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":212,"q":"During the implementation phase of a construction project, a key supplier went bankrupt and cannot supply the contracted material. This issue could affect the project schedule. What should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Update the schedule to include the delay","Update the issue log and act to minimize the impact","Escalate to the management team for delay approval","Add the risk and the delay to the risk register"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword ( supplier went bankrupt and cannot supply the contracted material -The issue ) so there is issue no risk\nThe issue is certain event or condition has negative impact (is in the past) . the project manager add and update the issue in issue log .\nBut the risk is uncertain event or condition has positive or negative impact.\n\nThe project manager should add and update the risk in risk register.\nso in real exam should read the question and identify this is risk or issue in this scenario this is issue so the project manager should update issue log.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":318}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع جديد لمشروع معرض لخطر الفشل ، ولا يعرف أصحاب المصلحة حالة المشروع ولا يعرفون الفوائد التي سيقدمها المشروع. كيف يمكن لمدير المشروع نقل هذه الفوائد إلى أصحاب المصلحة","oa":["أعد تحديد الخط المرجعي للجدول الزمني للمشروع  لإظهار الحالة الحالية للمشروع","قم بتحديث خريطة التسليمات مقابل متطلبات المشروع المتفق عليها","قم بإجراء تحليل التكلفة  مقابل المنفعة الخاص بالمشروع لأصحاب المصلحة","قم بإنشاء خطة إدارة المنافع المعينة للأهداف الإستراتيجية للمؤسسة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":213,"q":"A new project manager has been assigned to a project that is in danger of failling the stakeholders do not know the project status nor do they know what benefits will be delivered by the project.\n\nHow can the project manager convey these benefits to the stakeholders?","t":"S","o":["Re-baseline the project schedule to show the current status of the project","Update the deliverables map against the agreed-upon project requirements","Perform a project cost -benefit analysis for the stakeholders","Create a benefits management plan mapped to the organization's strategic objectives"],"c":[2],"f":"Cost-Benefit Analysis help to make the right decisions and to ensure that the benefits will be delivered according to the benefits management plan.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":319}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق رشيق بالعصف الذهني وتحديد أولويات جميع المخاطر وفقًا لشدتها. ما الذي يجب على الفريق فعله حيال المخاطر المحددة؟","oa":["توافق على أنه يمكن التعامل مع أي مشكلة عندما تصبح مشكلة","تقر بأنه سيتم التعامل مع المخاطر في التكرارات المقابلة","ركز على مخرجات المشروع بدلاً من المخاطر الموثقة","التخفيف من المخاطر التي تنطبق على التكرارات الحالية والتالية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":214,"q":"An agile team is brainstorming and prioritizing all of the risks according to severity. What should the team do about the identified risks?","t":"S","o":["Agree that any issue can be handled when it becomes a problem","Acknowledge that the risks will be handled in the corresponding iterations","Focus on the project deliverables rather than the documented risks","Mitigate the risks that are applicable to the current and following iterations"],"c":[3],"f":"To prioritize all of the risks according to severity the project manager should Mitigate the risks that are applicable to the current and following iterations .","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":320}},{"qa":"في منتصف التكرار ، تم إخطار فريق رشيق يعمل على تطوير منتج جديد بأن أحد أعضاء الفريق المهم سيترك المشروع لبضعة أسابيع بسبب بعض المشكلات الشخصية الملحة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع فيما يتعلق بالأنشطة التي كانت من مسؤولية عضو الفريق هذا؟","oa":["توصل إلى اتفاق مع الفريق حول كيفية التعامل مع الموقف","السماح للإدارة العليا أن تقرر كيفية المضي قدما في المشروع","تواصل مع فريق المشتريات لتعيين بديل لعضو الفريق","اقنع عضو الفريق بعدم المغادرة حتى اكتمال المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":215,"q":"In the middle of an iteration , an agile team working on the development of a new product was notified that an important team member will leave the project for a few weeks due to some urgent personal issues. What should the project manager do regarding the activities that were the responsibility of this team member?","t":"S","o":["Reach an agreement with the team on how to handle the situation","Allow senior management to decide how to proceed with the project","Reach out to the procurement team to hire a substitute for the team member","Convince the team member not to leave until the project is completed"],"c":[0],"f":"Since it's an agile project and we are in the middle of an iteration, the project manager sould Reach an agreement with the team on how to handle the situation .","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":321}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع جديد لمشروع أثناء التنفيذ. أدرك مدير المشروع أن السياسات الضريبية الجديدة تخلق مخاطر لتجاوز التكلفة بنسبة 25٪. قام مدير المشروع بتحديث سجل المخاطر وأبقى المشروع يعمل كالمعتاد. أعلن الرئيس التنفيذي أنه يمكن إلغاء المشروع لأن تجاوز التكلفة المقبولة هو 20٪ فقط. تفاجأ مدير المشروع تمامًا لأن هذه كانت معلومات جديدة. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب ذلك؟","oa":["قدم استجابة مناسبة للمخاطر","تنفيذ خطة إدارة الاتصالات بشكل صحيح","تأكد من تحديث تحمل المخاطر للشركة بشكل صحيح","نفذت خطة إشراك المعنيين بشكل صحيح"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":216,"q":"A new project manager was assigned to a project during implementation. The project manager realized that new tax policies are creating a risk for a cost overrun by 25% . The project manager updated the risk register and kept the project running as normal. The CEO has announced that the project could be canceled since the acceptable cost overrun is only 20%. The project manager was quite surprised as this was new information. What should the project manager have done to avoid this?","t":"S","o":["Provided a proper risk response","Implemented the communications management plan properly","Ensured the risk tolerance of the company was properly updated","Implemented the stakeholder engagement plan correctly"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword ( new information) .\ncommunication management plan include information","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":322}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يقود مشروعًا معقدًا من الناحية الفنية. المشروع جزء من برنامج عمل استراتيجي وأول من يستخدم نهجًا رشيقًا. يهتم أحد أعضاء مجلس الإدارة بحضور اجتماع لمعرفة مدى تقدم تسليم نطاق المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله قائد المشروع؟","oa":["قم بدعوة عضو مجلس الإدارة لاجتماع الوقوف اليومي","قم بدعوة عضو مجلس الإدارة إلى اجتماع التخطيط التالي","قم بدعوة عضو مجلس الإدارة إلى اجتماع المراجعة التالي","قم بدعوة عضو مجلس الإدارة إلى اجتماع التقييم  باثر راجعي القادم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":217,"q":"A project manager is leading a technically complex project. The project is part of a strategic program of work and the first to use an agile approach. One of the board members is interested in attending a meeting to see how the delivery of the project scope is progressing. What should the project lead do ?","t":"S","o":["Invite the board member to the next daily standup","Invite the board member to the next sprint planning","Invite the board member to the next sprint review","Invite the board member to the next sprint retrospective"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword (how the delivery of the project scope is progressing) so the best option sprint review . Sprint review : is held at the end of a sprint , during which the team demonstrate what was accomplished and give feedback .","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":323}},{"qa":"قام أحد العملاء بمراجعة خطة مشروع بدرجة عالية من عدم اليقين. أعرب العميل عن قلقه بشأن العمل الذي يتطلب الكثير من التكرارات مع خطر عدم الوصول إلى تاريخ التسليم الإلزامي. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يستخدمه مدير المشروع في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["النهج الرشيق","النهج الهجين","نهج الشلال","النهج التنبؤي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":218,"q":"A customer reviewed the plan for a project with high uncertainty. The customer expressed concerned about the work requiring so many iterations with a risk of not reaching the mandatory delivery date. Which approach should the project manager use in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Agile approach","Hybrid approach","Waterfall approach","Predictive approach"],"c":[0],"f":"Uncertainty means either Iterative or Incremental (Adaptive). Hybrid cannot be it here since there is no chance of being Predictive for any of the part of the project. This Cannot be Kanban since there is a deadline. Hence the option is only left as Agile.\nWhen things are not clear go with agile. Even in your answers try following agile, it works.\nAgile project management begins with the premise that software projects are not predictable. Market uncertainty is going to drive change. The more uncertain we are about our projects, the more the organization must plan to adapt. The implication of market uncertainty is that requirements will need to be changed over the life of the project.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":324}},{"qa":"تولى مدير المشروع للتو مشروعًا لتطوير منتج باستخدام دورة حياة هجين . مع هذا المشروع ، يكون للجهاز متطلبات ثابتة بينما لا تزال متطلبات البرامج قيد التطور. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع تطبيق دورة الحياة الهجين لهذا المشروع؟","oa":["يجب تحديد نطاق كل من الأجهزة والبرامج بشكل تكراري","يجب تحديد نطاق كل من الأجهزة والبرامج أثناء التخطيط الأولي للمشروع","طور البرنامج مع دورة حياة تنبؤية واستخدم دورة حياة تكيفية للأجهزة","تطوير الأجهزة بدورة حياة تنبؤية واستخدم دورة حياة تكيفية للبرنامج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":219,"q":"A project manager has just taken over a project to develop a product using a hybrid life cycle. With this project, the hardware has fixed requirements while the software requirements are still evolving. How should the project manager apply the hybrid life cycle for this project?","t":"S","o":["Both the hardware and software should have their scope defined iteratively","Both the hardware and software should have their scope defined during initial project planning","Develop the software with a predictive life cycle and use an adaptive life cycle the hardware","Develop the hardware with a predictive life cycle and use an adaptive life cycle for the software"],"c":[3],"f":"In this scenario , the hardware has fixed requirements so the project manager should develop the hardware with a predicitive life cycle since the project scope,time , and cost are determined in the early phases of the life cycle.\nwhile the software requirements are still evolving so the project managershould develop software with an adaptive life cycle .\nA hybrid development life cycle is a combination of predicitive an adaptive life cycles.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":325}},{"qa":"لقد أوصيت بتطوير دراسة جدوي  لكل مشروع تنظيمي متبوعًا بوضع خطة إدارة فوائد المشروع. من تنصح أن يكون صاحب دراسة الجدوى؟","oa":["مدير المشروع","لجنة التحكم في التغيير","فريق المشروع","راعي المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":220,"q":"You have recommended developing a business case for each of the organizational projects followed by the development of a project benefits management plan. Who would you recommend to be the owner of the business case ?","t":"S","o":["Project manager","Change Control Board","Project team","Project sponsor"],"c":[3],"f":"The project sponsor is generally accountable for the development and maintenance of the project business case document. The project manager is responsible for providing recommendations and oversight to keep the project business case, project management plan , project charter , and project benebfits management plan success measures in alignment with one another and with the goals and objectives of the organization. [ PMBOK Guide , 6th edition, Page 29 ]","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":326}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق أجايل حاليًا بتطوير نظام مراقبة المخزون. يتجادل اثنان من المبرمجين في الفريق ويوصون بأساليب تطوير مختلفة. أحدهما يرى أن النظام يجب أن يبنى من الصفر ، بينما يرى الآخر أن النظام الحالي يجب تحسينه وتصحيحه. كيف يجب أن تحل هذا الصراع؟","oa":["قم بتطوير المنتج من نقطة الصفر لأن ذلك سيجعل النظام أقرب إلى المتطلبات","اطلب من صاحب المنتج اختيار النهج الصحيح","اطلب من الفريق بأكمله تحليل كلا النهجين واختيار الأسلوب الذي سيقدم قيمة عمل أعلى","حدد نهج عمل التصحيح حيث سيوفر ذلك الوقت للمؤسسة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":221,"q":"An Agile team is currently developing an inventory control system. Two programmers on the team are arguing and recommending different development approaches . One is of the view that the system should be built from scratch, while the other believes that the existing system should be enhanced and patched. How should you resolve this conflict?","t":"S","o":["Develop the product from scratch as that wi11 bring the system closer to requirements","Ask the product owner to choose the right approach.","Ask the entire team to analyze both approaches and select the one that will deliver higher business value.","Select the patch work approach as that will save time for the organization"],"c":[2],"f":"This has to be a team decision so Ask the entire team to analyze both approaches and select the one that will deliver higher business value. [ Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 4 ]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":327}},{"qa":"ما الميزة التي يجب أن يعطيها الفريق الأولوية أولاً؟","oa":["ج","د","ب","أ"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":222,"q":"Which feature should the team prioritize first?","t":"S","o":["C","D","B","A"],"c":[3],"f":"To prioritize features\nFeature Name = Business Value / Development effort\nA= 6/2 = 3\nB=10/4= 2.5\nC=4/4 =1\nD=8/8=1\nFeature A is the highest value and the lowest effort.\nThe initiatives that the deliver the highest value and require the least effort will represent the top-priority item to add to your product backlog.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":328}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":223,"q":"Using the following values , calculate the management reserve : Project Budget = 100,000 - EAC = 120,000 - AC = 5,500 - BAC = 70,000","t":"S","o":["30,000","50,000","20,000","10,350"],"c":[0],"f":"The Management Reserve = Project Budget - BAC = 100,000-70,000 = 30,000","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4"},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لمشروع بنية تحتية. يقدم أعضاء فريق المشروع تقريرًا شهريًا عن الأنشطة المعينة لهم. ما الذي يجب عليك فعله للحفاظ على تدفق نقدي سليم ؟","oa":["تطبيق تحليل نوعي","تقديم تقارير المشروع","أنشطة بناء الفريق","تطبيق مبادئ القيمة المكتسبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":224,"q":"You are project manager for an infrastructure project. Your project team members report monthly on their assigned activities . What should you di to maintain a healthy cash flow?","t":"S","o":["Perform a qualitative","Provide project reports","Team building activities","Apply earned value (EV) principles"],"c":[3],"f":"Earned Value Management helps project managers to measure project performance .It is a systematic project management process used final variances in projects based on comparison of work performed and work planned. Earned Value Management is used on the cost and schedule control and can be very useful in project forecasting. Earned Value Manageemnt (EVM) provides quantitative data for project decision making.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":329}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي هو مثال على تكلفة فشل خارجية","oa":["تكلفة الضمان","تكلفة الوثائق","تكلفة الاختبار","تكلفة التدريب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":225,"q":"Which of the following is an example of an external failure cost","t":"S","o":["Warranty cost","Cost of documentation","Cost of testing","Cost of training"],"c":[0],"f":"Warranty cost is the cost that belongs to the category of external failure cost.","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":330}},{"qa":"كان إبراهيم يدير مشروعًا. أثناء إجراء تدقيق الجودة ، وجد أن أعضاء الفريق قد ارتكبوا عددًا من الأخطاء الطفيفة أثناء إنتاج منتج المشروع. إنه قلق بشأن ما إذا كانت عمليات المشروع تحت السيطرة أم لا. أي من الأدوات التالية يجب أن يستخدمها لإزالة شكوكه؟","oa":["شريط الرسم البياني","مخطط إيشيكاوا","خرائط المراقبة/ مخطط التحكم","الرسم البياني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":226,"q":"Ibrahim has been running a project . While performing a quality audit he found that the team memebers have committed a number of minor mistakes while producing the product of the project. He is concerned about whether or not the project processes are under control. Which of the following tools should he use to clear his doubts?","t":"S","o":["Bar Chart","Ishikawa Diagram","Control Chart","Histogram"],"c":[2],"f":"Control charts illustrate how a process behaves over time and when a process is subject to special cause variation, resulting in an out of control condition. The appropriate data is collected and analyzed to indicate the quality status of project processes and products.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":331}},{"qa":"اكتشف خبير في موضوع ضمان الجودة أن الفريق لم يتبع إجراءات الامتثال أثناء تصنيع الدواء. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمنع هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["مراجعة وثيقة خط الأساس للجودة","مراجعة خطة إدارة الجودة","مراجعة وثيقة مقاييس الجودة","مراجعة وثيقة تحسين الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":227,"q":"A quality assurance subject matter expert SME discovered that the formulation team didn't follow complaiance procedures while manufacturing a drug. What shpuld the project manager have done to prevent this issue?","t":"S","o":["Reviewed the quality baseline document","Reviewed the quality management plan","Reviewed the quality metrics document","Reviewed the quality improvement document"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword (team didn't follow complaiance procedures while manufacturing a drug) .\n\nQuality Management Plan includes the major procedures relevant for the project, such as dealing with nonconformance, corrective actions procedures, and continous improvement procedures.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":332}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع بتحليل عيب رئيسي وحرج لتحديد السبب الجذري. من أجل القيام بذلك ، نظر الفريق في العديد من العوامل المرتبطة بالعيوب وقام بتجميعها في فئات مثل الماكينة والطريقة والمادة والقوى العاملة. أي من أدوات الجودة التالية يستخدمها الفريق؟","oa":["الرسم البياني","مخطط التحكم","مخطط السبب والتأثير","المخططات الأنسيابية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":228,"q":"A project team is analyzing a major , critical defect to determine the root cause. In order to do this , the team considered various factors linked to the defects and grouped them into categorizes such as Machine , Method , Material , and Manpower. Which of the following tools of quality is the team using?","t":"S","o":["Histogram","Control chart","Cause - and -effect diagram","Flowchart"],"c":[2],"f":"Cause - and - effect diagrams are also known as fishbone diagrams, why-why diagrams, or Ishikawa diagrams. This type of diagram breaks down the causes of the problem statement identified into discrete branches, helping to determine the main or root cause of the problem. [PMBOK 6th edition ,Page 293]","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":333}},{"qa":"أنت تراقب حالة المشروع لتحديث تقدم المشروع وإدارة التغييرات على الخط المرجعي للجدول الزمني. لديك بعض الموارد المخصصة لأكثر من نشاط واحد في وقت واحد ، مما يجعلها مجمعة بشكل إجمالي خلال تلك الأيام. تريد تقليل هذا التحميل الزائد والحفاظ على استخدام الموارد عند مستوى ثابت. ما الأسلوب الذي يجب أن تستخدمه لتحقيق هذا الهدف؟","oa":["تخصيص الموارد","ضغط الموارد","ضغط الجدول الزمني","تسوية الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":229,"q":"You are monitoring the status of a project to update the project progress and manage changes to the schedule baseline. You have some resources assigned to more than one activity simultaneously , making them overallocated during those days. You want to reduce this overallocation and keep resource usage at a constant level. What technique should you use to achieve this goal ?","t":"S","o":["Resource Allocation","Resource Compression","Schedule Compression","Resource leveling"],"c":[3],"f":"Resource leveling is used to reduce overallocation and to keep resource usage at a constant level.\n\nThis technique can be used in both the develop schedule process and the control schedule process.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":334}},{"qa":"يقترب العميل من عضو فريق التصميم ويطلب إيقاف مهمة حالية ووضع مفهوم جديد. سيؤدي هذا إلى تغيير التصميم بشكل كبير ، وسيؤثر على ميزانية المشروع والجدول الزمني. يسأل عضو الفريق مدير المشروع عن مسار العمل التالي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["عقد اجتماع الفريق لمناقشة الطلب","اقبل الطلب وقم بإجراء التغييرات","اطلب من العميل الامتناع عن الأتصال المباشر مع أعضاء الفريق","الرجوع إلى إجراء عملية التحكم في التغيير المتكامل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":230,"q":"A client approaches a design team member requesting that a current task be stopped and a new concept the developed. This will significantly change the design, and impact the project budget and schedule. The team member asks the project manager for the next course of action. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Hold a team meeting to discuss the request","Accept the request and make the changes","Ask the client to refrain from directly contracting team members.","Refer to the perform integrated change control process"],"c":[3],"f":"Since the new concept be developed will significantly change the design, and impact the project budget and schedule , the project manager should refer to the perform integrated change control process to manage this change.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":335}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في شركة ، ومشروعك في مرحلة التنفيذ حاليًا. يغادر أحد فرق مشروعك الموقع مبكرًا في الساعة 3:00 مساءً يوم الجمعة ويسيء معاملة زملائه. ترغب في وضع توقعات واضحة فيما يتعلق بالسلوك المقبول لعضو الفريق. لتجنب مثل هذه المواقف ، يجب عليك إنشاء","oa":["مهارات التعامل مع الآخرين","مهارات الإدارة","أنشطة بناء الفريق","ميثاق الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":231,"q":"You are a project manager of a company , and your project is currently in the execution phase. One of your project teams leave the site early at 3:00 pm friday and mistreats his colleagues. You would like to establish clear expectations regarding the acceptable behavior of the team member. To avoid such situations , you should create:","t":"S","o":["Interpersonal skills","Management skills","Team-building activities","The team charter"],"c":[3],"f":"The team charter establishes clear rxpectations regarding acceptable behavior by project team members [PMBOK 6th edition, Page 320]","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":336}},{"qa":"يعمل محلل أعمال رائد في مشروع كبير باستمرار حتى وقت متأخر لوضع اللمسات الأخيرة على متطلبات التكرار التالي. في اجتماع قيادة الفريق الأسبوعي. يعلم مدير المشروع أن هناك العديد من محللي الأعمال في الفريق الذين لديهم اوقات فراغ . ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لضمان تساوي عبء العمل؟","oa":["قم بتأجيل تاريخ بدء التكرار التالي للسماح بمزيد من الوقت لجمع المتطلبات","قم بتوجيه محللي الأعمال الذين لديهم وقت  للحصول على ملكية أكبر للمشروع","راجع قائمة المتطلبات المفتوحة وأعد تعيينها لأعضاء الفريق الذي لديهم وقت","قم بتيسير مناقشة داخل الفريق لإعادة توزيع العمل داخل فريق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":232,"q":"A lead business analyst on a large project has consistently been working late to finalize requirements for the next sprint. The weekly team lead meeting. The project manager learns there are several business analysts on the team who have free cycles. What should the project manager do to ensure an even workload?","t":"S","o":["Delay the start date of the next sprint to allow more time for gathering requirements","Direct the business analysts with free cycles to take more ownership of the project","Review the list of open requirements and reassign them to team members with free cycles","Facilitate a discussion within the team to redistribute the work within the project team"],"c":[3],"f":"The best option when there is open discussion with team. in the scanario the project manager learns there are several business analysts who have free cycle so the project manager should facilitate a discussion within the team to redistribute the work within the project team","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":337}},{"qa":"يستغرق المشروع ستة أشهر من مدته المتوقعة البالغة تسعة أشهر ، ويبلغ مدير المشروع أن المشروع متأخر ثلاثة أشهر على الأقل عن الجدول الزمني لأن بعض أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين كانوا يقاومون أي تغييرات قد تحدث كنتائج للمشروع. ما كان يمكن القيام به بشكل مختلف أثناء التخطيط للمشروع لتجنب هذا الموقف","oa":["وضع خطة إدارة اتصالات بشكل أفضل","تطوير مصفوفة تقييم مشاركة المعنيين","تنفيذ أفضل لإدارة عمليات مشاركة المعنيين","إنشاء سجل المعنيين بشكل تفصيلي وشامل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":233,"q":"A project is six months into its nine - month projected duration , and the project manager is reporting that the project is at least three months behind schedule because certain key stakeholders were resistant to any changes that might occur as outcomes of the project. What might have been done differently during project planning to have avoided this situation","t":"S","o":["Establishment of more robust communications management plan","Development of a stakeholder engagement assessment matrix","Better execution of the manage stakeholder engagement processes","Creation of a comprehensive stakeholder register"],"c":[1],"f":"The scenario describe a situation where the resistance of certain key stakeholders has caused the project to run behind schedule and is asking what might have been done differently during the project planning. Two of the answer choices represent activities which are not associated with the planning process group , and , as a result , those responses can be eliminated. Both of the remaining answer choices represent plausible actions that may have led to better stakehlder engagement. In this case, the development of the stakeholder engagement assessment matrix directly addresses the issue described because the stakeholder engagement assessment matrix is technique which use during the plan stakeholder engagement processes and identifies key stakeholders along with their current and desired engagement level. Classifications for stakeholder engagement may include unaware,resistant, neutral , supportive , and leading .","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":338}},{"qa":"الحكومة ترعى مشروع إنشاء طريق سريع جديد. يقوم مدير المشروع المعين بإبلاغ المعنيين بأنه تمت الموافقة على ميثاق المشروع. يعمل مدير المشروع على خطة إدارة المشروع ويتلقى بريدًا إلكترونيًا من منظمة بيئية يسأل عن أهداف وتاريخ بدء المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لمعالجة الوضع؟","oa":["قم بتحديث خطة إدارة الاتصالات وفقًا لذلك","قم بإجراء جلسة عصف ذهني مع المعنيين والفريق","قم بإجراء تحليل المعنيين وتواصل مع المعنيين (أصحاب المصلحة) وفقًا لذلك","قم بالرد على الإيميل بالمعلومات المطلوبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":234,"q":"The government sponsors a project to construct a new highway. The assigned project manager communicates to stakeholders that the project charter was approved. The project manager is working on the project management plan and receives an email from an environmental organization asking for the objectives and start date of the project. What should the project manager do to address the situation?","t":"S","o":["Update the communication management plan accordingly","Conduct a brainstorming session with the stakeholders and the team","Conduct a stakeholder analysis and communicate to stakeholders accordingly","Respond to the email with the requested information"],"c":[2],"f":"Since the project in the planning phase and the environmental organization did not identified before , the project manager should first Conduct a stakeholder analysis to learn about their major requirements ,expectations , the potential for influencing project outcomes and communicate to stakeholders accordingly","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":339}},{"qa":"يركز مدير المشروع على الأنظمة والهيكل لتحقيق أهداف المشروع. ونتيجة لذلك ، فإن علاقة مدير المشروع بفريق المشروع متوترة. على الرغم من أن المشروع الحالي يتجه لتحقيق أهداف المشروع ، إلا أن الدوران المفرط لفريق المشروع يهدد المشروع. لتحسين الذات ، ما نوع المهارات التي يجب أن يقضي مدير المشروع الوقت في تطويرها؟","oa":["مهارات التواصل","مهارات القيادة","مهارات الإدارة","المهارات التشغيلية وحل المشكلات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":235,"q":"A project manager focuses on systems and structure to accomplish project goals. As a result , the project manager has a strained relationship with the project team. Although the current project is trending to meet project objectives, excessive turnover of the project team threatens the project. For self improvement , what type of skills should the project manager spend time developing?","t":"S","o":["Communication skills","Leadership skills","Management Skills","Operational and problem solving skills"],"c":[1],"f":"The strained relationship with the project team suggests that the project manager lacks in leadership skills to foster better relationships","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":340}},{"qa":"أنت تقود مشروع تطوير برمجيات ، والذي يتطلب معرفة العديد من لغات البرمجة. أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ، تم سحب إحدى المطورين من المشروع من قبل مديرها الوظيفي. قدم لك المدير مطورًا آخر بدلاً من ذلك. ما الذى ينبغى عليك فعله اولا؟","oa":["جدولة التدريب للمطور الجديد","عمل أختبار القدرة للمطور الجديد","تعريف المطور الجديد على راعي المشروع","عيّن للمطور قصة المستخدم التالية في التراكم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":236,"q":"You are leading a software development project, which requires knowledge of several programming languages . During project execution , one of the developers has been pulled out of the project by her functional manager. The manager provided you with another developer instead. What should you do first?","t":"S","o":["Schedule training for the new developer","Provide the new developer with an ability test","Introduce the new developer to the project sponsor","Assign the developer the next user story in the backlog"],"c":[1],"f":"An ability test would provide an assessment of the new developer's existing competencies in order to determine what, if any,gaps in skill set exist and how they might be addressed.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":341}},{"qa":"لقد تم تكليفك بقيادة مشروع رشيق. تريد التأكد من مشاركة معلومات المشروع داخل المنظمة وعبرها ، بحيث تظهر أي اختلالات أو تبعيات أو مشكلات أخرى تتعلق بالمتطلبات المتغيرة بشكل متكرر في أسرع وقت ممكن. كيف يمكن تحقيق هذا الهدف على أفضل وجه؟","oa":["من خلال تعزيز الشفافية","من خلال مشاركة وثائق شاملة","عن طريق توزيع تقرير المشروع أسبوعيا","من خلال دعوة أصحاب المصلحة إلى أجتماعات الوقفات اليومية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":237,"q":"You have been assigned to lead an agile project. You want to ensure that project information is shared within and across the organzation, so that any misalignments , dependencies , or other issues related to the frequently changing requirements are surfaced as quickly as possible. How could this goal be best achieved?","t":"S","o":["By promoting aggressive transparency","By sharing comprehensive documentation","By distribution the project report weekly","By inviting stakeholders to daily stand-ups"],"c":[0],"f":"In order to accelerate the sharing of information within and across the organization , agile methods promote aggressive transparency. Inviting stakeholders to project meetings and reviews or posting project artifacts in public spaces would help surface any misalignments , dependencies , or other issues related to the frequently changing project.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":342}},{"qa":"يطلب مكتب إدارة المشاريع  الخاص بمؤسستك بشكل دوري عناصر المشروع من جميع المشاريع والتحقق مما إذا كان يتم الالتزام بمعايير الشركة الخاصة بإدارة المشاريع أم لا. كما أنها داعمة في توفير القوالب والمبادئ التوجيهية المتعلقة بإدارة المشروع عند الطلب. أي نوع من مكتب إدارة المشاريع نشير إليه","oa":["مكتب إدارة المشاريع - مسيطر","مكتب إدارة المشاريع - موجه","مكتب إدارة المشاريع - متحكم","مكتب إدارة المشاريع - داعم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":238,"q":"Your organization's PMO is periodically asking for project artifacts from all projects and checking whether corporate standards of project management are being adhered to or not. They are also supportive in providing templates and guidelines related to project management when asked. Which type of PMO are we referring","t":"S","o":["Governing PMO","Directing PMO","Controlling PMO","Supporting PMO"],"c":[2],"f":"In this scenario The PMO is assisting with templates and guidelines like a suportive PMO + checking whether corporate standards ,so they are playing the bigger role of a controlling PMO here .","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":343}},{"qa":"أنت مدير المشروع لبناء شلال خرساني في مدينة ملاهي تخطيط كل شيء مقدمًا واتباع طريقة الشلال. ومع ذلك ، لا يريد العميل إصلاح كل شيء منذ البداية ، حيث قد يغير رأيه في عدد من المجالات بمجرد بدء المشروع ، ويحتاج إلى التأكد من أن إدارة المشروع يمكن أن تسمح بالتدفق على التأثيرات. ما نوع دورة حياة المشروع التي يجب أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع","oa":["ضمنية","تكيفية","صريحة","تنبؤية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":239,"q":"The project manager to build a concrete waterfall at a theme park likes to plan everything upfront and follow the waterfall method. However, the customer doesn't want everything fixed from the beginning , as she may change her mind in a number of areas once the project is underway, and needs to be sure that the project management can allow for flow on effects. What sort of ptoject life cycle should the project manager use","t":"S","o":["Tacit","Adaptive","Explicit","Predictive"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword ( she may change her mind in a number of areas once the project is underway) . The customer ask about Adaptive life cycle = Agile / Change driven , the deliverables are developed over multiple iterations where a detailed scope is defined asd approved for each iteration when it begins.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":344}},{"qa":"أنت تدير مشروع بناء. بعد تحديد المخاطر ، تبدأ عملية التحليل النوعي للمخاطر والآن ستقوم بتحديد أولوياتها . أي من التقنيات التالية ستستخدمها؟","oa":["تحليل الحساسية","مخطط مبعثر","مصفوفة الأحتمالية والتأثير","مخطط تورنادو"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":240,"q":"You are managing a construction project. After identifying risks , you start the qualitative risk analysis process and now you are going to prioritize them. Which of the following techniques are you going to use ?","t":"S","o":["Sensitive analysis","Scatter diagram","Probability and impact matrix","Tornado diagram"],"c":[2],"f":"Perform qualitative risk analysis process aims to priortize risks and focus on high risk so there are a lot of tools and techniques which used to priortize risks as Probability and Impact Matrix .","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":345}},{"qa":"كان اثنان من أعضاء الفريق يتجادلان مع بعضهما البعض بشكل مفتوح في الاجتماعات. تحدث كل عضو في الفريق بشكل فردي مع الراعي مباشرة واتخذ قرارات دون إبلاغ مدير المشروع. ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه؟ إختر إثنين","oa":["اطلب من أعضاء الفريق حلها بأنفسهم","ناقش هذا الموقف مع مديري المشاريع الآخرين واطلب النصيحة","عالج المشكلات السلوكية مع كل عضو في الفريق","ناقش السلوك مباشرة مع مديريهم واطلب منهم تصحيح السلوك","إعادة التأكيد على القواعد الأساسية في الاجتماع التالي والتأكد من أن جميع أعضاء الفريق على دراية بهذه القواعد."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":241,"q":"Two team members have been arguing with each other openly at meetings. Each team member individually spoke with the sponsor directly and made decisions without informed the project manager. What two actions should the project manager take? Choose two.","t":"M","o":["Ask the team members to work it out themselves","Discuss this situation with other project managers and ask for advice","Address the behavioral issues with each team member","Discuss the behavior directly with their managers and request them to correct the behavior","Reiterating ground rules at the next meeting and ensure that all team members are clear about these rules."],"c":[2,4],"f":"Two actions should the project manager take\n\n Address the behavioral issues with each team member \n \n Reiterating ground rules at the next meeting and ensure that all team members are clear about these rules.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":346}},{"qa":"لقد تم تعيينك كمدير المشروع بدلاً من مدير مشروع اخر كان يدير مشروعًا لتركيب إنارة شوارع المدينة. المشروع في مرحلة التنفيذ. يواجه مدير المشروع الجديد مشاكل مع بعض المخاطر غير المكتشفة في المشاريع السابقة. ما هي الوثيقة التي يجب أن يشير إليها مدير المشروع الجديد للتأكد من أن جميع المخاطر المحتملة متضمنة في تحديد المخاطر؟","oa":["مصفوفة الاحتمالات والتأثير","سجل المعنيين","سجل المخاطر","ميثاق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":242,"q":"You have just replaced a project manager who was managing a city street light installation project. The project is in its execution phase. The new project manager has issues with some undiscovered risks on previous projects. What document should the new project manager reference to ensure that all possible risks are involved in risk identification?","t":"S","o":["Probability and Impact Matrix","Stakeholder register","Risk register","Project charter"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword (Involved in risk identification) because the output of risk identifications is Risk Register\nRisk Register provides the details of all identified risks and their characteristics , that affect the project.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":347}},{"qa":"أنت تعلم أن نجاح مشروعك سيتحدد بمدى إدارتك للمخاطر. أنت تعلم أن تحديد المخاطر مبكراً يمكن أن يساعدك على الاستعداد بشكل أفضل مع استراتيجيات الاستجابة للمخاطر. أنت تناقش وتتشاور مع مديري المشاريع الآخرين في الشركة. يقترح أحد المديرين استخدام سوات لتحديد المخاطر. ماذا ستفعل بعد ذلك كجزء من هذه التقنية؟","oa":["اجمع ردودًا مجهولة المصدر من الخبراء وحدد المخاطر","اجمع أعضاء الفريق والخبراء معًا وناقشهم لتحديد المخاطر","قم بإجراء تحليل السبب الجذري لتحديد المشكلات وأسبابها والاستجابة المحتملة","تحديد نقاط القوة والضعف في المنظمة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":243,"q":"You know that the success of your project will be determined by how well you manage risks. You know that identifying risks upfront can help you be better prepared with risk response strategies. You discuss and consult with other project managers in the company. One manager suggests the usage of SWOT to identify risks. What would you do next as a part of this technique?","t":"S","o":["Gather anonymous responses from experts and identify risks","Gather team members and experts together and discuss to identify risks","Perform root cause analysis to identify problems , their cause , and potential response","Identify the organization's strengths and weaknesses"],"c":[3],"f":"SWOT technique refers to\nS= Strengths\nW= Weaknesses\nO=Opportunities\nT= Threats\nSo SWOT technique to identify Strengths and Weaknesses of the organization.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":348}},{"qa":"نصح مدير البرنامج الخاص بك أنك بحاجة إلى حماية المنظمة من المخاطر المالية. عند التخطيط لمشروع جديد ، تدرك أن هناك تعريف نطاق محدود يتعلق بالعمل المطلوب للوفاء بالعقد. ما هو أفضل نوع من العقود للاختيار؟","oa":["عقد تكلفة مضافاً إليه مبلغ تحفيزي","عقد تكلفة مضافاً إليه مبلغ ثابت","عقد السعر الثابث مع قيمة تحفيزية","عقد الزمن والمواد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":244,"q":"Your program manager has advised that you need to protect the organization from financial risk. In planning a new project , you realize there is a limited scope definition related to the work required to fulfill the contract. What is the best type of contract to choose?","t":"S","o":["Cost Plus Incentive Fee (CPIF)","Cost Plus Fixed Fee (CPFF)","Fixed Price Incentive Fee (FPIF)","Time and Material (T&M)"],"c":[0],"f":"Keyword ( a limited scope) . When you habe a project with limited scope, the most suitable type of contract is Cost-reimbursable contracts. This type should be used if the scope of work is expected to change significantly during the execution of the contract. We have two types of cost reimbursable contracts in the options given ( Cost plus incentive fee and cost plus a fixed fee). Both the risk lies on the buyer but cost plus incentive fee the risk is lower than the cost plus fixed fee where the buyer has to pay a fixed fee along with the cost incurred , but the cost plus incentive fee the buyer pays the fee based on achieving certain performance objectives mentioned in the contract.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":349}},{"qa":"يشعر مدير المشروع بالحاجة إلى تحديث أحد عقود موردي المشروع لتلبية الاحتياجات الحالية للمشروع. ومع ذلك ، قبل طلب أي تغيير ، يجب أن يعرف مدير المشروع العملية الصحيحة لإدراج تغيير في هذا العقد المحدد. ماذا يجب ان يفعل اولا؟","oa":["تحديث خطة إدارة مشتريات المشروع","مراجعة الإجراءات البديلة لتسوية المنازعات الموجودة في العقد","مراجعة إجراءات التحكم في التغيير كما هو موثق في العقد","إصدار طلب التغيير واعتماده من خلال عملية إجراء التحكم المتكامل في التغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":245,"q":"A project manager feels the need of updating one of the project supplier contracts to meet the current needs of the project. However , before any change can be requested , the project manager must know the right process to incorporate a change to this specific contract. What should he do first?","t":"S","o":["Update the project procurement management plan","Review alternative dispute resolution (ADR) procedures in the contract","Review the change control procedure as documented in the contract","Issue the change request and get it approved through integrated change control process"],"c":[2],"f":"The first step should be to gather enough information so that the right decision and course of action can be determined. The second step should be to issue a change request and follow its approval. The project manager must first review the change control procedure specific to the contract and that can be found in the procurement contract itself. [ PMBOK 6th edition, Page 489]","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":350}},{"qa":"أكمل أحد البائعين عمله على النحو المحدد في العقد وأنت الآن بصدد إنهاء عملية الشراء. فريق الجودة الخاص بك غير راضٍ عن العمل نظرًا لأن التفاوتات المسموح بها في المعالجة ليست قريبة كما كان يأملون ، ماذا تفعل مع البائع؟","oa":["اطلب منهم إعادة صياغة الأجزاء إلى التفاوتات المحددة","إنهاء عملية الشراء وبدء عقد جديد لأي إعادة صياغة","أطلب من البائع إصدار طلب تغيير","انهاء العقد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":246,"q":"One of the sellers has completed their work as specified in the contract and you are proceeding to close out the purchase. Your quality team is not satisfied with the work as the machining tolerances are not as close as they had hoped for you need to do which of the following with the seller ?","t":"S","o":["Request that they rework the parts to the specified tolerances","Close out the procurement and start a new contract for any rework","Request from seller to issue a change request","Terminate the contract"],"c":[1],"f":"The question states that the work is done to specifications. If you need to have some parts reworked a new contract needs to be written up. [PMBOK 6th edition, Page 499 ]","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":351}},{"qa":"متى تعقد مؤتمرات مقدمي العطاءات عادة؟","oa":["بعد تقديم العطاء أو الاقتراح ولكن قبل إرساء العقد","قبل تقديم العطاء أو الاقتراح من قبل مقدم العطاء","بعد اجتماعات فنية مع مقدمي العطاءات لمناقشة العقد","بعد منح العقد للإبقاء على البديل مفتوحًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":247,"q":"When do bidder conferences normally take place?","t":"S","o":["After submission of bid or proposal, but before contract award","Prior to the submission of a bid or proposal by the bidder","After technical meetings with bidders to discuss contract","After the contract has been awarded to keep alternative open"],"c":[1],"f":"Bidder conferences is techniques used in the process \" Conduct Procurement\" , and the output of this is \" Selected sellers\" so it has to be before awarding the contract. But it takes place \"prior to the submission\" and not after \"submission of bid\" so that vendors can take inputs from these meetings before final submission. [PMBOK 6th edition, Page 487]","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":352}},{"qa":"أثناء إغلاق المشروع ونقل تسليمات المشروع المكتملة إلى قسم التشغيل ، يكتشف مدير المشروع أن تقرير تدقيق من مرحلة مبكرة من المشروع مفقود. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["إكمال إغلاق المشروع وتحديث أصول العمليات التنظيمية","قم بإزالة تقرير التدقيق من مستندات المشروع المطلوبة وقم بتحديث خطة إدارة المشروع","يطلب من قسم التشغيل قبول المشروع بدون تقرير التدقيق","أبلغ قسم التشغيل بتقرير التدقيق المفقود"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":248,"q":"During project closure and transferring of the completed project deliverables to the operations group, the project manager discovers that an audit report from an early project phase is missing. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Complete project closure and update the Organizational Process Assets (OPA)","Remove the audit report from the required project documents and update the project management plan","Ask the operations group to accept the project without the audit report.","Inform the operation group about the missing audit report"],"c":[3],"f":"Ethically, the project manager must inform the operation group about the missing audit report.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":353}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في مشروع برمجيات. أكمل فريق التطوير المشروع ويخطط لبدء مرحلة الإغلاق. ومع ذلك ، يرفض أحد أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين التوقيع بسبب عدم الامتثال للنتائج المتفق عليها. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لتسهيل القبول؟","oa":["تقديم بيان عمل جديدًا يشمل التباين في التسليمات","قم بتوثيق عدم الامتثال وابدأ عملية إدارة التغيير","قم بإجراء تحليل التباين لتحديد أي انحراف في التسليمات","تسجيل عدم الامتثال وابدأ في إغلاق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":249,"q":"You are a project manager in a software project. A development team completed the project and plans to initiate the closure phase. However , one key stakeholder refuses to sign-off due to non-compliance with the agreed-upon deliverables . What should the project manager do to facilitate acceptance?","t":"S","o":["Provide a new statement of work (SOW) for the variation in the deliverables","Document the noncompliance and start the change management process","Conduct a variance analysis to identify any deviation in the deliverables","Record the noncompliance and initiate project closure"],"c":[2],"f":"First , the project manager should conduct a variance analysis to identify any deviation in the deliverables by comparing what was initially planned and the end result. [PMBOK 6th edition Page, 126 ]","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":354}},{"qa":"ما هي أهداف أغلاق العقد؟ (اختر ثلاثة)","oa":["لتقديم تقييم أداء موظفي البائع","لتحديث سجلات ومستندات العقد","للتحقق من إنجاز العمل وتسليمه للمواصفات","لإنهاء المشروع","لترتيب التسوية النهائية لمدفوعات البائع والمطالبات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":250,"q":"What are the goals of contract closeout? (Choose three)","t":"M","o":["To provide a performance evaluation of seller staff","To update contract records and documents","To verify work was done and delivered to specification","To close the project","To arrange for final settlement of seller payments and claims"],"c":[1,2,4],"f":"The goals of contract closeout\n\n \n To arrange for final settlement of seller payments and claims\n \n \n To verify work was done and delivered to specification\n \n \n To update contract records and documents","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":355}},{"qa":"نظرًا لأن فريق المشروع يكتسب فهمًا أفضل للقيمة التي قد يقدمها منتجهم ، فإنهم متحمسون لجعل المنتج حقيقة واقعة. نظرًا لحجم الميزات والعمل المطلوب ، يقرر فريق المشروع التسليم بشكل تدريجي. ما هي بعض الفوائد لهذه الاستراتيجية؟ (اختر ثلاثة)","oa":["يسمح للفريق بتجاهل التحدي أو تجاهله","تمكن المستخدمين النهائيين من تقديم التغذية الراجعة (ملاحظات)","اجعل القيادة العليا تروج لعملهم","يخلق شعوراً بالإلحاح لتقديم جزء من الحل","يسمح بتحقيق التقدم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":251,"q":"As the project team gains better understanding of the value their product might deliver , they are excited to make the product a reality. Due to the volume of features and the work required, the project team decides to delivery incrementally . What are some benefits to this strategy? (Choose three)","t":"M","o":["Allows the team to discard or ignore the challenging","Enables the end users to provide feedback","Make senior leadership promote their work","Creates a sense of urgency to deliver part of a solution","Allows progress to be realized"],"c":[1,3,4],"f":"Some benefits of using the incremental approach are enables the end -users to provide feedback and allow progress to be realized and creates a sense of urgency to deliver part of solution. An approach that provides finished deliverables that the customer may be able to use immediately. Some projects optimize for speed of delivery. Many businesses and initiatives cannot afford to wait for everything to be completed ; in these cases, customers are willing to receive a subset of the overall solution. This frequent delivery of smaller deliverables is called an incremantal life cycle.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":356}},{"qa":"فريق سكروم في منتصف التكرار يطلب راعي المشروع من  سكروم ماستر أن يتم تطوير متطلبات إلزامية جديدة وعاجلة ومعقدة مرتبطة بالامتثال على الفور في التكرار الحالي. ويؤكد الراعي أنه في حالة عدم تنفيذ المتطلب فقد يتم إلغاء المشروع بالكامل. ما هو أفضل رد لـ سكرم ماستر؟","oa":["قم بإرسال طلب تغيير لتحديث خط الأساس للنطاق وإضافة المتطلب إلى مصفوفة تتبع المتطلبات.","أضف المتطلب إلى سجل المنتج  الحالي وقم بتوجيه\nالفريق لبدء العمل عليه على الفور","أضف المتطلبات إلى سجل أعمال المنتج واطلب من مالك المنتج مراجعة المتطلبات بعد انتهاء التكرار","ناقش المتطلبات مع مالك المنتج ، ودعه يتخذ قرارًا ، بما في ذلك إلغاء التكرار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":252,"q":"A scrum team is midway into a sprint when the project sponsor approaches the scrum master and requests that a new , urgent , and potentially complex mandatory compliance -related requirement should be developed immediately in the current sprint . The sponsor stresses that if the requirement is not implemented , the entire project may be canceled . What is the scrum master's best response?","t":"S","o":["Submit a change request to update the scope baseline and add the requirement to the requirement traceability matrix.","Add the requirement to the current sprint backlog and direct the team to start working on it immediately.","Add the requirement to the product backlog and request the product owner to review the requirement after the sprint is over.","Discuss the requirements with the product owner , and let them make a decision , including sprint cancellation"],"c":[3],"f":"The product owner is the appropriate authority to review new requirements and decide, together with the team, whether the requirements should be included in the prodcut backlog and in what sprint. The product owner may decide to cnacel the current sprint and start a new sprint that includes this new high priority requirement. In this case the teaة likely needs time to asses the impact of the new mandatory compliance- related requirement. The scrum master should discuss the new requirement with the product owner who , together with the team , may decide to cancel the sprint.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":357}},{"qa":"مشكلة لم يتم تسجيلها على أنها خطر. قد يكون لهذه المشكلة تأثير كبير على المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تجنب إدارة المشكلة حيث لم يتم تسجيلها كخطر على المشروع","تأخير المشروع حتي يتم معالحة المشكلة","اعقد اجتماعًا مع فريق المشروع وأصحاب المصلحة المعنيين للاتفاق على أفضل طريقة لإدارة المشكلة.","أبلغ الراعي أن المشكلة قد تمت معالجتها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":253,"q":"An issue that had not been registered as a risk a ppeared . This issue may have a big impact on the project. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Avoid managing the issue as it was not registered as a risk for the project","Delay the project until the issue is addressed","Hold a meeting with the project team and relevant stakeholders to agree on the best way to manage the issues.","Inform the sponsor that the issue is addressed"],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question in Real Exam \nIssues are updated in the issue log, but we notice that this option is not among the available options, so we are thinking now why do we update issue in the issue log, as we will find out the causes of this issue , then put several solutions and choose the best solution, then implement the solution, then make sure that the solution contributed to solving the problem, then close the issue , and issue log is considered one of documents that can be viewed in the future. Always remember that there is a difference between a issue and a risk, as issue is an event or condition that has already occurred and has a negative impact, while risk is an event or condition that has not occurred yet, it is expected to occur and has a positive or negative impact. So in this scenario, it talks about issue and the best answer is that I assume that you have updated issue in issue log and you are expected to meet with the stakeholders and the team to find a solution, so this is the appropriate answer.\nThe international exam is not without questions related to problems and risks\n\nThe best option \" Hold a meeting with the project team and relevant stakeholders to agree on the best way to manage the issues\" .","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":358}},{"qa":"بدأت شركة مشروعًا لتحسين أحد منتجاتها الحالية. تم تطوير جميع منتجاتها داخليًا. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بإنشاء مستند الدروس المستفادة لمرحلة البدء","تأكد من أن خطة إشراك أصحاب المصلحة دقيقة وموثقة بشكل صحيح","تحديد مخاطر تنفيذ الحل الجديد وتقييم الأثر على المشروع","راجع الدروس المستفادة من المشروع السابق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":254,"q":"A company is initiating a project to enhance one of its existing products. All of its products are developed internally. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Create a lessons learned document for the initiation phase","Ensure the stakeholder engagement plan is accurate and properly documented.","Identify the risk of implementing the new solution and evaluate the impact on the project.","Review the lessons learned from the previous project."],"c":[3],"f":"Very Important question In Real Exam \n\nKeyword (Initiating - Enhance one of its existing products) so the project manager should review the lessons learned from the previous project.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":359}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع حاليًا ببناء نظام إدارة المستودعات. نظرًا لتعقيد المشروع والمتطلبات الغامضة ، قرر الفريق اعتماد نهج إدارة رشيق. إذا كان هناك حاجة إلى معدل أعلى لتحسين عملية الإدارة من قبل فريق المشروع ، فأي مما يلي يمكن أن يساعد في تحقيق هذا الهدف؟","oa":["عمل اجتماعات التقييم بأثر رجعي بشكل مستمر للتحسين المستمر","اعتماد أكس بي لمرحلة التطوير","تأجيل التطوير لحين استيفاء كافة المتطلبات","استخدام لوحة كانبان لتمكين الإدارة المرئية"],"rat":null,"fa":"الكلمة الرئيسية (رشيقة - تحسين). يمكن أن تسهل الأحداث بأثر رجعي عملية تحسين العملية من خلال السماح للفريق بالعصف الذهني حول ما تم بشكل جيد وما حدث بشكل خاطئ \n[Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition , Page 32].","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":255,"q":"A project team is currently building a warehouse management system . Due to the complexity of the project and ambiguous requirements, the team decided to adopt an Agile management approach. If a higher rate of management process improvement is required by the project team, which of the following can help achieve this objective?","t":"S","o":["Frequent retrospectives and selecting improvements","Adopting XP for the development phase","Deferring the development until all requirements have been collected","Using a Kanban board to enable visual management"],"c":[0],"f":"Keyword (Agile - Improve ) . Retrospectives can really facilitate process improvement by allowing the team to brainstorm on what went well and what went wrong [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition , Page 32].","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":360}},{"qa":"تقوم أنت وفريقك بتنفيذ أول مشروع رشيق في المنظمة. هذا مشروع خاص للمنظمة حيث يتم تنفيذ نهج الأجايل لأول مرة. لقد اقتربت من نهاية التكرار الأول في المشروع ولم تكتمل جميع قصص المستخدم المعينة. هل يمكن للفريق تمديد فترة التكرار لمدة يومين لإكمال جميع القصص المعينة في خطة التكرار؟","oa":["نعم ، ولكن يتطلب موافقة سكرم ماستر","نعم ، لكن يتطلب موافقة مالك المنتج.","لا ، التكرارات مرتبطة بوقت محدد","نعم ، لكن لا يمكن أن يكون التمديد أكثر من يومين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":256,"q":"You and your team are executing the first Agile project in the organization. This is a special project for the organization as Agile is being piloted for the first time . You are nearing the end of the first iteration on the project and not all of the assigned user stories are complete. Can the team extend the iteration duration by a couple of days in order to complete all assigned stories in the iteration plan?","t":"S","o":["Yes, but requires the approval of the scrum master","Yes, but requires the approval of the product owner.","No, the iterations are time-boxed","Yes, but the extension cannot be more than 2 days"],"c":[2],"f":"Agile is time boxed so the iteration durations cannot be extended. All incomplete stories need to be returned to the product backlog where they will get re-prioritized along with the other stories in the backlog. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 25]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":361}},{"qa":"طلب مالك المنتج بعض التغييرات الرئيسية التي سيكون لها تأثير كبير على المشروع وتتطلب إعادة ترتيب أولويات سجل المنتج والمتبقي من سجل أعمال المنتج . ماذا عليك ان تفعل؟","oa":["أستكمال القصص التي بدأت ولكن لا تحضر المزيد من القصص \"الجاهزة\" إلى \"قائمة الأعمال قيد التنفيذ","قم بإنهاء التكرار الحالي وإعادة ترتيب أولويات المشروع بأكمله","أكمل التكرار الحالي ، وأعد ترتيب أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج وقم بتكييف الخطة الجديدة للتكرار التالي","قم بإلغاء التكرار السريع واستدعِ على الفور لعمل أجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":257,"q":"The product owner has requested some major changes that will have a significant impact on the project and require reprioritizing the remaining backlog items. What should you do?","t":"S","o":["Complete the started stories but do not bring any more \"Ready\" stories into \"WIP\"","Terminate the current sprint and re-prioritize the entire project.","Complete the current iteration, re-prioritize the backlog and adapt the new plan for the next iteration.","Cancel the current sprint and immediately call a retrospective"],"c":[2],"f":"Agile teams typically don't adjust their long term plan during a sprint unless all of the items being. Developed are dropped from the backlog. It is recommended to complete the current sprint and then re-plan and adjust accordingly. [Agile Practice Guide , 1st edition, Page 25]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":362}},{"qa":"يمكن عرض دورات حياة المشروع في سلسلة متصلة تتراوح من الدورات التنبؤية من طرف إلى الدورات الرشيقة على الطرف الآخر ، مع دورات أكثر تكرارية أو تزايدية في المنتصف. هناك طريقة أخرى تتمثل في تصور الاستمرارية باستخدام مخطط ثنائي الأبعاد مع تكرار التسليم على المحور ص ودرجة التغيير على المحور السيني. ما هي دورة حياة المشروع التي ينبغي اقتراحها للربع مع درجة عالية من التغيير وتكرار عالي للتسليم","oa":["دورة الحياة التنبؤية","دورة الحياة التكرارية","دورة الحياة الرشيقة","دورة الحياة التزايدية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":258,"q":"Project life cycles can be shown on a continuum ranging from predictive cycles on one end, to Agile cycles on the other end , with more iterative or incremental cycles in the middle. Another approach is to visualize the continuum with a two-dimensional chart with the frequency of delivery on the Y-axis and the degree of change on the X-axis . What project life cycle should be proposed for the quadrant with a high degree of change and high frequency of delivery","t":"S","o":["Predictive","Iterative","Agile","Incremental"],"c":[2],"f":"The Agile approach is recommended for projects that require a high degree of change and high frequency of project deliveries [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 19]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":363}},{"qa":"أنت تدير تصميم وتطوير نظام الموارد البشرية. يدعو مشروعك إلى التواصل في شكل إعلانات ورسائل مع جمهور كبير للغاية. ما هي طريقة الاتصال التي ستكون مناسبة في ظل هذه الظروف","oa":["التواصل من خلال أتاحة (سحب) المعلومات","التواصل التفاعلي","التواصل من خلال ارسال (دفع ) المعلومات","التواصل اللفظي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":259,"q":"You are managing the design and development of HR system . Your project calls for communication in the form of announcements and messages with an extremely large audience. What communication method would be appropriate under such circumstances","t":"S","o":["Pull Communication","Interaction Communication","Push Communication","Verbal Communication"],"c":[0],"f":"Keyword (Large audiance) . Pull Communication is the best option for large audiances which it allows them to access information at their own discretion.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":364}},{"qa":"تستخدم فرق أجايل أيًا مما يلي لتحديد أولويات قصص المستخدمين بشكل تعاوني بناءً على قيمتها الخاصة بالنسبة إلى عميل المشروع","oa":["تنقيح سجل أعمال المنتج","لوحة كانبان","تخطيط الموجة المتدرجة","اجتماع الرجعية (التقييم بأثر رجعي )"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":260,"q":"Agile teams use which of the following to collaboratively prioritize user stories based on their respective value to the project's customer","t":"S","o":["Backlog refinement","Kanban Board","Rolling wave planning","Retrospective"],"c":[0],"f":"Refinement Backlog / Backlog grooming involves adding, removing and prioritizing stories in the product backlog. The purpose of refinement is to help the team understand whay the stories are and how large the stories are in relation to each other. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition , Page 52]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":365}},{"qa":"يتلقى مدير المشروع طلب عرض من العميل . المشروع واضح جدا بشأن المتطلبات. يجب إجراء تحليل المتطلبات في الشهر الأول من المشروع ، ويريد العميل رؤية عرض توضيحي للعمل المنجز كل أسبوعين. ما هو نهج المشروع الذي يجب أن يستخدمه مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تنبؤية لتحليل المتطلبات وأجايل لتسليمات للمشروع","تنبؤية لتحليل المتطلبات ومراحل التسليم للمشروع","تكرارية لتحليل المتطلبات ومراحل التسليم للمشروع","رشيقة(أجايل) لجميع مراحل المشروع ، بما في ذلك تحليل المتطلبات والتسليم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":261,"q":"A project manager receives a request for a proposal (RFP) from a client. The client is very clear about the requirements. A requirements analysis must be done in the first month of the project, and the client wants to see a demo of the work completed every two weeks.\nWhat project approach should the project manager use ?","t":"S","o":["Predictive for the requirements analysis and agile for delivery for the project.","Predictive for the requirements analysis and delivery phases of the project","Iterative for the requirements analysis and delivery phases of the project.","Agile for all of the phases of the project , including the requirements analysis and delivery"],"c":[0],"f":"The client is very clear about the requirements so Predicitive is suitable for requirements.\nbut in this scenario client wants to see a demo of the work completed every two weeks so Agile is suitable for delivery.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":366}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع حاليًا بتحليل تقدم التكرار الحالي ومراجعة الرسم البياني التالي. ماذا يسمى هذا المخطط؟","oa":["الرسم البياني التوزيعي","مخطط الأحتراق التصاعدي","خرائط التحكم","مخطط الأحتراق التنازلي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":262,"q":"A project team is currently analyzing its current iteration progress and reviewing the following chart. What is this chart called?","t":"S","o":["Histogram","Burnup Chart","Control Chart","Burndown Chart"],"c":[3],"f":"A burndown chart is a graphical representation of work left to do versus time. The outstanding work is shown on the vertical axis and time along the horizontal. It is useful for predicting when all of the work will be completed.\n\n[PMBOK Guide ,6th edition, Page 226 ]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":367}},{"qa":"تم جمع متطلبات النظام وتحديد نطاق المشروع. إذا كان أحد عوامل نجاح المشروع الرئيسية يتم تحقيقه في حدود الميزانية ، فأي من الأساليب التالية توصي باستخدامه في هذا المشروع؟","oa":["دورة الحياة التكرارية","دورة الحياة التزايدية","دورة الحياة الرشيقة","دورة الحياة التنبؤية او التقليدية"],"rat":null,"fa":"النهج التنبئي: متطلبات المشروع ثابتة والهدف هو إدارة التكلفة","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":263,"q":"System requirements have been collected and the project scope has been defined. If one of the major project's success factors is delivering within the budget, which of the following approaches would you recommend to be used on this project?","t":"S","o":["Iterative","Incremental","Agile","Predictive"],"c":[3],"f":"Predictive approach : Project requirements are fixed and the goal is to manage cost","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":368}},{"qa":"لقد طُلب منك تطوير موقع ويب جديد لأحد عملائك. يجب أن يكون موقع الويب مستقلاً عن المتصفح ويتم تسليمه في غضون شهر. على الرغم من أن تصميم موقع الويب بسيط ، إلا أن شرط استقلالية المتصفح قد أضاف بعض التعقيد إلى المشروع. أي من الأساليب التالية توصي به لهذا المشروع؟","oa":["تنبؤي","الأجايل","تكراري","تزايدي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":264,"q":"You have been asked to develop a new website for one of your clients. The website is required to be browser independent and delivered within a month. Although the website has a simple design, the requirement of browser independence has added some complexity to the project. Which of the following approaches would you recommend for this project?","t":"S","o":["Predictive","Agile","Iterative","Incremental"],"c":[2],"f":"Iterative life cycle : project requires a single final delivery. However, project work might require repetitions until all browsers are supported . An iterative approach is ideal in this situation .","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":369}},{"qa":"أنت تعمل في مشروع كبير ينقسم إلى المراحل التالية: الجدوى ، والمفاهيم ، والتصميم ، والنموذج الأولي ، والبناء. تريد استخدام مجموعات العمليات مع هذه المراحل المختلفة. ما هو النهج الموصى به؟","oa":["قم بتعيين مجموعة معالجة واحدة لكل مرحلة","كرر كل مجموعات العمليات الخمس لكل مرحلة","تخلص من بنية المرحلة وأعد تسمية كل مرحلة بأحد أسماء مجموعة العمليات","تخطي مجموعتين من مجموعات العمليات لأنها لا تنطبق على مشروع كبير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":265,"q":"You are working an a large project that is divided into the following phases: feasibility, conceptual, design,prototype,and build. You want to use the process groups with these different phases. What is recommended approach?","t":"S","o":["Assign one process group to each phase","Repeat all the five process groups for each phase","Eliminate your phase structure and rename each phase with one of the process group names","Skip a couple of the process groups since they don't apply to a large project."],"c":[1],"f":"Process groups shouldnot be confused with project phases. Each phase should contain all of the process groups.\n\n[PMBOK Guide 6th edition, page 19]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":370}},{"qa":"يواجه فريق رشيق صعوبة في تنسيق العمل الجاري. هذا يسبب تعارضات غير ضرورية وتأخيرات في المشروع. أي من الطريقتين التاليتين يمكن أن تساعد في هذا الموقف؟","oa":["النماذج الأولية وتنقيح سجل أعمال المنتج","لوحات القصة واجتماعات التقييم باثر رجعي","لوحات كانبان واجتماع الوقوف اليومي","مخطط جانت ,تنقيح سجل أعمال المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":266,"q":"An agile team is struggling with coordinating work in progress. This is causing unnecessary conflicts and delays on the project. Which of the following two techniques can help this Situation?","t":"S","o":["Prototyping and backlog grooming","Story boards and retrospectives","Kanban boards and daily stand-ups","Gantt chart and backlog grooming"],"c":[2],"f":"Help the team learn that they self-manage their work. Consider kanban boards to see the flow of work. Consider adaily stand-up to walk the board and see what work is where. [Agile Practice Guide , 1st edition, Page 58]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":371}},{"qa":"تنفيذ المشروع ، قدم العميل متطلبات محدثة ، والتي من الواضح أنها ستتطلب فقط تعديل طفيف على هيكل تجزئة العمل . ما الذى ينبغى عليك فعله اولا؟","oa":["اضبط هيكل تجزئة العمل حسب الضرورة لأن التغيير طفيف","قم بإرسال طلب تغيير لتحديث الخط المرجعي للنطاق","إرسال طلب تغيير لتحديث خط الأساس للجدول الزمني","رفض الطلب لأنه يمثل زحف النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":267,"q":"The project execution, the client provided updated requirements , which apparently will only require a minor adjustment to the work breakdown structure (WBS) . What should you do first?","t":"S","o":["Adjust the WBS as necessary as the change is minor","Submit a change request to update the scope baseline","Submit a change request to update the schedule baseline","Deny the request as it represents scope creep"],"c":[1],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam \nThe WBS is a component of the scope baseline.\nAn approved change request is required to update any of the project baselines including their components","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":372}},{"qa":"إذا كان سيتم إنتاج المخرجات باستخدام إطار عمل رشيق. ما هي الاستراتيجيات التي قد تكون مناسبة لكسب القبول الرسمي لنطاق المنتج؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["تأكد من أن نطاق المنتج يتجزء بالكامل إلى مستوى حزمة العمل أثناء التخطيط الأولي للمشروع","قم بإجراء عرض توضيحي كلما تم تطوير ميزات كافية من مجموعة متماسكة","اطلب من الفريق توضيح قصص المستخدم المكتملة لمالك المنتج في نهاية كل تكرار","اطلب من مالك المنتج حضور كل اجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي لمراجعة أجزاء المنتج المكتملة والموافقة عليها","قم بإجراء عملية التحقق من النطاق بمجرد اكتمال نطاق المشروع بالكامل وفقًا لخطة إدارة النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":268,"q":"If the deliverables will be produced using an agile framework . What strategies might be appropriate to gain formal acceptance of the product scope? (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Ensure that the product scope is fully decomposed down to the work package level during initial project planning","Conduct a demonstration whenever enough features have been developed to from a coherent set","Have the team demonstrate the completed user stories to the product owner at the end of each iteration","Ask the product owner to attend each sprint retrospective to review and approve the completed product increment","Perform the validate scope process once the entire project scope is complete in accordance with the scope management plan"],"c":[1,2],"f":"In flow-based agile , the development team will demonstrate the completed work once enough features have been developed to from a coherent set. Teams that use flow-based agile typically employ a kanban board to manage their workflow. In iteration -based agile , the project team should conduct an iteration review . During the iteration review , the project team demonstrates the completed work, and the product owner then accepts or declines the user stories.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":373}},{"qa":"مشروع كبير يؤثر على الحي الذي يقع فيه. الجيران غير راضين عن المشروع وقد تؤثر مقاومتهم للمشروع على الموعد النهائي للمشروع. ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذهما ؟ (اختر اثنين)","oa":["أرسل رسائل إلى الجيران واطلب منهم التفضل بعدم تعكير صفو المشروع","حلل الموقف واكتشف سبب الموقف السلبي للحي","قم بإعداد اجتماع مع ممثلي الأحياء لكسب التعاون","اطلب من العميل تمديد الموعد النهائي للمشروع لإتاحة الوقت لحل النزاع","اطلب من رئيس بلدية المدينة استخدام سلطته لوقف مقاومة الحي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":269,"q":"A large project is affecting the neighborhood in which it is located. The neighbors are not satisfied with the project and their resistance to the project may affect the project deadline. What two actions should the project manager take ?(Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Send letters to the neighbors and ask them kindly not to disturb the project","Analyze the situation and find out what is causing the neighborhood's negative attitude","Set up a meeting with neighborhood representatives to win cooperation","Ask the customer to extend the project deadline to allow time for conflict resolution","Ask the mayor of the city to use their authority to stop neighborhood resistance"],"c":[1,2],"f":"Here depends the importance of the project manager's role in dealing with situations. In this scenario, the project manager must do the following\n\n Analyze the situation and find out what is causing the neighborhood's negative attitude \n Set up a meeting with neighborhood representatives to win cooperation","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":374}},{"qa":"كيف سيشكل اختيار دورة حياة المشروع التنبؤية الطريقة التي يتم بها تنفيذ المشروع؟ (اختر ثلاثة)","oa":["سيتم تسليم قيمة العمل إلى العميل بشكل متكرر وليس فقط في نهاية المشروع","سيتم تحديد المتطلبات مقدماً قبل بدء تنفيذ المشروع","سيتم تحديد التكلفة والوقت ، وسيسمح لنطاق المشروع بالتنوع","سيتم تسليم منتج نهائي واحد في نهاية المشروع","سيتم تقييد التغييرات إلى أقصي مدي ممكن"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":270,"q":"How will the selection of a predicitive project life cycle shape the way the project is carried out? ( Choose three)","t":"M","o":["Business value will be delivered to the customer frequently rather than just at the end of the project","The requirements will be determined upfront before the project execution begins","Cost and time will be fixed , and the project scope will be allowed to vary","A single final product will be delivered at the end of the project","Changes will be constrained to the extend possible"],"c":[1,3,4],"f":"Traditional / Waterfall / Plan driven / Predictive Project : the project requirements and scope are typically determined during initial project planning . Once the project management Plan is approved , changes are constrained through a robust change management process. The product or result of the project is then typically delivered in its final form at the end of the project.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":375}},{"qa":"خلال أجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي ، يتحدث فريق أجايل عن عدم تلبية توقعات مالك المنتج. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع في بداية المشروع؟","oa":["تحديد القواعد الأساسية للفريق ورؤية المشروع المشتركة","تقييم قدرات فريق أجايل والتخطيط للتدريب المطلوب","إبلاغ رؤية المشروع وأهداف التكرار بوضوح للفريق","تحديد مساهمة فريق أجايل المتوقعة في إنشاء سجل أعمال المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":271,"q":"During the retrospective ceremony, the agile team is talking about the product owner's expectations not being met. What should the project manager have done at the beginning of the project?","t":"S","o":["Defined the team ground rules and shared project vision","Assessed the capabilities of the agile team and planned for the required training","Communicated project vision and sprint goals clearly to the team","Defined the expected agile team contribution in the creation of the backlog"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword (the product owner's expectations not being met) this mean that visions and goals wasn't clear so rereospective ceremony is for addressing problems and mistake in the last sprint or iteration and this meeting is after iteration review , before the next iteration planning so The project manager should communicated project vision and sprint goals clearly to the team at the begging of the project .","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":376}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع كــ سكرم ماستر في مشروع هجين ويتعامل مع صراعات بين أعضاء الفريق. ما هي الاستراتيجية التي ينبغي استخدامها للتعامل مع هذا الصراع","oa":["تصنيف الصراعات إلى مجموعتين: إيجابية وسلبية","ضع النزاعات في فئات: هيكلية وشخصية","ضع التعارضات في قائمة التعارضات المشتركة وتأكد من أنها مرئية","مراجعة النزاعات خلال سكروم اليومي حتى يتم التعامل معها في الوقت المناسب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":272,"q":"A project manager is acting as a scrum master in a hybrid project and is dealing with a conflict between team members. What strategy should be used to handle this conflict","t":"S","o":["Sort conflicts into two groups : Positive and negative","Place conflicts into categories: structural and interpersonal","Place conflicts on a shared conflict list and ensure it is visible","Review conflicts during daily scrum so they are handled in a timely manner"],"c":[0],"f":"Conflict may have both positive and negative effects on a team. It can help the team operate better by exploring issues more fully, but it can lead to emotional problems that damage communication.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":377}},{"qa":"في مشروع متعدد الجنسيات ، يكون أصحاب المصلحة في مناطق زمنية مختلفة. يعقد مدير المشروع اجتماعات منتظمة لتحديث المشروع مع أصحاب المصلحة. ومع ذلك ، فإن مجموعة من أصحاب المصلحة الذين لم يحضروا اجتماعات تحديث المشروع أبدًا يشكون إلى راعي المشروع من أنهم يعرفون القليل جدًا عن المشروع ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتغيير وقت الاجتماع في المناطق الزمنية للعمل لأصحاب المصلحة الذين يشكون","تأكد من حضور أصحاب المصلحة الذين يشتكون في اجتماعات تحديث المشروع التالية","ناقش المشكلة مع جميع أصحاب المصلحة واعمل على خطة إدارة الاتصالات لتلبية جميع متطلبات أصحاب المصلحة","سجل الاجتماع الدوري لتحديث المشروع وشاركه مع جميع أصحاب المصلحة بعد اكتمال الاجتماع"],"rat":null,"fa":"مجموعة من أصحاب المصلحة الذين لم يحضروا اجتماعات تحديث المشروع مطلقًا وهم يعرفون القليل جدًا عن المشروع ، لذلك يجب على مدير المشروع مناقشة المشكلة مع جميع أصحاب المصلحة والعمل على خطة إدارة الاتصالات لتلبية جميع متطلبات أصحاب المصلحة","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":273,"q":"In a multinational project, stakeholders are in different time zones. The project manager has regular project update meetings with the stakeholders. However , a group of stakeholders who have never attended project update meetings is complaining to the project sponsor that they know very little about the project.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Change the meeting time ti the working time zones of the stakeholders who are complaining","Ensure that the stakeholders who are complaining are present for the next project update meetings","Discuss the issue with all stakeholders and work on a communications management plan to meet all stakeholder requirements.","Record the regular project update meeting and share it with all stakeholders after the meeting is completed."],"c":[2],"f":"A group of stakeholders who have never attended project update meetings and they know very little about the project so the project manager should Discuss the issue with all stakeholders and work on a communications management plan to meet all stakeholder requirements.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":378}},{"qa":"يحيى هو مدير مشروع يبدأ مشروعًا باستخدام نهج هجين. طلب يحيى من أحد كبار أعضاء الفريق إجراء تحليل كمي للمخاطر ، يرد عضو الفريق بأنه لا يمتلك المعرفة اللازمة لأداء مثل التحليل. ماذا يفعل يحيى؟","oa":["ساعد عضو الفريق على إجراء التحليل الكمي للمخاطر من خلال التدريب والتوجيه والتدريب","اتصل بمكتب إدارة المشروع  واطلب منهم تعيين عضو آخر في الفريق لديه المعرفة لأداء هذه المهمة للفريق","قم بإجراء التحليل الكمي للمخاطر لعضو الفريق","تصعيد المشكلة إلى المدير الوظيفي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":274,"q":"Yahya is a project manager who is starting a project using a hybrid approach. Yahya has requested a senior team member to perform a quantitative risk analysis the team member responds that they do not have the knowledge to perform such as analysis. What should Yahya do ?","t":"S","o":["Help the team member to perform the quantitative risk analysis through coaching , mentoring and training","Contact the project management office (PMO) and request them to assign another team member who has the knowledge to perform this task to the team","Perform the quantitative risk analysis for the team member","Escalate the issue to the functional manager"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager should develop the team . the team memeber mentioned that they donot have the knowledge so the project manager should help the team member to perform the quantitative risk analysis theough coaching , mentoring and training.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":379}},{"qa":"أنت مسؤول عن تصميم نظام إدارة جديد للدروس المستفادة لمؤسسة ما. كجزء من المشروع ، تحتاج إلى التشاور مع عدد من كبار أصحاب المصلحة وتقييم احتياجاتهم ومتطلباتهم. عليك بعد ذلك تسهيل الإجماع على ميزات النظام ومهام سير العمل والعمليات والإجراءات. بمجرد تطوير النظام ، يجب نشره في جميع أنحاء المنظمة ويجب تدريب جميع الموظفين على الاستخدام الفعال للنظام. لقد اخترت استخدام دورة حياة مشروع مختلط. أي من دورات الحياة التالية ينبغي اعتمادها لمرحلة تدريب المستخدم في المشروع؟","oa":["دورة الحياة الرشيقة","دورة الحياة التزايدية","دورة الحياة التكرارية","دورة الحياة التنبؤية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":275,"q":"You are responsible for designing a new lessons learned management system for an organization. As a part of the project, you need to consult with a number of senior stakeholders and assess their needs and requirements. You then have to facilitate consensus on the system features, workflows, processes and procedures. Once the system is developed, it has to be rolled out across the organization and all employees have to be trained in effective use of the system. You have chosen to use a hybrid project life cycle. Which of the following life cycles should be adopted for the user training phase of the project?","t":"S","o":["Agile","Incremental","Iterative","Predictive"],"c":[3],"f":"Once the system is successfully designed and built, user training may be an extensive task but this can well be planned in advance. Predictive life cycle should be the most structured approach for this phase of the project. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 26]","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":380}},{"qa":"أحد المعنيين الذي تم تصنيفه بشكل خاطئ كمؤيد أصبح الآن مترددًا وأصبح مدير المشروع قلقًا. ما الذي يجب أن يتوخى مدير المشروع الحذر في المشاريع المستقبلية؟","oa":["إنشاء مصفوفة تقييم مشاركة المعنيين","تطوير المهارات الشخصية لإدارة توقعات المعنيين","عقد اجتماع مع الإدارة العليا","تحديد المعنيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":276,"q":"A stakeholder who was incorrectly classified as a supporter is now reluctant and the project manager becomes worried. What should the project manager do more carefully in future projects ?","t":"S","o":["Create the stakeholders engagement assessment matrix","Develop interpersonal skills to manage stakeholder expectations","Conduct a meeting with senior management","Identify stakeholder"],"c":[0],"f":"A stakeholder engagement assessment matrix supports the comparison between the current engagement levels required for successful project delivery . The stakeholder engagement assessment matrix , shown in figure displays gaps between current and desired engagement levels of individual stakeholders. PMBOK 6th edition PG,521","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":381}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي هو إطار عمل الإدارة الذي يظهر عندما تستخدم الفرق سكرم كطريقة مختارة للعمل وتستخدم طريقة كانبان كعدسة يمكن من خلالها عرض طريقة عملها وفهمها وتحسينها باستمرار؟","oa":["سكرومبان","لوحة المهام","العمل قيد التقدم","سكرم كانبان"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":277,"q":"Which of the following is the management framework that emerges when teams employ Scrum as the chosen way of working and use the Kanban Method as a lens through which to view, understand, and continuously improve how they work?","t":"S","o":["Scrumban","Task Board","WIP","Scrum of Kanban"],"c":[0],"f":"Scrumban is an Agile approach originally designed as a way to transition from Scrum to Kanban. As additional Agile frameworks and methodologies emerged, it became an evolving hybrid framework in and of itself where teams use Scrum as a framework and Kanban for process improvement.\n\n[Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 108]","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":382}},{"qa":"كان فريق ذاتي التنظيم يقدم ما هو مطلوب منه . وافق الفريق على مهمة تطوير باستخدام تقنية جديدة وبدأ حدوث انخفاض في سرعة التكرارات . ما هو قرار الإدارة المناسب لهذا الموقف؟","oa":["إضافة أعضاء جدد إلى الفريق وزيادة السرعة","نقل أعضاء الفريق الذين لا يؤدون بشكل جيد من الفريق","توفير الفرصة لأعضاء الفريق للتعلم والتكيف مع التكنولوجيا","أعد تعيين المشروع إلى فريق عمل بهذه التقنية سابقاً"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":278,"q":"A self-organizing team was delivering as commited . The team accepted a development task with new technology and the iterations started to have reduced velocity. What management decision is suited for this situation ?","t":"S","o":["Add new members to the team and increase the velocity","Move team members who are not performing from the team.","Provide opportunity for team members to learn and adjust to the technology","Re-assign the project to a team that has worked with this technology"],"c":[2],"f":"A self-organizing team in Agile environment . The management should provide safe environment for team to enable them to learn and adjust so the best option Provide opportunity for team members to learn and adjust to the technology","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":383}},{"qa":"يتم تعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع في شركة تنتقل إلى أجايل . لا يؤمن جميع المعنيين (اصحاب المصلحة ) بالمشروع ، ويود بعض المعنيين أن يتم التخطيط للإعلان المحدد للمشروع بأكمله في وقت مبكر من المشروع. ومع ذلك ، يحتاج راعي المشروع إلى ربح سريع لضمان استمرار المشروع. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يستخدمه مدير المشروع؟","oa":["مشروع هجين حيث سيؤدي ذلك إلى التخفيف من مخاوف أصحاب المصلحة","نهج تنبؤي لأن هذا من شأنه إرضاء كبار أصحاب المصلحة","نهج رشيق لأن هذا من شأنه أن يوفر وظائف العمل في وقت سابق","نهج تنبؤي حيث سيظهر فوائد لجميع أصحاب المصلحة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":279,"q":"A project manager is assigned to a project in a company that is transitioning to agile . Not all stakeholders believe in the project , and some stakeholders would like the entire project defined and planned out early in the project. However , the project sponsor needs a quick win to ensure the continuation of the project. What approach should the project manager use?","t":"S","o":["A hybrid project as this will mitigate stakeholders' concerns","A predictive approach as this would please the senior stakeholders","An Agile approach as this would provide working functionality earlier","A predictive approach as this will show benefits for all stakeholders"],"c":[0],"f":"Very Important Question in Real Exam \nThe hybrid method is used when\n\n There is a disagreement between the stakeholders on the methodology used.\n When a company moves from a traditional to agile , it must first work in a hybrid environment for a while to empower the team and create a new mindset.\n \n In this scenario some stakeholders would like the entire project defined and planned out early in the project (this Predicitve Approach) and the project sponsor needs a quick win to ensure the continuation of the project (This Agile Approach) , so the project manager should use A hybrid (mix of prdicitive , Agile Approach) project as this will mitigate stakeholders' concerns","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":384}},{"qa":"مشروع قيد التنفيذ. تعرف دورة حياة المشروع بأنها تنبؤية ؛ ومع ذلك ، سيتم تسليم منتج رئيسي بشكل تدريجي إلى العميل. الموارد المخصصة من ذوي الخبرة والموثوقية وعلى استعداد لاتخاذ القرارات التي يستخدمها مدير المشروع بعد كل تسليم تدريجي في مشاريع أخرى. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["حدد موعدًا لاجتماع اللجنة التوجيهية واحصل على موافقتها على الطلب","استشر مالك المنتج بشأن السماح للموارد باتخاذ القرارات","أبلغ الفريق أنه على الرغم من أن هذه بيئة هجينة ، يجب أن يظل مدير المشروع مسؤولاً عن اتخاذ القرارات","دعم قرارات الفريق ونقل مسؤولية اتخاذ القرار إليهم."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":280,"q":"A project is being executed . The project's life cycle is defined as predictive ; however a major deliverable will be handed over incrementally to the customer. The assigned resources are experienced and reliable and are willing to make decisions that the project manager used to make after each incremental delivery on other projects. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Schedule a steering committee meeting and obtain their approval on the request","Consult the product owner about letting the resources make decisions","Inform the team that although this is a hybrid environment , the project manager must still be responsible for making decisions","Support the decisions of the team and transfer the decision-making responsibility to them."],"c":[3],"f":"A major deliverable will be handed over incrementally to the customer this means that this is Agile approach and this approach is the team self-organizing team so the project manager should Support the decisions of the team and transfer the decision-making responsibility to them.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":385}},{"qa":"تم نشر مشروع هجين للتو ، ويخطط مدير المشروع لإغلاق المشروع من خلال ورش عمل للدروس المستفادة. يقوم أحد أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين بإبلاغ مدير المشروع أن وجود فريق سكرم في ورش العمل يعد مضيعة للوقت لأن المشروع تم تسليمه بنجاح. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["ادعُ أعضاء فريق سكروم كمشاركين إلزاميًا","اطلب من سكرم ماستر حضور ورش العمل","ادعُ أعضاء فريق سكروم كمشاركين اختياريين","اطلب من أعضاء فريق سكروم أن يشاركوا باجتماعات التقييم بأثر رجعي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":281,"q":"A hybrid project has just deployed , and the project manager is planning project closure with lessons learned workshops. A key stakeholder informs the project manager that having the scrum team in the workshops is a waste of time because the project was delivered successfully. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Invite the scrum team members as mandatory participants","Ask the scrum master to attend the workshops","Invite the scrum team members as optional participants","Ask the scrum team members to share retrospectives"],"c":[3],"f":"keyword (lessons learned) and retrospectives are meeting to discuss the performance to Identify how to improve teamwork by reflecting on what worked, what didn’t, and why (root causes). We recommend running a Retrospective with team every couple of weeks or at the end of a project milestone as lessons learned","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"Bank","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":386}},{"qa":"يهتم العميل بالوقت اللازم لإكمال المشروع ويطلب من فريق المشروع تقليل عدد التكرارات المطلوبة لإكمال المنتج. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يتبعه مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من الفريق تحدي تقديرات المشروع لتسريع التسليم","تحديد أولويات التسليمات بناءً على قيمة العمل وتحديد الإصدارات المتكررة","تحديد أولويات المهام ذات المخاطر العالية لتقليل عدد التكرارات المطلوبة","اطلب من الفريق رفع الحواجز أو العوائق في الاجتماعات اليومية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":282,"q":"A customer is concerned about the time required to complete a project is asking the project team to reduce the number of iterations required to complete the product. Which approach should the project manager take ?","t":"S","o":["Ask the team to challenge the project estimations for faster delivery","Prioritize deliverables based on business value and define frequent releases","Prioritize the tasks with high risks to reduce the number of iterations required","Ask the team to raise blockers or impediments in daily meetings"],"c":[1],"f":"Prioritize deliverables based on business value and define frequent releases","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":387}},{"qa":"تطلق شركة منتجًا جديدًا يجب أن يكون جاهزًا قبل بدء موسم الصيف. بعد عملية الاكتشاف ، يدرك الفريق أن المتطلبات غير مؤكدة للغاية. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب تضمين بعض خبراء موضوع الأعمال في الفريق","قم بدعوة أصحاب المصلحة لمناقشة تحديد أولويات متطلبات المشروع","سجل خطرًا وحدد خطة طوارئ لإنهاء المشروع في الوقت المحدد","ساعد الفريق في اقتراح الحد الأدنى من المنتجات القابلة للتطبيق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":283,"q":"A company is launching a new product that has to be ready before the summer season begins. After the discovery process, the team realizes that the requirements are very uncertain . What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Ask to include some business subject matter experts in the team","Invite stakeholders to discuss project requirements prioritization","Register a risk and define a contingency plan to finish the project on time","Assist the team in proposing a minimum viable product"],"c":[3],"f":"Very Important Question in Real Exam \nA company is launching a new product that has to be ready before the summer season begins so the company want to deliver product in short time so the project manager should \"Assist the team in proposing a minimum viable product\"","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":388}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بأداء دور سكرم ماستر الرئيسي لفريق مشروع من المطورين . في الأجتماع اليومي ، يشتكي اثنان من المطورين من الضوضاء الصادرة عن فريق مجاور ، وأداء أجهزة الكمبيوتر المحمولة الخاصة بهم ، وصعوبة حجز غرف الاجتماعات. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تعيين الإجراءات لجميع المعنيين والإشراف على تنفيذها","ملاحظة المعوقات واعمل على معالجتها لاحقًا","ملاحظة العوائق وقم بتصعيدها إلى مالك المنتج","الأقرار بالعوائق وتسهيل حلها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":284,"q":"A project manager is performing the scrum master role for a project team of delevopers. At the daily standup, a couple of developers complain about the noise from a neighboring team , the performance of their laptops, and the difficulty in booking meeting rooms. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Assign actions to all stakeholders and oversee their implementation","Note the impediments and work on addressing them later","Note the impediments and escalate them to the product owner","Acknowledge the impediments and facilitate their solutions"],"c":[3],"f":"Scrum master should work as facilitator by Acknowledge the impediments and facilitate their solutions","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":389}},{"qa":"في مشروع محدد للمدة والميزانية ، يريد العميل تطوير مكون أساسي يعتمد على ممارسات نهج الأجايل (الأساليب الرشيقة) ، حيث لم يتم تطوير النطاق النهائي للمتطلبات بالكامل بعد. يشارك مدير المشروع في تطوير العقد مع فريق المبيعات ويريد التأكد من أن تكاليف التطوير لا تؤثر على ربحية المشروع. أي من الضوابط التي يجب على مدير المشروع دمجها في العقد لمعالجة تطوير المكون الأساسي على وجه التحديد (اختر اثنين)","oa":["صِف العقد أو المكونات الثابتة والمرنة","تقييد عدد التكرارات الخاصة بتطوير في العقد","أطلب استخدام الموارد الداخلية فقط لهذا المشروع","توفير بدائل لتغيير النطاق في مراحل محددة من المشروع ضمن العقد","تشكيل لجنة حوكمة لمراجعة تسليم العقد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":285,"q":"In a fixed time and budget project the customer wants the development of a core component to be based on agile practices, as the final scope of the requirements has not yet been fully developed. The project manager is participating in contract development with the sales team and wants to ensure that development costs do not impact the profutability of the project. (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Tier the contract or fixed and agile components","Limit the number of iterations for development in the contract","Require that only internal resources be utilized for this project","Provide alternatives to scope change at specific project phases within the contract","Establish a governance committee to review the contract delivery"],"c":[1,2],"f":"Keyword (a fixed time and budget project)\n\nso the project manager should\n\n Require that only internal resources be utilized for this project\n \n Limit the number of iterations for development in the contract","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":390}},{"qa":"لقد بدأ للتو مشروع لتحويل منظمة من هيكل تنظيمي وظيفي إلى هيكل متوقّع. إذا نجح المشروع في تحقيق أهدافه ، فما هي النتيجة المرجحة؟ (اختر ثلاثة)","oa":["سيتم تجميع الموظفين حسب العمل الذي يتم إنجازه (الهندسة ، التصنيع ، إلخ)","سيكون لمدير (مدراء) المشروع سلطة أكبر على المشاريع","سيكون لمدير (مدراء) المشروع السيطرة على ميزانية المشروع","ستتحول المنظمة من الوضع الحالي إلى الحالة المستقبلية المطلوبة","سيتم تحديد دور مدير (مدراء) المشروع على أنه منسق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":286,"q":"A project has just been initiated to transform an organization from a functional organizational structure to projectized. If the project is successful in meeting its objectives, what will be the most likely outcome?\n(Choose three)","t":"M","o":["Employees will be grouped by the working being done (engineering, manufacturing,etc)","The project manager(s) will have significantly more authority over projects","The project manager(s) will have control over the project budget","The organization will shift from the current state to the desired future state","The role of the project manager(s) will be defined as a project coordinator"],"c":[1,2,3],"f":"Organizational structure projectized\n\n The project manager(s) will have control over the project budget \n \n The project manager(s) will have significantly more authority over projects \n \n The organization will shift from the current state to the desired future state","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":391}},{"qa":"الوعي السياسي مطلوب أثناء تطبيق المهارات الشخصية أو الجماعية أثناء تخطيط الاتصالات. كيف هذا حقا مفيد؟","oa":["يساعد في تقييم أصحاب المصلحة","يساعد مدير المشروع على فهم السياسة","إنها تمكن مدير المشروع من العمل بفعالية داخل هياكل السلطة","يساعد على فهم شبكة السلطة/ الأهتمام"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":287,"q":"Poltical awareness is required while applying interpersonal or team skills during communications planning. How is this really helpful?","t":"S","o":["It helps in stakeholder assessment","It helps the project manager to understand politics","It enables the project manager to work effectively within the power structures","It helps to understand the power/interest grid"],"c":[2],"f":"Poltical awareness is important during communications planning to understand power relationships and work within those situations.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":392}},{"qa":"بناءً على توقعات الإدارة ، يريدون التأكد من أن تسليم التكرار الأول يساعد فريق التسويق على تقديم نموذج المنتج الأولي للعملاء المحتملين. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ماذا يجب أن تفعل؟","oa":["قم بزيادة تفاصيل هيكل تجزئة العمل  لتقليل الأخطاء والتأخير","قم بتقسيم سجل أعمال المنتج إلى مراحل لضمان تسليم الميزات الرئيسية أولاً","حدد الحد الأدنى من الوظائف المطلوبة للمنتج","اطلب من الراعي إعطاء الأولوية لبعض وظائف المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":288,"q":"Based on the management's expectations, they want to ensure that the deliverable of the first iteration helps the marketing team present the product prototype to potential customers. As a project manager, what should you do?","t":"S","o":["Increase the details of the work breakdown structure (WBS) to minimize errors and delay.","Split the backlog into phases to ensure that the key features are delivered first.","Identify the minimum functionality required for the product","Ask the sponsor to prioritize some functionalities of the product"],"c":[2],"f":"The project manager should focus on delivering a minimum set of valuable features to satisfy early adopters","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":393}},{"qa":"تم التوقيع على ميثاق المشروع لمشروع مهم ولكن لم يتم إعداد بيان نطاق المشروع. تطلب الإدارة من مدير المشروع المضي قدمًا في المشروع بدون بيان نطاق المشروع المعتمد كمدير للمشروع ، ماذا يجب أن تفعل بعد ذلك؟","oa":["تصعيد المشكلة إلى راعي المشروع وإضافتها إلى سجل المخاطر","ابدأ المشروع بمدخلات من ميثاق المشروع لتوفير الوقت","أرفض العمل في المشروع لأن الإدارة لا تتبع ممارسات إدارة المشروع القياسية","اجتمع مع الإدارة لشرح المشاكل المحتملة في إدارة مشروع بدون بيان نطاق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":289,"q":"The project charter has been signed for a critical project but the project scope statement has not been prepared. Management asks the project manager to move forward with the project without an approved project scope statement As a project manager, what should you do next?","t":"S","o":["Escalate the issue to the project sponsor and add it to the risk register","Start the project with inputs from the project charter to save time","Refuses to work on the project because management is not following standard project management practices","Meet with the management to explain the potential problems with running a project without a project scope statement"],"c":[3],"f":"The first action the project manager should Meet with the management to explain the potential problems with running a project without a project scope statement","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":394}},{"qa":"كيف ينبغي لمدير المشروع أن يطور خطة إدارة المشروع للتأكد من أن المشروع يحقق باستمرار الفوائد المتوقعة","oa":["وضح فوائد المشروع مع الراعي","قم بتضمين فريق المشروع بأكمله في الاختبار","حدد الهدف من كل منتج عمل","قم بإجراء اختبار تكامل لكل إصدار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":290,"q":"How should the project manager develop the proejct management plan to ensure that the project continually delivers the expected benefit","t":"S","o":["Clarify project benefits with the sponsor","Include the entire project team in testing","Identify the goal of each work product","Perform integration testing of each release"],"c":[0],"f":"Early engagement between the sponsor and project manager ensures understanding of project purpose and objectives and desired stakeholder benefits .","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":395}},{"qa":"خلال أجتماع مراجعة اخر تكرار ، اشتكى صاحب المصلحة الرئيسي من أن المنتج يفتقد العديد من الميزات التي كانوا يتوقعونها. جادل فريق المشروع بأن كل زيادة تفي بمعايير القبول وتمت الموافقة عليها من قبل صاحب المصلحة الرئيسي. مؤشر أداء التكلفة للمشروع هو 1.15 ومؤشر أداء الجدول هو 1.43. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اشرح لأصحاب المصلحة أنه نظرًا لاستيفاء معايير القبول لكل تكرار ، يمكن إغلاق المشروع","اطلب من فريق المشروع إجراء التعديلات حيث يمكن أن تدعمها ميزانية المشروع والجدول الزمني","اطلب من صاحب المصلحة تقديم طلب تغيير لزيادة الميزانية والوقت لطلب التعديلات","تحليل سبب الفجوة في التفاهم مع الطرفين وتفاوضوا على الحل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":291,"q":"During the last sprint review , the main stakeholder complained that the product was missing many features they had been expecting. The project team argued that every incremental met the acceptance criteria and was approved by the main stakeholder. The cost perfromance index CPI of the project is 1.15 and the schedule performance index SPI is 1.43. What should project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Explain to the stakeholder that since the acceptance criteria for every increment were met , the project can be closed","Ask the project team to perform the modifications since the project budget and schedule can support them","Ask the stakeholder to submit a change request to increase the budget and time for the modifications request","Analyze the reason for the gap in understanding with both sides with both sides and negotiate a solution"],"c":[3],"f":"Without understanding the reason for the gap, the issue can occur again.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":396}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ، يلاحظ مدير المشروع أن عضوًا واحدًا فقط في الفريق لديه واحدة من المهارات الفنية اللازمة لبناء المنتج. يخشى مدير المشروع أن يكون لهذا تأثير مستقبلي على الجودة والجدول الزمني ، لأن معظم الأنشطة القادمة ستتطلب ثلاثة أشخاص على الأقل بهذه المهارة المحددة. ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه لمنع الفريق من أن يصبح غير مؤهل؟","oa":["قم بتيسير حدث تدريبي مع مدرب خارجي","استبعاد الأنشطة من خارطة الطريق","علم الفريق بأكمله المهارة الجديدة","شجع على العمل في أزواج ومشاركة المعرفة","زيادة الوقت المقدر للأنشطة التي تتطلب مثل هذه القدرات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":292,"q":"During the execution of a project , the project manager notices that only one team member has one of the technical skills needed to build the product. The project manager manager is afraid this might hace a future impact on the quality and schedule, because most of the upcoming activities will require at least three people with this specific skill. What two actions should the project manager take to prevent the team from being unqualified?","t":"M","o":["Facilitate a training event with an external trainer","Exclude the activities from the roadmap","Teach the entire team the new skill","Encourage working in pairs and knowledge sharing","Increase the time estimates on the activities that require such abilities"],"c":[0,3],"f":"The two actions should the project manager take to prevent the team from being unqualified\n\n Facilitate a training event with an external trainer \n Encourage working in pairs and knowledge sharing","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":397}},{"qa":"في مشروع تطوير البرمجيات ، يتفق مالك المنتج وفريق التطوير على سجل أعمال المنتج الخاص بالتكرار . الأولوية القصوى في سجل أعمال المنتج هي بناء وحدة دفع. عمل الفريق على الوحدة خلال النصف الأول من التكرار، ولكن الآن يريد مطوران قضاء بقية التكرار في التركيز على إعادة هيكلة ميزة أخرى قد تخلق مشاكل في المستقبل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["كرر للمطورين أهمية التركيز وتحقيق أهداف التكرار","امتدح المطورين على نشاطهم الاستباقي والتركيز على الجودة","دع المطورين يركزون على أعمال إعادة البناء ومناقشتها في أجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي","تصعيد المشكلة إلى المديرين الوظيفيين للمطور"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":293,"q":"In a software development project , the product owner and development team agree on a sprint backlog. The highest priority in the backlog is to build a payment module. The team worked on the module during the first half of the sprint , but now two developers want to spend the rest of the sprint focusing on refactoring another feature that might create issues in the future. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Restate to the developers the importance of focusing and meeting the sprint goals","Praise the developers for their pro-activity and focus on quality","Let the developers focus on the refactoring work and discuss it in the retrospective","Escalate the issue to the developer's functional managers"],"c":[0],"f":"To avoid issues in the future , the project manager should Restate to the developers the importance of focusing and meeting the sprint goals","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":398}},{"qa":"تم تسريح ثلاثة أعضاء من فريق أجايل بسبب التخفيض الأخير في الميزانية ، ولا يزال العميل يتوقع نتائج مبكرة للمشروع. ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه لمواءمة توقعات العملاء (اختر اثنين)","oa":["راجع سجل العوائق مع العميل","اطلب من فريق أجايل مراجعة سرعة التكرار المحدثة مع العميل","إرسال خطة إدارة المشروع التفصيلية إلى العميل","اطلب من مالك المنتج مراجعة سجل أعمال المنتج حسب الأولوية مع العميل","اطلب من فريق أجايل مراجعة وتحديث خطة إدارة الجودة مع العميل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":294,"q":"Three team members were released from an agile team due to recent budget reduction, the customer is still expecting early results for the project.\nWhich two actions should the project manager take to align customer expectations (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Review the impediments log with the customer","Ask the agile team to review the updated sprint velocity with the customer","Send a detailed project management plan to the customer","Ask the product owner to review the prioritized backlog with the customer","Ask the agile team to review and update the quality management plan with the customer"],"c":[1,3],"f":"The two actions should the project manager take to align customer expectations\n\n Ask the agile team to review the updated sprint velocity with the customer\n Ask the product owner to review the prioritized backlog with the customer","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":399}},{"qa":"أثناء اجتماع حالة المشروع ، يقوم أحد أعضاء الفريق بإبلاغ مدير المشروع بزيادة غير متوقعة في سعر المكون الأساسي المطلوب لإكمال التسليم. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتحديث خطة إدارة المخاطر للتكيف مع السيناريو الجديد","تحليل تأثير ارتفاع الأسعار على المشروع","الرجوع إلى خطة إدارة المشتريات","قم بتضمين السعر المتزايد في ميزانية المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":295,"q":"During a project status meeting, a team member informs the project manager of an unexpected increase in the price of an essential component required to complete the deliverable . What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Update the risk management plan to adapt to the new scenario","Analyze the impact of the price increase on the project","Refer to the procurement management plan","Include the increased price in the project budget"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword (an unexpected increase) Any change affects on the project so the project manager should first anlayze the impact of any change on project.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":400}},{"qa":"مشروع متأخر عن الجدول الزمني ومتجاوز الميزانية. نتيجة لزيادة ضغط أصحاب المصلحة ، تعرض فريق المشروع لضغط كبير. يتسبب هذا في حدوث تضارب بين مديري الجودة والإنتاج ، حيث يلوم كل منهم الآخر على التأخير وتجاوز التكاليف. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قابل مشرفي المديرين لمناقشة الإجراءات الممكنة","ناقش الموقف مع أصحاب المصلحة واتبع اقتراحاتهم للتعامل مع النزاع","راجع ميثاق الفريق للحصول على إرشادات حول كيفية التعامل مع هذا التعارض","قابل كلا المديرين ، واطلب منهم إنهاء النزاع على الفور لتجنب التأثير السلبي على المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":296,"q":"A project is behind schedule and overbudget . As result of increased stakeholder pressure , the project team has been placed under serious duress. This causes a conflict between the quality and production managers, with each blaming the other for the delay and cost overruns . What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Meet with the managers' supervisors to discuss possible actions","Discuss the situation with the stakeholders, and follow their suggestions for dealing with the conflict","Refer to the team charter for guidelines on how to deal with this conflict","Meet with both managers , and ask them to immediately end the conflict to avoid negatively Impacting the project."],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword (project is behind schedule and overbudget-a conflict) so the project manager should be proactive so the best option (Meet with both managers , and ask them to immediately end the conflict to avoid negatively Impacting the project)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":401}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في مشروع تصميم صناعي. أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ، أثار بعض أصحاب المصلحة مخاوف بشأن ضعف إدارة اتصالات المشروع. لقد صدمت لسماع هذا لأنك بذلت جهد كبير عند إعداد خطط إدارة المشروع ، وخاصة خطة إدارة الاتصالات. أنت تعتقد أن أصحاب المصلحة يتصرفون بشكل غير معقول. في هذه الحالة ، من المسؤول الآن عن إدارة توقعات أصحاب المصلحة هؤلاء؟","oa":["مدير المشروع","راعي المشروع","فريق المشروع","أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":297,"q":"You are project manager on an industrial design project. During project execution some of your stakeholders raised concerns regarding poor project communications management. You are shocked to hear this since you have left no stone unturned when preparing the project management plans, especially the communications management plan. You believe that the stakeholders are being unreasonable . In this situation,who is now responsible for managing these stakeholders' expectations?","t":"S","o":["Project manager","Project sponsor","project team","Project stakeholders"],"c":[0],"f":"Project manager is responsible for managing these stakeholders' expectations","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":402}},{"qa":"أنت تعمل كمدير بدوام جزئي في مؤسسة مصفوفة ضعيفة. يضيف مديرك الوظيفي إلى عبء العمل بإعلانك أنك مدير المشروع لفكرة عمل جديدة. بعد مراجعة دراسة الجدوى ، فأنت تدرك أنه يجب تعيين موظفين جدد لتنفيذ المشروع. ما هو القيد ، إن وجد ، الذي ستعمل بموجبه فيما يتعلق بتعيين موظفين إضافيين؟","oa":["أنت ، بصفتك مدير المشروع ، ستكون مسؤولاً عن تعيين الموظفين","سيكون المدير الوظيفي مسؤولاً عن تعيين الموظفين.","سيكون جميع أصحاب المصلحة مسؤولين عن تعيين الموظفين","ستكون الإدارة العليا مسؤولة عن تعيين الموظفين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":298,"q":"You are working as a part -time manager at a weak matrix organization. Your functional manager adds to your workload by declaring you the project manager for a new business idea. After reviewing the business case, you understand new personnel will need to be hired to execute the project. What constraint, if any,will you be operating under in terms of hiring additional staff?","t":"S","o":["You, as project manager , would be responsible for hiring staff","The functional manager would be responsible for hiring staff.","All stakeholders would be responsible for hiring staff","Senior management would be responsible for hiring staff"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager's role in a weak matrix organization is as a coordinator so the authority of project manager in this type of organization (Low) and the authority of staffing is resposibility of functional manager","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":403}},{"qa":"منصور هو مدير المشروع لمشروع البحث والتطوير. كان الاجتماع الأخير كارثيًا حيث تم قضاء المزيد من الوقت في الجدل ، وقليلًا من الوقت في القرارات ، واستغرق الاجتماع وقتًا طويلاً. ما الذي كان يجب فعله لمنع هذا الوضع؟","oa":["استخدم تقنيات الاستماع","قم بدعوة رئيس أعضاء الفريق فقط","قم بإعداد محادثة افتراضية","حدد جدول أعمال الاجتماع قبل الاجتماع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":299,"q":"Mansour is the project manager for a research and development project . The last few meeting were a disaster since more time was spent in arguments, less on decisions and, the meeting takes a long time. What should have done to prevent this situation?","t":"S","o":["Use listening techniques","Invite only team members boss","Set a virtual conversation","Set a meeting agenda before the meeting"],"c":[3],"f":"In this senario there is waste in the meeting and the meetings are a powerful model of interactive communication and take important decisions so the time is important factor to achieve objectives of meetings so the project manager should set a meeting agenda before the meeting to become the meetings effective","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":404}},{"qa":"أثناء جمع المتطلبات وتحديد منتجات المشروع ، قمت بتعيين مستشار خارجي لتقديم المشورة لك حول كيفية القيام بذلك بشكل أفضل ورفع مستوى الأساليب المرتبطة بها. يأتي المستشار بمعرفة واسعة بأفضل الممارسات في الصناعة في هذا الصدد. ما الذي سيفعله المستشار بشكل أساسي؟","oa":["تعليم تقنيات تحليل المتطلبات لفريق إدارة المشروع","قم بإجراء المقارنة المعيارية من خلال التوصية بأفضل الممارسات في فئتها في الصناعة المتعلقة بجمع المتطلبات وتحديد المنتجات","قم بإدارة استبيان مع أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين في مشروعك حول أفضل ممارساتهم","تبادل الأفكار بين أعضاء فريقك لتحديد أفضل الممارسات لجمع المتطلبات وتعريف المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":300,"q":"While collecting requirements and defining the project's products, you have hired an external consultant to advise you on how to do it better and raise the standard for their associated methods. The consultant mainly going to do ?","t":"S","o":["Teach requirements analysis techniques to the project management team","Perform bench-marking by recommending best in class practices in the industry related to collecting requirements and defining products","Administer a questionnaire with key stakeholders in your project about their best practices","Brainstorming among your team members to define the best practices for requirements gathering and product definition"],"c":[1],"f":"keyword ( best practices in the industry) so the benchmaring technique is the best option because benchmarking is technique use to compare with best in class to get methods for improvements","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":405}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع تخطط لمشروع لتطوير نظام جديد لكشوف الرواتب ، وأنت حاليًا بصدد تحديد احتياجات ومتطلبات أصحاب المصلحة وتوثيقها وإدارتها لتحقيق أهداف المشروع. اقترح أحد أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع أنه سيكون من المفيد الحصول على تصوير مرئي يوضح كيفية تفاعل الأشخاص والأنظمة الأخرى مع نظام كشوف المرتبات الجديد. تعجبك الفكرة وتريد معالجتها. ما هي أفضل طريقة لتنفيذ اقتراح أصحاب المصلحة؟","oa":["بناء مخطط مصفوفة","وضع مخططً السياق","صمم مخطط تقارب","قم بإنشاء مخطط هيكل السمكة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":301,"q":"You are a project manager planning a project to develop a new payroll system , and you are currently in the process of determining, documenting , and managing stakeholder needs and requirements to meet project objectives . A project stakeholder has suggested that it would be helpful to have a visual depiction showing how people and other systmes will interact with the new payroll system. You like the idea and want to address it. What is the best way to implement the stakeholder's suggestion?","t":"S","o":["Build a matrix diagram","Develop a context diagram","Design an affinity diagram","Create a fish bone diagram"],"c":[1],"f":"A context diagram is a visual depiction of the product scope showing a business system (process,equipement , computer , system ,etc.) and how people and other systems (actors) interact with it.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":406}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع حاليًا على تحديد احتياجات ومتطلبات المعنيين وتوثيقها وإدارتها. نظرًا للطبيعة الحساسة للمشروع ، هناك قلق من أن بعض المعنيين لن يقدموا ملاحظات صريحة ما لم يتم الحفاظ على السرية. ما هو أفضل مسار عمل لمدير المشروع؟","oa":["استخدم العصف الذهني لتوليد وجمع أفكار متعددة تتعلق بمتطلبات المشروع","قم بإجراء المقابلات لأستنباط المعلومات من المعنيين  من خلال التحدث إليهم مباشرة","عقد مجموعة مركزة للتعرف على توقعات المعنيين والمواقف حول المشروع","استخدم تحليل القرار متعدد المعايير لتوفير نهج تحليلي منظم لوضع المعايير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":302,"q":"A project manager is currently in the process of determining, documenting,and managing stakeholder needs and requirements. Due to the sensitive nature of the project, there is a concern that some stakeholders will not provide candid feedback unless confidentiality is maintained. What is the project manager's best course of action?","t":"S","o":["Use brainstorming to generate and collect multiple ideas related to project requirements","Conduct interviews to elicit information from stakeholders by talking to them directly","Hold a focus group to learn about stakeholder expectations and attitudes about the project","Use multi criteria decision analysis to provide a systematic analytical approach for establishing criteria"],"c":[1],"f":"In this scenario , Project manager needs to use a data gathering technique so the interviews is the best option to elicit high quality and confidential information.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":407}},{"qa":"يتم تعريف بيان نطاق المشروع الذي يتضمن مخرجات المشروع ، القيود، والافتراضات المرتبطة بأهداف المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["إنشاء تقسيم هرمي للنطاق الإجمالي الذي يتعين على فريق المشروع تنفيذه","خذ قبولًا رسميًا لنواتج المشروع المكتملة","تحديد المنتجات والخدمات والنتائج المراد تسليمها","مراقبة حالة المشروع ونطاق المنتج وإدارة التغييرات على خط الأساس للنطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":303,"q":"A project scope statement is defined with project deliverables, constraints ,and assumptions associated with the project objectives . What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Establish a hierarchical breakdown of the the total scope to be carried out by the project team","Take a formal acceptance of the completed project deliverables","Determine the products ,services and for results to be delivered","Monitoring the status of the project and product scope and managing changes to the scope baseline"],"c":[0],"f":"The project now is in planning phase - Define scope Process so the next process is Create WBS\nWBS is a hierarchical breakdown of the the total scope yo obtain accurate estimates for schedule and cost","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":408}},{"qa":"أنت مسؤول عن تشييد مبنى سكني شاهق. بعد إنشاء مخطط الشبكة ، تكون قد حددت المسار الحرج. بدأ العمل ، ولكن فجأة بسبب سوء الأحوال الجوية ، تأخر العمل على القاعدة. كان نشاط العمل الأساسي هذا على المسار الحرج. بصفتك مديرًا يتأمل هذا المشروع ، هل أنت قلق ولماذا؟","oa":["نعم - أي تأخير في الأنشطة على المسار الحرج سيؤدي إلى تأخير المشروع بأكمله","نعم - سيتعين عليك الآن نقل هذه الأخبار السيئة إلى العميل","لا - لا تؤثر الأنشطة على المسار الحرج على الجدول الزمني","لا - لا يهم إذا تأخر العمل على القاعدة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":304,"q":"You are in charge of constructing a high -rise residential building. After creating a network diagram , you have identified the critical path. Work has started , but suddenly due to inclement weather, plinth work has got delayed. This plinth work activity was on the critical path. As a manager deiving this project, would you be worried and why?","t":"S","o":["Yes - Any delay of activities on the critical path would lead to delay of the entire project","Yes - You will now have to relay this bad news to the client","No - Activities on the critical path do not impact the schedule","No - It will not matter f the plinth work is delayed"],"c":[0],"f":"Keyword (activity was on the critical path) - Activities in the critical path . the activities are on the critical path, therefore, delays should not be accepted, because any delay in any activity on the critical path will lead to a delay in the project as a whole.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":409}},{"qa":"إبراهيم هو مدير مشروع في منتصف الطريق من تنفيذه. يريد راعي المشروع إضافة ميزة جديدة لم يتم تحديدها أثناء مرحلة تجميع المتطلبات الأولية. مطلوب 15,000 دولار أمريكي لإضافة هذه الميزة. استنادًا إلى البيانات التالية ، (التكلفة المباشرة المقدرة للمشروع هي 200,000 دولار أمريكي ، وتقدر إعادة العمل بـ 15,000 دولار أمريكي ، واحتياطي إداري 20,000 دولار أمريكي) ، فماذا يجب أن يفعل إبراهيم؟","oa":["إصدار طلب تغيير لزيادة ميزانية التكلفة بمقدار 15000 دولار أمريكي","يجب أن يستخدم مدير المشروع 15000 دولار أمريكي من الأحتياطي الإداري","يجب أن يستخدم مدير المشروع 15000 دولار أمريكي لإعادة العمل.","اطلب موافقة الإدارة لزيادة ميزانية المشروع بمقدار 15000 دولار أمريكي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":305,"q":"Ibrahim is the project manager of a project that is halfway through its execution. The project sponsor wants to add a new feature that wasn't defined during rhe initial requirements gathering phase. 15,000 USD will be required to add this feature . Based on the following data ,( the estimated direct cost for a project is 200,000 USD, the estimated of rework is 15,000 USD, and management reserve is 20,000 USD), What should Ibrahim do?","t":"S","o":["Issue a change request to increase the cost budget by 15,000 $","The project manager should use 15,000 $ of management reserves","The project manager should use 15,000 $ for rework.","Seek approval from management to increase the project budget by 15,000 $"],"c":[0],"f":"Keyword( add a new feature-wasn't defined). As long as you did not specify at the beginning, any new request that requires, according to the predictive approach, to issue a change request to add the new feature that may lead to a change in the cost and cannot be disbursed from the current budget","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":410}},{"qa":"حدود التحكم العليا والسفلى المحددة هي 12 و -12 بينما لديك قراءات نقاط البيانات التالية 1.6،3.7،7.8،9.1، -6.8،14،8.9،4.2،0.0، -5.2 كيف تكون هذه العملية","oa":["تحت السيطرة","في حدود التحكم","خارج السيطرة","أداء يمكن التنبؤ به"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":306,"q":"The established upper and lower control limits are 12 and -12 while you have the following data points readings 1.6,3.7,7.8,9.1, 6.8,14,8.9,4.2,0.0,-5.2 How will you consider this process","t":"S","o":["In control","within control","Out of control","Predictable performance"],"c":[2],"f":"The control limits (-12 to 12 ) so There is data point (14) is out of this limits","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":411}},{"qa":"يرفض المستخدم النهائي بعض التسليمات ، على الرغم من استيفاء العديد من المتطلبات. بعد إجراء تحليل السبب الجذري ، يعلم مدير المشروع أنه لم يتم تنفيذ عملية ضبط الجودة  بسبب نقص الموارد. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب ذلك؟","oa":["إنشاء قوائم فحص الجودة","عقد اجتماعات عملية ضبط الجودة","طلبت المزيد من الموارد لنشاط مراقبة الجودة","تأكد من أن الجودة تمت إدارتها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":307,"q":"The end - user rejects some type of deliverables, although many of the requirements are met. After conducting a root cause analysis , the project manager learns that a specific quality control process was not performed due to a lack of resources . What should the project manager have done to avoid this ?","t":"S","o":["Created quality checklists","Held quality control process meetings","Requested more resources for quality control activity","Ensured that quality was managed"],"c":[3],"f":"The root cause of this problem is the lack of resources. so this is related to manage quality to ensure that quality was managed correctly to prevent this issue","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":412}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع متوقع تغيرلت في الطقس ويكون قاسي جدا خلال الفترة المقبلة. والمشروع متجاوز الميزانية ،  وراعي المشروع غير مستعد لتقديم تمويل إضافي. لتحقيق المعالم قبل بدء الطقس القاسي ، أي من التقنيات التالية يجب أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحليل الخيارات الأفتراضي","التتابع السريع","تسوية الموارد","ضغط زمن المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":308,"q":"A project manager is managing a project of extreme weather is expected soon. The project is overbudget, and the project sponsor isn't prepared to provide additional funding. To achieve the milestone before the extreme weather begins , which of the following techniques should the project manager use?","t":"S","o":["What is scenario analysis","Fast tracking","Resource leveling","Crashing"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword( the project is over budget) so you can't use crashing in this scenario.The project manager should use fast tracking to achieve the milestone before the extreme weather begins.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":413}},{"qa":"لقد حددت خطرًا قد يسبب مخاوف تتعلق بالسلامة للعاملين الذين يكملون المهمة. لقد قررت الاستعانة بطرف ثالث لإكمال هذا العمل لأن المخاطرة أكبر من أن تقبل داخليًا. ما هي هذه الاستجابة للمخاطر؟","oa":["تجنب","التحويل","قبول","تخفيف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":309,"q":"You have identified a risk that may cause safety concerns for the workers completing the task. You've decided to hire a third party to complete this work because the risk is too great to accept internally. Whicg risk response is this ?","t":"S","o":["Avoidance","Transference","Acceptance","Mitigation"],"c":[1],"f":"Transference : involves shifting ownership of a threat ti a third party to manage the risk and to bear the impact if the threat occurs. Agreements may be used to transfer ownership and liability for specified risks to another party.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":414}},{"qa":"في بداية المشروع ، كنت تلتقي بفريقك وترغب في معالجة جميع نقاط القوة والضعف والفرص والتهديدات التي يواجهها المشروع. ما الأداة التي يجب استخدامها؟","oa":["مخطط السبب والتاثير","تقنية دلفي","تحليل سوات","المقابلات الشخصية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":310,"q":"Early in the project , you are meeting with your team and would like to address all strenght , weaknesses , opportunities , and threats the project is facing. What tool should be used?","t":"S","o":["Cause and effect diagram","Delphi technique","SWOT Analysis","Interviewing"],"c":[2],"f":"SWOT is an acronym for Strenght , Weaknesses , Opportunities , and Threats.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":415}},{"qa":"حدثت مخاطر لم تكن مدرجة في سجل المخاطر. من أجل الحصول على تمويل لمواجهة هذه المخاطر ، ماذا ستفعل؟","oa":["تقدير تكلفة الإجراء واتخاذها من أساس التكلفة المعتمدة","قم بتقدير تكلفة الإجراء ، واستخدمه من الأساس المعتمد للتكلفة ولكن قلل هذا المبلغ من الأساس","تقدير تكلفة الإجراء واتخاذها من احتياطي الطوارئ الذي هو جزء من الوقت على مراحل الميزانية","تقدير تكلفة الإجراء واتخاذها من الاحتياطي الإداري الذي هو جزء من ميزانية المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":311,"q":"A risk that was not listed in the risk register occurred . In order to obtain funding to respond to this risk, what will you do ?","t":"S","o":["Estimate the cost of the action and take it from the approved cost baseline","Estimate the cost of the action, take it from the approved cost baseline but reduce this amount from the baseline","Estimate the cost of the action and take it from the contingency reserve which is part of the time phased budget","Estimate the cost of the action and take it from the management reserve which is part of the project budget"],"c":[3],"f":"Management reserve is unplanned risk which is part of the project budget","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":416}},{"qa":"أثناء إنشاء مصفوفة الاحتمالات والتأثير ، ما الذي يجب على الفريق ومدير المشروع مراعاته لدعم تحليل مخاطر المشروع","oa":["جودة المشروع والموارد","التأثيرات المحتملة على أهداف المشروع","نطاق المشروع وتسليمات المشروع","احتياطي الطوارئ للميزانية والجدول الزمني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":312,"q":"While creating the probability and impact matrix , what should the team and project manager consider to support the project risk analysis","t":"S","o":["Project quality and resources","Possible effects on the objectives of the project","Project scope and project deliverables","Contingency reserve for budget and schedule"],"c":[1],"f":"The probability and impact matrix is the possible effects on the objectives of the project by taking the highest priority level regardless of which objective is affected","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":417}},{"qa":"بعد تحليل المخاطر مع فريق المشروع ، تقرر أنت ، مدير المشروع ، إنشاء احتياطي للطوارئ للتعامل مع التهديد في حالة حدوثه. ما نوع هذه الاستراتيجية؟","oa":["التحويل","القبول النشط","التخفيف","القبول السلبي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":313,"q":"After analyzing risk with the project team you, the project manager , decides to establish a contingency reserve to handle the threat if it occurs. What type of strategy is this ?","t":"S","o":["Transference","Active acceptance","Mitigation","Passive Acceptance"],"c":[1],"f":"Active acceptance strategy is to establish a contingency reserve , including amounts of time , money , or resources to handle the threat if it occur.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":418}},{"qa":"أي من العمليات التالية يجب استخدامها لتنفيذ خطط الاستجابة للمخاطر المتفق عليها. فائدة هذه العملية هي أنها تضمن تنفيذ استجابات المخاطر المتفق عليها كما هو مخطط لها؟","oa":["تنفيذ الاستجابة للمخاطر","خطط للاستجابة للمخاطر","تحديد المخاطر","مراقبة وإغلاق المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":314,"q":"Which of the following processes should be used to implement agreed-upon risk response plans. The benefit of this process is that it ensures that agreed-upon risk responses are executed as planned?","t":"S","o":["Implement risk response","Plan risk response","Risk identification","Monitor and Close risk"],"c":[0],"f":"Implement risk response : is the process of implementing agreed-upon risk response plans.\nThe key benefit : ensuring that agreed-upon risk responses are executed as planned to address overall project risk exposure , minimize individual project threats, and maximize individual project opportunities.","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":419}},{"qa":"تصل الخرسانة الخاصة بالمشروع في الوقت المحدد ، لكن يكتشف مدير المشروع أن تركيبة الخرسانة غير صحيحة. ما هي الوثيقة التي يجب على مدير المشروع مراجعتها للتحقق من أداء الخرسانة ومتطلبات الجودة؟","oa":["خطة إدارة الجودة","طلب تقديم العروض","بيان عمل المشتريات  (SOW)","خطة إدارة المشتريات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":315,"q":"The concrete for a project arrives on time, but the project manager discovers that the concrete's composition is incorrect. What document should the project manager reviews to verify the concrete's performance and quality requirements?","t":"S","o":["Quality management plan","Request For Proposal (RFP)","Procurement Statement Of Work (SOW)","Procurement management plan"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword (concrete's performance and quality requirements)\nThe Procurement Statement Of Work (SOW) include\nSpecifications , quantity desired , quality levels , performance data , periord of performance , work location , and other requirements.\nSOW describes the procurement item in sufficient detail to allow prospective sellers to determine if they are capable of providing the products, services , or results. Sufficient detail can vary based on the nature of the item, the needs of the buyer, or the expected contract form.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":420}},{"qa":"بعد التكرار الثاني لمشروع تطوير المكون ، يجري فريق المشروع تقييم بأثر رجعي يوضح أنه في المرحلة الأولية فشل المشروع في الامتثال لوظائف المنتج. التخطيط لهذا المنتج له نهج تنبؤي في الغالب. ما هي التقنية التي ستساعد مدير المشروع على تسريع التسليم؟","oa":["ملكية الكود الجماعي","تخطيط الموجة المتدرجة","سكروم الشاملة","تقنية سوات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":316,"q":"After the second iteration of a component development project, the project team conducts a retrospective it shows that in the initial phase the project has failed to comply with product functionality. The planning for this product has a predominantly predicitive approach. Which technique will help the project manager to accelerate the deliverable ?","t":"S","o":["Collective code ownership","Rolling wave planning","Scrum of scrums","SWOT technique"],"c":[1],"f":"Rolling wave planning\nAn iterative planning technique in which the work to be accomplished in the near term is planned in detail, while work further in the future is planned at a higher level.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":421}},{"qa":"يعقد فريق العرض التوضيحي الأول للبرنامج الذي تم إنشاؤه حتى الآن في مشروع متوسط الحجم ، وقد كشف مالك المنتج عن عدد من المشكلات التي يرغبون في معالجتها قبل تقديم الموافقة ، كيف ينبغي لمدير المشروع التعامل مع هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["قم بتوجية مالك المنتج إلى خطة إدارة التغيير ، ثم قم بالتصعيد إلى اللجنة التوجيهية","قم بتوجيه مالك المنتج إلى مستند متطلبات العمل الموقع واشرح أن الخطة الحالية لا يمكنها تنسيق هذه التغييرات","أخبر مالك المنتج أنه سيتم معالجة المشكلات في الإصدار الثاني من البرنامج","خطط لمعالجة المشكلات من خلال تنقيح سجل أعمال المنتج ودمجها في التكرار التالي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":317,"q":"A team is holding the first demonstration of the software built to date on a medium -sized project the product owner has uncovered a number of issues they would like to be addressed before providing approval how should the project manager approach this problem ?","t":"S","o":["Refer the product owner to the change management plan , then escalate to the steering committee","Refer the product owner to the signed business requirement document and explain that the current plan cannot facilitate these changes","Tell the product owner the issues will be addressed in the second version of the software","Plan to address the issues through backlog grooming and incorporate them into the next sprint"],"c":[3],"f":"Plan to address the issues through backlog grooming and incorporate them into the next sprint","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":422}},{"qa":"طلب راعي المشروع المواصفات الفنية لمكون متعلق بالمشروع. لا يملك راعي المشروع الإذن بالاطلاع على المواصفات ولكنه يصر على رؤيتها. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["قابل راعي المشروع في أقرب وقت ممكن لمناقشة الأمر بشكل أكبر","ضع خطة إشراك أصحاب المصلحة لمساعدة الفريق على صياغة استجابة","قم بتحديث سجل المشكلات لجعل فريق المشروع على دراية ووضع إستراتيجية","تقديم المواصفات لراعي المشروع مع حذف بعض المعلومات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":318,"q":"The project sponsor requested technical specifications for a project- related component. The project sponsor does not have the authorization to see the specifications but insists on seeing them. What should the project manager do first in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Meet with the project sponsor as soon as possible to discuss the matter further","Create a stakeholder engagement plan to help the team formulate a response","Update the issue log to make the project team aware and to develop a strategy","Provide the specifications to the project sponsor with some information removed"],"c":[0],"f":"In this question, the project manager is asked what to do first So you, as a project manager, are always at the beginning. If you find a problem, you should look for an interview / meeting and search for solutions to the problem. Therefore, always in the project management professional exams \n\nthink about the following points \n\n What is the approach \n What is the current phase\n What is required (decision or technology) \n\nWe notice in this question that the approach used is not mentioned, so we will solve this question based on the traditional approach (waterfall). Decision required in question The decision that the project manager must take is to record this problem, but mention what he should do first. Here we are looking for the best way to understand the problems and search for solutions or communicate a concerned idea. We assume, for example, that there is confusion or conflict. What should you do? You will think that you meet the person and explain your point of view to him Or your opinion as well as hear his point of view","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":423}},{"qa":"خلال التكرار الثالث ، واجه الفريق تأخيرًا كبيرًا لم يشهد أي تحسينات كبيرة خلال الأسابيع القليلة الماضية. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب أعضاء فريق إضافيين للمساعدة في التحسينات","تنفيذ استراتيجيات التخفيف لهذا العنصر","إجراء مراجعات تقييمات بأثر رجعي بشكل مستمر وأقترح التحسينات","دمج نهج تنبؤي لهذا العنصر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":319,"q":"During the third iteration , the team encounters a major delay that has not had significant improvements over the last few weeks . What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Request additional team members to help with improvements","Implement mitigation strategies for this element","Retrospect frequently and suggest improvements","Incorporate a predictive approach for this element"],"c":[2],"f":"Approach : Agile\nKeyword: Improvements\nThe correct answer (Retrospective = Improvements)","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":424}},{"qa":"تمتلك الشركة عقدًا إلكترونيًا للحفاظ على قاعدة بيانات العملاء الخاصة بالعميل وتعزيزها. يقوم القسم القانوني للشركة بإبلاغ مدير المشروع بأنه قد يتم قريباً التوقيع على تشريع جديد يتطلب حماية أكثر صرامة لمعلومات العملاء ليصبح قانونًا. سيتطلب القانون تطبيق ميزات أمنية إضافية في قاعدة البيانات التي يحتفظ بها مدير المشروع. لم يتم تضمين هذه الميزات في نطاق العقد الحالي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب دعم راعي المشروع للتأثير على العميل لتعديل العقد على الفور","اطلب من القسم القانوني إثارة المشكلة في مفاوضات العقد التالية مع العميل","انتظر حتى يتم الانتهاء من المتطلبات القانونية حتى يمكن تحديد التغيير في النطاق بشكل ملموس","قم بتحديث سجل المخاطر لتضمين هذه المشكلة وناقش خطط الاستجابة المناسبة للمخاطر مع راعي المشروع والعميل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":320,"q":"A company has an esisting contract to maintain and enhance a client's customer database. The company's legal department informs the project manager that a new piece of legislation requiring stricter protection of customer information might soon be signed into law. The law will require additional security features to be implemented into the database the project manager is maintaining. These features are not included in the scope of the current contract. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Seek the project sponsor's support to influence the client to amend the contract immediately","Ask the legal department to raise the issue in the next contract negotiation with the customer","Wait until the legal requirements are finalized so the change in scope can be concretely defined","Update the risk register to include this issue and discuss the appropriate risk response plans with the project sponsor and client"],"c":[3],"f":"In this question mention ( features are not included in the scope of the current contract) so this is risk if project manager doesnot add it in the risk register will affect on the project objectives so the project manager should be proactive doesnot wait untill it becomes issue","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":425}},{"qa":"اقترح أحد المعنيين الجدد في المشروع تغييرًا على بعض معلمات المشروع في منتصف الطريق من التنفيذ ، فماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["رفض التغيير لأنه مخالف لما تم الاتفاق عليه خلال المراحل المبكرة من المشروع","تحويل التغيير إلى اللجنة التوجيهية لتقييمه واتخاذ قرار بشأن الخطوات التالية المناسبة","اقبل التغيير واستخدم أموال الطوارئ لتنفيذ هذا التغيير مع الحد الأدنى من تأثيرات الجدول الزمني","قم بتقييم التغيير المقترح مع إجراء عمليات التحكم المتكامل في التغيير وناقش التغيير مع راعي المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":321,"q":"A new relevant project stakeholder suggested a change to some of the project parameters midway through execution what should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Reject the change because it is contrary to what was agreed to during earlier phases of the project","Transfer the change to the steering committee for them to evaluate and decide the appropriate next steps","Accept the change and use contingency funds to implement this change with minimal schedule impacts","Evaluate the proposed change with integrated change controls and discuss the change with the project sponsor"],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword (change ) so the first step that the project manager evaluate this change","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":426}},{"qa":"ظل الفريق يعمل لمدة شهرين ,وباستمرار مدة قصص المستخدم تختلف عن ما هو مخطط لها. فكيف يجب على مدير المشروع معالجة هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["تعزيز تغيير مدة التكرار من أجل الالتزام كما هو مخطط","تأكد من أن حجم التكرار مناسب لمدة التكرار","المشاركة في توظيف مورد ذو مهارات عالية لتعزيز المهارات","ضع في اعتبارك استخدام نظام المكافآت لتشجيع التسليم في الوقت المناسب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":322,"q":"The team has been working for two months and has consistently missed planned user stories . How should the project manager address this issue?","t":"S","o":["Promote changing the iteration duration in order to commit as planned.","Ensure the sprint size is appropriate for the iteration duration","Engage in recruiting a highly skilled resource to reinforce the skills","Consider using a reward system to encourage timely delivery"],"c":[1],"f":"Project manager should Ensure the sprint size is appropriate for the iteration duration to avoid delay and delivery comply with consistent pace","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":427}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":323,"q":"Vendor a submitted a bid for 500,000$ . There is a 65% probability that the vendor will deliver behind schedule with a cost overrun of 100,000$ . The vendor will come in ahead of schedule for a savings of 50,000$ . What should the project manager determine as the value of the vendor's bid?","t":"S","o":["757,550$","452,500$","582,500$","547,500$"],"c":[1],"f":"Expected Monetary Value (EMV) = Probability * Impact\n65% probability behind schedule\nSo the probability ahead or on schedule = (1-65%)=35%\nSo EMV = (65%*-100,000)+(35%*50,000) = -47500\nSo the vendor's bid = Abid + EMV = 500,000+(-47500) = 452,500","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5"},{"qa":"بعد عدة تكرارات ، يقرر مدير المشروع تقديم المنتج إلى أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين. ملاحظات المعنيين هي أن الفريق أخطأ في العديد من الميزات. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لتجنب ذلك في المستقبل؟","oa":["أعداد جلسات جمع المتطلبات مع جميع المعنيين الرئيسيين لتقييم النطاق مرة أخرى وإعادة ترتيب أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج  بناءً على الجلسات","قم بدمج ممارسات التفكير التصميمي في دورة حياة المشروع لفهم شخصيات المنتج بشكل أفضل وتكون أكثر فاعلية لمطابقة احتياجاتهم","قم بتقييم مهارات الفريق للبحث عن شخص لديه خبرة في تصميم المنتج وتكليف هذا الشخص بمهمة إعادة بناء واجهة المنتج","قم بجدولة اجتماع المراجعة للتكرار لجمع التعليقات المبكرة من المعنيين وتكييف الخطة وفقًا لذلك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":324,"q":"After a couple of iterations , the project manager decides to present the product to a key stakeholder. The stakeholder's feedback is that the team missed the mark on many features. What should the project manager do to avoid this in the future ?","t":"S","o":["Setup requirements gathering sessions with all key stakeholders to evaluate the scope once again and re prioritize the backlog based on the sessions","Incorporate design thinking practices into the project life cycle to better understand the product's personas and be more effective to match their needs","Evaluate the team's skills to look for someone with experience in product design and assign that person the task of rebuilding the product interface","Schedule adequate sprint demos to gather early feedback from the stakeholders and adapt the plan accordingly"],"c":[3],"f":"The sprint review meeting should be held after the end of each sprint and before next sprint planning meeting to gather early feedback from the stakeholders and adapt the plan accordingly.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":428}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق البحث والتطوير بإنهاء مبادرة لمدة عامين. يركز مدير المشروع على الأنشطة الختامية للمشروع. ما هو النشاط الذي يجب اعتباره أولوية؟","oa":["حدد حالة اكتمال سجل أعمال المنتج  وتحديث خطة إدارة الاتصالات","عقد اجتماع للجنة التوجيهية لإبلاغهم بانتهاء المشروع","تأكد من تنفيذ أنشطة نقل المعرفة كما هو مخطط لها","حرر الموارد وخطط للاحتفال بإنجاز المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":325,"q":"A research and development team is finishing up a two-year initiative. The project manager is focused on the closing activities for the project.\nWhat activity should be considered as a priority?","t":"S","o":["Mark the product backlog completion status and update the communications management plan","Hold a steering committee meeting to inform them of the project completion","Ensure that knowledge transfer activities are executed as plan","Release the resources and plan for a project completion celebration"],"c":[2],"f":"the highest priority on the closing activities for the project are Ensure that knowledge transfer activities are executed as plan","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":429}},{"qa":"تمت الموافقة على ميثاق المشروع للتو ومنح راعي المشروع الإذن بالمضي قدمًا في المشروع. أكد مدير البرنامج أن أحد الموارد الرئيسية المطلوبة مطلوب أيضًا في مشروع آخر في نفس الوقت. سيؤثر هذا على تسليم المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["احصل على اجتماع مع مدير المشروع الخاص بالمشروع الآخر للعثور على حل لتحسين الموارد يعمل لكلا المشروعين","ادفع أجرًا إضافيًا للمورد الرئيسي لإنجاز العمل خارج ساعات العمل","تحدث مع العميل لمعرفة ما إذا كان الموعد النهائي لتسليم المشروع يمكن أن يتأخر بسبب توفر الموارد","تحدث إلى مدير البرنامج وحول إعطاء الأولوية لهذا المشروع على المشاريع الأخرى حتى تتوفر الموارد الرئيسية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":326,"q":"The project charter was just approved and the project sponsor has given permission to proceed with the project. The program manager has confirmed that one of the requested key resources is also needed on another project at the same time. This will affect project delivery. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Have a meeting with the project manager of the other project to find a resource optimization solution that works for both projects","Pay overtime to key resource to get the work done outside of working hours","Speak with the client to see if the project delivery deadline can be delayed due to resource availability","Talk to the program manager and about prioritizing this project over other projects so the key resources are available"],"c":[0],"f":"After approving the project charter, the project manager has full authority to use the resources, so a meeting with the project manager must be made","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":430}},{"qa":"يتلقى مدير المشروع بريدًا إلكترونيًا من البائع يفيد بتأخير التسليمات الرئيسية لمدة شهر. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["تحديث الإدارة والحصول على نصائحهم","الأجتماع مع الفريق وتحديد طرق لتلافي هذا التأخير","اتصل بالبائع للحصول على مبرر للتأخير","تقييم تأثير التأخير على خطة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":327,"q":"A project manager receives an email from a vendor that key deliverables will be delayed by a month. What should the project manager do first ?","t":"S","o":["Update the management and obtain their advice","Meet with the team identify ways to absorb this delay","Call the vendor to obtain a justification for the delay","Assess the impact of the delay on the project plan"],"c":[3],"f":"the project manager should first Assess the impact of the delay on the project plan","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":431}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":328,"q":"A project is contracted on a Cost Plus Fixed Fee (CPFF) basis with a Fixed fee of 5,000$ . The estimated cost is 50,000$. If the project comes in at 60,000$ with no changes in project scope, what would the total cost of the contract?","t":"S","o":["60,000","55,000","50,000","65,000"],"c":[3],"f":"The total cost of the contract = 60,000+5000 =65,000$","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5"},{"qa":"قام البائع بتنفيذ جميع الأعمال وفقًا للعقد ولكن المشتري ذكر أن أداء البائع ليس ضمن النطاق المسموح به من القيم لأحد المقاييس الداخلية للمشتري. يقرر المشتري خصم جزء من الدفعة للبائع. حسب العقد ، ما الذي يجوز للمشتري القيام به؟","oa":["يجب على البائع إكمال العمل مرة أخرى للوفاء بنطاق القيمة المترية الداخلية للمشتري","يُسمح للمشتري بخصم مبلغ صغير من الدفعة للبائع بسبب عدم الامتثال لنطاق القيمة المترية الداخلية للمشتري","يجب على المشتري أن يذهب إلى المحكمة وإلا قد يقاضيه البائع لعدم الدفع","يجب على المشتري أن يدفع للبائع مقابل العمل المنجز"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":329,"q":"A seller has performed all the work as per the contract but the buyer states that the seller performance is not within the allowed range of values for one of the buyer's internal metrics. The buyer decides to deduct a part of the payment to the seller. As per the contract, what is the buyer allowed to do ?","t":"S","o":["The seller should complete the work again to meet the buyer's internal metric value range","The buyer is allowed to deduct a small sum from the payment to the seller due to non-compliance with the buyer's internal metric value range","The buyer should go the court else the seller may sue them for non-payment","The buyer must pay the seller for the work performed"],"c":[3],"f":"The buyer must pay the seller as work has been performed as per the contract , any internal metrics not appering in the contract cannot be used for justifying non-payment reasons","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":432}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع من جانب المشتري. يسأل الرئيس التنفيذي لشركة ما مدير المشروع إذا كان البائع يفي بالنتائج لتحديد ما إذا كان يجب إنهاء العقد مبكرًا. ما الذي يجب تقديمه للمدير التنفيذي؟","oa":["متطلبات الأداء","خطة إدارة المشتريات","تقنيات تقييم العرض","تقييم أداء البائع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":330,"q":"You are a project manager from the buyer side . The CEO of a company asks the project manager wether the vendor is meeting the deliverables to determine if the contract should be terminated early. What should provided to the CEO?","t":"S","o":["Performance requirements","Procurement management plan","Proposal evaluation techniques","Seller performance evaluation"],"c":[3],"f":"Seller performance evaluation documentation is prepared by the buyer which documents the\nseller's ability to perform work.\n\nEven if the seller proposal confirms that the seller is capable of performing the required work, still the seller's performance must be evaluated regularly. The performance of the seller is documented using seller performance evaluation documentation. The evaluation documentation is prepared by the buyer and it determines if the seller is capable to continue the required work. This documentation is useful in procurement control. Seller performance evaluation documentation also specifies if the current supplier should be allowed to perform work or provide the required in future projects. Moreover, seller performance evaluation documentation also helps to rate the performance of the seller on the basis of the current or previous performance.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":433}},{"qa":"بعدإغلاق المشتريات وتقديم إشعار كتابي رسمي بإتمام العقد ، ما الذي يجب أن تفعله كمدير مشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["اكتب تقرير المشروع النهائي","قم بتحديث سجل الدروس المستفادة","إبلاغ أصحاب المصلحة","بدء عمليات تدقيق المشتريات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":331,"q":"After closing procurements and providing a formal written notice that the contract has been completed , what should the project manag;l]er do next?","t":"S","o":["Write the final project report","Update the lessons learned register","Inform the stakeholders","Initiate procurement audits"],"c":[1],"f":"After closing procurements and providing a formal written notice that the contract has been completed, the next step is updating the lessons learned register with techniques that were effective in maintaining the scope, schedule, and cost of the procured items","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":434}},{"qa":"بصفتك مدير مشروع ، إذا كنت ترغب في التحقق مما إذا كان مشروعك لا يزال متوافقًا مع الأهداف التنظيمية ، فأي مستند سيساعدك","oa":["سجل المشكلة","دراسة الجدوي","وصف نطاق المنتج","حاجة العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":332,"q":"As a project manager , if you would like to check if your project still align with the organizational goals , which document will help you","t":"S","o":["Issue log","Business case","Product scope description","Business need"],"c":[1],"f":"A business case provides justification for undertaking a project, programme or portfolio.\n\nIt evaluates the benefit, cost and risk of alternative options and provides a rationale for the preferred","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":435}},{"qa":"تريد شركة زيادة القيمة التجارية لأحد منتجاتها في سوق تنافسية للغاية. من أجل القيام بذلك ، تقوم الشركة بتكليف مشروع لإنشاء نموذج أولي. يبني الفريق النموذج الأولي بشكل تدريجي. ما هو الإجراء الذي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه كأولوية","oa":["التأكيد على استخدام منهجية كانبان.","تأكد من أن راعي المشروع على علم بتاريخ الذهاب إلى السوق.","تقديم قيمة الأعمال في أسرع وقت ممكن","تنفيذ دورة خطة العمل والتحقق والتصرف (PDCA)."],"rat":null,"fa":"من اجل زيادة الفرص وزيادة القيمة التجارية عند بناء نموذج اولي يجب ان يكون التركيز على قيمة الأعمال","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":333,"q":"A company wants to increase the commercial value of one of its products in a highly competitive market. In order to do this, the company commissions a project to create a prototype. The team constructs the prototype incrementally.\nWhich action should the project manager take as a priority?","t":"S","o":["Emphasize the use of Kanban methodology.","Ensure the project sponsor is aware of the go-to market date","Deliver business value as soon as possible.","Implement a plan-do-check-act (PDCA) cycle"],"c":[2],"f":"In order to increase opportunities and increase business value when building a prototype the focus must be on business value","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":436}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع يقود مشروع تطوير برمجيات في بيئة هجينة. أثناء تخطيط المشروع ، حدد مدير المشروع خطرًا حيث قد لا يتوفر مورد تقني لعنصر مسار هام عند الحاجة. قبل أسبوع واحد من الحاجة إلى المورد ، كان لدى المهندس الفني حالة طوارئ شخصية واضطر إلى أخذ إجازة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["راجع متطلبات العمل مع أصحاب المصلحة واستبعد المهمة المعينة للمورد التقني.",". استشر سجل المخاطر للحصول على استجابة مناسبة للمخاطر مخطط لها وتنفيذها","حديث تقرير الدروس المستفادة وسجل المخاطر لتوضيح أن هذه المخاطر قد تحققت.","قم بمراجعة خطة إدارة المشروع وانقل المهمة إلى وقت يكون فيه المورد التقني متاحًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":334,"q":"A project manager leads a software development project in a hybrid environment. During project planning, the project manager identified a risk where a technical resource for a critical path item may not be available when needed. One week before the resource is needed, the technical engineer had a personal emergency and had to take a leave.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Review the business requirement with stakeholders and exclude the task assigned to the technical resource","Consult the risk register for an appropriate planned risk response and implement.","Update the lessons learned report and the risk log to reflect that this risk has materialized.","Revise the project management plan and move the task to a time when the technical resource will be available."],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager identified a risk where a technical resource for a critical path item may not be available when needed So the project manager should Consult the risk register for an appropriate planned risk response and implement.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":437}},{"qa":"اعتمد الفريق للتو نهجًا رشيقًا. خلال اجتماعات الاستعداد اليومية ، أعرب الفريق عن مخاوفه بشأن تأخيرات المهام. عمل قائد المشروع مع مالك المنتج لتوضيح الميزات. طلب قائد المشروع من الفريق التتابع السريع لجميع ميزات المنتج لضمان التسليم. يتم الانتهاء من التكرارات  ولكن مع ميزات أقل أو جودة منخفضة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله قائد المشروع لضمان النجاح؟","oa":["مكّن الفريق من تحسين عملياتهم وأدواتهم وتفاعلاتهم ليكونوا أكثر فعالية في التسليم وإزالة العوائق","توجيه الفرق إلى الحلول الممكنة التي تساعد في إزالة العوائق والمساهمة في التسليم في الوقت المناسب","أقترح على الفريق إضافة عوائق كعناصر عمل في سجل أعمال المنتج ليتم إصلاحها في التكرارات التالية","أطلب من الفريق إنشاء سجل للعوائق وإبقائه محدثًا لاستخدامه في تخطيط التكرار التالي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":335,"q":"A team has just adopted an agile approach. During daily standup meetings, the team expressed concerns about task delays. The project leader worked with the product owner to get clarity on the features. The project leader asked the team to fast-track all product features to ensure delivery. Sprints are being completed but with either fewer features or low quality. What should the project leader have done to ensure success?","t":"S","o":["Empowered the team to improve their processes, tools, and interactions to be more effective in delivery and removing impediments","Directed teams to possible solutions that help in removing the impediments and contribute to a timely delivery","Suggested to the team to add impediments as work items in the product backlog to be fixed in the next sprints","Asked the team to create an impediment log and keep it updated for use in the next sprint planning"],"c":[0],"f":"Project leader/ Scrum master is servant leader so he should empower the team to solve to improve their processes. The team in agile approach is self organized.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":438}},{"qa":"يواجه أحد أعضاء فريق المشروع صعوبة في تسليم المهام المعينة لمشروع معرض لخطر التأخير. القضية الأساسية هي أن عضو الفريق لا يفهم النظام الجديد الذي تم تنفيذه مؤخرًا. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع","oa":["اطلب من عضو الفريق تعلم النظام الجديد كتدريب على رأس العمل","إصدار طلب تغيير لتمديد الجدول الزمني للمشروع","تصعيد أداء عضو الفريق إلى راعي المشروع","قم بتعيين مورد متمرس لدعم عضو الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":336,"q":"A project team member is having difficulty delivering assigned tasks for a project that is at risk of being delayed. The main issue is that the team member does not understand a new system that was recently implemented.\nWhat should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Ask the team member to learn the new system as on-the-job training.","Issue a change request to extend the project schedule","Escalate the team member's performance to the project sponsor","Assign an experienced resource to support the team member"],"c":[0],"f":"The Best option (Ask the team member to learn the new system as on-the-job training. )","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":439}},{"qa":"أثناء التكرار الثالث للمشروع ، يطلب مالك المنتج ميزة إلزامية أخرى. حدث هذا أيضًا في النكرارين السابقين ، مما أدى إلى فشل وتسبب في إحباط داخل الفريق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["دعوة لعقد اجتماع داخلي لمناقشة التغييرات وقيمتها","اطلب من مالك المنتج إعطاء الأولوية للعمل المتراكم مع فريق المشروع","اطلب من فريق سكرم تحديد أولويات تراكم المنتج","قم بدمج التغييرات في آخر تكرار قبل الإصدار الأول"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":337,"q":"During the third iteration of a project, the product owner requests another mandatory feature. This also happened in the previous two sprints, which resulted in failure and caused frustration within the team. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Call for an internal meeting to discuss the changes and their value","Ask the product owner to prioritize the backlog with the project team","Request the scrum team to prioritize the product backlog","Incorporate the changes in the last sprint before the first release"],"c":[0],"f":"The team could've accepted the PO's requests previously without analyzing the impact of the changes, which resulted in failures. This time the team should discuss the changes first and then make a proper decision. Also in accordance Agile principles, the team shouldn't accept any new features in the middle of the sprint.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":440}},{"qa":"تقوم شركة بتنفيذ مشروع مع أعضاء الفريق الموجودين في بلدان ومناطق زمنية مختلفة. الأداء الفردي مرضٍ ، لكن أداء الفريق ككل منخفض ، خاصة فيما يتعلق بالأنشطة الجماعية. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تسهيل التواصل وبناء الفريق","تفاوض مع أعضاء فريق جدد","مراجعة وإعادة تعيين مهام الفريق","مراجعة وتحديث خطة إدارة الاتصالات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":338,"q":"A company is implementing a project with team members located in different countries and time zones. Individual performance is satisfactory, but the team's performance as a whole is low, especially in terms of group activities.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Facilitate communication and team building","Negotiate for new team members","Review and reassign team assignments","Review and update the communications management plan"],"c":[0],"f":"As group activities performance is low and team members located in different countries and time zones, thus they need more chances to communicate, team building is a good idea. Good communicate will improve team work as agroup","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":441}},{"qa":"أعرب فريق المشروع عن قلقه من أن بعض أعضاء الفريق البعيدين غير قادرين على التعاون مع فريق المشروع الأكبر بسبب جدول عملهم. مدير المشروع مرتبك لأن الفريق بأكمله يقع في نفس المنطقة الزمنية ويعتقد أن هناك عوامل أخرى تلعب دورًا. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك?","oa":["افحص احتياجات الفريق الافتراضية","نفِّذ خيارات جديدة","تصحيح انتهاكات القواعد العامة","مراجعة الأداء بشكل رسمي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":339,"q":"A project team has expressed concern that certain remote team members are not able to collaborate with the larger project team due to their work schedule. The project manager is confused since the entire team is located in the same time zone and believes there are other factors at play.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Examine the team's virtual needs","Implement new options","Rectify ground rule violations","Review performance formally"],"c":[0],"f":"Project manager need to find out (examine) the issues first before you can rectify anything. It may just be technical issues or other things","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":442}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع مع فريق العميل على مشروع جديد. لا تزال بعض تعريفات ومتطلبات المنتج غير واضحة ، لكن العميل يريد بدء الأنشطة في أسرع وقت ممكن. تتوقع المنظمة أيضًا تسليم المنتج في تاريخ محدد بسبب متطلبات تنظيمية. نظرًا لطبيعة المشروع ، قرر مدير المشروع استخدام نهج هجين. لماذا اختار مدير المشروع نهج هجين؟","oa":["سيسمح النهج المختلط بإدارة متطلبات عدم اليقين بالإضافة إلى تقييد التاريخ","سيسمح النهج المختلط لمدير المشروع بمراجعة مواصفات المنتج","سيمكن النهج المختلط من بدء أنشطة المشروع على الفور ويسمح بوضع خطة لتعريفات المتطلبات","سيضمن النهج المختلط إنجاز تاريخ التسليم وسيزيل الشكوك حول المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":340,"q":"A project manager is working with a customer's team on a new project. Some product definitions and requirements are still not clear, but the customer wants to start activities as soon as possible. The organization is also expecting product delivery for a specific date due to a regulatory requirement. Due to the nature of the project, the project manager has decided to use a hybrid approach.\nWhy did the project manager choose a hybrid approach?","t":"S","o":["A hybrid approach will allow for management of the requirement uncertainties as well as the date restriction","A hybrid approach will allow the project manager to revise the product specifications","A hybrid approach will enable project activities to start immediately and allow for a plan for the requirements definitions","A hybrid approach will ensure the delivery date is accomplished and will eliminate product uncertainties"],"c":[2],"f":"Without knowing what is the requirement, as a project manager you cannot plan or schedule. Scope of a project comes from requirements. Schedule development can only be done scope is defined and validated - because it is Hybrid.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":443}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع هو جزء من فريق يطلق سلسلة من الميزات للتوافق مع لائحة جديدة. الفريق لديه 6 أسابيع فقط لإصدار الميزات للتطبيقات القديمة. أثناء اجتماع الوقوف اليومي ، أشار مهندس برمجيات إلى أن تطوير ميزة مهمة قيد الانتظار حتى يكمل المصمم المعين مهمة معينة. هذا التأخير هو عائق خطير للوفاء بتاريخ الإصدار. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قابل مدير فريق التصميم لإبلاغهم بالوضع الحالي وطلب مصمم إضافي","اطلب من مهندس البرمجيات المضي قدمًا دون استكمال الميزة المهمة","قابل المصمم لمشاركة الحالة الحالية وتطوير حل لإكمال المهمة","اتصل بمدير فريق التصميم واطلب إعادة النظر في قائمة الأولويات بناءً على الموقف الأخير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":341,"q":"A project manager is part of a team that is launching a series of features to comply with a new regulation. The team has only 6 weeks to release the features to the legacy applications. During the standup meeting, a software engineer indicated that the development of an important feature is on hold until the assigned designer completes a specific task. This delay is a serious road block to meeting the release date. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Meet with the design team manager to inform them of the current status and request an additional designer","Ask the software engineer to move forward without completing the important feature","Meet with the designer to share the current status and develop a solution to complete the task","Contact the design team manager and ask to reconsider the priority list based on the latest situation"],"c":[2],"f":"Always prefer face to face discussion. And involve the person/team. Team are self organized","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":444}},{"qa":"يقوم الفريق بتسليم ميزات للعميل في كل تكرار. بعد الانتهاء من كل تكرار ، تتم دعوة العميل للمراجعة. ومع ذلك ، غالبًا ما يكون العميل غير متاح وغالبًا ما يتم تأخير المراجعة ، مما يؤدي إلى زيادة إعادة العمل للفريق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من العميل توضيح جميع المتطلبات في بداية كل تكرار","اطلب من العميل مراجعة المخرجات في كل تكرار بناءً على توفرها","قم بتضمين العميل في أنشطة المشروع اليومية للحصول على التوجيه المطلوب","خطط مسبقًا وحدد أفضل طريقة لمراجعة الإنجازات مع العميل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":342,"q":"A team is delivering features to a customer at every iteration. After completing each iteration, the customer is invited for a review. However, the customer is frequently not available and the review is often delayed, which results in increased rework for the team. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Request the customer to clarify all requirements at the start of each iteration","Ask the customer to review the deliverables in each iteration based on their availability","Include the customer in daily project activities to gain the required guidance","Plan ahead and define the best way to review the deliverables with the customer"],"c":[3],"f":"It is important for the project manager to plan ahead and find a way to review the deliverables with the customer that is efficient and effective, despite the customer's availability. This could involve scheduling regular review sessions in advance, using online collaboration tools to facilitate remote reviews, or finding other ways to ensure that the customer is able to provide timely feedback. By proactively addressing the issue of customer availability, the project manager can help to minimize rework and ensure that the team is able to make progress efficiently.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":445}},{"qa":"سيقوم فريق المشروع المكون من أربعة أعضاء من الفريق بطرح تطبيق على مستوى الشركة لكل من الموظفين والمقاولين في بلد ما. للتسليم ضمن الأطر الزمنية الصارمة ، يجب التعاقد مع شركة محلية ماهرة في نشر التطبيقات وإدارة التغيير.\nما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتمكين الشركة المحلية؟","oa":["ابدأ في طرح التطبيق من خلال إدارة المقاول بالتفصيل","إدارة التوقعات والاتفاق على المتطلبات التي سيقدمها المقاول تحت إشراف مدير المشروع","حدد التوقعات واتفق على المتطلبات التي سيقدمها المقاول بتقارير مرحلية دورية","نشر موظفي المقاول تحت إشراف مدير المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":343,"q":"A project team consisting of four team members will be rolling out a company-wide application to both staff and contractors in a country. To deliver within strict the time lines, a local company skilled in application deployment and change management will need to be contracted.\nWhat should the project manager do to empower the local company?","t":"S","o":["Begin to roll out the application by micromanaging the contractor","Manage expectations and agree on the requirements that the contractor will deliver under the supervision of the project manager","Set expectations and agree on the requirements that the contractor will deliver with periodic progress reports","Deploy the contractor's staff under the supervision of the project manager"],"c":[1],"f":"Project manager should Manage expectations and agree on the requirements that the contractor will deliver under the supervision of the project manager","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":446}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يدير مشروع بناء يواجه تحديات. هناك تجاوز للجدول الزمني ، وتجاوز للتكلفة ، والعميل غير راضٍ عن تقدم النطاق المحدد. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["اتخذ إجراءات لتقليل تجاوز التكلفة","راجع نطاق المشروع وأهدافه","فرض شرط الجزاء على المورد","العمل مع العميل على استكمال النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":344,"q":"A project manager is managing a construction project that is facing challenges. There is schedule overrun, cost overrun, and the client is unhappy with the specific scope progress. What should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Take action to reduce the cost overrun","Review the scope and project objectives.","Enforce the penalty clause on the supplier","Work with the client on the scope completion"],"c":[1],"f":"If the Customer is unhappy about the scope it's better review it","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":447}},{"qa":"فريق مشروع موزع جغرافيًا ، يستمر أعضاء فريق المشروع في إرسال تقارير الحالة بالبريد الإلكتروني وتحديث الجداول الزمنية بعد مناقشات الاجتماع الأسبوعية. ومع ذلك ، يواجه الفريق صعوبة في تتبع التغييرات والتقدم المحرز. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تطوير برنامج إدارة المستندات للتحكم في الإصدار","حافظ على تحكم منفصل في المستندات عبر المناطق لتجنب التناقضات","تسهيل التدريب على التحكم في الإصدار وعناصر المشروع","احتفظ بمستودع مركزي للقطع الأثرية (النتاجات) بنظام تحكم في الإصدار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":345,"q":"In a geographically distributed project team, the project team members continue to email status reports and update schedules after their weekly meeting discussions. However, the team is having difficulty tracking the changes and progress made.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Develop a document management software for version control","Maintain separate document control via regions to avoid discrepancies.","Facilitate training on version control and project artifacts.","Maintain a central repository of artifacts with a version control system"],"c":[3],"f":"The correct Answer ( Maintain a central repository of artifacts with a version control system)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":448}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع يعتبر فيه التعاون مع الشركة عاملاً رئيسياً بالغ الأهمية. مدير المشروع غير متأكد من الطريقة التي يجب استخدامها. تم تعيين مدير مشروع أول لمساعدة مدير المشروع. ما هي النصيحة التي يجب أن يقدمها مدير المشروع الأول؟","oa":["وضع منهجية لإدارة المشروع تتطلب من العميل تقديم تحديثات يومية للفريق","اقترح استخدام نهج رشيق نظرًا لأن تعاون العملاء والفريق أمر بالغ الأهمية لنجاح المشروع","قدم نموذجًا لإدارة المشروع لمدير المشروع ليتبعه كدليل","اعمل مع مدير المشروع لتطوير نهج جديد من شأنه أن يعود بالفائدة على المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":346,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to a project where collaboration with the business is a critical key factor. The project manager is not sure about which approach to use. A senior project manager has been assigned to help the project manager. What advice should the senior project manager provide?","t":"S","o":["Establish a project management methodology that requires the customer to provide daily updates to the team","Suggest using an agile approach since customer and team collaboration is critical for project success","Provide a project management template for the project manager to follow as a guide","Work with the project manager to develop a new approach that will bring benefits to the project"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword (collaboration with the business is a critical key factor) so the Agile approach is the best .\nAgile Values \n\n Individuals and interactions over processes and tools.\n Working software over comprehensive documentation.\n Customer collaboration over contract negotiation.\n Responding to change over following a plan","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":449}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يدير مشروعًا كبيرًا. اكتشف أحد أصحاب المصلحة للتو خطرًا جديدًا لم يتم تحديده في المراحل السابقة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["أكد لأصحاب المصلحة أن سجل المخاطر قد تم استكماله والمصادقة عليه من قبل جميع أصحاب المصلحة","قم بإجراء تحليل للمخاطر مباشرة مع أصحاب المصلحة الذين رفعوا مستوى المخاطر وقم بتحديث سجل المخاطر","أضف المخاطر إلى سجل المخاطر وأعد تقييم السجل بمساعدة فريق المشروع وأصحاب المصلحة","إبلاغ المخاطر للجنة التوجيهية وطلب خطة التخفيف من الإدارة العليا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":347,"q":"A project manager is managing a large project. A stakeholder has just discovered a new risk that has not been identified in earlier stages. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Confirm to the stakeholder that the risk register has been completed and validated by all stakeholders","Perform a risk analysis directly with the stakeholder who raised the risk and update the risk register","Add the risk to the risk register and reevaluate the register with help from the project team and stakeholders","Communicate the risk to the steering committee and request a mitigation plan from senior management"],"c":[2],"f":"Any new risk that is discovered, the project manager must add / update the risk register and then conduct a risk analysis to prioritize the risks to develop effective response plans for the risks according to their priorities","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":450}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق سكروم بتحليل مخطط الإنهيار في اليوم الرابع من التكرار لمدة 15 يومًا. يظهر الرسم البياني للحرق التنازلي أدناه. ماذا يجب أن يفعل الفريق بعد ذلك؟","oa":["اطلب من فريق المشروع اختيار أي قصص إضافية حيث أن لديهم سعة إضافية مما هو مخطط له","استمر في عمل التكرار كما هو مخطط واستمر في المراقبة","استمر في التكرار حيث يظهر التقدم طرق للانقطاعات المحتملة","اسأل مالك المنتج إذا كان من الممكن قطع بعض القصص ذات الأولوية المنخفضة من التكرار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":348,"q":"A Scrum team is analyzing the burndown chart on day four of a 15-day sprint. The burndown chart is shown below. What should the team do next?","t":"S","o":["Ask the project team to select any additional stories as they have additional capacity than planned","Continue with the sprint work as planned and keep monitoring","Continue with the sprint as the progress shows buffers for potential interruptions","Ask the product owner if some low-priority stories could be cut from the sprint"],"c":[1],"f":"It's just day 4 of 15 days sprint. it's too early to take any action. Monitoring will be appropriate","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":451}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع يغلق مشروعًا ويستعد لتسليمه إلى فريق العمليات. أثناء التسليم ، تم تقديم فاتورة متأخرة بتكلفة أعلى من المخطط لها مقابل أعمال المشروع. ونتيجة لذلك ، تأخر تسليم المشروع وزادت تكاليف إنجاز المشروع المبلغ عنها. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذا الموقف؟","oa":["أشرك الفريق المالي وناقش المشكلة مع البائع","مراجعة التكلفة الإجمالية الملتزم بها مقابل التكلفة التي تم تحرير فواتير بها عند إقفال المشروع","يتم التقاط ومراجعة جميع أعمال المشروع والتكاليف ذات الصلة بانتظام","إخطار جميع البائعين بالمواعيد النهائية للفواتير وعدم الدفع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":349,"q":"A project manager is closing a project and preparing to hand it over to the operations team. During handover, a delayed invoice was submitted with a higher-than- planned cost against the project work. Consequently, project handover was delayed and the project's reported completion costs were increased. What should the project manager have done to avoid this situation?","t":"S","o":["Involved the finance team and discussed the issue with the vendor","Reviewed the total committed cost against the cost invoiced at project closing","Captured and reviewed all of the project work and related costs regularly","Notified all vendors about the invoicing and nonpayment deadlines"],"c":[2],"f":"The project manager should Captured and reviewed all of the project work and related costs regularly to avoid the delay and increasing of cost.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":452}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع مع فريق مشروع رشيق في موقع مشترك يعمل معًا لفترة طويلة بما يكفي ليكون في مرحلة أداء تطوير الفريق. تسبب حدث غير متوقع في تشتيت الفريق وأصبحوا غير قادرين الآن على العمل في موقع مشترك.\nما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله للحفاظ على أداء الفريق بأكبر قدر ممكن من الفعالية؟","oa":["قم بتزويد الفريق ببرنامج تعاون افتراضي وتدريب على البرنامج لتقليل الانقطاع","تحويل الفريق من نهج رشيق إلى نهج تنبؤي لتحسين التحكم في الأداء","اطلب من راعي المشروع وأصحاب المصلحة التنفيذيين تشجيع الفريق على الحفاظ على أدائهم","قم بتقييم أداء المشروع والتدخل إذا انخفض الأداء إلى مستوى غير مقبول"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":350,"q":"A project manager is working with a co-located agile project team that has worked together long enough to be in the performing phase of team development. An unforeseen event has caused the team to be dispersed and they are now unable to co-locate. What should the project manager do to keep the team performing as effectively as possible","t":"S","o":["Provide the team with virtual collaboration software and training on the software to minimize disruption","Transition the team from an agile approach to a predictive approach for better performance control","Ask the project sponsor and executive stakeholders to encourage the team to maintain their performance","Evaluate project performance and step in if performance decreases to an unacceptable level"],"c":[3],"f":"The team is in the performing stage of Tuckman, they are self-organizing and they can work through issues smoothly and effectively. What the Project manager need to do is monitor their performance to be sure they are still performing as they usually do, and, if there is a drop in performance, the team will be notified, and they will discuss to proffered a solution to the drop in performance","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":453}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بمراجعة متطلبات برنامج كبير. ما هي المتطلبات التي يجب على فريق المشروع تحديدها من أجل تجنب الغرامات","oa":["تأسيس عمليات الشركة","الامتثال للوائح الجديدة","تطوير خطوط إنتاج جديدة","اعتماد المنتجات المستدامة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":351,"q":"A project manager is reviewing the requirements of a large program.Which requirements should the project team prioritize to avoid getting fines","t":"S","o":["Establishing company processes","Complying with new regulations","Developing new product lines","Certifying sustainable products"],"c":[1],"f":"Complying with new regulations to avoid getting fines","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":454}},{"qa":"يتم تعيين مدير المشروع لمشروع تطوير البرمجيات الحرج. يستخدم الفريق نهجًا هجينًا وتم تقسيم التطوير إلى أربعة تكرارات. في نهاية التكرار الثالث ، يكتشف مدير المشروع أن القيمة المكتسبة  هي 500000 دولار أمريكي والقيمة المخططة  هي 550،000 دولار أمريكي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اضبط الميزانية","أعرض تعويم","التتابع السريع  للمشروع","اضبط الخط الزمني للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":352,"q":"A project manager is assigned to a critical software development project. The team is using a hybrid approach and has divided development into four sprints. At the end of sprint three, the project manager discovers that the earned value (EV) is US$500,000 and the planned value (PV) is US$550,000.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Adjust the budget","Introduce a float","Fast track the project","Adjust the project time line"],"c":[2],"f":"SPI = EV/ PV. EV(US$500,000) / PV(US$550,000) = 0.9 So current SPI is < 1. It means behind schedule So the best option is Fast track the project","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":455}},{"qa":"خلال ورشة العمل الدروس المستفادة ، ذكر أحد أصحاب المصلحة أن المشروع لم ينجح لأنه لم يقدم القيمة التجارية المتوقعة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع لمعالجة هذا القلق","oa":["مراجعة خطة إدارة الاتصالات مع أصحاب المصلحة","راجع خطة تحقيق فوائد الأعمال مع أصحاب المصلحة","مراجعة ميزانية خطة إدارة المشروع مع أصحاب المصلحة","مراجعة مهام خطة إدارة المشروع مع أصحاب المصلحة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":353,"q":"During the lessons learned workshop, one stakeholder mentioned that the project was unsuccessful as it did not deliver the expected business value.\nWhat should the project manager do to address this concern","t":"S","o":["Review the communications management plan with the stakeholders","Review the business benefits realization plan with the stakeholders","Review the project management plan budget with the stakeholders","Review the project management plan tasks with the stakeholders"],"c":[1],"f":"BENEFITS REALIZATION PLAN: A document outlining the activities necessary for achieving the planned benefits","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":456}},{"qa":"يوجد تعارض في مشروع رشيق حول العمليات التنظيمية وكثير منها لا يضيف أي قيمة للمشروع. لحل هذه المشكلة ، يجب اعتبار أي مما يلي ذو أولوية قصوى","oa":["احتياجات المنظمة","احتياجات العميل","إدارة احتياجات المشروع","احتياجات القيادة الرشيقة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":354,"q":"There is a conflict on an agile project about following organizational processes, many of which do not add any value to the project.\nTo resolve this, which one of the following should be regarded with the highest priority","t":"S","o":["Needs of the organization","Needs of the customer","Needs of the project manage","Needs of the agile lead"],"c":[1],"f":"One of the agile principle is customer satisfaction","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":457}},{"qa":"يستخدم فريق المشروع إحدى أدوات الإدارة المرئية لتحديد التبعيات. تم تحديد أن المعرفة بالمجال من فريق واحد يجب مشاركتها مع فريق آخر لضمان استمرارية الإنجازات. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["أعد توزيع أعضاء الفريق بحيث تتوفر المعرفة في كلا الفريقين","اطلب من الفرق المعنية التخطيط لجلسات تبادل المعرفة","إزالة التبعية لإزالة الحاجة إلى مشاركة المعرفة","ادمج كلا الفريقين في فريق واحد حتى تكون المعرفة متاحة بشكل عام"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":355,"q":"A project team is using one of the visual management tools to identify dependencies. It was identified that domain knowledge from one team needs to be shared with another team to ensure the continuity of deliverables.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Redistribute the team members so knowledge is available in both teams","Request the respective teams to plan for knowledge-sharing sessions","Remove the dependency to eliminate the need for knowledge sharing","Merge both teams into one team so the knowledge is commonly available"],"c":[1],"f":"The correct Answer (Request the respective teams to plan for knowledge-sharing sessions)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":458}},{"qa":"أفاد أحد أعضاء الفريق الذي يعمل على تسليم مشروع هام أن جهاز الكمبيوتر الخاص به لا يعمل. يقول قسم تكنولوجيا المعلومات أنه بسبب عبء العمل الكبير ، لن يتمكنوا من تقديم المساعدة لمدة أسبوع واحد. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع معالجة هذا الموقف؟","oa":["اطلب من عضو الفريق إيجاد حل مبتكر أو حل بديل للتغلب على المشكلة وتجنب التأخير في المشروع","استكشف الخيارات مع قسم تكنولوجيا المعلومات لتسريع الإصلاحات اللازمة بناءً على أهمية المشروع","حدد موعدًا لعقد اجتماع مع راعي المشروع لطلب ميزانية لشراء أو استئجار جهاز كمبيوتر جديد","استخدم احتياطيات المشروع لشراء معدات جديدة لتجنب التأثير على المسار الحرج للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":356,"q":"A team member who is working on a critical project deliverable reported that their computer is not working. The IT department says that due to a high workload, they will not be able to provide assistance for 1 week.\nHow should the project manager address this situation?","t":"S","o":["Ask the team member to find an innovative solution or workaround to overcome the issue and avoid project delays","Explore options with the IT department to expedite the necessary repairs based on criticality of the project","Schedule a meeting with the project sponsor to request a budget to buy or rent a new computer","Use project reserves to buy new equipment to avoid an impact to the critical path of the project"],"c":[1],"f":"The correct Answer (Explore options with the IT department to expedite the necessary repairs based on criticality of the project)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":459}},{"qa":"يقود مدير المشروع فريقًا من الأفراد المتنوعين من جميع الأعمار. تم تحديد ساعات العمل للمشروع في بداية المشروع ، واتفق جميع أعضاء الفريق على الساعات. ومع ذلك ، في وقت لاحق من المشروع ، أبلغ أحد أعضاء الفريق مدير المشروع أن الساعات المتفق عليها مسبقًا لم تعد تعمل بسبب الالتزامات الشخصية لعضو الفريق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["مساعد الفريق على إعادة تعريف الحد الأدني من المنتج قابل للأستخدام","التحقق من صحة أهداف التكرار مع العميل","دعوة العميل للاجتماعات اليومية","تغيير مدة التكرارات لتقديم قيمة أكبر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":357,"q":"A project manager is leading a team of diverse individuals of all ages. The working hours for the project were set at the beginning of the project, and all team members agreed to the hours. However, later in the project, one of the team members informed the project manager that the previously agreed upon hours no longer work due to the team member's personal commitments.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Helped the team redefine the MVP","Validated the iteration goals with the customer","Invited the customer to the daily meetings","Changed the duration of iterations to deliver more value"],"c":[1],"f":"The Correct Answer (Validated the iteration goals with the customer)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":460}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع في منظمة هرمية. اعتاد أعضاء فريق المشروع على إخبارهم بما يجب عليهم فعله ، وتشمل مراجعات الأداء النسبة المئوية لإكمال المهام المخصصة. بعد محادثة مع الراعي ، يدرك مدير المشروع أنه يحتاج إلى إعادة تعيين مهمتين لتلبية المرحلة التالية. يمكن أن يُنظر إلى هذا التغيير على أنه أداء ضعيف من قبل المكلفين الحاليين. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من عضو الفريق الأقل خبرة بشكل خاص التوقف عن العمل في المهمة وإبلاغ عضو آخر بالفريق بأنه قد تمت إعادة تعيين العمل","اطلب من عضو الفريق الأكثر خبرة بشكل خاص تولي المهمة وإبلاغ أعضاء الفريق الآخرين بأنه قد تم إعادة تعيين العمل","قم بتنظيم اجتماع فريق لإبلاغ أعضاء الفريق بالتغيير في الاتجاه والعمل معهم لتغيير تخصيص المهام","قم بتنظيم اجتماع للفريق وأبلغ أعضاء الفريق أنهم ، بصفتهم الشخص المسؤول عن التسليم ، قرروا تغيير تخصيص المهام"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":358,"q":"A project manager works in a hierarchical organization. The project team members are used to being told what to do, and the performance reviews include the percentage of completion of the allocated tasks. After a conversation with the sponsor, the project manager realizes that they need to reassign a couple of tasks to meet the next milestone. This change can be perceived as poor performance by the current assignees.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Ask the less experienced team member privately to stop working on the task and inform another team member that the work has been reassigned","Ask the more experienced team member privately to take the task and inform the other team members that work has been reassigned","Organize a team meeting to inform team members about a change in direction and work with them to change the task allocation","Organize a team meeting and inform the team members that, as the person accountable for delivery, they decided to change the task allocation"],"c":[2],"f":"The Correct Answer (Organize a team meeting to inform team members about a change in direction and work with them to change the task allocation)","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":461}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لقيادة فريق المشروع في بيئة مختلطة. يعمل الفريق على مجموعة من المشاريع الهامة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لضمان البيئة المناسبة والسلطة المناسبة لتسليم المشاريع بشكل فعال؟","oa":["قم بتعيين فريق مشروع منظم ذاتيًا لا يتأثر بالعوامل التنظيمية","وضع خطة مفصلة لإدارة المشروع لمشاركتها مع موارد المشروع","إنشاء لجنة توجيهية للمشروع تتماشى مع الهياكل التنظيمية الحالية","وضع سجل مخاطر مفصل ومشاركته مع جميع أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":359,"q":"A project manager has just been hired to lead a project team in a hybrid environment. The team is working on a group of critical projects.\nWhat should the project manager do to ensure the right environment and authority are in place to effectively deliver the projects?","t":"S","o":["Appoint a self-organizing project team that is not influenced by organizational factors","Develop a detailed project management plan to share with project resources","Create a project steering committee aligned with existing organizational structures.","Develop a detailed risk log and share it with all of the project stakeholders"],"c":[2],"f":"The Correct Answer (Create a project steering committee aligned with existing organizational structures.)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":462}},{"qa":"مشروع نظام إدارة المباني  في مرحلة التشغيل وسيبدأ تسليمه إلى فريق العمليات قريبًا. ومع ذلك ، أشار مدير المشروع إلى أن كلاً من فرق المشروع والتشغيل غير قادرين على تشغيل نظام إدارة المباني بشكل صحيح. نتيجة لذلك ، هناك خطر متزايد من تأخر الجدول الزمني للمشروع. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذا الموقف؟","oa":["تخصيص فريق مخصص للتسليم في المراحل الأولى من المشروع","تخصيص الموارد المناسبة للتدريب على أنظمة إدارة المباني في خطة المشروع","جمع الفريقين معًا في اجتماع مشترك لحل المشكلة","أجرى بعض التعديلات على نظام إدارة المباني لتكون أكثر ملاءمة للفرق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":360,"q":"A building management system (BMS) project is in its commissioning phase and handover to the operations team will commence soon. However, the project manager noted that both the project and operation teams are not able to properly operate the BMS. As a result, there is an increased risk of the project schedule being delayed.\nWhat should the project manager have done to avoid this situation?","t":"S","o":["Allocated a dedicated handover team at early stages of the project","Allocated proper resources for training on BMS in the project plan","Brought both teams together in a joint meeting to resolve the issue","Made some adjustments to BMS to be more suitable for the teams"],"c":[1],"f":"The questions get tricky sometimes with the end, I think thats really the trick to beating this exam. This particular question asks \"What should they have done?\" Not \"What should they do\" or \"what should they do next\" The issue is that neither of them know how to operate it. If this was a design flaw that made it over-complicated, that would be an issue where the team could get with operations and train them, but the issue here is that its such a complex software by nature that the team can build it but not know how to operate it/how things interact with each other.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":463}},{"qa":"بسبب عملية الاندماج والاستحواذ في الشركة ، تم تغيير صاحب المصلحة الرئيسي في مشروع مهم ، ويشكو صاحب المصلحة الجديد هذا من عدم علمه بالتأخير في المشروع الذي كان بقية أصحاب المصلحة على علم به. تتم مشاركة جميع الاتصالات حول المشروع عبر البريد الإلكتروني في بداية كل أسبوع. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع معالجة هذا الموقع؟","oa":["أرسل دليلًا إلى صاحب المصلحة الجديد بأن حالة المشروع قد تم إرسالها وفقًا للجدول الزمني","اقترح أن يقوم صاحب المصلحة الجديد بمراجعة حالة المشروع قبل اجتماع مجلس الإدارة التالي","ناقش متطلبات المشروع مع صاحب المصلحة الجديد ، وقم بتحديث خطة إدارة الاتصالات","شارك خطة إدارة الاتصالات مع صاحب المصلحة الجديد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":361,"q":"Due to a company merger and acquisition process, the main stakeholder of a critical project has been changed.This new stakeholder complains that they were unaware of a delay on the project of which the rest of the stakeholders were aware. All the communications about the project are shared via email at the start of every week. How should the project manager address this situaion?","t":"S","o":["Send evidence to the new stakeholder that the project's status was sent according to the schedule","Suggest that the new stakeholder review the project status before the next board meeting","Discuss project requirements with the new stakeholder, and update the communications management plan","Share the communications management plan with the new stakeholder"],"c":[2],"f":"New stakeholder complains that they were unaware of a delay on the project So the project manager should Discuss project requirements with the new stakeholder, and update the communications management plan","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":464}},{"qa":"عيّن إيهاب كمدير مشروع في شركة متعددة الجنسيات لتنفيذ برنامج جديد من شأنه التأثير على أقسام الخدمة. لضمان مواءمة توقعات أصحاب المصلحة مع المنتج النهائي ، ما الذي يجب أن يطوره إيهاب؟","oa":["مصفوفة تقييم مشاركة أصحاب المصلحة","خطة إشراك أصحاب المصلحة","دراسة الأعمال","هيكل تجزئة الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":362,"q":"Ehab has assigned as a project manager im a multinational company to implement new software that will impact serveral departments. To guarantee alignment of stakeholder expectations with th final product , what should Ehab develop?","t":"S","o":["Stakeholder engagement assessment matrix","Stakeholder engagement plan","Business Case","Resources breakdown structure (RBS)"],"c":[1],"f":"Stakeholder engagement plan: identifies the management strategies and actions required to effectively engage stakeholders. The stakeholder engagement plan provides guidance and information on managing stakeholder expectations. The stakeholder engagement plan include specific strategies or approaches for engaging with individuals or groups of stakeholders.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":465}},{"qa":"أحد عوامل نجاح المشروع هو مستوى مشاركة أصحاب المصلحة. أي مما يلي هو سمة صاحب المصلحة الداعم في المشروع؟","oa":["غير مدرك للتأثيرات المحتملة","تشارك بنشاط في نجاح المشروع","مدرك للتأثيرات المحتملة ولكنه مقاوم للتغيير","مدرك للتأثيرات المحتملة وداعم للتغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":363,"q":"One of the factors in making a project successful is stakeholder engagement level. Which of the following is the characteristic of a supportive stakeholder on a project ?","t":"S","o":["Unaware of potential impacts","Actively engaged in project success","Aware of potential impacts but resistant to change","Aware of potential impacts and supportive to change"],"c":[3],"f":"Stakeholders Level of Engagement\n- Unaware. Unaware of project and potential impacts.\n- Resistant. Aware of project and potential impacts and resistant to change.\n- Neutral. Aware of project yet neither supportive nor resistant.\n- Supportive. Aware of project and potential impacts and supportive to change.\n- Leading. Aware of project and potential impacts and actively engaged in ensuring the project is a success.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":466}},{"qa":"استقال مؤخرًا أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين في مشروع البناء الخاص بك من مهامه لأسباب شخصية. ماذا يجب أن تفعل بعد ذلك كجزء من إدارة المعنيين؟","oa":["قم بإزالة جميع التغييرات المقترحة من قبل المعنيين","تحديث سجل المعنيين","تواصل مع الراعي","فتح تحقيق في استقالته"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":364,"q":"A key stakeholder in your construction project has recently resigned from his duties due to personal reasons. What should you do next as part of stakeholder management?","t":"S","o":["Remove all changes suggested by the stakeholder","Update stakeholder register","Contact the sponsor","Initiate an investigation into his resignation"],"c":[1],"f":"When stakeholders are no longer involved in the project, you should update the stakeholder register to remove them from the project.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":467}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع تم تعيينه مؤخرًا في نزاع دائم مع مدير أول. نظرًا لأن هذا ليس مثاليًا للفريق ، فإن مدير المشروع يريد أعادة حل هذا الأمر. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تصعيد المشكلة إلى راعي المشروع","اطلب التوجيه من مديري المشاريع الآخرين","استعن بمساعدة وسيط محايد","اطلب اجتماعات مجدولة وجهًا لوجه مع المدير الأول"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":365,"q":"A recently appointed project manager is in constant conflict with a senior manager . Since this is not ideal for the team , the project manager wants to resolve this. What should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Escalate the issue to the project sponsor","Seek guidance from other project managers","Enlist the help of a neutral mediator","Request scheduled face-to-face meetings with the senior manager"],"c":[0],"f":"Keywords(A recently-conflict with a senior manager-the project manager wants to resolve).\nIt is obvious that you will choose the answer scheduled face-to-face meetings with the senior manager , but you need to read the question again - A recently appointed project manager and the conflict with the senior manager, that is, he may has authority over the project manager himself, and it was not clarified in the question what kind of organizational structure is it (Projectized / functional) in addition to the question It says resolve so the best option in this case if the problem is out of control or authority of the project manager's is escalation","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":468}},{"qa":"أنت دائمًا ما تكافح من أجل توفير الموارد لمشروعك حيث يتم مشاركتها عبر مشاريع مختلفة. الي من يجب أن تصعد هذة المشكلة؟","oa":["مكتب إدارة المشاريع","الراعي","قسم الموارد البشرية","المدير التنفيذي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":366,"q":"You are always struggling with resource supply for your project as they are shared across various projects. Who should you escalate this isse to","t":"S","o":["PMO","The sponsor","HR department","Executive manager"],"c":[0],"f":"Shared resources are usually administered by PMO.\nPMO: A structure to support decision making and delivery of change work within the organisation. PMOs are constantly evolving as organizations try to ensure that the PMO meets the needs of the organization. It is not enough to see the PMO within the context of a project management office supporting a particular project. It is much better to envision the PMO as the structure put in place to carry out projects for the entire organization. This may happen through a permanent PMO or via multiple offices (portfolio offices, program offices or project offices) which may be permanent or temporary. The focus is on providing central and local services.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":469}},{"qa":"لقد تم تعيينك مدير مشروع داخل منظمة نظم المعلومات. أنت لست على دراية بسياسات وإجراءات المنظمة. إذا كنت تريد معرفة المزيد عن إجراءات إدارة المشكلات العامة في المنظمة ، فأي مما يلي يجب عليك مراجعته؟","oa":["العوامل المحيطة بالمشروع","أصول العمليات التنظيمية","سجل المشكلة","خطة إدارة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":367,"q":"You have been appointed a project manager within an information systems organization. You arenot aware of the organization's policies and procedures. If you want to know more about the organization's general issues management procedures, which of the following should you review?","t":"S","o":["Enterprise Environmental Factors(EFFs)","Organizational Process Assets (OPAs)","Issue log","Project Management Plan"],"c":[1],"f":"If you are a new manager.\n\nYou find yourself in a new company.\n\nThe culture is different. The processes and policies are unlike anything you’re used to.\n\nTo make things more complicated, you have a team that expects you to provide strong leadership and stakeholders who expect reports on your progress.\nOrganizational process assets are tangible resources used by an organization to guide the management of its projects and operations. They include things like templates, contracts, processes, reports, and financial statements.\n\nAccording to The Standard for Project Management and A Guide to the Project Management Body of Knowledge (PMBOK Guide), “Organizational Process Assets (OPAs) are the plans, processes, policies, procedures, and knowledge bases specific to and used by the performing organization. These assets influence the management of the project. Organizational process assets include any artifact, practice, or knowledge from any or all of the performing organizations involved in the project that can be used to execute or govern the project. The organizational process assets also include the organization’s lessons learned from previous projects and historical information. Organizational Process Assets may include completed schedules, risk data, and earned value data.”","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":470}},{"qa":"في منتصف المشروع ، تتم ترقية مدير وحدة الأعمال الذي يتفاعل بانتظام مع فريق مدير المشروع إلى منصب إداري أعلى. المدير البديل من نفس الوحدة وهو على دراية بالمشروع إلى حد ما.بعد الحصول على مزيد من المعلومات حول المدير الجديد ، ما هي الخطوة التالية لمدير المشروع؟","oa":["أرسل إلى المدير الجديد نسخة من ميثاق المشروع لضمان فهم أهداف المشروع","حدد موعدًا لاجتماع مع المدير الجديد لمناقشة خطة فريق تحليل الأعمال","قم بتحديث سجل المعنيين  وخطة إشراك المعنيين لتشمل المدير الجديد","اتصل بمدير وحدة الأعمال السابق لمعرفة المزيد عن المدير الجديد."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":368,"q":"In the middle of a project , a business unit manager who regularly interacts with the project manager's team is promoted to a higher management position . The replacement manager is from the same unit and is somewhat familiar with the project.\nAfter getting more information about the new manager , what is the project manager's next step?","t":"S","o":["Send the new manager a copy of the project charter to ensure the project objectives are understood","Schedule a meeting with the new manager to discuss the business analysis team's plan","Update the stakeholder register and the stakeholder engagement plan to include the new manager","Contact the previous business unit manager to learn mire about the new manager."],"c":[2],"f":"Through your reading of such a question, you find the answer clear. The question says that the business unit manager who interacts regularly with the project manager team is promoted to a higher administrative position. Here he interacts regularly, that is, affects the project, and as long as he affects the project, she is among those Stakeholders The question also clarifies that he has been promoted to an administrative position The highest, then, here means a change in the level of power, so we must update and put a plan for it, any strategies.Do not forget, my dear brother, that the project management professional exam relies heavily on understanding, and if you focus on understanding, the exam will become very easy and very interesting. No matter how difficult the questions are, it will not affect your passing the exam.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":471}},{"qa":"في مشروع عالمي ، يتعين على مدير المشروع تخطيط وإدارة الاتصال بين أعضاء الفريق وأصحاب المصلحة من أجل ضمان بقاء المشروع على المسار الصحيح وتحقيق أهدافه ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["ضع في اعتبارك الاختلاف الثقافي بين أصحاب المصلحة","جدولة التدريب على الاتصال لأصحاب المصلحة على مستوى الإدارة","عقد اجتماع تكامل بين جميع أصحاب المصلحة","فهم كيف يمكن للجوانب السياسية أن تؤثر على المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":369,"q":"In a global project , the project manager has to plan and manage communication between the team members and stakeholders in order to ensure the project will remain on track and achieve its goals. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Consider cultural difference among stakeholders","Schedule communication training for management level stakeholders","Conduct an integration meeting among all stakeholders","Understand how political aspects can affect the project"],"c":[0],"f":"The question here focuses on ensuring that the project stays on track and achieves its goals. In addition to a global project, the project manager must plan and manage communication between team members - communication here is the answer to the question. We are in a different environment and we plan to communicate between the team so the project manager must differences between cultures to ensure success. .","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":472}},{"qa":"أي من الأنشطة التالية هو الأكثر أهمية الذي يجب القيام به للمساعدة في إدارة اجتماع المشروع؟","oa":["حدد الاجتماع بمدة زمنية محددة","إنشاء واتباع جدول الأعمال","تأكد من أن كل حاضر لديه فرصة للتحدث","متابعة بنود العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":370,"q":"Which of the following activities is the most important to perform to help manage a project meeting ?","t":"S","o":["Limit the meeting to a specific length of time","Create and follow an agenda","Ensure that every attendee has a chance to speak","Follow up on action items"],"c":[1],"f":"The meeting agenda sets the tone , the length,and the format of how the meeting will be conducted. Using a formal agenda makes it easy to create meeting minutes and followup actions items after the meeting","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":473}},{"qa":"تم مؤخراً تعيين المهندس رمضان مفتاح مديراً لمشروع إنشاء مركز تسوق جديد. يشتبه المهندس رمضان في وجود مواد في المبنى قد تشكل خطراً صحياً جسيماً. ماذا يجب أن يفعل المهندس رمضان؟","oa":["إجراء التحكم المتكامل في التغيير","استعن بخبير للتحقق في المواد الخطرة","تنفيذ خطة الاستجابة للمخاطر","تقييم المخاطر وتحديث سجل المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":371,"q":"Eng.Ramadan Mouftah has recently been assigned as the project manager for a new shopping mall construction project. Eng.Ramadan suspects that there are materials in the building that may be a serious health hazard. What should Eng.Ramadan do?","t":"S","o":["Perform integration change control","Hire a hazardous materials expert to investigate","Implement the risk response plan","Asses the risk and update the risk register"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword (suspect) so, the first step you should Hire a hazardous expertto carry out inspection. The project manager can stop the work immediately if the scenario mentioned (ensure) not suspect.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":474}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع لمشروع تكنولوجيا البرمجيات في منظمة مصفوفي مع فرق افتراضية. لسوء الحظ ، يقوم المدير الوظيفي بإبلاغ مدير المشروع بأنه قد لا تتوفر أي موارد متاحة لاختبار البرنامج. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["المشاركة مع المدير الوظيفي لمناقشة التفاصيل للحصول على الدعم المطلوب","ناقش متطلبات الاختبار في الاجتماع الأسبوعي للمشروع للتفاوض بشأن أفضل نهج لاختبار البرنامج","إرسال بريد إلكتروني إلى أخصائي المشتريات للتفاوض مع شركة متخصصة في اختبار البرامج","اطلب اجتماعًا عبر الهاتف مع الراعي لتقديم طلب تغيير للسماح لفريق التطوير بإجراء الاختبار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":372,"q":"A project manager for a software technology project works in a matrixed organization with virtual teams. Unfortunately, the functional manager informs the project manager that there may not be any resources available to test the software. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Engage with the functional manager to discuss details to obtain the required support","Discuss testing requirements at the weekly project meeting to negotiate the best approach to test software.","Send an email to the procurement specialist to negotiate with a company that specializes in software testing","Request a teleconference meeting with the sponsor to submit a change request to allow the development team to conduct testing"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager works in a matrix organization, meaning the decision is based on consultation and participation, and it is taken between the project manager and the functional manager. So, the project manager should engage with the functional manager to discuss the details.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":475}},{"qa":"يحضر مدير المشروع اجتماعًا مرحليًا مع أحد العملاء. يطلب العميل تغيير التصميم الذي من المحتمل أن يضيف قيمة إلى المشروع. ما هو الإجراء الذي يجب أن يتخذه مدير المشروع","oa":["استشر أعضاء الفريق واسمح لهم باتخاذ القرار","استيعاب طلب التغيير بما يخدم احتياجات العميل","اتخاذ القرارات المتعلقة بالصفقة والتي تركز على أهداف المشروع","إقناع العميل بعدم إجراء تغييرات على المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":"في هذا السيناريوا من السؤال المطروح فأن أفضل أختيار هو استشر الفريق لتمكين الفريق من اتخاذ قرارات","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":373,"q":"A project manager is attending a progress meeting with a client . The client requests a design change which might potentially add value to the project. What action should the project manager take","t":"S","o":["Consult with team members and allow them to make a decision","Accommodate the change request to serve the client's needs","Make transactional decisions focusing on the project goals","Convince the client not to make changes to the project"],"c":[0],"f":"In this scenario of the question being asked, the best option is to consult the team to enable the team to make decisions","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":476}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع مؤخرًا لمشروع جديد. عندما يلتقي مدير المشروع بفريق المشروع لأول مرة ، يخبر الفريق مدير المشروع أن جميع خطط ومستندات الإدارة الخاصة بالمشروع مفقودة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بإنشاء خطط إدارة المشروع مع فريق المشروع وشارك المستندات مع المعنيين","تكييف خطط إدارة المشروع والوثائق من المشاريع المنفذة السابقة لتوفير الوقت","اطلب من المعنيين تطوير جميع عناصر المشروع حتى يتمكن فريق المشروع من مواصلة أنشطتهم المجدولة","استمر في العمل على المهام المجدولة لتجنب تأخير المشروع وترك تطوير عناصر المشروع في وقت لاحق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":374,"q":"A project manager has recently assigned to a new project. When the project manager first meets the project team , the team tells the project manager that all of the management plans and documents for the project are missing . What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Create the project management plans with the project team and share the documents with the stakeholders","Adapt the project management plans and documents from previous executed projects in order to save time","Ask the stakeholders to develop all of the project artifacts so the project team can continue their scheduled activities","Continue working on scheduled tasks to avoid delaying the project and leave the development of the project artifacts for later"],"c":[0],"f":"In this question, it is mentioned that all plans and documents are missing, so the project manager must create them and participate with those involved in the project to review and evaluate them.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":477}},{"qa":"لقد شكل موقف عصيب بعض التحديات للفريق. يلاحظ مدير المشروع سلوكًا متسلسلًا في بعض أعضاء الفريق ، وقد بدأ ينتشر عبر المجموعة. يحتاج مدير المشروع إلى تدريب الفريق على تغيير طريقة تفكيرهم من أجل زيادة الكفاءة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["الاجتماع مع الفريق لمناقشة السلوك الصحيح والمتوقع في المواقف العصيبة والبدء في ممارستها","خلق بيئة من الاحترام والإنصاف حتى يتمكن الفريق من زيادة أداء مشروعهم في المواقف العصيبة.","ضمان اهتمام الناس ببعضهم البعض والعمل معًا بشكل فعال من خلال إدارة الفريق الفعال"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":375,"q":"A stressful situation has presented some challenges for the team. The project manager notices strees behavior in some of the team members, and it is beginning to spreed across the group. The project manager needs to coach the team to change their mindset in order to more efficient. What should the project manager do","t":"S","o":["Meet with the team to discuss the correct, expected behavior in stressful situations and start practicing it","Create an environment of respect and fairness so the team can increase their project performance is stressful situations.","Ensure the people care about each other and work effectively together through effective team management"],"c":[1],"f":"In this scenario from the question asked, the best choice is to create an environment where the team can adapt with changes and stressful situations needs as a project manager to change the mindset and this needs to create an environment of cooperation and fairness\nOption(Establish a productive environment where all team members can assist one another with the workload) Already it is a productive environment like many environments that exist in the world, but there are conflicts between the team. There are suspicions and psychological wars that create a threat and It is indeed a productive environment like many environments that exist in the world, but there are conflicts between the team. There are suspicions and psychological wars that can pose a threat and create stressful situations. Therefore, to change the mentality, you start by changing the environment and in it there is respect and fairness. Why? to increase performance in difficult situations? Here is the answer (creating an environment of respect and fairness So that the team can increase their project performance in stressful situations.) Related to the question","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":478}},{"qa":"يتطلب المشروع شراء كمية كبيرة من المعدات التي يجب أن تكون في الموقع قبل أن يبدأ أي نشاط آخر. قسم المشتريات لديه عملية موافقة طويلة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["استخدم المعدات الموجودة واستبدلها لاحقًا بالمعدات الجديدة","اتصل بالمورد الذي قدم معدات مماثلة لمشروع سابق","اطلب من راعي المشروع تسريع عملية اختيار البائعين","اعمل مع فريق المشتريات لإيجاد خيارات بديلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":376,"q":"A project requires the procurement of a large a,ount of equipment that needs to be on site before any other activity can begin. The procurement department has a lengthy approval process. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Use the existing equipment and replace it later with the new equipment","Contact the vendor that supplied similar equipment for a previous project","Ask the project sponsor to expedite the vendor selection process","Work with the procurement team to find alternative options"],"c":[3],"f":"In this scenario, although the procedures are lengthy and may take a lot of time, and may pose a danger in the event of a delay in the project, so we should not take the procurement procedure without participation and consultation. Here, the skills of the project manager appear in working with the team, communicating with the departments, and finding alternative solutions.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":479}},{"qa":"المشروع حاليا في طور التنفيذ. نظرًا لتعقيد المشروع والعدد الكبير من المتطلبات التنظيمية المعنية ، يقرر مدير المشروع إجراء مراجعة إدارية مع كبار المديرين التنفيذيين لضمان التنفيذ الناجح لمخرجات المشروع. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع مراجعته أثناء المراجعة الإدارية لضمان فعالية الاجتماع؟","oa":["المقاييس ومؤشرات الأداء الرئيسية تعكس موضوعيا حالة التسليمات","النواتج التي تعمل بشكل جيد وتلك التي تحتاج إلى مزيد من العمل","التغييرات المحتملة في إستراتيجية المشروع وردود الفعل من كبار المديرين التنفيذيين","تقارير متخصصة تم إنشاؤها خصيصًا للاجتماع وفقًا لتوجيهات راعي المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":377,"q":"A project is currently in the execution phase. Because of the complexity of the project and the large number of regulatory requirements involved, the project manager decides to hold a management review with senior executives to ensure the successful implementation of project deliverables. What should the project manager review during the management review to ensure the meeting is effective?","t":"S","o":["Metrics and key performance indicators (KPIs) that objectively reflect the status of deliverables","The deliverables that are performing well and those that need more work","Potential changes to the project's strategy and the feedback from senior executives","Specialized reports created specifically for the meeting as per directions from the project sponsor"],"c":[0],"f":"In this scenario, as a project manager, you must choose metrics that reflect the status of the deliverables. It might be metrics such as number of defects and percentage of completion.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":480}},{"qa":"تحدث اجتماعات تقدم المشروع عبر مكالمات جماعية افتراضية. في كل اجتماع يتعلق بتقدم المشروع ، يقوم أحد أعضاء الفريق باستمرار بمقاطعة الآخرين أثناء المناقشات. غالبًا ما لا تتاح الفرصة لأعضاء الفريق الآخرين للتحدث أو إكمال تفسيراتهم. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["إدارة الوقت بكفاءة باستخدام جدول الأعمال واطلب من كل مشارك المساهمة","ابدأ الاجتماع بمراجعة القواعد الأساسية ، وأهداف الاجتماع ، وجدول الأعمال","تحدث بشكل فردي مع عضو الفريق الذي يعطل المحادثات دائمًا","تحدث بشكل فردي مع أعضاء الفريق الذين لا يشاركون في المحادثات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":378,"q":"Project progress meetings occur via virtual conference calls. In every project progress meeting, one team member continuously interrupts others during discussions. Other team members often have no opportunity to talk or complete their explanations. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Manage time efficiently using the agenda and ask each participant to contribute","Start the meeting with a review of the ground rules, meeting objectives,and the agenda","Speak individually with the team member who always disrupts the conversations","Speak individually with the team members who do not participate in conversations"],"c":[1],"f":"In this scenario, as a project manager, you should start with the general rules for preventing interruptions. The general rules are guidelines agreed upon by the meeting participants in order to make the meeting more productive and enjoyable.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":481}},{"qa":"اشتكى أحد أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع من أنهم لم يتلقوا تسليمًا مهمًا تم ذكره في الجدول. أوضح عضو الفريق المسؤول عن هذا التسليم أنهم أرسلوا بريدًا إلكترونيًا إلى أصحاب المصلحة ، لإعلامهم بأن الناتج لن يتم تسليمه في الوقت المحدد. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذا الموقف؟","oa":["تأكد من أن عضو الفريق لم يتواصل مباشرة مع أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع","أخبر عضو الفريق بإرسال التسليم غير النهائي إلى صاحب المصلحة ووضع اللمسات الأخيرة عليه لاحقًا","التواصل مع أصحاب المصلحة مباشرة فيما يتعلق بتأخير التسليم","أكد أن صاحب المصلحة كان على علم بتأخير التسليم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":379,"q":"A project stakeholder complained that they didn't receive an important delivery that was stated in the schedule. The team member responsible for this deliverable explained that they sent an email to the stakeholder, adivising them that the deliverable would not be delivered on time. What should the project manager have done to avoid this situation?","t":"S","o":["Ensured that the team member didn't communicate directly with the project stakeholder","Told the team member to send the unfinished deliverable to the stakeholder and finalize it later","Communicated with the stakeholder directly regarding the delivery delay","Confirmed that the stakeholder was made aware of the delivery delay"],"c":[3],"f":"In this scenario, as a project manager, you must confirm that the dispatch has been completed. The option may be to review the communication management plan, but it is not among the options. Therefore, the best answer according to the specified options is confirm that the (stakeholder) is aware of the delivery delay.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":482}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بمراجعة مسودة ميثاق المشروع مع المعنيين الرئيسيين. أثناء الاجتماع ، يحدث تعارض بين الراعي وصاحب المنتج. كيف يجب أن يتعامل مدير المشروع مع الموقف؟","oa":["استمر في الاجتماع واستخدم تقنيات التيسير لتحسين التواصل داخل الفريق","أستمر في الاجتماع واطلب من راعي المشروع ومالك المنتج إنهاء مناقشتهما بعد الأجتماع في الموقع","قم بتأجيل الاجتماع ودعوة خبير في الموضوع للانضمام إلى الاجتماع التالي","قم بتأجيل الاجتماع واطلب من راعي المشروع ومالك المنتج إجراء مناقشتهما في وضع عدم الاتصال"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":380,"q":"A project manager is reviewing a draft o the project charter with key stakeholders. During the meeting, a conflict occurs between the sponsor and the product owner. How should the project manager deal with the situation?","t":"S","o":["Continue the meeting and use facilitation techniques to improve communication within the team","Continue the meeting and ask the project sponsor and product owner to take their discussion offline","Postpone the meeting and invite a subject matter expert to join the next meeting","Postpone the meeting and ask the project sponsor and product owner to take their discussion offline"],"c":[0],"f":"In this scenario as a project manager he must use facilitation skills to improve communication among the team","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":483}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع مع أعضاء الفريق والعملاء الذين يعملون في بلدان متعددة. يعمل الفريق على تنفيذ تقنية جديدة تتضمن الغموض والشكوك وغير معروفة ، سواء من حيث التكنولوجيا أو توقعات المستخدم النهائي لهذا الحل. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله للحفاظ على مشاركة المعنيين؟","oa":["استخدم البريد الإلكتروني كقناة اتصال","استخدم منصة تعاون مشتركة","استخدم أدوات التغذية الراجعة واتخاذ القرار","استخدم الاجتماعات كقناة اتصال"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":381,"q":"A project manager is working with team members and customers who are operating in multiple countries. The team is working is working on implementating a new technology that includes ambiguities , uncertainties, and unkowns, both in terms of technology and of the end-user expectations for this solution. What should the project manager do keep the stakeholders engaged?","t":"S","o":["Use email as a communication channel","Use a shared collaboration platform","Use feedback and decision making tools","Use meetings as a communication channel"],"c":[1],"f":"This is a figure that shows a joint collaboration platform, which is one of the smart ways that the project manager must apply. It is just a platform that enables geographically distributed teams to communicate, share, update information directly, and transfer information between devices. We can make decisions based on the existing data, which is provided by the teams and has forms and names according to company","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":484}},{"qa":"خلال مرحلة تنفيذ المشروع ، يتعارض اثنان من أعضاء الفريق مع أعضاء الفريق الآخرين على المستويين الفني والشخصي. ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه أولاً لمعالجة هذا التعارض (اختر اثنين)","oa":["قم بمعالجة الصراع أثناء اجتماعات الفريق للفريق بأكمله للمشاركة والعثور على الحلول","قم بالتصعيد لإدارة الموارد البشرية لان هي الجهه المختصة بالتعيين","رتب اجتماعات فردية مع أعضاء الفريق الذين لا يستطيعون العمل معًا بشكل فعال","ناقش الصراع مبكرًا بين أعضاء الفريق المتأثرين باستخدام نهج تعاوني مباشر","خطط لحل نزاعات أعضاء الفريق بعد التكرار وركز على تحقيق الهدف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":382,"q":"During a project's execution phase, two team members are having conflicts with other team members within on technical and interpersonal levels . Which two actions should the project manager take first to address this conflict (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Address the conflict during team meetings for entire team to participate and find solutions","Escalate to the Human Resources Department because it is the competent authority for appointment","Arrange individual meetings with team members who can not work together effectively","Discuss the conflict early among the affected team members using a direct,collaborative approach","Plan to resolve the team members' conflicts after the sprint and focus on achieving the goal"],"c":[2,3],"f":"Phase: Execution\nDecision: Make a decision to address conflicts within the team So the best options are \n\nArrange one-on-one meetings with team members who cannot work together effectively. \n\nDiscuss conflict early among affected team members using a direct, collaborative approach","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":485}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ مشروع معقد ، يواجه مدير المشروع العديد من طلبات التغيير من فرق مختلفة. قد تؤدي هذه التغييرات إلى عدم تلبية المشروع لأهدافه. كيف يجب أن يضمن مدير المشروع أن هذه التغييرات تدار بشكل فعال؟","oa":["قم بمراجعة خطة إدارة المشروع والاتصالات مع صاحب المصلحة الرئيسي","ارفض طلبات التغيير واستمر في تسليم المشروع كما هو مخطط له","راجع الأولويات مع مالك المنتج لتضمين التغييرات في سجل أعمال المنتج","سجل التغييرات باستخدام سجل المخاطر واستمر في المراقبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":383,"q":"During the execution of a complex project , the project manager encounters numerous change requests from various teams. These changes may result in the project not meetig its objectives. How should the project manager ensure that these changes are managed effectively","t":"S","o":["Review the project and communications management plan with the main stakeholder","Deny the change requests and keep delivering the project as planned","Review priorities with the product owner to include the changes in the backlog","Record the changes using the risk register and continue monitoring"],"c":[2],"f":"According to scenario, the changes did not achieve the project goals and it is required that he wants to ensure that the changes are managed effectively. Therefore, according to the agile approach, the project manager should review the priorities with the product owner to include the requirements in the product backlog.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":486}},{"qa":"يحلل مدير المشروع مخطط التدفق التراكمي ويحدد عنق الزجاجة في أنشطة الاختبار من فريق منظم ذاتيًا. بعد مناقشته مع الفريق ، يتم تحديد فجوة تتعلق باختبار المهارات. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لمعالجة المشكلة؟","oa":["قم بضم عضو جديد في فريق المشروع لديه مهارات اختبار","اطلب من فريق التطوير الإبطاء حتى يتمكن المختبرين من اللحاق بالركب","قم بتوفير التدريب للفريق بأكمله حتى يتمكنوا من إجراء الاختبارات","دعم الفريق لتحديد نهج لحل المشكلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":384,"q":"A project manager analyzes the cumulative flow chart and identifies a bottleneck in the testing activities from a self-organizing team. After discussion it with the team , a gap related to testing skills is identified . What should the project manager do to address the issue?","t":"S","o":["Onboard a new project team member who has testing skills","Ask the development team to slow down do the testers can catch up","Provide training to the entire team so they will be able to perform tests","Support the team to identify an approach to resolve the problem"],"c":[3],"f":"According to scenario, the team is self-organised, so the role of the project manager is to support the team to solve the problem. The option of including a new member of the team is not a correct choice, because the team must be multi-skilled and have the ability to solve the problem. It is not always if we encounter a problem that we assign or transfer it to a third party. Training may be A good way, but to improve performance, keep in mind that any company should be keen on training to improve the skills and knowledge of the employee on the current job and development to improve the skills and knowledge of the employee on the new job. For example, Fahd, if he is a project manager, the company should put a training program for him to improve his skills and knowledge of project management and according to For the company to see that one day Fahd will become a consultant with the Ministry, it must set a program for him as a project manager to improve his skills and knowledge regarding consulting, even if he becomes a consultant, he becomes competent for this position.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":487}},{"qa":"يتولى مدير مشروع خارجي إدارة إنشاء مكاتب شركة جديدة لشركة كبيرة. تنص خطة إدارة المشروع على أنه من الضروري التعاقد مع مورد خارجي مدرب تدريباً عالياً لمراجعة عنصر مهم في المشروع والتحقق من صحته. رفض العميل التعاقد مع المورد الخارجي بسبب التكلفة العالية ، حتى وإن كان ضمن ميزانية المشروع. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لحل هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["تقييم العواقب ومقابلة العميل لشرح السيناريوهات المحتملة","توظيف المورد من أجل تحقيق أهداف المشروع","اطلب من العميل عقد اجتماع واشرح له أنه لن يتم تنفيذ المهمة","حاول إنجاز المهمة داخليًا عن طريق تسوية الموارد في مشاريع أخرى"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":385,"q":"An external project manager is managing the construction of new corporate offices for a large company . The project management plan states that it is necessary to contract a highly trained external resource to revise and validate an important project component . The client has rejected hiring the external resource because of the high cost , even though it is within the project budget. What should the project manager do to resolve this issue?","t":"S","o":["Evaluate the consequences and meet with the client to explain the possible scenarios","Hire the resource in order to achieve the project objectives","Ask the client for a meeting and explain that the task will not be performed.","Try to accomplish the task internally by leveling resources from other projects"],"c":[0],"f":"According to this scenario, the customer refuses to contract with the external resource, even if it is within the budget, which means that he refuses this resource and any external resource, and the customer is one of the key stakeholders, and the goal of any company is customer satisfaction So the project manager should evaluate the consequences and meet with the client to explain the possible scenarios.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":488}},{"qa":"كان على مدير المشروع جدولة جلسات تخطيط إضافية لإضافة متطلبات من المعنيين الدوليين. أعرب المعنيين عن قلقه بشأن المنتج الذي لا يلبي احتياجات العميل. ما العامل الذي يجب على مدير المشروع مراعاته عند تطوير المنتج؟","oa":["مصفوفة المسؤولية","موقع المعنيين","احتياجات المعنيين","توافر الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":386,"q":"A project manager had to schedule additional planning sessions to add requirements from an international stakeholder. The stakeholder expressed concern about the product not meeting the client's needs. Which factor should the project manager have considered when developing the product?","t":"S","o":["Responsibility matrix","Stakeholder's location","Stakeholder's needs","Availability of resources"],"c":[2],"f":"To meet the needs of the client, the project manager should focus on stakeholder's needs, as it is the most important factor because the needs are translated into goals and plans to achieve them","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":489}},{"qa":"في منتصف الطريق خلال تنفيذ مشروع رشيق ، هناك تحول في الأهداف الاستراتيجية على المستوى لتعزيز التحول الرقمي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["قم بإعداد قصة مستخدم للتعامل مع التغيير وقم بتعيينها للتكرار التالي","التصعيد إلى مالك المنتج وإلغاء التكرارات القادمة","حدد موعدًا لعقد اجتماع مع الفريق لتقييم تأثير التغيير","قم بتحديث سجل أعمال المنتج ذات الأولوية للمخاطر بالتغيير الاستراتيجي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":387,"q":"Midway through the execution of an agile project, there is a shift in the strategic objectives at the level to promote digital transformation. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Prepare a user story to handle the change and assign it to the next iteration","Escalate to the product owner and cancel the upcoming iterations","Schedule a meeting with the team to assess the impact of the change","Update the risk prioritized backlog with the strategic change"],"c":[2],"f":"According to the scenario that there is a change and transformation of the digital systems, then the project manager must first meet with the project team for evaluation","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":490}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير مشروع المورّد وفريقه بتنفيذ حل برمجي عبر المؤسسة. يطالب أحد أصحاب المصلحة من العملاء الذي لم يكن حاضرًا أثناء عملية البيع بأن يقوم الفريق بتنفيذ متطلبات خارج النطاق دون تكلفة إضافية للمشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["اضبط النطاق الأساسي وجدولة الأساس وفقًا لذلك","نفذ جميع المتطلبات التي طلبها العميل","قم بإحالة صاحب المصلحة إلى مواصفات التسليم في بيان العمل","تصعيد موضوع المتطلبات الإضافية لفريق القيادة التنفيذية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":388,"q":"A vendor project manager and team are implementing a software solution across the organization. A customer stakeholder who was not present during the sales process is demanding that the team implement requirements that are out of scope without additional cost to the project. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Adjust the scope baseline and schedule the baseline accordingly","Implement all the requirements the customer has requested","Refer the stakeholder to the delivery specifications in the statement of work","Escalate the issue of the additional requirements to the executive leadership team"],"c":[2],"f":"Statement Of Work (SOW) include the Quality level and specifications , and the Quality desired","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":491}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع يدير مشروعًا لتطوير أداة جديدة بسبب المشروع ، يقرر مدير المشروع استخدام نهج رشيق. تصبح إحدى المخاطر المحددة مشكلة عندما يكتشف مدير المشروع أن شركة أخرى حصلت على براءة اختراع لأداة مشابهة جدًا. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لمعالجة هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["إجراء الشركة المالكة لبراءة اختراع الأداة المماثلة لمقارنة أوجه التشابه والاختلاف مع المشروع الحالي","تعليق المشروع وأعفاء الموارد من المهام حتى يتم حل المشكلة","أبلغ مالك المنتج وقم بتسجيل المشكلة في سجل المخاطر للمراقبة عن كثب للخطوات التالية","حدد موعدًا لاجتماع مع المعنيين المهمين لمراجعة المشكلة واتخاذ قرار بشأن الخطوات التالية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":389,"q":"A project manager is managing a project to develop a new tool because of the project, the project manager decides to use an agile approach . One of the identified risks becomes an issue when the project manager finds out that another company patented a very similar tool. what should the project manager do to address this issue?","t":"S","o":["Conduct the company that owns the patent of the similar tool to compare the similarities and differences with the current project","Put the project on hold and release the resources until the issue is resolved","Inform the product owner and log the issue in the risk register to monitor closely for next steps","Schedule a meeting with critical stakeholders to review the issue and decide on the next steps"],"c":[3],"f":"Agile is based on the principle of transparency, so it should be uncover issues and reviewed with stakeholders to make a decision","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":492}},{"qa":"اكتشف فريق المشروع أن آخر تسليم من مورد يفتقد مكونًا بالغ الأهمية ، والذي من المحتمل أن يؤخر المشروع علي الرغم من الإجراءات التصحيحية المتخذة . ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع ؟","oa":["قم بصياغة خطاب تحذير إلى البائع واطلب من أصحاب المصلحة الداخليين التعليق ، واطلب دعم أصحاب المصلحة لمحاسبة البائع","حدد أسوأ سيناريو ، ضعه في سجل مخاطر المشروع ، شارك السجل مع جميع أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع ، وأطلق تنبيهًا","اتصل بمديري الأقسام الذين تم تحديدهم على أنهم أصحاب مصلحة ، ويطلبون القلق ، ويقدمون تحديثًا للوضع","اطلب من المورد تحديد أصحاب المصلحة المتأثرين ، وإنشاء خطة عمل وتحديد تاريخ التنفيذ"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":390,"q":"The project team finds the latest delivery from a vendor is missing a critical component , which will likely delay the project in split of corrective measures. What should the project manager do to communicate this message?","t":"S","o":["Draft a warning letter to the vendor ask internal stakeholders to comment, and solicit stakeholder support to hold the vendor accountable","Identify the worst case scenario , put it into the project risk register, share the register with all project stakeholders, and raise an alert","Contact department managers who are identified as stakeholders, solicit concern , and provide update to the situation","Ask the vendor to identify the stakeholders affected , create an action plan and determine an implementation date"],"c":[3],"f":"The vendor was the reason for missing a component, and it may lead to a delay. So, there is risk . What is the the response? We will invite the vendor . We meet and determine who will be affected. We agree on an action plan and set the date so as not to cause delay in the project.\nAlways in the real exam, choose the answer using the linking strategy, link the question with what corresponds to the answer without delving into the answer. In this question, there is a resource that will have a reason for the occurrence of risk and the possibility of delay. Should we leave it like this or take a proactive action for that vendor and put a plan for the risk and set a time to prevent it Delay . If there is a problem with the team in the scenario of the question, we will meet with the team. These are successful strategies in passing the real exam.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":493}},{"qa":"بعد مرور عام على تنفيذ تغيير في السياسة لتحسين التنوع والشمول داخل فريقين ، هناك صراع متزايد داخل الشركة ، ما الذي كان يجب فعله لمنع هذا الصراع؟","oa":["كان يجب على المنظمة تقديم مفهوم التنوع على نطاق واسع","يجب أن تكون الإدارات الهامة في المنظمة قد شاركت في هذا التمرين","يجب أن يعمل فريق القيادة بشكل وثيق مع فريق التسويق للحصول على نظرة ثاقبة","يجب توفير تدريب التنوع على مستوى المنظمة للقوى العاملة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":391,"q":"A year after implementing a policy change to improve diversity and inclusion within two teams , there is increasing conflict within the company what should have been done to prevent this conflict?","t":"S","o":["The organization should have introduced the concept of diversity broadly","The critical departments in the organization should have been involved in this exercise","The leadership team should have worked closely with the marketing team to get insight on","Organization -wide diversity training should have been provided to the workforce"],"c":[3],"f":"Conflicts increase with diversity policy, so to treat these conflicts, training should be done to work in a diverse environment at the level of the organization to improve capabilities","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":494}},{"qa":"يواجه مدير المشروع تأخيرات في مهمتين مهمين سيتم تنفيذهما بواسطة فريقين مختلفين. يدرك مدير المشروع أن المدير الوظيفي لهذين الفريقين في نزاع لم يتم حله وأنهما لا يتواصلان بشكل صحيح. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتقييم تأثير التأخير على المشروع وابحث عن بدائل لإنشاء خطة أصلاحية","التواصل مع راعي المشروع فيما يتعلق بضرورة حل الخلاف بين المديرين","رتب اجتماعًا مع المديرين وحاول الوصول إلى اتفاق","قابل كلا الفريقين ومديريهما وحاول معرفة السبب الجذري للصراع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":392,"q":"The project manager is experiencing delays with two critical tasks that are to be executed by two different teams. The project manager realizes that the functional manager of those two teams have an unsolved conflict and they are not communicating proprly. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Evaluate the impact of the delay on the project and look for alternatives to create a remediation plan","Communicate with the project sponsor regarding the need to resolve the conflict between the managers","Arrange a meeting with the managers and try to reach agreement","Meet with both teams and their managers and try to figure out the root cause of the conflict"],"c":[2],"f":"To treat ongoing conflict problems is to meet with the parties to the conflict and reach a solution. Therefore, the best strategies for conflicts are problem-solving / cooperation","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":495}},{"qa":"حدد أحد أعضاء فريق المشروع عيبًا في تصميم الحل الأولي لمشروع ما. المعنيين ليسوا متأكدين مما إذا كان سيتم نشر النظام أم لا. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اقتراح إعادة تصميم حل للمشروع","مراجعة قياسات ضبط الجودة بالمشروع","تطوير أستراتيجية التخفيف بناءً على تصميم الحل","قم بإجراء تحليل للمخاطر مقابل هذه المشكلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":393,"q":"A project team member identified a defect in the initial solution design for a project . The stakeholders are not sure whether to deploy the system or not. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Propose a solution redesign for the project","Revise the project's quality control measurements","Develop a mitigation based on the solution design","Perform risk analysis against the issue"],"c":[2],"f":"Stakeholders are not sure whether to deploy the system or not So the project manager should Develop a mitigation based on the solution design","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":496}},{"qa":"بدأ مدير المشروع مشروعًا جديدًا ويجب عليه التأكد من أن أعضاء الفريق وأصحاب المصلحة مدربين تدريباً كافياً. بعد مقابلة مع الفريق ، يكتشف مدير المشروع أن جميع الموارد لديها خبرة في منهجيات رشيقة مختلفة ، فما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تعليم الفريق منهجية واحدة رشيقة بشكل كامل","تخطي التدريب لأن الفريق يفهم بالفعل أجايل","تأكد من أن الفريق لديه فهم مشترك عن أجايل","تأكد من أن فريق المشروع على دراية بجميع تقنيات أجايل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":394,"q":"The project manager started a new project and must ensure that the team members and stakeholders are adequately trained . After an interview with the team , the project manager discovers that all resources have experience in different agile methodologies what should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Teach one agile methodology fully and completely","Skip the training because the team already understands agile","Ensure the team has a common understanding of agile","Make sure the project team is aware of all agile techniques"],"c":[2],"f":"Ensure the team has a common understanding of agile","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":497}},{"qa":"تقوم سلسلة البيع بالتجزئة بتقييم مشروع لاستبدال أنظمة الدفع في جميع متاجرها في مواقع متعددة. من المتوقع أن يزيد المشروع من حصته في السوق ، وتحسين خدمات العملاء ، والاحتفاظ بالمزيد من العملاء. تم التخطيط للمشروع كتنفيذ مرحلي ، بناءً على التعلم من الأحداث السابقة خلال كل مرحلة. كيف يجب أن تزيد الأعمال من قيمة المشروع؟","oa":["استخدم مخطط هيكل السمكة للعثور على السبب الجذري لانخفاض الفوائد المالية مع مالك الفوائد","اطلب من مالك المنافع إعادة تقييم المخاطر المحددة التي تؤثر على نتائج المنافع المالية","التشاور مع الخبراء حول طرق خفض التكاليف وزيادة القيمة المالية للمشروع","حدد المنافع الملموسة وغير الملموسة المتوقعة في خطة إدارة الفوائد لكل مرحلة"],"rat":null,"fa":"حدد الفوائد الملموسة وغير الملموسة المتوقعة في خطة إدارة الفوائد لكل مرحلة","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":395,"q":"A retail chain is evaluating a project to replace payment systems across all its stores in multiple locations. The project is expected to increase market share, improve customer services , and retain more customers . The project is planned as a phased implementation, building on learning from the retrospectives during each phase. How should the business increase the value of the project?","t":"S","o":["Use a fishbone diagram to find the root cause of the lower financial benefits with the benefits owner","Ask the benefits owner to reassess the identified risks that are impacting the outcomes of the financial benefits","Consult with experts on methods to reduce costs and increase the financial value of the project","Quantify the expected tangible and intangible benefits in the benefits management plan for each phase"],"c":[3],"f":"Quantify the expected tangible and intangible benefits in the benefits management plan for each phase","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":498}},{"qa":"تقوم شركة نقل بتحويل عملياتها التشغيلية والنظام الرئيسي الذي تستخدمه هذه الشركة لنقل البضائع. بيان النطاق في مكانه. تم الاتفاق على نهج التسليم التكراري من قبل جميع أصحاب المصلحة. ما الذي يتعين على مدير المشروع القيام به بعد ذلك لمساعدة الفريق على فهم العمل الذي يتعين القيام به؟","oa":["ابدأ العمل على خطة إدارة المشروع مع حزم العمل والجدول الزمني المفصل وتعيينات العمل لأعضاء الفريق","قم بإنشاء خطة إدارة المتطلبات لتحديد كيفية جمع متطلبات المشروع وتحليلها وتوثيقها ، ثم تعيين المتطلبات لأعضاء الفريق","العمل مباشرة مع أصحاب المصلحة على هيكل تقسيم العمل وقم بتعيين المهام مع الجدول الزمني المطلوب لكل عضو في الفريق لبدء العمل.","العمل مع الفريق لتقسيم النطاق إلى هيكل تقسيم العمل وحزم العمل من أجل إنشاء التسليمات والجداول الزمنية المطلوبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":396,"q":"A transportation company is transforming its operational processes and the main system this company uses to move freight. The scope statement is in place. An iterative delivery approach has been agreed by all stakeholders. What does the project manager need to do next to help the team understand the work that needs to be done?","t":"S","o":["Start working on the project management plan with work packages, a detailed schedule, and work assignments for team members.","Create the requirements management plan to outline how project requirements will be collected, analyzed, and documented, and then assign requirements to team members.","Work directly with stakeholders on the work breakdown structure (WBS) and assign tasks with a required timeline for each team member to start the work.","Work with the team to decompose the scope into a WBS and work packages in order to create required deliverables and timelines."],"c":[1],"f":"To help the team understand the work to be done, a plan is created to determine how requirements can be collected, analyzed, and documented","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":499}},{"qa":"واجه أحد أعضاء الفريق صراعات شخصية في مشاريع سابقة ، مما جعلهم قلقين بشأن العمل في المشروع الحالي. يعرف مدير المشروع أن عضو الفريق هذا يمكنه إضافة قيمة إلى المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع للحصول على أقصى قيمة من عضو الفريق هذا؟","oa":["انصح عضو الفريق بعدم مشاركة المعلومات الشخصية من المشاريع السابقة مع الفريق بأكمله","أنصح عضو الفريق بالتركيز على المشروع الحالي واعتبار النزاعات الماضية كدروس مستفادة","استشر الموارد البشرية  وتحقق من سياسات الشركة بشأن ما هو مسموح به لتقديم المشورة لعضو الفريق","استشر راعي المشروع لمعرفة ما إذا كان مسموحًا بمشاركة المعلومات الشخصية مع الفريق بأكمله"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":397,"q":"A team member has experienced personal conflicts on past projects, making them nervous about working on the current project. The project manager knows this team member could add value to the project. What should the project manager do to get the most value from this team member","t":"S","o":["Advise the team member not to share personal information from past projects with the entire team","Advise the team member to focus on the current project and consider the past conflicts as lessons learned","Consult with human resources (HR) and check company policies on what is allowed to advise the team member","Consult with the project sponsor to find out if it is allowed to share personal information with the entire team"],"c":[1],"f":"Advise the team member to focus on the current project and consider the past conflicts as lessons learned","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":500}},{"qa":"تقوم شركة كبيرة بتحويل نفسها من نهج تنبؤي إلى نهج رشيق. يواجه فريق المشروع الذي لديه معرفة بالممارسات الرشيقة صراعات كبيرة مع المديرين التنفيذيين فيما يتعلق بالعمليات الواجب اتباعها. كيف ينبغي حل هذه النزاعات","oa":["تدريب المديرين التنفيذيين على الممارسات الرشيقة","اطلب من المديرين التنفيذيين استخدام ممارسات رشيقة","تفاوض مع المديرين التنفيذيين والاتفاق على العملية","تضمين المديرين التنفيذيين في استعادية الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":398,"q":"A large corporation is transforming itself from a predictive to agile approach. A project team with knowledge of agile practices is experiencing significant conflicts with the executives regarding the processes to be followed. How should these conflicts be resolved","t":"S","o":["Train the executives on agile practices","Request that the executives use agile practices","Negotiate with the executives and agree on a process","Include the executives in team retrospectives"],"c":[0],"f":"A problem with executives and the reason for their lack of knowledge of the agile approach, so the solution is to train them. We may say that the practical reality does not go beyond training senior managers, but training is for employees only. This is a wrong concept. Everyone needs training, especially if a new technology / method is applied.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":501}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع تدير مشروعًا معقدًا للغاية. على الرغم من أن المشروع تنبئي في الغالب ، فقد تمكن الفريق من تقسيم التصميم والتنفيذ إلى حزم أصغر باستخدام إطار عمل مختلط. تريد الشركة تتبع القيمة التي يقدمها تطبيق إطار العمل هذا ولكن لا توجد مجموعة محددة من العناصر القابلة للقياس للإطار. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ما الذي يجب عليك فعله أولاً؟","oa":["استخدم نفس عملية تتبع الفوائد من آخر مشروع تنبؤي وأضف ذلك إلى تقرير الحالة الشهري","قم بإنشاء تقرير بناءً على هيكل تنظيم العمل وقم بتحديثه بشكل منتظم","اعمل مع أصحاب المصلحة لتحديد الفوائد القابلة للقياس التي يمكن تتبعها وتعيين شخص مسؤول لرصدها والإبلاغ عنها","أبحث عن قوالب التقاريرالأكثر أستخدام لهذا الإطار ودمجها في المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":399,"q":"You are a project manager managing a very complex project. Although the project is mostly predictive, the team was able to break the design and execution into smaller packages using a hybrid framework. The business wants to keep track of the value delivered by this framework application but there is no defined set of measurable items for the framework. As a project manager ,what should you do first?","t":"S","o":["Use the same benefits tracking process from the last predictive project and add this to the monthly status report","Create a report based on the work breakdown structure and update it on a regular basis","Work with the stakeholders to determine which measurable benefits can be tracked and assign an accountable person to monitor and report them","Research with templates of reports were used the most for this framework and incorporate them into the project"],"c":[2],"f":"The best option is to work with stakeholders to identify measurable benefits that can be tracked and designate a responsible person to monitor and report on them","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":502}},{"qa":"يواجه مشروع يتبع النهج الرشيق مشكلات الجودة مع كل إصدار ، مما يؤدي إلى حدوث العديد من مشكلات الإنتاج. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لإصلاح المشكلة وتحسين الجودة؟","oa":["أنشئ نظامًا للمكافآت يمنح الحوافز لأعضاء الفريق القادرين على اكتشاف المزيد من العيوب","استعن بشركة خارجية لإضافة طبقة اختبار إضافية ، مع التأكد من فحص المنتج النهائي جيدًا قبل طرحه","استخدم الاجتماع الأستعدادي (أجتماع التقييم باثر رجعي) لفهم السبب الجذري لمشاكل الجودة بشكل أفضل ووضع خطة مع الفريق لمعالجة المشكلات","ابحث عن موافقة تمويل إضافية مع الراعي لاستبدال أعضاء الفريق المبتدئين بالأعضاء الأكثر خبرة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":400,"q":"An agile approach is facing quality issues with every release, generating many production problems. What should the project manager do to fix the problem and improve the quality?","t":"S","o":["Create a reward system granting incentives to the team members who are able to catch more defects","Hire an external company to add an additional layer of testing , making sure that the final product is well inspected before releasing","Use the retrospective meeting to better understand the root cause of the quality problems and put together a plan with the team to address the problems","Seek extra funding approval with the sponsor to replace junior team members for more experienced ones"],"c":[2],"f":"Quality issues with each release - improve quality so a retrospective meeting is best suited for this","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":503}},{"qa":"تعمل شركة على تغيير طريقة تطويرها وإصدارها للمنتجات في السوق. يعتقد التنفيذيون أن هذه مبادرة عالية المخاطر ، ويجب أن تكون هذه المبادرة ناجحة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع في هذا السيناريو؟","oa":["وضع خطة مفصلة  للتكرار  مع نتائج واضحة","وضع خطة لإدارة الاتصالات لإعلام الموظفين بنموذج العمل الجديد","قم بتطوير حالة عمل مع افتراضات للنموذج الجديد","اعتماد نهج تكراري يوفر أعلى قيمة للأعمال في وقت مبكر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":401,"q":"A product company is transforming the way it develops and releases products in the market. Executives believe that this is a high -risk initiative , and this initiative must be successful.\nWhat should the project manager do in this scenario?","t":"S","o":["Develop a detailed sprint plan with clear deliverables","Develop a communications management plan to inform the employees about the new business model","Develop a business case with assumptions for the new model","Adopt an iterative rollout approach that delivers the highest business value earlier"],"c":[3],"f":"there is a high -risk initiative , and this initiative must be successful so n iterative rollout approach with the highest business value earlier","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":504}},{"qa":"الوعي السياسي مطلوب أثناء تطبيق المهارات الشخصية أو الجماعية أثناء تخطيط الاتصالات. كيف هذا حقا مفيد؟","oa":["إنها تمكن مدير المشروع من العمل بفعالية داخل هياكل السلطة","يساعد في تقييم المعنيين","يساعد مدير المشروع على فهم السياسة","يساعد على فهم شبكة السلطة/ الأهتمام"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":402,"q":"Political awareness is required while applying interpersonal or team skills during communications planning. How is this really helpful?","t":"S","o":["It enables the project manager to work effectively within the power structures","It helps in stakeholder assessment","It helps the project manager to understand politics","It helps to understand the power/ interest grid"],"c":[0],"f":"Political Awareness is critical to enable the project manager to work effectively within the power structures","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":505}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع تعمل على مشروعين في نفس الوقت. بسبب اللوائح ، يجب تقليل مدة مشروع واحد. لكن ليس لديك موارد كافية. بالإضافة إلى ذلك ، لا يحتوي الجدول على أنشطة يمكن أن تتداخل. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ماذا يجب أن تفعل؟","oa":["تحليل كلا المشروعين لتحديد الاستخدام الأكثر فعالية للموارد المشتركة","استخدام الأستغلال الأمثل للموارد لتبرير طلب موارد أضافية للمشروع الحرج","تطبيق تقنيات التتبع السريع لضغط الجدول الزمني للمشروع الحرج","توفير التدريب على تحسينات الجدول الزمني لفرق المشروع لتحسين مهاراتهم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":403,"q":"You are a project manager working on two projects at the same time. due to regulations , the duration of one project must reduced. but you do not have enough resources. In addition, the schedule doesn't have activities that can overlapped . As a project manager , what should you do?","t":"S","o":["Analyze both projects to determine the most effective use of common resources","Use resource optimization to justify requesting more resources for the critical project","Apply fast-tracking techniques to compress the schedule of the critical project","Provide schedule optimizations training to the project teams to improve their skills"],"c":[0],"f":"In the scenario the project manager doesn't have enough resources , the schedule doesn't have activities that can be overlapped so the project manager should Analyse both projects to determine the most effective use of common resources","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":506}},{"qa":"مالك المنتج غير متأكد من كيفية المشاركة في جلسة مراجعة التكرار. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من صاحب المنتج التزام الهدوء والمراقبة","قم بإزالة مالك المنتج من الجلسة","قم بتوجيه مالك المنتج إلى موقع الويب حول مراجعات التكرار","قم بارشاد مالك المنتج على كيفية المساهمة في الجلسة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":404,"q":"The product owner is unsure on how to participate in an iteration review session. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Request the product owner remain quiet and observe","Remove the product owner from the session","Point the product owner to website about iteration reviews","Coach the product owner on how to contribute in the session"],"c":[3],"f":"In an agile environement , project manager is servant leader encourage the distribution of responsibility to the team to those people who have the knowledge to get work done and coaching the product owner on how to contibute in the session and changing their emphasis to coaching people who wnat help , fostering greater collaboration on the team , and aligning stakeholder needs","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":507}},{"qa":"يتطلع مدير المشروع إلى استبدال أحد أعضاء فريق أجايل الذي غادر لتولي منصب آخر. بعد إجراء مقابلات مع العديد من المتقدمين لملء المنصب ،يقوم مدير المشروع بتضييق القائمة لأربعة أفراد. أي من المرشحين التاليين يجب على مدير المشروع تعيينه؟","oa":["جديد في مشاريع الأجايل ويمكن تدريبه بسهولة لأنه ليس لديهم أي عادات رشيقة سيئة","فرد لديه مجموعة مهارات متنوعة ليتمكن من لعب العديد من الأدوار الرشيقة","مرشح لديه خبرة في التطوير على مجموعة واسعة من المنتجات","مطور برامج خبير يعمل بشكل جيد مع الآخرين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":405,"q":"A project manager is looking to replace one of the agile team members who left to take another position. After interviewing several applicants to backfill the position , the project manager narrows down the list to four individuals . Which of the following candidates should the project manager hire ?","t":"S","o":["New to agile and easily trainable as they do not have any bad agile habits","An individual with a diverse skill set to be able to play many agile roles","A candidate with development experience on a wide range of products","An expert senior software developer who works well with others"],"c":[1],"f":"Agile team practices emphasize the idea of generalizing specialists. Often those most valuable on the team are members who can develop, test, and play other roles and can switch responsibilities and tasks as the need arises. A team of generalizing specialists has less loss of information and rarely has anyone waiting or idle.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":508}},{"qa":"تضمنت مناهج إدارة المشاريع التقليدية العديد من مؤشرات الأداء الرئيسية التي تنبأت بنجاح المشروع. كيف نظهر نجاح مشروع أجايل ؟","oa":["من خلال إثبات أنه تم تسليم منتج قابل للأستخدام / التطبيق فعالاً إلى العميل","بالتسليم في الوقت المحدد","من خلال الحفاظ على سرعة الفريق الإنتاجية","من خلال إعادة استخدام مؤشرات الأداء الرئيسية والقياسات التقليدية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":406,"q":"Traditional project management approaches included multiple KPIs that predicted the success of a project. How do we demonstrate success of an Agile project?","t":"S","o":["By demonstrating that a working product has been delivered to the customer","By release on time","By maintain productive team velocity","By reusing the traditional KPIs and measures"],"c":[0],"f":"Agile Principles (Working software is the primary measure of progress)","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":509}},{"qa":"نظرًا لحجم المشروع وتعقيده ، ستحتاج إلى فرق متعددة تعمل بشكل متزامن لتحقيق أهداف المشروع. أي من الأساليب التالية موصى به في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["سكرم","كانبان","XP أكس بي","مجموعة سكرم الشاملة Scrum of Scrums"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":407,"q":"Due to the size and the complexity of the project , you would need multiple teams working concurrently to achieve the project objectives. Which of the following approaches is recommended in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Scrum","Kanban","XP","Scrum of Scrums (SoS)"],"c":[3],"f":"Scrum of Scrums (SoS)\nAn approach to coordinating the work of multiple Scrum teams wherein one or more members of each Scrum team come together to discuss and resolve inter-team dependency issues.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":510}},{"qa":"تضع مناهج إدارة المشروع التقليدية مدير المشروع في مركز تنسيق المشروع وتجعله مسؤولاً عن تتبع المشروع وإعداد التقارير. ومع ذلك ، فإن هذا النهج غير مناسب لـ:","oa":["مشاريع التغيير عالية حيث يوجد تعقيد أكثر مما يمكن لشخص واحد إدارته","المشاريع التي تتطلب جداول زمنية مفصلة ليتم تطويرها والموافقة عليها من قبل العملاء","المشاريع التي تتطلب أعمال تخطيط محملة مسبقًا","مشاريع منخفضة التغيير حيث تم توفير نطاق مفصل من قبل المنظمة العميلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":408,"q":"The traditional project management approaches place the project manager at the center of coordination for the project and makes them responsible for the project tracking and reporting. However , this approach is not suitable for:","t":"S","o":["High change projects where there is more complexity than one person can manage","Projects where detailed schedules are required to be developed and approved by the clients.","Projects that require front-loaded planning work","Low-Change projects where detailed scope has been provided by the client organization"],"c":[0],"f":"An Agile project management is High change projects where there is more complexity than one person can manage","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":511}},{"qa":"أنت تقود مشروعًا لتصميم نظام جديد ومبتكر يعتمد على التكنولوجيا المطورة حديثًا. في المشاريع السابقة ، باستخدام نهج تقليدي لإدارة مشروع الشلال ، واجهت مشاكل مع زحف النطاق. ومع ذلك ، نظرًا لطبيعة المشروع الحالي ، فقد قررت استخدام نهج رشيق. نظرًا لأنه يتناسب مع نطاق المشروع ، كيف سيختلف هذا المشروع عن مشاريعك السابقة؟","oa":["سيتم فهم نطاق المشروع بشكل أفضل في بداية المشروع","سيتطور نطاق المشروع خلال المشروع","سيتم تجنب زحف النطاق من خلال نظام صارم لإدارة التغيير","أثناء التخطيط الأولي ، سيتم إنشاء هيكل تفصيلي للعمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":409,"q":"You are leading a project to design a new and innovative system based on newly developed technology. In past projects , using a traditional waterfall project management approach, you have encountered issues with scope creep. However , given the nature of the current project , you have decided to use an agile approach. As it telated to project scope, how will this project differ from your past projects?","t":"S","o":["The project scope will be better understood at the beginning of the project","The project scope will evolve during the project","Scope creep will be avoided with a strict change management system","During initial planning, more detailed work breakdown structure will be created"],"c":[1],"f":"In the scenario you have decided to use an agile approach which differ about Traditional approach\nAn agile approach is change drriven development approach\n the project scope isnot unclear in the beginning or not weel iunderstood upfront will evolve during the project\nTraditional approach is plan driven development so detailed scope and clear in the planning phase","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":512}},{"qa":"أنت تعمل على مشروع يتكون من ثلاثة إصدارات ، خمس تكرارات لكل إصدار. سيوفر الإصدار الأول الميزات الضرورية المطلوبة لمنتج قابل للتطبيق على الأقل مع ميزات إضافية  بعد كل إصدار لاحق. يريد العميل معرفة الميزات التي ستتوفر في نهاية كل تكرار. ما هي أفضل أداة أو تقنية لاستخدامها في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["التخطيط لأصدار أجايل","الخط المرجعي للجدول الزمني","طريقة المسار الحرج","قائمة الأنشطة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":410,"q":"You are working on a project that consists of three releases , five iterations per release . The first release willprovide the must-have features required for a mininmum viable product with additional features added after each subsequent release. The customer wants to know which features will be available at the end of each iteration. What is the best tool or technique to use in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Agile release planning","Schedule Baseline","Critical path method","Activity list"],"c":[0],"f":"Agile release planning is a project management approach where teams build and release products in iterations or incremental stages rather than all at once or grouped into distinct major releases","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":513}},{"qa":"ما هو مؤشر أداء كانبان الرئيسي الذي يسمح للفرق بتقديم التزامات موثوقة حول المدة التي يستغرقها إنجاز العمل؟","oa":["السرعة","دورة الوقت","العمل قيد التقدم","العيوب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":411,"q":"Which kanban key performance indicator allows teams to make reliable commitments about how long it takes them to deliver work?","t":"S","o":["Velocity","Cycle time","WIP","Defects"],"c":[1],"f":"Cycle time refers to the time it takes for a work item to go through part of an overall process. Cycle time allows teams to make commitments how long it would take for the team to deliver work.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":514}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":412,"q":"You are managing a project with a budget of 20,000$ . You have spent 17,000$ so far , and the project is 75% complete. You have performed a variance analysis and determined that the estimate at completion (EAC) will be 22,667$ . What is the efficiency that must be maintained in order to complete the project with the current estimate at completion (EAC)","t":"S","o":["0.882","2.568","1.235","0.950"],"c":[0],"f":"BAC= 20,000$\nEV=75%* 20000$ = 15,000$\nAC=17,000$\nEAC= 22,667$\nTCPI= (BAC-EV)/(EAC-AC)= (20000-15000)/(22,667-17,000) = 0.882","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5"},{"qa":"تكلف مشروع مكتمل مؤخرًا أكثر واستغرق وقتًا أطول مما ينبغي. تم إجراء تحليل السبب الجذري ، وتقرر أن تكلفة الجودة تجاوزت ما هو الأمثل. على ما يبدو ، تضمنت خطة إدارة الجودة اختبارات مكثفة ومكلفة للغاية لضمان عدم وجود أي عيوب في المنتج. ما الذي كان من الممكن أن يمنع هذا الوضع؟","oa":["إجراء تحليل التكلفة والعائد","إجراء تحليل الحساسية","تطبيق تحليل نقاط القوة والضعف والفرص والتهديدات","تحليل المعنيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":413,"q":"A recently completed project cost more and took longer than it should have. A root cause analysis was performed, and it was determined that the cost of quality exceeded what was optimal. Apparently, the quality management plan included extensive and very costly testing to ensure that there were zero escaped defects in the product. What might have prevented this situation?","t":"S","o":["Performing a cost-benefit analysis","Conducting a sensitivity analysis","Including a SWOT analysis","Stakeholder analysis"],"c":[0],"f":"A cost -benefit analysis of each quality activity compares the cost of the quality step to the expected benefits. A-cost benefit analysis will help the project manager determine if the planned quality activities are cost -effective . Performing a cost -benefit analysis may have prevented the problem described in the scenario from occuring.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":515}},{"qa":"لقد تم إخطارك من قبل مكتب إدارة المشروع بأنه قد تم اختيار مشروعك لتدقيق الجودة المقرر إجراؤه خلال الأسابيع القادمة. ما الذي يجب أن يكون شاغلك الأساسي فيما يتعلق بالتدقيق؟","oa":["أن يتراجع المشروع عن الجدول الزمني للمشروع","البحث عن الأخطاء أو العيوب أو الأخطاء أو مشكلات عدم المطابقة الأخرى","التأكد من أن منتجات المشروع تقع ضمن حدود قبول الراعي","أن العمل المنجز يتوافق مع سياسات الشركة وعملياتها وإجراءاتها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":414,"q":"You have been notified by the project management office that your project has been selected for a quality audit that is scheduled to take place over the coming weeks. What should be your primary concern with regards to the audit?","t":"S","o":["That the project fall back line with the project schedule","Finding errors , defects , bugs , or other non conformance problems","Assuring that the project products fall within the sponsor's acceptance limits","That the work performed lines up with company policies , processes , and procedures"],"c":[3],"f":"Quality audit used to determine if project activities comply with organizational and project policies , processes , and procedures","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":516}},{"qa":"حصلت شركتك على عقد يتضمن دفع 10٪ إذا تم الانتهاء من المشروع قبل شهرين. تفكر في عدة خيارات لاستغلال هذه الفرصة. ما هو أفضل مسار يمكنك القيام به لزيادة فرص الحصول على المكافاءة؟","oa":["تسوية الموارد","تقليل نطاق المشروع","اشتري التأمين","ضغط الجدول الزمني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":415,"q":"Your company was awarded a contract that includes a 10% bouns payment if the project is completed two months early. You consider several options to exploit this opportunity . What is the best course of action for you to increase the chances of receiving the bouns?","t":"S","o":["Resource leveling","Reduce project scope","Purchase insurance","Crash the schedule"],"c":[3],"f":"Crash the schedule is the best option , you can add resources to complete the project earlier to secure the bouns.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":517}},{"qa":"في الاجتماع اليومي ، يشير أحد أعضاء الفريق إلى أنهم وجدوا خطرًا كبيرًا لم يكن معروفًا في السابق. كيف يجب أن تفعل  كـ مدرب أجايل؟","oa":["استخدم ما تبقى من اجتماع الوقوف لمناقشة هذه المسألة الهامة","اطلب مقابلة المطور بعد الاجتماع للحصول على مزيد من التفاصيل","اطلب من عضو الفريق المتأثر البقاء بعد الاجتماع لمناقشة المشكلة بمزيد من التفصيل","تصعيد المخاطر على العميل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":416,"q":"In a daily standup meeting , a team memeber indicates that they found a big risk that was previously unkown . How should the agile coach proceed?","t":"S","o":["Use the rest of the standup meeting to discuss this important issue","Ask to meet with the developer after the meeting to get more details","Ask the affected team member to stay after the meeting to discuss the issue in more detail","Escalate the risk to the customer"],"c":[2],"f":"Daily standup meeting is timeboxed 15 Minute so to discuss the issues is in a seperate meeting so the best option (Ask the affected team member to stay after the meeting to discuss the issue in more detail )","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":518}},{"qa":"يجتمع مالك المنتج مع فريق أجايل وأصحاب المصلحة لتحديد أولويات الميزات في سجل أعمال المنتج. يتم تصنيف كل ميزة بناءً على المخاطر المرتبطة بتطويرها والقيمة التي توفرها الميزة للعميل. ما الميزات التي يجب أن يعطيها مالك المنتج الأولوية لتطويرها أولاً من أجل زيادة احتمالية نجاح المشروع إلى الحد الأقصى؟","oa":["مخاطر منخفضة / قيمة عالية","مخاطر عالية / قيمة منخفضة","مخاطر منخفضة / قيمة منخفضة","مخاطر عالية / قيمة عالية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":417,"q":"A product owner meets with the agile team and stakeholders to prioritize features in the product backlog. Each feature is categorized based on the risk associated with its development and the value the feature provides to the customer. Which features should the product owner prioritize to be developed first in order to maximize the probability of projct success?","t":"S","o":["Low risk /High value","High risk/ Low value","Low risk /low value","High risk/High value"],"c":[3],"f":"First High value , High risk\nSecond High value , low risk\nThird low value /High risk\nFourth low value / low risk","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":519}},{"qa":"لقد بدأت للتو مشروعًا. ربما ظهرت بعض المخاطر التي تتوقعها لهذا المشروع في المشاريع السابقة. أي مما يلي يمكنك مراجعته لمعرفة كيفية التعامل مع هذه المخاطر والمشكلات؟","oa":["السياسات والإجراءات","سجل الدروس المستفادة","خطة إدارة المشروع","مستودع الدروس المستفادة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":418,"q":"You have just started a project. Some of the risks that you are anticipating for this project might have surfaced in previous projects. Which of the following would you review to see how these risks and issues were handled?","t":"S","o":["Policies and procedures","Lesson learned register","Project management plan","Lesson learned repository"],"c":[3],"f":"Lesson learned repository is One of the frequent deconflictions is the difference between the lessons learned register and the lessons learned repository. At first glance, these two concepts may seem the same to each other, it can be said that they are created in the same logic as the decency of the documents, but the main difference between the two is this. Lessons learned register is a document that is constantly created and updated with the start of the project, while lessons learned repository is a document that contains lessons learned about past projects, not limited to the current project. In the process of closing the project, the lessons learned register is transferred to the lessons learned repository. This difference may be challenging in pm exams especially if there is both repository and register in the options.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":520}},{"qa":"أثناء اجتماع مراجعة المشروع ، يشعر راعي المشروع بالقلق من أن المشروع قد لا يحقق النتائج كما هو مخطط له. بناءً على ذلك يقوم مدير المشروع بتقييم حالة المشروع. ما هي المعلومات التي يجب أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع كمؤشر على أن المشروع يقدم قيمة فعلية؟","oa":["يتماشى المشروع مع ميثاق المشروع","المشروع تحت الميزانية وفي الموعد المحدد","رضا المعنيين بحالة المشروع الحالية","يتماشى المشروع مع خطة إدارة المنافع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":419,"q":"During a project review meeting , the project sponsor is worried that the project may not be delivering results as planned. Based on that the project manager is evaluating the project status.\nWhat information shoulf the project manager use as an indicator that the project is actully delivering value ?","t":"S","o":["The project is aligned with the project charter","The project is under budget and on schedule","Stakeholders are satisfied with the current status","The project is aligned with the benefits management plan"],"c":[3],"f":"The benefits management plan presents a summary of the project's benefits expected by the business, how they will be delivered and how they will be measured. It will also describe any post-project benefits reviews that are required.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":521}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لمشروع مهم. لن يوافق العميل على الإغلاق ، بدعوى أن فريق المشروع لم يقم بعمليات التفتيش على الكود المنصوص عليها في عقد التطوير. أجرى فريق المشروع عمليات التفتيش على الكود. ومع ذلك ، فإن السجلات ليست كاملة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب المشورة القانونية المتخصصة بشأن تفسير البنود الواردة في العقد","عقد اجتماع مع فريق المشروع وراعي المشروع والعميل للموافقة على العمل الإضافي المطلوب لإغلاق المشروع والإضافة إلى الدروس المستفادة","أغلق المشروع وسلم التسليمات إلى العميل","عقد ورشة عمل الدروس المستفادة مع فريق المشروع وراعي المشروع لتجنب مشاكل الامتثال التعاقدي الناشئة في المشاريع المستقبلية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":420,"q":"You are a project manager for an important project . The client will not agree to closure, claiming that the project team has not performed the code inspections mandated in the development contract. The project team has performed the code inspections . However , the records are not complete. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Seek expert legal advice on the interpretation of the clauses in the contract","Hold a meeting with the project team , project sponsor , and the client to agree to the further work required to close the project and add to lessons learned","Close the project and hand over the deliverables to the client","Hold lessons learned workshop with the project team and project sponsor to avoid contractual compliance issues arising in future projects"],"c":[1],"f":"The best option (Hold a meeting with the project team , project sponsor , and the client to agree to the further work required to close the project and add to lessons learned )","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":522}},{"qa":"يقدم أحد أعضاء الفريق في مشروعك باستمرار مخرجات غير مكتملة ولا يؤدي أداءً جيدًا. ما الذى ينبغى عليك فعله اولا؟","oa":["ناقش المشكلة مع عضو الفريق على انفراد","ناقش الموضوع مع عضو الفريق بحضور راعي المشروع","ناقش المشكلة مع عضو الفريق بحضور أعضاء الفريق الآخرين","ناقش المشكلة مع عضو الفريق بحضور مدير الموارد البشرية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":421,"q":"A team member in your project is constantly providing incomplete deliverables and not performing well. What should you do first?","t":"S","o":["Discuss the issue with the team member in private","Discuss the issue with the team member in the presence of the project sponsor","Discuss the issue with the team member in the presence of other team members","Discuss the issue with the team member in the presence of HR manager"],"c":[0],"f":"Conflict should be dirst addressed in private , using a direct and collaborative approach.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":523}},{"qa":"أثناء مراجعة مصفوفة تقييم مشاركة المعنيين ، لاحظت أن أحد المعنيين المهمين ليس على دراية بالمشروع والاثار المحتملة. نظرًا لأنه يمكن أن يساهم بشكل كبير في نجاح مشروعك ، فقد قررت نقله لوضع داعم أو قيادي. أي مما يلي سيساعدك على تحقيق هدفك معه؟","oa":["أرسل له تقارير دورية عن المشروع وفوائده","أشركه في بعض أنشطة المشروع","حدد أولويات عالية لتوقعاته واهتماماته وقضاياه","اعرض عليه إجازة مدفوعة الأجر في هاواي مقابل دعمه"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":422,"q":"While reviewing the stakeholder engagement assessment matrix , you notice that one of the important stakeholders is at an unaware state at the moment and has no clue about what is going on in your project. As this stakeholder can contribute significantly to your project success , you decide to bring him to a supportive or leading state . Which of the following will help you to achieve your goal with this stakeholder?","t":"S","o":["Send him regular reports on the project and its benefits","Involve him in some project activities","Assign top priorities to his expectations , concerns , and issues","Offer him a paid vacation in Hawaii in exchange for his support"],"c":[1],"f":"The important stakeholder is at an unaware state and you decide to bring him to a supportive or leading state so you should Involve him in some project activities","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":524}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في شركة وأنت في مرحلة التنفيذ. أرسلت السلطات البيئية إخطارًا إلى مدير المشروع بوقف العمل. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب ذلك","oa":["وضع خطة مفصلة لإدارة المشروع","تحديد مخاطر المشروع","تحديد المعنيين","تحديد نطاق عمل مفصل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":423,"q":"You are a project manager of a company and you are in the execution phase. The environmental authorities sent a notice to the project manager to stop work . What should the project manager have done to avoid this","t":"S","o":["Developed a detailed project management plan","Identified project risks","Identified stakeholders","Defined a detailed scope of work"],"c":[2],"f":"The environmental authorities are keystakeholder so the project manager should identify stakeholders who impact on the project to avoid stop work .","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":525}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع الذي تمت ترقيته مؤخرًا يقوم بتسهيل الاجتماع الأسبوعي لتحديث الحالة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لضمان اجتماع مثمر؟","oa":["أقتصر الحضور على فريق المشروع والمعنيين","اقرأ بعناية آخر محضر الاجتماع","قم بتوزيع جدول أعمال محدد مسبقًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":424,"q":"A recently promoted project manager must facilitate the weekly status update meeting. What should the project manager do to ensure a productive meeting?","t":"S","o":["Limit attendance to the project team and stakeholders","Carefully read the latest meeting minutes","Circulate a defined agenda in advance"],"c":[2],"f":"Agendas are a common meeting tool. A good agenda should provide a high-level list of activities that will enable the team to achieve the meeting objectives. In addition to providing the meeting roadmap, it can also be used as a motivational tool. Refer to it frequently to check off the items that have been completed. This will reinforce what's been accomplished so far and keep the momentum moving forward.\n\nThe agenda can also be used to manage conversation. If the team begins to discuss topics that are scheduled for later in the meeting, refer to the agenda and ask them if the conversation can be postponed until then. Offer to capture a few relevant ideas in the parking lot to make sure you don't forget to discuss them.\n\nThe following steps should be used for meeting planning\n\n Prepare and distribute the agenda stating the objectives of the meeting.\n \n Ensure that the meetings start and finish at the published time.\n \n Ensure appropriate participants are invited and attend.\n \n Stay the topic.\n \n Manage expectations , issues , and conflicts during the meetings.\n \n Record all actions and those who have been allocated the responsibility for completing the action.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":526}},{"qa":"أثناء مرحلة التخطيط لمشروع ما ، يعلم مدير المشروع أن الراعي قد ألغى بعض الإنجازات المهمة في مشاريع أخرى على مدى السنوات الثلاث الماضية ، مما أدى إلى تباين سلبي في التكلفة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["توثيق المشكلة في سجل المشاكل","قم بتضمين الخطر في سجل المخاطر","حدد النطاق الأساسي بشكل صحيح","وثق الدرس المستفاد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":425,"q":"During the planning phase of a project , the project manager learns that the sponsor has eliminated some important deliverables in other projects over the past three years , producing a negative cost variance . What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Document the issue in the issue log","Include the risk in the risk register","Define the scope baseline correctly","Document the lesson learned"],"c":[1],"f":"The sponsor has eliminated some important deliverables in other projects over the past three years , producing a negative cost variance so the project manager should Include the risk in the risk register to develop strategy to avoid this decisions repeat in the future event","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":527}},{"qa":"كيف يجب تخصيص العمل للفريق في مشروع رشيق؟","oa":["يجب تخصيص المهام بشكل عشوائي لأعضاء الفريق ، باستخدام تخطيط بوكر","يجب تخصيص المهام الأكثر تعقيدًا من قبل قائد الفريق","يجب على سكروم ماستر تخصيص مهام محددة للأفراد","يجب على أعضاء الفريق أن يختاروا بأنفسهم المهام المناسبة لمهاراتهم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":426,"q":"How should work be allocate to the team in an Agile project ?","t":"S","o":["Tasks should be randomly allocated to team members , using planning poker","The most complex tasks should be allocated by the team leader","Scrum master should allocate specific tasks to individuals","Team members should self-select tasks appropriate to their skills"],"c":[3],"f":"In Agile projects , The team members are self- organizing and cross functional so the team should self-select tasks appropriate to their skills.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":528}},{"qa":"أنت تشرع في مشروع لبناء نظام مياه صالحة للشرب لدولة نامية. لقد قمت بمراجعة دراسة الجدوى وخطة إدارة الفوائد. خلال اجتماع مع أصحاب المصلحة ، تم تحديد أهداف المشروع ومعايير النجاح والمتطلبات عالية المستوى. ما الذي سيساعدك أكثر في إكمال هذه العملية؟","oa":["إنشاء مستند يصف كيفية تحليل المتطلبات وتوثيقها وإدارتها","إنشاء وصف تفصيلي لمخرجات المشروع","فهم قواعد وأنظمة العمل في البلد المستهدف","إنشاء مستند يصف كيف ومتى سيتم تسليم فوائد المشروع وكيف سيتم قياس الفوائد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":427,"q":"You are initiating a project to construct a potable water system for a developing country. You have reviewed the business case , benefits management plan. During a meeting with stakeholders, the project's objectives , success criteria, and high-level requirments have been determined. What else will assist you the most in completing this process?","t":"S","o":["Creating a document that describes how requirements will be analyzed , documented , and managed.","Creating a detailed description of the project deliverables","Understanding labor rules and regulations in the target country","Creating a document that describes how and when the benefits of the project will be delivered and how the benefits will be measured."],"c":[2],"f":"The term enterprise environmental factors refers to an input/output mechanism that is supposed to identify factors that cannot be controlled by the project team but have a significant impact on how the project has to be managed or on the outcome of the project, program or portfolio. This impact can be of positive or negative nature. The term is not very popular, but the concept is really important, given that most if not all projects are affected by the context they are managed in. As an example, if you are not allowed to use external resources and your project team lacks some skills to successfully execute the project, this is a result of an enterprise environmental factor.\n\nLabor rules and regulations in the target country can constrain the project and are not under the control of the project team.","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":529}},{"qa":"يحتوي المشروع الذي تديره على مؤشر أداء التكلفة الحالي 1.0 و مؤشر أداء الجدول الزمني 0.8. لقد أخطرت من قبل مكتب إدارة المشروع بأنه قد تم اختيار مشروعك لتدقيق الجودة المقرر إجراؤه خلال الأسابيع القادمة. ما الذي يجب أن يكون شاغلك الأساسي فيما يتعلق بالتدقيق؟","oa":["أن العمل المنجز يتوافق مع سياسات الشركة وعملياتها وإجراءاتها","البحث عن أخطاء أو عيوب أو أخطاء أو مشكلات أخرى تتعلق بعدم المطابقة في المنتج","أن المشروع يتماشى مع الجدول الزمني للمشروع","التأكد من أن منتجات المشروع تقع ضمن حدود قبول الكفيل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":428,"q":"The project you are leading has a current CPI of 1.0 and SPI of 0.8. You have notified by the project management office that your project has been selected for a quality audit that is scheduled to take place over the coming weeks. What should be your primary concern with regards to the audit ?","t":"S","o":["That the work performed lines up with company policies, processes, and procedures","Finding errors , defects,bugs , or other non conformance problems in the product","That the project falls back in line with the project schedule","Assuring that the project products fall within the sponsor's acceptance limits"],"c":[0],"f":"A quality audit is a structured , independent process used to determine if project activities comply with organizational and project policies , processes ,and procedures.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":530}},{"qa":"أنشأت إحدى المنظمات مكتب إدارة المشاريع (PMO) من النوع المتحكم . المهمة الأولى لمكتب إدارة المشروع هي تحديث المبادئ التوجيهية لامتثال المشروع في المنظمة. أي مما يلي يمكن لمكتب إدارة المشاريع تنفيذه؟ (اختر ثلاثة)","oa":["استخدام منهجيات معينة لإدارة المشروع","الالتزام باللوائح الصحية المحلية","اعتماد قوالب ونماذج وأدوات محددة","تعيين مديري المشاريع من قبل مكتب إدارة المشاريع","التوافق مع أطر الحوكمة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":429,"q":"An organization has established a controlling project management office (PMO). The first task of the PMO is to update the guidelines for project compliance in the organization. Which of the following could the PMO enforce ?( Choose three)","t":"M","o":["Use of particular project management methodologies","Adherence to local health regulations","Adoption of specific templates, forms , and tools","Assignment of project managers by the PMO","Conformance to governance frameworks"],"c":[0,2,4],"f":"There are three basic types of Project Management Office (PMO) organisations, varying in the degree of control and influence they have on projects within the organisation. You will need to determine which type you need to establish in order to have an effective project office.\n\nThe three types of PMOs include:\n\n1. Supportive PMO\nThe Supportive PMO generally provides support in the form of on-demand expertise, templates, best practices, access to information and expertise on other projects, and the like. This can work in an organisation where projects are done successfully in a loosely controlled manner and where additional control is deemed unnecessary. Also, if the objective is to have a sort of \"clearing-house\" of project management information across the enterprise to be used freely by project managers, then the Supportive PMO is the right type.\n\n2. Controlling PMO\nIn organisations where there is a desire to \"rein in\" the activities, processes, procedures, documentation, and more - a controlling PMO can accomplish that. Not only does the organisation provide support, but it also requires that the support be used. Requirements might include adoption of specific methodologies, templates, forms, conformance to governance, and application of other PMO controlled sets of rules. In addition, project offices might need to pass regular reviews by the controlling PMO, and this may represent a risk factor on the project. This works if a) there is a clear case that compliance with project management organisation offerings will bring improvements in the organisation and how it executes on projects, and b) the PMO has sufficient executive support to stand behind the controls the PMO puts in place.\n\n3. Directive PMO\nThis type goes beyond control and actually \"takes over\" the projects by providing the project management experience and resources to manage the project. As organisations undertake projects, professional project managers from the PMO are assigned to the projects. This injects a great deal of professionalism into the projects, and, since each of the project managers originates and reports back to the directive PMO, it guarantees a high level of consistency of practice across all projects. This is effective in larger organisations that often matrix out support in various areas, and where this setup would fit the culture.\n\nThe best type is very specific to the organisation, culture, and history of what works and what does not. But the objectives are - more or less - to:\n\nImplement a common methodology\nStandardise terminology\nIntroduce effective repeatable project management processes\nProvide common supporting tools\nUltimately, the objective is to improve levels of project success within the organisation\nBeing aware of these types can help you and your organisation more easily accomplish this.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":531}},{"qa":"تم إجراء عمليات تدقيق شهرية لتحديد ما إذا كانت أنشطة المشروع تتوافق مع سياسات الشركة وإجراءاتها وأفضل ممارساتها. خلال المشروع ، أشارت نتائج المراجعات الشهرية إلى أن الفريق كان في حالة امتثال. ومع ذلك ، في نهاية المشروع ، تقرر أن بعض أنشطة المشروع لم تمتثل للسياسات التنظيمية. ما الذي يتسبب على الأرجح في تفويت فجوات الامتثال هذه أثناء عمليات التدقيق؟","oa":["تم إجراء عمليات التدقيق من قبل مدقق حسابات خارجي للمنظمة","تم إجراء عمليات التدقيق من قبل مكتب إدارة المشاريع","تم إجراء عمليات التدقيق من قبل قسم التدقيق الداخلي للشركة","تم إجراء عمليات التدقيق من قبل أحد أعضاء فريق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":"عادة ما يتم إجراء التدقيق بواسطة كيان خارج الفريق. إن قيام أحد أعضاء فريق المشروع بإجراء التدقيق ينفي فوائد إجراء مراجعة مستقلة.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":430,"q":"Monthly audits were performed to determine if project activities comply with corporate policies , procedures , and best practices . Throughout the project , the results of the monthly audits indicated that the team was in compliance . However ,at the end of the project, it was determined that some of the project activities did not comply with organizational policies. What most likely causes these compliance gaps to be missed during the audits?","t":"S","o":["The audits were conducted by an auditor external to the organization","The audits were conducted by the project management office (PMO)","The audits were conducted by the company's internal audit department","The audits were conducted by one of the project team members"],"c":[3],"f":"An audit is usually performed by an entity external to the team. Having a project team member perform the audit negates the benefits of an independent review making.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":532}},{"qa":"قام مدير المشروع بتجميع قائمة من المخرجات الرئيسية ، والتي تشمل برنامج العمل ، ومواد تدريب الموظفين ، وأدلة المستخدم ، وما إلى ذلك. متى تكون المرة الأولى التي يتم فيها تحديد هذه المخرجات الرئيسية؟","oa":["عندما يتم تنفيذ عمليات مجموعة عمليات التنفيذ","عندما يتم تنفيذ عمليات مجموعة عملية التخطيط","أثناء عملية وضع ميثاق المشروع","أثناء عملية تحديد النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":431,"q":"A project manager has compiled a list of key deliverables , which include the working software, employee training materials , user manuals , etc. When is the first time that these key deliverables would have been identified?","t":"S","o":["When processes of the Executing process group are performed","When processes of the planning process group are performed","During the Develop project charter process","During the Define scope process"],"c":[2],"f":"The key deliverables are identified during the develop project charter.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":533}},{"qa":"لقد تم تكليفك للتو بمشروع رشيق قادم. كجزء من عمل ما قبل المشروع ، تقوم بمراجعة جميع سياسات المنظمة وإجراءاتها فيما يتعلق بالامتثال. أنت تدرك أن بعضها فقط قد يكون قابلاً للتطبيق على مشروعك. ما الذى ينبغى عليك فعله اولا؟","oa":["تصنيف فئات الامتثال لتحديد نفقات موارد المشروع","تبديل نهج إدارة المشروع من الرشيق إلى التقليدي","دمج جميع سياسات وإجراءات الامتثال في استراتيجية التنفيذ","تأكد من تضمين أنشطة الامتثال في خط الأساس للجدول الزمني للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":432,"q":"You have just been assigned to an upcoming agile project. As part of pre project work , you review all of the organization's policies and procedures regarding compliance. You realize that only some of them may be applicable to your project. What should you do first?","t":"S","o":["Classify the compliance categories to determine the expenditure of project resources","Switch the project management approach from agile to traditional","Incorporate all compliance policies and procedures in the implementation strategy","Ensure compliance activities are included in the project schedule baseline"],"c":[0],"f":"The scenario describes a situation where only some compliance - related policies and procedures for an agile project will be applicable. One of the principles outlined in the Agile Mainfesto states , \" Simplicity\"- the art of maximizing the amount of work not done - is essential . in keeping with an agile mindset , the project manager should minimize the overhead and only include those compliance activities that are necessary. Classify the compliance categoriesthat have been captured in the organization's policies and procedures may be helpful in differentiating those that require the expenditure of project resources and those that do not. For example , the organization may have specific guidelines for complying with union rules and activities.\nHowever , if the project underway will not have union involvement , then that entire compliance category can be disregarded.","ap":"agile","dm":"business","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":534}},{"qa":"خلال اجتماع مراجعة المخاطر للمشروع على وشك الانتهاء ، تم تحديد مخاطر جديدة. قد تؤثر هذه المخاطر على الجدول الزمني للمشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["تنبيه راعي المشروع للتأثير المحتمل","تحليل المخاطر","تنفيذ خطة الاستجابة للمخاطر","خفف من المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":433,"q":"During a risk review meeting for project nearing completion , a new risk has been identified . This risk may affect the project's schedule . What should the project manager do first ?","t":"S","o":["Alert the project sponsor of the potential impact","Analyze the risk","Implement risk response plan","Mitigate the risk"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager should analyze the risk after risk identification to priortize the risk and develop responses which is fit for this risks .","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":535}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع تقود مشروعًا ، حيث لديك اثني عشر مبرمجًا. اثنان منهم قد سلموا للتو خطابات استقالتهما. تم تحديد هذه المخاطر المحققة واحتسابها خلال مرحلة التخطيط للمشروع. إذا لم يتم اتخاذ أي إجراء ، فلن تلتزم بالمواعيد النهائية الخاصة بك. ماذا يجب ان تفعل بعد ذلك؟","oa":["مراجعة سجل المخاطر","ضغط الجدول الزمني","تنفيذ عملية خطة الاستجابة للمخاطر","إرسال طلب تغيير لتحديث خط الأساس للجدول الزمني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":434,"q":"You are a project manager leading a project , where you have tweleve programmers. Two of them have just handed in their letters of resignation. This realized risk had been identified and accounted for during the planning stage of the project. If no action is taken , you will not meet your deadlines. What should you do next?","t":"S","o":["Review the risk register","Crash the schedule","Perform the plan risk responses process","Submit a change request to update the schedule baseline"],"c":[0],"f":"The risk register records the agreed upon risk responses for each individual risk and the nominated owners for each response plan. The next thing you need to do is review the risk register so you can implement the agreed upon risk response.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":536}},{"qa":"بدون الاهتمام بأعلى قيمة للعميل ، قد يقوم فريق أجايل بإنشاء ميزات لا تحظى بالتقدير ، أو غير ذات قيمة غير كافية ، وبالتالي إهدار الجهد. كيف يخفف أجايل من هذه المخاطر؟","oa":["من خلال إنشاء خطة إدارة المشروع التفصيلية بمساعدة مدير المشروع","من خلال إنشاء خطة إدارة المشروع التفصيلية بمساعدة مالك المشروع","من خلال إنشاء سجل أعمال المنتج بمساعدة مدير المشروع","من خلال إنشاء سجل أعمال المنتج  بمساعدة مالك المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":435,"q":"Without attention to the highest value for the customer , the Agile team may create features that are not appreciated, or otherwise insufficiently valuable, therefore wasting effort. How does an Agile mitigate this risk ?","t":"S","o":["By creating the detailed project management plan with the help of the project manager.","By creating the detailed project management plan with the help of the product owner.","By creating the product backlog with the help of the project manager.","By creating the product backlog with the help of the product owner."],"c":[3],"f":"By creating the product backlog with the help of the product owner.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":537}},{"qa":"أي من الممارسات التالية يُنصح باستخدامها الشركة الموردة أثناء التعاقد مع عميل لمشروع رشيق؟","oa":["إضافة بند يسمح للمشتري بإلغاء العقد إذا فشل البائع في التسليم كما هو متفق عليه","باستخدام المعيار من العقود الموصى بها من قبل مكتب إدارة المشروع","الإصرار على التدخل القانوني","الحاجة إلى مشاركة العملاء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":436,"q":"Which of the following practices is recommended for a vendor company to use while contracting with a customer for an agile project?","t":"S","o":["Adding a clause allowing the buyer to cancel the contract if the vendor fails to deliver as agreed","Using standard from contracts recommended by the project management office","Insisting on legal involvement","Clearly stating the need for customer involvement"],"c":[3],"f":"The requirements for customer involvement should be clearly stated in the contract because Agile is predicated on continuous feedback and involvement of the customer.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":538}},{"qa":"لإنتاج التسليمات ، يجب أن يتعاقد مشروعك مع العديد من البائعين. سيتم تطوير المخرجات باستخدام إطار عمل رشيق مع تسليم مدفوع بالقيود ، مما سيؤثر على العلاقة التعاقدية مع البائعين. أي من الاستراتيجيات التالية هي الأنسب لهذا المشروع؟ (اختر ثلاثة)","oa":["استخدم عقد السعر الثابت لكل البائعين","تابع علاقة المخاطر المشتركة والمكافأة مع البائعين","اعتماد زيادات ثابتة السعر عند التعاقد مع البائعين","قم بتضمين خيار الإلغاء المبكر في عقود البائعين","قم بتطوير بيان عمل المشتريات بناءً على هيكل تجزئة العمل التفصيلي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":437,"q":"To produce deliverables , your project has to contract with several vendors. The deliverables will be developed using an agile framework with constraint driven delivery , which will influence the contractual relationship with the vendors. Which of the following strategies would be the most appropriate for this project? (Choose three)","t":"M","o":["Utilize a standard firm-fixed price contract for each of the vendors","Pursue a shared - risk -reward relationship with the vendors","Adopt fixed-price increments when contracting with the vendors","Include an early cancellation option in the vendor contracts","Develop the procurement statement of work based on the detailed WBS"],"c":[1,2,3],"f":"The question describes a project that will use agile methodologies, including constraint driven delivery . Constraint driven delivery is a common strategy for agile projects, where the cost and/or time are fixed, and the scope is allowed on vary. Such projects will require greater flexibility and a more collaborative relationship with vendors as compared to a traditional waterfall approach.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":539}},{"qa":"تعاقد مدير مشروع رشيق مع بائع بعض التسليمات المطلوبة للمشروع. يستخدم البائع أيضًا نهجًا رشيقًا لإدارة المشاريع لتقديم عمله. كيف ينبغي تقييم تقدم البائع؟","oa":["من خلال مراجعة النسخ الصادرة لعمل البائع","من خلال إجراء عمليات تدقيق المشتريات لعمليات البائع","من خلال حضور اجتماعات الوقوف اليومية لفريق البائعين","من خلال مراجعة تقرير التقدم الأسبوعي من البائع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":438,"q":"An agile project manager has contracted with a vendor some of the deliverables required for the project . The vendor is also using an agile project management approach to deliver their work. How should the progress of the vendor be assessed?","t":"S","o":["By reviewing the released versions of the vendor's work","By conducting procurement audits of the vendor's processes","By attending the vendor team's daily stand up meetings","By reviewing the weekly progress report from the vendor"],"c":[0],"f":"In Agile project one of the 12 principles \"Working software is the primary measure of progress.\"","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":540}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع تعمل عن كثب مع مسؤول المشتريات لديك الضمان للتأكد من إنهاء جميع المطالبات والفواتير والدفعات النهائية مع البائع. تم استيفاء شروط وأحكام العقد ، وتم قبول جميع المخرجات. ماذا يجب ان تفعل بعد ذلك؟","oa":["إنهاء جميع الأنشطة الخاصة بالمشروع وتحرير فريق المشروع","إجراء مراجعة منظمة لعملية الشراء","إخطار البائع بأن العقد قد اكتمل","قم بإجراء الفحص النهائي لمخرجات البائع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":439,"q":"You are a project manager working closely with your procurement administrator to ensure that all claims , invoices , and final payments have been finalized with the vendor. Terms and conditions of the conract have been met , and all deliverables have been accepted. What should you do next?","t":"S","o":["Finalize all activities for the project and release the project team","Carry out a structured review of the procurement process","Notify the vendor that the contract has been completed","Conduct the final inspection of the vendor's deliverables"],"c":[2],"f":"After all deliverables have been accepted with the vendor The buyer should provide the seller (vendor) with a formal written notice that the contract has been completed","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":541}},{"qa":"لا يعمل أحد المقاولين وفقًا للمعايير المتفق عليها. تريد إنهاء العقد وإشراك مقاول آخر لنفس الوظيفة. تحتاج إلى تحديد الإجراء القانوني المحدد للإنهاء المبكر للعقد. ماذا عليك ان تفعل ؟","oa":["تحقق من خطة إدارة المشتريات","مراجعة العقد","انظر إلى بيان النطاق","مراجعة سجل المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":440,"q":"One of the contractors is not performing to the agreed-upon standards. You want to terminate the contract and engage another contractor for the same job. You need to determine the specific legal procedure for the early termination of the contract. What should you do ?","t":"S","o":["Check the procurement management plan","Consult the contract","Look at the scope statement","Review the risk register"],"c":[1],"f":"properly drafted contract will contain a termination clause tht specifies the rights of the seller or buyer when a contract needs to be terminated. PMBOK 6th edition Page 489","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":542}},{"qa":"نظرًا لنقص الخبرة ، ستحتاج بعض مخرجات مشروع رشيق إلى الاستعانة بمصادر خارجية لبائعين خارجيين. تريد المنظمة المنفذة التأكد من أن البائع المحدد سيستخدم أجايل كطريقة تسليم لإنتاج التسليمات المتعاقد عليها. ما هو أفضل مسار عمل لمدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتطوير المخرجات داخلياً لأن هذا هو دائمًا أفضل وأرخص نهج لإدارة المشاريع الرشيقة","في معايير اختيار المصدر ، حدد أنه يجب على البائع استخدام أجايل كنهج لإدارة المشروع","حدد البائع بناءً على أفضل نهج تقني وأقل تكلفة وقم بإعداد تدريب رشيق للبائع","قم بتجميع فريق المشروع الرشيق للمؤسسة المنفذة مع فريق المشروع الخاص بالمورد الذي تم اختياره"],"rat":null,"fa":"من الممارسات المقبولة تمامًا للمشتري أن يطلب من أعضاء فريق البائع أن يتصرفوا مثل جزء ممتد من فريق أجايل الخاص بالمشتري كجزء من معايير اختيار البائع. لذلك ، يجب الإشارة في معايير اختيار المصدر إلى أن البائع يجب أن يستخدم أجايل كنهج لإدارة المشروع.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":441,"q":"Due to the lack of expertise , some agile project deliverables will need to be outsourced to external vendors. The performing organization wants to ensure that the selected vendor will use agile as their delivery method to produce the contracted deliverables . What is the best course of action for the project manager?","t":"S","o":["Develop the deliverables in house since this is always the best and cheapest approach to run agile projects","In the source selection criteria , specify that the vendor must use agile as their project management approach","Select the vendor based on the best technical approach and lowest cost and set up agile training for the vendor","Colocate the agile project team of the performing organization with the project team of the be selected vendor"],"c":[1],"f":"it is a perfectly acceptable practice for the buyer to require that the seller's team members act much like an extended part of the buyer's agile team as part of the vendor selection criteria . Therefore , indicating in the source selection criteria that the vendor must use agile as their project management approach.","ap":"agile","dm":"business","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":543}},{"qa":"يخطط مدير المشروع لمشروع تطوير التكنولوجيا ويحاول تحديد ما إذا كان من الأفضل إنتاج البرنامج باستخدام موارد داخلية أو شراء المنتج من مصدر خارجي. ما الأداة أو التقنية التي ستكون مفيدة للغاية لمدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحليل الاحتياطي","تحليل التصنيع مقابل الشراء","إجراء التحليل الكمي للمخاطر","تحليل المسار الحرج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":442,"q":"A project manager is planning a technology development project and is trying to determine if it is best to produce the software using internal resources or purchase the product from an outside source. What tool or technique will be most useful for the project manager?","t":"S","o":["Reserve analysis","Make-or buy analysis","Perform Quantitative Risk Analysis","Critical path analysis"],"c":[1],"f":"Make or Buy Analysis: The process of gathering and organizing data about product requirements and analyzing them against available alternatives, including the purchase or internal manufacture of the product. Make or Buy Decisions: Decisions made regarding the external purchase or internal manufacture of a product.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":544}},{"qa":"تتطلع شركة إلى الاستعانة بمصادر خارجية لبعض الأعمال لمشروع أجايل. يقوم مدير المشروع بمراجعة قائمة البائعين المحتملين الذين قدموا عروضهم . أي مما يلي هو الأهم بالنسبة لمدير المشروع للتأكيد عليه والتأكد منه عند اختيار البائع والتعاقد معه؟","oa":["فرض معيار الترميز والبرمجة الازدواجية والتكامل المستمر","التأكد من أن موظفي البائع وشركائه لديهم شهادة معتمدة في الأجايل","الحفاظ على الاتصال المنتظم وردود الفعل مع عملاء الشركة","إبرام العقود بتكلفة ثابتة مع الحوافز"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":443,"q":"A company is looking to outsource some work for an agile project. The project manager is reviewing the list of prospective vendors who submitted their prosposals . Which of the following is the most important for the project manager to emphasize and ensure when selecting and contracting with a vendor ?","t":"S","o":["Enforcing coding standard , pair programming , and continuous integration","Ensuring that the vendor's employees and associates are agile certified","Maintaining regular contact and feedback with the company's customer","Establishing contracts as fixed -cost with incentives"],"c":[2],"f":"All agile methods require regular stakeholder and customer feedback. The most important thing to emphasize and establish with an external vendor on an agile project is that the project structured to ensure that customers can provide regular feedback to the vendor during development.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":545}},{"qa":"طلب مدير مشروع من أحد أعضاء الفريق المساعدة في تطوير خطة إدارة التغيير. لقد عمل عضو الفريق فقط في مشاريع أجايل وليس على دراية بكيفية التعامل مع عملية إدارة التغيير في المشاريع ذات إطار عمل الشلال التقليدي. ما الذي يمكن أن يذكره مدير المشروع فيما يتعلق بالغرض من تطوير خطة إدارة التغيير؟","oa":["لتجنب أضافات ميزات أضافية  من قبل المطورين أثناء تنفيذ المشروع","لتوفير التوجيه لإدارة عملية التحكم في التغيير","لمنع حدوث تغييرات في المشروع","لتبسيط الموافقة على جميع طلبات التغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":"في النهج التقليدي تساعد خطة إدارة التغيير في إدارة عملية تغيير المشروع ، وتضمن التحكم الفعال في الميزانية والجدول الزمني والنطاق والتواصل والموارد. ستعمل خطة إدارة التغيير على تقليل التأثير الذي يمكن أن يحدثه التغيير على الأعمال والموظفين والعملاء وأصحاب المصلحة المهمين الآخرين ، والغرض من عملية إدارة التغيير هذه هو إدارة طلبات التغيير بحيث يتم التحكم في التغييرات المعتمدة ، مما يضمن بقاء المشروع قيد التشغيل الجدول الزمني ، في حدود الميزانية ويوفر النواتج المتفق عليها.\n\nيتم لجنة التحكم في التغيير من قبل مجموعة من الأشخاص الذين يقومون بمراجعة التغييرات الخاصة بالمشروع أو الموافقة عليها أو رفضها. يجب أن يشمل لجنة التحكم في التغيير بشكل مثالي راعي المشروع من بين أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين الآخرين في المشروع والإدارة العليا.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":444,"q":"A project manager has requested one of the team members to assist in the development of the change management plan. The team member has only worked on agile projects and is not familiar with how the change management process is handled on projects with a traditional waterfall framework . What might the project manager state regarding the purpose of developing a change management plan ?","t":"S","o":["To avoid gold plating by developers during project execution","To provide direction for managing the change control process","To prevent changes from occurring on the project","To streamline the approval of all change requests"],"c":[1],"f":"In traditional Approach A change management plan helps manage the project change process, and ensures the effective control of budget, schedule, scope, communication, and resources. The change management plan will minimize the impact a change can have on the business, employees, customers, and other important stakeholders.The purpose of this change management process is to manage change requests so that approved changes will be controlled, ensuring the project remains on schedule, within budget and provides the agreed deliverables.\n\nA Change Control Board is formed by a group of people that review, approve or reject the changes of a project. CCB should ideally include the Project Sponsor amongst other key project stakeholders and higher management.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":546}},{"qa":"المشروع السابق كان فاشلا ولم تتحقق اهدافه. ومع ذلك ، نظرًا لأن المنظمة لا تزال بحاجة إلى المخرجات التي كان من المقرر أن ينتجها هذا المشروع ، فإن المنظمة تبدأ مشروعًا جديدًا. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لضمان أن يبدأ المشروع الجديد باحتمالية أعلى للنجاح؟","oa":["تأكد من عدم مشاركة أعضاء الفريق من المشروع الفاشل في المشروع الجديد لتجنب تكرار الفشل","قم بتضمين افتراض ميثاق المشروع بأن هذا المشروع قد يفشل أيضًا في تلبية توقعات أصحاب المصلحة وفقًا لذلك","راجع الدروس المستفادة من المشروع الفاشل لدمج هذه المعرفة في ميثاق المشروع الخاص بالمشروع الجديد","اجمع المعلومات من مدير المشروع وفريق المشروع الفاشل واستخدم هذه المعلومات للتخطيط للمشروع الجديد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":445,"q":"The previous project was a failure , and its objectives have not been achieved. However, since the organization still needs the deliverables that were to be produced by that project, the organization initiates a new project. What should the project manager do to ensure that the new project starts with a higher probability of success ?","t":"S","o":["Make certain that the team members from the failed project are not involved in the new project to avoid repeating the failure","Include the assumption the project charter that this project may also fail to start stakeholder expectations accordingly","Review the lessons learned from the failed project to incorporate this knowledge into the project charter of the new project","Gather information from the project manager and the team of the failed project and use this information to plan the new project"],"c":[2],"f":"Lessons learned are the documented information that reflects both the positive and negative experiences of a project. They represent the organization's commitment to project management excellence and the project manager's opportunity to learn from the actual experiences of others.\n\nCapturing lessons learned should be an on-going effort throughout the life of the project. This mindset should be strongly encouraged by the project manager from day one. Whether we are using lessons learned to prepare for current projects or for identifying project management process improvements, we learn from project failures as well as project successes. By not learning from project failures we are doomed to repeat similar situations. By not maximizing on project successes, we miss opportunities to implement good processes and practices to successfully complete existing and future work.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":547}},{"qa":"يتم نقل مدير المشروع إلى بلد آخر لتنفيذ مشروع داخل مؤسستهم. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً لضمان التعاون داخل الفريق من أجل التسليم الناجح؟","oa":["حدد أسلوب القيادة المناسب لذلك الموقع","عيّن موردًا محليًا لإدارة الاتصال بالفريق","تحقق مما إذا كان يمكن أيضًا تخصيص موارد من المقر الرئيسي للمشروع","إرشاد أعضاء الفريق لأداء إدارة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":446,"q":"A project manager is transferred to another country to perform a project within their organization . What should the project manager do first to ensure collaboration within the team for successful delivery?","t":"S","o":["Determine a leadership style that is suitable for that location","Assign a local resource to manage communication with the team","Check if resources from headquarters can also be assigned to the project","Mentor the team members to perform project management"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager should \"Determine a leadership style that is suitable for that location\" to ensure collaboration within the team for successful delivery","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":548}},{"qa":"أنت تقود مشروعًا مختلطًا مع فريق رشيق يطور تطبيق الويب وفريق هندسي تقليدي لتصميم الخدمات التي ستستضيف التطبيق. تريد تحديد ما تقوله شركتك حول استخدام أدوات الوسائط الاجتماعية للتواصل والعمل مع أصحاب المصلحة لتلبية احتياجاتهم وتوقعاتهم. ما هو أفضل مسار للعمل لديك؟","oa":["استشر راعي المشروع","مراجعة  أصول العملية التنظيمية","مراجعة سجل أصحاب المصلحة","تحقق من مستودع الدروس المستفادة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":447,"q":"You are leading a hybrid project with an agile team developing the web application and a traditional engineering team to design the serves that will host the application. You want to determine what does your company say about the use of social media tools to communicate and work with the stakeholders to meet their needs and expectations. What is your best course of action?","t":"S","o":["Consult with the project sponsor","Check the organizational process assets","Review the stakeholder register","Check the lessons learned repository"],"c":[1],"f":"Most organizations have developed a range of templates, contracts, registers, and assessment tools to assist the management of their projects. Organizations have also acquired knowledge in the form of lessons learned—and the organization’s knowledge base that can be very useful.\n\nTherefore, Organizational Process Assets would include anything the organization has acquired that you can use in the management of the project. They include formal and informal plans, policies, procedures, and guidelines. These are very important for the planning stage, irrespective of the nature of the project. Whether your project is long-term or short-term, OPAs are a must.\n\nHere’s a list of common OPAs:\n\nSocial Media tools\nStandardized guidelines\nProposal evaluation criteria\nWork breakdown structure templates\nProject schedule network diagram templates\nRisk templates\nOrganizational standard processes\nProject closure guidelines\nDefect management processes\nLessons learned and historical databases\nChange control procedures\nFinancial control procedures\nProject files","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":549}},{"qa":"قررت شركة تطبيق نظام أرشفة جديد. حدث خرق للبيانات أثناء تنفيذ المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["راجع طرق التوثيق البديلة مع الفريق","قم بتحديث سجل المخاطر بالمخاطر والأثر المقترح","تنفيذ الاستجابة للمخاطر المخطط لها للتعامل مع المشكلة","اطلب من الفريق إصلاح النظام لحل المشكلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":448,"q":"A company has decided to implement a new archiving system. A data breach occurred during the implementation of the project. What should the project manager do first ?","t":"S","o":["Review alternative documentation methods with team","Update the risk register with the risk and proposed impact","Implement the planned risk response to handle the issue","Ask the team to fix the system to resolve the issue"],"c":[3],"f":"(A data breach occurred during the implementation) this is an issue so the project manager should ask the team to fix the system to resolve the issue.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":550}},{"qa":"يستخدم مدير المشروع منهجية تنبؤية لأكثر من 9 سنوات ويتحول إلى مشروع رشيق. لم يعمل أعضاء الفريق معًا من قبل. بعد تكرارين من العمل ، لم يحقق الفريق أي نتيجة  وهناك الكثير من الضغط لإنجاز العمل. ما نوع أسلوب القيادة الذي يجب أن يستخدمه مدير المشروع في هذه المرحلة؟","oa":["أسلوب توجيهي يتخذ قرارات للمجموعة للوصول إلى نتائج مبكرة","أسلوب قيادة سلبي يسمح للفريق بالتنظيم الذاتي حتى الوصول إلى مرحلة وضع المعايير","أسلوب قيادة يدرب الأشخاص الذين يرغبون في المساعدة ويعزز تعاون الفريق بشكل أكبر","أسلوب ديمقراطي يستخدم تقنيات يسود فيها رأي الأغلبية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":449,"q":"A project manager has been using a predictive methodology for more than 9 years and is switching to an agile project . The team memebers have no previously worked together. After two sprints of work , the team has not achieved any outcome and there is a lot of pressure to get work done. What kind of leadership style should the project manager use at this stage?","t":"S","o":["A directive style that makes decisions for the group to reach early outcomes","A passive leadership style that allows the team to self-organized until the norming stage is reached","A leadership style that coaches people who want help and fosters greater team collaboration","A democratic style that uses techniques where majority opinion prevails"],"c":[2],"f":"To improve performace of the team the project manager should use the best strategy A leadership style that coaches people who want help and fosters greater team collaboration","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":551}},{"qa":"المشروع في مرحلة التنفيذ ويتم إدارته باستخدام نهج مختلط. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لضمان الامتثال الكامل لمتطلبات الجودة أثناء مرحلة التنفيذ؟","oa":["ضع سياسات وإجراءات الجودة","تحليل متطلبات الجودة","مسح مستمر لجودة التسليمات","وضع خطة إدارة  الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":450,"q":"A project is in the implementation phase and is managed using a hybrid approach. What should the project manager do to ensure full compliance of quality requirements during the execution phase ?","t":"S","o":["Set up quality policies and procedures","Analyze the quality requirements","Continually survey the quality of the deliverable","Plan quality management"],"c":[2],"f":"To ensure full compliance of quality requirements using a hybrid approach during the execution phase the project manager should Continually survey the quality of the deliverable","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":552}},{"qa":"أثناء مراجعة النماذج الأولية ، وجد فريق الجودة بعض الانحرافات التي لا تؤثر على الوظيفة الرئيسية ولكن من المحتمل أن تكون مشكلة في المستقبل. لتجنب المشاكل الكبيرة في المستقبل ، يوصي الفريق بإجراءات تصحيحية تتطلب أموالاً إضافية. يكافح المشروع بالفعل للبقاء على الميزانية ، بل إنه استخدم بعض احتياطي الطوارئ. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اسأل مصمم المنتج عن سبب عدم مراعاة الانحراف في مرحلة التصميم","اطلب من فريق الجودة تجاهل العينة واختبارها مرة أخرى بعينة جديدة","أبلغ راعي المشروع أن المنتج يعمل وأن المشروع يواجه صعوبات في الميزانية","تقييم وبدء عملية طلب التغيير مع أصحاب المصلحة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":451,"q":"While reviewing prototypes , the quality team found some deviations that do not affect the main functionality but have the potential to be an issue in the future . To avoid major problems in the future , the team recommends corrective actions that will require additional funds . The project is already struggling to stay on budget and has even used some of the contigency reserve . What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Ask the product designer why the deviation was not considered in the design phase","Ask the quality team to discard the sample and test again with a new sample .","Report to the project sponsor that the product is working and the project is struggling with the budget","Evaluate and initiate the change request process with the stakeholders"],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword ( require additional funds) so the project manager should evaluate and initiate the change request process with the stakeholders and any change in the baseline should be through a formal change request","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":553}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع يقود مشروعًا مع العديد من المعنيين في المجالات الوظيفية الأخرى للشركة. تمت ترقية أحد المعنيين لقيادة مجال وظيفي آخر ، ولا يزال أحد المعنيين في هذا المشروع. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع أن يطلب تحديثه من فريق المشروع لضمان التواصل المناسب معه؟","oa":["خطة إدارة الاتصالات","خطة إدارة المشروع","سجل المعنيين","خطة مشاركة المعنيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":452,"q":"A project manager is leading a project with several stakeholders in other functional areas of the company . One of these stakeholders has just been promoted to lead another functional area , and remains a stakeholder for this project. What should the project manager have the project team update to ensure proper communications to stakeholders?","t":"S","o":["Communications management plan","Project management plan","Stakeholder register","Stakeholder engagement plan"],"c":[2],"f":"A stakeholder register is a project document that records the details of your stakeholders. You should update the register when you identify any new stakeholders. Any change in a stakeholder's attributes should be updated in the register. You should limit access to this document, as it may have sensitive information.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":554}},{"qa":"خلال مرحلة تنفيذ مشروع تكنولوجيا المعلومات للرعاية الصحية ، يستقيل مدير مشروع العميل. لم يعد أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيون يحصلون على معلومات محدثة في الوقت المناسب. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["تحديث خطة إدارة الاتصالات","إبلاغ المعنيين الرئيسيين مباشرة","استمر في إرسال المعلومات حتى يتم تلقي الرد","تحديث راعي المشروع بشأن هذه القضية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":453,"q":"During the execution phase of healthcare IT Project , The customer's project manager resigns . The key stakeholders are no longer getting updated information in a timely manner . What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Update the communications management plan","Inform the key stakeholders directly","Keep sending the information until a response is received","Update the project sponsor on the issue"],"c":[0],"f":"Keyword(The key stakeholder no longer getting updated information in a timely manner ) so the problem related to communication so the project manager should Update the communications management plan","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":555}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":454,"q":"While developing a new product , a key stakeholder expresses concern anout insufficient information on product feature requirements. The product team disagrees and mentions that detailed requirements have been provided . What should the project manager do to handle this situation?","t":"S","o":["Record the new requirements and ask the product team to develop them","Conduct new risk and scope analyses , identifying the missing information","Conduct new risk and scope analyses , identifying the missing information","Organize a discussion with the product team to clarify the missing information."],"c":[3],"f":"There is disagreement with the product teamand mentions that detailed requirements have been provided so the project manager should Organize a discussion with the product team to clarify the missing information.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5"},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ، اكتشف فريق المشروع فرصة جديدة. بعد المراجعة الداخلية ، وافق فريق المشروع على أن الفرصة خارج نطاق المشروع. قرر مدير المشروع تحديث سجل المخاطر وتصعيد الفرصة إلى مستوى أعلى. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع بعد ذلك بهذه الفرصة؟","oa":["لا يلزم اتخاذ مزيد من الإجراءات","إنشاء احتياطي طوارئ لدعم الفرصة","شارك هذه الفرصة مع مشروع آخ","مراقبة الفرصة بشكل أكبر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":455,"q":"During the implementation of a project, the project team discovered a new opportunity. After an internal review, the project team agreed that the opportunity is outside of the project scope. The project manager decided to update the risk register and escalate the opportunity to a higher level.\nWhat should the project manager do next with this opportunity?","t":"S","o":["No more action is required","Establish a contingency reserve to support the opportunity","Share this opportunity with another project","Further monitor the opportunity"],"c":[0],"f":"Since the project manager escalated the issue...waiting for approval","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":556}},{"qa":"أثناء التكرار الثالث للمشروع ، تم استبدال اثنين من أعضاء الفريق الحاليين. عندما دخل المشروع في التكرار التالي ، انخفضت سرعة الفريق وبدأ الأداء في التراجع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تصعيد المشكلة إلى الجهة الراعية للمشروع","عقد فعالية لبناء الفريق لمعالجة مؤشرات الأداء الرئيسية","مناقشة الانخفاض في الإنتاجية مع الموارد البشرية","قم بتوجيه الفريق للعودة إلى مرحلتي التشكيل والعصف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":456,"q":"During a project's third iteration, two of the existing team members were replaced. As the project entered the next iteration, the team velocity dropped and the performance started to slip.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Escalate the issue to the project sponsor","Convene a team building event to address key performance indicators (KPIs)","Discuss the decrease in productivity with human resources (HR)","Guide the team to revert back to the forming and storming stages."],"c":[3],"f":"In the question, it says that two members of the team have been replaced, so if new members join, we start with each person who knows himself and defines his skills and starts storming. Each member presents ideas and points of view, then we start working Teambuilding, and we use performance indicators for measurement","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":557}},{"qa":"خلال المرحلة الأخيرة من المشروع ، يطلب أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين من مدير المشروع إطلاع المجلس التنفيذي على عائد الاستثمار  وأي قيمة تجارية جديدة ذات صلة يتم تحديدها أثناء تنفيذ المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["راجع تحليل التكلفة مقابل المنفعة","راجع خطة إدارة المنافع","راجع خطة إدارة التكلفة","راجع عوامل النجاح المالي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":457,"q":"During the final stage of a project , one of the key stakeholders asks the project manager to debrief the executive board about the return on investment (ROI) and any relevant new commerical value identified during project implementation. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Review the cost - benefit analysis","Review the benefits management plan","Review the cost management plan","Review the financial success factors"],"c":[1],"f":"The benefits management plan presents a summary of the project's benefits expected by the business, how they will be delivered and how they will be measured. It will also describe any post-project benefits reviews that are required.\n\nThe benefits management plan should establish baselines and targets in order to measure achievement for each benefit identified.\nA benefits management plan explains what the benefits of the project area and how and when they’ll be delivered. The plan does this by including the following.\n\nDescribing what the benefit is\nCreating a schedule for when the benefit will be delivered\nIdentifying who owns the benefits\nDefining the metric used to measure the benefit and what the baseline will be\nListing the assumptions and risks associated with achieving the benefit\nhe benefits management plan will identify, monitor and track benefits over the project’s life cycle and often after the project is finished. This is used to make sure the organization and benefit owners (those who are the main beneficiaries) stay focused on the benefits throughout this process.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":558}},{"qa":"بدأت شركة في تنفيذ سكروم. في منتصف الطريق تقريبًا خلال التكرار الأول ، تتطور مشكلات الاتصال. لا يتزامن بعض أعضاء فريق المشروع مع أعضاء الفريق الآخرين. ما سبب هذه الفجوة في التواصل؟","oa":["لم يتم تحديث لوحة تكرار المشروع","لم يتم تطوير خطة إدارة  الأتصالات","لم يتم عقد اجتماعات الوقوف اليومية أو إنفاذها","لم يتم تحديث لوحة معلومات حالة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":458,"q":"A company starts implementating Scrum . About halfway through the first sprint, communication issues develop. Some project team members are not in sync with other team members. What is the cause for this communication gap","t":"S","o":["The project sprint board has not been updated","The communications management plan has not been developed","Daily standup meetings were not held or enforced","The project status dashboard has not been updated"],"c":[1],"f":"The cause for this communication gap is that the communiacations management plan has not been develope","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":559}},{"qa":"أثناء تدقيق الوثائق لشركة دولية ، تم تحديد أن الإصدار الأخير من الجدول الزمني للمشروع كان منذ شهر واحد على الرغم من أن مدير المشروع كان يعلم أنه تم تحديثه مؤخرًا. كيف ينبغي أن يتعامل مدير المشروع مع وثائق المشروع؟","oa":["حفظ الوثائق في نظام معلومات إدارة المشروع ، ومشاركتها مع  المعنيين المناسبين","تحديث خطة إدارة المشروع بانتظام ومشاركتها بشكل آمن مع جميع المعنيين","تم تعيين عضو فريق المشروع لضمان تحديث جميع وثائق المشروع","مراجعة سجل المخاطر لتحديد خطة الاستجابة للتدقيق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":459,"q":"During a documentation audit of an international company it was identified that the last version of the project schedule was from one month ago even though the project manager knew it was recently updated. How should the project manager have handled documentation for the project?","t":"S","o":["Kept documentation in the project management information system (PMIS) , and shared it with appropriate stakeholders","Updated the project management plan regularly and had it securely shared with all stakeholders","Assigned a project team member to ensure all project documentation was updated","Review the risk register to identify a response plan for the audit"],"c":[0],"f":"As a project manager, it is essential for you to efficiently manage all the documents, information, and data that come with a project. Since all the knowledge is too much for a project manager to handle alone, it becomes helpful to use a PMIS or a Project Management Institute System - a software that can help manage, control, and plan the flow of information and data.\n\nA Project Management Information System is designed to assist all elements of project management, including information that must be monitored or collected. PMIS can be used for project scope management, integration management, project time management, project cost management, project quality management, project risk management, communications management, and more.\n\nDepending on the project phase, PMIS may perform differently. It corresponds to the project manager's requirements and aids in the completion of project-specific phase needs. Depending on the stage of the project, a PMIS performs different functions. A basic PMIS should allow you to track your project's time, scope, and cost. A good PMIS should have a wide range of project management software functions that you may employ throughout the project life cycle.\n\n \n\n \n\nDepending on the project phase, PMIS may perform differently. It corresponds to the project manager's requirements and aids in the completion of project-specific phase needs. Depending on the stage of the project, a PMIS performs different functions. A basic PMIS should allow you to track your project's time, scope, and cost. A good PMIS should have a wide range of project management software functions that you may employ throughout the project life cycle.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":560}},{"qa":"وفقًا للرسم البياني للحرق التنازلي الموضح أدناه ، فإن خط الحرق التنازلي المنقط هو الخطة. ما الذي يجب أن يراه الفريق في اليوم الثالث","oa":["هم في خطر لهذا التسليم","هناك تجاوز للتكلفة","التكرار قبل الموعد المحدد","التكرار على المسار الصحيح"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":460,"q":"As per the burndown graph shown below , the dotted burndown line is the plan. What should the team see at day 3","t":"S","o":["They are at risk for that delivery","There is a cost overrun","The iteration is ahead of schedule","The iteration on track"],"c":[0],"f":"The graph shows an example of a burndown chart where the team planned to delivery 37 story points . Story points rate the relative work , risk and complexity of a requirements or story . Agile teams use story points to estimate effort . The dotted burndown line is the plan. The team can see by Day 3 that they are at risk for that delivery.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":561}},{"qa":"يعمل فريق رشيق لوقت إضافي في التكرارات القليلة الماضية. قرر مدير المشروع أنه من الآن فصاعدًا ، يجب أن يحتفظ الفريق بأسبوع عمل مدته 40 ساعة. ما هو السبب الأكثر احتمالا وراء قرار مدير المشروع؟","oa":["لتقديم برامج العمل بشكل متكرر","لتعظيم مقدار العمل غير المنجز","لتعزيز التنمية المستدامة","لتقليل حجم العمل الجاري"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":461,"q":"An agile team has been working overtime for the last few iterations . The project manager has decides that from now the team should maintain a 40-hour workweek. What is the most likely reason behind the project manager's decision?","t":"S","o":["To deliver working software frequently","To maximize the amount of work not done","To promote sustainable development","To minimize the amount of work in progress"],"c":[2],"f":"Agile processes promote sustainable development . The sponsors , developers . The sponsors , developers , and users should be able to maintain a constant pace idndefinitely . \" Constant pace would allow the team members to maintain their work-life balance, make fewer mistakes, sustain healthy productivity , collaborate better, and posiibly refrain from resigning.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":562}},{"qa":"اقترب المشروع من الاكتمال وتم اكتشاف خطر غير محدد سابقًا. ما هو الاحتياطي الذي سوف يستخدمه مدير المشروع لتغطية هذه المخاطر؟","oa":["خط الأساس لتمويل المشروع","خط الأساس للتكلفة","احتياطي إداري","احتياطي الطوارئ"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":462,"q":"The project near to complete and a previously unidentified risk is discovered . Which funds will the project manager use to cover this risk?","t":"S","o":["Project funding baseline","Cost baseline","Management reserve","Contingency reserve"],"c":[2],"f":"During the course of a project, you and your project team identify risks which are referred to as known/unknown risks. These risks are known – that is, they've been identified. However, we don't know the amount of rework that will be required if the risks occur.\n\nWe handle the known/unknown risks by creating a contingency reserve using estimating techniques such as the Expected Monetary Value (EMV) Method. The project manager adds the contingency reserve to the project budget, resulting in the cost baseline.\n\nCost Baseline = Cost Estimate + Contingency Reserve\n\nFurthermore, project managers encounter unknown/unknown risks. These risks have not been identified. Therefore, we don't know the cost of responding to these risks. Here's where the management reserve comes into play.\nThe management reserve is the amount of the project budget reserved for unforeseen work that is within the scope of the project. The project manager adds the management reserve to the cost baseline resulting in the total project budget.\n\nProject Budget = Cost Baseline + Management Reserve\nThe project manager does not have control of the management reserve. That's why it's called the \"management\" reserve. It's controlled by management, typically the project sponsor or senior management. Consequently, the project manager cannot access or adjust the management reserve without approval from the sponsor.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":563}},{"qa":"تم اكتشاف خطأ في التصميم الهندسي ونتج عنه إعادة عمل كبيرة وتجاوزات في التكلفة. يقوم مدير المشروع بتحليل السبب الجذري ويكتشف أن الرسم لم يتم فحصه وفقًا للإجراءات. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لضمان عدم حدوث ذلك في المشاريع المستقبلية؟","oa":["تحديث خطة إدارة الجودة","تحديد والتحكم في الموارد المسؤولة عن الأخطاء","سجل النتائج في مستودع الدروس المستفادة","أبلاغ كل مدير المشروع الآخر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":463,"q":"An error detected in the engineering dreawing and results in significant rework, and cost overruns. The project manager performs a root cause analysis and discovers that the drawing was not checked according to procedures . What should the project manager do to ensure that this doesn't happen in future projects?","t":"S","o":["Update the quality management plan.","Identify and control the resource responsible for the mistakes","Capture the findings in the lessons learned repository","Inform all the other project manager"],"c":[2],"f":"Capturing lessons learned should be an on-going effort throughout the life of the project. This mindset should be strongly encouraged by the project manager from day one. Whether we are using lessons learned to prepare for current projects or for identifying project management process improvements, we learn from project failures as well as project successes. By not learning from project failures we are doomed to repeat similar situations. By not maximizing on project successes, we miss opportunities to implement good processes and practices to successfully complete existing and future work","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":564}},{"qa":"يكتشف مدير المشروع عيبًا كبيرًا في أحد تسليمات المشروع . ما هي عملية إدارة المشروع التي يتم تنفيذها؟","oa":["أخذ العينات الإحصائية","ضبط الجودة","إدارة الجودة","وضع خطة إدارة الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":464,"q":"A project manager discovers a significant flaw in a major project deliverable. Which project management process is being performed?","t":"S","o":["Statistical sampling","Control quality","Manage quality","Plan quality management"],"c":[1],"f":"The Control Quality process is performed to measure the completeness,compliance, and fitness for use of a product or service prior to user acceptance and final delivery.This is done by measuring all steps, attributes, and variables used to verify conformance or compliance to the specifications stated during the planning stage.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":565}},{"qa":"تعتمد المهمة \"ب\" على المهمة \"أ\" التي تم تأخيرها. يتوفر مورد المهمة \"ب\" بشكل محدود ويجب أن تبدأ المهمة \"ب\" في الوقت المحدد. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لإعادة جدولة الجدول الزمني بحيث لا يتغير الموعد النهائي؟","oa":["التتابع السريع للمهمة  ( أ ) ونقل تاريخ بدء المهمة ( ب )","ضغط زمن المهمة  أ وابدأ المهمة ب حسب التخطيط","إعادة التخطيط لتاريخ بدء المهمة \"ب\" بحيث تبدأ بعد الانتهاء من المهمة أ","التتابع السريع للمهمة (ب) والبدء على الفور"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":465,"q":"Task B is dependent upon task A which is delayed. Resource for task B have limited availability and must begin task B on time . What should the project manager do to replan the schedule so that the deadline is unchanges?","t":"S","o":["Fast track task A and move task B's start date","Crash task A and start task B at the planning time","Re plan task B 's start date so it begins after the completion of task A","Fast track task B and immediately begin work"],"c":[1],"f":"The relation between task A and B is Finish to Start the task A is delayed, so the project manager should focus on crashing task A and start task B at the planned time so that the deadline is unchanged.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":566}},{"qa":"خلال مرحلة بدء مشروع تصميم معرض الوسائط المتعددة ، يقوم مدير المشروع بتطوير خطة إدارة المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لإكمال هذه المهمة؟","oa":["ابدأ استطلاعًا للحصول على آراء العملاء النهائيين وتحديد أولويات محتويات المعرض","ضع علامة مرجعية على القوائم القابلة للتسليم والنتيجة النهائية للمعارض الأخرى المماثلة","توضيح متطلبات العمل عالية المستوى مع منظم الحدث كأساس لتشكيل قائمة التسليمات","بدء اتفاقية خدمات إضافية في حالة عدم ذكر قائمة التسليمات الرئيسية بوضوح في العقد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":466,"q":"During the initiation phase stage of a multimedia exhibition -design project, the project manager is developing the project management plan. What should the project manager do to complete this task?","t":"S","o":["Initiate a survey to solicit end-customer opinions and prioritize exhibition contents","Benchmark other similar exhibitions' deliverable lists and final outcome","Clarify the high-level business requirements with the event organizer as a basis for forming the deliverables list","Initiate an additional services agreement in case the key deliverables list was not clearly stated in the contract"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword (initiation stage) during this stage all information is high level to help in planning. So the best option (Clarify the high-level business requirements with the event organizer as a basis for forming the deliverables list)","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":567}},{"qa":"يملك مدير المشروع أعضاء فريق حول العالم في العديد من المناطق الزمنية المختلفة ، يتوقف عمل المشروع بشكل متكرر لأن الأشخاص في أحد المكاتب يحتاجون إلى الانتظار حتى يستيقظ مكتب آخر للإجابة على الأسئلة. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب ذلك؟","oa":["معرفة  المزيد حول كيفية تفضيل كل عضو في الفريق للتواصل قبل إسناد أعمال المشروع","تخطيط المهام وحزم العمل وجدولة مواعيدها للتغلب على التحديات الجغرافية والمتعلقة بالمنطقة الزمنية","ضمان أن المشروع سيكون الأولوية العليا لجميع أعضاء الفريق","أستخدم أدوات التواصل ، مثل مؤتمرات الفيديو حتى تتمكن المكاتب المختلفة من التواصل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":467,"q":"A project manager has team members around the world in many different time zones project work frequently stalls because people in one office need to wait until another office is awake to have questions answered .\nWhat should the project manager have done to avoid this ?","t":"S","o":["Learned more about how each team member prefers to communicate before assigning project","Planned and scheduled tasks and work packages to overcome geographical and time zone challenges","Ensured that the project would be the highest priority for all team members","Used communication tools , such as video conferencing so different offices could communicate"],"c":[2],"f":"The problem with the scenario is not because video conferencing is not used. Regardless of the time differnece , a good mechanism should have been followed to avoid delaying the work and for the project to be a top priority for all team members so the best option is ( Ensured that the project would be the highest priority for all team members)","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":568}},{"qa":"يبدأ مدير المشروع مشروعًا باستخدام نهج هجين ويلاحظ أن بعض أعضاء الفريق لديهم فقط معرفة بالنهج التنبؤية ، فما الذي يحتاجه مدير المشروع أولاً من أجل الحصول على أداء جيد للمشروع ؟","oa":["تقديم تدريب لجميع أعضاء الفريق على النهج المختلط","قم بتغيير الفريق ليشمل خبراء مختصين","قم بتقييم التدريب المطلوب لكل عضو في الفريق","قم بتدريب أعضاء الفريق الذين يفتقرون إلى المعرفة المختلطة للتعلم أثناء العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":468,"q":"A project manager is starting a project using a hybrid approach and notices some team members only have knowledge of predictive approaches what does the project manager need to do first in order ro have good project performance?","t":"S","o":["Deliver hybrid training to all team members","Change the team to include hybrid experts","Assess the required training per team member","Coach those team members lacking hybrid knowledge to learn on the job."],"c":[3],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam \n\nIn the scenario project manager is starting a project using a hybrid approach (Agile + Predictive ) but some team members only have knowledge of predictive approaches so the project manager should Coach those team members lacking hybrid knowledge to learn on the job. in order to have good project performance","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":569}},{"qa":"في الاجتماع اليومي للمشروع ، يشكو أعضاء الفريق من تلقي رسائل بريد إلكتروني من مديريهم الوظيفيين لدعم المهام الأخرى غير المتعلقة بالمشروع. هذا له تأثير سلبي على إنتاجية الفريق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["قم بتسجيل هذا باعتباره خطرًا في سجل المخاطر واستمر في مراقبة المشكلة في الاجتماعات اللاحقة","اطلب من مالك المنتج التحدث مع المديرين الوظيفيين للتأكد من أن المتطلبات المستقبلية تأتي من خلال مالك المنتج","تعامل مع هذا القلق مع المديرين الفنيين لضمان عدم حدوث مزيد من التأخير","حدد موعدًا لاجتماع مع جميع المديرين الوظيفيين لحل تعارضات الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":469,"q":"At the daily project meeting , team members are complaining about receiving emails from their functional managers to support other nonproject-related tasks. This is having a negative impact on the team's productivity. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Log this as a risk in the risk register and continue to monitor the issue at subsequent meetings","Ask the product owner to speak with the functional managers to ensure future requirements come through the product owner.","Address this concern with the functional managers to ensure there will be no further delays","Schedule a meeting with all of the functional managers to resolve the resource conflicts"],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should Schedule a meeting with all of the functional managers to resolve the resource conflicts","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":570}},{"qa":"سيتضمن نظام التواصل الجديد ميزة رفع التقارير من خلال لوحة قياس عبر الانترنت . قد يتلقى المجلس التنفيذي تقارير الأداء كل أسبوعين من خلال لوحة قياس عبر الإنترنت. ماذا يجب أن تفعل كمدير مشروع؟","oa":["تحديث خطة إدارة التواصل","مراجعة خطة إدارة المشروع","تحديث خطة مشاركة المعنيين","راجع خطة إدارة التهيئة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":470,"q":"A company's new communication system will include online dashboard reporting. The executive board might receive bi-weekly performance reports through the online dashboard. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Update the communications management plan","Review the project management plan","Update the stakeholder engagement plan","Review the configuration management plan"],"c":[0],"f":"A company's new communication system need to Update the communications management plan to comply with expectations of stakeholders","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":571}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لمشروع بناء. خلال اجتماع مراجعة  المشروع ، قرر أصحاب المصلحة الاستجابة للمخاطر المعروفة والجديدة التي تمت مواجهتها أثناء تنفيذ المشروع. أي من القطع الأثرية التالية يجب على أصحاب المصلحة مراجعتها؟","oa":["سجل أعمال المنتج معدلة حسب المخاطر","خطة إدارة الوثائق","سجل المشروع","سجل الافتراض والقيود"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":471,"q":"You are a project manager for a construction project. During the project review meeting, the stakeholders decided to respond to known and new risks encountered during project execution. Which of the following artifacts should the stakeholders review?","t":"S","o":["Risk-adjusted backlog","Document management plan.","project log","Assumption/constraints log"],"c":[0],"f":"A risk-adjusted backlog is a backlog that includes work and actions to address threats and opportunities. Pmbok7 page#185.\n\nThe risk-adjusted backlog is a sprint or release backlog containing risk response tasks for actionable risks. For negative risks, these actions include avoiding, mitigating, and transferring. For positive risks, they include exploiting, enhancing, and sharing","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":572}},{"qa":"إدارة توقعات أصحاب المصلحة في مشروع عالي المخاطر هي مسؤولية .......","oa":["راعي المشروع","مدير المشروع","مدير أول","ظابط المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":472,"q":"The management of the stakeholder expectations in a high-risk project is the responsibility of……","t":"S","o":["Project sponsor.","Project manager.","Senior Manager.","Project Officer."],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager is responsible for the management of stakeholder expectations in the project.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":573}},{"qa":"شركة تركز بشدة على تقديم المشاريع باستخدام الأساليب التنبؤية على مستوى مدير مشروع جديد يستخدم أساليب مختلطة. يحتوي نطاق المشروع على عدد من المتطلبات غير الواضحة. كيف يجب أن يخطط مدير المشروع لتسليم المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتقسيم المتطلبات وتحديد أولويات المتطلبات في حزم العمل التكرارية","تصعيد مسألة المتطلبات غير الواضحة لفريق الإدارة وانتظر الإذن النهائي","تجاهل المتطلبات غير الواضحة والتركيز على خطة تسليم المشروع","انتظر حتى تكون المتطلبات أكثر وضوحًا قبل اتخاذ أي إجراء آخر بشأن المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":473,"q":"A company that is heavily focused on delivering projects using predictive approaches on-boards a new project manager who uses hybrid approaches. The scope of the project contains a number of unclear requirements.\nHow should the project manager plan the delivery of the project?","t":"S","o":["Break down the requirements and prioritize the requirements into iterative work packages","Escalate the issue of unclear requirements to the management team and wait for final authorization","Ignore the unclear requirements and focus on the delivery plan of the project.","Wait for the requirements to be more clear before any further action is taken on the project"],"c":[0],"f":"In the scenario The scope of the project contains a number of unclear requirements so The best option (Break down the requirements and prioritize the requirements into iterative work packages).","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":574}},{"qa":"تقوم شركة بتغيير نموذج أعمالها الحالي. يتطلب التغيير تنفيذ مشروع معقد باستخدام فرق أجايل متعددة. ما هي الخيارات الثلاثة التي يجب على مدير المشروع أن يعتمدها فريق الاختبار كآليات اختبار؟ (اختر ثلاثة.)","oa":["اختبار الأمان والأداء","الاختبارات القائمة على السلوك والتطوير القائم على الاختبار","الاختبار الشخصي المستقل","نهج تجريبي لتغطية جميع الخيارات الممكنة","اختبار القصة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":474,"q":"A company is changing their current business model. The change requires implementing a complex project using multiple agile teams.\nWhat three options should the project manager have the testing team adopt as testing mechanisms? (Choose three.)","t":"M","o":["Security and performance testing","Tests based on behavior and test-driven development","Independent personal testing","An experimental approach to cover all possible choices","Story testing"],"c":[1,2,4],"f":"The three options should the project manager have the testing team adopt as testing mechanisms in agile teams.\nA. Story testing\nB. Tests based on behavior and test-driven development\nC. Independent personal testing","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":575}},{"qa":"ناقش القائد الفني للعميل ميزة جديدة مع مدير المشروع. يعتقد مدير المشروع أن الميزة الجديدة ستعزز الأداء بشكل كبير ويضيفها كعنصر ذي أولوية عالية في  سجل أعمال المنتج . في نهاية التكرار، لم تكتمل جميع القصص المخططة لأن الميزة الجديدة استغرقت وقتًا أطول. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["اتفق مع فريق المشروع لتعديل وحذف بعض القصص في سجل أعمال التكرار الحالي","تفاوض مع سكروم ماستر  قبل إضافة القصة الجديدة إلى سجل أعمال التكرار","الحصول على موافقة من فريق المشروع وإضافة القصة الجديدة إلى سجل أعمال المنتج","احصل على موافقة من مالك المنتج وأضف القصة الجديدة إلى سجل أعمال المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":475,"q":"A customer's technical lead discussed a new feature with the project manager. The project manager believes the new feature will boost performance significantly and adds it as a high-priority item in the sprint backlog. At the end of the sprint, all of the planned stories were not completed because the new feature took more time.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Agree with the project team to modify and delete some of the stories in the current sprint backlog","Negotiate with the scrum master before adding the new story to the sprint backlog","Obtain approval from the project team and add the new story to the product backlog","Receive an agreement from the product owner and add the new story to the product backlog"],"c":[0],"f":"The product owner is responsible for adding and prioritizing user stories in product backlog. Adding new features took a long time, which led to the incompleteness of all the planned user stories. Therefore, to get the team back on the right track, agree with the project team to modify and delete some stories in the sprint backlog.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":576}},{"qa":"راعي المشروع لمبادرة كبرى يغير باستمرار ترتيب أولويات حزم العمل المعيارية. اعتاد الفريق على تكرارات  لمدة ثلاثة أسابيع وأصبح محبطًا بشكل متزايد من التغييرات اليومية في النطاق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بإعداد اجتماع مع فريق المشروع واطلب رأيهم حول ما يجب القيام به","عقد لقاء مع الراعي لشرح أهمية الحفاظ على دورة التكرار الصارمة","قليل دورة التكرار إلى متوسط طلب إعادة ترتيب الأولويات عن طريق حسابه بالأيام","انتقل إلى استراتيجية كانبان بحيث يمكن إعادة تخصيص العمل بسهولة أكبر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":476,"q":"The project sponsor of a major initiative is consistently changing the prioritization of modular work packages. The team is used to three week sprints and is becoming increasingly frustrated with the daily changes in scope.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Set up a meeting with the project team and ask for their opinion on what to do","Set up a meeting with the sponsor to explain the importance of keeping a strict sprint cycle","Decrease the sprint cycle to the average reprioritization request by calculating it in days.","Move to a Kanban strategy so that work can be reallocated more easily"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager should communicate with the sponsor and discuss the impact of the frequent changes in prioritization on the team's work and schedule. They should explain the importance of a strict sprint cycle for maintaining momentum, predictability, and accountability for the project, and find ways to align the sponsor's priorities with the team's work. This can help to mitigate the frustration of the team and ensure the project is on track.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":577}},{"qa":"مطلوب فريق رشيق لمعالجة المتطلبات التقنية المعقدة التي ليس لها تسليم مرئي لإظهار العميل. ما هو التوجيه الذي يجب أن يقدمه مدير المنتج لتحسين تطوير المتطلبات؟","oa":["اسمح للفريق بالتركيز وإكمال العمل المعقد لأنه سيقلل من مخاطر العثور على مشكلات لاحقًا في المشروع","إعادة ترتيب أولويات تراكم المنتج عن طريق تقليل أولوية النشاط المعقد ، بحيث يتم العمل عليه لاحقًا في المشروع","أبلغ العميل بأنه لن يكون هناك أي تسليم بسبب التعقيد الذي ينطوي عليه المتطلب","ناقش هذا الأمر مع الفريق وأعد ترتيب أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج لتقديم أقصى قيمة من خلال تضمين جزء من العمل المعقد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":477,"q":"An agile team is required to address a technical, complex requirement that has no visual deliverable to show the customer.\nWhat guidance should the product manager provide to improve the requirement development?","t":"S","o":["Allow the team to focus and complete the complex work because it will reduce the risk of finding issues later in the project","Reprioritize the product backlog by lowering the priority of the complex activity, so it will be worked on later in the project","Inform the customer that there will not be any deliverable due to the complexity involved in the requirement","Discuss this with the team and reprioritize the backlog to deliver maximum value by including a portion of the complex work"],"c":[3],"f":"The product manager should collaborate with the team to break down the complex requirement into smaller, manageable portions that can be incorporated into the product backlog. This approach allows the team to work on the complex requirement incrementally, delivering value to the customer and potentially making it easier to demonstrate progress. By reprioritizing the backlog and integrating portions of the complex work, the team can better manage the requirement development process.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":578}},{"qa":"مشروع في منتصف الطريق خلال مرحلة التنفيذ. يتم قبول مواصفات الجودة لمخرجات المشروع رسميًا. ومع ذلك ، فإن أحد أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين غير راضٍ ، مشيرًا إلى أن المخرجات لا تفي بمواصفات الجودة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["إبلاغ راعي المشروع بعدم رضاء أصحاب المصلحة","إخطار صاحب المصلحة بأنه سيتم اتباع إجراءات التحكيم","وثق المشكلة في سجل المشكلات وأرسل تقريرًا إلى الإدارة",".مراجعة مصفوفة تتبع المتطلبات وإجراء عمليات التفتيش"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":478,"q":"A project is halfway through its execution phase. The quality specifications for the project deliverables are formally accepted. However, a key stakeholder is dissatisfied, stating that the deliverables do not meet the quality specifications.\nWhat should the project manager do in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Inform the project sponsor of the stakeholder's dissatisfaction","Notify the stakeholder that arbitration procedures will be followed","Document the issue in the issue log and send a report to management","Review the requirements traceability matrix and conduct inspections"],"c":[3],"f":"A key stakeholder is dissatisfied, stating that the deliverables do not meet the quality specifications SO the project manager should Review the requirements traceability matrix and conduct inspections","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":579}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق بإنهاء الإصدار الثالث لتقديمه إلى أصحاب المصلحة كجزء من العرض التوضيحي. أبلغت الشركة التي تتعاقد من الباطن مع المطورين أن هناك مشكلة في التدفق النقدي ولن تكون الشركة قادرة على توفير نفس الموارد للتكرارات التالية. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["إنشاء سجل مخاطر لتتبع المخاطر وطلب ميزانية إضافية","قم بتحليل التأثير مقابل خطة الأصدار إذا لم تتم معالجة المشكلة","العمل مع مالك المشروع لتحديد أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج","تصعيد الموقف إلى الجهة الراعية للمشروع لحل محتمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":479,"q":"A team is finishing the third release to present to the stakeholder as part of a demonstration. The company that subcontracts the developers has communicated that there is a cash flow problem and the company will not be able to provide the same resources for the next iterations.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Create a risk register to track the risks and request additional budget","Analyze the impact against the release plan if the blocker is not addressed","Work with the project owner to prioritize the product backlog","Escalate the situation to the project sponsor for a possible resolution"],"c":[1],"f":"Analyze the impact against the release plan if the blocker is not addressed","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":580}},{"qa":"منظمة تنتقل من نهج تنبؤي إلى نهج رشيق. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع للتأكد من أن الأساليب الرشيقة ستحدث تغييرًا كبيرًا؟","oa":["تعلم قدر الإمكان عن المنظمة","تحديد العملاء الرئيسيين للمنظمة","الحصول على الدعم الإداري الكامل","إجراء تدريب على النهج الرشيق لأعضاء الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":480,"q":"An organization is transitioning from a predictive to an agile approach.\nWhat should the project manager do to ensure that the agile approaches will bring about significant change?","t":"S","o":["Learn as much as possible about the organization","Identify the organization's key clients","Obtain full management support","Conduct agile training for the team members"],"c":[3],"f":"An organization is transitioning from a predictive to an agile approach so the project manager should Conduct agile training for the team members to ensure that the agile approaches will bring about significant change","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":581}},{"qa":"تم نقل مدير مشروع إلى بلد آخر للعمل في مشروع رئيسي. أكمل مدير المشروع بنجاح مرحلة التخطيط وبدأ مرحلة التنفيذ ، وأبلغ عن تقدم جيد. خلال الاجتماع الأخير مع راعي المشروع ، تم إخبار مدير المشروع أن بعض أصحاب المصلحة قد اشتكوا من أن رسائل البريد الإلكتروني لمدير المشروع قاسية للغاية. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لحل هذا الموقف؟","oa":["تحديد مستوى تأثير أصحاب المصلحة الذين يشتكون","تعديل خطة إدارة الاتصالات لكسب ثقة أصحاب المصلحة","قم بتغيير وضع الاتصال من رسائل البريد الإلكتروني إلى الاجتماعات لتقليل شكاوى أصحاب المصلحة","اشرح للراعي أن نموذج الاتصال المستخدم هو من المقر الرئيسي للشركة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":481,"q":"A project manager has been transferred to another country to work on a key project. The project manager successfully completed the planning phase and has started the execution phase, reporting good progress. During the last meeting with the project sponsor, the project manager was told that some stakeholders have complained that the project manager's emails are very harsh.\nWhat should the project manager do to solve this situation?","t":"S","o":["Determine the level of influence of the stakeholders who are complaining","Adjust the communications management plan to gain stakeholder trust.","Change the communication mode from emails to meetings to reduce stakeholders complaints","Explain to the sponsor that the communication model being used is from company headquarters"],"c":[1],"f":"some stakeholders have complained that the project manager's emails are very harsh so the project manager should Adjust the communications management plan to gain stakeholder trust.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":582}},{"qa":"يتم تعيين مدير مشروع للعمل في مشروع معقد ومبتكر. التكنولوجيا التي يتم استخدامها وتطويرها جديدة ومعقدة ، ومعظم أصحاب المصلحة ليسوا على دراية بها. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يستخدمه مدير المشروع كقائد خادم؟","oa":["تخصيص الموارد لتوفير التدريب حول التكنولوجيا الجديدة لأصحاب المصلحة","اتصل براعى المشروع لإزالة أصحاب المصلحة من المشروع","اطلب من أصحاب المصلحة إيجاد التثقيف بشأن هذه التكنولوجيا الجديدة وتمويله ذاتيًا","تصعيد المشكلة مع الإدارة العليا لإيجاد حل جديد لهذا الموقف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":482,"q":"A project manager is assigned to work on a complex and innovative project. The technology being used and developed is new and complicated, and most of the stakeholders are unfamiliar with it.\nWhich approach should the project manager use as a servant leader?","t":"S","o":["Allocate resources to provide training about the new technology to the stakeholders","Contact the project sponsor to get those stakeholders removed from the project","Ask stakeholders to find and self-fund education about this new technology","Escalate the issue with upper management to find a novel solution for this situation"],"c":[0],"f":"Allocate resources to provide training about the new technology to the stakeholders","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":583}},{"qa":"شركة على وشك البدء في مشروع بحث معقد. نظرًا لمستوى عدم اليقين ، يوصي مدير المشروع باستخدام نهج مختلط ؛ ومع ذلك ، فإن المنظمة لديها خبرة فقط في المشاريع التنبؤية. كيف يمكن لمدير المشروع وضع استراتيجية لاستخدام نهج هجين للمنظمة؟","oa":["اعرض فوائد النهج المختلط على أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين للحصول على دعمهم","إنشاء طلب تغيير المشروع لتنفيذ المشروع باستخدام نهج مختلط","إرسال إخطار إلى فريق المشروع يؤكد أنهم سيستخدمون نهجًا مختلطًا في المشروع","إرسال خطاب إلى مكتب إدارة المشروع يطلب استخدام نهج مختلط"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":483,"q":"A company is about to start a complex research project. Due to the level of uncertainty, the project manager recommends the use of a hybrid approach; however, the organization only has experience with predictive projects.\nHow can the project manager strategize the use of a hybrid approach to the organization?","t":"S","o":["Present the benefits of a hybrid approach to key stakeholders to get their support","Create a project change request to execute the project using a hybrid approach","Submit a notification to the project team confirming they will be using a hybrid approach on the project","Send a letter to the project management office (PMO) requesting to use a hybrid approach"],"c":[0],"f":"Present the benefits of a hybrid approach to key stakeholders to get their support","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":584}},{"qa":"تخطط شركة لبدء مشروع يتضمن تقنية جديدة. مطلوب الموافقة على المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحديد مخاطر تطبيق التقنية الجديدة","راجع التكلفة وجدول خطوط الأساس للتنفيذ","تحديد إدارة التغيير للتكنولوجيا الجديدة","تحليل التكلفة وتحديد فوائد المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":484,"q":"A company plans to initiate a project involving a new technology. Approval for the project is required.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Identify the risks in implementing the new technology","Review the cost and schedule baselines for execution","Define change management for the new technology","Analyze the cost and identify the project benefits"],"c":[3],"f":"New Technology so the project manager should evaluate this technique before Approval by Analyzing the cost and identify the project benefits","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":585}},{"qa":"في منتصف مشروع تطوير البرمجيات ، قبل مبرمج التصميم الرئيسي عرضًا من أحد المنافسين. يحتاج مدير المشروع إلى إيجاد بديل للوفاء بحدث قادم. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحديث تقويم المورد","إصدار طلب إلى لجنة التحكم في التغيير","راجع خطة الاستجابة للمخاطر","قم بتعيين المهام إلى عضو آخر في الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":485,"q":"In the middle of a software development project, the lead design programmer accepted an offer from a competitor. The project manager needs to find a replacement to meet an upcoming milestone.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Update the resource calendar","Issue a request to the change control board (CCB)","Consult the risk response plan","Assign the tasks to another team member"],"c":[2],"f":"Loosing an expert to a competitor is a risk that shoul have been envisaged and planned for.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":586}},{"qa":"مشروع قيد التقدم مع فريق جديد في الأساليب الرشيقة. بعد أول مراجعة للتكرار ، يبدأ أداء الفريق في الانزلاق ، والاستنتاج هو أنه لا يوجد تدفق كاف للعمل للفريق. \n\nماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["إرسال طلب تغيير لإعادة تحديد أساس المشروع","ناقش المشكلة مع المعنيين","تغيير نهج المشروع إلى الهجين","توفير التدريب لمالك المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":486,"q":"A project is in progress with a team that is new to agile approaches. After the first sprint review, the team performance begins slipping, and the conclusion is that there is not an adequate flow of work for the team.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Submit a change request to re baseline the project","Discuss the issue with the stakeholders","Change the project approach to hybrid","Provide the product owner with training"],"c":[1],"f":"The flow of work in an agile process stems from the product backlog. The backlog is provided by the product owner/customer, which are important stakeholders. They prioritize work packages based on value, put them in the product backlog, and then during the sprint, the team picks items off of the backlog that they think they can finish in the time alotted for the sprint.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":587}},{"qa":"يتم تعيين مدير المشروع لفريق مشروع جديد لديه العديد من أصحاب المصلحة الذين يمكن أن يكون لهم تأثير كبير على نتائج المشروع. صنف مدير المشروع أصحاب المصلحة إلى أربع مجموعات مختلفة ويريد تحديد استراتيجية الاتصال. \n\nكيف يجب أن يتعامل مدير المشروع مع الاتصال؟","oa":["استخدام بنية اتصال موحدة عبر جميع المجموعات","تطوير وتحديد استراتيجية اتصال لأصحاب المصلحة","تحديد وتوجيه الاتصال إلى المعنيين المؤثرين","صف المجموعات الأربع في مصفوفة المعنيين في المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":487,"q":"A project manager is assigned to a new project team that has several stakeholders who can have significant influence over the project outcomes. The project manager categorized the stakeholders into four different groups and wants to define the communication strategy.\n \n\nHow should the project manager handle communication?","t":"S","o":["Utilize a uniform communication structure across all groups","Develop and define a communication strategy for stakeholders.","Define and direct communication to influential stakeholders.","Describe the four groups in the project stakeholder matrix"],"c":[1],"f":"The best option (Develop and define a communication strategy for stakeholders) to define the communication strategy .","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":588}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع بإجراء أجتماع التخطيط للتكرار. في نهاية التكرار، يجب نشر زيادات المنتج (النتيجة ) على موقع العميل. تلقى مالك المنتج رسالة بريد إلكتروني من مدير الحساب تفيد بأن العميل قد لا يكون جاهزًا لتثبيت الإصدار الجديد من المنتج. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اتصل بمدير المشروع الخاص بالعميل","اطلب من مالك المنتج إبلاغ العميل","اتصل بالرئيس الفني للعميل","اطلب من فريق المبيعات إبلاغ العميل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":488,"q":"A project team is conducting sprint planning. At the end of the sprint, the product increment must be deployed on a customer's site. The product owner received an email from the account manager that the customer may not be ready to install the new version of the product.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Contact the customer's project manager","Ask the product owner to inform the customer","Contact the customer's technical lead","Ask the sales team to inform the customer"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager should contact the customer's project manager to understand the reason for the delay and to determine if there are any issues that need to be addressed before the product increment can be deployed. This will give the project manager an opportunity to discuss any concerns or issues the customer may have and to develop a plan to address them. The project manager should also inform the product owner and the rest of the project team of the situation and discuss the potential impact on the project schedule and deliverables.\n\nIt is not appropriate to ask the sales team or product owner to inform the customer as they may not have the necessary expertise or experience to address the customer's concerns. Contacting the customer's technical lead may not be the best approach as they may not have the authority to make decisions about the installation of the new version of the product.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":589}},{"qa":"تم تكليف مدير المشروع بالبدء في مشروع كبير لتسليم معدات معقدة. سيكون جزء من المشروع نتيجة لعملية بحث طويلة ، ولكن بمجرد اكتمال ذلك ، يجب تسليم الجزء الآخر من المشروع بشكل تدريجي إلى العميل. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يختاره مدير المشروع لهذا المشروع؟","oa":["تكيفية","تنبؤية","تزايدية","هجين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":489,"q":"A project manager has been assigned with initiating a large project to deliver complex equipment. Part of the project will be the result of a long research process, but once this is completed, the other part of the project must be incrementally delivered to the customer.\nWhich approach should the project manager choose for this project?","t":"S","o":["Adaptive","Predictive","Incremental","Hybrid"],"c":[0],"f":"Adaptive is the correct answer. This is nowhere mentioned that the first part had a predefined scope. Since the first part was a long research, that has a high chance to be iterative and the 2nd part is evident enough to be increment. Both are the part of Adaptive but not Hybrid.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":590}},{"qa":"يستخدم مدير المشروع متعاقدًا من الباطن لتطوير تطبيقات الأجهزة المحمولة. عندما يختبر فريق المشروع التطبيق ، فإنهم يدركون أنه لا يتوافق مع معايير واجهة المستخدم الجديدة للشركة. على الرغم من أن هذه المعايير الجديدة لم يتم تضمينها في بيان العمل (SOW) ، فإن المقاول من الباطن يوافق على النطاق الإضافي طالما يتم الدفع مقابل هذا العمل الإضافي على الفور. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تفاوض بشأن أسعار جديدة بناءً على التقديرات المنقحة من المقاول من الباطن والتي تعكس العمل الجديد","بدء طلب التغيير ومراجعة العقد لتقييم خيارات الدفع قبل الرد","رفض طلب السداد للمقاول من الباطن ، لأن المنتج لا يتوافق مع احتياجات المشروع ويغلق المشروع","الشروع في تغيير لدمج مرحلة دفع فورية في العقد وفقًا لطلب المقاول من الباطن"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":490,"q":"A project manager is using a subcontractor for mobile application development. When the project team tests the application, they realize it does not comply with the new company user-interface standards. Even though these new standards were not included in the statement of work (SOW), the subcontractor agrees to the additional scope as long as payment for this additional work is paid immediately.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Negotiate new pricing based on the revised estimations from the subcontractor that reflect the new work","Initiate a change request and review the contract to evaluate the payment options before responding","Deny the subcontractor's payment request, because the product does not comply with the project needs and close the project.","Initiate a change to incorporate an immediate payment milestone in the contract as per the subcontractor's request."],"c":[1],"f":"New standards were not included in the statement of work so the project manager should Initiate a change request to reflect the new standards and review the contract to evaluate the payment options before responding","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":591}},{"qa":"يحتاج مدير المشروع المعين لمشروع تعليمي إلى تدريب القوى العاملة في تطوير التطبيق. العميل مسؤول عن توفير مركز التدريب ، والموعد النهائي لبدء التدريب الأول في غضون أسبوعين. يتصل العميل ليقول إن المركز لن يكون متاحًا خلال أسبوعين بسبب بعض المشاكل غير المتوقعة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["قم بتحديث جدول المشروع بالتاريخ الجديد للتدريب","تطبيق شروط وأحكام العقد مع الجزاءات","إصدار طلب تغيير ليعكس التاريخ المتوقع للتدريب","ساعد العميل في العثور على موقع بديل لبدء التدريب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":491,"q":"A project manager assigned to an education project needs to train a workforce in application development. The customer is responsible for providing the training center, and the deadline to start the first training is in 2 weeks. The customer calls to say that the center will not be available in 2 weeks due to some unforeseen problems.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Update the project schedule with the new date for training","Apply the terms and conditions of the contract with penalties","Issue a change request to reflect the anticipated date for training","Help the customer find an alternative location to start the training"],"c":[3],"f":"The customer is responsible for providing the training center and he calls to say that the center will not be available in 2 weeks so the project manager should Help the customer find an alternative location to start the training","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":592}},{"qa":"يريد العميل إنشاء برنامج مبتكر في السفر باستخدام نهج رشيق. تم تعيين مدير مشروع من الشركة للعمل على التفاصيل والتقديرات حسب طلب العميل. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع قبل إرسال المعلومات إلى العميل؟","oa":["ضع المهام مع التقديرات في سجل الأعمال ووضح أن المشروع لن يحتاج إلى أي احتياطيات","العمل مع الفريق لفهم وجهات نظرهم وإضافة التبعيات والمخاطر المناسبة","قم بتحليل المهام ، وتقديم التقديرات ، وتضمين نموذجًا تجريبيًا أوليًا ، وإرسالها إلى العميل مباشرةً","تسلسل المهام بالتقديرات وإضافة احتياطيات مخاطر قياسية لاستخدامها في تطوير البرامج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":492,"q":"A client wants to create an innovative software for the travel industry using an agile approach. A project manager from the company was assigned to work on the details and estimates as requested by the client.\nWhat should the project manager do before sending the information to the client?","t":"S","o":["Put the tasks with estimates in the backlog and clarify that the project will not need any reserves","Work with the team to understand their views and add the appropriate dependencies and risks","Analyze the tasks, provide estimates, include a prototype demo, and send to the client directly.","Sequence the tasks with estimates and add standard risk reserves to use for software development"],"c":[2],"f":"A client wants to create an innovative software for the travel industry using an agile approach so the project manager should Analyse the tasks, provide estimates, include a prototype demo, and send to the client directly","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":593}},{"qa":"وفقًا لمخطط الحرق التصاعدي هذا لآخر تكرار في اليوم السابع  ، ما الذي يجب أن يعالجه قائد المشروع مع مالك المنتج والفريق؟","oa":["يجب ألا يطلب مالك المنتج من الفريق تغيير التزاماته في التكرار","يقبل الفريق الكثير من العمل في التكرار بعد بدئه","يجب أن يتوقف الفريق في اليوم الرابع ويبدأ في تكرار جديد","لا يلبي الفريق توقعات مالك المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":493,"q":"According to this burnup chart for the last 7-day sprint, what should the project lead address with the product owner and team?","t":"S","o":["The product owner should not ask the team to change their sprint commitments.","The team is accepting too much work in the sprint after it has started","he team should have stopped on day 4 and started a new sprint","The team is not meeting the expectations of the product owner"],"c":[1],"f":"The burnup chart shows that the team is not on track to complete all the planned work by the end of the sprint. Therefore, the project lead should address this issue with the product owner and team and discuss the reasons behind the delay and the potential impact on the sprint goals. They should also consider adjusting the sprint backlog and priorities to ensure that the most critical items are completed.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":594}},{"qa":"بعد اندماج شركتين كبيرتين ، يتم تعيين مدير مشروع للمشروع. تقوم الشركة بتعيين مستشار لضمان استخدام أفضل الممارسات في أمن المعلومات. أثناء التكرار ، يطلب الاستشاري إجراء تغييرات على أحد مكونات البرنامج ، مدعياً أنه لا يلبي متطلبات السوق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["استمر في التكرار وراجع التغيير مع العميل","إلغاء التكرار وإضافة التغييرات المطلوبة","قم بإلغاء التكرار وقابل مالك المنتج","استمر في التكرار وأضف التغييرات المطلوبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":494,"q":"After the merger of two large companies, a project manager is assigned to a project. The company hires a consultant to ensure best practices are being used in information security. During an iteration, the consultant requests changes to a software component, claiming that it is not meeting market requirements.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Continue the iteration and review the change with the customer","Cancel the iteration and add the requested changes","Cancel the iteration and meet with the product owner","Continue the iteration and add the requested changes"],"c":[0],"f":"Changes cannot be made during an Sprint in agile, and changes are accepted and feedback is obtained at the sprint review meeting","ap":"agile","dm":"business","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":595}},{"qa":"مشروع إنشاء محطة لتوليد الكهرباء في الموقع بالقرب من محمية طبيعية. تتساءل مجموعة ناشطة بيئية عن الحاجة إلى المشروع. أبلغ العميل مدير المشروع بتجاهل المجموعة لأنها لا تدعم المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["اطلب من العميل الاتصال بمجموعة الناشطين وإعلامهم بحالة المشروع وتاريخ الانتهاء","أضف مجموعة النشطاء إلى قائمة أصحاب المصلحة وحلل التأثير الذي قد يكون لديهم على تسليم المشروع","اطلب من فريق المشروع تجاهل جميع الاتصالات من مجموعة الناشطين ومواصلة عملهم في المشروع","الالتزام بالتوجيهات الصادرة عن العميل نظرًا لأنهم يمولون المشروع وهم أصحاب المصلحة الأكثر أهمية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":495,"q":"A project to construct an electricity generation plant is on site near a nature reserve. An environmental activist group is questioning the need for the project. The customer has informed the project manager to disregard the group as they are not in support of the project.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Ask the customer to contact the activist group and let them know the project status and completion date","Add the activist group to the list of stakeholders and analyze the impact they may have on project delivery","Request the project team disregard all communication from the activist group and continue with their project work","Obey the directive from the customer since they are funding the project and are the most important stakeholder"],"c":[1],"f":"As a project manager, it is important to recognize that stakeholders can have both positive and negative impacts on a project. Environmental activists, in particular, may have concerns about the impact of the project on the surrounding environment. It is important for the project manager to add the activist group to the list of stakeholders and analyze the impact they may have on the project delivery. The project manager should engage with the activist group to understand their concerns and develop a plan to address them, while still delivering the project on time and within budget. Disregarding the activist group's concerns could lead to delays or legal issues down the line.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":596}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع على مشروع رشيق في بيئة أعمال متغيرة. يشعر راعي المشروع بالقلق بشأن تحقيق الفوائد ويطلب من مدير المشروع الانتباه إلى التغييرات التي يمكن أن تؤثر على المشروع. ما الإجراء الذي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه لتحديد التغييرات التي قد تؤثر على المنتج؟","oa":["اتخذ إجراءً لإعادة ترتيب أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج بعد كل تكرار لتقييم ما إذا كانت قصص المستخدمين لا تزال ذات قيمة للأعمال التجارية","قم بتطبيق أسلوب البرمجة الزوجية للرد على التغييرات فورًا ، حتى في منتصف التفاعل","تنفيذ التواصل وجهًا لوجه بين الفريق ومالك المنتج لتغيير أهداف التكرار حسب الحاجة","أوقف التكرار في أسرع وقت ممكن في حالة تحديد تغيير خارجي يجعل المنتج لا يقدر بثمن"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":496,"q":"A project manager is working on an agile project in a changing business environment. The project sponsor is worried about benefits realization and asks the project manager to pay attention to changes that can affect the project.\nWhich action should the project manager take to identify changes that may affect the product?","t":"S","o":["Take action to re prioritize the backlog after every iteration to evaluate if user stories are still valuable to the business.","Apply a pair programming technique to react to changes immediately, even in the middle of the interaction","Implement face-to-face communication between the team and product owner to change the iteration objectives as needed","Stop the iteration as soon as possible in case an external change that makes the product invaluable is identified"],"c":[0],"f":"To identify changes that may affect the product, the project manager should take action to reprioritize the backlog after every iteration. This will allow the project team to evaluate if the user stories are still valuable to the business and if they need to be adjusted or removed in light of any changes in the business environment. The project manager should also involve the product owner in this process, as they are the ones who are more familiar with the business requirements.","ap":"agile","dm":"business","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":597}},{"qa":"تمت الموافقة على بيان نطاق المشروع ، وتم تعيين مدير المشروع والفريق الأساسي للمشروع. فجأة ، يأخذ مدير المشروع إجازة مؤقتة بسبب حالة طبية طارئة. بينما يكون مدير المشروع في إجازة ، يطور الفريق الجدول الزمني للمشروع. عندما يعود مدير المشروع ، يكاد يكون الجدول الزمني المفصل قد اكتمل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تصعيد مسألة الامتثال إلى مكتب إدارة المشروع","وضع جدول زمني مفصل جديد مع الفريق وراعي المشروع","تأكد من أن الجدول الزمني يتماشى مع الرؤية والأهداف","تهنئة الفريق والانتقال إلى مرحلة التنفيذ"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":497,"q":"A project scope statement has been approved, and the project manager and core team have been assigned to the project. Suddenly, the project manager takes a temporary leave of absence due to a medical emergency. While the project manager is on leave, the team develops the project schedule. When the project manager returns, a detailed schedule is almost complete.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Escalate the compliance issue to the project management office (PMO)","Develop a new detailed schedule with the team and project sponsor","Ensure that the schedule is aligned with the vision and objectives","Congratulate the team and move on to the execution phase"],"c":[2],"f":"Ensure that the schedule is aligned with the vision and objectives.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":598}},{"qa":"قام البائع بتصنيع منتج معقد. خلال اختبار قبول المصنع ، تم تحديد العديد من أوجه القصور. تسليم المنتج على المسار الحرج ، وأي تأخير سيؤثر على اكتمال المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتقييم تأثير الجدول الزمني وتقييم الحل الأكثر جدوى لإبقاء المشروع على المسار الصحيح","شحن الحزمة كما هي ، واستكمال العمل المرحل في الموقع ، وإعادة شحن البائع لإعادة العمل","احتفظ بالشحنة حتى اكتمال إعادة العمل في منشأة البائع للتخلص من العمل الإضافي في الموقع","ابدأ مكالمات جماعية منتظمة مع البائع لتحديثات الحالة للحفاظ على التركيز على هذا العنصر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":498,"q":"A vendor has manufactured a complex product. During a factory acceptance test, several deficiencies were identified. Product delivery is on the critical path, and any delay would impact project completion.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Assess the schedule impact and evaluate the most feasible solution to keep the project on track","Ship the package as is, complete carryover work on-site, and back charge the vendor for the rework","Hold the shipment until the rework is completed at the vendor's facility to eliminate extra work on-site","Initiate regular conference calls with the vendor for status updates to keep this item in focus"],"c":[0],"f":"Remeber any change or any impact the project manager should first Assess the impact . In the scenario A vendor has manufactured a complex product ,any delay would impact project completion so the best option (Assess the schedule impact and evaluate the most feasible solution to keep the project on track)","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":599}},{"qa":"يعمل قائد المشروع على مشروع رشيق لبناء رؤية الفريق ، بما في ذلك عملية صنع القرار. تقرر أن يصوت الفريق على البنود ، وإذا وافق 90٪ من الفريق على القرار ، فسيتم التنفيذ. في أول اجتماع تقني للتصميم ، يتخذ الفريق قرارًا لا يوافق عليه قائد المشروع بشدة. كيف ينبغي لقيادة المشروع المضي قدما؟","oa":["رفض السماح للفريق بالمضي قدما في العمل بناء على قرارهم","خذ قيادة الفريق الفني جانبًا وحاول إقناعهم بتغيير تصويتهم","حدد أسباب الخلاف ودع الفريق يمضي قدمًا","رتب لقاء مع خبير بالمشروع واطلب منهم التدخل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":499,"q":"A project lead is working on an agile project to build the team's vision, including the decision-making process. It was decided that the team will vote on items, and if 90% of the team agrees on a decision, then it will be carried forward. At the very first technical design meeting, the team makes a decision that the project lead strongly disagrees with.\nHow should the project lead proceed?","t":"S","o":["Refuse to let the team proceed with the work based on their decision","Take the technical team lead aside and try to persuade them to change their vote","Note the reasons for the disagreement and let the team proceed","Set up a meeting with the project champion and ask them to intervene"],"c":[2],"f":"The project lead should respect the agreed-upon decision-making process and allow the team to proceed with their decision. However, it is important for the project lead to document their concerns and reasons for disagreement, in case any issues arise later in the project. This approach maintains the team's autonomy and promotes trust and collaboration within the team while ensuring that the project lead's concerns are documented and can be addressed if needed.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":600}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع حديثًا لقيادة فريق المشروع الذي سيعمل عن بُعد. قرر مدير المشروع استخدام مجموعة من الأدوات التي عملت بشكل جيد مع المشاريع السابقة. ومع ذلك ، هناك عدد قليل من أعضاء الفريق غير راضين عن هذه الخطة. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب ذلك؟","oa":["طلب من راعي المشروع الموافقة على شراء أحدث أداة تعاون في السوق","تفويض مسؤولية اختيار أدوات التعاون للقائد الفني للمشروع","السماح لأعضاء فريق المشروع باستخدام الأدوات التي ستعمل بشكل أفضل بالنسبة لهم لهذا المشروع.","التقى بفريق المشروع لتحديد احتياجات التعاون الخاصة بهم وتحديد الأدوات التي ستعمل بشكل أفضل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":500,"q":"A project manager is newly appointed to lead a project team that will be working remotely. The project manager decided to use a set of tools that worked well for previous projects. However, a few team members are not happy with this plan.\nWhat should the project manager have done to avoid this?","t":"S","o":["Asked the project sponsor for approval to purchase the newest collaboration tool on the market.","Delegated the responsibility of selecting the collaboration tools to the project's technical lead","Allowed the project team members to use the tools that will work best for them for this project.","Met with the project team to determine their collaboration needs and identified tools that will work best"],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should Met with the project team to determine their collaboration needs and identified tools that will work best","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":601}},{"qa":"يبدأ مدير المشروع في تلقي رسائل البريد الإلكتروني من مختلف المعنيين الذين يطلبون معلومات حول حالة المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لتجنب ذلك في المستقبل؟","oa":["قم بتعيين أحد أعضاء الفريق للرد على رسائل البريد الإلكتروني الواردة من المعنيين هؤلاء","قم بتضمين رسائل البريد الإلكتروني الخاصة بأصحاب المصلحة في جميع اتصالات حالة المشروع","جدولة اجتماعات أسبوعية لحالة المشروع مع جميع المعنيين بما في ذلك العملاء والموارد الداخلية","قم بتضمين احتياجات المعنيين في المشروع أثناء التخطيط لاستراتيجية اتصالات المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":501,"q":"A project manager starts to receive emails from different stakeholders requesting information about the project status.\nWhat should the project manager do to avoid this in the future?","t":"S","o":["Designate a team member to respond to the emails from these stakeholders","Include the stakeholders' emails in all of the project status communications","Schedule weekly project status meetings with all stakeholders including the customer and internal resources","Include the project stakeholders' needs while planning the project communications strategy"],"c":[3],"f":"By proactively identifying the communication needs and preferences of stakeholders and including them in the project communications plan, the project manager can ensure that stakeholders are informed about the project's progress and status in a timely and effective manner, thus reducing the likelihood of them having to reach out for information.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":602}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع على مشروع متعدد الجنسيات يضم أكثر من 100 من المعنيين. يهتم مدير المشروع بالمشاركة المناسبة للمعنيين ومستوى المشاركة المطلوب لإنجاز المشروع بنجاح. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["راجع سجل المشكلة مع المعنيين في المشروع","تنفيذ افتراضات المعنيين وتحليل القيود","تقييم مصفوفة تقييم مشاركة المعنيين","التواصل مع المعنيين لإيجاد حل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":502,"q":"A project manager is working on a multinational project that has more than 100 stakeholders. The project manager is concerned about the appropriate stakeholder participation and involvement level required for successful project delivery.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Review the issue log with the project stakeholders","Perform a stakeholder assumption and constraint analysis","Evaluate the stakeholder engagement assessment matrix","Communicate with the stakeholders to find a solution"],"c":[2],"f":"The stakeholder engagement assessment matrix is a tool that can help the project manager evaluate the level of stakeholder participation and involvement required for a successful project. This matrix is a useful tool for understanding the stakeholders' level of interest, power, and influence, and can help the project manager determine the most appropriate level of engagement for each stakeholder. By using this tool, the project manager can develop a stakeholder engagement plan that outlines how each stakeholder will be involved in the project and to what extent. This can help ensure that all stakeholders are adequately engaged, which can help improve project outcomes.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":603}},{"qa":"تلقى مدير المشروع طلبًا لإضافة ميزات ووظائف إلى المشروع بعد تحديد النطاق بالفعل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اتبع عملية مشاركة المعنيين","اتبع عملية إدارة المتطلبات","اتبع عملية إدارة التغيير","اتبع عملية إدارة المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":503,"q":"A project manager received a request to add features and functions to the project after the scope had already been established.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Follow the stakeholder engagement process","Follow the requirements management process","Follow the change management process","Follow the risk management process"],"c":[2],"f":"Change Management – The overall process in which changes are identified, documented, analyzed and decided (approved or partially approved or rejected). This process is usually unique to an organization. Many organizations used manual and automated tools for Change Management.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":604}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع لديه خبرة في المجال التقني. يُظهر مدير المشروع بشكل متكرر سلوكًا غير مقبول تجاه أعضاء الفريق الآخرين ؛ ومع ذلك ، عند مواجهته ، ينكر مدير المشروع هذا السلوك. ما سبب سلوك مدير المشروع؟","oa":["لم يكن مدير المشروع مدرباً بشكل صحيح","مدير المشروع في دور المشروع الخطأ","مدير المشروع يفتقر إلى التعاطف الضروري","يفتقر مدير المشروع إلى الذكاء العاطفي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":504,"q":"A project manager has expertise in the technical domain. The project manager frequently demonstrates unacceptable behavior toward other team members; however, when confronted, the project manager denies this behavior.\nWhat is the reason for the project manager's behavior?","t":"S","o":["The project manager was not properly trained","The project manager is in the wrong project role","The project manager lacks necessary empathy","The project manager lacks emotional intelligence (EI)"],"c":[0],"f":"It is clear that the topic is related to the skills of the project manager at the beginning of the scenario. It is mentioned that the project manager has experience in the technical field and in the talent triangle for project management we have 3 aspects. He has the technical side but lacks training in project management behaviors. It is more than emotional intelligence","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":605}},{"qa":"عينت شركة ناشئة للتو مديرًا تنفيذيًا ليس لديه خبرة سابقة في المشروع. يريد الرئيس التنفيذي تنفيذ المشاريع بموارده الخاصة وقد عين مديرًا للمشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يوصي مدير المشروع بأن يفعله الرئيس التنفيذي أولاً؟","oa":["استخدام نهج رشيق لجميع المشاريع القادمة","استخدام نهج تنبؤي لجميع المشاريع القادمة","إنشاء إطار لدعم نجاح المشروع","إنشاء إطار عمل لتبرير تنفيذ المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":505,"q":"A startup company has just appointed a CEO that has no prior project experience. The CEO wants to execute projects with their own resources and has appointed a project manager.\nWhat should the project manager recommend that the CEO do first?","t":"S","o":["Utilize an agile approach for all upcoming projects","Utilize a predictive approach for all upcoming projects","Create a framework to support project success","Create a framework to justify project execution"],"c":[2],"f":"As the CEO has no prior project experience and wants to make use of internal resources for the project execution., the first step for the project manager should be to recommend creating a framework to support project success. This framework should include project management best practices, such as defining project objectives, creating a project plan, identifying project stakeholders, defining project roles and responsibilities, setting up communication channels, and defining project metrics prior to that an assessment needs to be done for what exactly will be the enablers for success of the project. The Project success parameters need to be decided first, thereby necessitating the development of a project framework for success.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"Bank","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":606}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يعمل على مشروع تنفيذ نظام مالي لإحدى الشركات الحكومية. أحد أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين ، الذي يستخدم الأساليب التنبؤية ، لا يحب الأدوات الافتراضية مثل الدردشات وتتبع المهام وما إلى ذلك. إنهم يفضلون البريد الإلكتروني والمكالمات الهاتفية والاجتماعات وجهًا لوجه. كيف يجب أن يتعامل مدير المشروع مع هذا الموقف؟","oa":["اطلب من المدير استخدام أدوات الاتصال الافتراضية ولوحات المعلومات عبر الإنترنت","محاذاة والاتفاق مع أصحاب المصلحة على نهج الاتصال","استخدم جلسات مشاركة الشاشة بانتظام لإظهار التقدم للمعنيين","إنشاء لوحة معلومات رقمية لتلبية احتياجات المدير من المعلومات"],"rat":null,"fa":"محاذاة والاتفاق مع أصحاب المصلحة على نهج الاتصال","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":506,"q":"A project manager is working on a financial system implementation project for a government company. One of the key stakeholders, who uses predictive approaches, does not like virtual tools such as chats, task trackers, and so forth. They prefer email, telephone calls, and face-to-face meetings.\nHow should the project manager approach this situation?","t":"S","o":["Ask the manager to use virtual communication tools and online dashboards","Align and agree with the stakeholder on the communication approach.","Use regular screen-sharing sessions to show the progress to the stakeholder","Create a digital dashboard to meet the manager's information needs"],"c":[1],"f":"Align and agree with the stakeholder on the communication approach.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":607}},{"qa":"أبلغ راعي المشروع أن أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين يشكو من اختلافات في الأداء في المقاييس التي أبلغ عنها مدير المشروع ، مما يعطي الانطباع بأن المشروع خارج عن السيطرة. يقدم مدير المشروع حالة المشروع وفقًا لخطة إدارة الاتصالات المتفق عليها. ومع ذلك ، نادرًا ما يحضر المعني الرئيسي اجتماعات تقرير الحالة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً لمعالجة هذا الموقف؟","oa":["راجع هيكل توزيع الموارد لمطالبة مدير أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين باستبدال أصحاب المصلحة","استخدم احتياطيات الطوارئ لتنفيذ التتبع السريع وتحسين مؤشرات الأداء الرئيسية للجدول","تقديم دليل لراعي المشروع على أن المشروع يسير على الطريق الصحيح وأنه تم إرسال الاتصالات","تقييم احتياجات الاتصال لاكتشاف الثغرات وتعديل الخطة الأصلية إذا لزم الأمر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":507,"q":"The project sponsor reports that a key stakeholder is complaining about performance differences in the metrics reported by the project manager, which gives the impression that the project is out of control. The project manager has been providing the project's status according to the agreed-upon communications management plan. This key stakeholder, however, seldom attends the status report meetings.\nWhat should the project manager do first to address this situation?","t":"S","o":["Review the resource breakdown structure (RBS) to request the main stakeholder's manager to replace the stakeholder","Use the contingency reserves to implement fast tracking and improve the schedule key performance indicators (KPIs)","Provide evidence to the project sponsor that the project is on track and the communications have been sent","Evaluate the communication needs to discover the gaps and adjust the original plan if needed"],"c":[3],"f":"The first step the project manager should take is to evaluate the communication needs to determine whether there are any gaps or misunderstandings in the current plan. The project manager should then adjust the plan if needed to ensure that the key stakeholder is receiving the necessary information and has a clear understanding of the project's status. It may be necessary to schedule additional meetings with the key stakeholder or to provide them with more frequent updates. Ultimately, the goal should be to address the stakeholder's concerns and maintain a positive relationship with them.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":608}},{"qa":"وافق مجلس التحكم في التغيير (CCB) على طلب تغيير لإضافة مكون جديد داخل المنتج. يكتشف مدير العمليات التغيير بعد موافقته ويشكو من أن تنفيذ التغيير سيؤدي إلى تعطيل كبير لخط الإنتاج. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["قم بقيادة ورشة عمل لتحليل السبب الجذري مع فريق التصميم لتحديد الإخفاقات التي أدت إلى قرار إضافة مكون غير متوافق مع خط الإنتاج","قابل مدير العمليات لشرح طريقة التغيير وفهم مخاوف مدير العمليات بشأن التغيير","تصعيد المشكلة إلى الجهة الراعية للمشروع ، لأن قرار إضافة المكون يجلب العديد من الفوائد على الرغم من أنه سيعطل خط الإنتاج","الاعتراف رسميًا بمخاوف مدير العمليات وإثارة مخاطر جديدة تتمثل في أن المشروع قد يقدم الميزانية في وقت متأخر أو أكثر بسبب صعوبات التصنيع."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":508,"q":"The change control board (CCB) has approved a change request to add a new component within a product. The operations manager discovers the change after its approval and complains that the implementation of the change will cause significant disruption to the production line.\nWhat should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Lead a root cause analysis workshop with the design team to identify the failures that led to the decision to add a component that was not compatible with the production line.","Meet with the operations manager to explain the background for the change and understand the operation manager's concerns about the change.","Escalate the issue to the project sponsor, as the decision to add the component brings many benefits even though it will be disruptive to the production line.","Formally acknowledge the operation manager's concerns and raise a new risk that the project may deliver late and over budget due to manufacturing difficulties."],"c":[1],"f":"Meet with the operations manager to explain the background for the change and understand the operation manager's concerns about the change.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":609}},{"qa":"أثناء تخطيط التكرارلمشروع ما ، يختلف أعضاء الفريق حول الحجم المقارن لعناصر سجل أعمال المنتج وما إذا كانت تتناسب مع التكرار التالي. بالنظر إلى نهج هجين ، ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اتخذ القرار بشأن سجل أعمال المنتج  بناءً على ما هو أكثر منطقية","قم بإزالة العناصر من سجل أعمال المنتج حيث لا يمكن تقدير الحجم","قم بتيسير المناقشة حتى يتمكن أعضاء الفريق من التوصل إلى توافق في الآراء","اطلب من قائد تقني خارجي تقديم المدخلات والتخطيط للتكرار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":509,"q":"During the sprint planning of a project, the team members have a disagreement about the comparative size of the backlog items and if they would fit into the next sprint.\nConsidering a hybrid approach, what should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Make the decision about the backlog items based on what makes more sense","Remove the items from the product backlog since the size couldn't be estimated","Facilitate the discussion so that the team members can reach a consensus","Ask an external technical leader to provide input and plan the sprint"],"c":[2],"f":"Facilitate the discussion so that the team members can reach a consensus","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":610}},{"qa":"مشروع توسعة منشأة في طور التنفيذ. يوجد نشاط مشروع لتوصيل طاقة جميع المعدات الجديدة بالمنشأة الحالية ، النقطة A ، والتي تتطلب طول كابل كبير. وجد فريق البناء أنه يمكن توصيل الطاقة بالنقطة B وتوفير المال. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["اطلب قرارًا من فريق البناء بعد شرح ميزانية المشروع والجدول الزمني القيد","أضف المشكلة إلى سجل التغيير واطلب ميزانية إضافية من خلال لجنة التحكم في التغيير","قم بإجراء تحليل التكلفة والعائد للتقييم باستخدام خيار النقطة ب","استخدم خيار النقطة ب لأنه سيوفر تكلفة المشروع ووقته"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":510,"q":"A facility extension project is in the execution stage. There is a project activity to connect the power of all new equipment to an existing facility, Point A, which requires a significant cable length. The construction team found that the power could be connected to Point B and save money.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Seek a decision from the construction team after explaining the project budget and schedule constraint","Add the issue to the change log and request additional budget through the change control board (CCB)","Perform a cost-benefit analysis to evaluate using the Point B option","Use the Point B option because it will save the project cost and time"],"c":[2],"f":"Perform a cost-benefit analysis to evaluate using the Point B option","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":611}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع على العديد من مشاريع تشييد المباني باستخدام نهج إدارة المشاريع التنبؤية. تعمل القيادة العليا داخل المنظمة على تعزيز إدراج ممارسات أكثر مرونة في منهجيات المشروع الحالية. يريد راعي المشروع الآن أن تستخدم المشاريع منهجيات أكثر مرونة. قبل فرض أي أساليب رشيقة لاستخدامها في المشروع ، ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["تحويل جميع المشاريع الحالية إلى منهجيات رشيقة مع جدول زمني صارم","توفير تدريب رشيق لأولئك الذين سيكونون جزءًا من فريق المشروع","تقييم الثقافة التنظيمية والاستعداد للتحول","أوقف المشاريع الحالية مؤقتًا لمواءمتها مع إيقاع رشيق جديد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":511,"q":"A project manager is working on multiple building construction projects using a predictive project management approach. Senior leadership within the organization is promoting the inclusion of more agile practices into the current project methodologies. The project sponsor now wants the projects to use more agile methodologies.\nBefore mandating any agile methods to be used in a project, what should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Shift all existing projects to agile methodologies with a strict timeline","Provide agile training to those who will be part of the project team","Assess the organizational culture and readiness for the transformation","Pause the current projects to align them to the new agile cadence"],"c":[2],"f":"Training would not make sense till the organization's culture is not aligned to agile wat of working","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":612}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يعمل على مشروع معقد بدرجة عالية من التغيير. ما هي الإستراتيجية التي يجب أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع لضمان إكمال المشروع بنجاح؟","oa":["جدولة مراجعة منتظمة للمخاطر مع فريق إدارة المشروع","قم بتحديث خطة إدارة المشروع لتقليل احتمالية زحف النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":512,"q":"A project manager is working on a complex project with a high degree of change.\nWhat strategy should the project manager use to ensure a successful project completion?","t":"S","o":["Schedule a regular risk review with the project management team","Update the project management plan to reduce the possibility of scope creep"],"c":[1],"f":"As actively engaged Stakeholders may be able to provide feedback and necessary input during changes to have them incorporated smoothly. Moreover, sometimes during active communications, some risks may be revealed before they even turn into issues. Just stating my point of view.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":613}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يقود مشروعًا هجيناً (مختلط) ممولًا باتفاقية الوقت والمواد . اكتمل المشروع ووافق العميل على تسليم المنتج. بعد أسبوع ، طلب العميل من مدير المشروع إصلاح عيبين موجودين في المنتج. استجاب مدير المشروع بتقدير الوقت والمال وطلب من العميل تأكيد ذلك. اختلف العميل وأصر على أن يتم العمل بالمجان لأنه عيب في المنتج. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمنع ذلك؟","oa":["تدريب المهندسين العميل على دعم المنتج بعد تسليمه","اقترح أساسًا بتكلفة ثابتة مع إصلاحات مجانية للأخطاء لمدة شهر واحد","مراجعة خطة مراقبة جودة المشروع مع العميل","خطط لكيفية دعم المنتج الذي تم تسليمه بعد تسليمه"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":513,"q":"A project manager is leading a hybrid project funded by a time and materials (T&M) agreement. The project was completed, and the client accepted the delivery of the product. One week later, the client asked the project manager to fix two defects they found in the product. The project manager responded with an estimate of time and money and asked the client to confirm this. The client disagreed and insisted that the work should be done for free because it is a defect in the product.\nWhat should the project manager have done to prevent this?","t":"S","o":["Trained client engineers to support the product after its delivery","Suggested a fixed-cost basis and included free bug fixes for 1 month","Reviewed the project quality control plan with the client","Planned how the delivered product will be supported after its delivery"],"c":[3],"f":"A project manager is leading a hybrid project funded by a time and materials (T&M) agreement. One week later, the client asked the project manager to fix two defects they found in the product and the customer insisted that the work should be done for free because it is a defect in the product so the project manager should have Planned how the delivered product will be supported after its delivery.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":614}},{"qa":"أبرم فريق المشروع عقودًا لشراء المركبات وخدمات البناء. في منتصف تنفيذ المشروع ، يعلم الفريق أن مورد السيارة لا يمكنه تسليم المركبات. لا يوجد وقت كافٍ للعثور على مورد جديد دون تأخير المشروع. ما الإجراء الذي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه لشراء المركبات؟","oa":["اطلب من الفريق الفني مراجعة المتطلبات ، حتى لو تطلبت ميزانية إضافية","مراجعة عقود الخدمة الحالية لإيجاد خيار للمساعدة في شراء المركبات","ترتيب لقاء مع العميل لطلب وقت إضافي للعثور على مورد جديد","شراء المركبات من مورد آخر والإبلاغ عن التغيير إلى لجنة التحكم في التغيير  لاحقًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":514,"q":"A project team has established contracts for purchasing vehicles and construction services. In the middle of project execution, the team learns that the vehicle supplier cannot deliver the vehicles. There is not enough time to find a new supplier without delaying the project.\nWhich action should the project manager take to procure the vehicles?","t":"S","o":["Ask the technical team to revise the requirements, even if it requires extra budget","Review the existing service contracts to find an option to help procure the vehicles","Arrange a meeting with the client to request additional time to find a new supplier","Procure the vehicles from another supplier and report the change to the change control board (CCB) later"],"c":[1],"f":"The best option (Review the existing service contracts to find an option to help procure the vehicles).","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":615}},{"qa":"يقود مدير المشروع مشروعًا يعتمد على نظام إدارة البائعين الخاص بالعميل لتلبية المتطلبات الحرجة. لن يستفيد فريق إدارة البائعين من المشروع. ومع ذلك ، يتطلب المشروع دعمًا من رئيس الموردين. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["الحصول على المساعدة من الراعي لتسليط الضوء على أي مزايا غير مالية لفريق إدارة الموردين","احصل على الدعم من الراعي لتوظيف خبير في الموضوع من فريق إدارة الموردين للعمل على المشروع","مراجعة اختصاصات اللجنة التوجيهية لتشمل مدير الموردين","العمل مع الراعي على خطة إدارة الاتصالات للحصول على الدعم من رئيس الموردين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":515,"q":"A project manager is leading a project that has a dependency on the client's vendor management system for critical requirements. The vendor management team will not derive any benefits from the project. However, the project requires support from the vendor management head.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Obtain help from the sponsor to highlight any non financial benefits for the vendor management team","Get support from the sponsor to hire a subject matter expert (SME) from the vendor management team to work on the project","Review the terms of reference of the steering committee to include the vendor management head.","Work with the sponsor on a communications management plan to obtain support from the vendor management head."],"c":[3],"f":"If you was the vendor management head you would not waste your time sitting on a steering committee of a project you have no benefits from. you are convinced that this needs to be highlighted to your sponsor to find a solution. Reviseing the communication plan can be the first step","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":616}},{"qa":"في اجتماع المشروع ، يطلب محلل الأعمال مدخلات من مستشار تسويق لمواصلة العمل في مهمة. حاول محلل الأعمال الاتصال بالمستشار ولكن قيل له إن المستشار ليس لديه الوقت لمناقشة المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع للمضي قدماً بالمشروع؟","oa":["تصعيد القضايا المتعلقة بالاستشاري إلى المدير الوظيفي حتى يخصص الاستشاري الوقت اللازم للمشروع","ناقش الطلب مع الاستشاري وحدد الوقت مع محلل الأعمال والمستشار لمناقشة متطلبات المشروع","قم بتضمين مخاطر مشروع جديد في سجل المخاطر وتخصيص الاستشاري باعتباره مالك المخاطر حيث أنه من مسؤوليته توفير المدخلات","حث محلل الأعمال على الاستمرار في الاتصال بالمستشار لمناقشة المشروع حيث أن هذه مسؤولية محلل الأعمال"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":516,"q":"At a project meeting, a business analyst requires input from a marketing consultant to continue working on a task. The business analyst has tried to contact the consultant but has been told that the consultant does not have the time to discuss the project.\nWhat should the project manager do to move the project forward?","t":"S","o":["Escalate the issues about the consultant to the functional manager so the consultant dedicates the necessary time to the project","Discuss the request with the consultant and set up time with the business analyst and consultant to discuss the project requirements","Include a new project risk into the risk register and allocate the consultant as the risk owner as it is their responsibility to provide input","Urge the business analyst to continue contacting the consultant to discuss the project since this is the responsibility of the business analyst"],"c":[1],"f":"The best option (Discuss the request with the consultant and set up time with the business analyst and consultant to discuss the project requirements.)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":617}},{"qa":"يبدأ الفريق الأجتماع اليومي بشكل فردي لكل عضو فريق. أحيانًا يكون التداخل بين ساعات عمل أعضاء الفريق قصيرًا. خلال تلك الأوقات ، يتم تقليل التفاعلات والعمل كفريق واصبح العمل غير فعال. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":[". أبلغ أعضاء الفريق الذين ينضمون متأخرًا للانضمام مبكرًا والعمل معًا","خصص وقت التداخل لكل عضو في الفريق واطلب منهم الالتزام بالجدول الزمني","اطلب من الفريق البدء في نفس الوقت للحصول على أقصى عدد من ساعات عمل الفريق","اطلب من الفريق تحديد ميثاق الفريق والاتفاق على ساعات العمل الأساسية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":517,"q":"A team has individual daily start times for each team member. Sometimes the overlap between team member working hours is short. During those times, the interactions and work as a team are reduced and ineffective.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Inform the team members who are joining late to join early and work together","Allocate the overlap time for each team member and ask them to adhere to the schedule.","Ask the team to start at the same time to obtain the maximum number of team working hours","Ask the team to define a team charter and agree on core working hours"],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should facilitate a discussion with the team to develop a team charter that includes agreements on core working hours. This approach allows the team to define their expectations and align their schedules to maximize collaboration and effectiveness. It also promotes accountability and ownership among team members. The project manager should ensure that the team charter is documented and communicated to all team members, including stakeholders, to ensure everyone is aware of the agreed-upon working hours.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":618}},{"qa":"منظمة تكافح لبدء مشروع مهم. حدد مدير المشروع أن تعريف النطاق هو العنصر الرئيسي الذي يمنع المشروع من البدء. على الرغم من أن معظم بنود النطاق يتم تحديدها والاتفاق عليها بين أصحاب المصلحة ، إلا أن هناك عددًا قليلاً من العناصر التي يصعب فهمها والتي يصعب تحديدها في هذه المرحلة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["الحفاظ على زخم أصحاب المصلحة في العمل على تعريف النطاق حتى يتم تحقيق النطاق التفصيلي الكامل قبل بدء المشروع","اقترح تسليم عناصر النطاق المحددة جيدًا باستخدام نهج تنبؤي واستخدام نهج رشيق للتعامل مع العناصر المعقدة","قم بتحديث سجل المخاطر وتصعيد المشكلة إلى مكتب إدارة المشروع ، وطلب إضافة المزيد من الموارد للمساعدة في تحديد نطاق المشروع","يوصي بتقسيم المشروع إلى مشروعين أصغر من أجل العمل حصريًا في بيئة رشيقة دون تدخل من نهج تنبؤي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":518,"q":"An organization is struggling to start an important project. The project manager has identified that the scope definition is the main item preventing the project from starting. Although most of the scope items are defined and agreed upon among the stakeholders, there are a few items that are hard to grasp and very complex to define at this stage.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Maintain stakeholder momentum in working on the scope definition until a full detailed scope is achieved prior to starting the project","Propose that the well-defined scope items be delivered using a predictive approach and use an agile approach to deal with the complex items","Update the risk register and escalate the issue to the project management office (PMO), requesting more resources be added to help define the project scope","Recommend splitting the project into two smaller projects in order to work exclusively in an agile environment without interference from a predictive approach"],"c":[1],"f":"Propose that the well-defined scope items be delivered using a predictive approach and use an agile approach to deal with the complex items","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":619}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع في شركة كبيرة للإشراف على مشروع تجربة العملاء. داخل المشروع ، يعد رضا العملاء مشكلة كبيرة وهناك العديد من استفسارات العملاء التي لم يتم حلها على أساس يومي. تم إبلاغ مدير المشروع أن فريق خدمة العملاء غارق في هذه الاستفسارات التي لم يتم حلها. ما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه لتصحيح هذه المشكلة؟ (إختر إثنين.)","oa":["اطلب من الإدارة العليا استبدال مدير خدمة العملاء بمدير أكثر كفاءة","اطلب من فريق خدمة العملاء تحديد أولويات العمل على الاستعلامات التي يتم تلقيها هذا الأسبوع","نشر الحلول التي من شأنها تتبع الاستعلامات وتحديد أولوياتها وحلها في أسرع وقت ممكن","تأكد من أن المشكلات موجودة بالفعل عن طريق إجراء مسح وتحليلات أخرى قد تكشف عن المشكلة الحقيقية","اتصل بالعملاء على دفعات وأخبرهم أن المشكلات قيد العمل حاليًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":519,"q":"A project manager at a large corporation has been assigned to oversee a customer experience project. Within the project, customer satisfaction is a big issue and there are many unresolved customer queries on a daily basis. The project manager has been informed that the customer service team is overwhelmed with these unresolved queries.\nWhich two actions should the project manager take to correct this problem? (Choose two.)","t":"M","o":["Ask senior management to replace the customer service manager with a more qualified one","Request that the customer service team prioritizes work on queries that are received this week","Deploy solutions that will track, prioritize, and resolve queries as soon as possible","Confirm the issues truly exist by conducting a survey and other analyses that may detect the real issue","Contact the customers in batches and inform them that the issues are being worked on currently"],"c":[2,3],"f":"Two actions should the project manager take to correct problem 1.Confirm the issues truly exist by conducting a survey and other analyses that may detect the real issue. 2. Deploy solutions that will track, prioritize, and resolve queries as soon as possible.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":620}},{"qa":"بالقرب من نهاية المشروع ، يدعي العميل أن بعض التسليمات لم يتم الوفاء بها ويبدأ في بدء طلبات التغيير. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["مراجعة ميثاق المشروع المعتمد","مراجعة خط الأساس لنطاق المشروع","تصعيد طلب التغيير إلى راعي المشروع","الرجوع إلى مصفوفة تتبع المتطلبات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":520,"q":"Close to the end of a project, a customer claims that some deliverables have not been met and starts initiating change requests.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Review the approved project charter","Revise the project scope baseline","Escalate the change request to the project sponsor","Refer to the requirements traceability matrix"],"c":[3],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam \n\nAt the end of a project, before accepting change requests or making any adjustments, the project manager must first validate whether the deliverables have indeed failed to meet the agreed-upon requirements.\nThe Requirements Traceability Matrix (RTM) is the key tool that links each requirement to its corresponding deliverable or work item.\nBy reviewing the RTM, the project manager can confirm whether the customer’s claim is valid or not.\n\nThis avoids unnecessary changes and ensures accountability.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":621}},{"qa":"يقوم مشروع رشيق بتشغيل التكرار الثالث لمدة أسبوعين. بدأ مدير عمليات جديد ، لديه خلفية تنبؤية فقط ، العمل في الشركة. في الاجتماع الأول مع مدير المشروع ، يطلب المدير تقرير حالة المشروع الأسبوعي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قدم الجانب الرشيق للمدير واتفق على الحل","شارك هذا مع الفريق واطلب منهم إعداد تقارير للمدير","اشرح للمدير أن المشاريع الرشيقة لها تقارير مباشرة","ادعُ المدير لحضور اجتماعات الوقوف اليومية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":521,"q":"An agile project is running its third iteration with a duration of 2 weeks. A new operations director, who only has a predictive background, started working at the company. In the first meeting with the project manager, the director demands a weekly project status report.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Introduce the agile aspect to the director and agree on a solution","Share this with the team and ask them to develop reports for the director","Explain to the director that agile projects have live reports","Invite the director to attend the daily standup meetings"],"c":[0],"f":"Introduce the agile aspect to the director and agree on a solution","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":622}},{"qa":"تقوم شركة بتنفيذ مشروع تحول رقمي له موعد نهائي صارم. يريد فريق التسويق دمج هذا التنفيذ مع منتج جديد ، ولا يعرف مدير المشروع المعين حديثًا جميع التبعيات. باستخدام نهج مختلط ، ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لضمان أخذ التبعيات في الاعتبار؟","oa":["تسهيل الاتصال الذي يروج لـ مجموعة سكروم الشاملة بحيث تدرك الفرق المختلفة التبعيات والتقدم","تأكد من أن كل جدول مشروع فردي يتماشى مع المواعيد النهائية المشتركة","اجمع كل المشاريع الصغيرة في مشروع واحد كبير حتى يتمكن الفريق من التعاون بشكل أفضل كفريق واحد كبي","تنفيذ رسالة إخبارية عن المشروع بحيث يمكن إعلام أعضاء الفريق المختلفين بالتقدم المحرز في كل مشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":522,"q":"A company is conducting a digital transformation project that has a hard deadline. The marketing team wants to combine this implementation with a new product, and the newly assigned project manager is not aware of all the dependencies.\nUsing a hybrid approach, what should the project manager do to ensure the dependencies are taken into consideration?","t":"S","o":["Facilitate communication promoting a Scrum of Scrums so the different teams are aware of the dependencies and progress.","Make sure that each individual project schedule is aligned with the common deadlines","Combine all of the small projects into one big project so the team can collaborate better as one big team","Implement a project newsletter so the different team members can be informed about the progress of each project"],"c":[0],"f":"Facilitate communication promoting a Scrum of Scrums so the different teams are aware of the dependencies and progress.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":623}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يعمل على مشروع بناء. يطلب صاحب الشركة من مدير المشروع تقديم تقديرات التكلفة لمشروع الديكور الجديد في غضون 4 ساعات. كيف سيتمكن مدير المشروع من إكمال هذه المهمة؟","oa":["اتصل بخبير في الموضوع  للحصول على المشورة والتشاو","أخبر المالك أن المهمة تتطلب مزيدًا من الوقت والخبرة","قم بالدعوة إلى اجتماع مع فريق المشروع لتحديد النهج الأنسب","أخبر المالك أنه سيتم تقديم ترتيب تقريبي من حيث الحجم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":523,"q":"A project manager is working on a construction project. The company owner asks the project manager to provide cost estimates for the new decoration project within 4 hours.\nHow will the project manager be able to complete this task?","t":"S","o":["Contact a subject matter expert (SME) for advice and consultation","Tell the owner that the task requires more time and expertise","Call a meeting with the project team to identify the most appropriate approach","Tell the owner that a rough order of magnitude will be provided"],"c":[2],"f":"Call a meeting with the project team to identify the most appropriate approach","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":624}},{"qa":"يقترب المشروع من الانتهاء بنجاح ، ويفخر جميع المعنيين حقًا بالنتائج المحققة. يوصي مكتب إدارة المشروع (PMO) مدير المشروع بقيادة المشروع المماثل التالي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["عرض إنجازات المشروع وتفويض نقل المعرفة إلى اللجنة التوجيهية","اطلب من مكتب إدارة المشروع إدارة مستودع الدروس المستفادة","إشراك المعنيين الرئيسيين لاستكمال وتقديم الدروس المستفادة","اختيار نفس المعنيين  للمشروع التالي لتجنب القيام بنقل المعرفة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":524,"q":"A project is approaching successful completion, and all stakeholders are really proud of the achieved results. The project management office (PMO) recommends the project manager to lead the next similar project.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Present the project achievements and delegate knowledge transfer to the steering committee","Request the PMO to manage the lessons learned repository","Engage key stakeholders to complete and deliver lessons learned.","Select the same stakeholders for the next project to avoid doing knowledge transfer"],"c":[2],"f":"Engage key stakeholders to complete and deliver lessons learned","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":625}},{"qa":"مشروع متأخر عن الجدول الزمني بسبب تأخر تركيب المعدات. هذا يؤثر على العديد من الأنشطة الأخرى. قام المدير المسؤول عن تسليم المعدات بإخطار مدير المشروع بوجود مشكلة في قدرة الفريق الذي يقوم بالتثبيت. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمنع حدوث هذا الموقف؟","oa":["أجرى مراجعات دورية مع المدير بشأن توافر الموارد","تحديد متطلبات المهارة بشكل أوضح في بيان النطاق","طلب من المدير اتباع خطة إدارة الموارد المتفق عليه","التشاور مع فريق التثبيت على أساس منتظم للتحقق من التعارضات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":525,"q":"A project is behind schedule because of a delayed equipment installation. This is affecting many other activities. The manager responsible for the equipment delivery notified the project manager that there is a capacity issue for the team doing the installation.\nWhat should the project manager have done to prevent this situation from happening?","t":"S","o":["Conducted periodic reviews with the manager on resource availability","Defined the skill requirements more clearly in the scope statement","Asked the manager to follow the agreed-upon resource management plan","Consulted with the installation team on a regular basis to check for conflicts"],"c":[0],"f":"Conducted periodic reviews with the manager on resource availability","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":626}},{"qa":"بدأت شركة في تطوير منتج جديد. أثناء التنفيذ ، لاحظ فريق المشروع أن منافسًا آخر قد أطلق منتجًا بوظائف متشابهة جدًا وسعر سوق أرخص. ما الذي كان يجب فعله بشكل مختلف لتجنب هذا السيناريو؟","oa":["يجب إصدار الحد الأدنى من المنتج القابل للتطبيق  للحصول على تعليقات من السوق","كان يجب استخدام طريقة كانبان لتحسين العمل الجاري","كان ينبغي جدولة المزيد من اجتماعات تحسين سجل أعمال المنتج","كان ينبغي اعتماد نهج دورة الحياة التكرارية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":526,"q":"A company has started developing a new product. During execution the project team notices that another competitor has launched a product with very similar functionalities and a cheaper market price.\nWhat should have been done differently to avoid this scenario?","t":"S","o":["A minimum viable product (MVP) should have been released to get feedback from the market.","The Kanban method should have been utilized to optimize the work in progress (WIP).","More backlog refinement meetings should have been scheduled","An iterative life cycle approach should have been adopted"],"c":[0],"f":"A minimum viable product (MVP) should have been released to get feedback from the market.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":627}},{"qa":"منظمة على وشك البدء في مشروع متعدد المراحل. بسبب اللوائح الصارمة ، يجب التخطيط بشكل كامل لبعض المراحل مسبقًا. ومع ذلك ، تسمح المراحل الأخرى بمزيد من المرونة والتجريب في النطاق والجدول الزمني. يريد الراعي متابعة أهداف المشروع كما هو مخطط له ، ولكنه يريد أيضًا استيعاب المعلومات والتغييرات الجديدة مع تقدم المشروع. ما هو نهج إدارة المشروع الذي يجب أن يختاره مدير المشروع لهذا المشروع؟","oa":["تزايدي","رشيقة","مرحلي","هجين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":527,"q":"An organization is about to start a multiphased project. Due to strict regulations, some of the phases must be completely planned in advance. However, other phases allow for more flexibility and experimentation on scope and schedule. The sponsor wants to pursue the project objectives as planned, but also wants to accommodate new information and changes as the project progresses.\nWhich project management approach should the project manager select for this project?","t":"S","o":["Incremental","Agile","Phased","Hybrid"],"c":[3],"f":".","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":628}},{"qa":"بدأ أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين مؤخرًا في شركة وتم تعيينه لمشروع هجين. على الرغم من الخبرة الكبيرة في مجالهم ، إلا أن المعنيين قد تعرضوا فقط لنهج المشروع التنبؤي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تخصيص الوقت لتوجيه المعنيين في نهج المشروع المختار","أبلغ مكتب إدارة المشروع أن الفريق سيستخدم نهجًا تنبؤيًا لهذا المشروع","تحديث سجل المخاطر بالأثر المحتمل وإبلاغ اللجنة التوجيهية","أبلغ المعنيين أنه يجب عليهم رفع مستوى معرفتهم مع أصحاب المصلحة الآخرين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":528,"q":"A key stakeholder has recently started in a company and has been assigned to a hybrid project. Although very experienced in their domain, the stakeholder has only been exposed to predictive project approaches.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Allocate time to mentor the stakeholder in the selected project approach","Inform the project management office (PMO) that the team will use a predictive approach for this project","Update the risk register with the potential impact and apprise the steering committee","Inform the stakeholder that they must level their knowledge with other stakeholders"],"c":[0],"f":"Allocate time to mentor the stakeholder in the selected project approach","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":629}},{"qa":"يحضر أحد كبار المديرين أحد اجتماعات مراجعة المشروع ويعرب عن قلقه من أن المشروع لن يلبي معايير الجودة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["إبلاغ المدير الأول أن هناك معايير جودة معتمدة","اطلب من المدير الأول الموافقة على خطة اختبار قبول المستخدم","تقدير سجل الأعمال  للتنبؤ بالجودة","راجع خطة إدارة الجودة مع المدير الأول الذي حصل على أعلى تصويت"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":529,"q":"A senior manager attends one of the project review meetings and expresses concern that the project will not meet the quality standards.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Inform the senior manager that there are approved quality standards","Ask the senior manager to approve the user acceptance testing (UAT) plan","Estimate the backlog items to forecast quality","Review the quality management plan with the senior manager"],"c":[3],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam \n\nWhen a senior manager expresses concern about quality, the project manager should engage in a collaborative review of the quality management plan. This plan outlines how quality will be managed and ensured throughout the project.\nBy reviewing it together, the manager’s concerns can be addressed transparently, and any misunderstandings or gaps can be clarified or corrected.\n\nThis is a proactive and professional response that aligns with stakeholder engagement and quality management principles in the PMBOK® Guide.\n\nImagine the senior manager says:\n\"I'm concerned that the product may not meet the required quality.\"\n\nIf you respond with:\n\"Don’t worry, we have approved quality standards.\"\n→ This response is superficial and does not directly address the concern.\n\nBut if you respond with:\n\"Let me walk you through the quality management plan so we can see step by step how quality is being ensured.\"\n→ Here, you are involving the manager, providing reassurance, and supporting your words with a documented plan.\n\n📘 PMBOK® Guide 6th Edition:\n\nIn the 6th Edition, stakeholder engagement in quality management is discussed in several sections:\n\n \n Section 8.1.3.1 – Quality Management Plan (Page 286):\n This section outlines how the quality management plan should be tailored to the project's needs, considering stakeholder requirements and expectations.\n \n\nSection 13.2 – Plan Stakeholder Engagement (Pages 513–521):\nThis section details how to develop strategies to effectively engage stakeholders throughout the project lifecycle, including in quality planning and management..\n\n Reference \n\n📘 PMBOK® Guide 6th Edition:\n\n \n Section 8.1.3.1 – Quality Management Plan (Page 286):\n \n \n Section 13.2 – Plan Stakeholder Engagement (Pages 513–521):\n \n \n\n📘 PMBOK® Guide 7th Edition:\n\n \n Principle: Engage Stakeholders","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":630}},{"qa":"يضم فريق تطوير المنتجات أعضاء الفريق في أربعة بلدان مختلفة. يتم تكليف مدير أول بمهمة تعيين مدير مشروع لإدارة هذا المشروع والفريق الافتراضي. ما المهارة المطلوبة لمدير المشروع لإدارة هذا الفريق بنجاح؟","oa":["يمتلك مهارات شخصية قوية لقيادة فرق افتراضية عالية الأداء","يخطط ويتحكم في كل جانب من نواتج الفريق لتجنب المفاجآت","يتحدث عدة لغات وعاش في بلدان مختلفة","تنفذ معايير المنظمة والعمليات الخاصة بالمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":530,"q":"A product development team has team members located in four different countries. A senior manager is assigned the task of recruiting a project manager to manage this project and the virtual team.\nWhich skill is required for a project manager to successfully manage this team?","t":"S","o":["Possesses strong interpersonal skills to drive high-performing virtual teams","Plans and controls every aspect of the team's deliverables to avoid surprises","Speaks several languages and has lived in different countries","Implements the organization's standards and processes for the project"],"c":[3],"f":"Implements the organization's standards and processes for the project","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":631}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير مشروع أول في شركة لم تحقق ربحًا بعد. ومع ذلك ، فإن الشركة لديها العديد من المشاريع المبتكرة في التطوير. لقد تراجعت معظم الجداول الزمنية للمشروع ، وأصبح الموظفون مرتبكين. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمساعدة الشركة على تحقيق أهدافها المالية؟","oa":["اطلب من الإدارة العليا تعيين موظفين إضافيين لدعم المشاريع","التأكد من أن جميع المشاريع ذات جودة عالية وتسليمها في الوقت المحدد","تحديد أولويات المشاريع ، وإعطاء أولوية أعلى للمشاريع التي من شأنها زيادة الأرباح","تأكد من تتبع المشروع بسرعة حتى يتم استعادة الخطوط الزمنية المتخلفة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":531,"q":"A senior project manager is working for a company that is not yet making a profit. However, the company has many innovative projects in development. Most of the project time lines have slipped, and the staff is overwhelmed.\nWhat should the project manager do to help the company meet their financial objectives?","t":"S","o":["Request that upper management hire additional staff to support the projects","Ensure that all of the projects are of high quality and are delivered on time","Prioritize the projects, giving higher priority to projects that will increase profit","Make sure the project is fast tracked so that slipped time lines are recovered"],"c":[2],"f":"Prioritize the projects, giving higher priority to projects that will increase profit","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":632}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ، كان فريق المشروع العالمي يستخدم أداة مؤتمرات الفيديو لدعم الاجتماعات اليومية. ومع ذلك ، خلال هذه الاجتماعات ، شارك عدد قليل فقط من أعضاء الفريق بنشاط. نتيجة لذلك ، حدث الكثير من سوء الفهم. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لمعالجة هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["حجز اجتماعات فردية مع أعضاء الفريق الذين لا يتحدثون خلال الاجتماعات اليومية للحصول على تحديثاتهم","استخدم عمليات تسجيل الوصول الدورية لتسهيل الاجتماع ، بحيث تتاح الفرصة لجميع المشاركين للتحدث","تحقق من القواعد الأساسية للاجتماع لمراجعة الاتفاقية الأولية مع أعضاء الفريق","حدد أحد ممثلي الفريق للتحدث خلال الاجتماع اليومي ومشاركة تحديثات الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":532,"q":"During project execution, a global project team was using a video conferencing tool to support the daily meetings. However, during these meetings, only a few team members were actively participating. As a result, lots of misunderstandings occurred.\nWhat should the project manager do to address this issue?","t":"S","o":["Book one-on-one meetings with the team members who are not speaking up during the daily meetings to get their updates","Use round-robin check-ins to facilitate the meeting, so all participants have the opportunity to speak","Check the ground rules of the meeting to review the initial agreement with the team members","Identify one team representative to speak up during the daily meeting and share the team updates"],"c":[2],"f":"Checking the ground rules can help to ensure that everyone understands how the meetings should be conducted.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":633}},{"qa":"شركة لديها مشروع قيد التنفيذ. خلال جلسة التخطيط ، يكون العديد من أصحاب المصلحة في خلاف دائم وغالبًا ما يستخدمون الحجج الشخصية لدعم موقفهم. أعضاء الفريق يشعرون بالإحباط من الموقف. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذا الموقف؟","oa":["تعزيز أن الإدارة العليا لديها سلطة اتخاذ القرار","أطلب من أصحاب المصلحة عدم إبداء آرائهم خلال الاجتماع","أنشاء القواعد الأساسية قبل بدء المناقشة","دعوة راعياً رفيع المستوى للاجتماع لتقليل مستوى الخلاف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":533,"q":"A company has a transformation project in progress. During a planning session, several stakeholders are in constant disagreement and often use personal arguments to support their position. Team members are getting frustrated with the situation.\nWhat should the project manager have done to avoid this situation?","t":"S","o":["Reinforced that higher-level management has the decision power","Asked stakeholders not to voice their opinions during the meeting","Established ground rules before the discussion had started","Invited a high-level sponsor to the meeting to reduce the level of disagreement"],"c":[2],"f":"Established ground rules before the discussion had started","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":634}},{"qa":"أثناء مراقبة مشروع في موقع عمل ، يلاحظ مدير المشروع أن فترات راحة عمل فريق الموقع قد زادت بضع دقائق كل أسبوع. كيف يجب أن يتعامل مدير المشروع مع هذا؟","oa":["فصل بعض العمال لعدم التزامهم بسياسة القطيعة","إصدار تحذير رسمي مكتوب لجميع العاملين بالساعة بسبب تأخرهم في الراحة","تقليل الأجور للعمال بسبب فترات الراحة الطويلة","عقد اجتماع مع الفريق لمناقشة المشكلة واقتراح الحلول"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":534,"q":"While monitoring a project at a work site, the project manager notices that the site team's work breaks have increased by a few minutes every week.\nHow should the project manager approach this?","t":"S","o":["Dismiss some of the workers for failing to adhere to the break policy","Issue a formal written warning to all hourly workers for their break tardiness","Reduce payment to the workers due to their extended breaks","Have a meeting with the team to discuss the issue and propose solutions"],"c":[3],"f":"Have a meeting with the team to discuss the issue and propose solutions","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":635}},{"qa":"بعد توقيع اتفاقية مع البائع ، يلاحظ مدير المشروع أن البائع يطلب باستمرار تغييرات في بيان عمل المشتريات (SOW). هذه التغييرات من شأنها تحسين نتائج المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["قم بمراجعة عملية مراقبة المشتريات لتجنب التغييرات غير المرغوب فيها التي قد تؤثر على الجدول الزمني","تقييم الوضع كفرصة للتحسين وإجراء تحليل للمخاطر","إجراء تدقيق على عملية الشراء وإبلاغ البائع بملاحظات التدقيق","استشر قائمة البائعين المختارين للعطاء وقم بتقييم التغيير المحتمل للمورد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":535,"q":"After signing an agreement with a vendor, the project manager notices that the vendor is continuously asking for changes on the procurement statement of work (SOW). These changes would improve the project outcome.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Revise the procurement control process to avoid undesired changes that might affect the schedule","Assess the situation as an opportunity for improvement and perform a risk analysis","Conduct an audit on the procurement process and inform the vendor about the audit's observations","Consult the list of selected vendors for the bid and evaluate a possible change of vendor"],"c":[1],"f":"This changes would improve the project outcome\". A supplier doesn't generally have all the information for such a statement, this imply that this statement have been formulated by the someone in the project management core team. Therefore the best option (Assess the situation as an opportunity for improvement and perform a risk analysis).","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":636}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بتنفيذ إدارة القيمة المكتسبة (EVM) لمشروع خط أنابيب عبر البلاد. حدد مدير المشروع نسبة القيمة المكتسبة (EV) إلى التكلفة الفعلية (AC) للمشروع ووجد أن النتيجة المحسوبة هي 0.9024. ماذا تعني هذه القيمة للمشروع؟","oa":["حصل المشروع على قيمة أكبر مما هو مخطط له","أوشك المشروع على تجاوز التكلفة المخطط لها","بدأ المشروع في تجاوز التكلفة المخطط لها","يكسب المشروع قيمة أقل مما كان مخططا له"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":536,"q":"A project manager is performing earned value management (EVM) for a cross-country pipeline project. The project manager has determined the ratio of earned value (EV) to actual cost (AC) for the project and has found the calculated result to be 0.9024.\nWhat does this value mean for the project?","t":"S","o":["The project has earned more value than planned","The project is close to exceeding the planned cost","The project has started exceeding the planned cost","The project is earning less value than was planned"],"c":[0],"f":"The ratio of earned value (EV) to actual cost (AC) = 0.9024 EV , The project has earned more value than planned.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":637}},{"qa":"حدث غير متوقع أدى إلى إغلاق مشاريع الأشغال العامة لمدة 4 أسابيع. ستتأخر الأنشطة على المسار الحرج بناءً على الجدول الزمني للمشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بمراجعة خطة إدارة المشروع لمعرفة تأثير التأخير المحتمل","أضف 4 أسابيع إضافية إلى الجدول واطلب موارد إضافية","قم بتعطل خطة إدارة الموارد لإبقاء الجدول على المسار الصحيح","اطلب من الممول الحصول على تصريح عمل خاص لمواصلة العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":537,"q":"An unforeseen event has shut down public works projects for 4 weeks. Activities on the critical path will fall behind based on the project schedule.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Review the project management plan to see the impact of the possible delay","Add 4 additional weeks to the schedule and request additional resources","Crash the resource management plan to keep the schedule on track","Ask the sponsor to obtain a special work permit to continue work"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager should review the project management plan to assess the impact of the unexpected event on the project schedule, budget, and scope. he should analyze the project schedule to identify any critical activities that may fall behind and determine if there is any flexibility in the schedule to accommodate the delay. They should also assess the available resources and determine if additional resources are required to get the project back on track. Based on this analysis, the project manager should develop a plan to mitigate the impact of the delay on the project and communicate the plan to the stakeholders.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":638}},{"qa":"خلال الاجتماع الدوري للتقدم المحرز في المشروع ، أبلغ الرئيس التنفيذي مدير المشروع أن أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين لم يكن على دراية بالتطورات الأخيرة في المشروع. يتأكد مدير المشروع من أن صاحب المصلحة قد تم تحديده وتصنيفه على النحو الواجب في سجل المعنيين . ما هي وثيقة المشروع التي يجب على مدير المشروع مراجعتها لتحديد سبب هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["سجل المشكلة","مصفوفة تقييم مشاركة المعنيين","مصفوفة تتبع المتطلبات","سجل المعنيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":538,"q":"During a regular project progress meeting, the CEO informed the project manager that a major stakeholder has been unaware of recent developments on the project. The project manager is sure that the stakeholder was duly identified and classified in the stakeholder register.\nWhich project document should the project manager review in order to determine the reason for this issue?","t":"S","o":["Issue log","Stakeholder engagement assessment matrix","Requirements traceability matrix","Stakeholder register"],"c":[1],"f":"Now the project manager is trying to find our the reason for this issue. So he needs to check Stakeholder engagement assessment matrix","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":639}},{"qa":"استأجرت إحدى مؤسسات الرعاية الصحية متخصصًا جديدًا في الامتثال لضمان تلبية احتياجات الامتثال للرعاية الصحية. كانت التعليقات حول أخصائي الامتثال الجديد من الفريق متوسطة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لمساعدة أخصائي الامتثال الجديد على التحسين؟","oa":["توفير الوقت للمختص للتكيف مع وتيرة المشروع","تصعيد هذا الموقف إلى مدير المنطقة للتوصل إلى حل ممكن","تواصل مع مدير الموارد البشرية للبحث في ملاحظات الفريق","تنسيق لقاء فردي مع الأخصائي لتقييم الموقف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":539,"q":"A healthcare organization hired a new compliance specialist to ensure that the healthcare compliance needs are met. The feedback about the new compliance specialist from the team was average.\nWhat should the project manager do to help the new compliance specialist improve?","t":"S","o":["Provide time for the specialist to adjust to the pace of the project","Escalate this situation to the manager of the area for a possible solution","Contact the human resources (HR) manager about the team's feedback","Coordinate a one-to-one meeting with the specialist to assess the situation"],"c":[3],"f":"Coordinate a one-to-one meeting with the specialist to assess the situation","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":640}},{"qa":"الشركة التي تستخدم نهجًا تنبئيًا وتعمل في سوق شديد التنظيم تفقد الربحية لأن دورة حياة منتجها تستغرق وقتًا أطول من تلك الخاصة بمنافسيها. تم تعيين مدير مشروع جديد لتغيير هذا السيناريو. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يقترحه مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اقتراح نهج مختلط ، والاستفادة من فوائد النهج الرشيق مع احترام بعض جوانب صناعة الشركة","الانتقال إلى نموذج رشيق ، مع التركيز بشكل أساسي على نهج تكراري ، وترك دورة الحياة المتزايدة كخطوة تالية","التغيير إلى نموذج رشيق ، مع التركيز بشكل أساسي على دورة الحياة المتزايدة ، وترك النهج التكراري كخطوة تالية","حافظ على نهج تنبؤي ، ولكن قم بزيادة التركيز على التخطيط والتتبع الأفضل لتوقع المشاكل وتجنب التأخي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":540,"q":"A company that uses a predictive approach and operates in a highly regulated market is losing profitability because its product life cycle is taking longer than those of its competitors. A new project manager has been hired to change this scenario.\nWhat approach should the project manager propose?","t":"S","o":["Propose a hybrid approach, leveraging the benefits of an agile approach while respecting some aspects of the company's industry","Migrate to an agile model, focusing primarily on an iterative approach, leaving the incremental life cycle as a next step","Change to an agile model, focusing primarily on the incremental life cycle, leaving the iterative approach as a next step","Maintain a predictive approach, but increase the focus on better planning and tracking to anticipate problems and avoid delays"],"c":[0],"f":"Propose a hybrid approach, leveraging the benefits of an agile approach while respecting some aspects of the company's industry","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":641}},{"qa":"قام مدير المشروع بتعيين أعضاء الفريق للعمل معا على كمية كبيرة من التقارير الفنية. في بعض الأحيان ، لاحظ مدير المشروع أن المعلومات المهمة لم تتم مشاركتها بشكل صحيح بين الفريق. وقد تسبب هذا في تأخير التسليم ، وفي النهاية فشل في إكمال المشروع. ما هو السبب الجذري لهذه المشكلة؟","oa":["الإسناد غير السليم للمهام إلى أزواج أعضاء الفريق","أساليب الاتصال غير الصحيحة المطبقة أثناء التنفيذ","فقد تماسك الفريق لأن أعضاء الفريق عملوا في أزواج","عدم تدريب أعضاء الفريق على تخطيط الوثائق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":541,"q":"A project manager assigned team members to work in pairs on a large amount of technical reports. At times, the project manager noticed that important information was not shared properly among the team. This has caused delivery delays and, ultimately, the failure to complete the project.\nWhat is the root cause of this issue?","t":"S","o":["Improper assignment of tasks to team member pairings","Incorrect communication techniques applied during implementation","Team cohesiveness was lost because team members worked in pairs","Lack of team member training on documentation planning"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager noticed that important information ((was not shared properly)) among the team so the cause of the problem communications techniques","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":642}},{"qa":"يتم بناء نظام برمجيات لشركة. بمجرد أن يبدأ النظام في الإنتاج ، يرغب الفريق في جمع بيانات الاستخدام لتقييم القيمة المسلمة. ما هي ممارسة التقييم التي يجب أن يستخدمها المشروع للحصول على بيانات استخدام دقيقة؟","oa":["إنشاء الوظائف في البرنامج لجمع بيانات الاستخدام التشغيلي","قم بتضمين نموذج التغذية الراجعة في النظام ليتمكن المستخدمون من الرد عليه","أرسل استبيانًا إلى جميع المستخدمين بخصوص الميزات الأكثر فائدة","مقابلة عينة من المستخدمين للحصول على بيانات الاستخدام"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":542,"q":"A software system is being built for a company. Once the system is in production, the team would like to collect usage data to evaluate the delivered value.\nWhich evaluation practice should the project lead use to obtain accurate usage data?","t":"S","o":["Build the functionality in the software to collect the operational usage data","Embed a feedback form into the system for users to respond","Send out a questionnaire to all users regarding the most useful features","Interview a sampling of users to obtain the usage data"],"c":[0],"f":"Build the functionality in the software to collect the operational usage data","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":643}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يدير طرحًا وطنيًا لمنتج مبتكر في بيئة منظمة من المتوقع أن تتغير. مكتب إدارة المشروع (PMO) يحتاج إلى رؤية القيود التنظيمية مع الحفاظ على درجة من المرونة. ما الأداة التي يمكن لمدير المشروع استخدامها؟","oa":["استخدم مخطط الحرق التنازلي لتوفير الشفافية","استخدم سجل أعمال المنتج لإدارة التغييرات","استخدم لوحة كانبان لزيادة المساءلة","استخدم مخطط الحرق التصاعدي  لتوفير الشفافية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":543,"q":"A project manager is managing a national rollout for an innovative product in a regulated environment that is expected to change. The project management office\n(PMO) needs visibility of the regulatory constraints while maintaining a degree of flexibility.\nWhich tool can the project manager use?","t":"S","o":["Use a burndown chart to provide transparency","Use a product backlog to manage changes","Use a kanban board to increase accountability","Use a burnup chart to provide transparency"],"c":[1],"f":"The backlog is continuously updated as new requirements emerge or existing ones change. The project manager can use the product backlog to manage changes and ensure that the project team is aware of the regulatory constraints. By keeping the product backlog updated, the project manager can maintain flexibility and adjust the project's scope to accommodate regulatory changes.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":644}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير مشروع بتقييم الإجراءات اللازمة لإشراك أصحاب المصلحة في مشروع بناء مصنع في بلدة صغيرة. المجتمع المحلي يتكهن بتأثير المنشأة. هناك شائعات عن فرص عمل وتأثيرات بيئية مدرجة في مصفوفة مخاطر المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع فيما يتعلق بالمشاركة المجتمعية في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["بناء قنوات لتوسيع جهود الاتصال إلى المجتمع المحلي","ركز على أصحاب المصلحة الجانبيين فقط ودع المنظمة تدير المجتمع","استخدم إدارة المدينة للتعامل مع التواصل مع المجتمع","ضم ممثل الاتحاد المحلي في مجموعة أصحاب المصلحة ذوي النفوذ العالي والتأثير العالي"],"rat":null,"fa":"يجب على مدير المشروع تحديد جميع المعنيين، بما في ذلك المجتمع المحلي ، وبناء قنوات اتصال لتوفير معلومات دقيقة حول أهداف المشروع والجداول الزمنية والتأثير المحتمل. من خلال القيام بذلك ، يمكن لمدير المشروع معالجة أي مخاوف قد تكون لدى المجتمع المحلي وإدارة توقعاتهم.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":544,"q":"A project manager for a factory construction project in a small town is evaluating the necessary actions to engage stakeholders. The local community is speculating the impact of the facility. There are rumors of job opportunities and environmental impacts, which are listed on the project risk matrix.\nWhat should the project manager do with regard to community engagement in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Build channels to extend communication efforts to the local community","Focus on the sideward stakeholders only and let the organization manage the community","Use the city administration to address communication with the community","Include the local union representative in the high-power, high-impact stakeholder group"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager should identify all stakeholders, including the local community, and build communication channels to provide accurate information about the project's objectives, timelines, and potential impact. By doing so, the project manager can address any concerns the local community may have and manage their expectations.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":645}},{"qa":"قامت إحدى الشركات بطرح أحدث نظام لإدارة البيع بالتجزئة ، وتم تسليم المشروع للعمليات. يجد فريق العمليات أن العديد من المتطلبات اليومية لا يغطيها النظام ، وأن دعم المشروع له ساعات محدودة. تم حل فريق المشروع ولم تعد موارد العقد تعمل في المشروع. نتيجة لذلك ، واجه فريق العمليات العديد من مشكلات العملاء. ما الذي كان ينبغي على قائد المشروع فعله في البداية لتجنب هذا الموقف؟","oa":["استعرض خطة إدارة المشروع","إنشاء دليل عمليات مفصل","إشراك المعنيين المتواجدين بقسم العمليات أثناء التخطيط","زيادة ساعات الدعم لساعات العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":545,"q":"A company has rolled out the latest retail management system, and the project has been handed over to operations. The operations team finds that many of the day-to-day requirements are not covered in the system, and support for the project has limited hours. The project team has dissolved and the contract resources are no longer working on the project. As a result, the operations team has been facing numerous customer issues.\nWhat should the project lead have done initially to avoid this situation?","t":"S","o":["Reviewed the project management plan","Created a detailed operations manual","Involved operations stakeholders during planning","Increased support hours for the hours of operation"],"c":[2],"f":"Involved operations stakeholders during planning","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":646}},{"qa":"ينتقل فريق المشروع من نهج تنبؤي إلى نهج رشيق. يحاول مدير المشروع تقليل مشكلات الدعم التي واجهها المنتج في الإنتاج. إحدى نقاط العوائق الخاصة هي الانتقال إلى العمليات ، حيث تنشأ المشكلات عادةً. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لتحسين هذا السيناريو؟","oa":["زيادة التركيز على البنود المتراكمة التي تغطي متطلبات الدعم ، بالإضافة إلى أدلة المنتج وأدلة التشغيل","اطلب من فريق الدعم / التشغيل المشاركة في اجتماعات الاستعداد اليومية للمساهمة في تقدم المشروع","تعزيز مشاركة أصحاب المصلحة من خلال إشراكهم في وقت مبكر في المناقشات المتأخرة","إشراك فرق العمليات في جلسات التقييم بأثر رجعي (الاستعادي) والعرض التوضيحي ودمج ملاحظاتهم حول أنشطة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":546,"q":"A project team is transitioning from a predictive to an agile approach. The project manager is trying to minimize the support issues that the product has had in production. One particular pain point is the transition to operations, where the issues usually arise.\nWhat should the project manager do to improve this scenario?","t":"S","o":["Increase the focus on backlog items that cover support requirements, as well as product manuals and operation guides","Ask the support/operation team to participate in the daily standup meetings to contribute to the project's progress","Foster stakeholder participation by engaging them early on the backlog discussions","Engage the operation teams in the retrospectives and demo sessions and incorporate their feedback on project activities"],"c":[3],"f":"The Operations team is not involved in a spint retrospective. It is with the development team to look at what went well, what did not, and what could be done better.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":647}},{"qa":"تم تكليف مدير مشروع بمشروع لبناء مزرعة شمسية جديدة توفر طاقة نظيفة لمجمع سكني جديد. قررت الحكومة خفض الضريبة على منتجات الطاقة المتجددة اعتبارًا من 1 يناير. اتصل المورد وذكر أن الطلب الذي تم تقديمه للألواح الشمسية ليتم تسليمه قد يتأخر 20 ديسمبر حتى أوائل يناير. من ناحية أخرى ، سيواجه المشروع قيودًا مماثلة بسبب عطلة ديسمبر. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع حيال هذه المخاطر؟","oa":["الإصرار على قيام المورد بتسليم البضائع في التاريخ المتفق عليه","مراجعة عقد المورد لفهم شروط البيع","قبول المخاطر وتحديث سجل المخاطر","قم بتحديث سجل المخاطر واغتنم الفرصة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":547,"q":"A project manager has been assigned a project to build a new solar farm that will provide clean energy to a new housing complex. The government has decided to reduce the tax on renewable energy products starting 1 January. The supplier has reached out and stated that the order placed for solar panels to be delivered on\n20 December might be delayed until early January. On the other hand, the project will face similar constraints due to the December holidays.\nWhat should the project manager do about this risk?","t":"S","o":["Insist that the supplier deliver the goods on the agreed date","Review the supplier's contract to understand the terms of sale","Accept the risk and update the risk register","Update the risk register and take advantage of the opportunity"],"c":[3],"f":"It is positive risk that should be exploited","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":648}},{"qa":"يتم تعيين مدير مشروع لإدارة مشروع لعميل سابق للشركة. تم تحذير مدير المشروع من أن هذا العميل سيحاول على الأرجح إضافة نطاق إضافي للمشروع دون النظر في تأثير التغيير على الوقت والتكلفة والجودة والمخاطر. ما الإجراء الذي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه للمساعدة في تخطيط وإدارة الميزانية والموارد؟","oa":["حلل المخرجات إلى حزم عمل وقم بمراجعة ميثاق المشروع","إنشاء بيانات ضيقة النطاق ومراجعة المعلومات التاريخية","رفض السماح للعميل بتغيير النطاق وفحص سجل الدروس المستفادة","تضمين عملية تغيير النطاق ومراجعة ميثاق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":548,"q":"A project manager is assigned to manage a project for a previous client of the company. The project manager was warned that this client will likely try to add extra scope to the project without considering the impact of change on time, cost, quality, and risks.\nWhich action should the project manager take to help plan and manage the budget and resources?","t":"S","o":["Decompose the deliverables into work packages and review the project charter","Create tight scope statements and review the historical information","Refuse to allow the client to change the scope and examine the lessons learned register","Include a scope change process and review the project charter"],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should include a scope change process that outlines the steps for requesting, evaluating, approving, and managing scope changes. This process should be communicated to the client and the project team to ensure everyone understands how changes will be managed. The project manager should also review the project charter, which outlines the project's goals, objectives, and scope. This will help ensure that any proposed scope changes are aligned with the project's objectives and goals.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":649}},{"qa":"يدير مدير المشروع مشروعًا بنهج هجين وقد طلب من أحد كبار أعضاء الفريق إجراء تحليل كمي للمخاطر. يستجيب عضو الفريق بأنه ليس لديهم المعرفة لإجراء مثل هذا التحليل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اتصل بمكتب إدارة المشروع  واطلب منهم تعيين عضو آخر في الفريق لديه المعرفة لأداء هذه المهمة للفريق","تصعيد المشكلة إلى المدير الوظيفي","إجراء التحليل الكمي للمخاطر لعضو الفريق","ساعد أعضاء الفريق على إجراء التحليل الكمي للمخاطر من خلال التدريب والتوجيه والتدريب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":549,"q":"A project manager is managing a project with a hybrid approach and has requested a senior team member to perform a quantitative risk analysis. The team member responds that they do not have the knowledge to perform such an analysis.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Contact the project management office (PMO) and request them to assign another team member who has the knowledge to perform this task to the team","Escalate the issue to the functional manager","Perform the quantitative risk analysis for the team member","Help the team member to perform the quantitative risk analysis through coaching, mentoring, and training"],"c":[3],"f":"Help the team member to perform the quantitative risk analysis through coaching, mentoring, and training","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":650}},{"qa":"لقد عمل مطور كبير يعمل في مشروع كبير للذكاء الاصطناعي (AI) بجد وأظهر نتائج ممتازة. يسعد مدير المشروع جدًا بمساهمة المطور ويعتقد أن المطور يستحق مكافأة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["مكافأة المطور حسب دوافعه واهتماماته","طباعة شهادة الاعتراف وتقديمها للمطور خلال الاجتماع","إرسال بريد إلكتروني للتعرف على الفريق ونسخ الإدارة","خلق فرصة لفريق المشروع للتعرف على هذا المطور"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":550,"q":"A senior developer working on a large artificial intelligence (AI) project has worked hard and shown excellent results. The project manager is very happy with the developer's contribution and thinks that the developer deserves a reward.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Reward the developer according to their motivations and interests","Print a recognition certificate and present it to the developer during a meeting","Send a recognition email to the team and copy management","Create an opportunity for the project team to recognize this developer"],"c":[0],"f":"Reward the developer according to their motivations and interests","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":651}},{"qa":"يتم إطلاق برنامج عالمي ، وتشارك فرق موزعة مختلفة في تقديم المبادرة. إلى جانب تخطيط وتنفيذ نطاق المبادرة ، يجب مراعاة تفاعلات الفريق. كيف يجب أن تتفاعل فرق المشروع في اجتماعاتهم؟","oa":["المحادثات الهاتفية","محادثات الدردشة","رسائل البريد الإلكتروني المشفرة","عقد المؤتمرات عن طريق الفيديو"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":551,"q":"A global program is being kicked off, and various distributed teams are involved in delivering the initiative. Besides planning and executing the scope for the initiative, team interactions must be considered.\nHow should the project teams interact in their meetings?","t":"S","o":["Phone conversations","Chat conversations","Encrypted emails","Videoconferencing"],"c":[3],"f":"Videoconferencing\n\nA method enables the project teams interact in their meetings when they are distributed in different location or in global project","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":652}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع هو جزء من فريق مشروع عالمي وهو مسؤول عن إدارة النطاق الذي حدده بلدهم. هناك تقسيم واضح فيما يتعلق بأجزاء النطاق التي يجب أن تعالجها الفرق العالمية والمحلية. خلال آخر تكرار ، تلقى مدير المشروع طلبات يجب على الفريق العالمي التعامل معها. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["تصعيد الموقف لجهة راعي المشروع","تقييم قدرة الفريق على استيعاب عبء العمل","رفض عبء العمل مرة أخرى إلى الفريق العالمي","تقييم وفهم سبب الصراع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":552,"q":"A project manager is part of a global project team and is in charge of managing the scope defined by their country. There is a clear division regarding which pieces of the scope should be treated by global and local teams. During the last sprints, the project manager has been receiving requests that the global team should handle.\nWhat should the project manager do in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Escalate the situation to the project sponsor","Assess the team's capacity to absorb the workload","Reject the workload back to the global team","Evaluate and understand the cause of the conflict"],"c":[3],"f":"There is a clear conflict or \"division regarding which pieces of the scope should be treated by global and local teams.\"","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":653}},{"qa":"تقوم شركة بتحويل المشاريع من نهج تنبؤي إلى نهج رشيق. يشعر المدير المالي بالقلق من أن أحد المشاريع الرشيقة لديه ميزة مهمة للإدارة المالية والتي يتم تأخيرها لتكرار لاحق. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لتوضيح الموقف؟","oa":["طلب الدعم من الرئيس التنفيذي حول كيفية التعامل مع الموقف","وضح للمدير المالي أن عملية تحديد الأولويات تستند إلى قيمة الأعمال","إنشاء مجلس تنفيذي لمراجعة سجل أعمال المنتج وإعادة صياغة التكرارات التالية","زيادة حجم الفريق لمطابقة أي توقعات سابقة للمدير المالي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":553,"q":"A company is transitioning projects from a predictive to an agile approach. The CFO is concerned that one of the agile projects has an important feature for the financial department that is being delayed for a later iteration.\nWhat should the project manager do to clarify the situation?","t":"S","o":["Request support from the CEO on how to deal with the situation","Clarify with the CFO that the prioritization process is based on business value","Create an executive board to review the product backlog and replan the next iterations","Increase the size of the team in order to match any prior expectations of the CFO"],"c":[1],"f":"Clarify with the CFO that the prioritization process is based on business value","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":654}},{"qa":"يشارك مدير المشروع في عملية معقدة تقنيًا تخص مراجعة مؤشرات المشروع الرئيسية مع أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين على أساس منتظم. خلال أحد الاجتماعات ، أوضح راعي المشروع لمدير المشروع  أنه يستخدم سجل مخاطر  كوسيلة للتواصل حول المشروع على المستوى التنفيذي. كيف يجب أن يضمن مدير المشروع الإبلاغ عن مخاطر المشروع بدقة في سجل المخاطر؟","oa":["مراجعة المخاطر خلال تنفيذ المشروع","ضع قائمة بمخاطر المشروع التي تم تحديدها في الاجتماع الافتتاحي","تحديث المخاطر في خطة إدارة المخاطر","خطة لتحديث المخاطر عند إقفال المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":"مراجعة المخاطر خلال تنفيذ المشروع","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":554,"q":"A project manager for a technologically complex engagement reviews the key project indicators with the main stakeholders on a regular basis. During one of the meetings, the project sponsor explains that they are using the project manager's risk register as a way to communicate about the project at the executive level.\nHow should the project manager ensure that project risks are reported accurately in the risk register?","t":"S","o":["Review the risks throughout project execution","List the project risks identified in the kick-off meeting","Update the risks in the risk management plan","Plan to update the risks at project closure"],"c":[0],"f":"Review the risks throughout project execution","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":655}},{"qa":"هى مدير مشروع مؤخرًا مشروعًا وبدأ في إدارة مشروع جديد مع مشرف مختلف. كجزء من أنشطة المشروع المبكرة ، يتم تعيين المشرف من المشروع الأصلي للفريق كمورد غير إشرافي ويبدأ فورًا في تحدي جميع القرارات التي يتخذها المشرف الحالي. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لحل هذا التعارض؟","oa":["قم بإزالة المورد فورًا من فريق المشروع","التواصل مع المورد حول أدوار ومسؤوليات هذا المشروع","امنح فريق المشروع وقتًا للعمل من خلال المشكلات مع المشرف الجديد","تأكد من أن المشرف الجديد يأخذ زمام المبادرة عند الطعن"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":555,"q":"A project manager recently finished a project and started managing a new project with a different supervisor. As part of the early project activities, the supervisor from the original project is assigned to the team as a nonsupervisory resource and immediately begins challenging all decisions made by the current supervisor.\nWhat should the project manager do to resolve this conflict?","t":"S","o":["Immediately remove the resource from the project team","Communicate with the resource on the roles and responsibilities of this project","Give the project team time to work through the issues with the new supervisor","Ensure the new supervisor takes the lead when being challenged"],"c":[1],"f":"Communicate with the resource on the roles and responsibilities of this project","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":656}},{"qa":"أرسل مدير المشروع أول اتصال حول خطة إدارة المشروع إلى الفريق. في اليوم التالي ، سأل مهندسان ميدانيان عن أدوارهما والجدول الزمني للمشروع. ماذا كان يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["أرسال مصفوفة الأدوار والمسؤوليات مع خطة إدارة المشروع","تأكد من أن الاتصال كان مفهوماً وأطلب تعليقات من الفريق","ناقش الأدوار مع المديرين للمساعدة في شرحها لأعضاء فريقهم","أطلع كل عضو في الفريق على أدواره قبل إرسال خطة إدارة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":556,"q":"A project manager sent the first communication about the project management plan to the team. The next day, two field engineers were asking about their roles and the project schedule.\nWhat should the project manager have done?","t":"S","o":["Sent the roles and responsibilities matrix along with the project management plan","Confirmed that the communication was understood and solicited feedback from the team","Discussed the roles with the managers to help explain them to their team members","Briefed each team member on their roles before sending the project management plan"],"c":[1],"f":"Since the project management plan includes roles and schedule. Also, only two members ask that questions, which means the communication is not clear for these two members.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":657}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يدير مشروعًا في منتصف مرحلة تنفيذه ، وقد تم قبول معايير الجودة للنتائج رسميًا. ومع ذلك ، أدخلت وكالة حكومية مؤخرًا معايير جديدة قد تؤثر بشكل كبير على المشروع. يجب تغيير المخرجات لتتماشى مع معايير الجودة الجديدة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تقييم تأثير اللوائح الجديدة على المشروع وتقديم طلب التغيير","قم بإعداد عمليات منظمة ومستقلة لتحديد ما إذا كانت أنشطة المشروع تتبع المعايير","جدولة تدريب فريق المشروع على اللوائح الجديدة التي تضعها الجهة الحكومية","تحديث سجل الدروس المستفادة وإبلاغ الإدارة العليا بالمعايير الجديدة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":557,"q":"A project manager is managing a project that is halfway through its execution phase, and the quality standards of the deliverables were formally accepted.\nHowever, a government agency has recently introduced new standards that may significantly impact the project. The deliverables must be changed to align with the new quality standards.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Evaluate the impact the new regulations will have on the project and submit a change request","Set up a structured, independent processes to determine if project activities followed the standards","Schedule training for the project team on the new regulations introduced by the government agency","Update the lessons learned register and inform senior management of the new standards"],"c":[1],"f":"A government agency has recently introduced new standards that may significantly impact the project so the project manager should Set up a structured, independent processes to determine if project activities followed the standards","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":658}},{"qa":"فريق منظم ذاتيًا لمشروع مهم يقدم باستمرار قيمة وفقًا لالتزاماته. خلال أجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي ، لاحظ مدير المشروع أن معظم أعضاء الفريق تعرضوا للتوتر بسبب الالتزامات الزائدة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["دعم الفريق خلال مرحلة التخطيط للالتزام فقط بما يمكنهم تقديمه","اطلب موارد إضافية لمواصلة تقديم القيمة مع تقليل إجهاد الفريق","ساعد أعضاء الفريق من خلال تنظيم جلسات منتظمة لتخفيف التوتر وبناء الفريق","اطلب من أعضاء الفريق الفرديين التخطيط لإجازة متقطعة لتجنب التعرض للتوتر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":558,"q":"A self-organizing team for a critical project is consistently delivering value according to their commitments. During a retrospective, the project manager observed that most of the team members were stressed due to over commitments.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Support the team during the planning phase to only commit to what they are able to deliver","Request additional resources to continue delivering value while reducing team stress","Help the team members by organizing regular stress-relieving and team- building sessions","Ask individual team members to plan staggered leave to avoid becoming stressed"],"c":[0],"f":"Stress can only be taken away from you if you commit to what you are able to deliver.\" Working in Sprints at a sustainable pace improves the Scrum Team’s focus and consistency.\"","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":659}},{"qa":"تلقى مدير المشروع ميثاق المشروع لمنتج جديد. من المتوقع أن يكون للمشروع عمليتان رئيسيتان: جزء الأجهزة الذي يحتوي على مواصفات تفصيلية محددة بالفعل ، بما في ذلك آلة العينة ، وبرنامج واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتوي فقط على المواصفات الأساسية ومتطلبات نهج تصميم تجربة المستخدم. ما هو نهج إدارة المشروع الذي يجب أن يستخدمه مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تطوير البرمجيات لديه مستوى عالٍ من عدم اليقين ، لذلك يوصى باتباع نهج رشيق للمشروع.","النطاق محدد جيدا ؛ لذلك ، فإن النهج التنبئي واضح ومباشر ويمكن للأجهزة والبرامج أن تتم مزامنتها على البوابات","تختلف المخرجات بشكل كبير ، لذلك يجب تقسيم المشروع إلى مشروعين يحركهما برنامج","النهج المختلط ، باستخدام أجايل لتطوير البرمجيات ونهج تنبؤي لتسليم الأجهزة."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":559,"q":"A project manager received the project charter for a new product. The project is expected to have two main deliveries: the hardware part that has detailed specifications already defined, including a sample machine, and the user interface software that has only a basic specification and a requirement for a user experience design approach.\nWhich project management approach should the project manager use?","t":"S","o":["The software development has a high uncertainty level, so an agile approach is recommended for the project.","The scope is well defined; therefore, a predictive approach is straightforward and the hardware and software can by synchronized on the gates","The deliverables are significantly different, so the project should be split into two projects that are driven by a program.","A hybrid approach will work, using agile for software development and a predictive approach for the hardware deliveries"],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should use A hybrid approach will work using agile for software development which has only a basic specification and a predictive approach for the hardware deliveries which has detailed specifications","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":660}},{"qa":"تلقى أحد أعضاء فريق أجايل شهادة على أداة جديدة ؛ ومع ذلك ، يشكو عضو الفريق هذا من أن باقي الفريق لا يستخدم الأداة بسبب نقص المعرفة. كيف ينبغي للقائد الخادم أن يطبق الذكاء العاطفي للاستفادة من هذا الوضع لصالح المشروع؟","oa":["قدم حافزًا لأعضاء الفريق الذين يبدأون في استخدام الأداة الجديدة في هذا المشروع","اطلب من أعضاء الفريق استخدام معرفتهم المكتسبة مؤخرًا لتطوير وتقديم التدريب للفريق","اطلب ميزانية لمكافأة عضو الفريق حتى يتم تحفيز الآخرين للحصول على نفس الشهادة","قم بترقية عضو الفريق إلى مالك المنتج للاستفادة من المعرفة الجديدة مع العملاء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":560,"q":"An agile team member received certification on a new tool; however, this team member is complaining that the rest of the team is not using the tool due to lack of knowledge.\nHow should the servant leader apply emotional intelligence to leverage this situation to benefit the project?","t":"S","o":["Provide an incentive to team members who begin using the new tool on this project.","Ask the team member to use their recently acquired knowledge to develop and provide training to the team","Request budget to reward the team member so others will be motivated to obtain the same certification.","Promote the team member to product owner to leverage the new knowledge with the clients"],"c":[1],"f":"Ask the team member to use their recently acquired knowledge to develop and provide training to the team","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":661}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع بعد الموافقة على الميثاق. أثناء مراجعة الميثاق مع الفريق ، وجد مدير المشروع أن بعض بنود الميزانية الرئيسية ، الضرورية لتحقيق نتيجة المشروع ، قد فاتت. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["ناقش هذا الأمر على الفور مع راعي المشروع واطلب إعادة النظر في الميزانية للتأكد من دقتها","أضف بنود الميزانية المفقودة إلى سجل المخاطر وقدمها في اللجنة التوجيهية التالية للمشروع","تقليل جودة وتكلفة النواتج الأخرى للسماح بميزانية إضافية للعناصر التي فاتها","ابدأ المشروع وتعامل مع مشكلات الميزانية هذه عند ظهورها طوال دورة حياة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":561,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to a project after the charter has been approved. While reviewing the charter with the team, the project manager finds that some major budget items, necessary for achieving the project outcome, have been missed.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Immediately discuss this with the project sponsor and request to revisit the budget to ensure its accuracy","Add the missing budget items to the risk log and present them in the next project steering committee","Reduce the quality and cost of other deliverables to allow additional budget for the items that were missed","Start the project and deal with these budget issues as they arise throughout the project life cycle"],"c":[0],"f":"Immediately discuss this with the project sponsor and request to revisit the budget to ensure its accuracy","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":662}},{"qa":"تحولت مخاطر جدول المشروع إلى مشكلة. يتوقع مدير المشروع تأخيرات في تنفيذ المشروع. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لحل المشكلة؟","oa":["قم بتحديث خط الأساس للجدول الزمني إلى الخط الزمني الجديد للمشروع","تصعيد المشكلة إلى القيادة العليا لحلها","تحديث خطة إدارة المخاطر وإرسالها إلى فريق المشروع","العمل مع المعنيين ذو العلاقة  لتحديد الحلول الممكنة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":562,"q":"A project schedule risk has turned into an issue. The project manager foresees delays in project execution.\nWhat should the project manager do to resolve the issue?","t":"S","o":["Update the schedule baseline to the new project time line","Escalate the issue to senior leadership for resolution","Update the risk management plan and send it to the project team","Work with relevant stakeholders to determine possible solutions"],"c":[3],"f":"Work with relevant stakeholders to determine possible solutions","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":663}},{"qa":"يتكون المشروع من أعضاء الفريق غير منخرطين وغير الملتزمين الملتزمين بنجاح المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لمعالجة هذا الوضع؟","oa":["اقبل الموقف مع العلم أن هناك فترة سماح للجدول الزمني متاحة للإفراج عنها على أساس تدريجي عند الضرورة","تواصل مع كل عضو في الفريق للتعرف على وجهة نظره بشأن المشكلة ، ثم اجمع الفريق بأكمله لمناقشة الحل","اتصل براعى المشروع لطلب الموافقة على تسريح الفريق الحالي وتعيين موظفين بديلين","أرسل لكل عضو في الفريق رسالة بريد إلكتروني مباشرة تشير إلى احتمال اتخاذ إجراء تأديبي إذا لم يغيروا موقفهم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":563,"q":"A project is comprised of team members who are not engaged and committed to project success.\nWhat should the project manager do to address this situation?","t":"S","o":["Accept the situation knowing there is schedule slack available to release on an incremental basis when necessary","Call each team member to gain their perspective on the problem, then bring the whole team together to discuss a solution","Contact the project sponsor to request approval to release the current team and hire replacement personnel","Send each team member a direct email indicating that disciplinary action is likely if they do not change their attitude"],"c":[1],"f":"Contact the project sponsor to request approval to release the current team and hire replacement personnel","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":664}},{"qa":"في مشروع البناء حيث الوقت حرج ، حدث سوء تفاهم بين المشرف والفني. تحول سوء التفاهم إلى صراع كبير واشتكى الفني إلى مدير المشروع من أنه لا يمكنهم الاستمرار في العمل تحت إشراف المشرف بعد الآن. يستشهد المشرف بضعف أداء الفني كسبب للنزاع. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع حل المشكلة؟","oa":["توفير تدريب في الوقت المناسب للفني لتحسين مجموعة مهاراته","استخدم نهجًا تعاونيًا مباشرًا مع الفني والمشرف","تحدث إلى المشرف للتخفيف من حدة نهجهم وموقفهم","استبدل الفني بموارد عالية الأداء لأن الوقت أمر بالغ الأهمية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":564,"q":"In a time-critical construction project, a misunderstanding occurred between the supervisor and the technician. The misunderstanding turned into a major conflict and the technician has complained to the project manager that they cannot continue to work under the supervisor any longer. The supervisor cites the technician's poor performance as the reason for the conflict.\nHow should the project manager resolve the problem?","t":"S","o":["Provide a just-in-time training to the technician to improve their skill set","Use a direct, collaborative approach with the technician and supervisor","Talk to the supervisor to tone down their approach and attitude","Replace the technician with a high performing resource as time is critical"],"c":[1],"f":"Use a direct, collaborative approach with the technician and supervisor","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":665}},{"qa":"يتم تعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع تم فيه إشراك مورد لبناء نظام جديد. قبل أسبوع واحد من جدولة اختبار قبول المستخدم (UAT) ، يُبلغ البائع مدير المشروع أنه لا يمكنه تقديم سوى نصف الوظائف الموعودة بحلول تاريخ بدء UAT. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["اضبط الجدول الزمني للمشروع لاستيعاب تقدم التطوير الحالي للمورد","تواصل مع البائع وفريق المشروع واستكشف إمكانيات حل المشكلة","انتظر حتى يتعذر على البائع التسليم ثم طلب تعويضات مقطوعة بناءً على العقد","التصعيد إلى الإدارة والاستعداد لإغلاق المشروع عن طريق إلغاء العقد مع هذا البائع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":565,"q":"A project manager is assigned to a project where a vendor has been engaged to build a new system. One week before user acceptance testing (UAT) is scheduled, the vendor informs the project manager that they can only deliver half of the promised functions by the UAT start date.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Adjust the project schedule to accommodate the current development progress of the vendor","Communicate with the vendor and project team and explore possibilities for resolving the issue","Wait until the vendor cannot deliver and then invoke liquidated damages based on the contract","Escalate to management and prepare for project closure by canceling the contract with this vendor"],"c":[1],"f":"Communicate with the vendor and project team and explore possibilities for resolving the issue","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":666}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لقيادة مشروع برمجي لتحقيق وفورات في مؤسسة مالية مهمة. في البداية ، كانت مدة المشروع 13 شهرًا ، ولكن بسبب مشكلات مختلفة أثناء التنفيذ ، تم تمديد المشروع إلى 16 شهرًا. بحلول الشهر الحادي عشر ، تم تجاوز الوفورات المتوقعة ولكن لم تتحقق جميع الوظائف المخطط لها لذلك التاريخ. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع إبلاغ أصحاب المصلحة بالتقدم المحرز في المشروع؟","oa":["الإبلاغ عن توقعات الفوائد وخطة العمل للوظائف المعلقة","إرسال بريد إلكتروني مع التقدم الشهري للمشروع إلى جميع أصحاب المصلحة المعنيين","أكمل الوظائف البارزة قبل إبلاغ الراعي بسير المشروع","اذكر أن المشروع لم يحقق جميع الوظائف المتوقعة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":566,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to lead a software project to generate savings at an important financial institution. Initially, the duration of the project was 13 months, but due to various issues during execution, the project was extended to 16 months. By month 11, the expected savings were exceeded but not all of the functionalities planned for that date were fulfilled.\nHow should the project manager inform the stakeholders of the project's progress?","t":"S","o":["Communicate the benefit expectations and the action plan for the pending functionalities","Send an email with the monthly project progress to all relevant stakeholders","Complete the outstanding functionalities before informing the sponsor of the project progress","Report that the project has not fulfilled all the expected functionalities"],"c":[0],"f":"\"Benefit expectations\" should be reworded with \"realized benefits\" to make it more understandable","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":667}},{"qa":"يتم تعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع جديد سيطلق النسخة الرقمية من المنتج الحالي. على الرغم من أن المنتج معروف جيدًا ، إلا أن رؤية نسخته الرقمية ليست واضحة لأصحاب المصلحة. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لزيادة تسليم القيمة؟","oa":["اجمع الفريق لإنشاء خارطة طريق منتج شاملة ولكن التزم فقط بمتطلبات الربع التالي","إنشاء لوحة مهام مرئية مع جميع أصحاب المصلحة المعنيين لدعم تحديد أولويات الأعمال المتأخرة","العمل مع الفريق على تحديد الحد الأدنى من المنتج القابل للتطبيق  وتقديمه إلى أصحاب المصلحة","استخدم أسبايك للتعمق أكثر في التحديات التقنية للمنتج الجديد ، وبالتالي تقليل المخاطر الفنية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":567,"q":"A project manager is assigned to a new project that will launch the digital version of a current product. Even though the product is well known, the vision for its digital version is not clear to the stakeholders.\nWhat should the project manager do to increase value delivery?","t":"S","o":["Gather the team to create a comprehensive product roadmap but only commit to requirements for the next quarter","Create a visual task board with all of the relevant stakeholders to support backlog prioritization","Work with the team on the definition of a minimum viable product (MVP) and present it to the stakeholders","Use spikes to dig deeper into the technical challenges of the new product, thus reducing the technical risk"],"c":[2],"f":"By working with the team on the definition of a minimum viable product (MVP) and presenting it to the stakeholders, the project manager can gather feedback on the direction of the project and get buy-in from stakeholders. This approach also ensures that the team focuses on delivering the most important features first, which can reduce the risk of building unnecessary features. Once the MVP is defined, the project manager can then work with the team to break it down into smaller, manageable tasks for development.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":668}},{"qa":"ينتظر الفريق الذي يعمل على نشر قريب تلقي المعلومات الهامة من العميل. يواصل العميل تأجيل إرسال المعلومات مما يؤدي إلى تأخير النشر. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمنع التأخير؟","oa":["استخدام بيانات العينة الموجودة بالفعل","إشراك العميل في عملية النشر","مشاركة الإدارة العليا في العملية","حصلت على جميع المعلومات الهامة في وقت مبكر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":568,"q":"A team working on a close deployment waits to receive critical information from the customer. The customer keeps postponing sending the information which is delaying the deployment.\nWhat should the project manager have done to prevent the delay?","t":"S","o":["Used the sample data already in place","Involved the customer in the deployment process","Involved upper management in the process","Obtained all critical information ahead of time"],"c":[1],"f":"Identify and analyse well the stakeholders and their power / interest on the project so as to know how to better manage them. In this situation the customer has high power but low interest so needs to be actively consulted. The best way to go is to engage them in the deployment process.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":669}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع بتنفيذ نظام مستضاف لطرف ثالث. قبل بدء البث المباشر مباشرة ، يطلب العميل من فريق المشروع تضمين وظائف إضافية. حدد فريق المشروع المخاطر على تاريخ التسليم وأبلغ مدير المشروع أن بعض الوظائف المطلوبة تتعارض مع النطاق المتفق عليه. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من الفريق تقديم الوظيفة في تاريخ بدء التشغيل المتفق عليه","ناقش مع العميل المخاطر المحددة ومخاوف الفريق","اطلب من العميل بدء البث المباشر وإضافة الوظيفة الجديدة إلى الأعمال المتأخرة","ناقش مع الفريق ، وقم بتقدير الجهد ، ورفع طلب التغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":569,"q":"A project team is implementing a hosted system for a third party. Just before going live, the customer asks the project team to include additional functionality. The project team identified risks to the delivery date and informed the project manager that some of the requested functions are in conflict with the agreed scope.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Ask the team to deliver the functionality on the agreed go-live date","Discuss with the customer the risks identified and team's concerns","Ask the customer to go live and add the new functionality in the backlog","Discuss with the team, estimate the effort, and raise a change request"],"c":[1],"f":"The risk has already been identified, evaluated by the project team and its impact already determined as to have conflit with the scope. The next thing to do is to inform the customer and discuss raised concerns with him on the impact this change will have on the scope.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":670}},{"qa":"يحدد مدير المشروع مشكلة بين اثنين من أعضاء الفريق تؤثر على تطوير أحد المخرجات أثناء التكرار الثاني للمشروع. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع معالجة هذه المشكلة لتجنب أي تأثير على المشروع؟","oa":["تصعيد كلا أعضاء الفريق إلى مديريهم الوظيفيين والسماح لهم باتخاذ الإجراءات المناسبة","حدد موعدًا لعقد اجتماع مع كلا أعضاء الفريق لفهم المشكلة وتسهيل التوصل إلى حل يرضي الطرفين","أرسل تحذيرًا إلى كلا أعضاء الفريق للإشارة إلى أنه إذا استمرت المشكلة ، فسيتم إزالة كليهما من المشروع","اتصل بالمديرين الفنيين لطلب بدائل لأعضاء الفريق المتضاربين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":570,"q":"A project manager identifies an issue between two team members that is affecting the development of one of the deliverables during the second iteration of a project.\nHow should the project manager address this issue to avoid any impact to the project?","t":"S","o":["Escalate both team members to their respective functional managers and let them take the appropriate actions","Schedule a meeting with both team members to understand the issue and facilitate a solution that satisfies both parties","Send a warning to both team members indicating that if the issue continues, both will be removed from the project","Contact the functional managers to request substitutes for the conflicting team members"],"c":[1],"f":"Schedule a meeting with both team members to understand the issue and facilitate a solution that satisfies both parties","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":671}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ، تقرر الشركة أن الجميع سيحتاج إلى قضاء إجازة قبل نهاية العام. قد يتسبب هذا في تغيير الخط الزمني للمشروع. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع معالجة الموقف؟","oa":["اتفق مع الإدارة الوظيفية وأعضاء الفريق على جدول إجازة من شأنه أن يؤثر بشكل ضئيل على الجدول الزمني للمشروع","ناقش خطة الإجازة وقم بتضمين تغييرات الجدولة في قاعدة بيانات سجل التغيير","ادفع الجدول الزمني للمشروع وفقًا لخطة الإجازة المعمول بها بناءً على سياسة الشركة الأخيرة","تقديم طلب رسمي إلى الإدارة العليا يطلب منهم عدم المضي قدماً في هذا القرار بناءً على تأثيره على المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":571,"q":"During the execution of a project, a company decides that everybody will need to take vacation time before the end of the year. This may cause a change in the project time line.\nHow should the project manager address the situation?","t":"S","o":["Agree with functional management and team members on a vacation schedule that would minimally impact the project schedule","Discuss the vacation plan and include scheduling changes in the change log database","Push out the project timeline according to the vacation plan in place based on the recent company policy","Submit a formal request to senior management asking them not to proceed with this decision based on the impact it will have on the project"],"c":[1],"f":"Notice it didn't say all workers will go on vacation the same day or period. It simply says before the year ends. The project manager in the Schedule Management during the Develope Schedule Process considers as an input the Resource Managment Plan during Aquire/allocate Resource Process developed with the help of the functional manager incharge of the resources and which usually takes into consideration such scenarios. The Vacation plan is thus discused and shedule replanned accordingly. Normally this is achieved through lags placed on activities.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":672}},{"qa":"يريد مدير المشروع تعيين مهندس مبتدئ لمشروع جديد. في المشاريع السابقة ، أظهر المهندس مبادرة للقيام بمهام معقدة وحل المشكلات بطرق مبتكرة دون أي حاجة للتشجيع. ومع ذلك ، رفض المهندس دعوة مدير المشروع للانضمام إلى المشروع الجديد. ما هو السبب الأكثر احتمالا لرفض المهندس العمل في المشروع؟","oa":["لم يتبع مدير المشروع عملية التوظيف العادية مع المدير الوظيفي للمهندس","لم يقم مدير المشروع بدعم النمو المهني للمهندس والاعتراف به بشكل كاف","لدى المهندس \"نضوب في المشروع\" من العمل لساعات طويلة وحل المشكلات الصعبة","لم يشعر المهندس بالترحيب أو الاستمتاع بالعمل مع أعضاء فريق المشروع الآخرين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":572,"q":"A project manager wants to assign a junior engineer to a new project. In past projects, the engineer showed initiative to take on complex tasks and solve problems in innovative ways without any need for encouragement. However, the engineer declines the project manager's invitation to join the new project.\nWhat is the most likely reason for the engineer's refusal to work on the project?","t":"S","o":["The project manager did not follow the normal hiring process with the engineer's functional manager","The project manager did not sufficiently support and recognize the engineer's professional growth","The engineer has \"project burnout\" from working long hours and solving difficult problems","The engineer did not feel welcome or enjoy working with the other project team members"],"c":[0],"f":"Based on this phrase in the question \"showed initiative to take on complex tasks and solve problems in innovative ways without any need for encouragement\" gives an impression that he would not decline a request to tackle a project of interest simply because he wasn't supported with training and development.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":673}},{"qa":"تم تجميع ثمانية خبراء مؤهلين تأهيلا عاليا للعمل لمدة 6 أشهر في جانب معين من عملية تطوير المنتجات في المؤسسة. كيف يجب أن يدعم مدير المشروع هذا الفريق لتحقيق النجاح؟","oa":["تحديد الأدوار والأهداف لجميع أعضاء الفريق والمتابعة بانتظام مع اجتماعات فردية لمراجعة التقدم","العمل مع أعضاء الفريق لتحديد الهدف العام ودعمهم للمشاركة حول الهدف","تسليم السيطرة على جوانب محددة من أدوارهم كخبراء والسماح لهم بالاتفاق على الجداول الزمنية الخاصة بهم والأهداف","أحضر زميلًا أقدم وهو خبير أيضًا للتأكد من أن الفريق على المسار الصحيح لتحقيق الأهداف والغايات"],"rat":null,"fa":"مدير المشروع هو قائد خادم يجب أن يعمل كميسر لأعضاء الفريق المؤهلين تأهيلا عاليا في إنشاء بيئة عمل آمنة وجديرة بالثقة وشفافة مع إشراكهم في هدف مشروع مشترك","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":573,"q":"Eight highly qualified experts have been assembled to work for a 6-month period on a specific aspect of an organization's product development process.\nHow should the project manager support this team to succeed?","t":"S","o":["Define roles and targets for all team members and regularly follow up with one-to-one meetings to review progress","Work with the team members to define the overall objective and support them to engage around the goal","Hand over control of specific aspects of their roles as experts and let them agree on their own timelines and targets","Bring in a senior colleague who is also an expert to ensure the team is on track to achieve the goals and objectives"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager is a servant leader that should act like a facilitator to the highly qualified team members in establishing a safe, trustworthy and transparent working environement while communioning them to a common project goal","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":674}},{"qa":"اقترح مراقب تخفيض الميزانية للمشاريع لأن غالبية الحلول المنفذة أدت إلى عوائد قليلة على الاستثمار (ROI) أو تحسينات تشغيلية. اعترض مدير المشروع وقدم أصول المشروع موضحًا أن جميع الحلول قد تم عرضها وقبولها وتسليمها ضمن قيود الإطار ذات الصلة. اقترح مدير المشروع أن المشاكل قد تنبع من تقييم المشروع وعمليات الاختيار. ماذا كان مدير المشروع يشرح؟","oa":["تقنيات التفاوض الاستراتيجي في تحديد أولويات الميزانية في الدورات المقبلة","إدارة المخاطر في معالجة العوائق والعقبات والمعوقات التي تحول دون نجاح المشروع","تحديد السبب والنتيجة في تحليل السبب الجذري نحو تحقيق قيمة المشروع","مراحل التطور المتعددة التي قد يمر بها الأعضاء نحو تشكيلات العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":574,"q":"A controller proposed a budget reduction for projects because the majority of implemented solutions resulted in little returns on investment (ROI) or operational improvements. The project manager objected and presented project assets showing all solutions having been demonstrated, accepted, and delivered within the relevant framework constraints. The project manager suggested that the issues may stem from the project evaluation and selection processes.\nWhat was the project manager demonstrating?","t":"S","o":["Strategic negotiation techniques in determining budget priorities in future sessions","Risk management in addressing impediments, obstacles, and blockers to project success","Cause-and-effect identification in root cause analysis toward achieving project value","Multiple stages of development that members may go through toward working formation"],"c":[2],"f":"The project manager was demonstrating a focus on the project evaluation and selection processes, suggesting that the issues with low ROI or operational improvements may have been caused by flaws in the decision-making process rather than the solutions themselves. The project manager is attempting to identify the root cause of the problem to address it properly and improve the overall effectiveness of future project evaluation and selection","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":675}},{"qa":"تم نشر قانون جديد حول تصاريح التقسيم إلى مناطق لأبراج الاتصالات. قد يتسبب هذا في تجاوز التكلفة والجدول الزمني لطرح الشبكة الجديدة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحديث خطة المشروع لأن القانون هو التزام للمشروع","مقابلة الراعي لطلب المزيد من الوقت وزيادة الميزانية","تصغير نطاق تحديد التكلفة والجدول الأساسي","تقييم وترتيب أولويات تأثير القانون الجديد على خطة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":575,"q":"A new law was published about zoning permits for telecom towers. This may cause cost and schedule overruns for the new network rollout.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Update the project plan because the law is an obligation for the project","Meet the sponsor to ask for additional time and budget increase","Minimize the scope to catch the cost and schedule baseline","Assess and prioritize the impact of the new law on the project plan"],"c":[3],"f":"Assess and prioritize the impact of the new law on the project plan","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":676}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بتقييم المشروع ويدرك أن قيمته المكتسبة (EV) توضح أن التكلفة المنفقة أعلى من القيمة المقدمة. يكتشف مدير المشروع بعد ذلك أن الفريق قام بإضافة ميزات صغيرة ليست جزءًا من المتطلبات. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["شجع الفريق على الاستمرار ، لأن هذا سيساعد العميل في النهاية","طلب ميزانية إضافية لأنه تتم إضافة ميزات إضافية","اطلب من مالك المنتج إضافة ميزات إضافية إلى المتطلبات","اطلب من الفريق التركيز على الميزات المتفق عليها وتقديمها فقط"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":576,"q":"A project manager is evaluating a project and realizes that its earned value (EV) shows the cost spent is higher than the value delivered. The project manager then discovers that the team has been adding small features that are not part of the requirements.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Encourage the team to continue, as this will eventually help the customer","Request additional budget because additional features are being added","Ask the product owner to add the additional features to the requirements","Ask the team to focus on and deliver only the agreed-upon features"],"c":[3],"f":"The best option (Ask the team to focus on and deliver only the agreed-upon features)The reason is that the team is adding scope creep, which is adding features that are not part of the original requirements or scope baseline. This causes the actual cost (AC) to be higher than the earned value (EV), which means the project is over budget. The project manager should control the scope and ensure that only the features that are approved by the change control board (CCB) are implemented. Requesting additional budget or asking the product owner to add the features to the requirements are not good practices, as they do not follow the change management process. Encouraging the team to continue may not satisfy the customer or stakeholders, as they may not need or want the extra features.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":677}},{"qa":"عميل المشروع غاضب. عندما وصل العميل إلى موقع المشروع ، اكتشفوا أن أحد متطلباتهم لم يتم الوفاء به. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["استشر خطة إدارة النطاق مع العميل لفهم الفجوة","ناقش واتفق مع العميل لتنفيذ المتطلبات المفقودة","الرجوع إلى مصفوفة تتبع المتطلبات وتحليل المتطلبات","تحليل خطة إدارة الفوائد وتنفيذ التغيير المطلوب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":577,"q":"A project's customer is furious. When the customer arrived at the project site, they discovered that one of their requirements was not met.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Consult the scope management plan with the customer to understand the gap","Discuss and agree with the customer to implement the missing requirement","Refer to the requirements traceability matrix and analyze the requirement","Analyze the benefits management plan and implement the needed change"],"c":[2],"f":"Requirement not met means it was already defined in planning during Define Requirement Process before Create Scope Statement Process. A requirment traceability matrix should be consulted to have more information on this requirment and how it is linked to other artifacts of the project.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":678}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع يدير مشروعًا داخليًا لم يتم تعريفه بشكل جيد. في الآونة الأخيرة ، تلقى مدير المشروع العديد من طلبات التغيير التي أثارتها الإدارة العليا للمؤسسة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["تحفيز الفريق لتجنب الإحباط من العمل في مشروع مطول","قم بتقييم تجاوز الوقت ، وابدأ في التنفيذ لتجنب المزيد من التأخير","طلب زيادة مؤقتة في الميزانية لتجنب أي تجاوزات في الميزانية","راجع فوائد التغييرات المقترحة فيما يتعلق بدراسة الجدوى"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":578,"q":"A project manager is managing an internal project that was poorly defined. Recently, the project manager received several change requests raised by the organization's upper management.\nWhat should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Motivate the team to avoid the frustration of working on a prolonged project","Assess the time overrun, and start implementation to avoid additional delays","Request a provisional budget increase to avoid any budget overruns","Review the benefits of the proposed changes in relation to the business case"],"c":[3],"f":"First the project manager should Review the benefits of the proposed changes in relation to the business case","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":679}},{"qa":"تم تسليم منتج حديث في نهاية دورة حياة المشروع. ومع ذلك ، يدعي العميل أن المنتج لم يتم تصميمه وفقًا للمواصفات. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["كان يجب أن يتم تسجيل متطلبات العميل من أجل تلبية معايير العميل","كان يجب أن تكون متطلبات العميل قد تم تسجيلها وتعديلها لتلبي معايير المورد","كان ينبغي أن يشمل الاجتماع الاستعادي للتكرار (التقييم بأثر رجعي ) أصحاب المصلحة الضروريين","كان ينبغي التخطيط لاجتماع تخطيط مراجعة التكرار وفقًا لذلك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":579,"q":"A state-of-the-art product was delivered at the end of a project life cycle. However, the customer claims the product was not designed to specifications.\nWhat should the project manager have done to avoid this issue?","t":"S","o":["The customer's requirements should have been captured in order to meet the customer's standards.","The customer's requirements should have been captured and modified to meet the supplier's standards.","The sprint retrospective meeting should have included necessary stakeholders","The iteration review planning meeting should have been planned accordingly"],"c":[0],"f":"Its a predictive scenario. The Scope Management with its respective processes of Collect Requirements Process and Validate Scope Process would have handled this.\nDelivery at the end of a project lifecycle and not at the end of an iteration means predictive. If it was Agile, the issue would've been addressed at one of the Iteration review sessions.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":680}},{"qa":"طُلب من مدير المشروع تقديم ملاحظات حول الأداء فيما يتعلق بأحد أعضاء الفريق. يرغب مدير المشروع في جمع مدخلات إضافية من فريق المشروع لأنه لا توجد مقاييس لتقييم أداء الموظف. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["تحليل تأثير أعضاء الفريق","تحديد مستويات سلطة اتخاذ القرار","تحديد النهج المناسب","تقييم مساءلة مهمة أظهرها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":580,"q":"A project manager has been asked for performance feedback regarding one of the team members. The project manager would like to gather additional input from the project team because there are no metrics in place for evaluating employee performance.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Analyze team member influence","Identify levels of decision-making authority","Determine the appropriate approach","Evaluate demonstrated task accountability"],"c":[2],"f":"Determine the appropriate approach.\nThe project manager should first determine the appropriate approach to gather feedback from the project team. There are different methods that can be used such as one-on-one meetings, surveys, or group discussions. The appropriate approach will depend on factors such as the size of the team, the nature of the project, and the culture of the organization.\n\nOnce the appropriate approach has been determined, the project manager can proceed to gather feedback from the team members. The feedback should focus on the team member's performance in relation to their assigned tasks, their ability to work collaboratively with others, and any other relevant factors that contribute to their performance on the project.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":681}},{"qa":"بدأ مشروع طريق رئيسي جديد ، والتزم المقاول تعاقديًا بتقديم تقارير حالة منتظمة والمشاركة في اجتماعات التكامل. في منتصف دورة حياة المشروع ، يتوقف المقاول عن المشاركة في الاجتماعات وتقديم التقارير ، موضحًا أن هذه العناصر تستهلك الكثير من الوقت. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["تذكير المقاول بأنهم ملتزمون بحضور الاجتماعات وتقديم التقارير حسب العقد","تقديم مطالبة لعدم استيفاء شروط العقد والتعامل مع المطالبة وفقًا لحل النزاع البديل","التحدث مع محامي الشركة واطلب منه أن يطالب المقاول بالوفاء بالتزاماته التعاقدية","تقييم مخاطر عدم حضور المقاول للاجتماعات وتقديم تقارير عن بقية المشروع وتصعيدها إلى راعي المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":581,"q":"A new major road project is starting, and the contractor has contractually committed to submitting regular status reports and participating in integration meetings.\nHalfway through the project life cycle, the contractor stops participating in meetings and submitting reports, stating these items consume too much time.\nWhat should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Remind the contractor that they committed to attending meetings and submitting reports per the contract","Submit a claim for not fulfilling the contract terms and handle the claim in accordance with the alternative dispute resolution","Speak with the company's lawyer and request that they demand the contractor fulfill their contractual commitments","Assess the risk of the contractor not attending meetings and submitting reports for the rest of the project and escalate it to the project sponsor"],"c":[0],"f":"Key word is what should Project Manager do first.?\n First thing is to remind the contractor","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":682}},{"qa":"أثناء وضع اللمسات الأخيرة على خطط إدارة المشروع ، يزود العميل مدير المشروع بمجموعة جديدة من معايير الجودة التي يجب أن يلتزم بها المنتج النهائي. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لضمان التسليم السلس للمنتج؟","oa":["الاتفاق مع العميل على ميثاق مشروع جديد","إشراك العميل في تحليل فجوة الأداء","إشراك العميل في تحديد المخاطر","الاتفاق مع العميل على معايير القبول"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":582,"q":"While finalizing project management plans, a customer provides the project manager with a new set of quality standards to which the final product must adhere.\nWhat should the project manager do to ensure a smooth delivery of the product?","t":"S","o":["Agree with the client on a new project charter","Involve the client in a performance gap analysis","Involve the client in risk identification","Agree with the client on acceptance criteria"],"c":[3],"f":"When a customer provides a project manager with a new set of quality standards, the project manager should work with the customer to establish clear acceptance criteria that meet the new standards. The acceptance criteria should be measurable and should outline specific objectives that the final product must meet to be considered acceptable. By agreeing with the client on acceptance criteria, the project manager can ensure that the final product meets the customer's expectations and the new quality standards. This will help to prevent any misunderstandings or disagreements about the quality of the final product and ensure a smooth delivery of the product.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":683}},{"qa":"تم منح مدير المشروع نافذة حرجة مدتها 5 أيام وتم تخصيص حد أقصى قدره 100000 دولار أمريكي كاحتياطي للطوارئ. بعد ذلك ، قام مدير المشروع بصياغة مسار عمل بناءً على أفضل المعلومات المتاحة. بشكل عام ، كان من المطلوب إكمال خمسة إجراءات بتكلفة 20000 دولار أمريكي ومدة يوم واحد لكل منها. بعد 3 أيام من العمل ، أكمل مدير المشروع إجراءين وأنفق 80000 دولار أمريكي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["أكمل جميع الإجراءات ثم أبلغ العميل بالتكلفة الإضافية والجدول الزمني للتجاوز اللازمين لإكمال المشروع","نظرًا لأن مؤشر أداء التكلفة ومؤشر أداء الجدول الزمني أقل من 1.0 ، فأعد تقييم الإجراءات المتبقية وحدد أولوياتها","أوقف العمل ورفع طلب تغيير المشروع إلى لجنة التحكم في التغيير للحصول على أموال إضافية وتمديد الجدول الزمني للمشروع","بما أن مؤشر أداء التكلفة ومؤشر أداء الجدول الزمني  أكبر من 1.0 ، فأعد تقييم الإجراءات المتبقية وحدد أولوياتها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":583,"q":"A project manager has been given a critical, 5-day window and is allocated a maximum of US$100,000 as a contingency reserve. Subsequently, the project manager drafted a course of action based upon the best available information. Overall, five actions were required to be completed at a cost of US$20,000 and a duration of 1 day each. After 3 days of work, the project manager completed two actions and spent US$80,000.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Complete all actions and then inform the client of the additional cost and schedule overrun needed to complete the project","As the cost performance index (CPI) and schedule performance index (SPI) are less than 1.0, reevaluate and prioritize the remaining actions","Stop the work and raise a project change request to the change control board (CCB) for additional funds and a project schedule extension","As the CPI and SPI are greater than 1.0, reevaluate and prioritize the remaining actions"],"c":[1],"f":"CPI = Earned Value (EV) / Actual Value (AC)\nEV = The progress X Budgeted Cost = 2 (actions completed) X 20,000 (cost of each action) =40,000\nAC = Actual amount spent after two actions = 80,000\nTherefore, CPI = 40000 / 80000 =0.5\nNow, When the CPI < 1.0, then your project is over-costed or over-budgeted.\nYou have to re-evaluate and prioritize the remaining actions so that you are within the planned budget","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":684}},{"qa":"يريد مدير المشروع التأكد من أن المشاريع المماثلة في المستقبل تستخدم بيانات أداء المشروع كمرجع. ومع ذلك ، فإن مدير المشروع ليس متأكدًا من كيفية تحقيق ذلك. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["إرسال رسائل بريد إلكتروني دورية إلى الإدارة العليا بآخر تحديثات المشروع","الحفاظ على النتاجات محدثة ومتاحة لجميع المعنيين","مشاركة وثائق المشروع في مستودع مع وصول خاص","جدولة جلسات أسبوعية لتبادل المعرفة مع المعنيين  الرئيسيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":584,"q":"A project manager wants to make sure that similar projects in the future use the project's performance data as a reference. However, the project manager is not sure how to accomplish this.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Send periodic emails to senior management with the latest project updates","Keep project artifacts up-to-date and accessible to all stakeholders","Share project documentation in a repository with exclusive access","Schedule weekly knowledge-sharing sessions with key stakeholders"],"c":[1],"f":"Project artifacts are the documentation and other tangible outputs of the project, such as plans, schedules, status reports, and lessons learned. These artifacts are important sources of information that can be used to improve the management of future projects. Keeping project artifacts up-to-date and accessible to all stakeholders will help ensure that future projects can benefit from the performance data of the current project.\n \n Lessons learned are updated through out the project and final update done at the end of the project and archived. This will be a repository (DB) for future projects which will provide valuable information to the future PMs and othe stakeholders when considerations to take when carrying future similar projects\n\nOption(Sharing project documentation in a repository with exclusive access), may limit the accessibility of the information and exclude stakeholders who could benefit from it.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":685}},{"qa":"يكتمل المشروع بنسبة 70٪ عندما يطلب راعي المشروع تسليمًا إضافيًا.\nما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["فاوض مع راعي المشروع حول البدائل الممكنة","رفض الطلب لأنه فات الأوان ويؤدي إلى تسيب كبير في النطاق","تقديم الطلب إلى لجنة مراقبة التغيير للبت فيه","تحديد التأثير المحتمل لهذا التغيير على جميع جوانب المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":585,"q":"A project is 70% complete when the project sponsor requests an additional deliverable.\n\nWhat should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Negotiate with the project sponsor on the possible alternatives","Reject the request as being too late and leading to major scope creep","Submit the request to the change control board (CCB) for a decision","Determine the possible impact of this change on all aspects of the project"],"c":[3],"f":"First , the project manager should Determine the possible impact of this change on all aspects of the project then Submit the request to the change control board (CCB) for a decision","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":686}},{"qa":"بدأت إحدى الشركات مشروع تحول إداري لتحسين عمليات المنظمة باستخدام نهج تنبؤي. يعد هذا مشروعًا بالغ الأهمية بالنسبة للمؤسسة ، وفي منتصف المشروع ، لاحظ مدير المشروع أنه لا يمكن إنتاج أحد المخرجات بسبب عدم وجود مهارة فنية. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب ذلك؟","oa":["تحديد جميع المهارات المطلوبة بعد بدء المشروع","التخطيط لجميع التدريبات المطلوبة للفريق أثناء عملية الإعداد","حدد جميع المهارات المطلوبة أثناء التخطيط للمشروع","طلب من الراعي تحديد جميع المهارات المطلوبة أثناء التخطيط للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":586,"q":"A company initiated a departmental transformation project improving the processes for the organization using a predictive approach. This is a critical project for the organization and, in the middle of the project, the project manager noticed that one of the deliverables cannot be produced due to a missing technical skill.\nWhat should the project manager have done to avoid this?","t":"S","o":["Identified all required skills after the kick-off of the project","Planned all required training for the team during the onboarding process","Identified all required skills during the planning of the project","Asked the sponsor to identify all required skills during the planning of the project"],"c":[2],"f":"The keyword of this question is \"What should the Project Manager have done\", what should the Project Manager do in the first place, not what should the Project Manager do right now\nThis should have been handled in the planning phase of Resource Management during the Estimate Resource Process.\nProject Manager is meant to hire ready skills, there is no time for training in a project. Therefore he should have planned for this earlier.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":687}},{"qa":"يبدأ مدير المشروع مشروعًا جديدًا مع أعضاء فريق متنوعين للغاية. اختار مدير المشروع استخدام طريقة التصويت بالإجماع حتى يتمكن الفريق من الاتفاق والمشاركة في كيفية تنفيذ المشروع. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع المضي قدما؟","oa":["خلق بيئة حيث يتم التوصل إلى الاتفاق من خلال المناقشة","إنشاء جلسات عصف ذهني متكررة لمناقشة مشاكل المشروع","اسمح لأعضاء الفريق بالمساهمة بأفكارهم بطريقة تدفق الوعي","خلق بيئة يتم فيها التوصل إلى الاتفاق بأغلبية الأصوات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":587,"q":"A project manager is beginning a new project with very diverse team members. The project manager chose to use consensus building so the team can agree on and be engaged in how the project will be executed.\nHow should the project manager proceed?","t":"S","o":["Create an environment where the agreement is reached through discussion","Establish recurring brainstorming sessions to discuss project issues","Allow team members to contribute ideas in a stream-of-consciousness mode","Create an environment where the agreement is reached by a majority vote"],"c":[0],"f":"Create an environment where the agreement is reached through discussion.\n\nConsensus building involves creating an environment where team members can discuss and agree on the execution of the project. The project manager should encourage open communication and active listening among team members to ensure that everyone's ideas and concerns are heard and addressed.\n\nConsensus building is based on the principles of local participation and ownership of decisions. Ideally, the consensus reached will meet all of the relevant interests of stakeholders, who thereby come to a unanimous agreement.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":688}},{"qa":"يقود مدير المشروع فريقًا من الأفراد المتنوعين من جميع الأعمار. تم تحديد ساعات العمل للمشروع في بداية المشروع ، واتفق جميع أعضاء الفريق على الساعات. ومع ذلك ، في وقت لاحق من المشروع ، أبلغ أحد أعضاء الفريق مدير المشروع أن الساعات المتفق عليها مسبقًا لم تعد تعمل بسبب الالتزامات الشخصية لعضو الفريق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بإزالة عضو الفريق من فريق المشروع حتى يكون عادلاً مع الأعضاء الآخرين","ناقش نقص التفاني مع عضو الفريق ومديرهم الوظيفي","اسمح لكبار أعضاء الفريق بتحديد الوقت المناسب للفريق","أعد تقييم ساعات عمل الفريق بشكل تعاوني حتى لا تعيق المشكلة الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":588,"q":"A project manager is leading a team of diverse individuals of all ages. The working hours for the project were set at the beginning of the project, and all team members agreed to the hours. However, later in the project, one of the team members informed the project manager that the previously agreed upon hours no longer work due to the team member's personal commitments.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Remove the team member from the project team to be fair to the other members","Discuss the lack of dedication with the team member and their functional manager","Allow the most senior team members to decide the time that works for the team","Reassess the team's hours collaboratively so that the team is not impeded by the issue"],"c":[3],"f":"Reassess the team's hours collaboratively so that the team is not impeded by the issue","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":689}},{"qa":"تقوم إحدى الشركات بتنفيذ إستراتيجية نمو من خلال إنشاء منشأة إنتاج جديدة ، والتي ستنتقل قريبًا إلى مرحلة التشغيل. على الرغم من وجود سياسة حوكمة بالفعل ، يجب أن تمتثل الشركة للوائح المالية الجديدة التي تم تنفيذها مؤخرًا. سيؤدي الامتثال للوائح إلى تغيير كبير في نطاق المشروع. كيف يجب أن يستجيب مدير المشروع لهذا المطلب؟","oa":["تصعيد المشكلة إلى الإدارة العليا والسماح لهم باتخاذ القرار","إجراء تحليل لتقييم الأثر على المشروع","الامتثال المباشر للأنظمة المالية","متابعة سياسة حوكمة الشركة الحالية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":589,"q":"A company is implementing a growth strategy by constructing a new production facility, which will soon move into the operation phase. Although a governance policy was already in place, the company must comply with new financial regulations that have been recently implemented. Compliance with the regulations will cause a major change in project scope.\nHow should the project manager respond to this requirement?","t":"S","o":["Escalate the issue to upper management and let them decide","Perform an analysis to assess the Impact on the project","Directly comply with the financial regulations","Proceed with the existing company governance policy"],"c":[1],"f":"First thing is impact analysis .","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":690}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع طارئ يجب إكماله في غضون الأسابيع القليلة القادمة. يدرك مدير المشروع أن هذا سيكون له تأثير على المجتمع المحلي. نظرًا لأن العمل قريب من المدرسة ، فقد تفاعل مدير المشروع معهم لفهم احتياجاتهم. كيف يجب أن يضمن مدير المشروع استمرار العمل بسلاسة؟","oa":["أنصح المدرسة بالإغلاق طوال مدة عمل المشروع","الاتصال بالمدرسة لتضمين ساعات عدم عمل المشروع أثناء أوقات بدء المدرسة وانتهائها","تأجيل العمل المطلوب في المشروع حتى تبدأ الإجازة المدرسية","استمر في العمل كما هو مخطط له وأبلغ المدرسة عندما يصل فريق المشروع إلى الموقع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":590,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to an emergency project that must be completed within the next few weeks. The project manager realizes this will have an impact on the local community. As the work is near a school, the project manager has engaged with them to understand their needs.\nHow should the project manager ensure the work continues smoothly?","t":"S","o":["Advise the school to close for the duration of the project work","Liaise with the school to include nonworking project hours during school start and finish times","Postpone the required work on the project until school holidays begin","Continue the work as planned and inform the school when the project team arrives on-site"],"c":[1],"f":"Liaise with the school to include nonworking project hours during school start and finish times","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":691}},{"qa":"الوقت متأخر من الليل في عطلة نهاية الأسبوع عندما يتصل أحد أعضاء الفريق بمدير المشروع عبر الهاتف. عضو الفريق يبكي من ضغوط الموعد النهائي القادم. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["مراجعة سياسة الموارد البشرية في المنظمة","تعاطف مع عضو الفريق وناقش الخطوات التالية","اطلب من أعضاء الفريق إرسال مخاوفهم كتابةً","حدد موعد اجتماع مع عضو الفريق ليوم العمل التالي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":591,"q":"It is late at night on a weekend when a team member calls the project manager on the telephone. The team member is crying about the pressures of an upcoming deadline.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Review the organization's human resources (HR) policy","Empathize with the team member and discuss next steps.","Ask the team member to send their concerns in writing","Schedule a meeting with the team member for the next work day"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager should provide a listening ear and offer support to the team member who is under pressure and feeling overwhelmed by the upcoming deadline. The project manager should show empathy and understanding towards the team member's situation and offer words of encouragement and reassurance. This can help the team member feel heard and supported, which in turn can boost their morale and motivation.\n\nAdditionally, the project manager can discuss possible solutions or next steps with the team member, such as seeking help from other team members or reorganizing the workload. By addressing the problem and offering support, the project manager can help the team member regain a sense of control and feel more confident in meeting the deadline.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":692}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع مع الفريق لتسليم مشروع في شركة تستخدم طرق تسليم مختلفة. يشعر مدير المشروع بالقلق بشأن قنوات الاتصال المقترحة حاليًا من قبل مكتب إدارة المشروع (PMO) لأن بعض المعلومات تستغرق وقتًا طويلاً للوصول إلى أعضاء الفريق ، مما يتسبب في عواقب سلبية للتسليم. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع تجنب هذا الموقف في المستقبل؟","oa":["أخبر الراعي أن مدير المشروع سيستخدم نموذج الاتصال الخاص به لضمان التسليم في الوقت المحدد","الرجوع إلى السياسات والأطر المستخدمة على مستوى مؤسسة الشركة وإبلاغ أعضاء فريق المشروع","اتفق مع فريق المشروع على تعاون مناسب وتأكد من مشاركة المعلومات في جميع الأوقات","استخدم نفس الأساليب حتى نهاية التسليم الحالي واقترح طرقًا جديدة أثناء العرض بأثر رجعي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":592,"q":"A project manager is working with the team to deliver a project in a company that uses different delivery methods. The project manager is concerned about the communication channels currently suggested by the project management office (PMO) because some information is taking too much time to reach the team members, causing negative consequences for delivery.\nHow should the project manager avoid this situation in the future?","t":"S","o":["Tell the sponsor that the project manager will use their own communication model to ensure on-time delivery","Refer to the policies and frameworks used at the company enterprise level and inform the project team members","Agree with the project team on a suitable collaboration and make sure information is shared at all times","Use the same methods until the end of the current delivery and suggest new ones during the retrospective"],"c":[2],"f":"Agree with the project team on a suitable collaboration and make sure information is shared at all times","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":693}},{"qa":"يجب على الشركة تنفيذ لائحة جديدة. حددت الحكومة التاريخ الذي سيتم فيه تطبيق اللائحة ولكنها قدمت فقط معلومات عالية المستوى حول متطلبات اللائحة. لذلك ، من المتوقع حدوث تغييرات في التعريفات بسبب عدم اليقين. ما هي دورة الحياة التي يجب أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع لهذا المشروع؟","oa":["استراتيجية تنفيذ تكرارية","استراتيجية تنفيذ تنبؤية","استراتيجية تنفيذ رشيقة","استراتيجية تنفيذ مختلطة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":593,"q":"A company must implement a new regulation. The government has specified the date when the regulation will be enforced but has only provided high-level information on the regulation's requirements. Therefore, changes in definitions are to be expected due to uncertainty.\nWhich life cycle should the project manager use for this project?","t":"S","o":["An iterative execution strategy","A predictive execution strategy","An agile execution strategy","A hybrid execution strategy"],"c":[3],"f":"There is a already a date specified to enforce the regulation and also because the regulation requirements are only known at a very high level and government and they tend to be more waterfall type, but with the new unclear requirement, they can implement more agile up to a certain point. Second, since there is some guidance out there, prefer to be hybrid.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":694}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يدير مشروعًا له راع جديد يخفض الميزانية. كقائد خادم ، كيف يجب أن يتعامل مدير المشروع مع تخفيضات الميزانية مع الفريق؟","oa":["أبلغ كل عضو في الفريق أنه يجب عليهم الإفراج عن جزء من ميزانيتهم ولكن يجب أن يظلوا في الموعد المحدد دون أي تغيير في النطاق","مقابلة منسق الجدول والمحلل المالي لإخبارهم بخطوط الميزانية التي يجب تقليلها وأين يتم تحرير فترة الركود","التعاون مع الفريق لتقييم تأثير التغيير على المشروع والتوصية بخطة مشروع محدثة","قم بإخطار الجهة الراعية للمشروع بأن تخفيض الميزانية سوف يتطلب قسيمة الجدول الزمني وتقليص النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":594,"q":"A project manager is managing a project that has a new sponsor who is cutting the budget.\nAs a servant leader, how should the project manager handle the budget cuts with the team?","t":"S","o":["Inform each team member that they must release a portion of their budget but must remain on schedule with no change to the scope","Meet with the schedule coordinator and financial analyst to tell them which budget lines to reduce and where to release slack","Collaborate with the team to assess the impact of the change on the project and recommend an updated project plan","Notify the project sponsor that the budget reduction will require a schedule slip and scope reduction."],"c":[2],"f":"Collaborate with the team to assess the impact of the change on the project and recommend an updated project plan","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":695}},{"qa":"أكمل مدير المشروع تقييمًا لأداء فريق المشروع. كان أداء بعض أعضاء الفريق سيئًا في المهام الموكلة إليهم. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تطوير مناهج مختلفة بناءً على دوافع أعضاء الفريق وقدرتهم","إنشاء مقياس أداء قياسي جديد بناءً على متطلبات المشروع","توفير رقابة مكثفة على أعضاء الفريق الذين كان أداؤهم ضعيفًا","تطوير نهج معياري لتقديم التغذية الراجعة لجميع أعضاء الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":595,"q":"A project manager has completed an assessment of the project team's performance. Some team members have performed poorly on their assigned tasks.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Develop different approaches based on team members' motivation and ability","Create a new standard performance measure based on project requirements","Provide intensive oversight to the team members who performed poorly","Develop a standard approach to provide feedback to all team members"],"c":[0],"f":"It seems the initial approaches didn't work for all, thus different approaches should be undertaken accordingly","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":696}},{"qa":"يقود مدير المشروع مشروعًا متعدد السنوات يشمل المعنيين الداخليين والخارجيين. عندما يبدأ مدير المشروع في جمع المتطلبات ، يعرب المعنييون الإضافيون في الأعمال عن اهتمامهم بالمشاركة. \n\nما هي الإجراءات الثلاثة التي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذها لضمان المشاركة المناسبة لأصحاب المصلحة؟ (اختر ثلاثة.)","oa":["إشراك جميع المعنيين في خطة إشراك المعنيين وتوفير نفس مستوى الاتصال","وضع مصفوفة تأثير المعنيين  لتحديد مستوى المشاركة","إجراء تقييم المعنيين للتوافق مع أهداف المشروع","تصنيف وترتيب المعنيين على أساس مناصبهم في المنظمة","تحديد أولويات المعنيين  بناءً على مرحلة المشروع والحاجة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":596,"q":"A project manager is leading a multiyear project that involves internal and external stakeholders. As the project manager begins to gather requirements, additional business stakeholders express interest in being involved.\nWhich three actions should the project manager take to ensure proper stakeholder involvement? (Choose three.)","t":"M","o":["Include all stakeholders in the stakeholder engagement plan and provide the same level of communication","Develop a stakeholder impact/influence matrix to determine the level of engagement","Perform a stakeholder assessment to align with the project objectives","Classify and rank stakeholders based on their positions in the organization","Prioritize stakeholders based on the project phase and need"],"c":[1,2,4],"f":"The three actions should the project manager take to ensure proper stakeholder involvement\n\n1. Prioritize stakeholders based on the project phase and need.\n\n2. Perform a stakeholder assessment to align with the project objectives.\n\n3. Develop a stakeholder impact/influence matrix to determine the level of engagement.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":697}},{"qa":"يشرف مدير مشروع على مشروع كجزء من برنامج موجه نحو اضطراب تقني كبير. يتألف الفريق من محترفين شباب لامعين عملوا في مشاريع مختلفة للمنظمة في الماضي. ومع ذلك ، فقد اشتكى الفريق من أنهم واجهوا في السابق نقصًا في التوجيه أثناء تنفيذ المشروع ويخافون من نفس المشكلة في هذا المشروع. \n\nما الإجراءان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه لضمان عدم حدوث هذه المشكلة في هذا المشروع؟ (إختر إثنين.)","oa":["حافظ على مشاركة الفريق وتركيزه على اتجاه المشروع","التركيز على خطة إدارة الموارد وتتبع التقدم المحرز في المشروع","نظِّم نشاطًا للترابط مع الفريق وادعُ مديرًا خارجيًا للتحدث إلى الفريق","وضع رؤية واضحة للمشروع والتأكد من أنها مرئية لجميع المعنيين","شجع الفريق على القيام بجلسة عصف ذهني وقدم خطة للتخفيف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":597,"q":"A project manager is overseeing a project as part of a program geared toward a major technology disruption. The team is comprised of brilliant young professionals who have worked on different projects for the organization in the past. However, the team complained that they previously experienced a lack of direction during project execution and are afraid of the same issue in this project.\n \n\nWhich two actions should the project manager take to ensure that this issue does not occur in this project? (Choose two.)","t":"M","o":["Keep the team engaged and focused on the project's direction","Focus on the resource management plan and track project progress","Organize a team-bonding activity and invite an external manager to speak to the team","Set a clear vision for the project and ensure it is visible to all stakeholders","Encourage the team to do a brainstorming session and provide a mitigation plan"],"c":[0,3],"f":"The two actions should the project manager take to ensure that this issue does not occur in this project\n\n1. Set a clear vision for the project and ensure it is visible to all stakeholders.\n\n2. Keep the team engaged and focused on the project's direction.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":698}},{"qa":"بسبب التغييرات التنظيمية ، يتم استبدال العديد من المعنيين الرئيسيين بأخرى جديدة في منتصف المشروع. نتيجة لذلك ، تم رفع العديد من المتطلبات الجديدة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لضمان نجاح المشروع؟","oa":["مراجعة وترتيب أولويات المتطلبات الجديدة مع المعنيين لتحديد طلبات التغيير المطلوبة","تصعيد المشكلة إلى راعي المشروع واطلب الدعم للاحتفاظ بالمتطلبات الأصلية","اطلب الموافقة الفورية لتعديل الجدول الزمني للمشروع والميزانية من أجل تسليم جميع المتطلبات الجديدة","أكد للمعنيين  الجدد أن المتطلبات الجديدة غير مسموح بها في هذه المرحلة من المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":598,"q":"Due to organizational changes, several key stakeholders are replaced by new ones in the middle of a project. As a result, numerous new requirements are raised.\nWhat should the project manager do to ensure success of the project?","t":"S","o":["Review and prioritize new requirements with stakeholders to determine which change requests are needed.","Escalate the issue to the project sponsor and seek support to keep the original requirements","Seek immediate approval to amend the project timeline and budget in order to deliver all new requirements","Emphasize to the new stakeholders that new requirements are not allowed at this stage of the project"],"c":[0],"f":"Need a change request, first to amend the existing requirements and accept the new requirements.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":699}},{"qa":"يريد مدير المشروع ضمان مشاركة كافية من المعنيين طوال دورة حياة المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يدرجه مدير المشروع في خطة مشاركة المعنيين ؟","oa":["ردود الفعل من المعنيين على عمليات المشروع","شبكة السلطة / الأهتمام","طلبات التغيير التي بدأها المعنيين","مستويات مشاركة المعنيين المرغوبة والحالية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":599,"q":"A project manager wants to ensure sufficient stakeholder participation throughout a project's life cycle . What should the project manager include in the stakeholder engagement plan?","t":"S","o":["Feedback from stakeholders on project operations","Stakeholder power/ interest grid","Change requests initiated by stakeholders","Desired and current stakeholder engagement levels"],"c":[3],"f":"A model which a project manager uses to judge stakeholders’ current level of engagement with a project and the desired engagement level of each stakeholder engagement assessment matrix : stakeholder or stakeholder group. and it supports the comparison between the current engagement levels of stakeholders and the desired engagement levels required for successful project delivery.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":700}},{"qa":"إنتاجية أحد المطورين متدنية مقارنة بالآخر بسبب مشكلات الحضور المتكررة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لتحديد الإجراءات التأديبية المناسبة الخاصة بهذا المشروع؟","oa":["تحقق من خطة إدارة الموارد","مراجعة أصول العملية التنظيمية","مراجعة مصفوفة تعيين المسئوليات","مراجعة سجل المعنيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":600,"q":"One developer's productivity is lacking compared with the other due to repetitive attendance issue . What should the project manager do to determine the appropriate disciplinary actions specific to this project?","t":"S","o":["Check the resource management plan","Review the organizational process assets","Review RACI chart","Review the stakeholder register"],"c":[0],"f":"The resource management plan provides guidance on various aspects of team development including disciplinary actions as a result of team performance assessments.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":701}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في مشروع برمجيات. أنت تعمل مع فريق افتراضي عالمي يواجه الفريق صعوبة في التواصل مع بعضهم البعض وغالبًا ما يفوتهم رسالة مهمة. هذه الصعوبة تؤدي إلى ضياع المواعيد النهائية. ما الذي يجب عليك فعله لتعزيز فعالية فريق المشروع؟","oa":["بدء الاتصال اليومي لتقدم المشروع","تنفيذ الموقع المشترك لتحسين الأتصال بين الفريق","تحديد السبب الجذري لمشاكل الاتصال","حدد موعدًا لاجتماع مجلس مراقبة الاتصالات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":601,"q":"You are a project manager on a software project. You work with a global virtual team.The team is facing diffculty in communicating with each other and often misses important message . This difficulty leads to missed deadlines . What should you do to enhance project team effectiveness?","t":"S","o":["Initiate daily communication of project progress","Implement team colocation to improve communication","Identify the root cause of communication issues","Schedule a communication control board meeting"],"c":[1],"f":"the root cause of the communication issue is known because you are working with a global virtual team and the team is located in different places . To enhance project team effectiveness , you should implement team colocation to improve communication.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":702}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع في شركة تنتقل من نهج تقليدي إلى أسلوب رشيق. يفتقر الموظفون التنظيميون ذوو الصلة إلى الخبرة بالمنهجيات الرشيقة. اختارت المنظمة استخدام دورات الحياة الهجينة كاستراتيجية انتقال. ما الذي يجب فعله أيضًا لتسهيل الانتقال؟","oa":["تخلص من دور مدير المشروع تمامًا لأن فرق أجايل تدير نفسها بنفسها","تعاقد مع مدرب خارجي رشيق لمساعدة المنظمة في عملية الانتقال","استبدل مدير المشروع الحالي بمدرب خارجي رشيق متمرس","إنشاء مكتب توجيهي لإدارة المشاريع  لقيادة عملية الانتقال"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":602,"q":"A project manager is assigned to a project in a company that is transitioning from a traditional approach to agile . The relevant organizational personnel lacks experience with agile methodologies . The organization has elected to use hybrid life cycles as a tranisition strategy . What else should be done to facilitate the transition?","t":"S","o":["Eliminate the project manager's role entirely as agile teams are self- managing","Contract an external agile coach to assist the organization with the transition","Replace the existing project manager with an experienced external agile coach","Establish a directive project management office (PMO) to lead the transition"],"c":[1],"f":"An external agile coach can bring significant experience on agile best practices to assist the project team with the transition until internal resource are able to take over the responsibility.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":703}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع جديد محل مدير مشروع كان يدير مشروع تركيب إنارة شوارع المدينة. المشروع في مرحلة التنفيذ. خلال الاجتماع الأول لمراجعة المخاطر ، لاحظ مدير المشروع الجديد أن إصدار سجل المخاطر الذي يستخدمه أعضاء فريق المشروع يختلف عن الإصدار الذي يستخدمه مدير المشروع. ما الذي كان يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذا الموقف؟","oa":["اطلب المساعدة من خبراء بالموضوع","التحقق من صحة سجل الأشكاليات","الأشارة إلى خطة إدارة الاتصالات","التحقق من صحة القطع الأثرية (النتاجات)/ عناصر  للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":603,"q":"A new project manager has just replaced a project manager who was managing a city street light installation project. The project is in its execution phase. During the first risk review meeting , the new project manager notices that the version of the risk register used by the project team members is different from the one the project manager is using . What should the project manager have done to avoid this situation?","t":"S","o":["Ask help from subject matter experts","Validated the issue log","Referred to the communication management plan","Validated the project artifacts"],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should Validate the project artifacts to avoid the differentiation between versions.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":704}},{"qa":"في منتصف المشروع لعميل يجد مدير المشروع مشكلة غير متوقعة . بعد التحليل ، يقرر فريق المشروع أن المشكلة ستؤثر على الجدول الزمني ما لم يتم تخصيص المزيد من الموارد للمشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["أبلغ العميل بالمشكلة وناقش الخيارات حتى يتمكن من اتخاذ قرار بشأن التكلفة مقابل الجدول الزمني","اضبط الجدول الزمني لأنه ، في الماضي ، لم يكن العميل يدفع أي تكاليف إضافية ، ثم أبلغ العميل بالتغيير","استيعاب التكلفة الإضافية للموارد الإضافية داخليًا بحيث يكتمل المشروع ضمن الجدول الزمني","اجتمع مع فريق المشروع لمناقشة داخليًا ما إذا كانوا يعتقدون أن التكلفة أكثر أهمية للعميل من الجدول الزمني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":604,"q":"A project manager finds an unexpected issue halfway through a customer's project. After analysis , the project team determines that the issue will affect the timeline unless more resources are allocated to the project. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Inform the customer of the issue and discuss the options so that they are able to make a decision on cost versus timeline","Adjust the timeline since , in the past , the customer would not pay any additional costs , then inform the customer of the change","Absorb the additional cost for the additional resources internally so that the project completes within the timeline.","Meet with the project team to discuss internally whether they think cost is more important to the customer that the timeline"],"c":[0],"f":"Keyword ( an unexpected issue) so the best option (nform the customer of the issue and discuss the options so that they are able to make a decision on cost versus timeline)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":705}},{"qa":"يتلقى مدير المشروع بريدًا إلكترونيًا من عميل يقول إنه لا يريد الاستمرار في العمل مع أحد أعضاء فريق المشروع. لا يقدم العميل أي أسباب لهذا الشعور. يشعر مدير المشروع بالقلق لأن عضو فريق المشروع هذا يتمتع بمهارات عالية وخبرة وهو عنصر أساسي في أحد تسليمات المشروع الرئيسية. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لتخفيف الموقف؟","oa":["اطلب من عضو فريق المشروع الاتصال بالعميل للاعتذار عن سلوكه","قم بإزالة عضو فريق المشروع فورًا وقم بتعيين الأنشطة المعلقة لأعضاء الفريق الآخرين","أخبر العميل أنه ليس لديه السلطة لإزالة أعضاء فريق المشروع","تحدث إلى العميل وعضو فريق المشروع بشكل منفصل لتقييم المشكلة واتخاذ قرار بشأن الخطوات التالية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":605,"q":"A project manager receives an email from a customer saying that they do not want to keep working with one of the project team members. The customer does not provide any reasons for this sentiment. The project manager is concerned because this project team member is highly skilled and experienced and is key in one of the main project deliverables. What should the project manager do to ease the situation?","t":"S","o":["Ask the project team member to call the customer to apologize for their behavior","Remove the project team member immediately and assign the pending activities to other team members","Tell the customer that they do not have the authority to remove project team members","Talk to the customer and project team member separately to assess the issue and decide on the next steps"],"c":[3],"f":"If there is problem and can't know the reasons you should discuss face to face with the problem with the person who have the problem to know the reasons then develop solution so the best option (Talk to the customer and project team member separately to assess the issue and decide on the next steps)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":706}},{"qa":"انتقل مدير المشروع مؤخرًا إلى مؤسسة لقيادة مشروع رئيسي. يلاحظ مدير المشروع أن أداء الفريق أقل من الهدف ، ولا يتم تسليم المهام المعينة في الوقت المحدد. كما أن التزام الفريق ليس مناسبًا كما ينبغي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["دراسة وتحديد أسلوب القيادة المناسب للفريق","قم بتطبيق نهج رشيق للمساعدة في تحسين أداء الفريق","استعن بقائد فريق المشروع الذي يمكنه التأثير على أعضاء فريق المشروع","حدد موعدًا للاجتماع وقم بإبلاغ الفريق عن مخاوف الأداء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":606,"q":"A project manager has recently moved to an organization to lead a key project. The project manager notices that team performance is below the target , and the tasks assigned are not delivered on time . Team commitment is also not as appropriate as it should be. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Study and determine the appropriate leadership style suitable for the team","Apply an agile approach to help improve team performance","Hire a project team leader who can influence the project team members","Schedule a meeting and communicate the performance concern to the team"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager should Study and determine the approptiate leadership style suitable for the team to improve the team performance and acheiving the target.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":707}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع يقود مشروع هجين. تم تطوير هيكل تقسيم العمل (WBS) والجدول الزمني ، ولكن يواجه مدير المشروع صعوبة في تعيين موارد محددة لجميع مهام المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تصعيد المشكلة إلى راعي المشروع والسعي لتدخله الفوري","قم بتعيين المهام غير المخصصة إلى الدور الوظيفي ثم إعادة تخصيصها عند توفر الموارد","تجاهل المهام غير المخصصة في الوقت الحالي وأعد تخصيصها عند توفر الموارد","قم بتعيين المهام غير المخصصة إلى مدير مكتب إدارة المشروع  وأعد تخصيصها عند توفر الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":607,"q":"A project manager is leading a hybrid project. The work breakdown structure (WBS) and the schedule were developed, but the project manager is having difficulty assigning specific resources to all of the project tasks . What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Escalate the issue to the project sponsor and seek their immediate intervention","Assign the unallocated tasks to the functional role and then reallocate when the resources are available","Ignore the unallocated tasks for now and reallocate when the resources are available","Assign the unallocated tasks to the project management office (PMO) manager and reallocate when the resources are available ."],"c":[1],"f":"Assign the unallocated tasks to the functional role and then reallocate when the resources are available","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":708}},{"qa":"ترك أحد المعنيين في المشروع الشركة. صاحب المصلحة الجديد هو أحد أفراد عائلة أحد أعضاء الفريق.  لا يحضر صاحب المصلحة الاجتماعات. يكتشف مدير المشروع أن صاحب المصلحة كان يطلب من أفراد العائلة تحديثات المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تصعيد هذا إلى راعي المشروع","طلب أجتماع مع أصحاب المصلحة","إعادة توجيه تقارير حالة المشروع","تصميم تقرير حالة محدث"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":608,"q":"A project stakeholder has left the company. The new stakeholder is a family member of one of the team members. This stakeholder does not attend meetings. The project manager finds out that the stakeholder has been asking the family member for project updates. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Escalate this to the project sponsor","Request a meeting with the stakeholder","Forward the project status reports","Design an updated status report"],"c":[1],"f":"You, as a project manager, should have communication skills and communicate with others. So , the project manager should meet with the stakeholder to find out the reasons for the stakeholder not attending the meetings. Escalation should not be made unless it is outside the control of the project manager. Status reports cannot be sent before the stakeholder attends the meetings.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":709}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع يدير الانتقال إلى العمليات. يريد راعي المشروع ضمان توفير دعم جيد للمستخدمين النهائيين. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تأكد من تسليم الوثائق الشاملة","تأكد من أن دليل المستخدم مفصل ويحتوي على تعليمات واضحة","تأكد من نقل المعرفة إلى فريق العمليات","اطلب من فريق المشروع تقديم الدعم التشغيلي لمدة عام واحد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":609,"q":"A project manager is managing the transition to operations. The project sponsor wants to ensure that good suport is provided to the end users. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Ensure that comprehensive documentation is handed over","Ensure that the user guide is detailed and has clear instructions","Ensure that knowledge is transferred to the operations team","Ask the project team to provide operational support for 1 year"],"c":[2],"f":"The project manager should Ensure that knowledge is transferred to the operations team to ensure that good suport is provided to the end users , achieve project sponsor requirements","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":710}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يعمل على مشروع معقد بدرجة عالية من التغيير. ما هي الإستراتيجية التي يجب أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع لضمان إكمال المشروع بنجاح؟","oa":["قم بجدولة مراجعة منتظمة للمخاطر مع فريق إدارة المشروع","قم بإنشاء خارطة طريق لتغيير المشروع لتتبع جميع التغييرات غير المتوقعة","تحديث خطة إدارة المشروع لتقليل احتمالية زحف النطاق","زيادة المشاركة النشطة ومشاركة أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":610,"q":"A project manager is working on a complex project with a high degree of change . What strategy should the project manager use to ensure successful project completion?","t":"S","o":["Schedule a regular risk review with the project management team","Create a project change roadmap to keep track of all unforeseen changes","Update the project management plan to reduce the possibility of scope creep","Increase the active engagement and participation of key stakeholders"],"c":[3],"f":"The strategy which is fit with a complex project with a high degree of change is Increase the active engagement and participation of key stakeholders to ensure successful project completion.\nAs actively engaged Stakeholders may be able to provide feedback and necessary input during changes to have them incorporated smoothly. Moreover, sometimes during active communications, some risks may be revealed before they even turn into issues.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":711}},{"qa":"يعمل فريق المشروع على استراتيجية الاستجابة للمخاطر من خلال تقييم كل خطر والتوصل إلى استراتيجيات استجابة مناسبة. ومع ذلك ، لا يمكن تجنب أو تخفيف خطر معين له تأثير سلبي. علاوة على ذلك ، لا توجد طريقة لتتبع المخاطر عن طريق التعاقد الخارجي أو شراء التأمين. ما هو أفضل ما يمكن أن يفعله الفريق حيال المخاطر؟","oa":["تقاسم المخاطر من خلال تخصيص الملكية لطرف ثالث","تعامل معه على أنه خطر ثانوي وقم بتحديثه في سجل المخاطر","تقبل المخاطر","أعد النظر في استراتيجية الاستجابة للمخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":611,"q":"A project team is working on a risk response strategy by evaluating every risk and coming up with suitable response strategies. However , one particular risk with a negative impact cannot be avoided or mitigated. Furthermore , there is no way to tras=nsfer risk by outsourcincing or buying insurance. What is the best the team can do about the risk?","t":"S","o":["Share the risk by allocating ownership to a third party","Treat it as a secondary risk and update it in the risk register.","Accept the risk","Revisit the risk response strategy."],"c":[2],"f":"The question suggests that the team has already explored all the alternatives. In this case, the best strategy is to acceot the risk and , if possible, plan for a contingency to be implemented if risk occurs so the best option is accept the risk.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":712}},{"qa":"لدى شركة مشكلات جودة متكررة مع أحد مورديها الوحيدين. سيتعرض مشروع جديد لعقوبات كبيرة من العميل إذا تأخرت التسليمات ، فماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تفاوض مع البائعين الآخرين باستخدام طرق تحكم بجودة أفضل","تصعيد المشكلة إلى الإدارة العليا","تحديد المخاطر عالية المستوى قبل وضع خطط الطوارئ","مراجعة تقارير التفتيش الواردة وسجلات الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":612,"q":"A company has recurring quality issues with one of its sole source suppliers. A new project will incur significant penalties from the customer if deliverables are late what should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Negotiate with other vendors with better quality -control methods.","Escalate the issue to top management","Identify high -level risks prior to developing contingency plans","Review incoming inspection reports and quality logs"],"c":[2],"f":"In the past projects , the company has recurring quality issues with ine of its sole source suppliers. in the (new project will incur significant penalties from the customer if deliverables are late . So this is high level risk and should be initially take into consideration , then in the planning phase , the project manager should conduct a mitigation plan to reduce this risk such as conduct more tests and review incoming inspection reports and quality logs. Since its sole source then you don't have any other option to negotiate with other vendors with better quality - control methods. Therefor you have to consider this risk while you are planning the project. Since you should be proactive so the escalation process to top management is the last decision.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":713}},{"qa":"يشتكي أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين الذي يشارك بشكل كبير في المشروع أن التقارير المرسلة من قبل فريق المشروع غير كافية. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["اطلب من فريق المشروع مراجعة جميع هذه التقارير وتعديلها","تأكد من أن التقارير تتوافق مع خطة إدارة الاتصالات","اطلب من الراعي مقابلة أصحاب المصلحة لنزع فتيل الموقف بالتقارير","اشرح لأصحاب المصلحة أن هذه هي النماذج المعتمدة للتقارير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":613,"q":"A key stakeholder who is highly involved in the project claims that the reports sent by the project team are indequate. What should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Ask the project team to review and modify all of these reports","Ensure that the reports comply with the communication management plan","Ask the sponsor to meet with the stakeholder to diffuse the situation with the reports","Explain to the stakeholder that these are the approved templates for the reports"],"c":[1],"f":"A key stakeholder claims that the reports sent by the project team are indequate so the project manager should Ensure that the reports comply with the communication management plan","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":714}},{"qa":"يكون مدير المشروع على دراية جيدة بمعايير الصناعة للمؤسسة ويعتقد أنها لا تنعكس في مخرجات المشروع. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع مراجعته بعد ذلك؟","oa":["ميثاق المشروع","عملية الجودة","خطة إدارة الجودة","أصول العمليات التنظيمية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":614,"q":"A project manager is well-informed on the industry standards of the organization and believes that they are not reflected in the project deliverables. What should the project manager review next?","t":"S","o":["Project Charter","Quality Process","Quality Management Plan","Organizational Process Assets (OPAs)"],"c":[3],"f":"Organizational Process Asset (OPA) refers to all the implicit input or assets on processes used by an organization in operating their business. This may include business plans, processes, policies, protocols, and knowledge. While Enterprise Environmental Factors may be branched into two categories, internal and external to the organization, organization process asset is internal to the organization. It may come from the projects, programs, portfolios, documentation, or any other records in a said organization. There are three categories of organization process asset; 1) Processes, Policies, and Procedures; 2) Corporate Knowledge Base; 3) Team and SME Knowledge.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Governance","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":715}},{"qa":"المنتج الرئيسي لشركة ما يتطور ويتطلب استخدام تقنية جديدة. لا أحد في الفريق لديه معرفة بهذه التقنية، ومع ذلك تطوع بعض المطورين ذوي الخبرة في الفريق لدراسة المفاهيم والتطبيق، ويعتقدون أنهم سيكونون قادرين على تحمل المسؤولية الكاملة عن التقنية الجديدة. ماذا يجب على مدير المشروع أن يفعل؟","oa":["دعم المطورين بنيتهم لتعلم التكنولوجيا الجديدة","الاستعانة بمصادر خارجية للعمل التكنولوجي لطرف ثالث حتى لا يؤخر العمل","حدد هذه المتطلبات لأن المطورين لديهم مهام أكثر أهمية","وظف خارجيًا نظرًا لأن المطورين الداخليين قد كلفوا بالفعل بالعمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":615,"q":"A company's key product is evolving and requires the use of new technology. No one on the team is familiar with this technology; however, experienced developers on the team volunteered to study the concepts and application and believe they will be able to take full responsibility for the new technology. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Support the developers with their intention to learn the new technology","Outsource the technology work to a third party so as not to delay work","De scope this requirements as the developers have more important tasks","Hire externally since the internal developers already have assigned work"],"c":[0],"f":"🔹 Domain: People\n\n🔹 Approach: Agile\n\n🔹 Importance:\nVery important, because it tests your understanding of team empowerment, learning culture, and the project manager’s supportive role instead of forcing external solutions too quickly.\n\n🔹 Keywords:\nnew technology – no one on the team is familiar – developers volunteered – take full responsibility\n\nIn this question, the team is facing a new technical challenge, but one very important detail is that experienced developers have shown initiative and willingness to learn and take ownership. That is a positive signal the project manager should support, not suppress or immediately replace with external resources.\n\nIn agile environments, the project manager or leader is expected to play a supportive and enabling role, helping the team grow, self-learn, and acquire new skills.\nThis aligns with servant leadership, where the focus is on removing impediments, providing support, and enabling team success.\n\nChoosing external hiring or outsourcing may solve the issue faster in the short term, but it can weaken team ownership and prevent internal capability building.\nDe-scoping is not logical because the question clearly states that the new technology is required for the evolution of the company’s key product.\n\n🔹 Example:\nA company is enhancing a digital platform and needs to add an AI-based feature. No one on the team has enough expertise yet, but several experienced developers are willing to take quick training, study documentation, and experiment with prototypes. The best action for the project manager is to support them with training, time, coaching, and perhaps light expert guidance if needed, rather than taking the work away from them completely.\n\n🔹 Exam Tips:\nIf the team shows willingness to learn or take ownership, the correct answer is often to support and empower the team.\nIf the question emphasizes development, empowerment, motivation, or servant leadership, avoid external contracting or imposed solutions unless clearly necessary.\nIf the scenario included an urgent fixed deadline or no tolerance for a learning curve, external expert support might become more appropriate, but that is not stated here.\nIf the wording changed to something like: The deadline is fixed and missing it will cause a regulatory violation, then outside support or a specialist might be the better answer.\nIn this case, the context supports internal capability building.\n\n🔹 References:\n\n PMBOK 7th Edition: Pages 21–24, 33–36, 169–171\n PMBOK 6th Edition: Pages 332–337\n PMBOK 8th Edition: Pages 54–59, 118–123\n Agile Practice Guide: Pages 41–44, 56–60\n ECO 2026: Pages 6–10","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":716}},{"qa":"يستعد مدير المشروع لبدء مشروع جديد يتم فيه توزيع أعضاء الفريق جغرافيًا عبر بلدان مختلفة. يستخدم مدير المشروع خطة إدارة الاتصالات لإشراك أعضاء الفريق وإيجاد طريقة اتصال تناسب الجميع. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع تقييم فعالية مشاركة الفريق الافتراضي باستمرار؟","oa":["عقد اجتماعات فردية لخلق بيئة ثقة مع أعضاء الفريق","اجمع التعليقات من الفريق لمناقشة البدائل لتعزيز التواصل","عقد اجتماعات وفقًا لتفضيلات أعضاء الفريق وتوافرهم","عقد اجتماعات دورية وجهاً لوجه وتناول موضوع الاتصال"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":616,"q":"A project manager is preparing to start a new project in which the team members are distributed geographically across different countries. The project manager is using the communications management plan to engage the team members and find a communication method that suits everyone. How should the project manager continually evaluate the effectiveness of the virtual team's engagement ?","t":"S","o":["Conduct individual meetings to create a trusting environment with team members","Collect feedback from the team to discuss alternatives to enhance the communication","Hold meetings in accordance with the team member's preferences and availability","Establish periodic face to face meetings and address the communication topic"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager should Collect feedback from the team to discuss alternatives to enhance the communication to evaluate the effectiveness of the virtual team's engagement","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":717}},{"qa":"يكلف مدير المشروع بتطوير نموذج تدريب لدعم نمو أعضاء الفريق والتعرف عليه. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع مراعاته عند تحديد إستراتيجية التدريب الخاصة به؟","oa":["أهداف فريق المشروع المشتركة","أهداف المنظمة الإستراتيجية","الأهداف الفردية والشخصية","أنماط الاتصال الراسخة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":617,"q":"A project manager is tasked with developing a coaching model to support and recognize team members' growth. What should the proejct manger consider when defining their coaching strategy?","t":"S","o":["Project team's shared objectives","Organization's strategic goals","Individual and personal objectives","Established patterns of communication"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manger should identify Project team's shared objectives when defining their coaching strategy","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":718}},{"qa":"يشير جميع أعضاء فريق المشروع إلى مدير المشروع لاتخاذ قرارات مختلفة.\nيتسبب هذا في حدوث تأخيرات في بعض المهام ، حيث يكون مدير المشروع عادة مشغولاً بالاجتماعات على مدار اليوم.\nما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمنع هذه التأخيرات؟","oa":["توحيد سلطة اتخاذ القرار للبقاء مع مدير المشروع","راجع مخطط باريتو لتحديد مصدر التأخيرات","تفويض سلطة اتخاذ القرار لبعض المهام إلى الفريق","قابل الفريق في غضون أسبوعين للرد على جميع المهام المفتوحة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":618,"q":"All project team members refer to the project manager for various decisions.\nThis causes delays for some tasks, as the project manager is usually preoccupied in meetings throughout the day.\nWhat should the project manager do to prevent these delays?","t":"S","o":["Consolidate the decision-making authority to remain with the project manager","Review the Pareto diagram to identify the source of delays","Delegate the decision-making authority of some tasks to the team","Meet with the team in 2 weeks to respond to all of the open tasks"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword (project manager is usually preoccupied) so the best option (Delegate the decision-making authority of some tasks to the team )","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":719}},{"qa":"يقود مدير مشروع مشروعًا هجينًا يقوم ببناء تطبيق لبدء لشركة سفريات. نظرًا للأحداث غير المتوقعة ، لن تكون الميزات والحل الشامل قابلين للاستخدام للعديد من العملاء بسبب قيود السفر الجديدة. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["تقييم التغييرات البيئية والتوصية بمحور للمشروع","أوقف المشروع مؤقتًا إذا تعذر الوصول إلى قيمة العمل واجمع الدروس المستفادة","اطلب من إدارة المنظمة الحصول على المشورة بشأن اتجاه المشروع","أطلق سراح الفريق وساعدهم على تحقيق إمكاناتهم في مشروع جديد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":619,"q":"A project manager is leading a hybrid project that is building an app for a travel industry startup. Due to unforeseen events, the features and the overall solution will not be useable be many customers due to new travel restrictions. What should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Assess the environmental changes and recommend a pivot for the project","Pause the project if a business value cannot be reached and collect lessons learned","Ask the organization's management for advice regarding the project's direction","Release the team and help them achieve their potential on a new project"],"c":[2],"f":"The features and the overall solution will not be useable be many customers so The project manager should Ask the organization's management for advice regarding the project's direction.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":720}},{"qa":"مشروع على وشك أن يبدأ مع فريق مشروع عالمي. السفر ليس خيارًا قابلاً للتطبيق لأعضاء فريق المشروع ، لذلك سيشارك معظمهم تقريبًا. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لإشراك الفريق؟","oa":["اعقد اجتماعات فردية مع أعضاء الفريق لتحسين التواصل","جدولة اجتماعات الفريق الأسبوعية لتشجيع التعاون","اسأل الموارد البشرية لتوصيات بناء الفريق","استثمر في بيئة تعاون / مشاركة افتراضية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":620,"q":"A project is about to start with a global project team. Travel is not a viable option for project team members , so most will participate virtually. What should the project manager do to engage the team ?","t":"S","o":["Have one-on-one meetings with team members to improve communication","Schedule weekly team meetings to encourage collaboration","Ask human resources for team building recommendations","Invest in a virtual collaboration/colocation environment"],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should Invest in a virtual collaboration/colocation environment","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":721}},{"qa":"تلقى مدير المشروع للتو اتصالًا من مدير وظيفي تشغيلي لإكمال عنصر نطاق إضافي لمشروع تم إغلاقه رسميًا قبل بضعة أسابيع. يبدو النطاق صغيرًا نسبيًا وبسيط التعامل معه كجزء من نشاط العمليات اليومي. كيف يتعامل مدير المشروع مع هذا الطلب؟","oa":["تأكد من توفر الميزانية والموارد لتنفيذ طلب العمل","تقديم طلب التغيير وتخصيص الميزانية والموارد اللازمة للتنفيذ","تحقق من الموارد البديلة المتاحة في المنظمة للطلب","قم بتقييم طبيعة الطلب وخطة الاتصال وفقًا لذلك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":621,"q":"A project manager has just received communication from an operational functional manager to complete an additional scope item for a project that was formally closed a few weeks ago. The scope looks relatively small and simple to handle as part of the daily operations activity . How should the project manager deal with this request?","t":"S","o":["Confirm that the budget and resources are available to execute the work request","Submit a change request and allocate the budget and resources needed for execution","Check the alternative resources available in the organization for the request","Evaluate the nature of the request and plan communication accordingly"],"c":[3],"f":"Evaluate the nature of the request and plan communication accordingly","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":722}},{"qa":"يقود مدير المشروع مشروعًا عندما يطلب أحد المعنيين الرئيسين عملًا إضافيًا ليس في النطاق. كما يشعر هذا المعني بالقلق من أن رعاة المشروع قد لا يوافقون على التغيير الإضافي في النطاق ويمولونه. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["تقييم تكلفة العمل الإضافي المطلوب","قم بتقييم التأثير وتقديم طلب التغيير","ناقش التغيير المطلوب مع الفريق","ناقش التغيير المطلوب مع الراعي"],"rat":null,"fa":"يجب على مدير المشروع تقييم التأثير وتقديم طلب التغيير","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":622,"q":"A project manager is leading a project when a key stakeholder requests additional work that is not in the scope. The stakeholder is also concerned that the project sponsors may not apptove and fund the additional change in scope . What should the project manager do first ?","t":"S","o":["Evaluate the cost of the additional requested work","Evaluate the impact and submit a change request","Discuss the requested change with the team","Discuss the requested change with the sponsor"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager should Evaluate the impact and submit a change request","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Governance","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":723}},{"qa":"تم فقدان أحد المعالم الهامة للمشروع لأن أحد أعضاء الفريق لم يكمل مهامه في الوقت المحدد. أدى ذلك إلى مناقشة حادة خلال عرض توضيحي للمستخدمين النهائيين. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["اطلب من عضو الفريق تبرير التأخير أثناء اجتماع الفريق","مراجعة سياسات الموارد البشرية للإجراءات التصحيحية ذات الصلة","تصعيد مشكلة الأداء إلى المدير الوظيفي لعضو الفريق","ناقش المشكلة مع عضو الفريق في اجتماع فردي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":623,"q":"A critical project milestone was missed because one of the team members did not complete their tasks on time. This resulted in a heated discussion during a demonstration for the end users. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Ask the team member to justify the delay during a team meeting","Review the human resource policies for relevant corrective actions","Escalate the performance issue to the team member's functional manager","Discuss the issue with the team member in a one-on-one meeting"],"c":[3],"f":"In the scenario one of the team members did not complete their tasks on time so the project manager should Discuss the issue with the team member in a one-on-one meeting","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":724}},{"qa":"نظرًا لظروف غير متوقعة ، لم يتمكن المقاول من تعبئة فريق المشروع ، وهو الأمر الذي كان ضروريًا لإجراء اجتماعات ومناقشات وجهًا لوجه. تم عقد اجتماعات افتراضية في وقت لاحق ، لكن فريق المشروع المحلي والمستخدمين النهائيين يواجهون الآن فجوة اتصال تتسبب في تدني أداء الفريق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من المقاول حل هذه المشكلة لأن هذا التزام تعاقدي","إنهاء العقد وبدء عقد جديد مع مقاول محلي","أعد التقييم باستمرار لإزالة الحواجز للفريق","تنفيذ مؤشرات الأداء الرئيسية وإقناع المقاول بإشراك الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":624,"q":"Due to unforeseen circumstances, a contractor was unable to mobilize the project team, which was necessary to conduct face-to-face meetings and discussions. Virtual meetings were subsequently put in place, but the local project team and end users now face a communication gap that is causing the team's low performance. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Ask the contractor to solve this problem because this is a contractual obligation","Terminate the contract and initiate a new one with a local contractor","Reassess continually to remove blockers for the team","Implement key performance indicates and convince the contractor to engage the team"],"c":[2],"f":"The best option (Reassess continually to remove blockers for the team)","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":725}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لقيادة مشروع كبير في مؤسسة حكومية. لا توجد سياسات وإجراءات لإدارة المشروع لأنه لا يوجد مكتب إدارة المشروع (PMO). المديرين المعنيين غير مدركين لمسؤولياتهم للمشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["طلب تنفيذ تطبيق مكتب إدارة المشروع بالتوازي مع المشروع","توفير التدريب على إدارة المشروع للفريق الداخلي المشارك في المشروع فقط","ابدأ التخطيط للمشروع ثم اطلب تنفيذ مكتب إدارة المشروع في المنظمة","توفير التدريب على إدارة المشروع لأصحاب المصلحة وشرح مسؤولياتهم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":625,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to lead a major project in a government organization. There are no policies and procedures for project management since there is no proejct management office (PMO) . The managers involved are unaware of their responsibilities for the project. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Request that the implementation of a PMO be executed in parallel with the project","Provide project management training to only the internal team involved in the project","Start planning the project and then request that a PMO be implemented in the organization","Provide project management training to the stakeholders and explain their responsibilities"],"c":[3],"f":"Provide project management training to the stakeholders and explain their responsibilities","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":726}},{"qa":"منظمة تنتقل إلى أجايل. يناقش مدير المشروع كيفية إدارة المخاطر مع فريق التطوير في ضوء الانتقال لمشروع معين. يقدر الفريق مستوى الخطر على أنه منخفض. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بإنشاء سجل مخاطر لتحديد المخاطر والتقاطها ومراجعتها وإدارتها باستخدام عملية إدارة المخاطر","قم بتجميع جميع ادخالات سجل أعمال المنتج التي تم تقييمها من قبل فريق التطوير للحصول على دليل على أن إدارة المخاطر قد اكتملت","قم بإنشاء سجل مخاطر وقم بتضمين خطر عام واحد ، واضبط المستوى على منخفض ، ثم أغلق المخاطر في نهاية المشروع","ثق في تقدير المخاطر لفريق التطوير وأبلغ راعي المشروع أن المخاطر سيتم تقييم البيانات في وقت لاحق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":626,"q":"An organization is transitioning to agile. The project manager is discussing how to manage risks with the development team in light of the transition for a particular project. The team estimates the risk level as low. What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Create a risk register to identify, capture , review ,and manage risks using a risk management process","Capture all the backlog entries assessed by the development team to have evidence that risk management has been completed","Create a risk register an include a single generic risk , set the level to low, and then close the risk at the end of the project","Trust the development team's risk estimation and inform the project sponsor that the risks will be evaluate data later time"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager should (Create a risk register to identify, capture , review ,and manage risks using a risk management process)","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":727}},{"qa":"يحاول مكتب إدارة المشاريع (PMO) الخاص بالشركة تنفيذ نهج تكيفي، وقد طُلب من مدير المشروع استخدام أدوات التكيف في مشروعه التالي. هذه ليست المرة الأولى التي يتم فيها تقديم الطلب، وقد فشل المشروع السابق عندما تم تنفيذ أدوات التكيف. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["إجراء مقابلات فردية مع المعنيين الرئيسيين من أجل فهم جميع المخاوف ثم إعداد خطة إدارة الاتصالات","قم بإعداد طلب تغيير وأطلب موافقة اللجنة التوجيهية فيما يتعلق بإطار عمل المشروع الجديد","التعاقد مع شركة خارجية لتطوير وتنفيذ إطار عمل مختلط لهذا المشروع المحدد","قم بتوصية مكتب إدارة المشاريع بأن هذا ليس الوقت المناسب لبدء تنفيذ أدوات التكيف في المشاريع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":627,"q":"A company's PMO has been trying to implement an adaptive approach and a project manager has been asked to use adaptive tools in their next project. This is not the first time the request has been made , and the previous project failed when adaptive tools were implemented. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Conduct individual interviews with key stakeholders in order to understand all concerns then prepare a communication management plan .","Prepare a change request and seek approval from the steering committee regarding the new project framework.","Bring third-party company to develop and implement a hybrid framework for this specific project.","Recommend to the PMO that it's not the right time to start implementing adaptive tools in projects."],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam \nThe previous project failed when adaptive tools were implemented , the project manager should Bring third-party company to develop and implement a hybrid framework for this specific project.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":728}},{"qa":"أي من الأساليب التالية المستخدمة في دورات الحياة التكيفية تساعد في تقليل زحف النطاق؟","oa":["التكرارات","فترات زمنية محددة","مالك المنتج","قصص  المستخدم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":628,"q":"Which of the following techniques used in adaptive lifecycles helps in minizing scope creep?","t":"S","o":["Iterations","Time boxing","Product owner","User Stories"],"c":[1],"f":"A timebox is a limited time period within which a well-defined deliverable must be produced with given resources. The deadline to produce the deliverable is set and must not be changed. The difference between a timebox and classical progress control is that when a timebox is used, the scope of the deliverable is one of the variables of project management. The quality, however, is never a variable. Time boxing helps to minimize scope creep as it forces the teams to process essential feature first , then other features when time permits","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":729}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ عمل المشروع، لاحظ أحد أعضاء الفريق وجود خطر جديد محتمل، مما قد يؤثر على المسار الحرج للمشروع. ما الذي يجب على عضو الفريق فعله على الفور؟","oa":["قم بإنشاء تقرير مخاطر باستخدام التحليل النوعي للمخاطر المحددة لتنبيه الفريق بتأثيرات الجدول الزمني","قم بصياغة خطة احتياطية للطوارئ نظرًا لأن المسار الحرج معرض للخطر","توثيق المخاطر في سجل المخاطر","نوصي بتعليق المشروع لمدة يوم واحد لتجنب المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":629,"q":"While performing project work, a team member notices that there is a potential new risk, which could impact the project's critical path. What should the team member do immediately?","t":"S","o":["Generate a risk report using qualitative analysis of the identified risk to alert the team of the schedule impacts","Draft an emergency fallback plan since the critical path is in jeopardy","Document the risk in the risk register","Recommend the project be placed on hold for a day to avoid the risk"],"c":[2],"f":"A risk register is a document used to document , analysis and track and report on project risks and opportunities throughout the project’s life cycle. The contents of this tool can help you identify and organize information about potential issues that can impact project elements and outcomes. Here are some other uses of a risk register:\n\n Identifying potential risks\n Predicting the probability of a risk event occurring\n Putting controls in place to mitigate risks\n Establishing a response plan in the event a risk occurs\n Creating a risk report to summarize overall project risk, communicate to project stakeholders, and support overall risk management\n\n \n\nFor some projects, risk registers are required to meet compliance regulations. However, a risk register is an essential PMP exam tool for any project, no matter the size, complexity, or industry. Although it is impossible to anticipate every possible risk that could affect your project, a risk register will help you establish an effective risk management plan to prevent risks from derailing your project.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":730}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لمشروع حل رقمي جديد. لقد قمت بإنشاء جميع الخطط والأنشطة اللازمة لضمان نجاح التكامل وإطلاق الحلول. هناك خطر عدم توفر نظام الشريك مما قد يؤثر سلباً على المشروع. ما هو النشاط الرئيسي المطلوب لضمان نجاح المشروع؟","oa":["مراقبة مخاطر عدم توفر النظام الشريك بشكل مستمر ووضع خطط الحلول المناسبة في الخطط في حالة تحول المخاطر إلى مشكلة فعلية","خفف من المخاطر من خلال تطوير خطط بديلة لجعل الحل جاهزًا ومتاحًا دون إمكانات التكامل الكاملة","تخلص من المخاطر من خلال تكليف الشريك بتغيير إعدادات النظام لتسهيل التكامل مع الحل الجديد","إبلاغ المعنيين في المشروع بأن التكامل الكامل قد لا يكون ممكنًا وأن المشروع من المحتمل أن يتأخر نتيجة لذلك."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":630,"q":"You are a project manager of a new digital solution project. You have created all the necessary plans and activities to ensure a successful integration and solutions launch. There is a risk of a partner's system being unavailable which could impact the project negatively . What key activity is needed to ensure the project's success ?","t":"S","o":["Continuously monitor the risk of the partner system's unavailability and put the proper solution plans in plans in case the risk materializes into an actual issue.","Mitigate the risk by developing alternative plans to make the solution ready and available without full integration capabilities","Eliminate the risk by mandating the partner to change the system settings to facilitate easier integration with the new solution.","Communicate to the project stakeholders that full integration may not be possible and that the project will potentially be delayed as a result."],"c":[0],"f":"There is a risk of a partner's system being unavailable which could impact the project negatively so the project manager should Continuously monitor the risk of the partner system's unavailability and put the proper solution plans in plans in case the risk materializes into an actual issue to ensure the project's success","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":731}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في مشروع بناء. أثناء مرحلة التنفيذ، ستلاحظ وجود تعارضات بين المعنيين في المشروع، مما يؤدي إلى تأخير الموافقة على التسليمات والمخرجات. ما المجال الذي يجب أن تركز عليه؟","oa":["إعادة النظر في خطة إدارة المشروع لضمان التسليم في الوقت المحدد","زيادة وتيرة اجتماعات تحديث المشروع لإبقاء المعنيين على اطلاع","إعادة النظر في خطة مشاركة المعنيين، مع التركيز علي المعنيين المحددين الذين تم تجاهلهم","مراجعة وثائق الأعمال وتحديد الثغرات داخل النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":631,"q":"You are a project manager in a construction project. During the implementation phase , you observe conflicts between project stakeholders , resulting in deliverable and output approval delays . Which area should you focus?","t":"S","o":["Revisiting the project management plan to ensure deliverables are on time.","Increasing the frequency of project update meetings to keep stakeholders informed.","Revisiting the stakeholder engagement plan , focusing on specific overlooked stakeholders.","Reviewing the business documents and identifying gaps within scope."],"c":[2],"f":"A stakeholder engagement plan documents how involved and influential your project stakeholders are. It also outlines your stakeholder communication plan, including when you’ll reach out to each stakeholder, what platform you’ll use, and how much information you’ll deliver.\n\nStakeholders can either be individuals from within your team or external parties that are impacted by your work.\n\n Internal stakeholders may include project managers, operations teams, department heads, and board members.\n\n External stakeholders may include clients, customers, investors, suppliers, company partners, or shareholders.\n\nBecause communication with stakeholders begins right at the start of a project, you’ll create your engagement plan during the project planning phase. Once you have an idea for a project, identify who your stakeholders are and how involved they need (or want) to be. As the project progresses, you can adjust your Stakeholder Engagement Plan to meet their needs.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":732}},{"qa":"يتمتع عضو الفريق بمهارات فنية قوية جدًا ويهتم بدور قيادي. يفتح منصب قيادي خارج الفريق في المنظمة. لاحظ مدير المشروع أن عضو الفريق لديه فجوة كبيرة في التواصل بطريقة احترافية. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من عضو الفريق الامتناع عن متابعة الفرص الجديدة لأنها ليست مناسبة لمنصب قيادي","اقترح على عضو الفريق التركيز على المناصب ذات الجوانب الفنية وفرص العمل التقنية المحتملة","أوصي أعضاء الفريق بالتدريب على التواصل الفعال ودعم اهتماماتهم في التطوير الوظيفي","شجع عضو الفريق على البقاء في منصبه الحالي لأنه مهم للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":632,"q":"A team member has very strong technical skills and is interested in a leadership role. A leadership position opens up outside of the team in the organization. The project manager has observed that the team member has a major gap in communicating in a professional manner. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Ask the team member to refrain from pursuing new opportunities as they are not a suitable fit for a leadership position","Suggest the team member focus on positions with technical aspects and possible technical career opportunities.","Recommend the team member for effective communication training and support their career development interests.","Encourage the team member to stay in their current role as they are important to the project."],"c":[2],"f":"The project manager has observed that the team member has a major gap in communicating so the project manager should Recommend the team member for effective communication training and support their career development interests.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":733}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع هو جزء من منظمة تقوم بتقييم استخدام أساليب التسليم الرشيقة. أوصى مدير مكتب إدارة المشروع الجديد (PMO) الذي كان لديه تجربة سيئة مع نهج سكروم بأن يقوم مجلس إدارة المشروع باستبدال سكروم بنهج تنبؤي. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحديد خطة لإدارة المخاطر للنهج الجديد، حسب الحاجة","قم بمراجعة خطة تحقيق الفوائد لتشمل تكلفة التغيير","مراجعة خطة إدارة الاتصالات لتحديد المعنيين الجدد","تحديد خطة إدارة المشروع للنهج الجديد، حسب الحاجة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":633,"q":"A project manager is part of an organization that is assessing the use of agile delivery approaches. Anew project management office (PMO) manager who had a bad experience with a scrum approach recommended that the project board replace Scrum with a predictive approach . What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Define a risk management plan for the new approach , as needed.","Review the benefits realization plan to include the cost of the change","Review the communications management plan to identify new stakeholders","Define a project management plan for the new approach, as needed."],"c":[1],"f":"A new project management office (PMO) manager who had a bad experience with a scrum approach recommended that the project board replace Scrum with a predictive approach so the project manager should Review the benefits realization plan to include the cost of the change","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":734}},{"qa":"أنهى فريق المشروع التكرار الأول من أصل ستة. كان أداء تسليم التكرار (السرعة) 50%. أثناء أجتماع التقييم (الدروس المستفادة) بأثر رجعي، أدرك الفريق أنه تم التقليل من تعقيد العمل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اجتمع مع الفريق لمراجعة الإجراءات الداخلية لحل الموقف","اطلب استبدال بعض أعضاء الفريق بأعضاء أكثر خبرة","قم بتحديث سجل المشكلات وتصعيده إلى راعي المشروع","اطلب من المدير الفني مساعدة الفريق في حل المشكلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":634,"q":"A project team has finished its first iteration out of six. The iteration's delivery performance (velocity) was 50% . During the iteration retrospective , the team realizes that the complexity of the work was underestimated . What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Meet with the team to review internal actions to resolve the situation.","Ask to replace some team members with more experienced ones.","Update the issue log and escalate it to the project sponsor","Ask the technical manager to help the team with the issue"],"c":[0],"f":"During the iteration retrospective , the team realizes that the complexity of the work was underestimated so the project manager should Meet with the team to review internal actions to resolve the situation .","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":735}},{"qa":"بينما يحاول مدير المشروع إنشاء خط الأساس الأول للمشروع، يتم إرسال طلب تغيير من أحد المديرين الوظيفيين. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحليل تأثير طلب التغيير على المشروع","التقدم بطلب للحصول على موافقة رسمية من مجلس مراقبة التغيير","ناقش ذلك مع المدير الوظيفي والأطراف ذات الصلة","رفض طلب تغيير المدير الوظيفي على الفور"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":635,"q":"While a project manager is trying to build the first baseline for a project, a change request is being sent from one of the functional managers. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Analyze the impact of the change request on the project","Apply for a formal change control board approval","Discuss this with the functional manager and related parties","Reject the functional manager's change request immediately."],"c":[0],"f":"The best option (Analze the impact of the change request on the project)","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":736}},{"qa":"يهدف مشروع بناء وسائل النقل العام الكبير إلى تقليل الانبعاثات بشكل كبير. لقد تأخر المشروع بشدة بسبب عدم الامتثال للقوانين واللوائح البيئية. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمنع ذلك؟","oa":["تعيين متطلبات الامتثال البيئي، وتحديد المخاطر التي تواجه تحقيقها، وإعداد إجراءات التخفيف","تعيين مسؤول كبير للامتثال البيئي لتقديم تقاريره مباشرة إلى مدير المشروع","التواصل مع الجهة التنظيمية للحصول على إعفاء جزئي في ضوء الأهمية البيئية للمشروع","تم دمج احتياطيات جدول زمني كافية بناءً على تأخيرات مماثلة في المشاريع السابقة"],"rat":null,"fa":"يهدف مشروع بناء وسائل النقل العام الرئيسي إلى تقليل الانبعاثات بشكل كبير، لذلك يجب على مدير المشروع تعيين متطلبات الامتثال البيئي، وتحديد المخاطر لتحقيقها، وإعداد وسائل التخفيف","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":636,"q":"A major public transportation construction project is aimed at significantly reducing emissions. The project has been severely delayed due to non-compliance with environmental codes and bylaws. What should the project manager have done to prevent this?","t":"S","o":["Mapped environmental compliance requirements , identified risks to achieving them , and prepared mitigations.","Appointed a senior environmental compliance officer to report directly to the project manager.","Approached the regulator for a partial waiver in light of the environmental importance of the project.","Incorporated sufficient schedule reserves based on similar delays in past projects"],"c":[0],"f":"A major public transportation construction project is aimed at significantly reducing emissions so The project manager should Mapped environmental compliance requirements , identified risks to achieving them , and prepared mitigations.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":737}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع بإجراء تخطيط التكرار . بناءً على الجهد المقدر، قد يتم تسليم 95% فقط من العناصر المدرجة في التكرار . يطلب مالك المنتج من مدير المشروع النصيحة حول كيفية تحديد أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج. ما الذي يجب استخدامه لتحديد أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج.","oa":["التعقيد الفني","دقة التقدير","قيمة العمل","خطر التسليم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":637,"q":"A project team is conducting sprint planning. Based on the estimated effort,only 95% of the items included in the sprint may be delivered . The product owner asked the project manager for advice on how to prioritize the backlog items. What should be used to prioritize the backlog items.","t":"S","o":["Technical complexity","Estimation accuracy","Business Value","Risk to delivery"],"c":[2],"f":"🔹 Domain: Process\n\n🔹 Approach: Agile\n\n🔹 Importance:\nVery important, because it tests how backlog items are prioritized in agile, especially when delivery capacity is limited during Sprint Planning.\n\n🔹 Keywords:\nSprint planning – estimated effort – prioritize the backlog items\n\nDuring Sprint Planning, if the team realizes that not all selected items may be delivered, the product owner should ensure that the most important items come first.\nIn agile, the primary basis for backlog prioritization is business value, meaning the benefit delivered to the customer or organization.\n\nThis does not mean risk, complexity, or estimates are irrelevant, but they are supporting factors rather than the primary prioritization driver.\nThe Product Backlog is generally ordered with highest-value items first, then effort, dependencies, risk, and feasibility are considered.\n\nIn other words:\n\n The product owner focuses on value\n The development team supports estimation and technical feasibility\n Prioritization should maximize delivered value\n\n🔹 Example:\nSuppose there are four features for an app, but the team can only finish three.\nIf online payment provides the highest direct benefit to customers and the business, while a color theme enhancement provides less value, the payment feature should be prioritized first even if some other items are easier or less risky.\n\n🔹 Exam Tips:\nIf the exam asks how to order the Product Backlog, think first about business value or product value.\nIf the question is about what the product owner should prioritize when capacity is constrained, the answer is often value.\nIf the question focuses on what threatens Sprint completion, the answer may relate to risk, but this question is about prioritization, not threats.\nIf the question mentions effort or estimates, do not be misled; estimation is not the same as prioritization.\nIf the question is phrased as What should the product owner maximize? the answer is likely value.\n\n🔹 References:\n\n Agile Practice Guide: Pages 18–19, 51–56\n PMBOK 7th Edition: Pages 9–14, 40–44\n PMBOK 6th Edition: Pages 138, 163, 167\n PMBOK 8th Edition: Pages 22–27, 64–69\n ECO 2026: Pages 10–16","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":738}},{"qa":"قدم مدير المشروع الجدول الزمني للمشروع إلى المعنيين وطلبوا إكمال المشروع قبل شهرين من الموعد المحدد. \n\nماذا يجب على مدير المشروع أن يفعل؟","oa":["تقليل نطاق المشروع عن طريق إزالة الأنشطة وتقصير الجدول الزمني","قم بضغط الجدول الزمني لتقصير الجدول الزمني مع الحفاظ على النطاق دون تغيير","قم بتحديث خطة إدارة التكلفة لتخصيص المزيد من الموارد للمشروع لإنهاء النطاق مبكرًا","عقد اجتماع مع المعنيين لمواءمة الجداول الزمنية وتوقعات النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":638,"q":"A project manager presented the project schedule to the mam stakeholders They have requested that the project be completed two months earlier than the scheduled date \n\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Reduce the scope of the project by removing activities and shortening the timeline","Crash the schedule to shorten the timeline while keeping the scope unchanged","Update the cost management plan to allocate more resources to the project to finish the scope earlier.","Hold a stakeholder meeting to align timelines and scope expectations."],"c":[3],"f":"Stakeholders have requested that the project be completed two months earlier than the scheduled date so the project manager should hold a stakeholder meeting to align timelines and scope expectations.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Schedule","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":739}},{"qa":"تقوم إحدى الشركات بنقل مقرها الرئيسي إلى مدينة أخرى. يستخدم مدير المشروع المسؤول عن المهمة نهجًا تنبؤيًا أثناء عملية النقل. ومع ذلك، سيتم ترحيل أنظمة المعلومات باستخدام نهج رشيق. يحتاج مدير المشروع إلى تحديد نوع التحكم الذي سيتم توقيعه مع البائع المسؤول عن ترحيل الأنظمة. \n\nكيف يجب على مدير المشروع معالجة هذا الوضع؟","oa":["التفاوض على الدفع بعد اكتمال ترحيل المشروع","استخدم الزيادات ذات الأسعار الثابتة عند اكتمال قصص المستخدمين","تأكيد الدفع بعد كل مشروع بأثر رجعي","توقيع اتفاقية واحدة للمشروع بأكمله"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":639,"q":"A company is moving its headquarters to another city. The project manager responsible for the assignment has been using a predictive approach during the transition. However, the information systems will be migrated using an agile approach. The project manager needs to decide which kind of control to sign with the vendor responsible for migrating the systems.\n\nHow should the project manager address this situation?","t":"S","o":["Negotiate payment after all project migration is completed","Use fixed-price increments as user stories are completed.","Confirm payment after each project retrospective","Sign a single agreement for the whole project"],"c":[1],"f":"The information systems will be migrated using an agile approach. The project manager needs Project Manager should Use fixed-price increments as user stories are completed as kind of control to sign with the vendor responsible for migrating the systems.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":740}},{"qa":"تحتاج الشركة التي تقدم منتجًا جديدًا إلى السوق بحلول نهاية العام إلى بناء منشأة للتخزين والتوزيع. خلال الاجتماع الشهري لأصحاب المصلحة، تم اكتشاف أن موقع التنفيذ منطقة مملوكة للحكومة. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله أولاً؟","oa":["قم بتحديث سجل المشكلات","تحديد موقع بديل","تحديث سجل المخاطر","إصدار طلب تغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":640,"q":"A company that is introducing a new product into the market by the end of the year requires a storage and distribution facility to be built. During the monthly stakeholder meeting, it is discovered that the location for implementation is a government-owned area What should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Update the issue log","Identify an alternative site.","Update the risk register.","Issue a change request"],"c":[2],"f":"During the monthly stakeholder meeting, it is discovered that the location for implementation is a government-owned area this is risk if the company introduce her product in this location will led loses and The company may be exposed to violations from the government so the project manager should update the risk register to develop responses .","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":741}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لتولي مشروع برمجي موجود. لقد ورث مدير المشروع فريقًا بسيطًا يتكون من أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين وخبراء الموضوع (SMEs) وكبار المطورين. \n\nأثناء مراجعة حالة المشروع مع الفريق، لاحظ مدير المشروع أن الفريق يبدو أنه يفتقر إلى التوجيه والحماس. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع الجديد؟","oa":["تنظيم جلسات متكررة لبناء الفريق وتحديث سجل المخاطر","الاجتماع مع راعي المشروع واقتراح الإجراء التصحيحي للمشروع","تشجيع المشاركة في اتخاذ القرار وتمكين الفريق","التأكد من قيام الجميع بأداء المهام الموكلة إليهم كما هو مخطط لها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":641,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to take over an existing software project. The project manager inherited a lean team comprised of key stakeholders, subject matter experts (SMEs), and senior developers. While reviewing the project status with the team, the project manager observes that the team seems to lack direction and enthusiasm.\nWhat should the new project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Organize frequent team building sessions and update the risk register.","Meet with the project sponsor and propose a corrective action for the project.","Encourage participation in decision making and empower the team.","Ensure everyone performs their assigned tasks as planned."],"c":[2],"f":"The team seems to lack direction and enthusiasm so the project manager should Encourage participation in decision making and empower the team.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":742}},{"qa":"تؤدي مفاوضات عقد النقابات العمالية إلى تأخير استكمال مشروع بناء مصنع جديد. ونظرًا لأن عقد العمل كان من المقرر تجديده هذا العام، فقد قام مدير المشروع بتوثيق عملية التفاوض باعتبارها خطرًا على المشروع. وكان المشروع على وشك البدء بالمرحلة الأولى من تركيب المعدات في المصنع عندما بدأت المفاوضات. كيف ينبغي لمدير المشروع معالجة الوضع؟","oa":["تصعيد المشكلة إلى اللجنة التوجيهية لطلب دعم التخفيف","قم بتسجيل المشكلة واتبع الإجراءات المخطط لها في خطة الاستجابة للمخاطر","الحصول على موارد العقد وتقديم طلب تغيير لتأثير التكلفة","الاجتماع مع فريق المشروع لتحديد خيارات تخفيف المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":642,"q":"A labor union contract negotiation is delaying the completion of a project to build a new manufacturing plant. Because the labor contract was due for renewal this year, the project manager documented the negotiation process as a risk to the project. The project was about to start the first phase of equipment installation at the plant when the negotiation began.\nHow should the project manager address the situation?","t":"S","o":["Escalate the issue to the steering committee to ask for mitigation support.","Log the issue and follow the planned actions in the risk response plan.","Acquire contract resources and submit a change request for the cost impact.","Meet with the project team to determine options for risk mitigation."],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword(The project was about to start the first phase) this is certain event ,this is meaning issue has negative impact so the best option (Log the issue and follow the planned actions in the risk response plan.)","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":743}},{"qa":"في المشروع المختلط، قرر العميل إجراء تغيير كبير في تصميم المشروع. تمت الموافقة على هذا التغيير وأصبح التأثير على الجدول الزمني والميزانية معروفًا. \n\nيرفض قائد فريق البرمجيات، الذي من المفترض أن يقوم بتطوير البرنامج، الالتزام بمواعيد التسليم مدعيًا أنهم يعملون باستخدام نهج رشيق ولا يمكنهم الالتزام بموعد تسليم نهائي للأجهزة يعتمد الفريق على هذا البرنامج لتطوير الجزء الخاص به من المنتج ماذا يجب على مدير المشروع أن يفعل؟","oa":["إضافة هذا الخطر إلى سجل المخاطر ومراقبته وفق خطة إدارة المخاطر","اطلب من قائد فريق البرمجيات استخدام نهج تنبؤي والالتزام بموعد التسليم","فرض مواعيد التسليم على قائد فريق البرمجيات وإخطار المدير الوظيفي بالموقف","تصعيد هذا الأمر إلى الإدارة العليا وطلب المساعدة لحل المشكلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":643,"q":"In a hybrid project, the customer decided on a major change for the project design. This change was approved and the impact on schedule and budget is known The software team leader, who is supposed to develop the software, refuses to commit to delivery dates claiming that they work using an agile approach and cannot commit to a final delivery date The hardware team depends on this software to develop their part of the product What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Add this risk to the risk register and monitor it according to the risk management plan","Ask the software team leader to use a predictive approach and commit to a delivery date","Impose the delivery dates on the software team leader and notify the functional manager about the situation","Escalate this to higher management and ask for help to resolve the issue."],"c":[1],"f":"This change was approved and the impact on schedule and budget is known so the best option choose predictive approcah because the requirements became clear , where Agile approach is working with unclear requirements","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":744}},{"qa":"تنتقل إحدى المؤسسات إلى أسلوب Agile وتم اختيار المشروع كمشروع تجريبي. \n\nيتمتع مدير المشروع المعين فقط بالخبرة في استخدام الأساليب التنبؤية ولكن يتعين على مدير المشروع الآن استخدام أساليب Agile بمساعدة مدرب رشيق أثناء استعراض التكرار الخامس بأثر رجعي ، يشكو فريق المشروع من وجود العديد من العقبات مع المنظمة والتي تؤدي إلى تأخير المشروع وإعادة العمل. \n\nماذا يجب على مدير المشروع أن يفعل في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["تعزيز التعاون للمساعدة في إزالة العقبات أمام الفريق","قم بتضمين حلول العوائق خلال الاجتماعات الوقوف اليومية","قم بإنشاء تكرار مخصص لحل العقبات مع الفريق","قم بإجراء تحليل السبب الجذري أثناء الاجتماعات اليومية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":644,"q":"An organization is transitioning to agile and a project has been chosen as a pilot The assigned project manager only has experience using predictive approaches but the project manager is now required to use agile approaches with the help of an agile coach During the retrospective of the fifth sprint, the project team complains that many obstacles exist with the organization that are creating project delays and rework What should the project manager do in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Promote collaboration to help remove the obstacles for the team","Include impediment resolutions during daily standup meetings","Create a dedicated sprint to solve the obstacles with the team","Perform a root cause analysis during the standup meetings"],"c":[0],"f":"One of the principles of the agile approach is team cooperation, so if there are obstacles, the team must cooperate to remove the obstacles by help of the project manager (Scrum Master).","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":745}},{"qa":"يتأخر المشروع عن الجدول الزمني ويتجاوز الميزانية، مما يؤدي إلى حدوث مشكلة في التسليم التالي. \n\nيقوم مدير المشروع بإبلاغ أصحاب المصلحة، الذين يشعرون بقلق بالغ بشأن المشروع. \n\nما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله للتخفيف من مخاوف أصحاب المصلحة؟","oa":["تحدث مع الراعي واشرح له الموقف حتى يتمكن الراعي من شرحه لأصحاب المصلحة","عرض مؤشرات الأداء والتوصية بالإجراءات التصحيحية لأصحاب المصلحة","تحديد موعد لجلسة انطلاق لشرح مشاكل المشروع والحصول على الموافقة والدعم","إرسال رسائل للتوضيح حتى يكون هناك فهم كامل للموقف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":645,"q":"A project is behind schedule and over budget, resulting in a problem for the next deliverable. \n\nThe project manager informs the stakeholders, who are very concerned about the project. \n\nWhat should the project manager do to alleviate the stakeholders' concerns?","t":"S","o":["Speak with the sponsor and explain the situation so that the sponsor can explain it to the stakeholders","Demonstrate the performance indexes and recommend corrective actions to the stakeholders","Schedule a kick-off session to explain the problems of the project and gain approval and support","Send communications for clarification so there is a full understanding about the situation."],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should Send communications for clarification so there is a full understanding about the situation to alleviate the stakeholders' concerns.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":746}},{"qa":"بسبب التخفيض الأخير في الميزانية، تم تسريح اثنين من أعضاء الفريق من فريق Agile. لا يزال العميل يتوقع النتائج المبكرة للمشروع. ما الإجراءين اللذين يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذهما لمواءمة توقعات العملاء؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["اطلب من فريق اجايل مراجعة وتحديث خطة إدارة الجودة مع العميل.","إرسال خطة مفصلة لإدارة المشروع إلى العميل","مراجعة سجل المعوقات مع العميل","اطلب من فريق اجايل مراجعة سرعة التكرار المحدثة مع العميل","اطلب من مالك المنتج مراجعة سجل أعمال المنتج ذات الأولوية مع العميل."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":646,"q":"Due to a recent budget reduction, two team members were released from an agile team. The customer is still expecting early results for the project.\nWhich two actions should the project manager take to align customer expectations? (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Ask the agile team to review and update the quality management plan with the customer.","Send a detailed project management plan to the customer.","Review the impediments log with the customer.","Ask the agile team to review the updated sprint velocity with the customer.","Ask the product owner to review the prioritized backlog with the customer."],"c":[3,4],"f":"Two actions should the project manager take to align customer expectations\n1- Ask the product owner to review the prioritized backlog with the customer.\n2-Ask the agile team to review the updated sprint velocity with the customer.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":747}},{"qa":"يحتوي المشروع على جدول تسليم ضيق للغاية يقترب المشروع من تاريخ التسليم وغالبًا ما يرسل راعي المشروع تنبيهات إلى مدير المشروع لتجنب أي تأخير في الجدول الزمني لقد كان أداء فريق المشروع عند مستوى مقبول حتى الآن ولكن مدير المشروع يريد التأكد من أداء الفريق يتم الحفاظ على مستوى الأداء حتى النهاية ما هو الإجراء الذي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه لتحفيز أداء فريق المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتعيين عدد قليل من أعضاء الفريق المؤقتين للمساعدة في العمل الإضافي","أبلغ الفريق بضغوط التسليم من راعي المشروع","إرسال إشعار رسمي إلى أعضاء الفريق لتوجيههم إلى الحفاظ على الأداء","منح شهادات تقدير لتشجيع الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":647,"q":"A project has a very tight delivery schedule The project is approaching the delivery date and the project sponsor often sends the project manager alerts to avoid any schedule slippage The project team has performed at an acceptable level until now but the project manager wants to ensure the team's performance level is maintained until the end What action should the project manager take to motivate the project team's performance?","t":"S","o":["Hire a few temporary team members to help with the additional work","Inform the team about the delivery pressure from the project sponsor","Send a formal notice to team members instructing them to maintain performance","Award certificates of appreciation to encourage the team"],"c":[3],"f":"Team Members Performance is continuously improving so Project Manager Should Appreciate throughout Project lifecycle","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":748}},{"qa":"بعد مراجعة خطة إدارة المشروع مع أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين، تم إخبار مدير المشروع بأن خطة الإصدار لمدة 18 شهرًا غير مقبولة ويجب إطلاق المنتج في غضون ستة أشهر. بناءً على الجدول الزمني الجديد، ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله؟","oa":["قم بمراجعة سجل أعمال للمشروع بحثًا عن العناصر ذات الأولوية العالية والتوصل إلى الحد الأدنى من المنتج القابل للتطبيق  الذي يناسب الجدول الزمني المتوقع","الحصول على موافقة الراعي على مضاعفة ميزانية المشروع ثلاث مرات، وتعيين عدد أكبر من الأشخاص للتعويض عن الجدول الزمني المضغوط","قم بمراجعة المسار الحرج مع أصحاب المصلحة، موضحًا سبب عدم إمكانية تسليم النطاق بالكامل في الجدول الزمني المتوقع","قم بالتخطيط للعمل الإضافي وتطبيق التتبع السريع والتعطل ومشاركة مخاطر الفشل مع أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":648,"q":"After reviewing the project management plan with key stakeholders, the project manager was told that an 18-month release plan was unacceptable and the product should launch in six months. Based on the new timeline, what should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Review the project backlog looking for high-priority items and come up with a minimum viable product (MVP) that fits the expected timeline","Seek approval with the sponsor to triple the project budget, hiring more people to compensate for the compressed schedule","Go over the critical path with stakeholders, explaining why it is not possible to deliver all the scope in the expected timeline","Plan for overtime apply crashing and fast tracking and share the risk of failure with project stakeholders"],"c":[0],"f":"The product should launch in six months , so this is fit with agile approach so the project manager should Review the project backlog looking for high-priority items and come up with a minimum viable product (MVP) that fits the expected timeline.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":749}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في مشروع تطوير البرمجيات. العلاقة بين المطورين وفريق مراقبة الجودة سيئة، لذلك يقاوم المطورون الاختبارات. لا يمكن تسليم المنتج بعد أن تم اختباره واجتيازه من خلال مراقبة الجودة. كمدير للمشروع، ماذا عليك أن تفعل؟","oa":["مقابلة المطورين وفريق ضبط الجودة على الفور لضمان تلبية معايير الجودة","تقييم التأثير وإبلاغ العميل","الاستعانة بمصادر خارجية لأنشطة إدارة الجودة","تحديث خطة إدارة الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":649,"q":"You are a project manager in a software development project . The developers and the quality control team have a poor relationship , so the developers are resisting the tests. The product cannot be delivered unit it has been tested and passed by quality control. As a project manager , what should you do?","t":"S","o":["Immediately meet with the developers and quality control team to ensure that the quality standards are met.","Evaluate the impact and inform the customer","Outsourcing the quality management activities","Update the quality management plan"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager should be proactive and manage the conflict between the quality control department and the developers , so the project manager should meet with the developers and quality control team to ensure that the quality standards are met.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":750}},{"qa":"كمديرًا للمشروع، فإن العديد من أعضاء فريق المشروع جدد في المشروع، وبينما يعملون بشكل جيد كفريق، فإنك تشعر بالقلق بشأن ما إذا كانوا يتبعون الإجراءات بشكل صحيح. ما هي الأداة أو التقنية التي من المحتمل أن تساعدك في تحديد ما إذا كانت هناك مشكلة","oa":["مخططات إيشيكاوا","الفحص","الرسوم البيانية التوزيعية","تدقيق الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":650,"q":"As a project manager , many of your project team members are new to the project , and while they are working well as a team , you are concerned as to whether they are following the procedures correctly . What tool or technique is likely to help you determine if there is a problem","t":"S","o":["Ishikawa diagrams","Inspection","Histogram","Quality audit"],"c":[3],"f":"According to the PMBOK® Guide, a quality audit is “a structured, independent process to determine if project activities comply with organizational and project policies, processes, and procedures.”\n\nAudits help assess how well a process complies with regulations, internal policies, and other compliance drivers. The Project Manager may perform audits as a self-check, or they may be performed by a third party.\nSince the team meners are new to the project , a quality audit could identify compliance with the procedures as well as proactively offer assistance to improve implementation of the procedures .\n \n\nPMBOK Guide 6th Page(s) 294-295","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":751}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بإدارة مشروع يتضمن تسليمًا رئيسيًا فشل في اختبار القبول النهائي. المشروع الآن متأخر عن الجدول الزمني ويتجاوز الميزانية لأنه يجب إنشاء بديل. ما هي العملية التي يجب على مدير المشروع استخدامها لتحديد سبب حدوث الفشل؟","oa":["تحليل البديل","التجزئة","تحليل السبب الجذري","طريقة المسار الحرج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":651,"q":"A project manager is managing a project with a major deliverable that failed its final acceptance test.The project is now behind schedule and over budget because a replacement must be created . What process should the project manager use to determine why the failure occurred?","t":"S","o":["Alternative analysis","Decomposition","Root cause analysis","Critical path method"],"c":[2],"f":"Root cause analysis (RCA) is a method deployed to determine the sequence of events that ultimately result in product or material failure. It moves beyond casual factors that may influence product life and provides a full understanding what went wrong, how to fix it, and how to prevent recurrences.\n\nRoot cause analysis is an analytical technique used to determine the basic underlying reason that causes a variance , defect , or risk . A root cause may underlie more than one variance , defect , or risk. It may also be used as a technique for identifying root causes of a problem and sloving them. When all root causes for a problem are removed , the problem does not recur.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Governance","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":752}},{"qa":"نوران هي مديرة مشروع في مشروع بناء كبير. كانت نوران قد خططت في الأصل لاستخدام الرافعتين البرجيتين الخاصتين بالشركة في وقت واحد لمشروع ما، لكنها علمت للتو أن إحداهما لن تكون متاحة. تقوم نوران بتعديل الجدول الزمني بحيث يتم إنشاء المكونات بشكل تسلسلي باستخدام الرافعة البرجية المتبقية. لسوء الحظ، يؤثر هذا الإجراء على المسار الحرج ويؤخر تاريخ الانتهاء المخطط للمشروع. أي من التقنيات التالية استخدمتها نوران في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["طريقة المسار الحرج","تحليل الاحتياطي","تسوية الموارد","التتابع السريع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":652,"q":"Nouran is a project manager on a large construction project. Nouran had originally planned to use both of the company's tower crane simultaneously for a project but has just learned that one of them will be unavailable .\nNouran adjusts the schedule so that the components are created sequentially using the one remaining tower crane . Unfortunately , this action affects the critical path and delays the planned finish date of the project.\nWhich of the following techniques has been used by Nouran in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Critical path method","Reserve analysis","Resource leveling","Fast tracking"],"c":[2],"f":"Resource leveling. A technique in which start and finish dates are adjusted based on resource constraints with the goal of balancing the demand for resources with the available supply. Resource leveling can be used when shared or critically required resources are available only at certain times or in limited quantities, or are over- allocated, such as when a resource has been assigned to two or more activities during the same time period , or there is a need to keep resource usage at a constant level.\nResource leveling can often cause the original critical path to change. Available float is used for leveling resources. Consequently, the critical path through the project schedule may changeResource leveling. A technique in which start and finish dates are adjusted based on resource constraints with the goal of balancing the demand for resources with the available supply. Resource leveling can be used when shared or critically required resources are available only at certain times or in limited quantities, or are over- allocated, such as when a resource has been assigned to two or more activities during the same time period , or there is a need to keep resource usage at a constant level. Resource leveling can often cause the original critical path to change. Available float is used for leveling resources. Consequently, the critical path through the project schedule may change.\n\nPMBOK Guide 6th edition, Page 211","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":753}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بعقد اجتماع مع فريق المشروع المعين حديثًا. الغرض الأساسي من الاجتماع هو تعيين الأدوار والمسؤوليات لأعضاء الفريق. وبما أن أعضاء الفريق يجتمعون للمرة الأولى، اطلب من كل منهم أن يقدم نفسه ويشارك في تمرين بناء الفريق. ما هي المرحلة التي يمثلها هذا السيناريو في نموذج سلم تاكمان لتطوير الفريق؟","oa":["التشكيل","العصف","الانسجام","التنفيذ"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":653,"q":"A project manager is conducting a meeting with the newly hired project team. The primary purpose of the meeting is to assign roles and responsibilities to the team members . Since the team members are meeting for the first time , you have each of them introduce themselves and participate in a team - building exercise . What stage in the Tuckman ladder model of team development does this scenario represent?","t":"S","o":["Forming","Storming","Norming","Performing"],"c":[0],"f":"Forming. This phase is where the team members meet and learn about the project and their formal roles and responsibilities. Team members tend to be independent and not as open in this phase.\nPMBOK Guide 6th - Page 238\n\nForming. The project team first comes together. Members get to know each other’s name, position on the project team, skill sets, and other pertinent background information. This might occur in the kickoff meeting.\nPMBOK Guide 7th - Page 166","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":754}},{"qa":"بعض زملائك في إدارة المشاريع يرون أن مهارات القيادة ومهارات استخدام برامج إدارة المشاريع من المهارات المهمة التي يجب أن يمتلكها مدير المشروع، وذلك وفقًا لمثلث المواهب (PMI Talent Triangle).\n\nأي من الخيارات التالية يعكس جميع كفاءات مدير المشروع؟","oa":["طرق العمل، مهارات القوة، الفطنة والحنكة والذكاء التجاري","الخبرة الإدارية، والخبرة العملية، والخبرة في المجال","إدارة المشاريع، إدارة الأفراد، الأعمال والاستراتيجية","المعرفة، الأداء، الشخصية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":654,"q":"Some of your project management peers are of the opinion that leadership and project management software usage skills are some of the important skills a project manager should have . As per PMI Talent Traingle . \n\nWhich of the below reflects all the competencies of a project manager.","t":"S","o":["Ways of working , Power skills , Business Acumen","Management experience , process expertise , domain experience","Project management , People management , Business and strategy","Knowledge , Performance , Personality"],"c":[0],"f":"🔹 Domain: Business Environment\n\n🔹 Approach: Hybrid\n\n🔹 Importance:\nVery important and frequently tested, especially based on PMBOK 7th and 8th editions\n\n🔹 Keywords:\nPMI Talent Triangle – leadership – project management software – competencies\n\nThe PMI Talent Triangle includes three key competencies:\n\n Ways of Working: includes Agile, Predictive, and Hybrid approaches along with tools and techniques\n Power Skills: leadership, communication, emotional intelligence, influencing\n Business Acumen: understanding strategy, aligning with organizational goals, delivering value\n\n📌 This reflects the shift from a technical role to a strategic leadership role focused on value delivery\n\n🔹 Example:\nA project manager uses Agile (Ways of Working), leads the team (Power Skills), and aligns the project with business goals (Business Acumen)\n\n🔹 Exam Tips:\nIf Talent Triangle appears, choose Ways of Working + Power Skills + Business Acumen\nIf Power Skills is replaced by Leadership, it is likely incorrect\nIf Technical Skills appears, it refers to the old model\nIf the question says “skills of PM” without Talent Triangle, focus on the context\n\n🔹 References:\n\n PMBOK 7th Edition: Page 4–10\n PMBOK 6th Edition: Page 11\n PMBOK 8th Edition: Page 28–32\n Agile Practice Guide: Page 8–12\n ECO 2026: Page 2–4","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Project Management Framework","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":755}},{"qa":"يعلم فريق المشروع من أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين أن بعض التسليمات قد تم تقديمها للموافقة عليها دون علمهم. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمنع هذا الوضع؟","oa":["تم تحديد موعد لعقد اجتماع مع العميل وفريق المشروع","ابلاغ  فريق المشروع","راجع محضر الاجتماع الأخير المتعلق بالتسليم","التحقق من خطة إدارة الاتصالات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":655,"q":"The project team learns from key stakeholders that some deliveriables have been forwarded for approval without their knowledge . What should the project manager have done to prevent this situation?","t":"S","o":["Scheduled a meeting with the customer and the project team","Notified the project team","Consulted the most recent meeting minutes related to deliverable","Verified the communication management plan"],"c":[3],"f":"The communication management plan should be verified to determine what communications should be shared with whom .\nPMBOK Guide 6th edition . Page 377\n\nCommunication planning overlaps with stakeholder identification, analysis, prioritization, and\nengagement as described in the Stakeholder Performance Domain (Section 2.1). Communication is\nthe most important factor in engaging with stakeholders effectively. Planning communication for the\nproject entails considering the following:\n▶ Who needs information?\n▶ What information does each stakeholder need?\n▶ Why should information be shared with stakeholders?\n▶ What is the best way to provide information?\n▶ When and how often is information needed?\n▶ Who has the information needed?\nThere may be different categories of information, such as internal and external, sensitive\nand public, or general and detailed. Analyzing the stakeholders, information needs, and categories\nof information provides the foundation for establishing the communications processes and plans\nfor the project.\n\nPMBOK Guide 7th edition . Page 64","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":756}},{"qa":"لقد قمت للتو بتعيين مدير مشروع لمشروع تصنيع كبير. أنت تريد أن تفهم عملية إعداد بيان نطاق المشروع وكيف سيتم الحصول على القبول الرسمي لتسليمات المشروع المكتملة. أي مما يلي يجب عليك الرجوع إليه؟","oa":["خطة إدارة المعنيين","خطة إدارة المتطلبات","خطة إدارة الجودة","خطة إدارة النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":656,"q":"You have just assigned as project manager for a large manufacturing project. You want to understand the process for preparing a project scope statement and how formal acceptance of the completed project deliverables will be obtained. Which of the following will you have to reference?","t":"S","o":["The stakeholder management plan","The requirements management plan","The quality management plan","The scope management plan"],"c":[3],"f":"SCOPE MANAGEMENT PLAN\nThe scope management plan is a component of the project management plan that describes how the scope will be\ndefined, developed, monitored, controlled, and validated. The components of a scope management plan include:\nuu Process for preparing a project scope statement;\nuu Process that enables the creation of the WBS from the detailed project scope statement;\nuu Process that establishes how the scope baseline will be approved and maintained; and\nuu Process that specifies how formal acceptance of the completed project deliverables will be obtained.\nThe scope management plan can be formal or informal, broadly framed or highly detailed, based on the needs\nof the project.\n\nPMBOK Guide 6th edition , Page 137\n\n \n\n Scope management plan. This plan is a component of the project or program management plan that describes how the scope will be defined, developed, monitored, controlled, and validated.\n\nPMBOK Guide 7th edition , Page 187","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Scope","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":757}},{"qa":"أثناء تطوير خطة إدارة النطاق، يطلب أحد المعنيين إضافة تقنية تجريبية إلى نطاق المشروع للمساعدة في تسويق المنتج. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["استخدم احتياطي المشروع للتكنولوجيا التجريبية","زيادة ميزانية المشروع مع تكلفة التكنولوجيا التجريبية","قم بمراجعة خط الأساس للنطاق مع المعنيين","قم بتضمين المعنيين في اجتماعات تخطيط النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":657,"q":"During the development of the scope management plan , a stakeholder requests the addition of pilot technology into the project scope to assist with product marketing . What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Use the project reserve for the pilot technology","Increase the project budget with the cost of the pilot technology","Review the scope baseline with the stakeholder","Include the stakeholder in the scope planning meetings"],"c":[3],"f":"During the development of the scope management plan , a stakeholder requests the addition of pilot technology into the project scope to assist with product marketing so the project manager should Include the stakeholder in the scope planning meetings .","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Scope","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":758}},{"qa":"أنت متأخر لمدة أسبوع واحد في المشروع بسبب التسليم من قبل البائع. أنت مجبر على ضغط الجدول الزمني لمشروعك بسبب تاريخ انتهاء محدد من قبل الحكومة والذي يقيد مشروعك. بعد الاجتماع مع فريقك، وجدت طريقة لضغط المشروع دون إضافة المزيد من الموارد أو زيادة تكلفة المشروع. وهذا مثال على أي مما يلي؟","oa":["ضغط زمن المشروع","التتابع السريع","تخفيف المخاطر","تسوية الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":658,"q":"You are running one week behnid on a project due to delivery by a vendor.You are forced to compress your project schedule due to a government - mandated end date that constrains your project. After meeting with your team , you found a method to compress the project without adding more resources or increase the project cost . This is an example of which of the following?","t":"S","o":["Crashing","Fast tracking","Risk mitigation","Resource leveling"],"c":[1],"f":"Fast Tracking. A schedule compression method in which activities or phases normally done in sequence are performed in parallel for at least a portion of their duration.\nPMBOK Guide 7th edition , Page 52","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":759}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع برنامج GHY لشركتك. لقد أكملت المشروع مؤخرًا وتحتاج إلى توزيع تقرير إغلاق المشروع. من الذي يجب أن يحصل على نسخة من تقرير إغلاق المشروع؟","oa":["راعي المشروع","اتبع الإرشادات المنصوص عليها في خطة إدارة اتصالات المشروع","لا احد . تم إنشاؤه للحصول على معلومات تاريخية في المستقبل","كل المعنيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":659,"q":"You are the project manager of the GHY software project for your company. You've recently completed the project and need to distribute the project closure report. Who should get a copy of the project closure report?","t":"S","o":["Project sponsor","Follow the guidelines established in the project's communications management plan","No one . It is created for future historical information","All stakeholders"],"c":[1],"f":"The communications management plan is a component of the project management plan that describes how project communications will be planned, structured, implemented, and monitored for effectiveness. \n\nThe plan contains the following information:\n Stakeholder communication requirements;\nInformation to be communicated, including language, format, content, and level of detail;\nEscalation processes;\nReason for the distribution of that information;\nTimeframe and frequency for the distribution of required information and receipt of acknowledgment or response,\nif applicable;\nPerson responsible for communicating the information;\nPerson responsible for authorizing release of confidential information;\nPerson or groups who will receive the information, including information about their needs, requirements, and\nexpectations;\nMethods or technologies used to convey the information, such as memos, email, press releases, or social media;\nResources allocated for communication activities, including time and budget;\nMethod for updating and refining the communications management plan as the project progresses and develops,\nsuch as when the stakeholder community changes as the project moves through different phases;\nGlossary of common terminology;\nFlow charts of the information flow in the project, workflows with possible sequence of authorization, list of\nreports, meeting plans, etc.; and\nConstraints derived from specific legislation or regulation, technology, organizational policies, etc.\nThe communications management plan can include guidelines and templates for project status meetings, project\nteam meetings, e-meetings, and email messages. The use of a project website and project management software can\nbe included if these are to be used in the project.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":760}},{"qa":"لقد نفذت المنظمة تاريخياً معظم المشاريع باستخدام نهج تنبؤي. وتريد المنظمة الآن التحول إلى نهج رشيق. ونتيجة لهذا التغيير، يشعر مدير المشروع بالقلق بشأن عملية تحديد النطاق للمشاريع القادمة. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لضمان تحديد النطاق بالكامل؟","oa":["الاجتماع بالمدير العام وإقناعه بالعودة لاستخدام النهج التنبؤي لتجنب أي مخاطر","اطلب من الراعي زيادة الميزانية للتحقق مما إذا كانت كل احتياجات العمل مدرجة في المتطلبات","ساعد الرعاة والمعنيين في صياغة رؤية المنتج وجمع الفريق ومالك المنتج معًا لتوضيح التوقعات","اطلب من المدير العام مراجعة كل المتطلبات للتأكد من أن جميع المشاريع سوف تقدم المنتجات المطلوبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":660,"q":"An organization has historically executed most projects using a predictive approach. The organization now wants to change over to an agile approach . Due to this change , the project manager is worried about the scope definition process for upcoming projects. What should the project manager do to ensure the scope is completely defined?","t":"S","o":["Meet with the general manager and convince them to return to use the predictive approach to avoid any risk.","Ask the sponsor to increase a budget to check if every business needs are included in the requirements.","Help sponsors and stakeholders craft the product vision and bring the team and product owner together to clarify the expectations.","Ask the general manager to review every requirement to ensure that all projects will deliver the required products ."],"c":[2],"f":"The project manager should help sponsors and stakeholders craft the product vision and bring the team and product owner together to clarify the expectations to ensure the scope is completely defined in agile approach.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":761}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع تعمل على مشروع بالغ الأهمية. لدى بعض المعنيين شكاوى حول أداء بعض أعضاء الفريق. تريد فهم الموقف وتقديم تعليقات للفريق في أقرب وقت ممكن. \n\nما هي الإجراءات الثلاثة التي يجب عليك اتخاذها لمعالجة هذا الوضع؟ اختر ثلاثة","oa":["إجراء اجتماع يومي للفريق","طلب مراجعة أداء المدير","عقد جلسة تقييم بأثر رجعي","إجراء مراجعة سنوية","تحديد القواعد الأساسية للفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":661,"q":"You are a project manager working on a critical project. Some stakeholders have complaints about some of the team member's performance . You want to understand the situation and provide feedback to the team as soon as possible. \n\nWhat three actions should you take to address this situation? Choose three","t":"M","o":["Perform a daily team meeting","Request a manager performance review","Perform a retrospective session","Conduct an annual review","Define team ground rules"],"c":[0,2,4],"f":"Some stakeholders have complaints about some of the team member's performance , so the project manager should (1-Define team ground rules , 2-Perform a retrospective session , 3-Perform a daily team meeting) to understand the situation and provide feedback to the team as soon as possible.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":762}},{"qa":"يتواجد فريق تطوير المشروع في مناطق مختلفة حول العالم. في الأسبوع الماضي، تم تأجيل إصدار مهم للغاية لأن أحد المطورين لم يستجب في الوقت المحدد لرسالة بريد إلكتروني تم إرسالها إلى الجميع. يبدو أن المطور قد فاته قراءة البريد الإلكتروني. \n\nما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذه المواقف؟","oa":["مراجعة خطة مشاركة المعنيين","مراجعة خطة إدارة الاتصالات","مراجعة خطة إدارة المخاطر","مراجعة خطة إدارة الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":662,"q":"A project development team is located in different areas around the world. Last week , avery important release was delayed because one of the developers did not respond on time to an email that was sent to everyone. The developer seems to have missed reading the email.\n\nWhat should the project manager do to avoid these situations?","t":"S","o":["Review the stakeholder engagement plan","Review the communications management plan","Review the risk management plan","Review the resource management plan"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword (The developer seems to have missed reading the email. )\nThe project manager should Review the communications management plan to ensure the agreed-upon methods and types of communication. Because it is clear in the scenario that the email was not agreed upon as a way of communication with the developer. Therefore , the communication management plan must be reviewed and updated if necessary to include all communication needs of all stakeholders in the project.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":763}},{"qa":"فى مشروع رشيق أشار راعي المشروع إلى أن مجموعة معينة من المعنيين لم تشارك في المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بالدعوة إلى اجتماع مع فريق المشروع لتحديد سبب عدم مشاركة المعنيين  ومن المسؤول","اجتمع مع مجموعة المعنيين للتعرف على اهتماماتهم ومتطلبات المشروع، وإضافتها إلى سجل أعمال المنتجات","قم بإشراك مالك المنتج، مع الإشارة إلى مخاوف الراعي، واطلب الخطوات التالية المناسبة","قم بمراجعة خطة إدارة الاتصالات لتحديد كيفية تخطيط المعنيين في المشروع للمشاركة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":663,"q":"An agile project's sponsor has indicated that a particular stakeholder group has not been engaged in the project. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Call a meeting with the project team to determine why the stakeholder has not been engaged and who is accountable.","Meet with the stakeholder group to capture their interests and project requirements , and add these to the product backlog.","Engage the product owner, indicating the sponsor's concerns, and request the appropriate next steps.","Review the communications management plan to determine how the stakeholders on the project were planning to be involved"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword ( Agile )\nAn agile approach is concerned with the continuous involvement of stakeholders, so the project manager should Meet with the stakeholder group to capture their interests and project requirements , and add these to the product backlog.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":764}},{"qa":"يشعر العميل بالقلق بشأن الوقت اللازم لإكمال المشروع ويطلب من فريق المشروع تقليل عدد التكرارات المطلوبة لإكمال المنتج. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يتبعه مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحديد أولويات التسليمات بناءً على قيمة الأعمال وتحديد الإصدارات المتكررة","اطلب من الفريق إثارة الحواجز أو العوائق في الاجتماعات اليومية","اطلب من الفريق تحدي تقديرات المشروع من أجل التسليم بشكل أسرع","حدد أولويات المهام ذات المخاطر العالية لتقليل عدد التكرارات المطلوبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":664,"q":"A customer is concerned about the time required to complete a project and is asking the project team to reduce the number of iterations required to complete the product. Which approach should the project manager take?","t":"S","o":["Prioritize deliverables based on business value and define frequent releases.","Ask the team to raise blockers or impediments in daily meetings.","Ask the team to challenge the project estimations for faster delivery.","Prioritize the tasks with high risks to reduce the number of iterations required."],"c":[0],"f":"The project team want to reduce the number of iterations required to complete the product so the project manager should Prioritize deliverables based on business value and define frequent releases","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":765}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع في مشروع لبناء مجمع صناعي. سيتم تنفيذ المشروع على ثلاث مراحل مختلفة: الهندسة والمشتريات والبناء.\nمرحلة الشراء في مرحلة البدء. يريد راعي المشروع متابعة مراحل المشروع كما تم التخطيط لها، ولكنه يريد أيضًا استيعاب البيانات الجديدة والمدخلات من العميل والتغييرات خلال المراحل المختلفة مع تقدم المشروع والتكيف معها. كيف ينبغي لمدير المشروع التعامل مع هذا المشروع؟","oa":["تقييم واتخاذ قرار بشأن نهج إدارة المشروع على مراحل","استخدم نموذجًا مختلطًا للجمع بين دورات الحياة التنبؤية والتكيفية","تطبيق النهج التنبؤي لإدارة المشاريع","تنفيذ النهج التكيفى فى إدارة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":665,"q":"A project manager is working on a project to build a manufacturing complex. The project will run in three different phases: engineering, procurement, and construction. The procurement phase is in the initiation stage. The project sponsor wants to pursue the project phases as they have been planned, but also wants to accommodate and adjust to new data, input from the customer, and changes during the various phases as the project progresses. How should the project manager approach this project?","t":"S","o":["Evaluate and decide on a phased project management approach","Use a hybrid model to combine predictive and adaptive lifecycles.","Apply a predictive project management approach","Implement an adaptive project management approach"],"c":[1],"f":"Since The Project sponsor wants to accommodate and adjust to new data, input from the customer, and changes during the various phases as the project progresses. So the project manager should Use a hybrid model to combine predictive and adaptive lifecycles.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":766}},{"qa":"منظمة تنتقل إلى نهج رشيق.تتم مراجعة التكرار (الاعمال التى تم الانتهاء منها) ، لم يقبل مالك المنتج نتيجة التكرار ولديه بعض المخاوف. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من مالك المنتج قبول النتيجة حيث قام الفريق بتسليم ما تم الاتفاق عليه في تخطيط التكرار","أنشئ سجلاً في سجل المشكلات وقم بتصعيد المشكلة إلى اللجنة التوجيهية للمشروع","اطلب من فريق المشروع معالجة مشكلات مالك المنتج نظرًا لأن مالك المنتج هو المسؤول عن النطاق في النهج الرشيق","قم بتنظيم اجتماع تقييم التكرار بأثر رجعي وناقش المشكلات وكيف يمكن تجنبها في التكرار (السباق ) التالي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":666,"q":"An organization is transitioning to an agile approach. At the projects first, sprint review, the product owner did not accept the result of the sprint and has some concerns. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Ask the product owner to accept the outcome since the team delivered what was agreed in the sprint planning","Create a record in the issue register and escalate the issue to the project steering committee","Ask the project team to address the product owner's issues since the product owner is responsible for the scope in agile","Organize a sprint retrospective and discuss the issues and how they can be avoided in the next sprint"],"c":[3],"f":"During the Sprint Retrospective, the team discusses: What went well in the Sprint. What could be improved? What will we commit to improve in the next Sprint so the best option \" Organize a sprint retrospective and discuss the issues and how they can be avoided in the next sprint\".","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":767}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":667,"q":"A junior project manager was recently hired to lead a complex project scheduled to kick off in 2 weeks. The junior project manager was introduced to another project manager for mentoring .Which two benefits will the junior project manager realize by being assigned to a mentor? (Choose two).","t":"M","o":["The mentor can provide past project documentation with early warning indicators that potential problems could occur","The mentor will be immediately available to takeover the project if there are problems or project delays","The mentor will be involved in the decision-making processes implemented by the junior project manager","The junior project manager reports administratively to their mentor so that human resource(HR) questions can be answered quickly.","The mentor will be immediately available to takeover the project if there are problems or project delays"],"c":[0,1],"f":"The two benefits will the junior project manager realize by being assigned to a mentor\n\n1- The junior project manager can discuss certain problems with their mentor without fear of retribution\n\n2- The mentor can provide past project documentation with early warning indicators that potential problems could occur","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8"},{"qa":"بعد اجتماع حالة المشروع، يدرك مدير المشروع أن المشروع ضمن الميزانية، وأن فحوصات الجودة إيجابية، وتباين الجدول الزمني سلبي. كيف يجب على مدير المشروع تأهيل حالة المشروع؟","oa":["قبل الموعد المحدد","متأخر عن الجدول الزمنى","في الموعد المحدد","توقف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":668,"q":"After a project status meeting, the project manager realizes that the project is under budget, quality checks are positive, and the schedule variance is negative. How should the project manager qualify the project status?","t":"S","o":["Ahead of schedule","Behind schedule","On schedule","Stopped"],"c":[1],"f":"The schedule variance is negative, so the project is Behind schedule","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":768}},{"qa":"يواجه الفريق المرن تحديًا يتعلق بجودة مخرجاته. في كل مرة يتم ترقية إحدى الميزات إلى مرحلة الإنتاج، تظهر العديد من العيوب، مما يمنع العملاء من استخدام الحل بشكل صحيح. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذا الوضع في المستقبل؟","oa":["قم بتقليل دورة الإصدار واستثمر المزيد من الوقت في الميزات الحالية بدلاً من إصدار ميزات جديدة","قم بإنشاء برنامج حوافز للفريق بجوائز، مما يسمح لأعضاء الفريق بالعمل الإضافي للعثور على العيوب","قم بتعيين متخصص في ضمان الجودة ودمج المرحلة الثانية من الاختبار في دورة حياة المشروع الحالية","استخدم العرض الاسترجاعي التالي لفهم السبب الجذري لمشاكل الجودة واطلب من الفريق وضع خطة عمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":669,"q":"An agile team is facing a challenge with the quality of its deliverables. Every time a feature is promoted to production, many defects arise, preventing the customers from properly using the solution. What should the project manager do to avoid this situation in the future?","t":"S","o":["Reduce the release cycle and invest more time on the current features instead of releasing new ones","Create a team incentive program with prizes, allowing the team members to work overtime to find defects","Hire a quality assurance specialist and integrate a second phase of testing into the current project life cycle","Use the next retrospective to understand the root cause of the quality issues and have the team come up with an action plan."],"c":[3],"f":"Many defects arise, preventing the customers from properly using the solution so the project manager should Use the next retrospective to understand the root cause of the quality issues and have the team come up with an action plan and to avoid this situation in the future.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":769}},{"qa":"لقد تولى مدير المشروع للتو مشروعًا في مرحلة جمع المتطلبات. يشير أحد المعنيين إلى أنهم لم يتلقوا أي تحديثات للتقدم على الرغم من إرسال التقارير على أساس أسبوعي. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لضمان حصول جميع المعنيين على المعلومات الصحيحة حول المشروع؟","oa":["إنشاء تقارير مرحلية يومية وإرسالها إلى جميع المعنيين","قم بتضمين المعنيين في اجتماعات الحالة الأسبوعية مع الفريق","عقد اجتماع للجنة التوجيهية مع جميع المعنيين لتقديم تحديث شامل عن التقدم المحرز في المشروع","قم بتقييم جميع المعنيين في المشروع وتوثيق طريقة الاتصال المفضلة لديهم وتكرارها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":670,"q":"A project manager has just taken over a project that is in the requirements gathering phase. A stakeholder indicates that they have not received any progress updates even though reports have been sent on a weekly basis. What should the project manager do to ensure all stakeholders are receiving proper information about the project?","t":"S","o":["Create daily progress reports and send them to all stakeholders","Include stakeholders in the weekly status meetings with the team","Hold a steering committee meet ng with all stakeholders to provide a comprehensive update on the project progress","Assess all of the project stakeholders and document their preferred communication method and frequency."],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager to ensure all stakeholders are receiving proper information about the project, he should Assess all of the project stakeholders and document their preferred communication method and frequency.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":770}},{"qa":"بدأ فريق المشروع العمل في مشروع معقد يتضمن تكنولوجيا جديدة كمنتج. الفريق جديد على التكنولوجيا والنهج المقترح. بالإضافة إلى ذلك، يشعر العميل بالقلق بشأن كيفية استلام المنتج في السوق. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمساعدة الفريق والعميل؟","oa":["إدارة المخاطر المرتبطة بالنهج المقترح","ساعد الفريق في تحديد الحد الأدنى من المنتج القابل للتطبيق للتحقق من صحة الافتراضات","التنسيق مع وحدة الأعمال للحصول على المتطلبات التفصيلية","العمل بشكل وثيق مع فريق التسويق في أبحاث السوق وقطاعات المنتجات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":671,"q":"A project team began working on a complex project that involves new technology as a product. The team is new to the technology and the proposed approach. Additionally, the customer is apprehensive about how the product will be received in the market. What should the project manager do to help the team and the customer?","t":"S","o":["Manage the risks associated with the proposed approach.","Assist the team with identifying the minimum viable product(MVP) to validate assumptions.","Coordinate with the business unit to get detailed requirements.","Work closely with the marketing team on market research and product segments."],"c":[1],"f":"The team is new to the technology and the proposed approach in additional to the customer is apprehensive about how the product will be received , so the project manager should Assist the team with identifying the minimum viable product(MVP) to validate assumptions.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":771}},{"qa":"يقود مدير المشروع مشروعًا سيتم تسليمه باستخدام إطار عمل Scrum. تمتلك المنظمة مكتبًا مبتكرًا لإدارة المشاريع (PMO) يدعم بشكل كامل Agile ولديه أيضًا فريق مشتريات ودود للغاية. يجب إشراك بائع جديد لتوفير المزيد من المطورين لمنصة إعداد التقارير الجديدة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["استشر فريق التطوير وقم بإشراك البائع الموصى به من قبلهم","استخدم نهجًا رشيقًا وقم بإشراك البائع الذي قدم أداءً جيدًا في مؤسسة سابقة","استخدم نهجًا رسميًا باستخدام سياسات وإجراءات ونماذج وتعليمات العمل الخاصة بالمشتريات","استشر مالك المنتج واشترك مع البائع الذي يوصي به"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":672,"q":"A project manager is leading a project that will be delivered using a Scrum framework. The organization has an innovative project management office (PMO) that fully supports agile and also has a very friendly procurement team. A new vendor needs to be engaged to provide more developers for a new reporting platform. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Consult the development team and engage a vendor that is recommended by them","Use an agile approach and engage a vendor that delivered well in a previous organization","Use a formal approach using procurement policies, procedures, forms, and work instructions","Consult the product owner and engage a vendor that is recommended by them."],"c":[2],"f":"A new vendor should be engaged as per a formal approach using procurement policies, procedures, forms, and work instructions.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Governance","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":772}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بتنفيذ مشروع برمجي على مستوى المؤسسة. المشروع له تأثير تجاري كبير ويحظى بدعم كامل من الإدارة العليا. ومع ذلك، يواجه مدير المشروع صعوبات في الحصول على دعم العديد من الإدارات الرئيسية. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["إقناع الإدارة العليا بتقديم مكافآت للإدارات المقاومة","افهم مخاوف المستخدمين وأعد النظر في خطة مشاركة المعنيين","مطالبة الإدارة العليا بالتواصل مع هذه الإدارات","قم بتعيين مستشار لإدارة المشروع للمساعدة في حل المشكلة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":673,"q":"A project manager is implementing an enterprise-wide software project. The project has a great business impact and is fully supported by senior management. However, the project manager is facing difficulties getting the support of several key departments. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Convince senior management to introduce rewards to resisting departments","Understand the user concerns and revisit the stakeholder engagement plan","Ask senior management to communicate with these departments","Hire a project management consultant to help resolve the issue"],"c":[1],"f":"The Project manager should Understand the user concerns and revisit the stakeholder engagement plan to get the support of several key departments.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":773}},{"qa":"في مؤسسة تتمتع بتوازن جيد بين العمل والحياة، كان فريق واحد مثقلًا بشكل مستمر، مما أدى إلى تسليم المنتج في وقت متأخر وبجودة رديئة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["طلب استبدال بعض أعضاء الفريق","طلب الإدارة لفريق عالي الأداء","اطلب من الفريق العمل أكثر للتسليم في الوقت المحدد","اطلب من الفريق التركيز على القيام بتخطيط أفضل"],"rat":null,"fa":"نظرًا لعدم وجود تخطيط جيد، كان أحد الفريقين مثقلًا بشكل مستمر، وبالتالي تسليم المنتج متأخرًا بجودة رديئة، لذا يجب على مدير المشروع أن يطلب من الفريق التركيز على القيام بتخطيط أفضل.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":674,"q":"In an organization with a good work-life balance, one team was continuously overloaded, thereby delivering the product late with poor quality. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Request the replacement of certain team members","Request management for a high-performing team","Request the team to work more for on-time delivery","Request the team to focus on doing better planning"],"c":[3],"f":"Because there isnot good planning ,one team was continuously overloaded, thereby delivering the product late with poor quality so the project manager should request the team to focus on doing better planning.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":774}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بإحضار عضو جديد في الفريق من بيئة رشيقة للعمل في بيئة تنبؤية. يتوقع مدير المشروع الاستفادة من الخبرة الرشيقة لعضو الفريق الجديد مع أعضاء الفريق الحاليين. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لدمج عضو الفريق الجديد بفعالية؟","oa":["حدد التوقعات مع عضو الفريق الجديد واشرح له ما هو مطلوب","ندرك أن تعيين هذا الموظف الجديد يشكل خطرا على الفريق الحالي","يجتمع مع جميع أعضاء الفريق ويشرح موقف الموظف الجديد","تدريب عضو الفريق الجديد على النهج التنبؤي لإدارة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":675,"q":"A project manager brings in a new team member from an agile environment to work in a predictive environment. The project manager expects to leverage the new team member's agile experience with the existing team members.\nWhat should the project manager do to integrate the new team member effectively?","t":"S","o":["Set expectations with the new team member and explain what is needed","Acknowledge that hiring this new employee is a risk to the existing team","Meet with all team members and explain the new employee's position.","Train the new team member in the predictive project management approach."],"c":[0],"f":"A new team member worked in agile environment and he will transfer to work in predictive environment so the project manager should set expectations with the new team member and explain what is needed to integrate the new team member effectively","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":775}},{"qa":"في مشروع يستخدم نهجًا مختلطًا، كان أداء الفريق ممتازًا باستمرار خلال المراحل التنبؤية. ومع ذلك، عندما بدأت التكرارات، بدأ أعضاء الفريق في إظهار علامات انخفاض الالتزام مع وجود صراعات وارتباك بين الفريق ، مما أدى إلى انخفاض الروح المعنوية. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله للتعامل مع هذا الموقف؟","oa":["تحديد أعضاء الفريق الذين يؤثرون على الروح المعنوية المنخفضة","أداء أنشطة بناء الفريق وتعزيز التعاون","منح أعضاء الفريق المزيد من السلطة لاتخاذ القرارات","تدريب أعضاء الفريق على العمليات والمعرفة الرشيقة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":676,"q":"In a project using a hybrid approach, the performance of the team was consistently excellent during the predictive stages. When the iterations began, however, the team members started to show signs of low commitment, conflicts, and confusion, resulting in low morale. What should the project manager do to handle this situation?","t":"S","o":["Identify the team members who are impacting low morale.","Perform team-building activities and enhance collaboration","Give team members more authority to make decisions.","Coach the team members on agile processes and knowledge"],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword (When the iterations began, the team members started to show signs of low commitment)\nSO the project manager should Coach the team members on agile processes and knowledge to fill this gap.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":776}},{"qa":"قدم مالك المنتج سجل اعمال المنتج إلى الفريق، وأثار الفريق مخاوف بشأن تنفيذ بعض الميزات بسبب عوائق مختلفة. ما الذي يجب أن يقترحه مدير المشروع على مالك المنتج أن يفعله بعد ذلك؟","oa":["تقدير الأثر المالي للعوائق وطلب تمويل إضافي","ابدأ بإزالة العوائق، بدءًا بالأسهل أولاً، لتعزيز إنجازات الفريق","التقاط العوائق وإبلاغ الإدارة بأن مساعدتهم مطلوبة في حل العوائق","تأكد من التقاط العوائق وترتيب أولوياتها بناءً على الميزات الأعلى قيمة"],"rat":null,"fa":"يجب أن يقترح مدير المشروع على مالك المنتج التأكد من التقاط العوائق وترتيب أولوياتها بناءً على الميزات الأعلى قيمة لتقليل مخاوف الفريق بشأن تنفيذ بعض الميزات بسبب العوائق المختلفة.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":677,"q":"A product owner presented the backlog to the team, and the team raised concerns over implementing some of the features due to various impediments. What should the project manager suggest that the product owner do next?","t":"S","o":["Estimate the financial impact of the impediments and request additional funding","Begin to remove the impediments, starting with the easiest ones first, to foster team accomplishment","Capture the impediments and inform management that their assistance is needed in resolving the impediments","Ensure that the impediments are captured and prioritized based upon the highest valued features"],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should suggest that the product ownerEnsure that the impediments are captured and prioritized based upon the highest valued features to reduce team concerns over implementing some of the features due to various impediments.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":777}},{"qa":"يستمر أحد المعنيين في المطالبة بإجراء تغييرات على نطاق المشروع لا تتوافق مع متطلبات المشروع الأصلية. تم طلب أحد التغييرات قبل شهر واحد من تاريخ إطلاق المشروع. ومن المتوقع أن يتسبب هذا التغيير في تأخيرات كبيرة في المشروع. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["الاستمرار في تاريخ الإطلاق وفقًا لخطة إدارة المشروع المعتمدة","إبلاغ اللجنة التوجيهية للمشروع بمخاطر تأخير المشروع","قم بتحديث مستند إدارة التغيير","تقديم طلب تغيير إلى لجنة التحكم في التغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":678,"q":"A certain stakeholder keeps asking for changes to the project scope that are not consistent with the original project requirements. One of the changes was requested one month before the project launch date. This change is projected to cause significant project delays. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Continue with the launch date as per the approved project management plan.","Inform the project steering committee about the project delay risk.","Update the change management document.","Submit a change request to the change control board (CCB)."],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword (changes to the project scope - cause significant project delays ) .. The project manager should Submit a change request to the change control board (CCB) for reviewing and approval.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Scope","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":778}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في مشروع بناء. المشروع قبل الموعد المحدد وتحت الميزانية. ثم يقترح أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين إجراء تغيير ليشمل ميزة ذات قيمة مضافة لن تؤثر على الجدول الزمني للمشروع وتكلفته. ماذا يجب ان تفعل بعد ذلك؟","oa":["أخبر المعنيين بأنه لا ينبغي تنفيذ التغييرات عندما يكون المشروع متأخرًا عن الجدول الزمني","تقييم تأثير التغيير مع الفريق","قم بتحديث خطة إدارة المشروع لتشمل الميزة الجديدة","أخبر المعنيين أنه ستتم إضافة الميزة نظرًا لأن المشروع أقل من الميزانية"],"rat":null,"fa":"لا يؤثر التغيير على الجدول الزمني والتكلفة ولكن يجب على مدير المشروع تقييم تأثير التغيير مع الفريق على قيود المشروع الأخرى.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":679,"q":"You are a project manager in a construction project. The project is ahead of schedule and under budget. A key stakeholder then suggests a change to include a value-added feature that wouldn't impact project schedule and cost. What should you do next?","t":"S","o":["Advise the stakeholder that changes shouldn't be implemented when a project is behind schedule.","Evaluate the change's impact with the team.","Update the project management plan to include the new feature.","Advise the stakeholder that, since the project is under budget, the feature will be added"],"c":[1],"f":"The change does not impact the schedule and cost but the project manager should Evaluate the change's impact with the team on other project constraints.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Schedule","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":779}},{"qa":"يريد مدير المشروع قياس السرعة كمؤشر على تقدم الفريق الرشيق. أي من المقاييس التالية من الأفضل أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع لهذا الغرض؟","oa":["عدد التكرارات التي أكملها الفريق لكل إصدار","عدد نقاط قصة المستخدم التي أكملها الفريق لكل تكرار","عدد نقاط القصة المخطط إكمالها في التكرار التالي","عدد نقاط قصة المستخدم التي أكملها الفريق يوميًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":680,"q":"A project manager wants to measure velocity as the indicator of the agile team's progress. Which of the following metrics is best for the project manager to use for this purpose?","t":"S","o":["The number of iterations completed by the team per release","The number of user story points completed by the team per iteration","The number of story points planned to be completed in the next iteration","The number of user story points completed by the team per day"],"c":[1],"f":"Velocity is typically calculated as the sum of story points sizes for the features actually completed during an iteration. Agile Practice Guide -PMI, Page(s) 61, 64","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":780}},{"qa":"---------- يمكن تعريفها على أنها تقنية لتطبيق Scrum على نطاق واسع لفرق متعددة تعمل على نفس المنتج، وتنسيق المناقشات حول التقدم المحرز في اعتمادياتها المتبادلة، والتركيز على كيفية دمج تسليم البرامج، خاصة في مجالات التداخل.","oa":["سكروم","سكروم واسع النطاق (LeSS)","سكروم موحد","مجموعة سكروم الشاملة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":681,"q":"------------------- can be defined as a technique to operate Scrum at scale for multiple teams working on the same product, coordinating discussions of progress on their inter-dependencies, and focusing on how to integrate the delivery of software, especially in areas of overlap.","t":"S","o":["Scrum","Large Scale Scrum (LeSS)","Unified scrum","Scrum of scrums"],"c":[3],"f":"Scrum of Scrums: A technique to operate Scrum at scale for multiple teams working on the same product, coordinating discussions of progress on their interdependencies, and focusing on how to integrate the delivery of software, especially in areas of overlap. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, page 154].","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":781}},{"qa":"أنت تدير مشروع بناء كبير. يعمل فريق المشروع الخاص بك في مبنيين مختلفين في جميع أنحاء المدينة. تريد توصيل الرؤية وإلهام فريق المشروع لتحقيق الأداء العالي. أي من المهارات التالية تساعد مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تعليق","الذكاء العاطفي","الوعي السياسي","القيادة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":682,"q":"You are managing a large construction project. Your project team works in two different buildings across the city. You want to communicate the vision and inspire the project team to achieve high performance. Which of the following skills help the project manager?","t":"S","o":["Feedback","Emotional intelligence","Political awareness","Leadership"],"c":[3],"f":"Successful projects require leaders with strong leadership skills. Leadership is the ability to lead a team and inspire them to do their jobs well. It encompasses a wide range of skills, abilities, and actions. Leadership is important through all phases of the project life cycle. There are multiple leadership theories defining leadership styles that should be used as needed for each situation or team. It is especially important to communicate the vision and inspire the project team to achieve high performance.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":782}},{"qa":"أثناء اجتماع الفريق، لا يظل أعضاء فريقك في صلب الموضوع وغالبًا ما يقاطعون بعضهم البعض. يؤدي هذا إلى أن يستغرق الاجتماع وقتًا أطول من المخطط له. كمدير مشروع، ماذا يجب أن تفعل؟","oa":["تنفيذ القواعد العامة","مشاركة أعضاء الفريق في مكان مناسب للفريق","توجيه الاجتماعات","إدارة قنوات الاتصال بشكل أفضل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":683,"q":"During a team meeting, your team members don't remain on topic and often interrupt each other. This causes the meeting to take longer than planned. As a project manager, what should you do?","t":"S","o":["Conduct the ground rules.","Co-locate the team members in a place which is suitable to team","Direct the meetings.","Better manage the communication channels"],"c":[0],"f":"Ground rules, defined in the team charter are established to set clear expectations regarding acceptable behavior by the project team members. So the project manager should Escalate ground rule to comply bt team members and remain on topic and do not interrupt each other.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":783}},{"qa":"مارك يدير مشروع بناء المطار. ويقوم حاليًا بتقييم جوانب المعنيين مثل مصالحهم وحقوقهم وملكيتهم ومعرفتهم ومساهماتهم. ما هي التقنية التي تفضلها لحل هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["تحليل السبب الجذري","خرائط المعنيين باستخدام نموذج البروز","تحليل المعنيين","خطة إشراك المعنيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":684,"q":"Mark is managing an airport construction project. He is currently assessing stakeholder aspects like their interests, rights, ownership, knowledge, and contributions. What will be your preference of technique to work this out?","t":"S","o":["Root cause analysis","Stakeholder mapping using salience model","Stakeholder analysis","Stakeholder engagement plan"],"c":[2],"f":"Stakeholder analysis results in a list of stakeholders and relevant information such as their positions in the organization, roles on the project, \"stakes,\" expectations, attitudes (their levels of support for the project), and their interest in information about the project. Stakeholders' stakes can include but are not limited to a combination of interest, Rights, contribution and ownership.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"Bank","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":784}},{"qa":"خلال مرحلة البدء، يقوم مدير المشروع بتصنيف قائمة المعنيين (اصحاب المصلحة) في المشروع ويكتشف المعنيين المهتمين الذين يتمتعون بسلطة قليلة. كيف ينبغي إدارة المعنى هذا؟","oa":["إبقاءه على اطلاع","متابعتهم","الادارة عن قرب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":685,"q":"During the initiation phase, the project manager classifying a list of project stakeholders and discovers an interested stakeholder with little authority. How should manage this stakeholder?","t":"S","o":["Keep informed","Monitor","Manage Closely"],"c":[0],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam\n\nThe stakeholder is interested in the project with little authority so you will keep him informed.\n\nSakeholder analysis, stakeholders are assessed based on two primary dimensions:\n\n \n Power (influence/authority)\n \n \n Interest (level of involvement or concern)\n \n\nIf a stakeholder has high interest but low power, the correct engagement strategy is to:\n\n👉 Keep Informed\n\n \n Ensure they are regularly updated with relevant information.\n \n \n Engage them as needed to maintain their support and interest.\n \n \n They may influence others or become more powerful in the future.\n \n\n 📚 Reference:\n \n \n PMBOK® Guide – 6th Edition, Chapter 13: Project Stakeholder Management\n \n \n Stakeholder Engagement Assessment Matrix (Power/Interest Grid)","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":785}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لمشروع تطوير البنية التحتية. أحد المعنيين غير المحددين ليس سعيدًا بأداء مشروعك. لقد طلب بعض التحديثات لتنفيذ المشروع. كمدير للمشروع، ما الذي يجب عليك فعله بعد ذلك؟","oa":["تنفيذ التغيير","إصدار طلب تغيير الى لجنة التحكم فى التغيير  (CCB)","تحديث سجل المعنيين","تحليل تأثير الطلب على المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":686,"q":"You are a Project Manager for an infrastructure development project. An unidentified stakeholder is not happy with your project performance. He has asked for some updates to perform on the project. As a project manager, what should you do next?","t":"S","o":["Implement the change","Issue a change request to change control board (CCB)","Update stakeholder register","Analyze the impact of the request on the project"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword (Unidentified stakeholder) you should first update the stakeholder register.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":786}},{"qa":"عندما ينضم أحد المعنيين المؤثرين الجدد إلى المنظمة وسيكون مسؤولاً عن بعض جوانب المشروع. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله أولاً لإشراك المعنيين هذا بشكل فعال؟","oa":["قم بتحديث مخطط راسى بمسؤوليات المعنى الجدد","مراجعة مصفوفة تقييم مشاركة المعنيين","تقديم طلب تغيير لتحديث خطة مشاركة المعنيين","حدد موعدًا لعقد اجتماع مع المعنى الجديد في المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":687,"q":"When a new influential stakeholder joins the organization and will be responsible for a few aspects of the project. What should the project manager do first to engage this stakeholder effectively?","t":"S","o":["Update the RACI chart with the responsibilities of the new stakeholder","Revise the stakeholder engagement assessment matrix","Submit a change request to update the stakeholder engagement plan","Schedule a meeting with the new project stakeholder"],"c":[3],"f":"The Manage Stakeholder Engagement process is the process of communicating and working with stakeholders to meet their needs and expectations, address issues, and foster the appropriate stakeholder involvement. In order to effectively manage the new stakeholder's level of engagement, the project manager must understand, among other things, the stakeholder's requirements and expectations. Meeting with the stakeholder provides an opportunity for the project manager to establish a relationship and gather the necessary information from the stakeholder to engage him effectively. Therefore, of the available options, the first thing for the project manager to do is meet with the stakeholder to learn the stakeholder's requirements and expectations for the project. The incorrect answer choices represent actions that may not be necessary, or the project manager does not have enough information to perform at this point.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":787}},{"qa":"يقوم أعضاء فريق المشروع بتطوير وثيقة تصف القيم المهمة لنجاح الفريق مثل مشاركة أفضل الممارسات، والاستماع لبعضهم البعض بعقل متفتح، والتواصل باحترام أثناء الاجتماعات. أي مما يلي يصف هذه الوثيقة؟","oa":["خطة إدارة الموارد","ميثاق الفريق","تقويمات الموارد","خطة إدارة الاتصالات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":688,"q":"Project team members are developing a document that describes values that are important to the team's success such as sharing best practices, listening to each other with an open mind, and communicating respectfully during meetings. Which of the following describes this document?","t":"S","o":["Resource management plan","Team charter","Resource calendars","Communication management plan"],"c":[1],"f":"The team charter is a document that records the team values, agreements, and operating guidelines, as well as establishing clear expectations regarding acceptable behavior by project team members.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":788}},{"qa":"بعد اجتماع إداري رفيع المستوى، يطلب المدير الذي يرأس الاجتماع من مدير المشروع توثيق عناصر العمل وإبلاغها إلى جميع المعنيين . مدير المشروع هو جزء من ________ منظمة","oa":["مصفوفة متوازنة","مصفوفة قوية","مصفوفة ضيقة","مصفوفة ضعيفة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":689,"q":"After a high-level management meeting, the manager chairing the meeting asks the Project Manager to document and communicate the action items to all the stakeholders. The Project Manager is part of a________________ organization.","t":"S","o":["Balanced Matrix","Strong Matrix","Tight Matrix","Weak Matrix"],"c":[3],"f":"The Project Manager is part of a weak matrix organization and is playing the role of project expeditor. The project expeditor acts primarily as a staff assistant and communication coordinator. The expeditor personally cannot make or enforce decisions.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":789}},{"qa":"أنت تعمل مع اثنين من شركاء البحث لتحديد ما إذا كان تنفيذ نظام WiFi في الحي سيفيد السكان. وكجزء من هذا الجهد، ستعمل مع السلطات للحصول على المستندات الحكومية ذات الصلة. ستقوم أيضًا بإجراء استطلاع شامل حول كيفية استخدام الأشخاص للنظام وإنشاء تقارير من الاستطلاع. ماذا تسمي هذا الجهد؟","oa":["دراسة بحثية","عملية","استبيان","مشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":690,"q":"You are working with a couple of research associates to determine if implementing a WiFi system in the neighborhood is going to benefit residents. As part of this effort, you will be working with authorities to get related government documents. Also, you will do an extensive survey on how people will be using the system and create reports from the survey. What do you call this effort?","t":"S","o":["A Research Study","An Operation","A Survey","A Project"],"c":[3],"f":"Every project generates a unique product, service, or result. This is a project because it is generating a unique result (knowledge and documentation) and it is temporary. Although not stated explicitly in the question description, the project time-constrained or there is a timeline wherein project tasks will be considered completed (i.e. WiFi system implemented, obtained government-related documents, survey complete, and reports created.)","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":790}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي يصف بشكل أفضل دور راعي المشروع؟","oa":["راعي المشروع هو المسؤول عن إدارة المشروع","راعي المشروع مسؤول عن إدارة جودة التسليمات","راعي المشروع مسؤول عن تحديد المعنيين الرئيسيين","راعي المشروع هو المسؤول عن توفير التمويل للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":691,"q":"Which of the following best describes the role of a project sponsor?","t":"S","o":["Project Sponsor is responsible for managing the project","Project Sponsor is responsible for managing the quality of deliverables","Project Sponsor is responsible for identifying key stakeholders","Project Sponsor is responsible for providing funding for the project"],"c":[3],"f":"The sponsor provides funding directly or indirectly and is responsible for approving or denying the budget. The project sponsor is also generally the one who approves the Project Charter, but that is not mentioned in the question.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":791}},{"qa":"في اجتماعات مشروعك، تجد بانتظام أن موظفي المشروع يهزون رؤوسهم ولكنهم لا يتحدثون كثيرًا أو يطرحون الأسئلة. أي من التدريبات التالية سيساعد في تحسين هذا الوضع؟","oa":["التدريب على لغة الجسد","مهارات الاستماع النشط","مهارات التعامل مع الآخرين","مهارات العرض"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":692,"q":"In your project meetings, you regularly find that project staff are nodding their heads but do not speak much or ask questions. Which of the below training will help improve this situation?","t":"S","o":["Body language training","Active listening skills","Interpersonal skills","Presentation skills"],"c":[1],"f":"Active listening related to acknowledging, confirming, clarifying, understanding and removing communication barriers.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":792}},{"qa":"أنت تدير مشروعًا برمجيًا رشيقًا. في السابق، كنت تدير فقط مشاريع غير رشيق . ما نوع الاجتماعات التي تجدها فريدة لمشروعك الحالي مقارنة بمشاريعك السابقة؟","oa":["اجتماعات التكرار","اجتماعات التصميم","اجتماعات مراجعة الجودة","اجتماعات مراجعة أداء البائعين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":693,"q":"You are managing an agile software project. Previously you had managed only non-Agile projects. Which type of meetings would you find to be unique to your current project compared to your earlier projects?","t":"S","o":["Sprint meetings","Design meetings","Quality review meetings","Vendor performance review meetings"],"c":[0],"f":"Sprint meetings are unique to agile projects.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":793}},{"qa":"أنت تدير مشروعًا متعدد الجنسيات مع أعضاء فريق من بلدان مختلفة ومناطق زمنية مختلفة. في هذا السيناريو، ترغب في اختيار وسائط الاتصال الأكثر كفاءة لمتطلبات المشروع. ما هي الطريقة الأنسب لمعالجة هذا؟","oa":["ناقش متطلبات الاتصال والخيارات المتاحة مع المعنيين للحصول على مدخلاتهم","استخدم مزيجًا من تكنولوجيا الاتصالات كما هو الحال في مشروع اقرانك","استكشف أدوات الاتصال المتاحة في السوق، واطلب عرض أسعار حصريًا لمشروعك بدلاً من استخدام الأداة الموجودة في المؤسسة","استخدم التقنية الأكثر فعالية من حيث التكلفة، وأشرك الجميع في شرح استخدامها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":694,"q":"You are managing a multinational project with team members across different countries and varying time zones. In this scenario, you wish to choose a communication media which is most efficient to project requirements. What should be the most appropriate way to address this?","t":"S","o":["Discuss the communication requirements and the available options with stakeholders to seek their inputs","Use a combination of communication technology as is done in your peer's project","Explore communication tools available in the market, and ask for quotation exclusively for your project instead of using existing tool in the organization","Use the most cost effective technique, and involve everyone to explain its usage"],"c":[0],"f":"It is important to have effective communication media in this project, especially considering the team is in different geographical locations and communication requirements are complex. It is best to take input from the stakeholders of the project and understand their communication requirements before finalizing a technique.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":794}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المحفظة بإبلاغ مدير المشروع بإنهاء مشروعه. مدير المشروع يريد إبلاغ المعنيين وأعضاء الفريق حول هذا الموضوع. ما هي الوثيقة التي يجب على مدير المشروع الرجوع إليها؟","oa":["خطة إدارة التغيير","خطة إدارة الاتصالات","خطة إدارة الموارد","مصفوفة تعيينات المسؤولية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":695,"q":"A portfolio manager informs the project manager that their project was terminated. The project manager wants to inform\nthe stakeholders and team members about this. To what document should the project manager refer?","t":"S","o":["Change Management Plan.","Communication management plan.","Resources Management Plan","Responsibility assignments matrix (RAM)."],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword (inform) The project manager should refer to the Communication management plan to inform the stakeholders and team members about the project's termination decision. Because the Communication management plan includes who & when & why should send the information.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":795}},{"qa":"بعد إجراء تحليل البيانات، يحدد مدير المشروع سبب ودرجة التباين المرتبط بالنطاق المعتمد. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله بعد ذلك؟","oa":["قم بمراجعة خط الأساس للنطاق","تغيير خط الأساس لقياس الأداء","قرر ما إذا كان الإجراء التصحيحي أو الوقائي مطلوبًا","تحديث خطة إدارة النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":696,"q":"After conducting data analysis, a project manager determines the cause and degree of variance relatives to the approved scope. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Revise the scope baseline.","Change the performance measurement baseline.","Decide if a corrective or preventative action is required.","Updates the scope management plan."],"c":[2],"f":"Important aspects of project scope control include determining the cause and degree of variance relative to the scope baseline and deciding whether corrective or preventive action is required.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Scope","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":796}},{"qa":"قام مدير المشروع بتسليم تسليم رئيسي للمشروع. يعود العميل بعد أسبوع من الإصدار قائلًا إنه غير راضٍ تمامًا عن التسليم. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله بعد ذلك؟","oa":["التأكد من أن التسليمات القادمة تحتوي على الميزات التي حددها العميل وتتجاوز توقعاته","استمر في التسليم التالي حيث يجب الانتهاء من المشروع في الوقت المحدد","قم بإجراء التحقق من نطاق هذا الناتج للتحقق مما إذا كان يلبي أهداف المشروع","تحدث إلى المدير الأول لمناقشة مخاوف العملاء وحلها"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":697,"q":"A Project Manager has delivered a major deliverable of the project. The customer comes back a week after the release saying that he is not entirely satisfied with the deliverable. What should the Project Manager do NEXT?","t":"S","o":["Ensure that the next deliverables have the features that the customer specified and exceed his expectations","Continue with the next deliverable as the project has to be finished on time","Do a scope verification of this deliverable to check if it satisfies project objectives","Talk to the Senior Manager to discuss the customer concern and resolution"],"c":[2],"f":"Verifying the project scope includes reviewing deliverables to ensure that each is completed satisfactorily. If this is successful, it should provide customer satisfaction","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Scope","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":797}},{"qa":"يستخدم مدير المشروع الجدول الزمني من مشروع مماثل لتقدير تكلفة أنشطة المشروع لمشروع جديد. ما الطريقة التي تم استخدامها لاستخلاص التقديرات؟","oa":["استشارة خبير","تقدير البارامترية","تقدير من أسفل إلى أعلى","تقدير مماثل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":698,"q":"A project manager uses the schedule from a similar project to estimate the cost of the project activities for a new project. Which method was used to derive the estimates?","t":"S","o":["Expert judgement.","Parametric estimating.","Bottom-up estimating.","Analogous estimating."],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword ( uses the schedule from a similar project ) Analogous estimates are usually done in the initial stages of the project when limited information is known. They use historical information and expert judgment. Analogous cost estimating is generally less costly and time-consuming compared to other methods, but it is also less accurate.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Schedule","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":798}},{"qa":"أي من العمليات التالية تختص بمقارنة نتائج العمل بمتطلبات الجودة للتأكد من أن النتيجة مقبولة؟","oa":["إدارة الجودة","التحكم بالنطاق","التحقق من صحة النطاق","مراقبة الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":699,"q":"Which of the following processes are concerned with comparing the work results with the quality requirements to ensure the result is acceptable?","t":"S","o":["Manage Quality","Control Scope","Validate Scope","Control Quality"],"c":[3],"f":"Control Quality is concerned with comparing the work results with the quality requirements to ensure the result is acceptable.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":799}},{"qa":"لتحسين جودة مخرجات المشروع، يقرر مدير المشروع إشراك فريق المشروع في تحديد معايير المشروع وسياساته وإرشاداته. يعتقد الفريق أن هذا مضيعة للجهد، ويرغب في الاستمرار في تنفيذ المشروع كما هو مخطط له. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله بعد ذلك؟","oa":["انشاء خطة إدارة الجودة وتوزيعها على المعنيين","الاجتماع مع أعضاء الفريق الفردي، وإجبارهم على الامتثال","قم بتسجيل المشكلة مع الفريق ومناقشتها مع قسم الموارد البشرية.","تنظيم اجتماع لفريق المشروع لخلق رؤية مشتركة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":700,"q":"To improve the quality of project deliverables, the project manager decides to involve the project team in defining project standards, policies, and guidelines. The team thinks that this a waste of effort, and would like to continue to execute the project as planned. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Produce the quality management plan, and distribute it to stakeholders.","Meet with individual team members, and force them to comply.","Log an issue with the team and discuss it with the human resources department.","Organize a project team meeting to create a shared vision."],"c":[3],"f":"The project manager should Organize a project team meeting to create a shared vision and the importance of the quality of the project deliverable and this is not a waste of effort and should defining project standards, policies, and guidelines To improve the quality of the project deliverables. The next step Produce the quality management plan, and distribute it to stakeholders.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP-Exam 6","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":800}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع في مشروع تكنولوجيا المعلومات. أثناء نشر نظام جديد، يحدث انقطاع غير متوقع للطاقة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["إجراء تحليل نوعي للمخاطر","الرجوع إلى سجل المخاطر وإبلاغ المعنيين الرئيسيين","احتمالية المخاطر وتقييم الأثر","تصنيف المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":701,"q":"You are a project manager in an IT project. During the deployment of a new system, an unexpected power outage occurs. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Perform a qualitative risk analysis","Refer to the risk register and inform key stakeholders","Risk probability and impact assessment","Risk categorization"],"c":[1],"f":"As an unexpected power outage occurs, the project manager should first Refer to the risk register and inform key stakeholders to handle this scenario. Risk categorization and Risk probability and impact assessment are T&T in Perform a qualitative risk analysis process, therefore they can be excluded.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":801}},{"qa":"أي من العمليات التالية يجب على مدير المشروع تنفيذها لتجنب زحف النطاق الناجم عن التغييرات غير المنضبطة؟","oa":["تنفيذ عملية التحليل النوعي للمخاطر","تنفيذ عملية التحكم المتكامل في التغيير","التحقق من صحة عملية النطاق","عملية مراقبة الجودة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":702,"q":"Which of the following Processes must the project manager perform to avoid scope creep caused by uncontrolled changes?","t":"S","o":["Perform Qualitative Risk Analysis Process","Perform integrated change control process","Validate Scope Process","Control Quality Process"],"c":[1],"f":"The uncontrolled expansion to product or project scope without adjustments to time, cost, and resources is referred to as scope creep. Change is inevitable, so the project manager must perform all changes through the Integrated Change Control process to avoid scope creep caused by uncontrolled changes.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Scope","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":802}},{"qa":"أثناء المشروع، يدرك مدير المشروع أن صاحب المصلحة الجديد مهتم بالمشروع ويريد التأكد من أن صاحب المصلحة على دراية كاملة بأهداف المشروع وغاياته ومخاطره. كمدير للمشروع، ما الذي يجب عليك فعله لتعزيز نجاح المشروع؟","oa":["أضف صاحب المصلحة الجديد إلى خطة إدارة الاتصالات","جدولة اجتماع مع المعنيين الجدد","تحديث خطة مشاركة المعنيين","شارك تقارير حالة المشروع مع أصحاب المصلحة الجدد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":703,"q":"During a project, a project manager realizes that a new stakeholder is interested in the project and wants to ensure the stakeholder is fully aware of the goals, objectives, and risks of the project. As a project manager, what should you do to enhance the success of the project?","t":"S","o":["Add the new stakeholder to the communications management plan","Schedule a meeting with the new stakeholder","Update the stakeholder engagement plan","Share the project status reports with the new stakeholder"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword ( a project manager realizes) so the project manager already classified the stakeholders that he is an interested stakeholder. so the next step is to Update the stakeholder engagement plan based on his needs, expectations, interests, and potential impact on the project to enhance the success of the project.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":803}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لخط إنتاج رقمي جديد، والذي تأمل الشركة أن يعزز إيراداتها. المنتج معقد ويتطلب تعليقات العملاء لتحسين المنتج باستمرار. يتم التعامل مع المشروع من قبل فريق رشيق متعدد الوظائف. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لضمان تسليم القيمة بسرعة؟","oa":["تحديد المهام التي يمكن تشغيلها بالتوازي لتسليم المشروع بشكل أسرع","اطلب زيادة في الميزانية لدفع رواتب الخبراء المتخصصين بالإضافة إلى الوقت","اطلب من راعي المشروع توفير موارد إضافية لتسريع المشروع","خطط للمشروع لتقديم القيمة بشكل تدريجي من خلال الإصدارات المنتظمة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":704,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to a new digital product line, which the company hopes will boost their revenue. The product is complex and requires customer feedback to continually refine the product The project is being handled by across-functional agile team. What should the project manager do to ensure value is delivered quickly?","t":"S","o":["Identify tasks that can run in parallel to deliver the project faster","Request a budget increase to pay the subject matter experts (SMEs) moreover time","Ask the project sponsor to provide additional resources to fast-track the project.","Plan the project to deliver value incrementally with regular releases"],"c":[3],"f":"One means of delivering value sooner rather than later is via incremental delivery. Early and regular incremental releases lead to higher customer value and an increased market share.\nDividing the product into increments enables parts or elements of the product to be in the hands of customers prior to full delivery of the product.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":804}},{"qa":"قد سلط فريق المشروع الضوء على قضية رئيسية تتعلق بالأولويات المتضاربة فيما يتعلق ببعض متطلبات المعنيين. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اسمح لفريق المشروع بتحديد المتطلبات الأكثر ملاءمة للمتابعة","قم بالتصعيد إلى مكتب إدارة المشروع  واطلب حلاً للمتطلبات","التفاوض على اتفاقية مشتركة مع أصحاب المصلحة المعنيين فيما يتعلق بالمتطلبات","تحديد أولويات العناصر الأخرى للفريق والتعامل مع المتطلبات المتعارضة لاحقًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":705,"q":"A major issue about conflicting priorities has been highlighted by the project team with regard to a few stakeholder requirements. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Allow the project team to decide what is the most appropriate requirement to follow.","Escalate to the project management office(PMO) and request a solution for the requirements","Negotiate a common agreement with the involved stakeholders regarding the requirements","Prioritize other items for the team and deal with the conflicting requirements later"],"c":[2],"f":"Keyword (conflicting priorities) so the project manager should use negotiation skills so the correct answer \" Negotiate a common agreement with the involved stakeholders regarding the requirements\".","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":805}},{"qa":"يقوم مدير المشروع بمراجعة الدروس المستفادة لمشروع تاريخي. وتوضح المراجعة أن مهندس العميل كان مصراً على مراجعة جميع التغييرات، حتى تلك التي لم يتم تحديدها في العقد. كيف يجب أن يتعامل مدير المشروع مع ذلك عند التخطيط للمشروع؟","oa":["قم بتحديث سجل مخاطر المشروع لتحديد هذه المخاطر ووصف كيفية التخفيف من المشكلة","تأكد من أن خطة إدارة التغيير تسلط الضوء على هذا المطلب لمنع حدوث مشكلات مستقبلية","قم بتحديث ميثاق المشروع بهذه المعلومات المتعلقة بإدارة التغيير","تحدث مع العميل للتأكد من أنه على علم بإجراءات إدارة التغيير"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":706,"q":"A project manager is reviewing the lessons learned for a historical project. The review identifies that the client's engineer was adamant that they review all changes, even those not identified in the contract. How should the project manager deal with this when planning the project?","t":"S","o":["Update the project risk register to identify this risk and describe how to mitigate the issue","Ensure the change management plan highlights this requirement to prevent future issues","Update the project charter with this information regarding change management","Talk with the client to ensure they are aware of the change management procedure"],"c":[1],"f":"The review identifies that the client's engineer was adamant that they review all changes so the project manager should Ensure the change management plan highlights this requirement to prevent future issues.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":806}},{"qa":"يحتاج فريق المشروع إلى اتباع إرشادات الامتثال التنظيمية الإلزامية للمشروع. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لضمان الالتزام بالامتثال؟","oa":["تقييم الامتثال عندما يكون هناك وقت في المشروع","تضمين الامتثال ضمن أدوات التطوير","تعيين أحد أعضاء فريق المشروع لضمان الامتثال","مراجعة الالتزام بالامتثال في نهاية المشروع."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":707,"q":"A project team needs to follow regulatory compliance guidelines that are mandatory for the project. What should the project manager do to ensure compliance adherence?","t":"S","o":["Assess compliance when there is time in the project","Include compliance within the development tools","Assign a project team member to ensure compliance","Review compliance adherence at the end of the project."],"c":[2],"f":"A project team needs to follow regulatory compliance guidelines that are mandatory for the project so the project manager should Assign a project team member to ensure compliance","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":807}},{"qa":"مشروع معقد في مرحلة التنفيذ. لم يوافق أحد أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين الجدد في المشروع على مخرجات المشروع، مما قد يؤثر على التقدم العام. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله بعد ذلك؟","oa":["اجتمع مع أصحاب المصلحة لفهم سبب التأخير","قم بتيسير جلسة عصف ذهني لإيجاد الحلول المحتملة","سجل ذلك في سجل المشكلات وقم بتصعيده إلى راعي المشروع","ناقش الحاجة إلى التأثير على صاحب المصلحة هذا مع الراعي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":708,"q":"A complex project is in the execution phase. A key stakeholder who is new to the project has not been approving project deliverables, which could impact the overall progress. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Meet with the stakeholder to understand what is causing the delays.","Facilitate a brainstorming session to find potential workarounds","Capture this in the issue log and escalate it to the project sponsor.","Discuss the need to influence this stakeholder with the sponsor."],"c":[0],"f":"Keyword (not been approving project deliverables -impact the overall progress) so the project manager should meet with the stakeholder to understand what is causing the delays.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":808}},{"qa":"تقوم المؤسسة باستيراد العديد من المواد اللازمة لبناء المنتج. ونظرًا للتأخير في الشحن العالمي، لم تصل بعض المواد الأساسية بعد. مما أدى إلى عدم القدرة على الانتهاء من بناء المنتج للإصدار القادم. يجتمع مدير المشروع مع أصحاب المصلحة لمناقشة الخيارات. ما الذي يجب أن يوصي به مدير المشروع؟","oa":["طلب تسويق لإطلاق حملة إعلانية للمنتج المتوفر حاليًا","استكشاف ما إذا كان من الممكن توفير المواد محليًا والحصول عليها في الوقت المحدد","التقِ بالفريق الهندسي لتصنيع المواد داخل الشركة","قم بتحديث خطة إدارة المشروع، مع الأخذ في الاعتبار إجازات فريق التجميع لتقليل النفقات"],"rat":null,"fa":"نظرًا لعدم القدرة على الانتهاء من بناء المنتج للإصدار القادم، يجب على مدير المشروع استكشاف ما إذا كان من الممكن توفير المواد محليًا والحصول عليها في الوقت المحدد.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":709,"q":"An organization imports many of the materials for a product build. Due to global shipping delays, some of the essential materials have yet to arrive. resulting in the inability to finish building the product for the upcoming release. The project manager is meeting with stakeholders to discuss options. What should the project manager recommend?","t":"S","o":["Request marketing to launch an advertising campaign for the product that IS currently in stock","Explore if the materials could be supplied locally and obtained on time.","Meet with the engineering team to manufacture the materials in-house","Update the project management plan, factoring in furloughs of the assembly team to reduce expenses"],"c":[1],"f":"Due to the inability to finish building the product for the upcoming release, the project manager should Explore if the materials could be supplied locally and obtained on time.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Artificial Intelligence","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":809}},{"qa":"يشارك فريقان في مشروع عالمي. بعد الإصدار الأول، تم تحديد العديد من المشكلات المتعلقة بالمنتج، والتي كان من الممكن تجنبها بسهولة من خلال التواصل الأفضل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتيسير الاجتماع مع كلا الفريقين حتى يتمكنوا من الاتفاق على القضايا واقتراح الحلول التي تناسب كلا الفريقين","تحسين نظام عقد المؤتمرات عبر الفيديو لتوفير توافر وجودة أفضل من أجل زيادة الاتصالات","اطلب من سفراء الفريق من كل موقع السفر إلى الآخر لتسهيل التواصل وتقليل المشكلات","تحسين نظام البريد الإلكتروني لتوفير توافر وجودة أفضل من أجل زيادة التواصل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":710,"q":"Two teams are engaged in a global project. After the first release, many issues were identified on the product, which could easily have been avoided with better communication. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Facilitate a meeting with both teams so that they can agree on the issues and propose solutions that work for both teams","Improve the videoconferencing system to provide better availability and quality in order to increase communication","Have team ambassadors from each location travel to the other in order to facilitate communication and minimize issues","Improve the Email system to provide better availability and quality in order to increase communication"],"c":[0],"f":"An interactive model of communication is the best communication method to solve problems.\nThe project manager should facilitate a meeting with both teams so that they can agree on the issues and propose solutions that work for both teams","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":810}},{"qa":"مشروع تطوير جديد على وشك البدء، ويعرف مدير المشروع أن العميل ذو الكفاءة العالية يقدم طلبات محددة ومتكررة للغاية في جميع التكرارات. سيتطلب هذا المشروع تنسيق العقد مع أطراف ثالثة، ويجب على مدير المشروع إيجاد طريقة أفضل لإدارة توقعات العملاء والشركاء. ما هي الإستراتيجية التي يجب أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع؟","oa":["العمل بشكل وثيق جدًا مع العميل والأطراف الثالثة لتلبية احتياجاتهم","حدد النطاق والميزات التي سيتم نشرها في العقد بشكل واضح","التركيز على تنفيذ البرامج كحل خدمة للعميل","قم بتغيير تعريفات التسويق وإدارة المنتجات لتلبية احتياجات أصحاب المصلحة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":711,"q":"A new development project is about to start, and the project manager knows that a high-proof customer makes very specific and frequent requests in all sprints. This project will demand contract coordination with third parties, and the project manager must find a better way to manage customer and partner expectations. What strategy should the project manager use?","t":"S","o":["Work very closely with the customer and third parties to meet their needs","Specify the scope and features to be deployed in the contract clearly","Focus on the implementation of software as a service solution for the customer","Change the marketing and product management definitions to meet stakeholder needs"],"c":[0],"f":"The best way to manage customer and partner expectations \"Work very closely with the customer and third parties to meet their needs\"","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":811}},{"qa":"تمت الموافقة للتو على حالة عمل المشروع ويقوم مدير المشروع بإنشاء خطة إدارة المزايا. ومن غير الواضح كيف تتوافق فوائد المشروع مع رؤية المنظمة. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله أولاً للتحقق من التوافق؟","oa":["يجتمع مع راعي المشروع للحصول على مزيد من المعلومات","اطلب من فريق المشروع تأخير البداية أثناء حل المشكلة","اطلب نسخة من سجل افتراضات المشروع لمزيد من المعرفة","التشاور مع أعضاء فريق المشروع للحصول على آرائهم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":712,"q":"A project's business case was just approved and the project manager is creating the benefits management plan. It is unclear how the benefits from the project align with the organization's vision. What should the project manager do first to verify alignment?","t":"S","o":["Meet with the project sponsor to obtain more information.","Ask the project team to delay the kick-off while resolving the concern","Request a copy of the project assumptions log for more insight","Consult with the project team members to gain their opinions"],"c":[0],"f":"To verify alignment with the organization's vision, the project manager should Meet with the project sponsor to obtain more information.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":812}},{"qa":"قامت إحدى الشركات بمشروع تحول كبير استعدادًا للاقتصاد المتغير. أثناء التخطيط لمشروع التحول، يرفض المورد الرئيسي من الموارد البشرية الموافقة على خطة المشروع المقترحة. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لفهم سبب رفض المورد؟","oa":["التحدث مع زميلهم","التواصل مع المشرف عليهم","تحدث مباشرة مع المورد","تنظيم اجتماع للفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":713,"q":"A company has undertaken a large transformation project in preparation for the changing economy. During the planning of the transformation project, the key resource from human resources (HR) refuses to approve the proposed project plan. What should the project manager do to gain an understanding of the cause for the resource's refusal?","t":"S","o":["Speak with their colleague.","Communicate with their supervisor.","Speak directly with the resource","Organize a team meeting"],"c":[2],"f":"As a project manager, you should Speak directly with the resource to understand why he refuses to approve the proposed project plan.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":813}},{"qa":"____________ يسمى أيضًا \"صوت العميل\"؟","oa":["مالك المنتج","سكروم ماستر","فريق التطوير","الراعى او الكفيل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":714,"q":"The ____________ is also called \"the voice of the customer\"?","t":"S","o":["Product Owner","Scrum Master","Development team","Sponsor"],"c":[0],"f":"Because the Product Owner must understand the needs and priorities of the stakeholders, including customers and users, this role is commonly referred to as the Voice of the Customer. It is the needs and priorities of stakeholders that demand flexibility in applying Scrum.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":814}},{"qa":"يطلب أحد المعنيين من جون الأسكرم ماستر (مدير المشروع فى النهج الرشيق) أن يُظهر له أحدث تقرير حالة أسبوعي للتحقق من صحة المشروع ومقدار العمل المتبقي في المشروع. بدلاً من ذلك، يأخذ جون المعنيين إلى جدار الفريق حيث يتم نشر بعض التحديثات ذات الصلة بشكل مستمر. لمعالجة استفسار المعنيين، يشير جون على وجه التحديد إلى","oa":["اتجاه السرعة","سجل أعمال التكرار Sprint backlog","مخطط الحرق التنازلى Burndown chart","لوحة كانبان"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":715,"q":"A stakeholder requests John the Scrum Master, to show him the latest weekly status report to check the project's health and the remaining amount of work in the project. Instead, John takes the stakeholder to the team wall where a few pertinent updates are posted continuously. To address the stakeholder's query, John specifically points out to","t":"S","o":["Velocity trend","Sprint backlog","Burndown chart","Kanban board"],"c":[2],"f":"A burndown chart shows the amount of work that has been completed in a sprint, and the total work remaining.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":815}},{"qa":"إنتاجية أحد المطورين ضعيفة مقارنة بالآخرين بسبب مشكلات الحضور المتكررة. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتحديد الإجراءات التأديبية المناسبة الخاصة بهذا المشروع؟","oa":["مراجعة مخطط RACI","مراجعة سجل المعنيين","مراجعة أصول العملية التنظيمية","التحقق من خطة إدارة الموارد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":716,"q":"One developer's productivity is lacking compared with the others due to repetitive attendance issues. What should the project manager do to determine the appropriate disciplinary actions specific to this project?","t":"S","o":["Review RACI chart","Review the Stakeholder register","Review the organizational process assets","Check the resource management plan"],"c":[3],"f":"The resource management plan provides guidance on various aspects of team development including disciplinary actions as a result of team performance assessments.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":816}},{"qa":"يجري مشروع رشيق تكراره الخامس من أصل ثمانية. أحد المعنيين(اصحاب المصلحه) ليس سعيدًا بالتقدم الذي أحرزه الفريق حتى الآن. تتواصل صاحبة المصلحة مع الفريق وتطلب من الفريق من الآن فصاعدًا إبلاغها بحالة عملهم بشكل مستمر. كيف يجب أن يستجيب القائد الخادم؟","oa":["أقترح أن يقوم أصحاب المصلحة بمراجعة مشعات المعلومات بشكل دوري","قم بدعوة أصحاب المصلحة إلى اجتماعات الوقوف اليومي (اجتماع بدون وقوف)  ومراجعات التكرار وتقييمات باثر رجعى","تزويد أصحاب المصلحة بخط الأساس لقياس الأداء","اشرح لأصحاب المصلحة أن المشاريع الرشيقة لا تشجع على مراقبة التقدم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":717,"q":"An agile project is running its fifth iteration out of eight. A stakeholder is not happy with the progress the team made so far. The stakeholder approaches the team and requests that from now on the team informs her about the status of their work on an ongoing basis. How should a servant leader respond?","t":"S","o":["Suggest that the stakeholder periodically reviews the information radiators.","Invite the stakeholder to the daily standups, iteration reviews, and retrospectives","Provide the stakeholder with the performance measurement baseline.","Explain to the stakeholder that agile projects discourage progress monitoring"],"c":[0],"f":"An information radiator is a visible, physical (or electronic) display that provides project information to the stakeholders enabling up-to-the-minute knowledge sharing without having to disturb the project team. In the reference provided, one of the Agile Manifesto authors, says that an information radiator \"displays information in a place where passersby can see it. With information radiators, the passerby does not need to ask questions; the information simply hits them as they pass by.\" In the scenario provided, an information radiator, such as a Kanban board and/or a burndown chart, can allow the stakeholder to monitor the progress of the user stories being developed by the team. Kanban board can display work in progress at each stage of development. A burndown chart allows seeing how much work remained to be completed in a release or an iteration. Of the choices provided, suggesting that the stakeholder periodically reviews the information radiators would address the stakeholder's request to monitor the status of the team's work on an ongoing basis and is, therefore, the best answer to the question asked.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":817}},{"qa":"خلال العرض التوضيحي لمشروع رشيق. يذكر العميل أن المنتج لا يعكس رؤية المنتج ومتطلباته التي تمت مناقشتها في البداية. يقول العميل أن المنتج يحتاج إلى تغييرات كبيرة قبل أن يصبح مقبولاً. ما الذي كان يمكن أن يمنع هذا الوضع؟","oa":["اتباع عملية مراقبة التغيير الأكثر صرامة في المنظمة","إدارة الصراعات بشكل أكثر كفاءة بين العميل والفريق","عزل فريق التطوير عن المعنيين لتجنب التشتيت","السماح بشفافية أعلى للعمل أمام المعنيين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":718,"q":"During the demo of an agile project. the client states that the product does not reflect the product vision and requirements initially discussed. The client says that the product needs significant changes before it would be acceptable. What might have prevented this situation?","t":"S","o":["Following a more rigorous organization's change control process","Managing conflicts more efficiently between the client and the team","Isolating the development team from stakeholders to avoid distraction","Allowing higher transparency of the work in front of the stakeholders"],"c":[3],"f":"To accelerate the sharing of information among stakeholders, agile methods promote aggressive transparency. For example, agile encourages inviting any stakeholders (which would include the client) to project meetings and reviews to surface as quickly as possible any misalignment, dependency, or other issue related to the changing project. Also, many agile teams post information radiators (project status and progress artifacts) in public spaces for everybody to view.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 9","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":818}},{"qa":"ما هي مسؤولية ScrumMaster؟","oa":["تنسيق الاجتماعات لفريق التطوير والأهداف التي يحددها فريق التطوير لنفسه","تحديد مهام فريق التطوير أثناء التكرار","فرض المقاييس وإدارة أداء فريق التطوير","تعليم سكرم والتأكد من اعتماده واستخدامه بالشكل الصحيح"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":719,"q":"What is the ScrumMaster responsible for?","t":"S","o":["The Development Team's meetings and for the objectives the Development Team outlines for itself.","Defining the Development Team's tasks during the Sprint.","Imposing metrics and managing the performance of the Development Team.","Teaching Scrum and seeing that it is adopted and used correctly."],"c":[3],"f":"The scrum master is responsible for ensuring the Scrum process is upheld and works to ensure the Scrum team adheres to the practices and rules as well as coaches the team on removing impediments. PMI Practice guide page, 101","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":819}},{"qa":"يلاحظ مدير المشروع أن هناك مشاركة ومساهمة محدودة من عضو جديد في الفريق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["كتابة شكوى إلى قسم الموارد البشرية","مراجعة أدوار ومسؤوليات كل عضو في الفريق","ناقش الوضع مع راعي المشروع","تدريب عضو الفريق الجديد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":720,"q":"A project manager notices that there is limited participation and contribution from a new team member. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Write a complaint to the human resources department.","Review the roles and responsibilities of each team member.","Discuss the situation with the project sponsor.","Discipline the new team member."],"c":[3],"f":"Very important question in real exam \n\nThe Project manager should FIRST (Discipline - Correction - Direction ) the new team member because of his limited participation and contribution.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":820}},{"qa":"خلال اجتماعات الفريق المنتظمة، يلاحظ مدير المشروع أن هناك علامات واضحة على وجود صراع وقضايا تتعلق بتعيينات المهام والملكية غير الواضحة. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمعالجة ذلك؟","oa":["اجتمع بشكل فردي مع أعضاء الفريق لفهم الصراعات والقضايا","التحقيق في الطرق الممكنة لتحسين تعاون الفريق والروح المعنوية","تغيير هيكل اجتماعات المشروع العادية لتحسين التواصل","تحديد والحصول على اتفاق بشأن المسؤول المسؤول، والتشاور، وإبلاغ مصفوفة راسى"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":721,"q":"During regular team meetings, the project manager notices that there are clear signs of conflict and issues related to unclear task assignments and ownership. What should the project manager do to address this?","t":"S","o":["Meet individually with team members to understand the conflicts and issues.","Investigate possible ways to improve team collaboration and morale.","Change the structure of the regular project meetings to improve communication.","Define and obtain agreement on a responsible accountable, consult, and inform RACI Matrix."],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword (unclear task assignments and ownership ). A RACI Matrix is a useful tool to use to ensure clear assignment of roles and responsibilities when the team consists of internal and external resources. So the project manager should Define and obtain agreement on a responsible accountable, consult, and inform RACI Matrix to adress this situation.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":821}},{"qa":"بعد شهر واحد من مشروع مدته 12 شهرًا، يقوم البائع بإبلاغ مدير المشروع بأنه سيتم تأخير معدات المشروع المطلوبة. وبعد إجراء مزيد من التحقيق، علم مدير المشروع أن هذا البائع يتمتع بسمعة سيئة في الأداء. ما الذي كان ينبغى على مدير المشروع فعله لمنع ذلك؟","oa":["مراجعة وثائق الدروس المستفادة من المشاريع الأخرى","التحقق من سجل المخاطر المحدث وسجل المشكلات","تضمين احتياطي طوارئ  في الخط المرجعى للجدول الزمني","إضافة بائع احتياطي إلى قائمة البائعين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":722,"q":"One month into a 12-month project., a vendor informs the project manager that required project equipment will be delayed. After further investigation, the project manager learns that this vendor has a reputation for underperforming. What should the project manager have done to prevent this?","t":"S","o":["Reviewed the lessons learned documents from other projects","Check the updated risk register and issue log","Included a contingency buffer in the schedule baseline","Added a backup vendor to the vendor list"],"c":[0],"f":"To prevent this situation, the project manager should have reviewed the lessons learned documents from other projects to know more about the reputation of vendor.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Artificial Intelligence","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":822}},{"qa":"مشروع تطوير البرمجيات الخاص بك في مرحلة البدء. يريد الراعي الاستفادة من الإيرادات المبكرة من التسليم المتزايد ويدفع لاستخدام نهج رشيق. ومع ذلك، فإن الفريق يعارض بشدة رشيقة بسبب الصراع بين أعضاء الفريق. إنهم يصرون على اتباع نهج تنبؤي حتى يتمكنوا من العمل بشكل مستقل مع تعيينات المهام الفردية. ما هو أفضل مسار للعمل لمعالجة هذه الصراعات؟","oa":["حدد نهجًا تنبؤيًا لتجنب الصراع بين أعضاء الفريق","اعتماد إطار عمل أكس بي لأنه يتسم بالمرونة، ولكن أعضاء الفريق يعملون بشكل مستقل","تطبيق نهج رشيق لإدارة المشروع حسب طلب الراعي","يوصي بقيادة المشروع باستخدام نهج إدارة المشروع المختلط"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":723,"q":"Your software development project is in initiation. The sponsor wants to take advantage of early revenue from incremental delivery and pushes to use an agile approach. However, the team is strongly opposed to agile due to strife among the team members. They insist on a predictive approach so they can work independently with individual task assignments. What is your best course of action to address these conflicts?","t":"S","o":["Select a predictive approach to avoid conflict among the team members","Adopt an XP framework since it is agile, but team members work independently","Apply an agile project management approach as requested by the sponsor","Recommend to lead the project using a hybrid project management approach"],"c":[3],"f":"Very important question in real exam \n\nA hybrid approach would provide the opportunity for early revenue generation through incremental delivery as requested by the sponsor while allowing the project team members to work independently with individually assigned tasks.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":823}},{"qa":"باعتبارك خبيرًا في سكروم، فإنك تقوم بتسهيل عرض تقييم تكرار باثر رجعي الذي فشل في تحقيق جميع أهدافه. يتجادل أعضاء فريق التطوير ومالك المنتج حول من المسؤول عن الفشل. بعد إجراء تحليل السبب الجذري، يمكنك الكشف عن مصدر الصراع. مما يلي، ما الذي اكتشفته على الأرجح؟","oa":["لم يتضمن مخطط جانت نقاطًا كافية للقصة","لقد فشلت، بوصفك مدير سكروم، في تعيين قصص المستخدم لفريق التطوير","حدد مالك المنتج عدد قصص المستخدم التي سيتم إكمالها أثناء التكرار","قرر فريق التطوير عدد قصص المستخدمين التي سيتم إكمالها أثناء التكرار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":724,"q":"As a scrum master, you are facilitating a retrospective for a sprint that failed to meet all of its objectives. Members of the development team and the product owner are arguing over who is responsible for the failure. After performing a root cause analysis, you uncover the source of the conflict. Of the following, what did you most likely discover?","t":"S","o":["The Gantt chart did not include enough story points.","You, as the scrum master, failed to assign user stories to the development team.","The product owner determined how many user stories were to be completed during the sprint.","The development team decided how many user stories were to be completed during the sprint."],"c":[2],"f":"When properly using a scrum framework, the product owner prioritizes the user stories in the product backlog. The product owner, however, should not determine 'how many' user stories will be completed during the sprint. Instead, it is the development team members who decide how many user stories they can commit to completing. If the product owner overcommitted the development team, then the sprint will likely fail to meet some or all of its objectives. Additionally, if the product owner assigns the work to the development team, then the team is less likely to be fully committed to completing the sprint objectives. The incorrect answer choices represent the correct application of scrum best practices or are not relevant to scrum.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":824}},{"qa":"كجزء من عملية تقدير مدة النشاط، يقوم مدير المشروع بتسهيل اجتماع تخطيط التكرار مع مالك المنتج وفريق سكرم. يقوم مدير المشروع بتقسيم قصص المستخدم إلى مهام ذات مستوى منخفض، ويقدر الوقت المطلوب بالساعات، ويحدد سجل أعمال التكرار بناءً على قدرة الفريق. على الرغم من التخطيط الدقيق، فشل التكرار . ما الذي كان من الممكن أن يفعله مدير المشروع بشكل مختلف؟","oa":["تم استخدام نقاط القصة بدلاً من الساعات أثناء تقدير حجم قصص المستخدم ومهامه","تمكين الفريق من تحديد عدد قصص المستخدمين التي يمكنهم إكمالها أثناء التكرار","طلب من الفريق تحديد أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج قبل تحديد سجل أعمال التكرار","تم تعيين المهام ذات المستوى المنخفض المحددة لأفراد محددين في الجدول الزمني للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":725,"q":"As part of the Estimate Activity Durations process, the project manager facilitates a sprint planning meeting with the product owner and Scrum team. The project manager breaks down the user stories into low-level tasks, estimates the time required in hours, and determines the sprint backlog based on the team's capacity. Despite meticulous planning, the sprint fails. What might the project manager have done differently?","t":"S","o":["Used story points instead of hours while estimating the size of the user stories and tasks","Empowered the team to determine how many user stories they can complete during the sprint","Asked the team to prioritize the product backlog before determining the sprint backlog","Assigned the identified low-level tasks to specific individuals in the project schedule"],"c":[1],"f":"The scenario suggests a hybrid project management approach is used in the project by incorporating Scrum into a predictive model. In Scrum, the team is empowered to determine how many user stories they can complete during a sprint.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":825}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي يعد من مكونات تقويم الموارد؟ (إختر إثنين.)","oa":["استراتيجيات التدريب","خطط الاعتراف","أيام العمل","توافر الموارد المادية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":726,"q":"Which of the following are components of a Resource Calendar? (Choose two.)","t":"M","o":["Training Strategies","Recognition Plans","Working days","Availability of physical resource"],"c":[2,3],"f":"A resource calendar identifies the working days, shifts, start and end of normal business hours, weekends, and public holidays when each specific resource is available. PMBOK 6th edition page, 323","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":826}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يعمل مع الفريق لتطوير تطبيق برمجي. نظرًا لحالات الفشل التي حدثت في تطبيقات مماثلة في الماضي، فإن التعليقات السريعة من العميل حول مدى ملاءمة التسليمات مهمة جدًا. ما هو النهج الأفضل الذي ينبغي اختياره؟","oa":["تكيفى","شلال","تقليدي","تنبؤي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":727,"q":"A project manager working with the team to develop a software application. Due to failures in similar applications in the past, the rapid feedback from the customer on the suitability of the deliverables is very important. What is the best approach that should be selected?","t":"S","o":["Adaptive","Waterfall","Traditional","Predictive"],"c":[0],"f":"An adaptive approach is a generic term for various project management approaches typically used on agile projects. This approach promotes the work to be undertaken in short cycles so that the results can be reviewed early and adapted as necessary. Of the choices provided, the adaptive approach is the only one that would provide rapid feedback on the suitability of the deliverables making this choice the best answer to the question","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":827}},{"qa":"يتم تعيين مدير المشروع لمشروع في شركة تنتقل إلى نظام Agile. خلال اجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعى، يصبح الاجتماع مثيرًا للجدل قليلاً مع ظهور أولى علامات الصراع بين العديد من أعضاء الفريق. ما هو أفضل مسار للعمل لمدير المشروع؟","oa":["معالجة الوضع خلال الاجتماع لمحاسبة الأفراد المتورطين في الصراع","لا تتدخل إلا إذا أصبح النزاع مدمرًا وخذ قسطًا من الراحة إذا لزم الأمر لمخاطبة الأفراد على انفراد","التدخل الفوري لتجنب المزيد من التصعيد وتلف العلاقات بين أعضاء الفريق","لا تتدخل بغض النظر عما يحدث لأن فرق اجايل تدير نفسها بنفسها ويمكنها التعامل مع أي شيء"],"rat":null,"fa":"الصراع أمر لا مفر منه ويمكن أن يكون مفيدًا للمشروع عندما يعزز مناقشة الفريق ويشجع النقاش. من المهم أن يتم تشجيع حل النزاعات، وتعزيز بيئة مفتوحة حيث يتم تمكين أعضاء الفريق للتعبير عن آرائهم ومخاوفهم بشأن المشروع. ومع ذلك، عندما يصبح الصراع مدمرًا، قد يكون من المناسب والضروري أن يتدخل مدير المشروع. الإجراء المناسب الذي يجب أن يتخذه مدير المشروع في هذه الحالة هو أخذ قسط من الراحة ومخاطبة الأفراد على انفراد. لكن في هذا السيناريو، لا يزال الصراع في بدايته. لا توجد معلومات كافية في السيناريو لتحديد ما إذا كان الصراع سوف يتصاعد ويصبح مدمراً. لذلك، في هذه المرحلة، لا يلزم اتخاذ أي إجراء من سكرم ماستر. لاختيار الإجابة الصحيحة في هذا السؤال بالذات، يجب مقارنة الموقف الموصوف في السيناريو بصيغة الاختيارات المتاحة. \"فقط إذا أصبح الصراع مدمرا\" هو الجزء الأساسي الذي يجعل التدخل فقط إذا أصبح الصراع مدمرا وأخذ قسط من الراحة إذا لزم الأمر لمخاطبة الأفراد على انفراد هو أفضل إجابة على السؤال المطروح.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":728,"q":"A project manager is assigned to a project in a company that is transitioning to agile. During the sprint retrospective meeting, the meeting becomes slightly contentious with the first signs of conflict between several team members. What is the best course of action for the project manager?","t":"S","o":["Address the situation during the meeting to hold the individuals who are involved in the conflict accountable","Intervene only if the conflict becomes destructive and take a break if needed to address individuals privately","Intervene immediately to avoid further escalation and damaged relationships between the team members","Do not intervene regardless of what happens since agile teams are self-managing and can handle anything"],"c":[1],"f":"Conflict is inevitable and can be beneficial to a project when it promotes team discussion and encourages debate. It is important that the resolution of conflicts be encouraged, promoting an open environment where team members are empowered to express their opinions and concerns about the project. However, when conflict becomes destructive, it may be appropriate and necessary for the scrum master to intervene. The appropriate action for the scrum master to take in this circumstance would be to take a break and address individuals in private. In the scenario, however, the conflict is still at its very beginning. There is not enough information in the scenario to determine if the conflict is going to escalate and become destructive. Therefore, at this point, no action is needed from the scrum master. To select the correct answer in this particular question, one should compare the situation described in the scenario with the wording of the available choices. \"Only if the conflict becomes destructive\" is the key part that makes intervening only if the conflict becomes destructive and taking a break if needed to address individuals privately the best answer to the question asked.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 2","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":828}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع للمشروع الداخلي الذي سيقدم أداة جديدة للمؤسسة المنفذة ليستخدمها موظفوها. حدث صراع بين فريق المشروع ومدير التدريب. يريد الفريق استخدام دورات تطوير قصيرة للحصول على تعليقات مبكرة وإدارة المعدل المرتفع للتغيير القادم من الموظفين. ومن ناحية أخرى، يصر مدير التدريب على إنشاء خطة تدريب مفصلة مقدما لتدريب الموظفين. ما هي أفضل طريقة لمدير المشروع لحل النزاع؟","oa":["تسهيل التوصل إلى حل وسط من خلال اعتماد نهج مختلط","تجنب الصراع عن طريق تصعيد المشكلة إلى راعي المشروع","التأكيد على القواسم المشتركة بين كلا النهجين","فرض إطار عمل رشيق لإرضاء فريق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":729,"q":"You are a project manager for the internal project that will deliver a new tool to the performing organization for use by its employees. A conflict occurred between the project team and the training manager. The team wants to use short development cycles to gain early feedback and manage the high rate of change coming from the employees. The training manager, on the other hand, insists on creating a detailed training plan upfront to train the employees. What is the best way for the project manager to resolve the conflict?","t":"S","o":["Facilitate a compromise by adopting a hybrid approach","Avoid the conflict by escalating the issue to the project sponsor","Emphasize the commonalities between both approaches","Force an agile framework to satisfy the project team"],"c":[0],"f":"Using an agile approach for product development and then a predictive approach for training should resolve the conflict. The hybrid approach is the logical choice based on the limited information provided in the scenario.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP-Exam 3","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":829}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع تدير مشروع برمجيات كبير. أرسل فريق مشروعك معلومات سرية إلى مقاول من الباطن عن طريق الخطأ. ما الذي كان يمكن أن يمنع هذا الموقف؟","oa":["مراجعة سجل المعنيين","مراجعة خطة إدارة التواصل","مراجعة خطة إدارة النطاق","مراجعة خطة مشاركة المعنيين"],"rat":null,"fa":"خطة إدارة الاتصالات هي أحد مكونات خطة إدارة المشروع التي تصف كيفية تخطيط اتصالات المشروع وتنظيمها وتنفيذها ومراقبتها للتأكد من فعاليتها. تحتوي الخطة على المعلومات التالية: الشخص المسؤول عن التصريح بالإفصاح عن المعلومات السرية؛ ومتطلبات التواصل مع أصحاب المصلحة؛ وعمليات التصعيد؛ والإطار الزمني وتواتر توزيع المعلومات المطلوبة والشخص المسؤول عن توصيل المعلومات.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":730,"q":"You are a project manager managing a large software project. Your project team sent confidential information to the subcontractor by mistake. What could have prevented this situation?","t":"S","o":["Review stakeholder register","Reviewing the Communication management Plan","Reviewing the Scope management Plan","Reviewing the stakeholder engagement Plan"],"c":[1],"f":"The communications management plan is a component of the project management plan that describes how project communications will be planned, structured, implemented, and monitored for effectiveness. The plan contains the following information: Person responsible for authorizing the release of confidential information; Stakeholder communication requirements; Escalation processes; Timeframe and frequency for the distribution of required information and Person responsible for communicating the information.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Resources","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":830}},{"qa":"أي من المهارات الشخصية ومهارات الفريق التالية تساعد على تقليل سوء الفهم وتحسين التواصل ومشاركة المعرفة؟","oa":["القيادة","الوعي السياسي","سجل الدروس المستفادة","الاستماع الفعال"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":731,"q":"Which of the following interpersonal and team skills helps to reduce misunderstandings and improves communication and knowledge sharing?","t":"S","o":["Leadership","Political awareness","Lessons learned register","Active listening"],"c":[3],"f":"Active listening helps reduce misunderstandings and improves communication and knowledge sharing.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":831}},{"qa":"أثناء اجتماع مراجعة المخاطر، يحدد الفريق أحد المخاطر. لا يستطيع مدير المشروع تحديد طريقة لإدارة المخاطر داخلياً لأنها تقع في نطاق فريق مشروع آخر. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع؟","oa":["نقل المخاطر إلى فريق آخر","قبول الخطر","تخفيف الخطر","تصعيد المخاطر إلى الإدارة العليا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":732,"q":"During a risk review meeting, the team identifies a risk. The project manager is unable to determine a way to manage the risk internally because it is in the domain of another project team. What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Transfer the risk to another team","Accept the risk","Mitigate the risk","Escalate the risk to senior management."],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword( The risk in the domain of another project team) Escalation is appropriate when the project team or the project sponsor agrees that a threat is outside the scope of the project or that the proposed response would exceed the project manager's authority. Escalated risks are managed at the program level, portfolio level, or other relevant part of the organization, and not on the project level. The project manager determines who should be notified about the threat and communicates the details to that person or part of the organization. It is important that ownership of escalated threats is accepted by the relevant party in the organization.","ap":"general","dm":"process","ch":"Risk","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":832}},{"qa":"تعد المطابقة للمتطلبات والملاءمة للاستخدام من المفاهيم الأساسية في إدارة الجودة. أي مما يلي هو اسم آخر لاحتياجات العملاء؟","oa":["صوت العميل","القائمة الفورية","زحف النطاق","عملية رسم الخرائط"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":733,"q":"Conformance to requirements and fitness for use are key concepts in quality management. Which of the following is another name for customer needs?","t":"S","o":["Voice of the Customer","Prompt list","Scope creep","Process mapping"],"c":[0],"f":"In quality management, customer needs and requirements are also known as voice of the customer (VOC). [PMBOK® Guide 6th edition, Page 145]","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":833}},{"qa":"على الرغم من أن الأشخاص قد يقولون إنهم يستطيعون تحديد مشاعرهم الشخصية وتقييمها وإدارتها، إلا أن العديد من الفرق تعاني من التوتر والسلوكيات غير المتعاونة بين زملائها. لقد أدركت ذلك في المشاريع التي كنت فيها عضوًا في الفريق، وخاصة الفرق الافتراضية. الآن بعد أن أصبحت مدير مشروع محترفًا، فأنت تريد إنشاء بيئة يستطيع فيها زملائك في الفريق تقليل التوتر وزيادة التعاون. أي مما يلي هو أفضل الممارسات التي يجب اتباعها؟","oa":["ركز على الأهداف المراد تحقيقها واطلب ترك المشاعر خارج المشروع","استخدام الذكاء العاطفي للتحكم في مشاعر أعضاء الفريق","الحفاظ على علاقة جيدة مع راعي المشروع","التأكيد على مجالات الاتفاق بدلاً من مجالات الاختلاف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":734,"q":"Although people may say they can identify, assess, and manage their personal feelings, many teams experience tension and uncooperative behaviors among teammates. You have recognized this on projects where you have been a team member, especially virtual teams. Now that you are a professional project manager, you want to establish an environment in which teammates can reduce tension and increase cooperation. Which of the following is the best practice to follow?","t":"S","o":["Focus on goals to be served and ask that emotions be left outside the project","Use emotional intelligence to control the sentiments of team members","Maintain a good relationship with the project sponsor","Emphasize areas of agreement rather than areas of difference"],"c":[1],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam \n\nEmotional intelligence (the ability to manage your emotions and others' emotions) leads directly to reducing conflict and making positive decisions.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":834}},{"qa":"وفقًا لمخطط الحرق الموضح أدناه، ماذا حدث في اليوم السابع؟","oa":["زادت سرعة الفريق","انخفضت سرعة الفريق","تمت إضافة العمل إلى النطاق","تمت إزالة العمل من النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":735,"q":"As per the burn up chart shown below, what happened at day 7?","t":"S","o":["The team velocity increased","The team velocity decreased","Work was added to the scope","Work was removed from the scope"],"c":[3],"f":"At day 7, 2 points were removed from the scope, bringing the total in the backlog to 30 points so The right option is that work was removed from the scope.\n\nBut if in another scenario in real exam what is happend in 4 or 5 or 6 day the correct answer the scope has been increased.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":835}},{"qa":"باعتبارك مدير مشروع لشركة متعددة الجنسيات، فأنت مسؤول عن تطوير المنتجات الجديدة وصيانة المنتجات الحالية. يتم إسناد 90٪ من التطوير إلى متخصصين متعاقدين. يوجد نظام عمليات لإدارة تطوير المنتج باستمرار، ويتم استخدام العديد من العقود للتحكم في العمل وضمان تنفيذ العمل المقبول. بعد أن يبلغ المقاول عن اكتمال المرحلة ونقل التسليمات المكتملة إلى الآخرين، ما هي خطوتك التالية؟","oa":["دفع الفواتير","تحديث شهادات التدريب","مراجعة وثائق قبول العميل","تدقيق سجلات الدفع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":736,"q":"As the project manager for a multinational company, you are responsible for new product development and maintenance of existing products. 90% of the development is outsourced to contract professionals. A system of processes is in place to consistently manage product development, and several contracts are used to control the work and ensure acceptable work is performed. After a contractor reports completion of a phase and the transfer of the completed deliverable's to others, what is your next step?","t":"S","o":["Pay invoices","Update the training certifications","Review customer acceptance documentation","Audit payment records"],"c":[2],"f":"After a contractor reports completion of a phase and the transfer of the completed deliverables to others, your next step is to review customer acceptance documentation from the Validate Scope process.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":836}},{"qa":"أنت تحضر اجتماع تحديث حالة المشروع على مستوى المؤسسة. يتلقى جميع الحضور لوحة مؤشرات أداء التكلفة لكل مشروع، ويقوم كل مدير مشروع بعرض حالة مشروعه. تُظهر مقاييس أحد المشاريع أن BAC يبلغ 120,000 دولارًا أمريكيًا، وAC بقيمة 99,000 دولارًا أمريكيًا، وEAC بقيمة 125,000 دولارًا أمريكيًا. ومع ذلك، صرح مدير المشروع أن تكلفة ETC ستكون 20000 دولار. ماذا عليك ان تفعل؟","oa":["إبلاغ الإدارة العليا بوجود خطأ حسابي","لا تفعل شيئا","تهنئة مدير المشروع لكونه تحت الميزانية","تقديم المشورة لمدير المشروع لاستخدام الأموال من احتياطيات الطوارئ للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":737,"q":"You are attending a project status update meeting at the organization level. All attendees receive a dashboard of cost metrics of each project, and each project manager is presenting the status of his project. The metrics of one project shows a BAC of $120,000, AC of $99,000 and an EAC of $125,000. However, the project manager states that the ETC will be $20,000. What should you do?","t":"S","o":["Notify the senior management that there is a calculation error","Do nothing","Congratulate the project manager for being under budget","Advise the project manager to use fund from the contingency reserves of the project"],"c":[0],"f":"As the ETC is being calculated and reported, that means the EAC= AC+ETC, so there is calculation error. As per the PMI code of ethics, you should report any mistake you observe to the appropriate management.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":837}},{"qa":"أنت مدير المشروع لمشروع برمجي. أثناء قيامك بتحديد نطاق العمل الذي يتعين عليك القيام به، يمكنك الجلوس مع جميع المعنيين stakeholders في المشروع وتسجيل جميع المتطلبات التي يمكنك الحصول عليها منهم. أي مما يلي ليس متطلبًا صالحًا من المعنيين stakeholders؟","oa":["لا يمكن أن يكون هناك أكثر من 5% من التباين في الجدول الزمني للمشروع","يجب أن تتناسب جودة المنتج مع المقاييس التنظيمية لجودة البرنامج","يجب أن يكون العمل الذي يقوم به الفريق أفضل مما فعلوه في مشروعهم الأخير","يجب أن تكون الميزانية في حدود 10% من التكلفة المتوقعة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":738,"q":"You are the project manager for a software project. As you are defining the scope of the work you need to do, you sit down with all of the project's stakeholders and record all of the requirements you can get from them. Which of the following is not a valid requirement from stakeholders?","t":"S","o":["There can be no more than 5% schedule variance on the project","The quality of the product must fit within organizational metrics for software quality","The work the team does must be better than they did on their last project","The budget must be within 10% of our projected cost"],"c":[2],"f":"Saying that the work must be better is subjective. Requirements gathered in stakeholder analysis need to be quantifiable. That way, the team has a goal they can shoot for and you can always tell how close or far from it you are.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":838}},{"qa":"أنت تعمل في شركة سيارات، وقد أجريت تقديرًا مستقلاً لمعرفة تكلفة التعاقد من الباطن على تصنيع 1,000,000 محمل كروي. لقد قدرت التكلفة بـ 800 دولار لكل محمل. ومع ذلك، عندما طلبت عروض الأسعار والعروض من وجهه نظر البائعين ، كان الحد الأدنى للسعر المعروض هو 1000 دولار لكل اتجاه. أي مما يلي ليس سببا للتباين في التقدير؟","oa":["ولم يكن بيان عمل المشتريات واضحا","لم تكن هناك تغييرات كبيرة في تكلفة المواد والعمالة منذ العام الماضي","لم يكن بيان عمل المشتريات كافياً","لقد أساء البائع وجهه نظره فى فهم بيان عمل الشراء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":739,"q":"You are working for an automobile company, and you had conducted an independent estimate to find out the cost of sub-contracting the manufacturing of 1,000,000 ball bearings. You estimated the cost to be $800 per bearing. However, when you asked for bids and proposals from perspective sellers, the minimum price quoted was $1000 per bearing. Which of the following is not a reason for the variance in the estimate?","t":"S","o":["The procurement statement of work was not clear","There have not been major changes in cost of material and labor since the last year","The procurement statement of work was not sufficient","The perspective seller misunderstood the procurement statement of work"],"c":[1],"f":"Significant differences in cost estimate can be an indication that the procurement statement of work was deficient, ambiguous, and/or that the perspective sellers either misunderstood or failed to respond fully to the procurement statement of work.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":839}},{"qa":"أثناء مراجعة التكرار Sprint الأخيرة، ذكر مالك المنتج أن المنتج لا يقدم أي قيمة. يعتقد مدير المشروع أن المنتج مطابق لجميع المواصفات المقدمة. الفريق في حيرة من أمره من تصريح مالك المنتج. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله عند استخدام النهج المختلط؟","oa":["حدد أولويات سجل اعمال المنتج للمشروع واطلب من فريق التطوير معالجة المشكلات","قم بمراجعة خطة إدارة فوائد المشروع مع مالك المنتج","قم بتصعيد الأمر إلى المجلس التنفيذي حتى يتمكنوا من اتخاذ قرار بشأن الخطوات التالية","اطلب من مالك المنتج إنهاء المشروع لأنه لم يعد متوافقًا مع الفوائد المتوقعة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":740,"q":"During the last sprint review, the product owner stated that the product does not deliver any value. The project manager believes that the product meets all the provided specifications. The team is confused by the product owner's statement.\nWhat should the project manager do when using a hybrid approach?","t":"S","o":["Prioritize the project backlog and ask the development team to x the issues","Review the project's benefits management plan with the product owner","Escalate the matter to the executive board so they can decide on next steps","Ask the product owner to terminate the project as it is no longer aligned to the expected benefits"],"c":[1],"f":"•The benefits management plan describes key elements of the benefits and may include but is not limited to: \n\n•Target benefits (financial value)\n•Strategic alignment (e.g., how well the project benefits align to the business strategies of the organization) \n\n•Timeframe for realizing benefits (e.g., benefits by phase, short-term, long-term, and ongoing)\n•Benefits owner (e.g., the accountable person to monitor, record, and report realized benefits)\n•Metrics (e.g., the measures to be used to show benefits realized, direct measures, and indirect measures) •Risks (e.g., risks for realization of benefits).","ap":"hybrid","dm":"people","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":840}},{"qa":"تريد إحدى المدن بناء مركز مجتمعي وعينت مديرًا للمشروع. تم العثور على الموقع وتم استكمال كافة الموافقات والحوكمة اللازمة. عندما تم إطلاق المشروع، تم اكتشاف أنه لم تتم استشارة مجموعة المزارعين المحليين، وأنهم يستخدمون الموقع للتسويق شهرياً. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله للمضي قدمًا في المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب من راعي المشروع مناقشة التعويض مع مجموعة المزارعين عن الأعمال المفقودة","قم بتوثيق المخاطر المتعلقة بالتأثير الذي يمكن لمجموعة المزارعين إحداثه على المشروع","الاستمرار في بناء المركز حيث أن مجموعة المزارعين لا تحتاج إلى استشارة","مناقشة أهداف المشروع مع جميع أصحاب المصلحة، بما في ذلك مجموعة المزارعين، ومراجعة متطلباتهم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":741,"q":"A town wants to build a community center and has appointed a project manager. A site was found, and all of the necessary approvals and governance were completed. When the project kick-off was held, it was discovered that a local farmers' group was not consulted, and they use the site for a monthly market. What should the project manager do to move forward with the project?","t":"S","o":["Request that the project sponsor discuss compensation with the farmers' group for the lost business.","Document a risk related to the impact that the farmers' group could bring to the project.","Continue building the center as the farmers' group does not need to be consulted.","Discuss the project objectives with all stakeholders, including the farmers' group, and review their requirements."],"c":[3],"f":"Building a community center. After assigning the project manager the next step identify stakeholder and the local farmers are stakeholders and In the question scenario, it was mentioned that they were not consulted, so as a project manager should Discuss the project objectives with all stakeholders, including the farmers' group, and review their requirements.","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":841}},{"qa":"قام مدير المشروع بإعداد خطة لإدارة فوائد المشروع. أي مما يلي يجب تضمينه في هذه الوثيقة؟","oa":["المواءمة الاستراتيجية، صاحب الفوائد، سجل المخاطر","الفوائد المستهدفة، والمواءمة الاستراتيجية، والإطار الزمني لتحقيق الفوائد","متطلبات المشروع، الفوائد المستهدفة، سجل المشكلات، المقاييس","الفوائد المستهدفة، صاحب الفوائد، الدروس المستفادة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":742,"q":"A project manager prepared a project benefits management plan. Which of the following should be included in this document?","t":"S","o":["Strategic alignment, benefits owner, risk register","Target benefits, strategic alignment, time frame for realizing benefits","Project requirements, target benefits, issue log, metrics","Target benefits, benefits owner, lessons learned"],"c":[1],"f":"•The benefits management plan describes key elements of the benefits and may include but is not limited to: \n\n•Target benefits (financial value)\n•Strategic alignment (e.g., how well the project benefits align to the business strategies of the organization) \n\n•Timeframe for realizing benefits (e.g., benefits by phase, short-term, long-term, and ongoing)\n•Benefits owner (e.g., the accountable person to monitor, record, and report realized benefits)\n•Metrics (e.g., the measures to be used to show benefits realized, direct measures, and indirect measures) •Risks (e.g., risks for realization of benefits).","ap":"predictive","dm":"business","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":842}},{"qa":"أحد أعضاء اللجنة التوجيهية يشتكي من التقرير الأسبوعي. وذكروا أن التقرير طويل جدًا ويحتوي على تفاصيل غير ضرورية. ونتيجة لذلك، فهم غير قادرين على الحصول على الرسالة الرئيسية واتخاذ الإجراء. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب شكاوى مماثلة؟","oa":["عرض التقارير الأسبوعية في عرض تقديمي لعضو اللجنة التوجيهية","التحقق من المعلومات اللازمة لأعضاء اللجنة التوجيهية","أرسل تقريرًا يوميًا أقصر إلى عضو اللجنة التوجيهية هذا","اعرض الحالة في اجتماع أسبوعي مع اللجنة التوجيهية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":743,"q":"A steering committee member is complaining about the weekly report. They stated that the report is too long and has unnecessary details. As a result, they are unable to obtain the main message and take action. What should the project manager do to avoid similar complaints?","t":"S","o":["Demonstrate the weekly reports in a presentation for the steering committee member.","Verify the information needed for steering committee members.","Send a shorter daily report to this steering committee member.","Present the status at a weekly meeting with the steering committee."],"c":[1],"f":"A steering committee member is complaining about the weekly report which is too long and has unnecessary details so the project manager should Verify the information needed for steering committee members to avoid similar complaints.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":843}},{"qa":"لقد حدد عدد قليل من المطورين قائمة بالعوائق في الاجتماع اليومي daily standup ويطلبون مساعدة قائد المشروع في تحديد أولوياتها. هناك عدد قليل من عناصر سجل أعمال المنتج backlog معقدة، وقد حدد أحد المختبرين المبتدئين بعض عيوب الامتثال. سيترك مالك المنتج product owner واثنين من المطورين فريق المشروع، ولن يتم تجديد العقد مع شريك الاختبار ودعم الإنتاج. ما هي المشكلة التي يجب أن يركز عليها قائد المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["توظيف وتأهيل وتدريب المطورين الجدد","البحث عن مالك منتج جديد لتحديد أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج Product backlog","مناقشة قضايا الامتثال التنظيمي في الاجتماع","تطوير عقد جديد لدعم الإنتاج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":744,"q":"A few developers have identified a list of impediments at the daily standup and are asking for the project lead's assistance in prioritizing them. There are a few complex backlog items, and a new junior tester has identified a few compliance defects. The product owner and a couple of developers will be leaving the project team, and the contract with the test and production support partner will not be renewed. Which issue should the project lead focus on first?","t":"S","o":["Recruiting, on boarding, and training new developers.","Finding a new product owner to prioritize the product backlog.","Regulatory compliance issues discussed in the meeting.","Developing a new contract for production support."],"c":[1],"f":"The key word in the question is the product owner will leave the business, and there is complexity in the product backlog, so we are looking for the answer. Searching for a new product owner and priorities. My professional brother and sister notice that the international exam can be passed easily if you understand the scenarios of the question and look for the connection between the question and the answer.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":844}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ مشروع بناء، تشكو إحدى الشركات المجاورة من أن ارتفاع المبنى الحالي لا يتوافق مع المخططات الأولية للمشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع أولاً؟","oa":["اطلب من الشركات المجاورة مغادرة الموقع فورًا لأن الموقع ملك خاص","أبلغ الشركات المحاورة أنه تمت الموافقة على جميع وثائق المشروع","اطلب من الشركات المجاورة تقديم شكوى رسمية بشأن مخاوفها","إبلاغ الشركات المجاورة أنه سيتم تصعيد الشكوى إلى راعي المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":745,"q":"During the execution of a construction project, one of the neighboring businesses is complaining that the current building height does not agree with the initial project plans. What should the project manager do first?","t":"S","o":["Ask the neighbor to leave the site immediately because the site is on private property.","Inform the neighbor that all of the project documentation has been approved.","Ask the neighbor to submit a formal complaint about their concerns.","Inform the neighbor that the complaint will be escalated to the project sponsor."],"c":[2],"f":"One of the neighboring businesses is complaining that the current building height does not agree with the initial project plans So the project manager should first Ask the neighbor to submit a formal complaint about their concerns.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Value Delivery and Benefits Realization","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":845}},{"qa":"مدير المشروع يستخدم نهجا رشيقاً Agile approach. أثناء اجتماع التخطيط للتكرار sprint planning ، وضع مالك المنتج علامة على أحد عناصر سجل الاعمال backlog باعتبارها ذات قيمة تجارية عالية وسهلة التنفيذ. ومع ذلك، حدد أعضاء الفريق الآخرون وجود تبعية عالية بين هذا العنصر وعنصر آخر تم وضع علامة عليه على أنه ذو قيمة تجارية منخفضة ودرجة عالية من التعقيد. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لدعم تحديد أولويات سجل الاعمال backlog ؟","oa":["قم بإعطاء الأولوية للعنصر الذي تم وضع علامة عليه على أنه ذو قيمة تجارية عالية وتعقيد منخفض لهذا التكرار","قم بتيسير المناقشة حتى يتوصل الفريق إلى اتفاق حول البندين","ادعم الفريق لنقل كلا العنصرين إلى التكرار التالي عندما يعرف الفريق المزيد","قم بإعطاء الأولوية للعنصر الذي تم وضع علامة عليه باعتباره تبعية ذات قيمة تجارية منخفضة وتعقيدًا عاليًا"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":746,"q":"A project manager is using an agile approach. During the sprint planning meeting, the product owner flagged a backlog item as high business value and easy to implement. However, the other team members identified a high dependency between this item and another item that is flagged as low business value and high complexity. What should the project manager do to support the backlog prioritization?","t":"S","o":["Prioritize the item flagged as high business value and low complexity for this sprint.","Facilitate the discussion until the team reaches an agreement about the two items.","Support the team to move both items to the next sprint when the team will know more.","Prioritize the item flagged as a dependency with low business value and high complexity."],"c":[1],"f":"There are different opinions with the team so project manager as servant leader should Facilitate the discussion until the team reaches an agreement about the two items.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":846}},{"qa":"تستخدم إحدى المؤسسات أسلوب التسليم المختلط لمشروع تجاري. تمت ترقية مالك المنتج، وهو الشخص الذي كان يدير المشروع أيضًا، إلى دور أعلى. لقد انضم قائد مشروع جديد إلى المشروع. ما هي القطعة الأثريةartifact (المخرجات)  التي يجب أن يستخدمها المشروع لضمان تحديد فوائد المشروع؟","oa":["مخطط باريتو","حالة الأعمال Business Case","ٍسجل اعمال المنتج","بيان العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":747,"q":"An organization is using a hybrid delivery approach for a business project. The product owner, the person who was also managing the project, was promoted to a more senior role. A new project lead has joined the project. Which artifact should the project lead use to ensure that the project benefits have been identified?","t":"S","o":["Pareto chart","Business case","Product backlog","Statement of work (SOW)"],"c":[1],"f":"The correct answer is: Business case\nThe business case brings together the benefits, disadvantages, costs, and risks of the current situation and future vision so that executive management can decide if the project should go ahead.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"business","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":847}},{"qa":"في بيئة مصفوفة ضعيفة، يتخلف اثنان من أعضاء الفريق الرئيسيين عن مهامهما، مما سيؤثر على نجاح المشروع. يكشف المزيد من التحقيقات التي أجراها مدير المشروع أن لديهم مشكلات لم يتم حلها مع بعضهم البعض. يطلب منهم مدير المشروع إيجاد طريقة لحل المشكلات، لكن هذا لم ينجح. ثم يعقد مدير المشروع اجتماعًا معهم للتوصل إلى حل دائم للقضايا، لكن هذا أيضًا لم ينجح. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله بعد ذلك؟","oa":["قم بإيقاف عضوي الفريق الرئيسيين عن العمل على الفور","وضع هذه القضية على جدول أعمال الاجتماع القادم للفريق","تصعيد الموضوع إلى سلطة أعلى","إعادة تعيين أحد أعضاء الفريق الرئيسيين لمهمة مختلفة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":748,"q":"In a weak matrix environment, two key team members are falling behind with their tasks, which will affect the success of the project. Further investigation by the project manager reveals that they have unresolved issues with each other. The project manager asks them to find a way to resolve the issues, but this is unsuccessful. The project manager then holds a meeting with them to work out a permanent solution to the issues, but this is also unsuccessful. What should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Suspend the two key team members immediately.","Put the issue on the agenda for the next team meeting","Escalate the issue to a higher authority","Reassign one of the key team members to a different task"],"c":[2],"f":"The correct answer is: Escalate the issue to a higher authority\nbecause of your inability to solve it and also because of the weak authority of the project manager in the weak matrix","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 4","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":848}},{"qa":"يحتاج الفريق إلى اتباع الامتثال المحدد للأمن السيبراني والذي يعد إلزاميًا لمشروع العميل. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لمراقبة الامتثال في المشروع؟","oa":["مراجعة مع خبراء الأمن","التشاور مع أعضاء الفريق","ناقش مع العميل","جدولة عمليات تدقيق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":749,"q":"A team needs to follow defined cybersecurity compliance that is mandatory for a customer project. What should the project manager do to monitor compliance in the project?","t":"S","o":["Review with security experts.","Confer with team members.","Discuss with the customer.","Schedule regular project audits."],"c":[3],"f":"To monitor compliance in the project, the project manager should Schedule regular project audits.\n\nQuality audits are used to verify compliance with organizational policies, processes, and procedures.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":849}},{"qa":"تقوم لجنة اختيار المشاريع بوضع قائمة مختصرة للمشاريع للعام المقبل. ما هي معايير الاختيار التي يجب أن يوصي بها مدير المشروع؟","oa":["المشاريع ذات المخاطر الأقل المرتبطة بها","المشاريع التي تزيد من قيمة الأعمال","المشاريع ذات أقصى قدر من الإيرادات","المشاريع مع أقل مدة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":750,"q":"A project selection committee is shortlisting projects for the coming year. Which selection criteria should the project manager recommend?","t":"S","o":["Projects with the least associated risks","Projects that maximize the business value","Projects with maximum revenue generation","Projects with the least duration"],"c":[1],"f":"The criteria should the project manager recommend \"Projects that maximize the business value\"","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":850}},{"qa":"حصل مدير المشروع على معلومات من السوق من شأنها أن تقلل من قيمة الأعمال التي يقدمها مشروع مستمر. وبناءً على تلك المعلومات، يعتقد مدير المشروع أنه يجب إيقاف المشروع. كيف ينبغي لمدير المشروع التعامل مع الوضع؟","oa":["قم بإجراء مناقشة مع الراعي والتوصية بإعادة تقييم قيمة أعمال المشروع","قم بإزالة العناصر التي لم تعد قابلة للتطبيق من سجل أعمال المنتج وقدمها إلى فريق المشروع","استمر في العمل على النطاق المحدد ومراجعة مصفوفة المخاطر","قم بإجراء مناقشة مع راعي المشروع وقم بإلغاء المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":751,"q":"A project manager acquired information from the market that would reduce the business value being delivered by an ongoing project. Based on that information, the project manager believes the project should be stopped. How should the project manager handle the situation?","t":"S","o":["Have a discussion with the sponsor and recommend the project business value be reassessed.","Remove the items no longer applicable from the backlog and present the backlog to the project team.","Continue working on the defined scope and review the risk matrix.","Have a discussion with the project sponsor and cancel the project."],"c":[0],"f":"The correct answer is: Have a discussion with the sponsor and recommend the project's business value be reassessed.\n\nThe project sponsor is generally accountable for the development and maintenance of the project business case document. \n\nThe project manager is responsible for providing recommendations and oversight to keep the project business case, project management plan, project charter, and project benefits management plan success measures in alignment with one another and with the goals and objectives of the organization.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":851}},{"qa":"قد طُلب من مدير المشروع أن يوصي بممارسة سريعة لتوفير قيمة الأعمال في جميع أنحاء المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يوصي به مدير المشروع؟","oa":["استرجاع الأحداث بشكل متكرر لضمان تنفيذ الدروس المستفادة وإجراءات التحسين","التطوير التكراري وجمع التعليقات المتكررة من أعضاء فريق المشروع","تكرارات محددة زمنيًا للسماح لفريق الاختبار باختبار زيادات المنتج بدقة","التسليم المتزايد والتحسين المتكرر لسجل الأعمال بناءً على تعليقات المستخدمين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":752,"q":"The project manager was asked to recommend an agile practice to provide business value throughout the project. What should the project manager recommend?","t":"S","o":["Frequent retrospectives to ensure that lessons learned and improvement actions are implemented","Iterative development and collection of frequent feedback from project team members","Time-boxed iterations to allow the testing team to thoroughly test the product increments","Incremental delivery and frequent backlog refinement based on user feedback"],"c":[3],"f":"Incremental delivery and frequent backlog refinement based on user feedback will provide business value throughout the project.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":852}},{"qa":"ليس لدى المنظمة المنفذة مكتب لإدارة المشروع (PMO) أو إجراءات سياسات حوكمة رسمية ومبادئ توجيهية لهذا النوع من المشاريع. كمدير للمشروع، ما الذي يجب عليك فعله أولاً لتحديد نهج إدارة المشروع؟","oa":["اختر إما إطارًا تنبؤيًا أو مرنًا يناسب طبيعة المشروع، واستخدم هذا الإطار كأساس لسياسات وإجراءات وإرشادات إدارة المشروع","استشر خبيرًا متخصصًا  فيما يتعلق بأفضل سياسات وإجراءات وإرشادات الحوكمة التي سيستخدمها المشروع","التشاور مع أعضاء الفريق وأصحاب المصلحة لتحديد ما إذا كانت المنظمة لديها أي إجراءات ومبادئ توجيهية غير رسمية تتعلق بسياسات الحوكمة","تدريب فريق الإدارة الذاتية لإنتاج سياسات وإجراءات وإرشادات حوكمة مخصصة للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":753,"q":"The performing organization does not have a project management office (PMO) or formal governance policies procedures, and guidelines for this type of project. As a project manager, what should you do first to determine a governance approach for the project?","t":"S","o":["Choose either a predictive or agile framework best suited to the nature of the project, and use this framework as the basis for project governance policies, procedures, and guidelines","Consult a subject matter expert (SME) as to the best governance policies, procedures, and guidelines to be used by the project","Consult with team members and stakeholders to determine whether the organization has any informal governance policies procedures, and guidelines","Coach the self-managing team to produce tailored governance policies, procedures and guidelines for the project"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager should first Consult a subject matter expert (SME) as to the best governance policies, procedures, and guidelines to be used by the project to determine a governance approach for the project.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP-Exam 5","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":853}},{"qa":"لقد تلقيت للتو رسالة بريد إلكتروني تفيد بأن أربعة أعضاء من فريق المشروع يتجادلون حول أدوار المشروع وهناك ارتباك حول من هو المسؤول عن أي عمل. قررت أن الفريق يحتاج إلى طريقة للإشارة بوضوح إلى أدوار المشروع فيما يتعلق بأنشطة المشروع. ما هو أفضل حل لهذه المشكلة؟","oa":["تحديد من هو المسؤول، ومن هو المسؤول، ومن يجب استشارته، ومن يحتاج ببساطة إلى إعلامه بأنشطة المشروع","دع الفريق يقرر بشكل طبيعي من يقوم بماذا","إنشاء إطار عمل لمساعدة الفريق على تقييد وتحديد وشرح أدوار المشروع","يجب على الفريق تقييم وتخصيص وربط وتكامل أنشطة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":754,"q":"You have just received an e-mail message that four project team members are arguing over project roles and there is confusion over who is in charge of what work. You decide that the team needs a way to clearly indicate project roles with respect to project activities. What is the best solution to this problem?","t":"S","o":["Determine who is responsible, who is accountable, who should be consulted, and who simply needs to be informed about project activities.","Let the team naturally decide who does what.","Create a framework to help the team restrain, ascertain, constrain, and explain project roles.","The team should rate, allocate, correlate, and integrate project activities."],"c":[0],"f":"A RACI chart is a type of responsibility assignment matrix. \n\nThis document will clearly outline team roles and assignments to activities, so there is no confusion about who is in charge of which project activities.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":854}},{"qa":"لإشراك المعنيين الذين تم تحديدهم حديثًا في المشروع في أقرب فرصة، يقترح مدير الفريق دعوتهم إلى اجتماع مراجعة التكرار القادم لإثبات للمعنيين أن الفريق يتحرك في الاتجاه الصحيح والحصول على ملاحظات من المعنيين حول ما أنجزه الفريق. أي مما يلي يعد سببًا آخر لدعوة المعنيين إلى هذا الاجتماع؟","oa":["لإعطاء الأولوية لقصص المستخدم عالية المخاطرللتكرار القادم","لمناقشة الخطط الرئيسية للتكرار التالي","للتفكير في أداء الفريق","لإعادة تحديد أولويات سجل اعمال الإصدارات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":755,"q":"To engage the newly identified stakeholders in the project at the earliest opportunity, the scrum master suggests inviting them to the upcoming sprint review meeting to demonstrate to the stakeholders that the team is moving in the right direction and get feedback from the stakeholders about what the team has accomplished. Which of the following is another reason for inviting the stakeholders to this meeting?","t":"S","o":["To prioritize high-risk user stories for the next sprint","To discuss the high-level plans for the next sprint","To reflect on the team performance","To re-prioritize the release backlog"],"c":[1],"f":"The sprint review is conducted for three main reasons:\n1. To prove to the stakeholders that the team is moving in the right direction;\n2. To get feedback from the stakeholders about the work completed; and\n3. To discuss the work of the next sprint with the stakeholders\n\nNote: The discussion is conducted at a high-level and does not replace the one held at the spring","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":855}},{"qa":"بصفتك مدير مشروع، تلقيت طلب تغيير من أحد المعنيين  لمشروع تطوير برمجيات مستمر. ما هي الخطوة التالية التي يجب أن تتخذها؟","oa":["تجاهل طلب التغيير؛ آراء أصحاب المصلحة ليست مهمة","الرد على صاحب المصلحة بأن طلبات التغيير غير مسموح بها","تقييم تأثير التغيير على نطاق المشروع ووقته وتكلفته","تنفيذ التغيير على الفور."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":756,"q":"As a project manager, you've received a change request from a stakeholder for an ongoing software development project. What should be your next step?","t":"S","o":["Ignore the change request; stakeholder's opinions are not important.","Respond to the stakeholder that change requests are not allowed","Evaluate the impact of the change on the project's scope, time, and cost","Implement the change immediately."],"c":[2],"f":"The best course of action when receiving a change request from a stakeholder, is to evaluate the impact of the change on the project's scope, time, and cost. It is important to assess and analyse the potential consequences of implementing the change before approving or rejecting it to ensure that it won't negatively impact the project or the project's objectives.\n\n In a real-world project management scenario, the stakeholders have a vested interest in the project, their inputs should not be disregarded, and all change requests should at least be evaluated.\nTopic: project governance\nConcept: project management processes\nTalent Triangle: power skills","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":856}},{"qa":"بصفتك مدير مشروع، قمت بتحليل أداء مشروعك ووجدت أن بعض المهام تتأخر باستمرار. واكتشفت أن بعض أصحاب المصلحة لا يقدمون المعلومات اللازمة في الوقت المناسب. ماذا يجب أن تفعل؟","oa":["التواصل مع أصحاب المصلحة لفهم سبب التأخير والتوصل إلى حل مقبول للطرفين","تجاهل المشكلة والاستمرار في الاعتماد على المدخلات المتأخرة من أصحاب المصلحة","تصعيد المشكلة إلى الراعي دون مناقشة أصحاب المصلحة.","قلل من مشاركة أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":757,"q":"As a project manager, you have analyzed the performance of your project and found that few tasks are consistently lagging. You discovered that some stakeholders are not providing the necessary information on time. What should you do?","t":"S","o":["Communicate with the stakeholders to understand the cause of the delay and come up with a mutually agreeable solution.","Ignore the issue and continue to rely on late inputs from stakeholders.","Escalate the issue to the sponsor without discussing with the stakeholders.","Reduce the stakeholders' involvement in the project."],"c":[0],"f":"The best approach as a project manager when tasks are lagging due to late information from stakeholders would be to communicate with the stakeholders, understand why they are not able to provide needed details in time and agree on a solution together.","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":857}},{"qa":"يلاحظ مدير المشروع عدة عيوب في مخرجات المشروع. ما هو أفضل مسار عمل لضمان الجودة؟","oa":["إجراء تحليل السبب الجذري وتنفيذ الإجراءات التصحيحية","طرد عضو الفريق المسؤول عن العيوب","استبدال فريق المشروع بأكمله","تجاهل العيوب لأنها بسيطة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":758,"q":"A project manager notices several defects in the project's deliverables. What is the best course of action to ensure quality?","t":"S","o":["Perform a root cause analysis and implement corrective actions","Fire the team member responsible for the defects","Replace the entire project team","Ignore the defects since they are minor"],"c":[0],"f":"It is important to know the cause of the defect to fix the problem and ensure that it does not happen again","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":858}},{"qa":"في المشروع، تكون لجنة التحكم في التغيير مسؤولة عن مراجعة جميع طلبات التغيير والموافقة عليها. أثناء اجتماع مراجعة المشروع، تتم مناقشة طلب التغيير الذي يستلزم إضافة ميزات جديدة إلى مخرجات المشروع دون إجراء تحليل شامل للتأثير. ماذا ينبغي لمدير المشروع أن يفعل في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["الموافقة على طلب التغيير لتسريع الجدول الزمني للمشروع","التوصية بتقييم طلب التغيير بشكل أكبر من خلال تحليل شامل للتأثير","تنفيذ طلب التغيير على الفور لتلبية توقعات أصحاب المصلحة","التشاور مع أعضاء الفريق حول طلب التغيير دون تحليل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":759,"q":"In a project, the Change Control Board (CCB) is responsible for reviewing and approving all change requests. During a project review meeting, a change request is discussed that entails adding new features to the project deliverables without a thorough impact analysis. What should the project manager do in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Approve the change request to expedite the project timeline","Recommend that the change request be further evaluated with a comprehensive impact analysis","Implement the change request immediately to meet stakeholder expectations","Consult with team members about the change request without analysis"],"c":[1],"f":"Steps of Change Request Steps of Change Request \n\n1- Meeting with stakeholder to understand reason 2- Submit change Request 3- Impact Analysis . 4- Inform stakeholder about the impact of such change 5- Send Formal Change Request to Change Control Board. 6- CCB Decision ( Approve / Reject )\n\n7-Updates Pans and Document with change 8- Communicate / inform stakeholder 9-Implement approved change request","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":859}},{"qa":"لقد أجرت إدارتك العليا عدة تغييرات في نطاق المشروع مما أدى إلى عدم توافق في تخصيص الموارد. ما هي الخطوة التالية التي يجب أن تتخذها لضمان نضج إدارة الموارد؟","oa":["التخلص تمامًا من خطة إدارة الموارد والبدء من جديد","إعادة تقييم خطة إدارة الموارد الخاصة بك في ضوء التغييرات، بما في ذلك مراجعة القدرات وإعادة تخصيص الموارد بناءً على النطاق المنقح","إفراط في استخدام الموارد لمواكبة التغييرات","تجاهل التغييرات والاستمرار في خطة تخصيص الموارد الحالية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":760,"q":"Your senior management has made several changes in the project scope which has led to a misalignment in resource allocation. What should be your next step to ensure resource management maturity?","t":"S","o":["Completely scrap the resource management plan and start anew.","Re-evaluate your resource management plan in light of the changes, including reviewing capacities and reallocating resources based on the revised scope.","Overwork the resources to keep up with the changes.","Ignore the changes and continue with the current resource allocation plan."],"c":[1],"f":"The best answer is to re-evaluate the resource management plan considering the changes made by senior management. This includes reviewing resource capacities and reallocating them based on the revised project scope.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":860}},{"qa":"على الرغم من وجود فريق موهوب، فإن تسليمات المشروع غالبًا ما تتأخر بسبب عدم كفاءة التواصل بين الفريق. كيف يمكن تحسين هذه المشكلة في سياق التحسين المستمر؟","oa":["عزل أعضاء الفريق وجعلهم يركزون على مهامهم الفردية فقط","زيادة وتيرة اجتماعات الفريق بغض النظر عن الحاجة","فرض اتصالات هرمية صارمة لضمان تدفق المعلومات من خلال القنوات الرسمية فقط","تنفيذ ممارسات رشيقة تشجع على التواصل الفعال، مثل الاجتماعات اليومية، والتأكيد على أهمية الشفافية والتواصل المفتوح"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":761,"q":"Despite having a talented team, project deliverables often get delayed due to inefficiencies in team communication. How could this issue be improved in the context of continuous improvement?","t":"S","o":["Isolate team members and make them focus on their individual tasks only.","Increase the frequency of team meetings irrespective of the need.","Enforce strict hierarchical communication to ensure that information flows only through official channels.","Implement agile practices that encourage efficient communication, such as daily stand-up meetings, and stress on importance of transparency and open communication."],"c":[3],"f":"Keyword (inefficiencies in team communication) so PM should Implement agile practices that encourage efficient communication, such as daily stand-up meetings, and stress on importance of transparency and open communication.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":861}},{"qa":"يتسبب مشروع البناء الخاص بك في تلوث ضوضائي مفرط، مما يؤدي إلى انخفاض جودة الحياة للسكان القريبين. ما هو الحل الأفضل؟","oa":["تجاهل المشكلة، لأن البناء صاخب بطبيعته","نفذ تدابير الحد من الضوضاء مثل وضع أسوار حول المعدات الصاخبة، وجدول الأنشطة المزعجة في فترات زمنية أقل حساسية","اطلب من السكان الانتقال مؤقتًا","زد من سرعة المشروع للانتهاء منه بشكل أسرع مع الاستمرار في إحداث نفس القدر من الضوضاء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":762,"q":"Your construction project is causing excessive noise pollution, which is lowering the quality of life for nearby residents. What is the best solution?","t":"S","o":["Ignore the problem, since construction is naturally noisy.","Implement noise-reducing measures such as enclosures around noisy equipment, and schedule disruptive activities in less sensitive time periods.","Ask the residents to relocate temporarily.","Increase the project speed to finish quicker while still making the same amount of noise."],"c":[1],"f":"Your construction project is causing excessive noise pollution So PM should Implement noise-reducing measures such as enclosures around noisy equipment, and schedule disruptive activities in less sensitive time periods.","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Introduction","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":862}},{"qa":"تأخر تقدم المشروع عن الموعد المحدد. حدد مدير المشروع أن تغيير النطاق تم إجراؤه دون المرور بالعمليات المناسبة. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["إجراء تحليل السبب الجذري لفهم المشكلة وتنفيذ الإجراءات التصحيحية","إلقاء اللوم على أعضاء الفريق لعدم اتباع عملية التحكم في التغيير","عكس التغييرات على الفور دون مزيد من التحليل","تجاهلها والتركيز فقط على إنهاء المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":763,"q":"A project's progress is behind schedule. The Project Manager has identified that a scope change was made without going through the proper processes. What should the Project Manager do?","t":"S","o":["Conduct a root cause analysis to understand the issue and implement corrective actions.","Blame the team members for not following the change control process.","Immediately reverse the changes without further analysis.","Ignore it and focus only on finishing the project."],"c":[0],"f":"The best approach when a project's progress is behind schedule due to scope change without going through the proper processes, the Project Manager should 'Conduct a root cause analysis to understand the issue and implement corrective actions.'. With this method, the manager will be able to understand what caused the issue in the first place and take the appropriate steps to rectify it.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":863}},{"qa":"أنت تدير مشروع تطوير برمجيات معقد. وفي منتصف الطريق، يطلب العميل تغييرًا كبيرًا في النطاق لدمج وظائف الذكاء الاصطناعي، ووعد بتغطية التكاليف الإضافية. يتماشى هذا التغيير مع أهداف العمل طويلة الأجل ولكنه سيؤخر المشروع لمدة ثلاثة أشهر. يشعر فريق التطوير بالحماس تجاه التحدي، لكن بعض أصحاب المصلحة يعبرون عن مخاوفهم بشأن التأخير. كيف يجب عليك المضي قدمًا في طلب تغيير النطاق هذا؟","oa":["وافق على طلب التغيير على الفور، حيث يكون العميل على استعداد لتغطية التكاليف الإضافية والفريق متحمس للتحدي","استشر فريق التطوير لإنشاء خطة تنفيذ مفصلة لوظائف الذكاء الاصطناعي، ثم قدمها إلى العميل للموافقة النهائية قبل بدء التغيير","نفذ التغيير تدريجيًا، بدءًا بوحدة ذكاء اصطناعي صغيرة لتقليل تأخيرات المشروع مع تلبية طلب العميل والحفاظ على تحفيز الفريق","أجر تحليلًا شاملاً للتأثير، وقدم النتائج إلى لجنة التحكم في التغيير، وانتظر قرارهم قبل المتابعة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":764,"q":"You're managing a complex software development project. Midway through, the client requests a significant scope change to incorporate AI functionality, promising to cover additional costs. This change aligns with long-term business goals but would delay the project by three months. The development team is excited about the challenge, but some stakeholders express concerns about the delay. How should you proceed with this scope change request?","t":"S","o":["Approve the change request immediately, as the client is willing to cover additional costs and the team is enthusiastic about the challenge.","Consult with the development team to create a detailed implementation plan for the AI functionality, then present it to the client for final approval before initiating the change.","Implement the change gradually, starting with a small AI module to minimize project delays while satisfying the client's request and maintaining team motivation.","Conduct a thorough impact analysis, present findings to the change control board, and await their decision before proceeding."],"c":[3],"f":"The best option \"Conduct a thorough impact analysis, present findings to the change control board, and await their decision before proceeding\"","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":864}},{"qa":"عند إجراء مراجعة، تلاحظ وجود صراع بين عضوين في الفريق يؤثر على أداء الفريق. بصفتك مدير مشروع، كيف يجب عليك معالجة هذا الأمر؟","oa":["تجاهل الصراع، على أمل أن يتم حله من تلقاء نفسه","تسهيل اجتماع مع الأطراف المتصارعة لفهم المشكلات الأساسية ومعالجتها","تحدث فقط مع عضو الفريق الذي تشعر أنه على حق","عاقب أعضاء الفريق بشكل علني أثناء المراجعة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":765,"q":"When conducting a retrospective, you notice a conflict between two team members affecting the team's performance. As a project manager, how should you address this?","t":"S","o":["Ignore the conflict, hoping it will self-resolve.","Facilitate a meeting with the conflicting parties to understand and address the underlying issues.","Only talk to the team member you feel is right.","Discipline the team members openly during the retrospective."],"c":[1],"f":"To address this conflict between two team members you should Facilitate a meeting with the conflicting parties to understand and address the underlying issues.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":865}},{"qa":"يتبع مدير المشروع خطة إدارة الموارد ويحتاج إلى اكتساب فهم أفضل لتفضيلات وتطلعات أعضاء الفريق من أجل تصميم أنشطة التطوير الفردية. ما هو أفضل مسار للعمل؟","oa":["جدولة مقابلات منظمة مع كل عضو في الفريق","إجراء تحليل SWOT","تقديم اختبارات القدرات لأعضاء فريق المشروع","إجراء تقييم للفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":766,"q":"A project manager is following the resource management plan and needs to gain a better understanding of the team members' preferences and aspirations in order to tailor individual developmental activities. What is the best course of action?","t":"S","o":["Schedule structured interviews with each team member","Perform a SWOT analysis","Provide ability tests to the project team members","Conduct a team assessment"],"c":[0],"f":"Very Important question in Real Exam\nPreferences and aspirations will be unique for each individual and will require an individual assessment. Structured interviews represent one of the various individual and team assessment tools which may be used in support of the Develop Team process. Structured interviews provide an opportunity for each team member to express their personal preferences and aspirations.","ap":"general","dm":"people","ch":"Stakeholders","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":866}},{"qa":"أثناء عرض الاطلاق، اوضح العميل أن احدى قصص المستخدمين ليست جاهزة ليستخدمها العميل . ما قائمة المراجعة التي ينبغي للفريق النظر فيها اغفاله في قصة المستخدم لمعرفة ما الذى تم","oa":["مخطط السرعة","تعريف الجهوزية","تعريف المنجز","مخطط الحرق التنازلي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":767,"q":"During a sprint demo, the customer says that or of the user stories is not ready for customer use. Which checklist should the team look at to find out what has been missed for the user story?","t":"S","o":["Velocity chart","Definition of ready (DOR)","Definition of done (DoD)","Burndown chart"],"c":[2],"f":"This is Very Important Question in Real Exam \n\nThe Definition of Done (DoD) is a checklist of criteria that must be met for a user story to be considered complete. If the customer says the user story is not ready, it means it doesn't meet the agreed-upon DoD.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":867}},{"qa":"يُطوّر مدير المشروع خطة لتحسين العمليات لتشجيع التحسين المستمر للعمليات طوال فترة المشروع. أيٌّ مما يلي يُعدّ أداةً أو أسلوبًا فعالًا لمساعدة مدير المشروع على ضمان نجاح خطة تحسين العمليات؟","oa":["تحليل العمليات","نظام التحكم في التغيير","المقارنة المعيارية","نظام إدارة التهيئة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":768,"q":"The project manager develops a process improvement plan to encourage continuous process improvement during the life of the project. Which of the following is a valid tool or technique to assist the project manager to assure the success of the process improvement plan?","t":"S","o":["Process analysis","Change control system","Benchmarking","Configuration management system"],"c":[0],"f":"When the project manager develops a Process Improvement Plan, the goal is to enhance performance and increase efficiency throughout the project lifecycle. To achieve this, the project manager should use a tool or technique that helps analyze current processes, identify inefficiencies, and suggest areas for improvement.","ap":"hybrid","dm":"process","ch":"Hybrid Life Cycle","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":868}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":769,"q":"The value of the features completed to date is $100,000. The actual cost expended to date is $107,000. The team planned on completing 32 story points by this time and have actually\ncompleted 33 story points. Which of the following options are true?\n(Choose two)","t":"M","o":["SPI=0.96","SPI=1.03","CPI=1.03","CPI=0.93"],"c":[1,3],"f":"🔹 Given:\n\n \n Earned Value (EV) = $100,000 (Value of features completed to date)\n \n \n Actual Cost (AC) = $107,000 (Actual cost to date)\n \n \n Planned Story Points = 32\n \n \n Actual Story Points Completed = 33\n \n\n➡️ Answer CPI=0.93 is correct.\n\n✅ 2. SPI (Schedule Performance Index)\n\nHere, SPI is calculated using story points because we're using agile metrics.\n\n so SPI=1.03","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7"},{"qa":"يقترب موعد التسليم المتفق عليه لمشروع معين، ومع ذلك، يُدرك مدير المشروع أن 75% فقط من العمل قد تم إنجازه. يقوم مدير المشروع بعد ذلك بإصدار طلب تغيير.\nما الذي ينبغي أن يصرح به طلب التغيير؟","oa":["تخصيص موارد إضافية باستخدام صندوق الطوارئ (الاحتياطي)","موافقة تصعيدية لاستخدام تمويل الطوارئ","إجراء تصحيحي بناءً على أسباب التأخير","عمل الفريق لساعات إضافية للالتزام بالجدول الزمني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":770,"q":"An accepted deadline for a project approaches. However, the project manager realizes only 75% percent of the work has been completed. The project manager then issues a change request.\nWhat should the change request authorize?","t":"S","o":["Additional resources using the contingency fund","Escalation approval to use contingency funding","Corrective action based on causes","Team overtime to meet schedule"],"c":[2],"f":"A corrective action is an intentional activity that realigns the project to the expected performance.\nSince the project is behind schedule, the project manager must first analyze the cause of the delay and then propose a corrective action via a change request to bring the project back on track.","ap":"predictive","dm":"process","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 7","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":869}},{"qa":"أنت تقود مشروع تطوير برمجيات. طلب أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين تغييرًا كبيرًا في ميزة رئيسية قرب نهاية مرحلة التنفيذ.\n\nما أول إجراء يجب أن تقوم به؟","oa":["تنفيذ التغيير إذا كان سيضيف قيمة","مراجعة طلب التغيير من خلال عملية التحكم المتكامل في التغييرات","تصعيد الطلب إلى راعي المشروع","إبلاغ الفريق بإيقاف العمل حتى اتخاذ قرار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":771,"q":"You are leading a software development project. A senior stakeholder requests a major feature change near the end of the execution phase.\n\nWhat should you do FIRST?","t":"S","o":["Implement the change if it adds value","C. Review the change request through the integrated change control process","Escalate the request to the sponsor.","Inform the team to stop working until a decision is made"],"c":[1],"f":"In project management, particularly during execution, changes often arise. However, PMI emphasizes that any change—especially significant ones—must first go through the Perform Integrated Change Control (PICC) process. This process involves documenting the request, analyzing its impact on scope, time, cost, quality, and resources, and getting formal approval before implementation. This protects the project from uncontrolled scope changes, ensures alignment with the baseline, and maintains governance.\n\nThe PICC process includes tools like the change control board (CCB), expert judgment, and impact analysis. Skipping this process can cause budget overruns, missed deadlines, or dissatisfaction among stakeholders due to undocumented scope additions.\n\n🔑 Keywords:\n\nChange Request – Integrated Change Control – Execution Phase – Scope Creep – Stakeholder Impact\n\n📚 PMI References:\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Edition\n 📖 Section: 4.6 – Perform Integrated Change Control\n 📄 Page: 115–118\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Edition\n 📖 Section: Tailoring Change Management\n 📄 Domain: Planning & Decision-Making (Change Control Governance)","ap":"predictive","dm":"people","ch":"Plan-Driven Life Cycle (Waterfall)","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":870}},{"qa":"توثق وثيقة حالة العمل الحاجة التجارية للمشروع. ما مسؤولية مدير المشروع تجاه هذه الوثيقة؟","oa":["تحديث حالة العمل في نهاية كل مرحلة","يمكن لمدير المشروع تقديم توصيات لتعديلها إذا لزم الأمر","إجراء تغييرات على حالة العمل إذا لزم الأمر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":772,"q":"The business case documents the business needs of a project. What is the project manager's\n responsibility regarding the business case?","t":"S","o":["Update the business case at the end of each phase","The project manager may make recommendations to revise it if needed","Making changes on the business case if necessary"],"c":[1],"f":"The business case is developed before the project starts, typically by the sponsor. It outlines the justification for the project. While the project manager relies on it for planning and execution, they are not responsible for maintaining or updating it, except for suggesting changes when needed.\n\nThe project manager does not update or modify the business documents since they are not project documents; however, the project manager may make recommendations to keep the project business case in alignment with the goals and objectives of the organization. [PMBOK 6th edition, Page 78].\n🔑 Keywords \n\nBusiness Case – Project Sponsor – Governance – Initiation\n📚 References\n\n \n PMBOK® 6th Ed: Section 1.2.6, Page 30\n \n \n PMBOK® 7th Ed: Section 2.3.2 – Business Case Alignment with Governance","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Finance","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":871}},{"qa":"ما النتيجة الرئيسية لاجتماع مراجعة التكرار (Sprint Review)؟","oa":["جزء مكتمل من المنتج","هدف الاسبرنت (التكرار ) كما تم الاتفاق عليه بين مالك المنتج والفريق","قائمة عناصر سجل اعمال المنتج مرتبة حسب الأولوية","يقوم الفريق بوضع الصياغة النهائية لسجل Sprint Backlog الخاص بالتكرار القادم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":773,"q":"What is the main outcome of a Sprint Review?","t":"S","o":["An increment of the product","A sprint goal as agreed upon by the product owner and team","A prioritized list of backlog items","The team finalizes the Sprint Backlog for the next Sprint."],"c":[1],"f":"🔹 Domain: Process\n\n🔹 Approach: Agile\n\n🔹 Importance:\nImportant, because it tests your understanding of Scrum events and the distinction between Sprint Review, Sprint Planning, Increment, and Product Backlog updates.\n\n🔹 Keywords:\nSprint Review – sprint goal – product owner – team\n\nThe Sprint Review is held to inspect what was completed during the Sprint and determine whether the Sprint Goal was achieved, while gathering stakeholder feedback and discussing what to do next.\nIn this question, the best answer is the sprint goal as agreed upon by the product owner and team, because the essence of the Sprint Review is checking completed work against the agreed goal.\n\nIt is important to distinguish among these ideas:\n\n The increment is produced during the Sprint\n Product Backlog reprioritization may be influenced by the review\n The next Sprint Backlog is finalized during Sprint Planning\n The Sprint Review focuses on completed work and goal achievement\n\n🔹 Example:\nA team is building a banking app, and the Sprint Goal is enabling fingerprint login. During the Sprint Review, the team demonstrates the feature to the product owner and stakeholders to confirm the goal was actually achieved. The main outcome here is validation of the Sprint Goal, not finalizing the next Sprint Backlog.\n\n🔹 Exam Tips:\nIf you see Sprint Review, think of demonstrating completed work, inspecting the goal, and collecting stakeholder feedback.\nIf the option mentions Increment only, be careful because the increment is a Sprint deliverable, not the meeting outcome itself.\nIf the option mentions finalizing the next Sprint Backlog, that points to Sprint Planning.\nIf the exam rephrases the question as What does the team inspect with stakeholders at the end of the Sprint? the answer will likely relate to completed work or Sprint Goal achievement.\nIf it asks What is updated after the Sprint Review? the answer may be the Product Backlog, not the Sprint Goal.\n\nReferences \n\n Agile Practice Guide, page 53–59\n PMBOK Guide Seventh Edition, page 131–135\n Examination Content Outline 2026, page 10–13\n PMBOK Guide Sixth Edition, page 756–761","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP-Exam 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":872}},{"qa":"يريد أحد العملاء أن يتم تطوير مكوّن أساسي بالاعتماد على الممارسات الرشيقة، لأن النطاق النهائي للمتطلبات لم يكتمل تطويره بالكامل بعد. يشارك مدير المشروع في إعداد العقد مع فريق المبيعات، ويريد التأكد من أن تكاليف التطوير لا تؤثر على ربحية المشروع.\n\nما الضابطان اللذان يجب على مدير المشروع تضمينهما في العقد لتطوير هذا المكوّن الأساسي؟ (اختر إجابتين)","oa":["إنشاء لجنة حوكمة لمراجعة تسليمات العقد","تقسيم أو تحديد المكوّنات الثابتة والمكوّنات الرشيقة","تقديم بدائل لتغيير النطاق عند مراحل محددة من المشروع داخل العقد","قصر استخدام هذا المشروع على الموارد الداخلية فقط","تحديد عدد التكرارات الخاصة بالتطوير في العقد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":774,"q":"A customer wants the development of a core component to be based on agile practices, as the final scope of the requirement has not yet been fully developed. The project manager is participating in contract development with the sales team and wants to ensure that development costs do not impact the profitability of the project.\n\nWhich two controls should the project manager incorporate in the contract for the development of the core component? (Choose 2)","t":"M","o":["Establish a governance committee to review the contract delivery","Identify or separate fixed and agile components","Provide alternatives to scope change at specific project phases within the contract","Require only internal resources be utilized for this project","Specify the number of iterations for development in the contract"],"c":[1,4],"f":"Domain:\nProcess \n\n🔹 Approach:\nHybrid\n\n🔹 Importance:\nVery important, because it tests how contracts are structured in agile or hybrid environments and how the project manager protects profitability when final scope is not fully defined.\n\n🔹 Keywords:\ncore component – agile practices – final scope – contract development – profitability\n\nThis question is about selecting appropriate contractual controls when the customer wants a core component developed using agile practices because the final scope is not yet fully defined.\nThe challenge is not just delivering the work, but doing so in a way that preserves flexibility without losing control over cost and profitability.\n\nThat is why the best two controls are:\n\nFirst: specify the number of iterations in the contract\nThis prevents development from continuing in an uncontrolled manner. In agile work, the customer may keep requesting refinements or changes, so defining a limited number of iterations creates a clear financial and time boundary.\n\nSecond: identify or separate fixed and agile components\nSome parts of the project may already be well defined and can be treated as fixed components, while other parts are still evolving and can be managed using agile methods. This distinction reduces ambiguity and makes the contract more balanced between flexibility and control.\n\nThis reflects adaptive contracting logic in agile, where not everything is fixed upfront, but clear boundaries and controls are still needed to prevent profitability erosion.\n\n🔹 Example:\nA software company signs a contract to build a digital platform. One core area, such as authentication integration and security rules, is already well defined and can be treated as fixed. But user interface refinements and optimization features are still evolving, so they are handled in an agile way.\nThe contract states that only 6 iterations are included for the evolving work and clearly separates the fixed elements. This allows flexibility without leaving cost unlimited.\n\n🔹 Exam Tips:\nIf the question mentions agile contracting, incomplete scope, and profitability or cost, think about controls that prevent unlimited openness.\nIf an option sets boundaries on iterations, time, or cost, it is often closer to the correct answer.\nIf an option separates fixed and variable parts, it usually reflects strong hybrid contracting logic.\nIf an option focuses only on internal resources or only on governance committees, it is usually less direct than actual contractual controls.\nIf the wording changed to a fully predictive environment with clearly defined scope, the answer might shift more toward a fixed-price contract rather than iteration control.\n\n🔹 References:\n\n PMBOK 7th Edition: Pages 129–136\n PMBOK 6th Edition: Pages 471–489\n Agile Practice Guide: Pages 77–81, 131–134\n ECO 2026: Pages 14–18","ap":"general","dm":"business","ch":"Governance","ex":"PMP - Exam 8","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":873}},{"qa":"أي مما يلي سيكون نتيجة اجتماع تخطيط التكرار","oa":["مربع أدوات التكرار مع لوحة العمل ومستودع التعليمات البرمجية","قائمة بأولويات بنود سجل أعمال المنتج","هدف التكرار على النحو المتفق عليه من قبل مالك المنتج وأعضاء الفريق","الزيادات في المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":775,"q":"Which of the following would be a result of a sprint planning meeting","t":"S","o":["A sprint toolbox with the storyboard, code repository.","A prioritized list of backlog items","A sprint goal as agreed upon by the product owner and the team members","An increment of the product"],"c":[2],"f":"Very Important Question In Real Exam \n\nA sprint goal includes a description of what the product owner and the team have agreed to accomplish during the sprint. \n\nA sprint goal is among the artifacts produced during the sprint planning meeting. \n\nThe product owner then presents the updated backlog items during the sprint planning meeting. \n\nAgile Practice Guide - First Edition, Page(s) 154","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":113}},{"qa":"فريق رشيق مكلف بتطوير روبوت. يريد مدير المشروع التأكد من التصميم قبل بناء الروبوت الفعلي، يتلقى الفريق ملاحظات مبكرة حول المتطلبات ويعدل التصميم وفقًا لذلك. أي مما يلي يجب على مدير المشروع استخدامه لتحقيق هذا الهدف","oa":["مراجعة التصميم","حالة الأعمال","قوائم المراجعة","نماذج أولية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":776,"q":"An agile team is tasked with the development of a robot. The project manager wants to ensure that before the actual robot is built, the team receives early feedback on requirements and adapts the design accordingly. Which of the following should the project manager use to achieve that goal","t":"S","o":["Design review","Business case","Checklists","Prototyping"],"c":[3],"f":"Prototyping supports the concept of progressive elaboration in iterative cycles, such as those used on agile projects described in the scenario. When enough feedback cycles have been performed, the requirements obtained from the prototype are sufficiently complete to move to the design or build phase. PMBOk 6th edition Page, 147","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":131}},{"qa":"ما هو مفهوم الأجايل المستخدم لتمكين الفريق لاتخاذ القرارات والبقاء المسؤولية","oa":["التفكير المرن","التنظيم الذاتي","التنمية المستدامة","ادارة الأداء"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":777,"q":"What agile concept is used to empower the team to make decisions and stay accountable","t":"S","o":["Lean Thinking","Self-Organization","Incremental development","Performance Management"],"c":[1],"f":"Self-organizing Teams: ** Not command and control. ** Responsibility delegated to the team. ** The team must be organized to deliver what is expected. ** The focus is on the overall team goal. ** Empower the team to make decisions and stay accountable.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":137}},{"qa":"يجب أن يقوم مستخدمو سكروم بشكل متكرر بمراجعة القطع الأثرية لـ سكروم والتقدم نحو هدف التكرار لاكتشاف الفروق غير المرغوب فيها. أي ركن من أركان سكرم يمثل هذا","oa":["الفحص","الشفافية","التكيف","الأسبرنت"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":778,"q":"Scrum users must frequently review Scrum artifacts and progress toward a Sprint Goal to detect undesirable variances. Which pillar of Scrum does this represent","t":"S","o":["Inspection","Transparency","Adaptation","Sprint"],"c":[0],"f":"Scrum has 3 Pillars.\n\n1- Transparency Significant aspects of the process must be visible to those responsible for the outcome. Transparency requires those aspects be defined by a common standard so observers share a common understanding of what is being seen. For example: A common language referring to the process must be shared by all participants; and, Those performing the work and those inspecting the resulting increment must share a common definition of \"Done\".\n\n2- Inspection Scrum users must frequently inspect Scrum artifacts and progress toward a Sprint Goal to detect undesirable variances. Their inspection should not be so frequent that inspection gets in the way of the work. Inspections are most beneficial when diligently performed by skilled inspectors at the point of work. \n\n3- Adaptation If an inspector determines that one or more aspects of a process deviate outside acceptable limits and that the resulting product will be unacceptable, the process or the material being processed must be adjusted. An adjustment must be made as soon as possible to minimize further deviation.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":138}},{"qa":"بغض النظر عن حجم وتعقيد المشروع ، أي مما يلي يوفر منصة لفريق أجايل للتعرف على عملياته وتحسينها وتكييفها؟","oa":["سباقات السرعة","القائد الخادم","مالك المنتج","التقيمات بأثر رجعي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":779,"q":"Regardless of the size and complexity of a project, which of the following provides a platform to an Agile team to learn about, improve, and adapt its processes","t":"S","o":["Sprints","Servant-leader","Product owner","Retrospectives"],"c":[3],"f":"Retrospectives allow Agile teams to learn about, improve, and adapt their processes. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 50]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":143}},{"qa":"طُلب من مدير المشروع تقديم إشارة إلى الوقت المتبقي في مشروع رشيق. ما هي الأدوات التي يمكن استخدامها لتوفير هذه المعلومات؟","oa":["مخطط باريتو","مخطط الأحتراق/ الأنهيار (التوقف)","نقاط القصة لقصص المستخدم المتبقي","تحليل وثيقة متطلبات العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":780,"q":"A project manager was asked to provide an indication of the time remaining on an agile project. What tools can be used to provide this information?","t":"S","o":["Pareto chart","A release burndown chart","Story points for the remaining user stories","Analysis of the business requirements document"],"c":[1],"f":"A burndown chart is a simple tool that tracks a team’s work progress against the amount of time remaining to complete the work. The chart shows the ideal rate of effort needed to reach work completion by a set date. Using a burndown chart helps you:\n\nCommunicate progress\nTrack remaining work\nPlan for future events\nReach work completion on time","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":144}},{"qa":"يقدر أعضاء فريق الأجايل المدة التي سيستغرقها تطوير ميزات لتطبيق جديد دون القلق بشأن الدقة. يشعر عضو الفريق الجديد بالقلق من أن نقص التخطيط الآن قد يتسبب في مشاكل في الجدولة لاحقًا. ما هي أفضل نصيحة يمكن للممارس الرشيق أن يقدمها لعضو الفريق الجديد بشأن الحجم الرشيق وتقدير مدة المشروع؟","oa":["بمجرد إنشاء السرعة، سيتحدد إجمالي عدد نقاط القصة  المنقسمة حسب السرعة على مدة المشروع","لتحديد مدة المشروع، يجب حساب السرعة قبل بدء التكرار الأول","يتم تحديد مدة المشروع باستخدام تقدير من أسفل إلى أعلى من خلال إضافة مدة المهام التي تضم قصص المستخدم","يمكن تحديد مدة المشروع عن طريق إضافة عدد نقاط القصة التي أكملها الفريق في كل تكرار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":781,"q":"Agile team members are estimating how long it would take to develop features for a new application without being overly concerned about accuracy. A new team member is concerned that a lack of planning now would cause scheduling problems later on. What is the best advice that the agile practitioner can give to this new team member on agile sizing and estimating the project duration","t":"S","o":["Once the velocity is established, the total amount of story points divided by velocity will determine the project duration","To determine the project duration , velocity should be calculated prior to the start of the first iteration.","Project duration is determined using bottom-up estimating by adding up the duration of the tasks comprising the user stories","The project duration can be determined by adding the number of story points completed by the team in each iteration."],"c":[0],"f":"Hint: In Agile, project duration cannot be accurately estimated up front. Rather, it can be derived from observing the team performance and knowing the total amount of story points. \"The duration of a project is not estimated as much as it is derived by taking the total number of story points and dividing it by the velocity of the team.\" Velocity can be roughly estimated at the beginning of the project if the project uses the same team, same (or similar) technologies, and other team and project attributes that are same or similar to the previously completed projects. If the velocity cannot be estimated based on those factors, it should be observed during the first two to three iterations. Once the velocity is established and the total amount of the story points is known, this amount can be divided by the current team's velocity to arrive at how many iterations it will take for the team to complete the project work. Iterations are time-boxed intervals, for example, two weeks. Knowing the number of the iterations, the team will be able to tell how long the project will take. For example, with ten 2-week iterations, the project duration will be 20 weeks. . Velocity is usually known after the team has run a few iterations (typically two to three). Dividing the total amount of story points by velocity would result in the number of iterations required to complete the project. With a time-boxed iteration length (for example 2 weeks), an estimated project duration can then be calculated.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":148}},{"qa":"الاستجابة للتغيير في متابعة الخطة هي واحدة من قيم بيان أجايل الرئيسية. أي من نهج الأجايل التالية يساعد في تحقيق هذه القيمة","oa":["تحسين سجل أعمال المنتج","القائد خادم","فرق التنظيم الذاتي","لوحات كانبان"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":782,"q":"Responding to change over following a plan” is one of the key Agile Manifesto values. Which of the following Agile approaches helps in achieving this value","t":"S","o":["Backlog refinement","Servant-leader","Self-organizing teams","Kanban boards"],"c":[0],"f":"Backlog refinement allows the product owner to change project priorities in line with evolving business needs. This changes the focus from following a predefined plan to responding to change. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 97]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":163}},{"qa":"إن مشروع إطلاق منتج جديد في مرحلة أولية للغاية وتتطور المتطلبات بسبب المنافسة الشديدة في السوق ، يرغب العميل في إطلاق المنتج مع الحفاظ على مرونة النطاق. يعتزم فريق المشروع بدء العمل بناءً على توقعات مشروع مماثل تم تسليمه العام الماضي. ما نهج المشروع الذي يناسب السيناريو؟","oa":["تنفيذه كمشروع مع بوابات المرحلة","قم بتنفيذه باستخدام نفس نهج المشروع المرجعي","قم بتنفيذه كمشروع سكرم","قم بتنفيذه كمشروع تنبؤي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":783,"q":"A project for a new product launch is in a very initial stage and the requirements are evolving Due to stiff competition in the market, the customer would like to launch the product keeping the scope flexible. The project team intends to start the work based on the forecast of a similar project delivered last year Which project approach suits the scenario","t":"S","o":["Execute it as a project with stage gates","Execute it using the same approach as the reference project","Execute it as a Scrum project","Execute it as a predictive project"],"c":[2],"f":"Because the requirements are evolving and the customer would like to launch the product keeping the scope flexible. SO the team should Execute it as a Scrum project. Note: Scrum is one of the most popular agile methods.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":170}},{"qa":"كان فريق أجايل يكافح لمواكبة الوتيرة المخطط لها ، والتي تؤدي في كثير من الأحيان إلى فشل التكرار. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع للمساعدة في تجنب هذا الموقف في المستقبل","oa":["قم بالتبديل إلى نهج كانبان ، وتنفيذ الميزات على أساس من يأتي أولاً يخدم أولاً ، وتعزيز وتيرة مستدامة","استبدل أعضاء الفريق المبتدئين بأعضاء أكثر خبرة وناقش نطاق المشروع لتعويض فجوة الميزانية","اطلب من راعي المشروع الموافقة على العمل الإضافي لتعويض نقص الأداء أثناء تعديل الخطة","راجع سرعة الفريق على مدار آخر تكرار واضبط الخطة وفقًا لذلك"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":784,"q":"An agile team has been struggling to keep up with the planned pace, which is frequently resulting in sprint failures What should the project manager do to help avoid this situation in the future","t":"S","o":["Switch to a Kanban approach, implementing features on a first-come, first-serve basis, fostering a sustainable pace","Replace junior team members with more experienced ones and negotiate the project scope to compensate for the budget gap","Ask the project sponsor to approve overtime to compensate for the lack of performance while adjusting the plan","Review the velocity of the team over the last several sprints and adjust the plan accordingly"],"c":[3],"f":"Review the velocity of the team over the last several sprints and adjust the plan accordingly","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":172}},{"qa":"يخطط فريق رشيق للأدوات التي سيستخدمونها في المشروع. يتناقش أعضاء الفريق حول كيفية إظهار العمل الجاري. من بين الخيارات التالية ، ما الأداة التي من المرجح أن يختاروها","oa":["لوحة المهام","قائمة قصص المستخدم المتراكمة\nUse Story backlog","خريطة طريق المنتج","هيكل تجزئة العمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":785,"q":"An agile team is planning for tools they will use for the project. The team members are debating how they should show what work is in progress. Of the following options, which tool are they most likely to select","t":"S","o":["task board","Use Story backlog","Product Roadmap","WBS"],"c":[0],"f":"Of the options presented, the best tool to show work in progress is a task board. The user story backlog shows what work is still remaining to be done on the project. The product roadmap shows when work is planned to be completed. Work breakdown structures are not commonly used on agile projects. \n \n\nVery Important Question In Real Exam \n\nIn agile environments (like Scrum or Kanban), the Task Board (or Kanban board) is the primary tool to visualize what tasks are To Do, In Progress, or Done. It provides transparency and enables the team to manage work-in-progress effectively.\n\n🔑 Keywords: Agile – Task Board – WIP – Visualization – Transparency\n\n📚 PMBOK 6: Agile Practice Guide p. 58\n📚 PMBOK 7: Delivery Performance Domain – Agile Tools & Techniques","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":177}},{"qa":"انضم عضو جديد في الفريق إلى فريق أجايل الخاص بك. سأل لك لماذا نستخدم موسكو. أجبته أنها تستخدم ل","oa":["تخطيط المخاطر والحساب","القيام بتقدير عبء العمل","ترتيب الأولويات","تحجيم القصة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":786,"q":"A new team member joined your agile team. He asked you what we use MOSCOW for. You answer him it is used for","t":"S","o":["Risk planning and calculation","Doing workload estimation","Prioritization","Sizing the story"],"c":[2],"f":"MoSCoW prioritization, also known as the MoSCoW method or MoSCoW analysis, is a popular prioritization technique for managing requirements. ... The acronym, MoSCoW, stands for 4 different categories of initiatives: must-haves, should-haves, could-haves, and will not have at this time.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":178}},{"qa":"ما هي العوائق الثلاثة التالية التي يجب على سكرام ماستر الانتباه إليها؟ اختر ثلاثة","oa":["أحد أعضاء الفريق يتحدث عن قصة مستخدم ليست موجودة على لوحة سكرم","مراجعة سجل اعمال المنتج في الاجتماعات الاحتياطية اليومية","تقنية تمنع القدرات الرشيقة","نقص في تمكين الفريق وعدم القدرة على التنظيم الذاتي","يتحدث أحد أعضاء الفريق عن قصة مستخدم موجودة على لوحة سكرم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":787,"q":"Which three of the following are impediments the scrum master should pay attention to? Choose three","t":"M","o":["A team member talking about a user story that is not on the scrum board","A review of the backlog at daily standup meetings.","A technology that blocks agile capabilities","A lack of team empowerment and an inability to self-organize.","A team member is talking about a user story that is on the scrum board."],"c":[0,2,3],"f":"The impediments are Actions that slow down or hinder progress. The Three impediments are: \n\n1- A lack of team empowerment and an inability to self-organize. \n\n2- A technology that blocks agile capabilities. \n\n3-A team member talking about a user story that is not on the scrum board.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":242}},{"qa":"أي من الترتيبات التالية يسمح للمشتري بأقل قدر من المرونة لتغيير نطاق الأعمال المتعاقد عليه؟","oa":["ترتيبات السعر الثابت.","عدم تجاوز الوقت وترتيب المواد.","خيار النطاق الديناميكي.","خيار الإلغاء المبكر."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":788,"q":"Which of the following arrangements allows least flexibility to the buyer to alter the contracted scope of works?","t":"S","o":["Fixed-price arrangements.","Not-to-exceed time and materials arrangement.","Dynamic scope option.","Early cancellation option."],"c":[0],"f":"A not-to-exceed time and materials allows replacing original scope with new scope. The dynamic scope option allows scope adjustments at specified points in the project. The early cancellation option allows termination halfway through the project. The fixed-price arrangement is the least flexible option. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 78]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":271}},{"qa":"أي من المصطلحات التالية يشير إلى التكلفة المؤجلة للعمل الذي لم يتم إنجازه في مرحلة سابقة من دورة حياة المنتج؟","oa":["تكلفة الفرصة","صافي القيمة الحالية","الدين الفني","التكلفة الغارقة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":789,"q":"Which of the following terms refers to the deferred cost of work not done at an earlier point in the product life cycle?","t":"S","o":["Opportunity cost","Net present value","Technical debt","Sunk cost"],"c":[2],"f":"Technical debt refers to the deferred cost of work not done at an earlier point in the product life cycle. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 154]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":276}},{"qa":"يتقدم فريق أجايل بشكل أبطأ قليلاً مما كان مخططًا له في بداية التكرار. أي من مقاييس أجايل التالية سوف يؤثر هذا؟","oa":["نقاط القصة","الوقت المثالي","السرعة الاتجاهية","المدة الفعلية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":790,"q":"An Agile team is progressing a little slower than what was planned at the start of the iteration. Which of the following Agile metrics will this effect?","t":"S","o":["Story points","Ideal time","Velocity","Actual duration"],"c":[2],"f":"Story points and ideal time are sizing/estimating metrics; these do not change with actual performance. Velocity, however, would get reduced if the team is delivering fewer story points than planned. Actual duration is an absolute number you get at the end of an activity, it can be different than the planned duration, but the final value doesn’t change. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 61]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":281}},{"qa":"يقع مدير المشروع في منتصف مشروع رشيق يتألف من 100 قصة مستخدم مقسمة إلى خمسة تكرارات. تبلغ قيمة كل قصة مستخدم 50 دولارًا. الإنفاق الفعلي هو 2000 دولار وتم تسليم 50 قصة مستخدم. كيف هو أداء المشروع","oa":["المشروع تحت الميزانية ومع الجدول الجدولي","المشروع فوق الميزانية وتحت الجدول الزمني","المشروع تحت الميزانية وخلف الجدول الجدولي","المشروع مع الميزانية والجدول الزمني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":791,"q":"A Project manager is in the middle of an agile project comprised of 100 user stories broken down into five iterations . Each user story is worth 50$ . The actual expenditure is 2,000$ and 50 user stories have been delivered. How is the project performing.","t":"S","o":["The project is under budget and on schedule","The project is over budget and behind schedule","The project is under budget and behind schedule","The project is on budget and on schedule"],"c":[0],"f":"EV = 50*50 = 2500 , AC = 2000 \n\nCV =EV-AC= 2500-2000 = + 500 so The project is under budget \n \n\n The Project is the middle = 1/2 *100 = 50 user stories \n\nPV = 50*50 = 2500\nSV= EV-PV = 2500-2500 = 0 so The project is on the schedule .","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":284}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يقود مشروعًا معقدًا من الناحية الفنية. المشروع جزء من برنامج عمل استراتيجي وأول من يستخدم نهجًا رشيقًا. يهتم أحد أعضاء مجلس الإدارة بحضور اجتماع لمعرفة مدى تقدم تسليم نطاق المشروع. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله قائد المشروع؟","oa":["قم بدعوة عضو مجلس الإدارة إلى اجتماع المراجعة التالي","قم بدعوة عضو مجلس الإدارة لاجتماع الوقوف اليومي","قم بدعوة عضو مجلس الإدارة إلى اجتماع التخطيط التالي","قم بدعوة عضو مجلس الإدارة إلى اجتماع التقييم  باثر راجعي القادم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":792,"q":"A project manager is leading a technically complex project. The project is part of a strategic program of work and the first to use an agile approach. One of the board members is interested in attending a meeting to see how the delivery of the project scope is progressing. What should the project lead do ?","t":"S","o":["Invite the board member to the next sprint review","Invite the board member to the next daily standup","Invite the board member to the next sprint planning","Invite the board member to the next sprint retrospective"],"c":[0],"f":"Keyword (how the delivery of the project scope is progressing) so the best option sprint review . Sprint review : is held at the end of a sprint , during which the team demonstrate what was accomplished and give feedback .","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":323}},{"qa":"فريق سكروم في منتصف التكرار يطلب راعي المشروع من  سكروم ماستر أن يتم تطوير متطلبات إلزامية جديدة وعاجلة ومعقدة مرتبطة بالامتثال على الفور في التكرار الحالي. ويؤكد الراعي أنه في حالة عدم تنفيذ المتطلب فقد يتم إلغاء المشروع بالكامل. ما هو أفضل رد لـ سكرم ماستر؟","oa":["ناقش المتطلبات مع مالك المنتج ، ودعه يتخذ قرارًا ، بما في ذلك إلغاء التكرار","أضف المتطلب إلى سجل المنتج  الحالي وقم بتوجيه\nالفريق لبدء العمل عليه على الفور","أضف المتطلبات إلى سجل أعمال المنتج واطلب من مالك المنتج مراجعة المتطلبات بعد انتهاء التكرار","قم بإرسال طلب تغيير لتحديث خط الأساس للنطاق وإضافة المتطلب إلى مصفوفة تتبع المتطلبات."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":793,"q":"A scrum team is midway into a sprint when the project sponsor approaches the scrum master and requests that a new , urgent , and potentially complex mandatory compliance -related requirement should be developed immediately in the current sprint . The sponsor stresses that if the requirement is not implemented , the entire project may be canceled . What is the scrum master's best response?","t":"S","o":["Discuss the requirements with the product owner , and let them make a decision , including sprint cancellation","Add the requirement to the current sprint backlog and direct the team to start working on it immediately.","Add the requirement to the product backlog and request the product owner to review the requirement after the sprint is over.","Submit a change request to update the scope baseline and add the requirement to the requirement traceability matrix."],"c":[0],"f":"The product owner is the appropriate authority to review new requirements and decide, together with the team, whether the requirements should be included in the prodcut backlog and in what sprint. The product owner may decide to cnacel the current sprint and start a new sprint that includes this new high priority requirement. In this case the teaة likely needs time to asses the impact of the new mandatory compliance- related requirement. The scrum master should discuss the new requirement with the product owner who , together with the team , may decide to cancel the sprint.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":357}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع حاليًا ببناء نظام إدارة المستودعات. نظرًا لتعقيد المشروع والمتطلبات الغامضة ، قرر الفريق اعتماد نهج إدارة رشيق. إذا كان هناك حاجة إلى معدل أعلى لتحسين عملية الإدارة من قبل فريق المشروع ، فأي مما يلي يمكن أن يساعد في تحقيق هذا الهدف؟","oa":["اعتماد أكس بي لمرحلة التطوير","عمل اجتماعات التقييم بأثر رجعي بشكل مستمر للتحسين المستمر","تأجيل التطوير لحين استيفاء كافة المتطلبات","استخدام لوحة كانبان لتمكين الإدارة المرئية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":794,"q":"A project team is currently building a warehouse management system . Due to the complexity of the project and ambiguous requirements, the team decided to adopt an Agile management approach. If a higher rate of management process improvement is required by the project team, which of the following can help achieve this objective?","t":"S","o":["Adopting XP for the development phase","Frequent retrospectives and selecting improvements","Deferring the development until all requirements have been collected","Using a Kanban board to enable visual management"],"c":[1],"f":"Keyword (Agile - Improve ) . Retrospectives can really facilitate process improvement by allowing the team to brainstorm on what went well and what went wrong [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition , Page 32].","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":360}},{"qa":"تقوم أنت وفريقك بتنفيذ أول مشروع رشيق في المنظمة. هذا مشروع خاص للمنظمة حيث يتم تنفيذ نهج الأجايل لأول مرة. لقد اقتربت من نهاية التكرار الأول في المشروع ولم تكتمل جميع قصص المستخدم المعينة. هل يمكن للفريق تمديد فترة التكرار لمدة يومين لإكمال جميع القصص المعينة في خطة التكرار؟","oa":["نعم ، لكن يتطلب موافقة مالك المنتج.","لا ، التكرارات مرتبطة بوقت محدد","نعم ، ولكن يتطلب موافقة سكرم ماستر","نعم ، لكن لا يمكن أن يكون التمديد أكثر من يومين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":795,"q":"You and your team are executing the first Agile project in the organization. This is a special project for the organization as Agile is being piloted for the first time . You are nearing the end of the first iteration on the project and not all of the assigned user stories are complete. Can the team extend the iteration duration by a couple of days in order to complete all assigned stories in the iteration plan?","t":"S","o":["Yes, but requires the approval of the product owner.","No, the iterations are time-boxed","Yes, but requires the approval of the scrum master","Yes, but the extension cannot be more than 2 days"],"c":[1],"f":"Agile is time boxed so the iteration durations cannot be extended. All incomplete stories need to be returned to the product backlog where they will get re-prioritized along with the other stories in the backlog. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 25]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":361}},{"qa":"طلب مالك المنتج بعض التغييرات الرئيسية التي سيكون لها تأثير كبير على المشروع وتتطلب إعادة ترتيب أولويات سجل المنتج والمتبقي من سجل أعمال المنتج . ماذا عليك ان تفعل؟","oa":["قم بإلغاء التكرار السريع واستدعِ على الفور لعمل أجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي","قم بإنهاء التكرار الحالي وإعادة ترتيب أولويات المشروع بأكمله","أستكمال القصص التي بدأت ولكن لا تحضر المزيد من القصص \"الجاهزة\" إلى \"قائمة الأعمال قيد التنفيذ","أكمل التكرار الحالي ، وأعد ترتيب أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج وقم بتكييف الخطة الجديدة للتكرار التالي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":796,"q":"The product owner has requested some major changes that will have a significant impact on the project and require reprioritizing the remaining backlog items. What should you do?","t":"S","o":["Cancel the current sprint and immediately call a retrospective","Terminate the current sprint and re-prioritize the entire project.","Complete the started stories but do not bring any more \"Ready\" stories into \"WIP\"","Complete the current iteration, re-prioritize the backlog and adapt the new plan for the next iteration."],"c":[3],"f":"Agile teams typically don't adjust their long term plan during a sprint unless all of the items being. Developed are dropped from the backlog. It is recommended to complete the current sprint and then re-plan and adjust accordingly. [Agile Practice Guide , 1st edition, Page 25]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":362}},{"qa":"يمكن عرض دورات حياة المشروع في سلسلة متصلة تتراوح من الدورات التنبؤية من طرف إلى الدورات الرشيقة على الطرف الآخر ، مع دورات أكثر تكرارية أو تزايدية في المنتصف. هناك طريقة أخرى تتمثل في تصور الاستمرارية باستخدام مخطط ثنائي الأبعاد مع تكرار التسليم على المحور ص ودرجة التغيير على المحور السيني. ما هي دورة حياة المشروع التي ينبغي اقتراحها للربع مع درجة عالية من التغيير وتكرار عالي للتسليم","oa":["دورة الحياة التكرارية","دورة الحياة الرشيقة","دورة الحياة التزايدية","دورة الحياة التنبؤية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":797,"q":"Project life cycles can be shown on a continuum ranging from predictive cycles on one end, to Agile cycles on the other end , with more iterative or incremental cycles in the middle. Another approach is to visualize the continuum with a two-dimensional chart with the frequency of delivery on the Y-axis and the degree of change on the X-axis . What project life cycle should be proposed for the quadrant with a high degree of change and high frequency of delivery","t":"S","o":["Iterative","Agile","Incremental","Predictive"],"c":[1],"f":"The Agile approach is recommended for projects that require a high degree of change and high frequency of project deliveries [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition, Page 19]","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":363}},{"qa":"تستخدم فرق أجايل أيًا مما يلي لتحديد أولويات قصص المستخدمين بشكل تعاوني بناءً على قيمتها الخاصة بالنسبة إلى عميل المشروع","oa":["اجتماع الرجعية (التقييم بأثر رجعي )","تخطيط الموجة المتدرجة","تنقيح سجل أعمال المنتج","لوحة كانبان"],"rat":null,"fa":"تنقيح سجل أعمال المنتج يتضمن إضافة القصص وإزالتها وتحديد أولوياتها في سجل أعمال المنتج. الغرض من التنقيح هو مساعدة الفريق على فهم ما هي القصص ومدى اتساعها بالنسبة لبعضها البعض.\n\n[دليل الممارسة الرشيقة ، الطبعة الأولى ، الصفحة 52]","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":798,"q":"Agile teams use which of the following to collaboratively prioritize user stories based on their respective value to the project's customer","t":"S","o":["Retrospective","Rolling wave planning","Backlog refinement","Kanban Board"],"c":[2],"f":"Refinement Backlog / Backlog grooming involves adding, removing and prioritizing stories in the product backlog. The purpose of refinement is to help the team understand whay the stories are and how large the stories are in relation to each other. [Agile Practice Guide, 1st edition , Page 52]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":365}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع حاليًا بتحليل تقدم التكرار الحالي ومراجعة الرسم البياني التالي. ماذا يسمى هذا المخطط؟","oa":["خرائط التحكم","مخطط الأحتراق التصاعدي","الرسم البياني التوزيعي","مخطط الأحتراق التنازلي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":799,"q":"A project team is currently analyzing its current iteration progress and reviewing the following chart. What is this chart called?","t":"S","o":["Control Chart","Burnup Chart","Histogram","Burndown Chart"],"c":[3],"f":"A burndown chart is a graphical representation of work left to do versus time. The outstanding work is shown on the vertical axis and time along the horizontal. It is useful for predicting when all of the work will be completed.\n\n[PMBOK Guide ,6th edition, Page 226 ]","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":367}},{"qa":"إذا كان سيتم إنتاج المخرجات باستخدام إطار عمل رشيق. ما هي الاستراتيجيات التي قد تكون مناسبة لكسب القبول الرسمي لنطاق المنتج؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["اطلب من الفريق توضيح قصص المستخدم المكتملة لمالك المنتج في نهاية كل تكرار","اطلب من مالك المنتج حضور كل اجتماع التقييم بأثر رجعي لمراجعة أجزاء المنتج المكتملة والموافقة عليها","قم بإجراء عملية التحقق من النطاق بمجرد اكتمال نطاق المشروع بالكامل وفقًا لخطة إدارة النطاق","قم بإجراء عرض توضيحي كلما تم تطوير ميزات كافية من مجموعة متماسكة","تأكد من أن نطاق المنتج يتجزء بالكامل إلى مستوى حزمة العمل أثناء التخطيط الأولي للمشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":800,"q":"If the deliverables will be produced using an agile framework . What strategies might be appropriate to gain formal acceptance of the product scope? (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Have the team demonstrate the completed user stories to the product owner at the end of each iteration","Ask the product owner to attend each sprint retrospective to review and approve the completed product increment","Perform the validate scope process once the entire project scope is complete in accordance with the scope management plan","Conduct a demonstration whenever enough features have been developed to from a coherent set","Ensure that the product scope is fully decomposed down to the work package level during initial project planning"],"c":[0,3],"f":"In flow-based agile , the development team will demonstrate the completed work once enough features have been developed to from a coherent set. Teams that use flow-based agile typically employ a kanban board to manage their workflow. In iteration -based agile , the project team should conduct an iteration review . During the iteration review , the project team demonstrates the completed work, and the product owner then accepts or declines the user stories.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":373}},{"qa":"يهتم العميل بالوقت اللازم لإكمال المشروع ويطلب من فريق المشروع تقليل عدد التكرارات المطلوبة لإكمال المنتج. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يتبعه مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحديد أولويات التسليمات بناءً على قيمة العمل وتحديد الإصدارات المتكررة","اطلب من الفريق تحدي تقديرات المشروع لتسريع التسليم","اطلب من الفريق رفع الحواجز أو العوائق في الاجتماعات اليومية","تحديد أولويات المهام ذات المخاطر العالية لتقليل عدد التكرارات المطلوبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":801,"q":"A customer is concerned about the time required to complete a project is asking the project team to reduce the number of iterations required to complete the product. Which approach should the project manager take ?","t":"S","o":["Prioritize deliverables based on business value and define frequent releases","Ask the team to challenge the project estimations for faster delivery","Ask the team to raise blockers or impediments in daily meetings","Prioritize the tasks with high risks to reduce the number of iterations required"],"c":[0],"f":"Prioritize deliverables based on business value and define frequent releases","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":387}},{"qa":"في مشروع محدد للمدة والميزانية ، يريد العميل تطوير مكون أساسي يعتمد على ممارسات نهج الأجايل (الأساليب الرشيقة) ، حيث لم يتم تطوير النطاق النهائي للمتطلبات بالكامل بعد. يشارك مدير المشروع في تطوير العقد مع فريق المبيعات ويريد التأكد من أن تكاليف التطوير لا تؤثر على ربحية المشروع. أي من الضوابط التي يجب على مدير المشروع دمجها في العقد لمعالجة تطوير المكون الأساسي على وجه التحديد (اختر اثنين)","oa":["صِف العقد أو المكونات الثابتة والمرنة","تشكيل لجنة حوكمة لمراجعة تسليم العقد","أطلب استخدام الموارد الداخلية فقط لهذا المشروع","توفير بدائل لتغيير النطاق في مراحل محددة من المشروع ضمن العقد","تقييد عدد التكرارات الخاصة بتطوير في العقد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":802,"q":"In a fixed time and budget project the customer wants the development of a core component to be based on agile practices, as the final scope of the requirements has not yet been fully developed. The project manager is participating in contract development with the sales team and wants to ensure that development costs do not impact the profutability of the project. (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Tier the contract or fixed and agile components","Establish a governance committee to review the contract delivery","Require that only internal resources be utilized for this project","Provide alternatives to scope change at specific project phases within the contract","Limit the number of iterations for development in the contract"],"c":[2,4],"f":"Keyword (a fixed time and budget project)\n\nso the project manager should\n\n Require that only internal resources be utilized for this project\n \n Limit the number of iterations for development in the contract","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":390}},{"qa":"بناءً على توقعات الإدارة ، يريدون التأكد من أن تسليم التكرار الأول يساعد فريق التسويق على تقديم نموذج المنتج الأولي للعملاء المحتملين. بصفتك مدير مشروع ، ماذا يجب أن تفعل؟","oa":["اطلب من الراعي إعطاء الأولوية لبعض وظائف المنتج","حدد الحد الأدنى من الوظائف المطلوبة للمنتج","قم بزيادة تفاصيل هيكل تجزئة العمل  لتقليل الأخطاء والتأخير","قم بتقسيم سجل أعمال المنتج إلى مراحل لضمان تسليم الميزات الرئيسية أولاً"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":803,"q":"Based on the management's expectations, they want to ensure that the deliverable of the first iteration helps the marketing team present the product prototype to potential customers. As a project manager, what should you do?","t":"S","o":["Ask the sponsor to prioritize some functionalities of the product","Identify the minimum functionality required for the product","Increase the details of the work breakdown structure (WBS) to minimize errors and delay.","Split the backlog into phases to ensure that the key features are delivered first."],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager should focus on delivering a minimum set of valuable features to satisfy early adopters","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":393}},{"qa":"خلال أجتماع مراجعة اخر تكرار ، اشتكى صاحب المصلحة الرئيسي من أن المنتج يفتقد العديد من الميزات التي كانوا يتوقعونها. جادل فريق المشروع بأن كل زيادة تفي بمعايير القبول وتمت الموافقة عليها من قبل صاحب المصلحة الرئيسي. مؤشر أداء التكلفة للمشروع هو 1.15 ومؤشر أداء الجدول هو 1.43. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تحليل سبب الفجوة في التفاهم مع الطرفين وتفاوضوا على الحل","اطلب من صاحب المصلحة تقديم طلب تغيير لزيادة الميزانية والوقت لطلب التعديلات","اطلب من فريق المشروع إجراء التعديلات حيث يمكن أن تدعمها ميزانية المشروع والجدول الزمني","اشرح لأصحاب المصلحة أنه نظرًا لاستيفاء معايير القبول لكل تكرار ، يمكن إغلاق المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":804,"q":"During the last sprint review , the main stakeholder complained that the product was missing many features they had been expecting. The project team argued that every incremental met the acceptance criteria and was approved by the main stakeholder. The cost perfromance index CPI of the project is 1.15 and the schedule performance index SPI is 1.43. What should project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Analyze the reason for the gap in understanding with both sides with both sides and negotiate a solution","Ask the stakeholder to submit a change request to increase the budget and time for the modifications request","Ask the project team to perform the modifications since the project budget and schedule can support them","Explain to the stakeholder that since the acceptance criteria for every increment were met , the project can be closed"],"c":[0],"f":"Without understanding the reason for the gap, the issue can occur again.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":396}},{"qa":"يعقد فريق العرض التوضيحي الأول للبرنامج الذي تم إنشاؤه حتى الآن في مشروع متوسط الحجم ، وقد كشف مالك المنتج عن عدد من المشكلات التي يرغبون في معالجتها قبل تقديم الموافقة ، كيف ينبغي لمدير المشروع التعامل مع هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["قم بتوجيه مالك المنتج إلى مستند متطلبات العمل الموقع واشرح أن الخطة الحالية لا يمكنها تنسيق هذه التغييرات","أخبر مالك المنتج أنه سيتم معالجة المشكلات في الإصدار الثاني من البرنامج","قم بتوجية مالك المنتج إلى خطة إدارة التغيير ، ثم قم بالتصعيد إلى اللجنة التوجيهية","خطط لمعالجة المشكلات من خلال تنقيح سجل أعمال المنتج ودمجها في التكرار التالي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":805,"q":"A team is holding the first demonstration of the software built to date on a medium -sized project the product owner has uncovered a number of issues they would like to be addressed before providing approval how should the project manager approach this problem ?","t":"S","o":["Refer the product owner to the signed business requirement document and explain that the current plan cannot facilitate these changes","Tell the product owner the issues will be addressed in the second version of the software","Refer the product owner to the change management plan , then escalate to the steering committee","Plan to address the issues through backlog grooming and incorporate them into the next sprint"],"c":[3],"f":"Plan to address the issues through backlog grooming and incorporate them into the next sprint","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":422}},{"qa":"خلال التكرار الثالث ، واجه الفريق تأخيرًا كبيرًا لم يشهد أي تحسينات كبيرة خلال الأسابيع القليلة الماضية. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["اطلب أعضاء فريق إضافيين للمساعدة في التحسينات","دمج نهج تنبؤي لهذا العنصر","إجراء مراجعات تقييمات بأثر رجعي بشكل مستمر وأقترح التحسينات","تنفيذ استراتيجيات التخفيف لهذا العنصر"],"rat":null,"fa":"النهج : الرشيق\nالكلمة المفتاحية : التحسينات (موجودة في نص السؤال )\nالإجابة الصحيحة (بأثر رجعي = تحسينات)\n في نهج الأجايل يكون هناك اجتماعات التقييم باثر رجعي  مخصصة لبحث طرق التحسينات","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":806,"q":"During the third iteration , the team encounters a major delay that has not had significant improvements over the last few weeks . What should the project manager do ?","t":"S","o":["Request additional team members to help with improvements","Incorporate a predictive approach for this element","Retrospect frequently and suggest improvements","Implement mitigation strategies for this element"],"c":[2],"f":"Approach : Agile\nKeyword: Improvements\nThe correct answer (Retrospective = Improvements)","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":424}},{"qa":"ظل الفريق يعمل لمدة شهرين ,وباستمرار مدة قصص المستخدم تختلف عن ما هو مخطط لها. فكيف يجب على مدير المشروع معالجة هذه المشكلة؟","oa":["المشاركة في توظيف مورد ذو مهارات عالية لتعزيز المهارات","ضع في اعتبارك استخدام نظام المكافآت لتشجيع التسليم في الوقت المناسب","تعزيز تغيير مدة التكرار من أجل الالتزام كما هو مخطط","تأكد من أن حجم التكرار مناسب لمدة التكرار"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":807,"q":"The team has been working for two months and has consistently missed planned user stories . How should the project manager address this issue?","t":"S","o":["Engage in recruiting a highly skilled resource to reinforce the skills","Consider using a reward system to encourage timely delivery","Promote changing the iteration duration in order to commit as planned.","Ensure the sprint size is appropriate for the iteration duration"],"c":[3],"f":"Project manager should Ensure the sprint size is appropriate for the iteration duration to avoid delay and delivery comply with consistent pace","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":427}},{"qa":"بعد عدة تكرارات ، يقرر مدير المشروع تقديم المنتج إلى أحد المعنيين الرئيسيين. ملاحظات المعنيين هي أن الفريق أخطأ في العديد من الميزات. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع لتجنب ذلك في المستقبل؟","oa":["قم بدمج ممارسات التفكير التصميمي في دورة حياة المشروع لفهم شخصيات المنتج بشكل أفضل وتكون أكثر فاعلية لمطابقة احتياجاتهم","قم بجدولة اجتماع المراجعة للتكرار لجمع التعليقات المبكرة من المعنيين وتكييف الخطة وفقًا لذلك","قم بتقييم مهارات الفريق للبحث عن شخص لديه خبرة في تصميم المنتج وتكليف هذا الشخص بمهمة إعادة بناء واجهة المنتج","أعداد جلسات جمع المتطلبات مع جميع المعنيين الرئيسيين لتقييم النطاق مرة أخرى وإعادة ترتيب أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج  بناءً على الجلسات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":808,"q":"After a couple of iterations , the project manager decides to present the product to a key stakeholder. The stakeholder's feedback is that the team missed the mark on many features. What should the project manager do to avoid this in the future ?","t":"S","o":["Incorporate design thinking practices into the project life cycle to better understand the product's personas and be more effective to match their needs","Schedule adequate sprint demos to gather early feedback from the stakeholders and adapt the plan accordingly","Evaluate the team's skills to look for someone with experience in product design and assign that person the task of rebuilding the product interface","Setup requirements gathering sessions with all key stakeholders to evaluate the scope once again and re prioritize the backlog based on the sessions"],"c":[1],"f":"The sprint review meeting should be held after the end of each sprint and before next sprint planning meeting to gather early feedback from the stakeholders and adapt the plan accordingly.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":428}},{"qa":"تريد شركة زيادة القيمة التجارية لأحد منتجاتها في سوق تنافسية للغاية. من أجل القيام بذلك ، تقوم الشركة بتكليف مشروع لإنشاء نموذج أولي. يبني الفريق النموذج الأولي بشكل تدريجي. ما هو الإجراء الذي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه كأولوية","oa":["تنفيذ دورة خطة العمل والتحقق والتصرف (PDCA).","التأكيد على استخدام منهجية كانبان.","تأكد من أن راعي المشروع على علم بتاريخ الذهاب إلى السوق.","تقديم قيمة الأعمال في أسرع وقت ممكن"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":809,"q":"A company wants to increase the commercial value of one of its products in a highly competitive market. In order to do this, the company commissions a project to create a prototype. The team constructs the prototype incrementally.\nWhich action should the project manager take as a priority?","t":"S","o":["Implement a plan-do-check-act (PDCA) cycle","Emphasize the use of Kanban methodology.","Ensure the project sponsor is aware of the go-to market date","Deliver business value as soon as possible."],"c":[3],"f":"In order to increase opportunities and increase business value when building a prototype the focus must be on business value","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":436}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق سكروم بتحليل مخطط الإنهيار في اليوم الرابع من التكرار لمدة 15 يومًا. يظهر الرسم البياني للحرق التنازلي أدناه. ماذا يجب أن يفعل الفريق بعد ذلك؟","oa":["استمر في عمل التكرار كما هو مخطط واستمر في المراقبة","استمر في التكرار حيث يظهر التقدم طرق للانقطاعات المحتملة","اسأل مالك المنتج إذا كان من الممكن قطع بعض القصص ذات الأولوية المنخفضة من التكرار","اطلب من فريق المشروع اختيار أي قصص إضافية حيث أن لديهم سعة إضافية مما هو مخطط له"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":810,"q":"A Scrum team is analyzing the burndown chart on day four of a 15-day sprint. The burndown chart is shown below. What should the team do next?","t":"S","o":["Continue with the sprint work as planned and keep monitoring","Continue with the sprint as the progress shows buffers for potential interruptions","Ask the product owner if some low-priority stories could be cut from the sprint","Ask the project team to select any additional stories as they have additional capacity than planned"],"c":[0],"f":"It's just day 4 of 15 days sprint. it's too early to take any action. Monitoring will be appropriate","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":451}},{"qa":"أثناء تنفيذ مشروع معقد ، يواجه مدير المشروع العديد من طلبات التغيير من فرق مختلفة. قد تؤدي هذه التغييرات إلى عدم تلبية المشروع لأهدافه. كيف يجب أن يضمن مدير المشروع أن هذه التغييرات تدار بشكل فعال؟","oa":["سجل التغييرات باستخدام سجل المخاطر واستمر في المراقبة","راجع الأولويات مع مالك المنتج لتضمين التغييرات في سجل أعمال المنتج","ارفض طلبات التغيير واستمر في تسليم المشروع كما هو مخطط له","قم بمراجعة خطة إدارة المشروع والاتصالات مع صاحب المصلحة الرئيسي"],"rat":null,"fa":"حسب السيناريوا الواضح أن التغيرات قد لم تحقق أهداف المشروع ومطلوب انه يريد أن يضمن أن  التغيرات تدار بشكل فعال لذا فانه وفق لنهج الأجايل يجب على مدير المشروع مراجعة الأولويات مع مالك المنتج لتضمين المتطلبات في سجل أعمال المنتج","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":811,"q":"During the execution of a complex project , the project manager encounters numerous change requests from various teams. These changes may result in the project not meetig its objectives. How should the project manager ensure that these changes are managed effectively","t":"S","o":["Record the changes using the risk register and continue monitoring","Review priorities with the product owner to include the changes in the backlog","Deny the change requests and keep delivering the project as planned","Review the project and communications management plan with the main stakeholder"],"c":[1],"f":"According to scenario, the changes did not achieve the project goals and it is required that he wants to ensure that the changes are managed effectively. Therefore, according to the agile approach, the project manager should review the priorities with the product owner to include the requirements in the product backlog.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":486}},{"qa":"تقوم شركة نقل بتحويل عملياتها التشغيلية والنظام الرئيسي الذي تستخدمه هذه الشركة لنقل البضائع. بيان النطاق في مكانه. تم الاتفاق على نهج التسليم التكراري من قبل جميع أصحاب المصلحة. ما الذي يتعين على مدير المشروع القيام به بعد ذلك لمساعدة الفريق على فهم العمل الذي يتعين القيام به؟","oa":["ابدأ العمل على خطة إدارة المشروع مع حزم العمل والجدول الزمني المفصل وتعيينات العمل لأعضاء الفريق","قم بإنشاء خطة إدارة المتطلبات لتحديد كيفية جمع متطلبات المشروع وتحليلها وتوثيقها ، ثم تعيين المتطلبات لأعضاء الفريق","العمل مباشرة مع أصحاب المصلحة على هيكل تقسيم العمل وقم بتعيين المهام مع الجدول الزمني المطلوب لكل عضو في الفريق لبدء العمل.","العمل مع الفريق لتقسيم النطاق إلى هيكل تقسيم العمل وحزم العمل من أجل إنشاء التسليمات والجداول الزمنية المطلوبة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":812,"q":"A transportation company is transforming its operational processes and the main system this company uses to move freight. The scope statement is in place. An iterative delivery approach has been agreed by all stakeholders. What does the project manager need to do next to help the team understand the work that needs to be done?","t":"S","o":["Start working on the project management plan with work packages, a detailed schedule, and work assignments for team members.","Create the requirements management plan to outline how project requirements will be collected, analyzed, and documented, and then assign requirements to team members.","Work directly with stakeholders on the work breakdown structure (WBS) and assign tasks with a required timeline for each team member to start the work.","Work with the team to decompose the scope into a WBS and work packages in order to create required deliverables and timelines."],"c":[1],"f":"To help the team understand the work to be done, a plan is created to determine how requirements can be collected, analyzed, and documented","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":499}},{"qa":"يواجه مشروع يتبع النهج الرشيق مشكلات الجودة مع كل إصدار ، مما يؤدي إلى حدوث العديد من مشكلات الإنتاج. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لإصلاح المشكلة وتحسين الجودة؟","oa":["أنشئ نظامًا للمكافآت يمنح الحوافز لأعضاء الفريق القادرين على اكتشاف المزيد من العيوب","ابحث عن موافقة تمويل إضافية مع الراعي لاستبدال أعضاء الفريق المبتدئين بالأعضاء الأكثر خبرة","استعن بشركة خارجية لإضافة طبقة اختبار إضافية ، مع التأكد من فحص المنتج النهائي جيدًا قبل طرحه","استخدم الاجتماع الأستعدادي (أجتماع التقييم باثر رجعي) لفهم السبب الجذري لمشاكل الجودة بشكل أفضل ووضع خطة مع الفريق لمعالجة المشكلات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":813,"q":"An agile approach is facing quality issues with every release, generating many production problems. What should the project manager do to fix the problem and improve the quality?","t":"S","o":["Create a reward system granting incentives to the team members who are able to catch more defects","Seek extra funding approval with the sponsor to replace junior team members for more experienced ones","Hire an external company to add an additional layer of testing , making sure that the final product is well inspected before releasing","Use the retrospective meeting to better understand the root cause of the quality problems and put together a plan with the team to address the problems"],"c":[3],"f":"Quality issues with each release - improve quality so a retrospective meeting is best suited for this","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":503}},{"qa":"تضمنت مناهج إدارة المشاريع التقليدية العديد من مؤشرات الأداء الرئيسية التي تنبأت بنجاح المشروع. كيف نظهر نجاح مشروع أجايل ؟","oa":["من خلال إثبات أنه تم تسليم منتج قابل للأستخدام / التطبيق فعالاً إلى العميل","من خلال إعادة استخدام مؤشرات الأداء الرئيسية والقياسات التقليدية","بالتسليم في الوقت المحدد","من خلال الحفاظ على سرعة الفريق الإنتاجية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":814,"q":"Traditional project management approaches included multiple KPIs that predicted the success of a project. How do we demonstrate success of an Agile project?","t":"S","o":["By demonstrating that a working product has been delivered to the customer","By reusing the traditional KPIs and measures","By release on time","By maintain productive team velocity"],"c":[0],"f":"Agile Principles (Working software is the primary measure of progress)","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":509}},{"qa":"أنت تقود مشروعًا لتصميم نظام جديد ومبتكر يعتمد على التكنولوجيا المطورة حديثًا. في المشاريع السابقة ، باستخدام نهج تقليدي لإدارة مشروع الشلال ، واجهت مشاكل مع زحف النطاق. ومع ذلك ، نظرًا لطبيعة المشروع الحالي ، فقد قررت استخدام نهج رشيق. نظرًا لأنه يتناسب مع نطاق المشروع ، كيف سيختلف هذا المشروع عن مشاريعك السابقة؟","oa":["سيتطور نطاق المشروع خلال المشروع","أثناء التخطيط الأولي ، سيتم إنشاء هيكل تفصيلي للعمل","سيتم تجنب زحف النطاق من خلال نظام صارم لإدارة التغيير","سيتم فهم نطاق المشروع بشكل أفضل في بداية المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":815,"q":"You are leading a project to design a new and innovative system based on newly developed technology. In past projects , using a traditional waterfall project management approach, you have encountered issues with scope creep. However , given the nature of the current project , you have decided to use an agile approach. As it telated to project scope, how will this project differ from your past projects?","t":"S","o":["The project scope will evolve during the project","During initial planning, more detailed work breakdown structure will be created","Scope creep will be avoided with a strict change management system","The project scope will be better understood at the beginning of the project"],"c":[0],"f":"In the scenario you have decided to use an agile approach which differ about Traditional approach\nAn agile approach is change drriven development approach\n the project scope isnot unclear in the beginning or not weel iunderstood upfront will evolve during the project\nTraditional approach is plan driven development so detailed scope and clear in the planning phase","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":512}},{"qa":"أنت تعمل على مشروع يتكون من ثلاثة إصدارات ، خمس تكرارات لكل إصدار. سيوفر الإصدار الأول الميزات الضرورية المطلوبة لمنتج قابل للتطبيق على الأقل مع ميزات إضافية  بعد كل إصدار لاحق. يريد العميل معرفة الميزات التي ستتوفر في نهاية كل تكرار. ما هي أفضل أداة أو تقنية لاستخدامها في هذه الحالة؟","oa":["قائمة الأنشطة","الخط المرجعي للجدول الزمني","طريقة المسار الحرج","التخطيط لأصدار أجايل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":816,"q":"You are working on a project that consists of three releases , five iterations per release . The first release willprovide the must-have features required for a mininmum viable product with additional features added after each subsequent release. The customer wants to know which features will be available at the end of each iteration. What is the best tool or technique to use in this situation?","t":"S","o":["Activity list","Schedule Baseline","Critical path method","Agile release planning"],"c":[3],"f":"Agile release planning is a project management approach where teams build and release products in iterations or incremental stages rather than all at once or grouped into distinct major releases","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":513}},{"qa":"ما هو مؤشر أداء كانبان الرئيسي الذي يسمح للفرق بتقديم التزامات موثوقة حول المدة التي يستغرقها إنجاز العمل؟","oa":["السرعة","دورة الوقت","العمل قيد التقدم","العيوب"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":817,"q":"Which kanban key performance indicator allows teams to make reliable commitments about how long it takes them to deliver work?","t":"S","o":["Velocity","Cycle time","WIP","Defects"],"c":[1],"f":"Cycle time refers to the time it takes for a work item to go through part of an overall process. Cycle time allows teams to make commitments how long it would take for the team to deliver work.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":514}},{"qa":"يجتمع مالك المنتج مع فريق أجايل وأصحاب المصلحة لتحديد أولويات الميزات في سجل أعمال المنتج. يتم تصنيف كل ميزة بناءً على المخاطر المرتبطة بتطويرها والقيمة التي توفرها الميزة للعميل. ما الميزات التي يجب أن يعطيها مالك المنتج الأولوية لتطويرها أولاً من أجل زيادة احتمالية نجاح المشروع إلى الحد الأقصى؟","oa":["مخاطر منخفضة / قيمة منخفضة","مخاطر عالية / قيمة عالية","مخاطر منخفضة / قيمة عالية","مخاطر عالية / قيمة منخفضة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":818,"q":"A product owner meets with the agile team and stakeholders to prioritize features in the product backlog. Each feature is categorized based on the risk associated with its development and the value the feature provides to the customer. Which features should the product owner prioritize to be developed first in order to maximize the probability of projct success?","t":"S","o":["Low risk /low value","High risk/High value","Low risk /High value","High risk/ Low value"],"c":[1],"f":"First High value , High risk\nSecond High value , low risk\nThird low value /High risk\nFourth low value / low risk","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":519}},{"qa":"لإنتاج التسليمات ، يجب أن يتعاقد مشروعك مع العديد من البائعين. سيتم تطوير المخرجات باستخدام إطار عمل رشيق مع تسليم مدفوع بالقيود ، مما سيؤثر على العلاقة التعاقدية مع البائعين. أي من الاستراتيجيات التالية هي الأنسب لهذا المشروع؟ (اختر ثلاثة)","oa":["تابع علاقة المخاطر المشتركة والمكافأة مع البائعين","استخدم عقد السعر الثابت لكل البائعين","اعتماد زيادات ثابتة السعر عند التعاقد مع البائعين","قم بتضمين خيار الإلغاء المبكر في عقود البائعين","قم بتطوير بيان عمل المشتريات بناءً على هيكل تجزئة العمل التفصيلي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":819,"q":"To produce deliverables , your project has to contract with several vendors. The deliverables will be developed using an agile framework with constraint driven delivery , which will influence the contractual relationship with the vendors. Which of the following strategies would be the most appropriate for this project? (Choose three)","t":"M","o":["Pursue a shared - risk -reward relationship with the vendors","Utilize a standard firm-fixed price contract for each of the vendors","Adopt fixed-price increments when contracting with the vendors","Include an early cancellation option in the vendor contracts","Develop the procurement statement of work based on the detailed WBS"],"c":[0,2,3],"f":"The question describes a project that will use agile methodologies, including constraint driven delivery . Constraint driven delivery is a common strategy for agile projects, where the cost and/or time are fixed, and the scope is allowed on vary. Such projects will require greater flexibility and a more collaborative relationship with vendors as compared to a traditional waterfall approach.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":539}},{"qa":"تعاقد مدير مشروع رشيق مع بائع بعض التسليمات المطلوبة للمشروع. يستخدم البائع أيضًا نهجًا رشيقًا لإدارة المشاريع لتقديم عمله. كيف ينبغي تقييم تقدم البائع؟","oa":["من خلال حضور اجتماعات الوقوف اليومية لفريق البائعين","من خلال مراجعة تقرير التقدم الأسبوعي من البائع","من خلال إجراء عمليات تدقيق المشتريات لعمليات البائع","من خلال مراجعة النسخ الصادرة لعمل البائع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":820,"q":"An agile project manager has contracted with a vendor some of the deliverables required for the project . The vendor is also using an agile project management approach to deliver their work. How should the progress of the vendor be assessed?","t":"S","o":["By attending the vendor team's daily stand up meetings","By reviewing the weekly progress report from the vendor","By conducting procurement audits of the vendor's processes","By reviewing the released versions of the vendor's work"],"c":[3],"f":"In Agile project one of the 12 principles \"Working software is the primary measure of progress.\"","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":540}},{"qa":"نظرًا لنقص الخبرة ، ستحتاج بعض مخرجات مشروع رشيق إلى الاستعانة بمصادر خارجية لبائعين خارجيين. تريد المنظمة المنفذة التأكد من أن البائع المحدد سيستخدم أجايل كطريقة تسليم لإنتاج التسليمات المتعاقد عليها. ما هو أفضل مسار عمل لمدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتجميع فريق المشروع الرشيق للمؤسسة المنفذة مع فريق المشروع الخاص بالمورد الذي تم اختياره","قم بتطوير المخرجات داخلياً لأن هذا هو دائمًا أفضل وأرخص نهج لإدارة المشاريع الرشيقة","حدد البائع بناءً على أفضل نهج تقني وأقل تكلفة وقم بإعداد تدريب رشيق للبائع","في معايير اختيار المصدر ، حدد أنه يجب على البائع استخدام أجايل كنهج لإدارة المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":821,"q":"Due to the lack of expertise , some agile project deliverables will need to be outsourced to external vendors. The performing organization wants to ensure that the selected vendor will use agile as their delivery method to produce the contracted deliverables . What is the best course of action for the project manager?","t":"S","o":["Colocate the agile project team of the performing organization with the project team of the be selected vendor","Develop the deliverables in house since this is always the best and cheapest approach to run agile projects","Select the vendor based on the best technical approach and lowest cost and set up agile training for the vendor","In the source selection criteria , specify that the vendor must use agile as their project management approach"],"c":[3],"f":"it is a perfectly acceptable practice for the buyer to require that the seller's team members act much like an extended part of the buyer's agile team as part of the vendor selection criteria . Therefore , indicating in the source selection criteria that the vendor must use agile as their project management approach.","ap":"agile","dm":"business","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":543}},{"qa":"بدأت شركة في تنفيذ سكروم. في منتصف الطريق تقريبًا خلال التكرار الأول ، تتطور مشكلات الاتصال. لا يتزامن بعض أعضاء فريق المشروع مع أعضاء الفريق الآخرين. ما سبب هذه الفجوة في التواصل؟","oa":["لم يتم عقد اجتماعات الوقوف اليومية أو إنفاذها","لم يتم تحديث لوحة تكرار المشروع","لم يتم تحديث لوحة معلومات حالة المشروع","لم يتم تطوير خطة إدارة  الأتصالات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":822,"q":"A company starts implementating Scrum . About halfway through the first sprint, communication issues develop. Some project team members are not in sync with other team members. What is the cause for this communication gap","t":"S","o":["Daily standup meetings were not held or enforced","The project sprint board has not been updated","The project status dashboard has not been updated","The communications management plan has not been developed"],"c":[3],"f":"The cause for this communication gap is that the communiacations management plan has not been develope","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":559}},{"qa":"وفقًا للرسم البياني للحرق التنازلي الموضح أدناه ، فإن خط الحرق التنازلي المنقط هو الخطة. ما الذي يجب أن يراه الفريق في اليوم الثالث","oa":["هناك تجاوز للتكلفة","هم في خطر لهذا التسليم","التكرار قبل الموعد المحدد","التكرار على المسار الصحيح"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":823,"q":"As per the burndown graph shown below , the dotted burndown line is the plan. What should the team see at day 3","t":"S","o":["There is a cost overrun","They are at risk for that delivery","The iteration is ahead of schedule","The iteration on track"],"c":[1],"f":"The graph shows an example of a burndown chart where the team planned to delivery 37 story points . Story points rate the relative work , risk and complexity of a requirements or story . Agile teams use story points to estimate effort . The dotted burndown line is the plan. The team can see by Day 3 that they are at risk for that delivery.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":561}},{"qa":"يعمل فريق رشيق لوقت إضافي في التكرارات القليلة الماضية. قرر مدير المشروع أنه من الآن فصاعدًا ، يجب أن يحتفظ الفريق بأسبوع عمل مدته 40 ساعة. ما هو السبب الأكثر احتمالا وراء قرار مدير المشروع؟","oa":["لتعزيز التنمية المستدامة","لتقليل حجم العمل الجاري","لتعظيم مقدار العمل غير المنجز","لتقديم برامج العمل بشكل متكرر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":824,"q":"An agile team has been working overtime for the last few iterations . The project manager has decides that from now the team should maintain a 40-hour workweek. What is the most likely reason behind the project manager's decision?","t":"S","o":["To promote sustainable development","To minimize the amount of work in progress","To maximize the amount of work not done","To deliver working software frequently"],"c":[0],"f":"Agile processes promote sustainable development . The sponsors , developers . The sponsors , developers , and users should be able to maintain a constant pace idndefinitely . \" Constant pace would allow the team members to maintain their work-life balance, make fewer mistakes, sustain healthy productivity , collaborate better, and posiibly refrain from resigning.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":562}},{"qa":"أنت مدير مشروع لمشروع بناء. خلال اجتماع مراجعة  المشروع ، قرر أصحاب المصلحة الاستجابة للمخاطر المعروفة والجديدة التي تمت مواجهتها أثناء تنفيذ المشروع. أي من القطع الأثرية التالية يجب على أصحاب المصلحة مراجعتها؟","oa":["خطة إدارة الوثائق","سجل أعمال المنتج معدلة حسب المخاطر","سجل الافتراض والقيود","سجل المشروع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":825,"q":"You are a project manager for a construction project. During the project review meeting, the stakeholders decided to respond to known and new risks encountered during project execution. Which of the following artifacts should the stakeholders review?","t":"S","o":["Document management plan.","Risk-adjusted backlog","Assumption/constraints log","project log"],"c":[1],"f":"A risk-adjusted backlog is a backlog that includes work and actions to address threats and opportunities. Pmbok7 page#185.\n\nThe risk-adjusted backlog is a sprint or release backlog containing risk response tasks for actionable risks. For negative risks, these actions include avoiding, mitigating, and transferring. For positive risks, they include exploiting, enhancing, and sharing","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":572}},{"qa":"تقوم شركة بتغيير نموذج أعمالها الحالي. يتطلب التغيير تنفيذ مشروع معقد باستخدام فرق أجايل متعددة. ما هي الخيارات الثلاثة التي يجب على مدير المشروع أن يعتمدها فريق الاختبار كآليات اختبار؟ (اختر ثلاثة.)","oa":["اختبار الأمان والأداء","الاختبارات القائمة على السلوك والتطوير القائم على الاختبار","اختبار القصة","نهج تجريبي لتغطية جميع الخيارات الممكنة","الاختبار الشخصي المستقل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":826,"q":"A company is changing their current business model. The change requires implementing a complex project using multiple agile teams.\nWhat three options should the project manager have the testing team adopt as testing mechanisms? (Choose three.)","t":"M","o":["Security and performance testing","Tests based on behavior and test-driven development","Story testing","An experimental approach to cover all possible choices","Independent personal testing"],"c":[1,2,4],"f":"The three options should the project manager have the testing team adopt as testing mechanisms in agile teams.\nA. Story testing\nB. Tests based on behavior and test-driven development\nC. Independent personal testing","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":575}},{"qa":"ناقش القائد الفني للعميل ميزة جديدة مع مدير المشروع. يعتقد مدير المشروع أن الميزة الجديدة ستعزز الأداء بشكل كبير ويضيفها كعنصر ذي أولوية عالية في  سجل أعمال المنتج . في نهاية التكرار، لم تكتمل جميع القصص المخططة لأن الميزة الجديدة استغرقت وقتًا أطول. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["الحصول على موافقة من فريق المشروع وإضافة القصة الجديدة إلى سجل أعمال المنتج","تفاوض مع سكروم ماستر  قبل إضافة القصة الجديدة إلى سجل أعمال التكرار","اتفق مع فريق المشروع لتعديل وحذف بعض القصص في سجل أعمال التكرار الحالي","احصل على موافقة من مالك المنتج وأضف القصة الجديدة إلى سجل أعمال المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":827,"q":"A customer's technical lead discussed a new feature with the project manager. The project manager believes the new feature will boost performance significantly and adds it as a high-priority item in the sprint backlog. At the end of the sprint, all of the planned stories were not completed because the new feature took more time.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Obtain approval from the project team and add the new story to the product backlog","Negotiate with the scrum master before adding the new story to the sprint backlog","Agree with the project team to modify and delete some of the stories in the current sprint backlog","Receive an agreement from the product owner and add the new story to the product backlog"],"c":[2],"f":"The product owner is responsible for adding and prioritizing user stories in product backlog. Adding new features took a long time, which led to the incompleteness of all the planned user stories. Therefore, to get the team back on the right track, agree with the project team to modify and delete some stories in the sprint backlog.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":576}},{"qa":"راعي المشروع لمبادرة كبرى يغير باستمرار ترتيب أولويات حزم العمل المعيارية. اعتاد الفريق على تكرارات  لمدة ثلاثة أسابيع وأصبح محبطًا بشكل متزايد من التغييرات اليومية في النطاق. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بإعداد اجتماع مع فريق المشروع واطلب رأيهم حول ما يجب القيام به","عقد لقاء مع الراعي لشرح أهمية الحفاظ على دورة التكرار الصارمة","قليل دورة التكرار إلى متوسط طلب إعادة ترتيب الأولويات عن طريق حسابه بالأيام","انتقل إلى استراتيجية كانبان بحيث يمكن إعادة تخصيص العمل بسهولة أكبر"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":828,"q":"The project sponsor of a major initiative is consistently changing the prioritization of modular work packages. The team is used to three week sprints and is becoming increasingly frustrated with the daily changes in scope.\nWhat should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Set up a meeting with the project team and ask for their opinion on what to do","Set up a meeting with the sponsor to explain the importance of keeping a strict sprint cycle","Decrease the sprint cycle to the average reprioritization request by calculating it in days.","Move to a Kanban strategy so that work can be reallocated more easily"],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager should communicate with the sponsor and discuss the impact of the frequent changes in prioritization on the team's work and schedule. They should explain the importance of a strict sprint cycle for maintaining momentum, predictability, and accountability for the project, and find ways to align the sponsor's priorities with the team's work. This can help to mitigate the frustration of the team and ensure the project is on track.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":577}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق بإنهاء الإصدار الثالث لتقديمه إلى أصحاب المصلحة كجزء من العرض التوضيحي. أبلغت الشركة التي تتعاقد من الباطن مع المطورين أن هناك مشكلة في التدفق النقدي ولن تكون الشركة قادرة على توفير نفس الموارد للتكرارات التالية. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع بعد ذلك؟","oa":["قم بتحليل التأثير مقابل خطة الأصدار إذا لم تتم معالجة المشكلة","تصعيد الموقف إلى الجهة الراعية للمشروع لحل محتمل","إنشاء سجل مخاطر لتتبع المخاطر وطلب ميزانية إضافية","العمل مع مالك المشروع لتحديد أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":829,"q":"A team is finishing the third release to present to the stakeholder as part of a demonstration. The company that subcontracts the developers has communicated that there is a cash flow problem and the company will not be able to provide the same resources for the next iterations.\nWhat should the project manager do next?","t":"S","o":["Analyze the impact against the release plan if the blocker is not addressed","Escalate the situation to the project sponsor for a possible resolution","Create a risk register to track the risks and request additional budget","Work with the project owner to prioritize the product backlog"],"c":[0],"f":"Analyze the impact against the release plan if the blocker is not addressed","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":580}},{"qa":"تم تكليف مدير المشروع بالبدء في مشروع كبير لتسليم معدات معقدة. سيكون جزء من المشروع نتيجة لعملية بحث طويلة ، ولكن بمجرد اكتمال ذلك ، يجب تسليم الجزء الآخر من المشروع بشكل تدريجي إلى العميل. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يختاره مدير المشروع لهذا المشروع؟","oa":["تكيفية","تنبؤية","تزايدية","هجين"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":830,"q":"A project manager has been assigned with initiating a large project to deliver complex equipment. Part of the project will be the result of a long research process, but once this is completed, the other part of the project must be incrementally delivered to the customer.\nWhich approach should the project manager choose for this project?","t":"S","o":["Adaptive","Predictive","Incremental","Hybrid"],"c":[0],"f":"Adaptive is the correct answer. This is nowhere mentioned that the first part had a predefined scope. Since the first part was a long research, that has a high chance to be iterative and the 2nd part is evident enough to be increment. Both are the part of Adaptive but not Hybrid.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":590}},{"qa":"يريد العميل إنشاء برنامج مبتكر في السفر باستخدام نهج رشيق. تم تعيين مدير مشروع من الشركة للعمل على التفاصيل والتقديرات حسب طلب العميل. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع قبل إرسال المعلومات إلى العميل؟","oa":["ضع المهام مع التقديرات في سجل الأعمال ووضح أن المشروع لن يحتاج إلى أي احتياطيات","العمل مع الفريق لفهم وجهات نظرهم وإضافة التبعيات والمخاطر المناسبة","قم بتحليل المهام ، وتقديم التقديرات ، وتضمين نموذجًا تجريبيًا أوليًا ، وإرسالها إلى العميل مباشرةً","تسلسل المهام بالتقديرات وإضافة احتياطيات مخاطر قياسية لاستخدامها في تطوير البرامج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":831,"q":"A client wants to create an innovative software for the travel industry using an agile approach. A project manager from the company was assigned to work on the details and estimates as requested by the client.\nWhat should the project manager do before sending the information to the client?","t":"S","o":["Put the tasks with estimates in the backlog and clarify that the project will not need any reserves","Work with the team to understand their views and add the appropriate dependencies and risks","Analyze the tasks, provide estimates, include a prototype demo, and send to the client directly.","Sequence the tasks with estimates and add standard risk reserves to use for software development"],"c":[2],"f":"A client wants to create an innovative software for the travel industry using an agile approach so the project manager should Analyse the tasks, provide estimates, include a prototype demo, and send to the client directly","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":593}},{"qa":"وفقًا لمخطط الحرق التصاعدي هذا لآخر تكرار في اليوم السابع  ، ما الذي يجب أن يعالجه قائد المشروع مع مالك المنتج والفريق؟","oa":["يجب ألا يطلب مالك المنتج من الفريق تغيير التزاماته في التكرار","يقبل الفريق الكثير من العمل في التكرار بعد بدئه","لا يلبي الفريق توقعات مالك المنتج","يجب أن يتوقف الفريق في اليوم الرابع ويبدأ في تكرار جديد"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":832,"q":"According to this burnup chart for the last 7-day sprint, what should the project lead address with the product owner and team?","t":"S","o":["The product owner should not ask the team to change their sprint commitments.","The team is accepting too much work in the sprint after it has started","The team is not meeting the expectations of the product owner","he team should have stopped on day 4 and started a new sprint"],"c":[1],"f":"The burnup chart shows that the team is not on track to complete all the planned work by the end of the sprint. Therefore, the project lead should address this issue with the product owner and team and discuss the reasons behind the delay and the potential impact on the sprint goals. They should also consider adjusting the sprint backlog and priorities to ensure that the most critical items are completed.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":594}},{"qa":"يعمل مدير المشروع على مشروع رشيق في بيئة أعمال متغيرة. يشعر راعي المشروع بالقلق بشأن تحقيق الفوائد ويطلب من مدير المشروع الانتباه إلى التغييرات التي يمكن أن تؤثر على المشروع. ما الإجراء الذي يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذه لتحديد التغييرات التي قد تؤثر على المنتج؟","oa":["تنفيذ التواصل وجهًا لوجه بين الفريق ومالك المنتج لتغيير أهداف التكرار حسب الحاجة","اتخذ إجراءً لإعادة ترتيب أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج بعد كل تكرار لتقييم ما إذا كانت قصص المستخدمين لا تزال ذات قيمة للأعمال التجارية","قم بتطبيق أسلوب البرمجة الزوجية للرد على التغييرات فورًا ، حتى في منتصف التفاعل","أوقف التكرار في أسرع وقت ممكن في حالة تحديد تغيير خارجي يجعل المنتج لا يقدر بثمن"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":833,"q":"A project manager is working on an agile project in a changing business environment. The project sponsor is worried about benefits realization and asks the project manager to pay attention to changes that can affect the project.\nWhich action should the project manager take to identify changes that may affect the product?","t":"S","o":["Implement face-to-face communication between the team and product owner to change the iteration objectives as needed","Take action to re prioritize the backlog after every iteration to evaluate if user stories are still valuable to the business.","Apply a pair programming technique to react to changes immediately, even in the middle of the interaction","Stop the iteration as soon as possible in case an external change that makes the product invaluable is identified"],"c":[1],"f":"To identify changes that may affect the product, the project manager should take action to reprioritize the backlog after every iteration. This will allow the project team to evaluate if the user stories are still valuable to the business and if they need to be adjusted or removed in light of any changes in the business environment. The project manager should also involve the product owner in this process, as they are the ones who are more familiar with the business requirements.","ap":"agile","dm":"business","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":597}},{"qa":"بدأت شركة في تطوير منتج جديد. أثناء التنفيذ ، لاحظ فريق المشروع أن منافسًا آخر قد أطلق منتجًا بوظائف متشابهة جدًا وسعر سوق أرخص. ما الذي كان يجب فعله بشكل مختلف لتجنب هذا السيناريو؟","oa":["يجب إصدار الحد الأدنى من المنتج القابل للتطبيق  للحصول على تعليقات من السوق","كان يجب استخدام طريقة كانبان لتحسين العمل الجاري","كان ينبغي اعتماد نهج دورة الحياة التكرارية","كان ينبغي جدولة المزيد من اجتماعات تحسين سجل أعمال المنتج"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":834,"q":"A company has started developing a new product. During execution the project team notices that another competitor has launched a product with very similar functionalities and a cheaper market price.\nWhat should have been done differently to avoid this scenario?","t":"S","o":["A minimum viable product (MVP) should have been released to get feedback from the market.","The Kanban method should have been utilized to optimize the work in progress (WIP).","An iterative life cycle approach should have been adopted","More backlog refinement meetings should have been scheduled"],"c":[0],"f":"A minimum viable product (MVP) should have been released to get feedback from the market.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":627}},{"qa":"أي من الأساليب التالية المستخدمة في دورات الحياة التكيفية تساعد في تقليل زحف النطاق؟","oa":["قصص  المستخدم","مالك المنتج","فترات زمنية محددة","التكرارات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":835,"q":"Which of the following techniques used in adaptive lifecycles helps in minizing scope creep?","t":"S","o":["User Stories","Product owner","Time boxing","Iterations"],"c":[2],"f":"A timebox is a limited time period within which a well-defined deliverable must be produced with given resources. The deadline to produce the deliverable is set and must not be changed. The difference between a timebox and classical progress control is that when a timebox is used, the scope of the deliverable is one of the variables of project management. The quality, however, is never a variable. Time boxing helps to minimize scope creep as it forces the teams to process essential feature first , then other features when time permits","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":729}},{"qa":"أنهى فريق المشروع التكرار الأول من أصل ستة. كان أداء تسليم التكرار (السرعة) 50%. أثناء أجتماع التقييم (الدروس المستفادة) بأثر رجعي، أدرك الفريق أنه تم التقليل من تعقيد العمل. ماذا يجب أن يفعل مدير المشروع؟","oa":["قم بتحديث سجل المشكلات وتصعيده إلى راعي المشروع","اطلب استبدال بعض أعضاء الفريق بأعضاء أكثر خبرة","اطلب من المدير الفني مساعدة الفريق في حل المشكلة","اجتمع مع الفريق لمراجعة الإجراءات الداخلية لحل الموقف"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":836,"q":"A project team has finished its first iteration out of six. The iteration's delivery performance (velocity) was 50% . During the iteration retrospective , the team realizes that the complexity of the work was underestimated . What should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Update the issue log and escalate it to the project sponsor","Ask to replace some team members with more experienced ones.","Ask the technical manager to help the team with the issue","Meet with the team to review internal actions to resolve the situation."],"c":[3],"f":"During the iteration retrospective , the team realizes that the complexity of the work was underestimated so the project manager should Meet with the team to review internal actions to resolve the situation .","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":735}},{"qa":"يقوم فريق المشروع بإجراء تخطيط التكرار . بناءً على الجهد المقدر، قد يتم تسليم 95% فقط من العناصر المدرجة في التكرار . يطلب مالك المنتج من مدير المشروع النصيحة حول كيفية تحديد أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج. ما الذي يجب استخدامه لتحديد أولويات سجل أعمال المنتج.","oa":["دقة التقدير","خطر التسليم","قيمة العمل","التعقيد الفني"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":837,"q":"A project team is conducting sprint planning. Based on the estimated effort,only 95% of the items included in the sprint may be delivered . The product owner asked the project manager for advice on how to prioritize the backlog items. What should be used to prioritize the backlog items.","t":"S","o":["Estimation accuracy","Risk to delivery","Business Value","Technical complexity"],"c":[2],"f":"🔹 Domain: Process\n\n🔹 Approach: Agile\n\n🔹 Importance:\nVery important, because it tests how backlog items are prioritized in agile, especially when delivery capacity is limited during Sprint Planning.\n\n🔹 Keywords:\nSprint planning – estimated effort – prioritize the backlog items\n\nDuring Sprint Planning, if the team realizes that not all selected items may be delivered, the product owner should ensure that the most important items come first.\nIn agile, the primary basis for backlog prioritization is business value, meaning the benefit delivered to the customer or organization.\n\nThis does not mean risk, complexity, or estimates are irrelevant, but they are supporting factors rather than the primary prioritization driver.\nThe Product Backlog is generally ordered with highest-value items first, then effort, dependencies, risk, and feasibility are considered.\n\nIn other words:\n\n The product owner focuses on value\n The development team supports estimation and technical feasibility\n Prioritization should maximize delivered value\n\n🔹 Example:\nSuppose there are four features for an app, but the team can only finish three.\nIf online payment provides the highest direct benefit to customers and the business, while a color theme enhancement provides less value, the payment feature should be prioritized first even if some other items are easier or less risky.\n\n🔹 Exam Tips:\nIf the exam asks how to order the Product Backlog, think first about business value or product value.\nIf the question is about what the product owner should prioritize when capacity is constrained, the answer is often value.\nIf the question focuses on what threatens Sprint completion, the answer may relate to risk, but this question is about prioritization, not threats.\nIf the question mentions effort or estimates, do not be misled; estimation is not the same as prioritization.\nIf the question is phrased as What should the product owner maximize? the answer is likely value.\n\n🔹 References:\n\n Agile Practice Guide: Pages 18–19, 51–56\n PMBOK 7th Edition: Pages 9–14, 40–44\n PMBOK 6th Edition: Pages 138, 163, 167\n PMBOK 8th Edition: Pages 22–27, 64–69\n ECO 2026: Pages 10–16","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":738}},{"qa":"بسبب التخفيض الأخير في الميزانية، تم تسريح اثنين من أعضاء الفريق من فريق Agile. لا يزال العميل يتوقع النتائج المبكرة للمشروع. ما الإجراءين اللذين يجب على مدير المشروع اتخاذهما لمواءمة توقعات العملاء؟ (إختر إثنين)","oa":["اطلب من مالك المنتج مراجعة سجل أعمال المنتج ذات الأولوية مع العميل.","اطلب من فريق اجايل مراجعة سرعة التكرار المحدثة مع العميل","مراجعة سجل المعوقات مع العميل","إرسال خطة مفصلة لإدارة المشروع إلى العميل","اطلب من فريق اجايل مراجعة وتحديث خطة إدارة الجودة مع العميل."],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":838,"q":"Due to a recent budget reduction, two team members were released from an agile team. The customer is still expecting early results for the project.\nWhich two actions should the project manager take to align customer expectations? (Choose two)","t":"M","o":["Ask the product owner to review the prioritized backlog with the customer.","Ask the agile team to review the updated sprint velocity with the customer.","Review the impediments log with the customer.","Send a detailed project management plan to the customer.","Ask the agile team to review and update the quality management plan with the customer."],"c":[0,1],"f":"Two actions should the project manager take to align customer expectations\n1- Ask the product owner to review the prioritized backlog with the customer.\n2-Ask the agile team to review the updated sprint velocity with the customer.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":747}},{"qa":"بعد مراجعة خطة إدارة المشروع مع أصحاب المصلحة الرئيسيين، تم إخبار مدير المشروع بأن خطة الإصدار لمدة 18 شهرًا غير مقبولة ويجب إطلاق المنتج في غضون ستة أشهر. بناءً على الجدول الزمني الجديد، ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله؟","oa":["قم بالتخطيط للعمل الإضافي وتطبيق التتبع السريع والتعطل ومشاركة مخاطر الفشل مع أصحاب المصلحة في المشروع","قم بمراجعة سجل أعمال للمشروع بحثًا عن العناصر ذات الأولوية العالية والتوصل إلى الحد الأدنى من المنتج القابل للتطبيق  الذي يناسب الجدول الزمني المتوقع","الحصول على موافقة الراعي على مضاعفة ميزانية المشروع ثلاث مرات، وتعيين عدد أكبر من الأشخاص للتعويض عن الجدول الزمني المضغوط","قم بمراجعة المسار الحرج مع أصحاب المصلحة، موضحًا سبب عدم إمكانية تسليم النطاق بالكامل في الجدول الزمني المتوقع"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":839,"q":"After reviewing the project management plan with key stakeholders, the project manager was told that an 18-month release plan was unacceptable and the product should launch in six months. Based on the new timeline, what should the project manager do?","t":"S","o":["Plan for overtime apply crashing and fast tracking and share the risk of failure with project stakeholders","Review the project backlog looking for high-priority items and come up with a minimum viable product (MVP) that fits the expected timeline","Seek approval with the sponsor to triple the project budget, hiring more people to compensate for the compressed schedule","Go over the critical path with stakeholders, explaining why it is not possible to deliver all the scope in the expected timeline"],"c":[1],"f":"The product should launch in six months , so this is fit with agile approach so the project manager should Review the project backlog looking for high-priority items and come up with a minimum viable product (MVP) that fits the expected timeline.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":749}},{"qa":"لقد نفذت المنظمة تاريخياً معظم المشاريع باستخدام نهج تنبؤي. وتريد المنظمة الآن التحول إلى نهج رشيق. ونتيجة لهذا التغيير، يشعر مدير المشروع بالقلق بشأن عملية تحديد النطاق للمشاريع القادمة. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لضمان تحديد النطاق بالكامل؟","oa":["الاجتماع بالمدير العام وإقناعه بالعودة لاستخدام النهج التنبؤي لتجنب أي مخاطر","ساعد الرعاة والمعنيين في صياغة رؤية المنتج وجمع الفريق ومالك المنتج معًا لتوضيح التوقعات","اطلب من المدير العام مراجعة كل المتطلبات للتأكد من أن جميع المشاريع سوف تقدم المنتجات المطلوبة","اطلب من الراعي زيادة الميزانية للتحقق مما إذا كانت كل احتياجات العمل مدرجة في المتطلبات"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":840,"q":"An organization has historically executed most projects using a predictive approach. The organization now wants to change over to an agile approach . Due to this change , the project manager is worried about the scope definition process for upcoming projects. What should the project manager do to ensure the scope is completely defined?","t":"S","o":["Meet with the general manager and convince them to return to use the predictive approach to avoid any risk.","Help sponsors and stakeholders craft the product vision and bring the team and product owner together to clarify the expectations.","Ask the general manager to review every requirement to ensure that all projects will deliver the required products .","Ask the sponsor to increase a budget to check if every business needs are included in the requirements."],"c":[1],"f":"The project manager should help sponsors and stakeholders craft the product vision and bring the team and product owner together to clarify the expectations to ensure the scope is completely defined in agile approach.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":761}},{"qa":"يشعر العميل بالقلق بشأن الوقت اللازم لإكمال المشروع ويطلب من فريق المشروع تقليل عدد التكرارات المطلوبة لإكمال المنتج. ما هو النهج الذي يجب أن يتبعه مدير المشروع؟","oa":["حدد أولويات المهام ذات المخاطر العالية لتقليل عدد التكرارات المطلوبة","تحديد أولويات التسليمات بناءً على قيمة الأعمال وتحديد الإصدارات المتكررة","اطلب من الفريق تحدي تقديرات المشروع من أجل التسليم بشكل أسرع","اطلب من الفريق إثارة الحواجز أو العوائق في الاجتماعات اليومية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":841,"q":"A customer is concerned about the time required to complete a project and is asking the project team to reduce the number of iterations required to complete the product. Which approach should the project manager take?","t":"S","o":["Prioritize the tasks with high risks to reduce the number of iterations required.","Prioritize deliverables based on business value and define frequent releases.","Ask the team to challenge the project estimations for faster delivery.","Ask the team to raise blockers or impediments in daily meetings."],"c":[1],"f":"The project team want to reduce the number of iterations required to complete the product so the project manager should Prioritize deliverables based on business value and define frequent releases","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":765}},{"qa":"يواجه الفريق المرن تحديًا يتعلق بجودة مخرجاته. في كل مرة يتم ترقية إحدى الميزات إلى مرحلة الإنتاج، تظهر العديد من العيوب، مما يمنع العملاء من استخدام الحل بشكل صحيح. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لتجنب هذا الوضع في المستقبل؟","oa":["قم بإنشاء برنامج حوافز للفريق بجوائز، مما يسمح لأعضاء الفريق بالعمل الإضافي للعثور على العيوب","قم بتقليل دورة الإصدار واستثمر المزيد من الوقت في الميزات الحالية بدلاً من إصدار ميزات جديدة","قم بتعيين متخصص في ضمان الجودة ودمج المرحلة الثانية من الاختبار في دورة حياة المشروع الحالية","استخدم العرض الاسترجاعي التالي لفهم السبب الجذري لمشاكل الجودة واطلب من الفريق وضع خطة عمل"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":842,"q":"An agile team is facing a challenge with the quality of its deliverables. Every time a feature is promoted to production, many defects arise, preventing the customers from properly using the solution. What should the project manager do to avoid this situation in the future?","t":"S","o":["Create a team incentive program with prizes, allowing the team members to work overtime to find defects","Reduce the release cycle and invest more time on the current features instead of releasing new ones","Hire a quality assurance specialist and integrate a second phase of testing into the current project life cycle","Use the next retrospective to understand the root cause of the quality issues and have the team come up with an action plan."],"c":[3],"f":"Many defects arise, preventing the customers from properly using the solution so the project manager should Use the next retrospective to understand the root cause of the quality issues and have the team come up with an action plan and to avoid this situation in the future.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":769}},{"qa":"بدأ فريق المشروع العمل في مشروع معقد يتضمن تكنولوجيا جديدة كمنتج. الفريق جديد على التكنولوجيا والنهج المقترح. بالإضافة إلى ذلك، يشعر العميل بالقلق بشأن كيفية استلام المنتج في السوق. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لمساعدة الفريق والعميل؟","oa":["إدارة المخاطر المرتبطة بالنهج المقترح","ساعد الفريق في تحديد الحد الأدنى من المنتج القابل للتطبيق للتحقق من صحة الافتراضات","العمل بشكل وثيق مع فريق التسويق في أبحاث السوق وقطاعات المنتجات","التنسيق مع وحدة الأعمال للحصول على المتطلبات التفصيلية"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":843,"q":"A project team began working on a complex project that involves new technology as a product. The team is new to the technology and the proposed approach. Additionally, the customer is apprehensive about how the product will be received in the market. What should the project manager do to help the team and the customer?","t":"S","o":["Manage the risks associated with the proposed approach.","Assist the team with identifying the minimum viable product(MVP) to validate assumptions.","Work closely with the marketing team on market research and product segments.","Coordinate with the business unit to get detailed requirements."],"c":[1],"f":"The team is new to the technology and the proposed approach in additional to the customer is apprehensive about how the product will be received , so the project manager should Assist the team with identifying the minimum viable product(MVP) to validate assumptions.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":771}},{"qa":"قدم مالك المنتج سجل اعمال المنتج إلى الفريق، وأثار الفريق مخاوف بشأن تنفيذ بعض الميزات بسبب عوائق مختلفة. ما الذي يجب أن يقترحه مدير المشروع على مالك المنتج أن يفعله بعد ذلك؟","oa":["تأكد من التقاط العوائق وترتيب أولوياتها بناءً على الميزات الأعلى قيمة","تقدير الأثر المالي للعوائق وطلب تمويل إضافي","التقاط العوائق وإبلاغ الإدارة بأن مساعدتهم مطلوبة في حل العوائق","ابدأ بإزالة العوائق، بدءًا بالأسهل أولاً، لتعزيز إنجازات الفريق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":844,"q":"A product owner presented the backlog to the team, and the team raised concerns over implementing some of the features due to various impediments. What should the project manager suggest that the product owner do next?","t":"S","o":["Ensure that the impediments are captured and prioritized based upon the highest valued features","Estimate the financial impact of the impediments and request additional funding","Capture the impediments and inform management that their assistance is needed in resolving the impediments","Begin to remove the impediments, starting with the easiest ones first, to foster team accomplishment"],"c":[0],"f":"The project manager should suggest that the product ownerEnsure that the impediments are captured and prioritized based upon the highest valued features to reduce team concerns over implementing some of the features due to various impediments.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":777}},{"qa":"يريد مدير المشروع قياس السرعة كمؤشر على تقدم الفريق الرشيق. أي من المقاييس التالية من الأفضل أن يستخدمها مدير المشروع لهذا الغرض؟","oa":["عدد نقاط القصة المخطط إكمالها في التكرار التالي","عدد التكرارات التي أكملها الفريق لكل إصدار","عدد نقاط قصة المستخدم التي أكملها الفريق يوميًا","عدد نقاط قصة المستخدم التي أكملها الفريق لكل تكرار"],"rat":null,"fa":"يتم حساب السرعة عادةً على أنها مجموع أحجام نقاط القصة للميزات المكتملة فعليًا أثناء التكرار. دليل ممارسة Agile -PMI، الصفحة (الصفحات) 61، 64","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":845,"q":"A project manager wants to measure velocity as the indicator of the agile team's progress. Which of the following metrics is best for the project manager to use for this purpose?","t":"S","o":["The number of story points planned to be completed in the next iteration","The number of iterations completed by the team per release","The number of user story points completed by the team per day","The number of user story points completed by the team per iteration"],"c":[3],"f":"Velocity is typically calculated as the sum of story points sizes for the features actually completed during an iteration. Agile Practice Guide -PMI, Page(s) 61, 64","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":780}},{"qa":"تم تعيين مدير مشروع لخط إنتاج رقمي جديد، والذي تأمل الشركة أن يعزز إيراداتها. المنتج معقد ويتطلب تعليقات العملاء لتحسين المنتج باستمرار. يتم التعامل مع المشروع من قبل فريق رشيق متعدد الوظائف. ما الذي يجب على مدير المشروع فعله لضمان تسليم القيمة بسرعة؟","oa":["تحديد المهام التي يمكن تشغيلها بالتوازي لتسليم المشروع بشكل أسرع","خطط للمشروع لتقديم القيمة بشكل تدريجي من خلال الإصدارات المنتظمة","اطلب من راعي المشروع توفير موارد إضافية لتسريع المشروع","اطلب زيادة في الميزانية لدفع رواتب الخبراء المتخصصين بالإضافة إلى الوقت"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":846,"q":"A project manager has been assigned to a new digital product line, which the company hopes will boost their revenue. The product is complex and requires customer feedback to continually refine the product The project is being handled by across-functional agile team. What should the project manager do to ensure value is delivered quickly?","t":"S","o":["Identify tasks that can run in parallel to deliver the project faster","Plan the project to deliver value incrementally with regular releases","Ask the project sponsor to provide additional resources to fast-track the project.","Request a budget increase to pay the subject matter experts (SMEs) moreover time"],"c":[1],"f":"One means of delivering value sooner rather than later is via incremental delivery. Early and regular incremental releases lead to higher customer value and an increased market share.\nDividing the product into increments enables parts or elements of the product to be in the hands of customers prior to full delivery of the product.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":804}},{"qa":"يطلب أحد المعنيين من جون الأسكرم ماستر (مدير المشروع فى النهج الرشيق) أن يُظهر له أحدث تقرير حالة أسبوعي للتحقق من صحة المشروع ومقدار العمل المتبقي في المشروع. بدلاً من ذلك، يأخذ جون المعنيين إلى جدار الفريق حيث يتم نشر بعض التحديثات ذات الصلة بشكل مستمر. لمعالجة استفسار المعنيين، يشير جون على وجه التحديد إلى","oa":["مخطط الحرق التنازلى Burndown chart","سجل أعمال التكرار Sprint backlog","لوحة كانبان","اتجاه السرعة"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":847,"q":"A stakeholder requests John the Scrum Master, to show him the latest weekly status report to check the project's health and the remaining amount of work in the project. Instead, John takes the stakeholder to the team wall where a few pertinent updates are posted continuously. To address the stakeholder's query, John specifically points out to","t":"S","o":["Burndown chart","Sprint backlog","Kanban board","Velocity trend"],"c":[0],"f":"A burndown chart shows the amount of work that has been completed in a sprint, and the total work remaining.","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":815}},{"qa":"مدير مشروع يعمل مع الفريق لتطوير تطبيق برمجي. نظرًا لحالات الفشل التي حدثت في تطبيقات مماثلة في الماضي، فإن التعليقات السريعة من العميل حول مدى ملاءمة التسليمات مهمة جدًا. ما هو النهج الأفضل الذي ينبغي اختياره؟","oa":["شلال","تقليدي","تكيفى","تنبؤي"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":848,"q":"A project manager working with the team to develop a software application. Due to failures in similar applications in the past, the rapid feedback from the customer on the suitability of the deliverables is very important. What is the best approach that should be selected?","t":"S","o":["Waterfall","Traditional","Adaptive","Predictive"],"c":[2],"f":"An adaptive approach is a generic term for various project management approaches typically used on agile projects. This approach promotes the work to be undertaken in short cycles so that the results can be reviewed early and adapted as necessary. Of the choices provided, the adaptive approach is the only one that would provide rapid feedback on the suitability of the deliverables making this choice the best answer to the question","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":827}},{"qa":"وفقًا لمخطط الحرق الموضح أدناه، ماذا حدث في اليوم السابع؟","oa":["انخفضت سرعة الفريق","تمت إزالة العمل من النطاق","زادت سرعة الفريق","تمت إضافة العمل إلى النطاق"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":849,"q":"As per the burn up chart shown below, what happened at day 7?","t":"S","o":["The team velocity decreased","Work was removed from the scope","The team velocity increased","Work was added to the scope"],"c":[1],"f":"At day 7, 2 points were removed from the scope, bringing the total in the backlog to 30 points so The right option is that work was removed from the scope.\n\nBut if in another scenario in real exam what is happend in 4 or 5 or 6 day the correct answer the scope has been increased.","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":835}},{"qa":null,"oa":null,"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":850,"q":"The value of the features completed to date is $100,000. The actual cost expended to date is $107,000. The team planned on completing 32 story points by this time and have actually\ncompleted 33 story points. Which of the following options are true?\n(Choose two)","t":"M","o":["SPI=1.03","SPI=0.96","CPI=1.03","CPI=0.93"],"c":[0,3],"f":"🔹 Given:\n\n \n Earned Value (EV) = $100,000 (Value of features completed to date)\n \n \n Actual Cost (AC) = $107,000 (Actual cost to date)\n \n \n Planned Story Points = 32\n \n \n Actual Story Points Completed = 33\n \n\n➡️ Answer CPI=0.93 is correct.\n\n✅ 2. SPI (Schedule Performance Index)\n\nHere, SPI is calculated using story points because we're using agile metrics.\n\n so SPI=1.03","ap":"agile","dm":"people","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1"},{"qa":"ما النتيجة الرئيسية لاجتماع مراجعة التكرار (Sprint Review)؟","oa":["هدف الاسبرنت (التكرار ) كما تم الاتفاق عليه بين مالك المنتج والفريق","جزء مكتمل من المنتج","قائمة عناصر سجل اعمال المنتج مرتبة حسب الأولوية","يقوم الفريق بوضع الصياغة النهائية لسجل Sprint Backlog الخاص بالتكرار القادم"],"rat":null,"fa":null,"svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":851,"q":"What is the main outcome of a Sprint Review?","t":"S","o":["A sprint goal as agreed upon by the product owner and team","An increment of the product","A prioritized list of backlog items","The team finalizes the Sprint Backlog for the next Sprint."],"c":[0],"f":"🔹 Domain: Process\n\n🔹 Approach: Agile\n\n🔹 Importance:\nImportant, because it tests your understanding of Scrum events and the distinction between Sprint Review, Sprint Planning, Increment, and Product Backlog updates.\n\n🔹 Keywords:\nSprint Review – sprint goal – product owner – team\n\nThe Sprint Review is held to inspect what was completed during the Sprint and determine whether the Sprint Goal was achieved, while gathering stakeholder feedback and discussing what to do next.\nIn this question, the best answer is the sprint goal as agreed upon by the product owner and team, because the essence of the Sprint Review is checking completed work against the agreed goal.\n\nIt is important to distinguish among these ideas:\n\n The increment is produced during the Sprint\n Product Backlog reprioritization may be influenced by the review\n The next Sprint Backlog is finalized during Sprint Planning\n The Sprint Review focuses on completed work and goal achievement\n\n🔹 Example:\nA team is building a banking app, and the Sprint Goal is enabling fingerprint login. During the Sprint Review, the team demonstrates the feature to the product owner and stakeholders to confirm the goal was actually achieved. The main outcome here is validation of the Sprint Goal, not finalizing the next Sprint Backlog.\n\n🔹 Exam Tips:\nIf you see Sprint Review, think of demonstrating completed work, inspecting the goal, and collecting stakeholder feedback.\nIf the option mentions Increment only, be careful because the increment is a Sprint deliverable, not the meeting outcome itself.\nIf the option mentions finalizing the next Sprint Backlog, that points to Sprint Planning.\nIf the exam rephrases the question as What does the team inspect with stakeholders at the end of the Sprint? the answer will likely relate to completed work or Sprint Goal achievement.\nIf it asks What is updated after the Sprint Review? the answer may be the Product Backlog, not the Sprint Goal.\n\nReferences \n\n Agile Practice Guide, page 53–59\n PMBOK Guide Seventh Edition, page 131–135\n Examination Content Outline 2026, page 10–13\n PMBOK Guide Sixth Edition, page 756–761","ap":"agile","dm":"process","ch":"Change-Driven Life Cycle ( Adaptive/Agile)","ex":"PMP VIP 1","referenceMergeSource":{"repo":"MohamedSAttia/PMP-N","commit":"cd59db17d10e013490d22808c4eb83f00647b577","path":"index.html","url":"https://pmp-n.vercel.app/","index":872}},{"qa":"خلال السبرنت الثالث، يتصادم مطوّران خبيران مرارًا حول التصميم التقني وبدأ التوتر يبطئ الفريق. بصفتك قائدًا خادمًا، ما أول ما تفعله؟","oa":["صعّد الخلاف إلى مديريهما الوظيفيين.","يسّر جلسة تعاونية ليطرحا مصالحهما ويصلا لحلٍّ مشترك.","احسم التصميم بنفسك توفيرًا للوقت.","استبعد أحد المطوّرَين من الفريق."],"rat":[{"e":"Escalation is premature and removes team ownership.","a":"التصعيد سابق لأوانه ويسلب الفريق مسؤوليته."},{"e":"Correct — collaboration yields a win-win and preserves team cohesion.","a":"صحيح — التعاون يحقّق مكسبًا للطرفين ويحافظ على تماسك الفريق."},{"e":"Forcing damages morale and buy-in.","a":"الفرض يضرّ بالروح المعنوية والالتزام."},{"e":"Removing talent is a last resort, not a first action.","a":"استبعاد الكفاءات ملاذ أخير لا إجراء أول."}],"fa":"التعاون/حل المشكلة هو الأسلوب المفضّل لإدارة الصراع؛ القائد الخادم ييسّر الحوار للوصول إلى توافق قبل التصعيد أو الفرض.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":852,"t":"S","dm":"people","ap":"agile","ch":"Al Saeed Authored","ex":"Al Saeed Authored","q":"During the third sprint, two senior developers repeatedly clash over the technical design, and the tension is now slowing the team down. As the servant-leader, what should you do FIRST?","o":["Escalate the conflict to their functional managers.","Facilitate a collaborative session so they surface interests and reach a shared solution.","Decide the design yourself to save time.","Remove one developer from the team."],"c":[1],"f":"Collaborate/problem-solve is the preferred conflict approach; the servant-leader facilitates dialogue toward consensus before escalating or forcing."},{"qa":"اُكتُشف نشاط جديد أثناء التنفيذ لا يؤثّر على تاريخ الانتهاء. ما الذي يجب أن يفعله مدير المشروع تاليًا؟","oa":["ابدأ العمل فورًا لأن تاريخ الانتهاء لن يتأثر.","قدّم طلب تغيير عبر الضبط المتكامل للتغيير.","حدّث خط الأساس الزمني مباشرةً.","اطلب موافقة الراعي شفهيًا."],"rat":[{"e":"Starting work without approval bypasses change control.","a":"بدء العمل دون موافقة يتجاوز ضبط التغيير."},{"e":"Correct — CR through Perform Integrated Change Control is required.","a":"صحيح — يلزم طلب تغيير عبر عملية الضبط المتكامل."},{"e":"Baselines change only after an approved CR.","a":"لا يتغيّر خط الأساس إلا بعد اعتماد طلب التغيير."},{"e":"Verbal approval is not valid governance.","a":"الموافقة الشفهية ليست حوكمة سليمة."}],"fa":"أي نطاق جديد—even لو لا يؤثّر على الزمن—يمرّ عبر الضبط المتكامل للتغيير قبل بدء العمل أو تحديث خط الأساس.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":853,"t":"S","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored","ex":"Al Saeed Authored","q":"A new activity is discovered during execution that does not affect the end date. What should the project manager do next?","o":["Begin the work immediately since the end date is unaffected.","Submit a change request through integrated change control.","Update the schedule baseline directly.","Ask the sponsor to approve it verbally."],"c":[1],"f":"Any new scope—even schedule-neutral—goes through integrated change control before work or baseline updates."},{"qa":"في منتصف التكرار، يبلّغ فريق الأمن الفريقَ بلائحة تنظيمية جديدة يجب أن يمتثل لها المنتج. أي إجراءين يتخذهما مدير المشروع؟ (اختر اثنين)","oa":["اطلب من فريق الأمن التفاصيل الدقيقة للّائحة.","أوقف التكرار فورًا.","اطلب من الفريق تحليل أثر إدراج هذه اللائحة.","أضِفها بصمت للإصدار التالي دون نقاش."],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — accurate details are needed before acting.","a":"صحيح — التفاصيل الدقيقة لازمة قبل التصرف."},{"e":"Halting the whole iteration is an overreaction.","a":"إيقاف التكرار كله ردّ فعل مبالغ فيه."},{"e":"Correct — impact analysis informs prioritization.","a":"صحيح — تحليل الأثر يوجّه ترتيب الأولويات."},{"e":"Skipping analysis and discussion is poor practice.","a":"تجاوز التحليل والنقاش ممارسة سيئة."}],"fa":"اجمع المتطلبات الدقيقة، ثم حلّل الأثر مع الفريق قبل إعادة ترتيب الأولويات مع مالك المنتج.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":854,"t":"M","dm":"people","ap":"agile","ch":"Al Saeed Authored","ex":"Al Saeed Authored","q":"Mid-iteration, the security team informs the team of a new regulation the product must comply with. Which TWO actions should the project manager take? (Choose two)","o":["Ask the security team for the detailed requirements of the regulation.","Immediately halt the iteration.","Ask the team to analyze the impact of including this regulation.","Add it silently to the next release without discussion."],"c":[0,2],"f":"Gather precise requirements, then analyze impact with the team before re-prioritizing with the product owner."},{"qa":"وصّل كل مصطلح من القيمة المكتسبة بمعناه الصحيح.","oa":["كفاءة الإنفاق (العمل المنجز لكل تكلفة)","كفاءة الجدول (المنجز مقابل المخطط)","تنبؤ التكلفة الكلية عند الاكتمال"],"rat":null,"fa":"CPI = EV/AC (كفاءة التكلفة)؛ SPI = EV/PV (كفاءة الجدول)؛ EAC = التكلفة الكلية المتوقعة.","svg":null,"prompts":[{"a":"CPI","e":"CPI"},{"a":"SPI","e":"SPI"},{"a":"EAC","e":"EAC"}],"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":855,"t":"MT","dm":"process","ap":"general","ch":"Al Saeed Authored","ex":"Al Saeed Authored","q":"Match each earned-value term to its correct meaning.","o":["Budget spent efficiency (work done per cost)","Schedule efficiency (work done vs planned)","Forecast of total cost at completion"],"c":[0,1,2],"f":"CPI = EV/AC (cost efficiency); SPI = EV/PV (schedule efficiency); EAC = forecast total cost."},{"qa":"وصّل كل دور من سكرم بمسؤوليته الأساسية.","oa":["يعظّم قيمة المنتج ويرتّب قائمة العمل","يدرّب الفريق ويزيل المعوقات","يبني الإصدار في كل سبرنت"],"rat":null,"fa":"مالك المنتج يرتّب العمل ويعظّم القيمة؛ سكرم ماستر يزيل المعوقات؛ المطوّرون يبنون الإصدار.","svg":null,"prompts":[{"a":"Product Owner","e":"مالك المنتج"},{"a":"Scrum Master","e":"سكرم ماستر"},{"a":"Developers","e":"المطوّرون"}],"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":856,"t":"MT","dm":"people","ap":"agile","ch":"Al Saeed Authored","ex":"Al Saeed Authored","q":"Match each Scrum role to its primary responsibility.","o":["Maximizes product value and orders the backlog","Coaches the team and removes impediments","Builds the increment each sprint"],"c":[0,1,2],"f":"Product Owner orders backlog & maximizes value; Scrum Master removes impediments; Developers build the increment."},{"qa":"في مخطط الشبكة: المسار A→C→E يستغرق 3+2+2=7 أيام، والمسار B→D→E يستغرق 5+4+2=11 يومًا. ما المسار الحرج؟","oa":["A → C → E","B → D → E","المساران متساويان","لا يمكن تحديده"],"rat":[{"e":"7 days is shorter — it has float, not critical.","a":"7 أيام أقصر — لديه طفو وليس حرجًا."},{"e":"Correct — 11 days is the longest path = critical path.","a":"صحيح — 11 يومًا هو الأطول = المسار الحرج."},{"e":"They are not equal (7 vs 11).","a":"ليسا متساويين (7 مقابل 11)."},{"e":"It can be determined from the durations.","a":"يمكن تحديده من المدد."}],"fa":"المسار الحرج هو الأطول عبر الشبكة (11 يومًا)، وهو الذي يحدّد أقل مدة للمشروع وله طفوٌ صفري.","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 190\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:460px;width:100%\">\n<defs><marker id=\"ar\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#5B6B84\"/></marker></defs>\n<style>.n{fill:#FFF4E2;stroke:#EA580C;stroke-width:2}.t{font:700 13px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#13294F}.d{font:600 11px Cairo;fill:#5B6B84}.e{stroke:#5B6B84;stroke-width:1.5;marker-end:url(#ar)}</style>\n<line class=\"e\" x1=\"70\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"45\"/><line class=\"e\" x1=\"70\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"145\"/>\n<line class=\"e\" x1=\"185\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"95\"/><line class=\"e\" x1=\"185\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"95\"/>\n<line class=\"e\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"95\"/>\n<rect class=\"n\" x=\"20\" y=\"25\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"45\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><text class=\"d\" x=\"45\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3d</text>\n<rect class=\"n\" x=\"20\" y=\"125\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"45\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B</text><text class=\"d\" x=\"45\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5d</text>\n<rect class=\"n\" x=\"130\" y=\"25\" width=\"55\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"157\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C</text><text class=\"d\" x=\"157\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2d</text>\n<rect class=\"n\" x=\"130\" y=\"125\" width=\"55\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"157\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\">D</text><text class=\"d\" x=\"157\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4d</text>\n<rect class=\"n\" x=\"245\" y=\"75\" width=\"55\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"272\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">E</text><text class=\"d\" x=\"272\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2d</text>\n<rect class=\"n\" x=\"350\" y=\"75\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"380\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Finish</text></svg>","prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":857,"t":"S","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored","ex":"Al Saeed Authored","q":"In the network diagram, path A→C→E takes 3+2+2=7 days and path B→D→E takes 5+4+2=11 days. Which is the critical path?","o":["A → C → E","B → D → E","Both paths equally","Cannot be determined"],"c":[1],"f":"The critical path is the longest path through the network (11 days), which determines the minimum project duration and has zero float."},{"qa":"بالنظر إلى مخطط الإنجاز التنازلي للسبرنت، يظل خط الأداء الفعلي أعلى من الخط المثالي معظم السبرنت. ماذا يدل ذلك؟","oa":["الفريق متقدّم عن الجدول.","الفريق متأخّر — العمل المتبقي أعلى من المثالي.","تم تقليص نطاق السبرنت.","السرعة لا علاقة لها بهذا المخطط."],"rat":[{"e":"Above ideal means behind, not ahead.","a":"فوق المثالي يعني متأخرًا لا متقدمًا."},{"e":"Correct — remaining work exceeds the ideal trend.","a":"صحيح — العمل المتبقي يتجاوز المسار المثالي."},{"e":"The chart shows remaining work, not scope cuts.","a":"المخطط يعرض العمل المتبقي لا تقليص النطاق."},{"e":"Burndown directly reflects velocity/throughput.","a":"الإنجاز التنازلي يعكس السرعة/الإنتاجية مباشرة."}],"fa":"عندما يبقى خط الإنجاز الفعلي أعلى من الخط المثالي، فإن العمل المتبقي أكبر من المخطط — الفريق متأخّر وقد لا يحقّق هدف السبرنت.","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 210\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:440px;width:100%\">\n<style>.ax{stroke:#94A3B8;stroke-width:1.5}.gl{font:600 11px Cairo;fill:#5B6B84}.id{stroke:#0D9488;stroke-width:2;stroke-dasharray:5 4;fill:none}.ac{stroke:#EA580C;stroke-width:2.5;fill:none}</style>\n<line class=\"ax\" x1=\"55\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"170\"/><line class=\"ax\" x1=\"55\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"170\"/>\n<text class=\"gl\" x=\"8\" y=\"30\">Work</text><text class=\"gl\" x=\"360\" y=\"188\">Time</text>\n<polyline class=\"id\" points=\"55,30 400,170\"/>\n<polyline class=\"ac\" points=\"55,30 110,55 165,60 220,95 275,140 330,150 400,170\"/>\n<circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"95\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#EA580C\"/><text class=\"gl\" x=\"228\" y=\"92\" fill=\"#EA580C\">actual</text>\n<text class=\"gl\" x=\"120\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#0D9488\">ideal</text></svg>","prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":858,"t":"S","dm":"process","ap":"agile","ch":"Al Saeed Authored","ex":"Al Saeed Authored","q":"Looking at the sprint burndown chart, the actual line is consistently ABOVE the ideal line for most of the sprint. What does this indicate?","o":["The team is ahead of schedule.","The team is behind — remaining work is higher than ideal.","The sprint scope was reduced.","Velocity has no relation to this chart."],"c":[1],"f":"When the actual burndown stays above the ideal line, more work remains than planned — the team is behind and may not meet the sprint goal."},{"qa":"أي وثيقتين تُعدّان وثائق عمل قد يوصي مدير المشروع بتحديثها لكنه لا يملكها؟ (اختر اثنين)","oa":["دراسة الجدوى/حالة العمل","ميثاق المشروع","خطة إدارة المنافع","سجل المخاطر"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — business case is a business document.","a":"صحيح — دراسة الجدوى وثيقة عمل."},{"e":"The charter is a project document owned by the PM/sponsor jointly.","a":"الميثاق وثيقة مشروع."},{"e":"Correct — benefits management plan is a business document.","a":"صحيح — خطة المنافع وثيقة عمل."},{"e":"The risk register is a project document.","a":"سجل المخاطر وثيقة مشروع."}],"fa":"دراسة الجدوى وخطة إدارة المنافع وثيقتا عمل يملكهما الراعي؛ يوصي مدير المشروع بتحديثهما دون امتلاكهما.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":859,"t":"M","dm":"business","ap":"general","ch":"Al Saeed Authored","ex":"Al Saeed Authored","q":"Which TWO documents are business documents that the project manager may recommend updates to but does NOT own? (Choose two)","o":["Business case","Project charter","Benefits management plan","Risk register"],"c":[0,2],"f":"The business case and benefits management plan are business documents owned by the sponsor; the PM may recommend but not update them."},{"qa":"أثناء الانطلاق، يبدي أصحاب المصلحة توقعات متضاربة حول ما يجب أن يقدّمه التطبيق أولًا. ما أول ما ينبغي أن يفعله مدير المشروع؟","oa":["تيسير ورشة لبناء رؤية مشتركة للمنتج ومواءمة الأولويات","ترك الفريقين الرشيقين يبدآن ببناء الميزة الأكثر طلبًا فورًا","تصعيد الخلاف إلى الراعي التنفيذي ليتخذ القرار","توثيق طلبات كل صاحب مصلحة في قائمة الأعمال والمضي لتخطيط السباق"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — align on a shared vision first so priorities have a reference.","a":"صحيح — المواءمة على رؤية مشتركة أولًا لتصبح للأولويات مرجعية."},{"e":"Building before alignment risks the wrong 'most-requested' feature and rework.","a":"البناء قبل المواءمة يخاطر ببناء الميزة الخطأ وإعادة العمل."},{"e":"Escalating abdicates the PM's facilitation role; the conflict is resolvable by alignment.","a":"التصعيد يتخلّى عن دور التيسير؛ الخلاف قابل للحل بالمواءمة."},{"e":"Logging requests without a vision just defers the conflict into the backlog.","a":"التوثيق دون رؤية يؤجّل الخلاف داخل قائمة الأعمال فقط."}],"fa":"الرؤية المشتركة تواءم التوقعات المتضاربة قبل بدء العمل؛ بدونها تفتقر قرارات الأولوية وقائمة الأعمال لمرجع. البدء بالبناء أو التصعيد أو مجرد التوثيق تتخطّى المواءمة التي تمنع إعادة العمل.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":900,"t":"S","dm":"people","ap":"hybrid","q":"During kickoff, stakeholders express conflicting expectations about what the app must deliver first. What should the project manager do FIRST?","o":["Facilitate a workshop to build and align on a shared product vision and priorities","Let the two Agile squads start building the most-requested feature immediately","Escalate the disagreement to the executive sponsor for a decision","Document each stakeholder's requests in the backlog and proceed to sprint planning"],"c":[0],"f":"A shared vision aligns conflicting expectations before work starts; without it, prioritization and backlog decisions lack a reference point. Building first, escalating, or just logging requests all skip the alignment that prevents rework."},{"qa":"تتراجع سرعة الفريق الجديد عبر أول ثلاثة سباقات. أي إجراءين يمثّلان أفضل استجابة للقيادة الخادمة؟ (اختر إجابتين)","oa":["العمل مع الفريق لتحديد المعوقات التي تبطئه وإزالتها","توجيه الفريق في التقدير والوتيرة المستدامة مع تركه ينظّم نفسه","زيادة التزام السباق لدفع الفريق لتسليم المزيد","إخضاع الأقل أداءً لرقابة إضافية وتقارير حالة يومية","استبدال Scrum Master لإعادة ضبط ديناميكية الفريق"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — removing impediments is core servant leadership.","a":"صحيح — إزالة المعوقات جوهر القيادة الخادمة."},{"e":"Correct — coaching + self-organization builds a sustainable, improving team.","a":"صحيح — التوجيه والتنظيم الذاتي يبني فريقًا مستدامًا يتحسّن."},{"e":"Pushing more commitment on a struggling new team worsens velocity and trust.","a":"دفع المزيد على فريق جديد يعاني يزيد تراجع السرعة والثقة سوءًا."},{"e":"Individual surveillance breaks psychological safety and self-organization.","a":"مراقبة الأفراد تكسر الأمان النفسي والتنظيم الذاتي."},{"e":"Swapping the SM mid-forming disrupts, not helps, a team still norming.","a":"استبدال SM أثناء التكوين يعطّل فريقًا ما زال يتشكّل."}],"fa":"القائد الخادم يزيل المعوقات ويوجّه نحو وتيرة مستدامة وتنظيم ذاتي. زيادة الالتزام أو مراقبة الأفراد أو تغيير الأدوار تعالج الأعراض وتضرّ الثقة — عكس تمكين فريق في طور التكوين.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":901,"t":"M","dm":"people","ap":"agile","q":"The new team's velocity is declining across the first three sprints. Which TWO actions are the BEST servant-leadership responses? (Choose two)","o":["Work with the team to identify and remove impediments slowing them down","Coach the team on estimation and sustainable pace, letting them self-organize","Increase the sprint commitment to push the team to deliver more","Assign the lowest performers additional oversight and daily status reports","Replace the Scrum Master to reset team dynamics"],"c":[0,1],"f":"Servant leaders remove impediments and coach toward a sustainable pace and self-organization. Pushing more commitment, surveilling individuals, or reshuffling roles treat symptoms and damage trust — the opposite of empowering a forming team."},{"qa":"موعد الإطلاق من البنك المركزي ثابت ولا يمكن تحريكه، لكن المسار التنبؤي متأخر (SPI = 0.88)، والنطاق أصلًا هو الحد الأدنى التنظيمي. ما أنسب إجراء على الجدول؟","oa":["ضغط المسار الحرج (Crashing) بإضافة موارد مؤهّلة لأنشطة الامتثال","المسار السريع (Fast-tracking) بتداخل اختبار الامتثال مع التكامل الأساسي","تقليص النطاق التنظيمي لاستعادة الجدول","تمديد موعد الإطلاق وطلب الموافقة رسميًا عبر ضبط التغيير"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — crashing adds resources to shorten the critical path with least added risk here.","a":"صحيح — الضغط يضيف موارد لتقصير المسار الحرج بأقل خطر إضافي هنا."},{"e":"Fast-tracking compliance testing in parallel raises rework/defect risk in a regulated deliverable.","a":"المسار السريع لاختبار الامتثال بالتوازي يرفع خطر إعادة العمل في مخرج تنظيمي."},{"e":"The scope is already the regulatory minimum — it cannot be cut.","a":"النطاق أصلًا الحد الأدنى التنظيمي — لا يمكن تقليصه."},{"e":"The central-bank date is fixed and cannot move.","a":"موعد البنك المركزي ثابت ولا يتحرّك."}],"fa":"مع موعد ثابت ونطاق أدنى وعمل امتثال لا يصح تداخله (المسار السريع لاختبار تنظيمي يضيف خطر إعادة عمل)، الضغط بإضافة موارد مؤهّلة يضغط المسار الحرج بأقل خطر. تقليص النطاق مستحيل (حد أدنى تنظيمي) والموعد لا يتحرّك.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":902,"t":"S","dm":"process","ap":"hybrid","q":"The central-bank go-live date is fixed and cannot move, yet the predictive workstream is behind (SPI = 0.88). Scope is already the regulatory minimum. What is the MOST appropriate schedule action?","o":["Crash the critical path by adding qualified resources to compliance activities","Fast-track by overlapping the compliance testing with core integration","Reduce the regulatory scope to recover the schedule","Extend the go-live date and formally request approval via change control"],"c":[0],"f":"With a fixed date, minimum scope, and compliance work that cannot safely overlap (fast-tracking regulatory testing adds rework risk), crashing by adding qualified resources compresses the critical path with the least risk. Scope cut is impossible (regulatory minimum) and the date cannot move."},{"qa":"بالرجوع إلى لوحة المؤشرات: مع SPI = 0.88 و CPI = 1.10، كيف تصف المسار التنبؤي للراعي؟","oa":["متأخر عن الجدول لكنه أقل من الميزانية","متقدّم على الجدول لكنه تجاوز الميزانية","متأخر عن الجدول ومتجاوز الميزانية","مطابق للجدول والميزانية"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — SPI<1 behind, CPI>1 under budget.","a":"صحيح — SPI<1 متأخر، CPI>1 أقل من الميزانية."},{"e":"Reversed — SPI<1 is behind, not ahead; CPI>1 is under, not over.","a":"معكوس — SPI<1 متأخر لا متقدّم؛ CPI>1 أقل لا أكثر."},{"e":"CPI>1 means under budget, not over.","a":"CPI>1 يعني أقل من الميزانية لا أكثر."},{"e":"SPI=0.88 is not on schedule.","a":"SPI=0.88 ليس مطابقًا للجدول."}],"fa":"SPI < 1 ← متأخر عن الجدول؛ CPI > 1 ← كفاءة تكلفة (أقل من الميزانية). إذن المسار متأخر عن الجدول لكنه أقل من الميزانية — إشارة شائعة للتفكير في الضغط (Crashing).","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 150\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:460px;width:100%\"><style>.b{fill:#EA580C}.g{fill:#0D9488}.t{font:700 13px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#1E2A3B}.s{font:600 11px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#5B6B84}</style><text class=\"t\" x=\"10\" y=\"22\">لوحة مؤشرات المسار التنبؤي</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"45\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#EEF2F8\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"45\" width=\"132\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" class=\"b\"/><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"63\">SPI = 0.88</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"90\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#EEF2F8\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"90\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" class=\"g\"/><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"108\">CPI = 1.10</text></svg>","prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":903,"t":"GR","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","q":"Refer to the workstream dashboard. With SPI = 0.88 and CPI = 1.10, how should you describe the predictive workstream to the sponsor?","o":["Behind schedule but under budget","Ahead of schedule but over budget","Behind schedule and over budget","On schedule and on budget"],"c":[0],"f":"SPI < 1 → behind schedule; CPI > 1 → cost-efficient (under budget). So the workstream is behind schedule but under budget — a common signal to consider crashing."},{"qa":"بخصوص فجوة إقامة البيانات المكتشفة حديثًا، وصّل كل استراتيجية استجابة للمخاطر بالإجراء الذي يمثّلها أفضل تمثيل.","oa":["نقل كل بيانات العملاء إلى مركز بيانات داخل الدولة معتمد لسدّ الفجوة","شراء تأمين ضدّ المسؤولية التنظيمية لتغطية الغرامات المحتملة","رفع الأمر إلى مجلس حوكمة البرنامج لأنه يتجاوز صلاحيتك","إعادة التصميم لتجنّب تخزين البيانات المقيّدة بالإقامة نهائيًا"],"rat":null,"fa":"تخفيف = تقليل الاحتمال/الأثر (مركز داخل الدولة). نقل = تحويل الأثر لطرف ثالث (تأمين). تصعيد = يتجاوز صلاحيتك ← الحوكمة. تجنّب = إزالة السبب (عدم تخزين البيانات).","svg":null,"prompts":[{"e":"Mitigate","a":"تخفيف"},{"e":"Transfer","a":"نقل"},{"e":"Escalate","a":"تصعيد"},{"e":"Avoid","a":"تجنّب"}],"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":904,"t":"MT","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","q":"For the newly discovered data-residency gap, match each risk RESPONSE strategy to the action that best represents it.","o":["Move all customer data to an in-country certified data center to close the gap","Buy regulatory-liability insurance to cover potential penalties","Raise the issue to the program governance board as it exceeds your authority","Redesign to avoid storing residency-restricted data altogether"],"c":[0,1,2,3],"f":"Mitigate = reduce probability/impact (in-country DC). Transfer = shift impact to a third party (insurance). Escalate = beyond your authority → governance. Avoid = eliminate the cause (don't store the data)."},{"qa":"لا يزال الراعي النافذ متشككًا ويؤثّر على آخرين ضدّ النهج الرشيق. ما أفضل إجراء لإشراكه؟","oa":["دعوة الراعي لمراجعة السباق القادمة ليرى الزيادات العاملة ويشكّل الأولويات","إرسال تقرير مكتوب مفصّل للراعي يدافع عن منهجية الرشاقة","الطلب من اللجنة التوجيهية تجاوز مخاوف الراعي","تقليل التواصل مع الراعي حتى تتوفّر مقاييس أكثر إيجابية"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — involvement + transparency converts skeptics better than argument.","a":"صحيح — الإشراك والشفافية يكسبان المتشكك أكثر من الجدل."},{"e":"A written defense argues at, not with, the sponsor — weak for a powerful skeptic.","a":"تقرير دفاعي يجادل الراعي لا يشركه — ضعيف مع متشكك نافذ."},{"e":"Overruling a powerful sponsor breeds resistance and political risk.","a":"تجاوز راعٍ نافذ يولّد مقاومة وخطرًا سياسيًا."},{"e":"Avoidance lets negative influence spread unchecked.","a":"التجنّب يترك التأثير السلبي ينتشر دون ضبط."}],"fa":"أفضل ما يحرّك صاحب مصلحة نافذًا متشككًا هو الإشراك المباشر والشفافية — رؤية زيادات عاملة حقيقية والتأثير في الأولويات يبني الملكية. الدفاع المكتوب أو التجاوز أو التجنّب يزيد المقاومة.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":905,"t":"S","dm":"people","ap":"general","q":"The powerful sponsor remains skeptical and is influencing others against the Agile approach. What is the BEST engagement move?","o":["Invite the sponsor to the next sprint review to see working increments and shape priorities","Send the sponsor a detailed written report defending the Agile methodology","Ask the executive steering committee to overrule the sponsor's concerns","Reduce contact with the sponsor until you have more positive metrics to show"],"c":[0],"f":"A skeptical, powerful stakeholder is best moved by direct involvement and transparency — seeing real working increments and influencing priorities builds ownership. Written defenses, overruling, or avoidance increase resistance."},{"qa":"رتّب خطوات التعامل مع مخاطرة الامتثال المكتشفة حديثًا بالترتيب الصحيح.","oa":["تسجيل المخاطرة وتوثيق سياقها","إجراء التحليل النوعي (احتمال × أثر)","تخطيط الاستجابة المناسبة للمخاطرة","تنفيذ الاستجابة وتحديث سجل المخاطر"],"rat":null,"fa":"الترتيب: تحديد/تسجيل ← تحليل (نوعي) ← تخطيط الاستجابة ← تنفيذ وتحديث السجل. تخطّي التحليل أو التصرّف قبل التخطيط يخاطر باستجابة غير مناسبة.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":906,"t":"OR","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","q":"Put the steps for handling the newly discovered compliance risk in the CORRECT order.","o":["Register the risk and document its context","Perform qualitative analysis (probability × impact)","Plan the appropriate risk response","Implement the response and update the risk register"],"c":[0,1,2,3],"f":"Order: identify/register → analyze (qualitative) → plan response → implement & update the register. Skipping analysis or acting before planning risks a mismatched response."},{"qa":"عليك تحديد كيفية تخصيص النهج المختلط. أي عاملين يبرّران أكثر إبقاء مسار الامتثال تنبؤيًا لا رشيقًا؟ (اختر إجابتين)","oa":["المتطلبات ثابتة بحكم التنظيم ومن غير المرجّح تغيّرها","موعد نهائي صارم مفروض خارجيًا يتطلّب معالم قابلة للتنبؤ وتوثيقًا","العميل يريد إصدارات متكررة لميزات الامتثال","نطاق الامتثال شديد عدم اليقين ويُتوقّع تطوّره","الفريقان يفضّلان العمل بالسباقات"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — fixed regulatory requirements suit a predictive plan.","a":"صحيح — متطلبات تنظيمية ثابتة تناسب خطة تنبؤية."},{"e":"Correct — a hard external deadline needs predictable, documented milestones.","a":"صحيح — موعد خارجي صارم يحتاج معالم موثّقة قابلة للتنبؤ."},{"e":"Frequent releases favor Agile, not predictive.","a":"الإصدارات المتكررة ترجّح الرشاقة لا التنبؤي."},{"e":"High uncertainty favors Agile's adaptivity, not predictive.","a":"عدم اليقين العالي يرجّح تكيّف الرشاقة لا التنبؤي."},{"e":"Team preference alone is not a tailoring driver.","a":"تفضيل الفريق وحده ليس محرّكًا للتخصيص."}],"fa":"التنبؤي يناسب متطلبات مستقرة ثابتة تنظيميًا ومواعيد صارمة مفروضة تتطلّب معالم موثّقة قابلة للتنبؤ. النطاق غير المؤكّد المتطوّر أو الرغبة في إصدارات متكررة يرجّحان الرشاقة؛ وتفضيل الفريق وحده لا يحكم التخصيص.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":907,"t":"M","dm":"process","ap":"hybrid","q":"You must decide how to tailor the hybrid approach. Which TWO factors MOST justify keeping the compliance workstream predictive rather than Agile? (Choose two)","o":["Requirements are fixed by regulation and unlikely to change","A hard, externally mandated deadline requires predictable milestones and documentation","The customer wants frequent releases of compliance features","The compliance scope is highly uncertain and expected to evolve","The squads prefer working in sprints"],"c":[0,1],"f":"Predictive fits stable, regulation-fixed requirements and hard mandated deadlines needing documented, predictable milestones. Uncertain/evolving scope or a desire for frequent releases would favor Agile; team preference alone doesn't drive tailoring."},{"qa":"المورّد الخارجي للمدفوعات، الواقع على المسار الحرج، يشير إلى تأخّر محتمل أسبوعين. ما أول ما ينبغي فعله؟","oa":["مراجعة العقد واتفاقية الشراء لفهم الحلول والالتزامات","البدء فورًا في البحث عن مورّد مدفوعات بديل","إضافة احتياطي جدول وإبلاغ الراعي بأن الموعد سيتأخّر","التصعيد إلى تنفيذيي المورّد للمطالبة بالتسليم في الموعد"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — understand contractual remedies/obligations before acting.","a":"صحيح — افهم الحلول والالتزامات التعاقدية قبل التصرّف."},{"e":"Sourcing a new vendor first may breach the current contract and waste time.","a":"البحث عن مورّد جديد أولًا قد يخالف العقد الحالي ويهدر الوقت."},{"e":"Conceding the fixed date prematurely skips remedies you may hold.","a":"التنازل عن الموعد الثابت مبكّرًا يتخطّى حلولًا قد تملكها."},{"e":"Escalation without knowing your contractual leverage is premature.","a":"التصعيد دون معرفة نفوذك التعاقدي سابق لأوانه."}],"fa":"في مخاطرة شراء، افهم أولًا الموقف التعاقدي (الالتزامات، الحلول، اتفاقيات الخدمة) قبل التصرّف. البحث عن بديل أو التنازل عن الموعد أو التصعيد المبكّر قد يخالف الاتفاق أو يهدر الجهد.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":908,"t":"S","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","q":"The third-party payment vendor, on the critical path, signals a possible two-week slip. What should the project manager do FIRST?","o":["Review the contract and procurement agreement to understand remedies and obligations","Immediately begin sourcing an alternative payment vendor","Add schedule reserve and inform the sponsor the date will slip","Escalate to the vendor's executives to demand on-time delivery"],"c":[0],"f":"For a procurement risk, first understand the contractual position (obligations, remedies, SLAs) before acting. Sourcing alternatives, conceding the date, or escalating prematurely may violate the agreement or waste effort."},{"qa":"يسأل الراعي كيف يضمن المشروع قيمة الامتثال التنظيمي المستمرة بعد الإطلاق. أي إجابة تعكس أفضل تفكيرًا في بيئة الأعمال؟","oa":["تحديد فوائد وضوابط الامتثال في خطة تحقيق الفوائد ومتابعتها بعد الإطلاق","إغلاق المشروع بمجرد اجتياز التطبيق تدقيق الإطلاق","نقل كامل مسؤولية الامتثال لفريق العمليات عند التسليم","تتبّع جدول المشروع وتكلفته فقط حتى الإطلاق"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — link to benefits realization and monitor compliance value post-launch.","a":"صحيح — الربط بتحقيق الفوائد ومتابعة قيمة الامتثال بعد الإطلاق."},{"e":"Passing an audit is a milestone, not sustained benefit realization.","a":"اجتياز التدقيق معلم وليس تحقيق فوائد مستدامًا."},{"e":"Dumping responsibility at handover breaks accountability for value.","a":"رمي المسؤولية عند التسليم يكسر المساءلة عن القيمة."},{"e":"Tracking only schedule/cost ignores business value and compliance.","a":"تتبّع الجدول/التكلفة فقط يتجاهل قيمة الأعمال والامتثال."}],"fa":"تفكير بيئة الأعمال يربط المخرجات بفوائد مستدامة وقيمة امتثال تتجاوز التسليم — تُوثَّق في خطة تحقيق الفوائد وتُتابَع بعد الإطلاق. الإغلاق أو رمي المسؤولية أو تتبّع الجدول/التكلفة فقط تتجاهل القيمة والامتثال المستمرّين.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case1","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":909,"t":"S","dm":"business","ap":"general","q":"The sponsor asks how the project ensures ongoing regulatory compliance value after go-live. Which response BEST reflects business-environment thinking?","o":["Define compliance benefits and controls in the benefits-realization plan and monitor them post-launch","Close the project once the app passes the go-live audit","Transfer all compliance responsibility to the operations team at handover","Track only project schedule and cost until go-live"],"c":[0],"f":"Business-environment thinking ties deliverables to sustained benefits and compliance value beyond delivery — captured in a benefits-realization plan and monitored after launch. Closing, dumping responsibility, or tracking only schedule/cost ignore ongoing value and compliance."},{"qa":"مطوّران في نزاع مفتوح حول المعمارية يعطّل الفريق. ما أول ما ينبغي أن يفعله Scrum Master؟","oa":["فهم مصدر النزاع وسياقه، ثم تيسير وصول الفريق إلى حل","حسم المعمارية بنفسه لإنهاء الخلاف بسرعة","تصعيد المطوّرَين للرئيس التنفيذي لاتخاذ إجراء تأديبي","الفصل بين المطوّرَين على أعمال مختلفة لتجنّب مزيد من الصدام"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — identify source/context, then facilitate resolution.","a":"صحيح — حدّد المصدر/السياق ثم يسّر الحل."},{"e":"Deciding for them removes team ownership and may pick the wrong design.","a":"الحسم نيابةً عنهم يزيل ملكية الفريق وقد يختار التصميم الخطأ."},{"e":"Jumping to discipline escalates a resolvable technical disagreement.","a":"القفز للتأديب يصعّد خلافًا تقنيًا قابلًا للحل."},{"e":"Separating them avoids, not resolves, the conflict.","a":"الفصل يتجنّب النزاع لا يحلّه."}],"fa":"إدارة النزاع تبدأ بتحديد المصدر/السياق ثم تيسير حل تشاركي (يُفضّل التعاون/حل المشكلة). الحسم نيابةً عنهم أو التصعيد التأديبي أو التجنّب بالفصل لا يعالج جذر المشكلة ولا يبني الفريق.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":910,"t":"S","dm":"people","ap":"agile","q":"Two developers are in open conflict over architecture, disrupting the team. What should the Scrum Master do FIRST?","o":["Understand the source and context of the conflict, then facilitate the team toward a resolution","Decide the architecture themselves to end the dispute quickly","Escalate both developers to the CEO for disciplinary action","Separate the developers onto different work to avoid further clashes"],"c":[0],"f":"Conflict management starts with identifying the source/context, then facilitating a collaborative resolution (ideally collaborate/problem-solve). Deciding for them, escalating to discipline, or avoiding via separation don't resolve the underlying issue or build the team."},{"qa":"يقول أصحاب المصلحة إن عروض السباق لا تطابق توقعاتهم، وتعريف «تمّ» لدى الفريق غير متّسق. ما أفضل إجراء تصحيحي؟","oa":["تيسير اتفاق الفريق على تعريف «تمّ» واضح ومشترك ومعايير قبول","إضافة تفاصيل أكثر لكل قصة مستخدم قبل السباق التالي","جعل مالك المنتج يعتمد كل مهمة قبل بدئها","تمديد مدة السباق لإعطاء الفريق وقتًا أكثر لكل عنصر"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — a shared DoD + acceptance criteria aligns quality and expectations.","a":"صحيح — DoD مشترك ومعايير قبول يوائم الجودة والتوقعات."},{"e":"Over-detailing stories doesn't fix an inconsistent quality bar.","a":"تفصيل القصص لا يصلح معيار جودة غير متّسق."},{"e":"PO pre-approval of tasks breaks self-organization and misses DoD.","a":"اعتماد المالك للمهام يكسر التنظيم الذاتي ويفوّت DoD."},{"e":"Longer sprints don't create a shared definition of quality.","a":"السباقات الأطول لا تنشئ تعريفًا مشتركًا للجودة."}],"fa":"عدم اتساق المخرجات وعدم مطابقة التوقعات يشيران إلى تعريف «تمّ» ومعايير قبول ضعيفة/غير واضحة. ضبط DoD يوائم الجودة والتوقعات. تفاصيل القصص أو اعتماد المهام مسبقًا أو إطالة السباق لا تعالج غياب معيار الجودة المشترك.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":911,"t":"S","dm":"process","ap":"agile","q":"Stakeholders say sprint demos don't match expectations, and the team's Definition of Done is inconsistent. What is the BEST corrective action?","o":["Facilitate the team to agree a clear, shared Definition of Done and acceptance criteria","Add more detail to every user story before the next sprint","Have the product owner approve each task before it starts","Extend sprint length to give the team more time per item"],"c":[0],"f":"Inconsistent output and mismatched expectations point to a weak/shared-but-unclear Definition of Done and acceptance criteria. Fixing DoD aligns quality and expectations. More story detail, task pre-approval, or longer sprints don't address the missing shared quality bar."},{"qa":"إطلاق منافس يهدّد موقع المنتج في السوق. من منظور بيئة الأعمال، ما الذي ينبغي أن يوجّه قرار التحويل أكثر؟","oa":["إعادة تقييم حالة العمل والقيمة التي يقدّمها مُميِّز الذكاء الاصطناعي للعملاء","مدى سرعة الفريق في برمجة ميزة الذكاء الاصطناعي الجديدة","تفضيل المطوّرَين للمعمارية","عناصر قائمة الأعمال المتبقية في السباق الحالي"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — revisit business case/customer value to justify the pivot.","a":"صحيح — أعد تقييم حالة العمل/قيمة العميل لتبرير التحويل."},{"e":"Coding speed is execution, not the strategic basis for a pivot.","a":"سرعة البرمجة تنفيذ لا أساس استراتيجي للتحويل."},{"e":"Architecture preference is internal, not a market decision input.","a":"تفضيل المعمارية داخلي لا مدخل لقرار سوق."},{"e":"Remaining backlog is tactical, not the pivot rationale.","a":"قائمة الأعمال المتبقية تكتيكية لا مبرّر للتحويل."}],"fa":"تحوّل السوق محفّز بيئة أعمال: أعد النظر في حالة العمل وقيمة العميل قبل الالتزام بالتحويل. سرعة البرمجة أو جدل المعمارية الداخلي أو قائمة السباق تفاصيل تنفيذ لا مبرّرًا استراتيجيًا.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":912,"t":"S","dm":"business","ap":"agile","q":"A competitor's launch threatens the product's market position. From a business-environment view, what should MOST inform the pivot decision?","o":["Reassessing the business case and the value the AI differentiator delivers to customers","How quickly the team can code the new AI feature","The two developers' architecture preference","The current sprint's remaining backlog items"],"c":[0],"f":"A market shift is a business-environment trigger: revisit the business case and customer value before committing to a pivot. Coding speed, internal architecture debates, or current backlog are execution details, not the strategic justification."},{"qa":"يتجادل مالك المنتج وقائد المبيعات علنًا حول الأولويات، مربكين الفريق. ما أكثر نهج فعّالية؟","oa":["تيسير جلسة ترتيب أولويات بأسلوب متّفق عليه لتظهر قائمة أعمال واحدة مرتّبة","الطلب من الرئيس التنفيذي تحديد أولويات مَن تفوز","ترك الفريق يختار العناصر التي يبنيها كل سباق","التناوب في الأولويات بين القائدَين كل سباق"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — one ordered backlog via a transparent method resolves the conflict.","a":"صحيح — قائمة أعمال واحدة مرتّبة بأسلوب شفاف تحلّ التعارض."},{"e":"CEO fiat doesn't build lasting alignment or respect the PO role.","a":"حسم الرئيس لا يبني مواءمة دائمة ولا يحترم دور PO."},{"e":"Team picking features bypasses the PO's prioritization accountability.","a":"اختيار الفريق للميزات يتجاوز مساءلة PO عن الأولويات."},{"e":"Alternating priorities creates thrash and instability.","a":"تناوب الأولويات يخلق تذبذبًا وعدم استقرار."}],"fa":"قائمة أعمال واحدة مرتّبة يملكها PO، متّفق عليها بأسلوب ترتيب شفاف (مثل القيمة/MoSCoW)، تحلّ تعارض الأولويات. حسم الرئيس أو اختيار الفريق للميزات أو تناوب الأولويات يخلق عدم استقرار ويقوّض دور PO.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":913,"t":"S","dm":"people","ap":"agile","q":"The product owner and sales lead argue publicly about priorities, confusing the team. What is the MOST effective approach?","o":["Facilitate a prioritization session using an agreed method so a single ordered backlog emerges","Ask the CEO to name whose priorities win","Let the team choose which items to build each sprint","Alternate priorities between the two leaders each sprint"],"c":[0],"f":"A single ordered backlog owned by the PO, agreed via a transparent prioritization method (e.g., value/MoSCoW), resolves competing priorities. CEO fiat, team-picks-features, or alternating priorities create instability and undermine the PO role."},{"qa":"يطالب الرئيس التنفيذي بموعد تسليم مؤكّد لميزة الذكاء الاصطناعي وسط عدم يقين عالٍ. أي إجابتين توازنان بين الشفافية والرشاقة؟ (اختر إجابتين)","oa":["تقديم نطاق تنبؤ مبني على السرعة مع مستوى ثقة، يُحدَّث كل سباق","الالتزام بموعد ثابت الآن لإرضاء الرئيس","تسليم شريحة رفيعة شاملة مبكرًا للتحقق من الجدوى وتحسين التنبؤ","رفض إعطاء أي موعد لأن الرشاقة بلا مواعيد","الطلب من الفريق العمل الإضافي لضمان أبكر موعد ممكن"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — a confidence-based forecast range is transparent and honest.","a":"صحيح — نطاق تنبؤ قائم على الثقة شفاف وصادق."},{"e":"A fixed date under high uncertainty over-promises and risks trust.","a":"موعد ثابت تحت عدم يقين عالٍ يبالغ في الوعد ويخاطر بالثقة."},{"e":"Correct — an early thin slice validates feasibility and sharpens the forecast.","a":"صحيح — شريحة رفيعة مبكرة تتحقق من الجدوى وتحسّن التنبؤ."},{"e":"Refusing any date is unhelpful; forecasts are expected.","a":"رفض أي موعد غير مفيد؛ التنبؤات متوقّعة."},{"e":"Overtime guarantees nothing and harms sustainable pace.","a":"العمل الإضافي لا يضمن شيئًا ويضرّ الوتيرة المستدامة."}],"fa":"الشفافية + الرشاقة = تنبؤ بنطاق مع ثقة (يُحدَّث كل سباق) وتقليل المخاطرة بشريحة رفيعة مبكرة. الالتزام الثابت تحت عدم اليقين أو رفض أي موعد أو فرض العمل الإضافي تكسر الثقة أو الاستدامة.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":914,"t":"M","dm":"process","ap":"agile","q":"The CEO demands a firm delivery date for the new AI feature amid high uncertainty. Which TWO responses best balance transparency with agility? (Choose two)","o":["Provide a forecast range based on velocity with a confidence level, updated each sprint","Commit to a fixed date now to satisfy the CEO","Deliver a thin end-to-end slice early to validate feasibility and refine the forecast","Refuse to give any date because Agile has no deadlines","Ask the team to work overtime to guarantee the earliest possible date"],"c":[0,2],"f":"Transparency + agility = forecast a range with confidence (updated each sprint) and de-risk with an early thin slice. Fixed commitments under uncertainty, refusing any date, or forcing overtime all break trust or sustainability."},{"qa":"وصّل كل مقياس رشيق بما يقيسه أساسًا.","oa":["حجم العمل الذي ينجزه الفريق في السباق","الزمن من بدء العمل حتى التسليم","عناصر العمل المنجزة لكل وحدة زمن"],"rat":null,"fa":"السرعة = العمل المنجز لكل سباق؛ زمن الدورة/التسليم = مدة التسليم؛ الإنتاجية = العناصر المنجزة لكل وحدة زمن.","svg":null,"prompts":[{"e":"Velocity","a":"السرعة (Velocity)"},{"e":"Cycle time","a":"زمن الدورة (Cycle time)"},{"e":"Throughput","a":"الإنتاجية (Throughput)"}],"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":915,"t":"MT","dm":"process","ap":"agile","q":"Match each Agile metric to what it primarily measures.","o":["Amount of work a team completes per sprint","Time from work start to delivery","Work items completed per unit of time"],"c":[0,1,2],"f":"Velocity = work completed per sprint; Lead/Cycle time = duration to deliver; Throughput = items completed per time unit."},{"qa":"للتحوّل نحو ميزة الذكاء الاصطناعي، على الفريق إعادة ترتيب الأولويات. مَن المسؤول عن ترتيب قائمة أعمال المنتج؟","oa":["مالك المنتج (Product Owner)","Scrum Master","فريق التطوير","الرئيس التنفيذي"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — the PO owns and orders the product backlog.","a":"صحيح — PO يملك ويرتّب قائمة أعمال المنتج."},{"e":"The SM facilitates; they don't order the backlog.","a":"SM ييسّر؛ لا يرتّب القائمة."},{"e":"The dev team delivers items; it doesn't own priority order.","a":"فريق التطوير يسلّم العناصر؛ لا يملك ترتيب الأولوية."},{"e":"The CEO is a stakeholder providing input, not the backlog owner.","a":"الرئيس صاحب مصلحة يقدّم مدخلات لا مالكًا للقائمة."}],"fa":"مالك المنتج مسؤول عن تعظيم القيمة وترتيب قائمة أعمال المنتج، مع دمج مدخلات أصحاب المصلحة. SM ييسّر، والفريق يسلّم، والرئيس صاحب مصلحة — ولا أحد منهم يملك ترتيب القائمة.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":916,"t":"S","dm":"process","ap":"agile","q":"To pivot toward the AI feature, the team must reprioritize. Who is accountable for ordering the product backlog?","o":["The product owner","The Scrum Master","The development team","The CEO"],"c":[0],"f":"The product owner is accountable for maximizing value and ordering the product backlog, incorporating stakeholder input. The SM facilitates, the team delivers, and the CEO is a stakeholder — none owns backlog order."},{"qa":"بعد الاتفاق على التحوّل، يشعر بعض أعضاء الفريق بالقلق تجاه مجال الذكاء الاصطناعي الجديد الذي لم يعملوا فيه. أفضل استجابة قيادية أن:","oa":["دعم الفريق بوقت للتعلّم والعمل الثنائي والوصول للخبرة لبناء القدرة","توظيف فريق ذكاء اصطناعي خارجي ونقل الأعضاء الحاليين لغيره","إخبار الفريق بأن يتدبّر أمره حفاظًا على استقلاليته","خفض التوقعات وتمديد الجداول بهدوء دون إخبار أصحاب المصلحة"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — build capability via learning, pairing, and expertise.","a":"صحيح — ابنِ القدرة عبر التعلّم والعمل الثنائي والخبرة."},{"e":"Replacing the team destroys morale and knowledge.","a":"استبدال الفريق يدمّر المعنويات والمعرفة."},{"e":"'Figure it out' abandons the team under stress.","a":"«تدبّروا أمركم» تخلٍّ عن الفريق تحت الضغط."},{"e":"Hiding timeline changes violates transparency and trust.","a":"إخفاء تغيّر الجداول ينتهك الشفافية والثقة."}],"fa":"القائد الخادم يبني القدرة — وقت تعلّم، عمل ثنائي، إرشاد، وصول للخبرة — لينمو الفريق في المجال الجديد. استبدالهم أو التخلّي عنهم أو إخفاء تغيّر الجداول يضرّ الثقة والشفافية.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":917,"t":"S","dm":"people","ap":"agile","q":"After the pivot is agreed, some team members feel anxious about the new AI domain they haven't worked in. The BEST leadership response is to:","o":["Support the team with learning time, pairing, and access to expertise to build capability","Hire an external AI team and reassign current members elsewhere","Tell the team to figure it out to preserve their autonomy","Lower expectations and quietly extend timelines without telling stakeholders"],"c":[0],"f":"A servant leader builds capability — learning time, pairing, mentoring, expert access — so the team can grow into the new domain. Replacing them, abandoning them, or hiding timeline changes damage trust and transparency."},{"qa":"يُدخل التحوّل ذكاءً اصطناعيًا سيعالج بيانات العملاء. أي شاغلين من بيئة الأعمال يجب أن يعالجهما مدير المشروع استباقيًا؟ (اختر إجابتين)","oa":["خصوصية البيانات والامتثال التنظيمي لمعالجة الذكاء الاصطناعي لبيانات العملاء","الاستخدام الأخلاقي والمسؤول للذكاء الاصطناعي بما يوائم سياسة المنظمة","نظام ألوان واجهة ميزة الذكاء الاصطناعي","في أي سباق تُسلّم الميزة","لغة البرمجة المفضّلة للفريق"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — privacy/regulatory compliance for AI data processing.","a":"صحيح — الخصوصية/الامتثال لمعالجة بيانات الذكاء الاصطناعي."},{"e":"Correct — ethical, responsible-AI use per organizational policy.","a":"صحيح — الاستخدام الأخلاقي المسؤول وفق سياسة المنظمة."},{"e":"UI color is an execution detail, not a governance concern.","a":"لون الواجهة تفصيل تنفيذ لا شاغل حوكمة."},{"e":"Sprint timing is tactical scheduling, not business governance.","a":"توقيت السباق جدولة تكتيكية لا حوكمة أعمال."},{"e":"Language preference is an internal technical choice.","a":"تفضيل اللغة اختيار تقني داخلي."}],"fa":"واجبات بيئة الأعمال تشمل الخصوصية/الامتثال التنظيمي والاستخدام الأخلاقي المسؤول للذكاء الاصطناعي وفق السياسة. ألوان الواجهة وتوقيت السباق ولغة البرمجة تفاصيل تنفيذ لا شواغل حوكمة بيئة أعمال.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":918,"t":"M","dm":"business","ap":"general","q":"The pivot introduces AI that will process customer data. Which TWO business-environment concerns must the PM proactively address? (Choose two)","o":["Data-privacy and regulatory compliance for AI processing of customer data","Ethical and responsible-AI use aligned with organizational policy","The color scheme of the new AI feature's UI","Which sprint the feature lands in","The team's preferred programming language"],"c":[0,1],"f":"Business-environment duties include privacy/regulatory compliance and ethical, responsible-AI use per policy. UI colors, sprint timing, and language choice are execution details, not business-environment governance concerns."},{"qa":"أثناء التحوّل، ينمو نطاق الإصدار الحالي سباقًا بعد سباق (زحف النطاق). ما أفضل طريقة لضبطه في هذا السياق الرشيق؟","oa":["الإبقاء على قائمة أعمال واحدة مرتّبة واستخدام التوقيت الصندوقي بحيث تُوازَن العناصر الجديدة مقابل الحالية","تجميد قائمة الأعمال ورفض كل عنصر جديد حتى الإصدار","إضافة كل عنصر مطلوب وتمديد موعد الإصدار حسب الحاجة","تمرير كل عنصر جديد عبر لجنة ضبط تغيير رسمية"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — prioritized backlog + timeboxing trades new work against existing.","a":"صحيح — قائمة مرتّبة + توقيت صندوقي يوازن الجديد مقابل الحالي."},{"e":"Freezing the backlog kills Agile adaptivity.","a":"تجميد القائمة يقتل تكيّف الرشاقة."},{"e":"Adding everything and extending dates is the definition of creep.","a":"إضافة كل شيء وتمديد المواعيد هو تعريف الزحف."},{"e":"A formal CCB is a predictive control, mismatched to sprint cadence.","a":"لجنة الضبط الرسمية أداة تنبؤية لا تناسب إيقاع السباقات."}],"fa":"في الرشاقة، يُضبط النطاق بقائمة أعمال واحدة مرتّبة وتوقيت صندوقي: العمل الجديد مرحّب به لكنه يُوازَن مقابل عناصر أقل قيمة ضمن تكرارات ثابتة. التجميد يقتل التكيّف، والإضافة اللامحدودة تسبّب الزحف، ولجنة الضبط الرسمية أداة تنبؤية لا تناسب إيقاع السباقات.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":"case2","emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":919,"t":"S","dm":"process","ap":"agile","q":"During the pivot, scope for the current release is growing sprint over sprint (scope creep). What is the BEST way to control it in this Agile context?","o":["Keep a single prioritized backlog and use timeboxing so new items trade off against existing ones","Freeze the backlog and reject all new items until release","Add every requested item and extend the release date as needed","Route each new item through a formal change control board"],"c":[0],"f":"In Agile, scope is controlled by a single prioritized backlog and timeboxing: new work is welcome but must trade off against lower-value items within fixed iterations. Freezing kills adaptivity, unlimited additions cause creep, and a formal CCB is a predictive control not suited to sprint cadence."},{"qa":"في مصفوفة السلطة/الاهتمام، اضغط الربع الذي تضع فيه صاحب مصلحة ذا سلطة عالية واهتمام منخفض.","oa":["أبقِه راضيًا (سلطة عالية، اهتمام منخفض)","أدِرْه عن قرب (سلطة عالية، اهتمام عالٍ)","راقبه (سلطة منخفضة، اهتمام منخفض)","أبقِه مطّلعًا (سلطة منخفضة، اهتمام عالٍ)"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — high power, low interest = Keep Satisfied.","a":"صحيح — سلطة عالية، اهتمام منخفض = أبقِه راضيًا."},{"e":"That quadrant is high interest too — Manage Closely.","a":"هذا الربع اهتمامه عالٍ أيضًا — أدِرْه عن قرب."},{"e":"Low power doesn't match a high-power stakeholder.","a":"سلطة منخفضة لا تطابق صاحب سلطة عالية."},{"e":"High interest doesn't match a low-interest stakeholder.","a":"اهتمام عالٍ لا يطابق صاحب اهتمام منخفض."}],"fa":"سلطة عالية + اهتمام منخفض ← أبقِه راضيًا: اهتمام كافٍ لإبقائه راضيًا دون إفراط في إشراكه. عالٍ/عالٍ = أدِرْه عن قرب؛ منخفض/منخفض = راقبه؛ سلطة منخفضة/اهتمام عالٍ = أبقِه مطّلعًا.","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:320px;width:100%\"><style>.q{cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}.q:hover{opacity:.85}.lab{font:700 12px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#1E2A3B;pointer-events:none}.ax{font:600 11px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#5B6B84;pointer-events:none}</style><rect data-i=\"0\" class=\"q\" x=\"30\" y=\"30\" width=\"130\" height=\"115\" fill=\"#FFE9CC\" stroke=\"#EA580C\"/><text class=\"lab\" x=\"55\" y=\"92\">Keep Satisfied</text><rect data-i=\"1\" class=\"q\" x=\"160\" y=\"30\" width=\"130\" height=\"115\" fill=\"#FFF4E2\" stroke=\"#EA580C\"/><text class=\"lab\" x=\"185\" y=\"92\">Manage Closely</text><rect data-i=\"2\" class=\"q\" x=\"30\" y=\"145\" width=\"130\" height=\"115\" fill=\"#EEF2F8\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\"/><text class=\"lab\" x=\"70\" y=\"207\">Monitor</text><rect data-i=\"3\" class=\"q\" x=\"160\" y=\"145\" width=\"130\" height=\"115\" fill=\"#F0FDFA\" stroke=\"#0D9488\"/><text class=\"lab\" x=\"185\" y=\"207\">Keep Informed</text><text class=\"ax\" x=\"10\" y=\"90\" transform=\"rotate(-90 10,90)\">Power ↑</text><text class=\"ax\" x=\"120\" y=\"285\">Interest →</text></svg>","prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":930,"t":"HS","dm":"people","ap":"general","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"On the Power/Interest grid, click the quadrant where you should place a stakeholder with HIGH power and LOW interest.","o":["Keep Satisfied (high power, low interest)","Manage Closely (high power, high interest)","Monitor (low power, low interest)","Keep Informed (low power, high interest)"],"c":[0],"f":"High power + low interest → Keep Satisfied: give enough attention to keep them content without over-involving them. High/high = Manage Closely; low/low = Monitor; low power/high interest = Keep Informed."},{"qa":"في مصفوفة المخاطر، اضغط الخلية التي تمثّل مخاطرة عالية الاحتمال وعالية الأثر (أعلى أولوية).","oa":["احتمال عالٍ / أثر عالٍ (أحمر)","احتمال منخفض / أثر عالٍ (كهرماني)","احتمال عالٍ / أثر منخفض (كهرماني)","احتمال منخفض / أثر منخفض (أخضر)"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — high×high is the red, top-priority cell.","a":"صحيح — عالٍ×عالٍ هي الخلية الحمراء الأعلى أولوية."},{"e":"High impact but low probability is medium, not top.","a":"أثر عالٍ لكن احتمال منخفض متوسط لا الأعلى."},{"e":"High probability but low impact is medium, not top.","a":"احتمال عالٍ لكن أثر منخفض متوسط لا الأعلى."},{"e":"Low/low is the lowest priority.","a":"منخفض/منخفض أدنى أولوية."}],"fa":"أعلى أولوية = احتمال عالٍ × أثر عالٍ (المنطقة الحمراء) — تُعالَج أولًا بتخطيط الاستجابة. الخلايا الكهرمانية متوسطة؛ والخضراء منخفضة (غالبًا تُقبل).","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 240\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:300px;width:100%\"><style>.c{cursor:pointer}.c:hover{opacity:.8}.l{font:700 11px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#1E2A3B;pointer-events:none}.a{font:600 10px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#5B6B84;pointer-events:none}</style><rect data-i=\"2\" class=\"c\" x=\"40\" y=\"30\" width=\"110\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#FEF3C7\" stroke=\"#D97706\"/><text class=\"l\" x=\"55\" y=\"74\">P↑ / I↓</text><rect data-i=\"0\" class=\"c\" x=\"150\" y=\"30\" width=\"110\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#FECACA\" stroke=\"#DC2626\"/><text class=\"l\" x=\"175\" y=\"74\">P↑ / I↑</text><rect data-i=\"3\" class=\"c\" x=\"40\" y=\"110\" width=\"110\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#D1FAE5\" stroke=\"#059669\"/><text class=\"l\" x=\"55\" y=\"154\">P↓ / I↓</text><rect data-i=\"1\" class=\"c\" x=\"150\" y=\"110\" width=\"110\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#FEF3C7\" stroke=\"#D97706\"/><text class=\"l\" x=\"175\" y=\"154\">P↓ / I↑</text><text class=\"a\" x=\"14\" y=\"115\" transform=\"rotate(-90 14,115)\">Probability ↑</text><text class=\"a\" x=\"120\" y=\"212\">Impact →</text></svg>","prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":931,"t":"HS","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"On the risk matrix, click the cell representing a HIGH-probability, HIGH-impact risk (top priority).","o":["High probability / High impact (red)","Low probability / High impact (amber)","High probability / Low impact (amber)","Low probability / Low impact (green)"],"c":[0],"f":"Highest priority = high probability × high impact (red zone) — address first with response planning. The amber cells are medium; green is low priority (often accepted)."},{"qa":"أكمل الصيغة. مؤشر أداء التكلفة: CPI = EV ÷ ______","oa":[],"rat":null,"fa":"CPI = EV / AC (القيمة المكتسبة ÷ التكلفة الفعلية). CPI > 1 يعني كفاءة تكلفة (أقل من الميزانية).","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":["ac","actual cost","actualcost"],"acceptA":["ac","التكلفة الفعلية"],"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":932,"t":"FB","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"Complete the formula. Cost Performance Index: CPI = EV ÷ ______","o":[],"c":[],"f":"CPI = EV / AC (Earned Value ÷ Actual Cost). CPI > 1 means cost-efficient (under budget)."},{"qa":"أكمل الفراغ: في مخطط الشبكة، أطول مسار بطفوٍ كلّي صفري يُسمّى المسار ______.","oa":[],"rat":null,"fa":"المسار الحرج هو أطول مسار عبر الشبكة؛ طفوُه صفري ويحدّد أقل مدة للمشروع.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":["critical"],"acceptA":["الحرج","حرج"],"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":933,"t":"FB","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"Fill in the blank: In a network diagram, the longest path with zero total float is called the ______ path.","o":[],"c":[],"f":"The critical path is the longest path through the network; it has zero float and determines the minimum project duration."},{"qa":"رتّب خطوات الضبط المتكامل للتغيير بالترتيب الصحيح.","oa":["تسجيل طلب التغيير","تقييم الأثر على النطاق والجدول والتكلفة والمخاطر","قرار لجنة ضبط التغيير (موافقة/رفض/تأجيل)","تحديث الخطة وخطوط الأساس، ثم الإبلاغ"],"rat":null,"fa":"الترتيب: تسجيل ← تقييم الأثر ← قرار اللجنة ← تحديث خطوط الأساس والإبلاغ. التصرّف قبل تقييم الأثر أو قرار اللجنة يخالف ضبط التغيير.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":934,"t":"OR","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"Arrange the integrated change control steps in the CORRECT order.","o":["Record the change request","Assess impact on scope, schedule, cost, and risk","Decision by the change control board (approve/reject/defer)","Update the plan and baselines, then communicate"],"c":[0,1,2,3],"f":"Order: record → assess impact → CCB decision → update baselines & communicate. Acting before impact assessment or CCB decision violates change control."},{"qa":"يرتّب مخطّط تورنادو المخاطر حسب أثرها على تكلفة المشروع. أي متغيّر ينبغي أن يحظى بالاهتمام أولًا؟","oa":["سعر المورّد (أعرض شريط)","أجر العمالة (شريط متوسط)","تكلفة المواد (شريط ضيّق)","سعر العملة (أضيق شريط)"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — the widest (top) bar has the greatest cost impact.","a":"صحيح — أعرض شريط (الأعلى) هو الأكثر أثرًا على التكلفة."},{"e":"Medium bar = less impact than the widest.","a":"الشريط المتوسط أقل أثرًا من الأعرض."},{"e":"Narrow bar = small impact.","a":"الشريط الضيّق أثره صغير."},{"e":"Narrowest bar = least impact.","a":"أضيق شريط أقل أثرًا."}],"fa":"في مخطّط تورنادو، أعرض شريط في الأعلى هو الأكثر تأثيرًا على النتيجة، فيُعطى الاهتمام أولًا. والأشرطة الأضيق أقل تأثيرًا تدريجيًا.","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:420px;width:100%\"><style>.b{fill:#EA580C}.s{font:600 11px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#5B6B84}</style><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"30\" width=\"240\" height=\"24\" class=\"b\"/><text class=\"s\" x=\"335\" y=\"47\">سعر المورّد</text><rect x=\"130\" y=\"66\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" class=\"b\" opacity=\".8\"/><text class=\"s\" x=\"295\" y=\"83\">أجر العمالة</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"102\" width=\"100\" height=\"24\" class=\"b\" opacity=\".6\"/><text class=\"s\" x=\"265\" y=\"119\">تكلفة المواد</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"138\" width=\"60\" height=\"24\" class=\"b\" opacity=\".45\"/><text class=\"s\" x=\"245\" y=\"155\">سعر العملة</text></svg>","prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":935,"t":"GR","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"The tornado diagram ranks risks by impact on project cost. Which variable should receive attention FIRST?","o":["Vendor price (widest bar)","Labor rate (medium bar)","Material cost (narrow bar)","Currency rate (narrowest bar)"],"c":[0],"f":"In a tornado diagram, the widest bar at the top has the greatest impact on the outcome, so it gets attention first. Narrower bars have progressively less influence."},{"qa":"وصّل كل نوع عقد بالطرف الذي يتحمّل أكبر قدر من مخاطر التكلفة.","oa":["البائع يتحمّل أكبر مخاطر التكلفة","المشتري يتحمّل أكبر مخاطر التكلفة","مخاطرة مشتركة عبر حافز حول هدف"],"rat":null,"fa":"السعر الثابت (FP): البائع يتحمّل مخاطر التكلفة. التكلفة القابلة للسداد (CR): المشتري يتحمّلها. الحافز (مثل FPIF/CPIF): مخاطرة مشتركة حول هدف عبر صيغة الحافز.","svg":null,"prompts":[{"e":"Fixed-Price (FP)","a":"السعر الثابت (FP)"},{"e":"Cost-Reimbursable (CR)","a":"التكلفة القابلة للسداد (CR)"},{"e":"Incentive (FPIF/CPIF)","a":"الحافز (FPIF/CPIF)"}],"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":936,"t":"MT","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"Match each contract type to the party that bears the MOST cost risk.","o":["Seller bears the most cost risk","Buyer bears the most cost risk","Risk shared via incentive around a target"],"c":[0,1,2],"f":"Fixed-Price (FP): seller bears cost risk. Cost-Reimbursable (CR): buyer bears cost risk. Incentive (e.g., FPIF/CPIF): risk shared around a target via the incentive formula."},{"qa":"أي سلوكين يميّزان القائد الخادم أفضل تمييز؟ (اختر إجابتين)","oa":["يزيل المعوقات ليركّز الفريق على القيمة","ينمّي أعضاء الفريق ويطوّر قدراتهم","يوزّع كل المهام ويتتبّع إنتاج الأفراد عن كثب","يتخذ كل القرارات التقنية المهمة لتوفير الوقت","يعتمد كل إجراء قبل أن يمضي الفريق"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — removing impediments is core servant leadership.","a":"صحيح — إزالة المعوقات جوهر القيادة الخادمة."},{"e":"Correct — growing people's capability is central.","a":"صحيح — تنمية قدرات الأفراد محورية."},{"e":"Micromanaging output contradicts servant leadership.","a":"تتبّع الإنتاج بدقة يناقض القيادة الخادمة."},{"e":"Deciding everything removes team empowerment.","a":"حسم كل شيء يزيل تمكين الفريق."},{"e":"Approving every action blocks self-organization.","a":"اعتماد كل إجراء يعيق التنظيم الذاتي."}],"fa":"القائد الخادم يزيل المعوقات وينمّي الأفراد. سلوكيات التحكّم والسيطرة — توزيع كل المهام، حسم كل شيء، اعتماد كل إجراء — عكس القيادة الخادمة.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":937,"t":"M","dm":"people","ap":"agile","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"Which TWO behaviors best characterize a servant leader? (Choose two)","o":["Removes impediments so the team can focus on value","Develops team members and grows their capability","Assigns all tasks and tracks individual output closely","Makes all key technical decisions to save time","Approves every action before the team proceeds"],"c":[0,1],"f":"Servant leaders remove impediments and develop people. Command-and-control behaviors — assigning all tasks, deciding everything, approving every action — are the opposite of servant leadership."},{"qa":"باستخدام صناديق حالة المشروع، اسحب كل صندوق إلى النقطة على مخطط الإنجاز المتناقص (Burn-down) التي تشير فيها الحالة. تأكّد أن كل صندوق يقابل نقطة محدّدة على المخطط.","oa":["متقدّم على الجدول 1","متقدّم على الجدول 2","مطابق للجدول","متأخر عن الجدول"],"rat":null,"fa":"في مخطط الإنجاز المتناقص، الخط الفعلي فوق الخط المثالي يعني عملًا متبقيًا أكثر من المخطّط ← متأخر. وتحت الخط المثالي يعني عملًا متبقيًا أقل ← متقدّم. وعلى الخط = مطابق. النقطة A (450>400) متأخر؛ B (300=300) مطابق؛ C (100<150) متقدّم؛ D (50>0) متأخر.","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><style>.ax{stroke:#94A3B8;stroke-width:1}.gr{stroke:#E4EAF3;stroke-width:1}.actual{stroke:#2563EB;stroke-width:2.5;fill:none}.ideal{stroke:#E11D48;stroke-width:2.5;fill:none;stroke-dasharray:0}.lab{font:600 10px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#5B6B84}.pt{font:800 11px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#1E2A3B}.ttl{font:700 12px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#1E2A3B}</style><text class=\"ttl\" x=\"150\" y=\"18\">Project team A - Burn down chart</text><line class=\"ax\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"250\"/><line class=\"ax\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"250\"/><g class=\"gr\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"210\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"170\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"130\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"90\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"50\"/></g><text class=\"lab\" x=\"28\" y=\"254\">0</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"22\" y=\"214\">100</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"22\" y=\"174\">200</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"22\" y=\"134\">300</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"22\" y=\"94\">400</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"22\" y=\"54\">500</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"60\" y=\"268\">4/30</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"130\" y=\"268\">5/1</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"200\" y=\"268\">5/4</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"270\" y=\"268\">5/5</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"340\" y=\"268\">5/6</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"410\" y=\"268\">5/7</text><polyline class=\"ideal\" points=\"60,50 130,90 200,130 270,170 340,190 410,250\"/><polyline class=\"actual\" points=\"60,50 130,70 200,130 270,170 340,210 410,230\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"70\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2563EB\"/><text class=\"pt\" x=\"122\" y=\"62\">A</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"130\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2563EB\"/><text class=\"pt\" x=\"192\" y=\"122\">B</text><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"210\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2563EB\"/><text class=\"pt\" x=\"332\" y=\"202\">C</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"230\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2563EB\"/><text class=\"pt\" x=\"402\" y=\"222\">D</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"300\" y=\"42\">— Work Left (Hours)</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"300\" y=\"56\" fill=\"#E11D48\">— Ideal Burndown</text></svg>","prompts":[{"e":"Point A — 5/1 (actual 450 vs ideal 400)","a":"النقطة A — 5/1 (الفعلي 450 مقابل المثالي 400)"},{"e":"Point B — 5/4 (actual 300 vs ideal 300)","a":"النقطة B — 5/4 (الفعلي 300 مقابل المثالي 300)"},{"e":"Point C — 5/6 (actual 100 vs ideal 150)","a":"النقطة C — 5/6 (الفعلي 100 مقابل المثالي 150)"},{"e":"Point D — 5/7 (actual 50 vs ideal 0)","a":"النقطة D — 5/7 (الفعلي 50 مقابل المثالي 0)"}],"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":[3,2,0,3],"pdSentence":null,"id":940,"t":"EM","dm":"process","ap":"agile","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"Using the project status boxes, drag each box to the point on the burn-down chart where the project indicates that status. Ensure that each box corresponds to a specific point on the chart.","o":["Ahead of schedule 1","Ahead of schedule 2","On Schedule","Behind schedule"],"c":[0,1,2,3],"f":"On a burn-down chart, the ACTUAL line ABOVE the ideal line means more work remains than planned → behind schedule. BELOW the ideal line means less work remains than planned → ahead of schedule. ON the line = on schedule. Point A (450>400) behind; Point B (300=300) on schedule; Point C (100<150) ahead; Point D (50>0) behind."},{"qa":"تسبّب الدوران المرتفع للموظفين في مركز حلول الأعمال (BSC) في إحباط كبير لدى عملاء B2B، أساسًا بسبب فقدان المعلومات التاريخية المخزّنة في البريد الإلكتروني. وللتخفيف، يتبنّى المركز منصة Service Cloud لتعزيز وضوح استفسارات العملاء وإدارتها. ويُتوقّع أن يحقّق المشروع 10 ملايين دولار سنويًا وفق تمرين التخطيط السنوي، لكن حالة العمل المقدَّمة أظهرت 4 ملايين فقط من الفوائد. وعلى الراعي معالجة مخاوف مكتب تحوّل الأعمال والتواصل مع ممارس الرشاقة للتوضيح.\n\nبالرجوع إلى مصفوفة تتبّع المتطلبات: أي متطلبات تسهم أكثر في الـ 4 ملايين من الفائدة المخفَّضة؟ (اختر اثنين)","oa":["RQ001 — وظائف جاهزة لخدمة عملاء B2B تعالج المشكلات الفورية باستخدام المنصة بدل البريد","RQ002 — تسريع تحويل البريد وتقليل عدد الرسائل التي تتطلّب تدخّل موظف","RQ003 — تحسين سرعة حلّ رسائل البريد وضمان ردود في وقتها","RQ004 — تحليلات متقدمة تشمل ذكاء الأعمال ووضوح استخدام الحل","RQ005 — تصنيف آلي للحالات بالذكاء الاصطناعي وتوليد أفضل رد وتلخيص الحالات","RQ006 — استبيانات رضا بعد كل حالة وتصعيد آلي"],"rat":[{"e":"Enabling baseline functionality — necessary but not the largest benefit driver.","a":"وظائف أساسية تمكينية — ضرورية لكنها ليست أكبر محرّك للفائدة."},{"e":"Correct — deflection directly removes agent effort = major cost benefit.","a":"صحيح — التحويل يزيل جهد الموظف مباشرةً = فائدة تكلفة كبرى."},{"e":"Improves speed but still requires agent handling.","a":"يحسّن السرعة لكنه ما زال يتطلّب معالجة الموظف."},{"e":"Analytics give visibility, not direct benefit realization.","a":"التحليلات تعطي وضوحًا لا تحقيقًا مباشرًا للفائدة."},{"e":"Correct — AI classification/summarization removes manual handling at scale.","a":"صحيح — التصنيف والتلخيص بالذكاء الاصطناعي يزيلان المعالجة اليدوية على نطاق واسع."},{"e":"CSAT surveys measure satisfaction; they don't drive the $ benefit.","a":"استبيانات الرضا تقيس الرضا ولا تحقّق الفائدة المالية."}],"fa":"المشكلة المذكورة هي فقدان المعلومات التاريخية في البريد وحجم الاستفسارات المعتمدة عليه. RQ002 (تحويل البريد وتقليل تدخّل الموظف) و RQ005 (التصنيف الآلي وتوليد الردود والتلخيص) يزيلان مباشرةً المعالجة اليدوية للبريد — وهو أكبر محرّك لفائدة تكلفة العمالة. أما RQ001/RQ003 فتمكينية أو تدريجية، و RQ004/RQ006 يضيفان وضوحًا وقياسًا لا قيمة فائدة مباشرة.","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 230\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:560px;width:100%\"><style>.hdr{font:700 10px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#fff}.cell{font:400 9px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#1E2A3B}.id{font:700 9px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#1E2A3B}.tab{font:700 10px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#1E2A3B}</style><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"560\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#F1F5FB\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"2\" width=\"170\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\"/><text class=\"tab\" x=\"12\" y=\"15\">Requirements Traceability Matrix</text><rect x=\"178\" y=\"2\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#E4EAF3\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\"/><text class=\"tab\" x=\"186\" y=\"15\">Excerpt from Plan</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"28\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#334155\"/><text class=\"hdr\" x=\"12\" y=\"42\">Requirement ID</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"28\" width=\"472\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#334155\"/><text class=\"hdr\" x=\"92\" y=\"42\">Requirement Description</text><g><rect x=\"4\" y=\"48\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"id\" x=\"24\" y=\"66\">RQ001</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"48\" width=\"472\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"cell\" x=\"90\" y=\"60\">Out-of-the-box functionality for B2B customer service immediate</text><text class=\"cell\" x=\"90\" y=\"71\">issues with staff using the platform instead of emails</text></g><g><rect x=\"4\" y=\"76\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F8FAFC\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"id\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\">RQ002</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"76\" width=\"472\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F8FAFC\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"cell\" x=\"90\" y=\"90\">Accelerate email deflection, reducing emails requiring agent intervention</text></g><g><rect x=\"4\" y=\"96\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"id\" x=\"24\" y=\"110\">RQ003</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"96\" width=\"472\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"cell\" x=\"90\" y=\"110\">Improve email resolution speed, ensuring timely customer responses</text></g><g><rect x=\"4\" y=\"116\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F8FAFC\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"id\" x=\"24\" y=\"130\">RQ004</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"116\" width=\"472\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F8FAFC\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"cell\" x=\"90\" y=\"130\">Advanced analytics including BI and solution usage visibility</text></g><g><rect x=\"4\" y=\"136\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"id\" x=\"24\" y=\"150\">RQ005</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"136\" width=\"472\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"cell\" x=\"90\" y=\"150\">AI automated case classification, best reply generation, case summarization</text></g><g><rect x=\"4\" y=\"156\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F8FAFC\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"id\" x=\"24\" y=\"170\">RQ006</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"156\" width=\"472\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#F8FAFC\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text class=\"cell\" x=\"90\" y=\"170\">CSAT surveys after each case and automated escalation</text></g></svg>","prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":941,"t":"GRM","dm":"business","ap":"agile","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"The high staff turnover at the Business Solutions Center (BSC) has caused significant frustration among B2B customers, primarily due to the loss of historical information stored in email. To mitigate this, the BSC is adopting a Service Cloud platform to enhance the visibility and management of customer queries. The project is expected to deliver $10 million annually according to the annual planning exercise, but the business case presented only demonstrated $4 million in benefits. The business sponsor needs to address concerns from the Business Transformation Office and engage with the agile practitioner for clarification.\n\nRefer to the Requirements Traceability Matrix. Which specific requirements contribute the MOST to the $4 million in reduced benefit? (Choose two)","o":["RQ001 — Out-of-the-box functionality for B2B customer service immediate issues with staff using the platform instead of emails","RQ002 — Accelerate email deflection, reducing the number of emails requiring agent intervention","RQ003 — Improve email resolution speed, ensuring timely customer responses","RQ004 — Advanced analytics including BI and solution usage visibility","RQ005 — AI automated case classification, best reply generation, and case summarization","RQ006 — CSAT surveys after each case and automated escalation"],"c":[1,4],"f":"The stated problem is loss of historical information in email and the volume of email-driven queries. RQ002 (email deflection reducing agent intervention) and RQ005 (AI case classification, reply generation, summarization) directly remove manual email handling — the largest labor-cost benefit driver. RQ001/RQ003 are enabling or incremental; RQ004 and RQ006 add visibility and measurement, not direct benefit value."},{"qa":"أكمل الجملة باختيار المستند الصحيح من القائمة.","oa":["خطة إدارة المتطلبات","خطة إدارة التكلفة","خطة إدارة النطاق","خطة إدارة الجدول الزمني","خطة إدارة التغيير","خطة إدارة الجودة"],"rat":[{"e":"Defines how requirements are analyzed and traced, not durations.","a":"تحدّد كيفية تحليل المتطلبات وتتبّعها لا المدد."},{"e":"Governs budgeting and cost control, not activity sequencing.","a":"تحكم الموازنة وضبط التكلفة لا تسلسل الأنشطة."},{"e":"Defines scope definition/validation, not durations or dependencies.","a":"تحدّد تعريف النطاق والتحقق منه لا المدد والاعتماديات."},{"e":"Correct — activities, durations and dependencies are schedule elements.","a":"صحيح — الأنشطة والمدد والاعتماديات عناصر جدول."},{"e":"Governs change requests and approvals.","a":"تحكم طلبات التغيير والموافقات."},{"e":"Governs quality standards and assurance.","a":"تحكم معايير الجودة وضمانها."}],"fa":"الأنشطة والمدد التقديرية والاعتماديات عناصر جدول زمني — تحكمها خطة إدارة الجدول الزمني. خطتا المتطلبات والنطاق تحدّدان ما يُسلَّم؛ وخطط التكلفة والتغيير والجودة تحكم مجالات معرفة أخرى.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":{"e":"The plan includes the activities, estimated durations and dependencies. This is the ______.","a":"تتضمّن الخطة الأنشطة والمدد التقديرية والاعتماديات. هذه هي ______."},"id":942,"t":"PD","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"Complete the sentence by selecting the correct document from the list.","o":["Requirements Management Plan","Cost Management Plan","Scope Management Plan","Schedule Management Plan","Change Management Plan","Quality Management Plan"],"c":[3],"f":"Activities, estimated durations and dependencies are schedule elements — governed by the Schedule Management Plan. Requirements/Scope plans define what is delivered; Cost, Change and Quality plans govern other knowledge areas."},{"qa":"أكمل الجملة باختيار الدور الصحيح من القائمة.","oa":["Scrum Master","مالك المنتج (Product Owner)","فريق التطوير","راعي المشروع","المدير الوظيفي"],"rat":[{"e":"Facilitates the process and removes impediments.","a":"ييسّر العملية ويزيل المعوقات."},{"e":"Correct — owns value maximization and backlog order.","a":"صحيح — يملك تعظيم القيمة وترتيب القائمة."},{"e":"Delivers the increment; does not own priority.","a":"يسلّم الزيادة؛ لا يملك الأولوية."},{"e":"Funds and champions the project.","a":"يموّل المشروع ويدعمه."},{"e":"Owns functional resources, not the backlog.","a":"يملك الموارد الوظيفية لا قائمة الأعمال."}],"fa":"مالك المنتج مسؤول عن تعظيم القيمة وترتيب قائمة أعمال المنتج. Scrum Master ييسّر ويزيل المعوقات؛ وفريق التطوير يسلّم؛ والراعي يموّل ويدعم؛ والمدير الوظيفي يملك الموارد.","svg":null,"prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":{"e":"The person accountable for maximizing product value and ordering the backlog is the ______.","a":"الشخص المسؤول عن تعظيم قيمة المنتج وترتيب قائمة الأعمال هو ______."},"id":943,"t":"PD","dm":"people","ap":"agile","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"Complete the sentence by selecting the correct role from the list.","o":["Scrum Master","Product Owner","Development Team","Project Sponsor","Functional Manager"],"c":[1],"f":"The Product Owner is accountable for maximizing value and ordering the product backlog. The Scrum Master facilitates and removes impediments; the Development Team delivers; the Sponsor funds and champions; the Functional Manager owns resources."},{"qa":"اضغط في المكان الصحيح: منطقة المنحنى (S-curve) التي حقّق فيها التخفيف أكبر انخفاض في الاحتمال التراكمي لتجاوز التكلفة.","oa":["المنطقة A — المنتصف الحاد حول 7,000–8,000 دولار حيث يتباعد المنحنيان أكثر ما يكون","المنطقة B — الذيل العلوي فوق 9,000 دولار حيث يتقارب المنحنيان قرب 100%","المنطقة C — الذيل السفلي تحت 6,000 دولار حيث المنحنيان قرب 0%","المنطقة D — أقصى اليمين حيث يلتقي المنحنيان"],"rat":[{"e":"Correct — widest vertical gap = largest probability reduction.","a":"صحيح — أوسع فجوة رأسية = أكبر انخفاض في الاحتمال."},{"e":"Curves converge near 100% — minimal difference.","a":"المنحنيان يتقاربان قرب 100% — فرق ضئيل."},{"e":"Curves converge near 0% — minimal difference.","a":"المنحنيان يتقاربان قرب 0% — فرق ضئيل."},{"e":"Where curves meet the difference is zero.","a":"حيث يلتقي المنحنيان يكون الفرق صفرًا."}],"fa":"أثر التخفيف يكون أكبر حيث تتّسع الفجوة الرأسية بين منحنى «قبل» ومنحنى «بعد» — أي منتصف المنحنى الحاد. وعند الطرفين يتقارب المنحنيان (قرب 0% وقرب 100%) فيكون الانخفاض ضئيلًا.","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:460px;width:100%\"><style>.ax{stroke:#94A3B8}.gr{stroke:#EEF2F8}.lab{font:600 9px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#5B6B84}.rg{cursor:pointer;fill:transparent;stroke:#94A3B8;stroke-dasharray:4 3;stroke-width:1.5}.rg:hover{fill:rgba(249,115,22,.12)}.rl{font:800 11px Cairo,sans-serif;fill:#1E2A3B;pointer-events:none}</style><line class=\"ax\" x1=\"55\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"240\"/><line class=\"ax\" x1=\"55\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"240\"/><text class=\"lab\" x=\"24\" y=\"30\">100%</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"30\" y=\"85\">75%</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"30\" y=\"140\">50%</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"30\" y=\"195\">25%</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"34\" y=\"243\">0%</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"60\" y=\"256\">$5.5k</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"140\" y=\"256\">$6.5k</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"220\" y=\"256\">$7.5k</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"300\" y=\"256\">$8.5k</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"380\" y=\"256\">$9.5k</text><path d=\"M55,238 C120,236 170,200 215,120 C260,45 320,28 440,24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563EB\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M55,239 C140,238 200,215 255,140 C300,70 350,32 440,25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E11D48\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect class=\"rg\" data-i=\"0\" x=\"175\" y=\"70\" width=\"105\" height=\"120\"/><text class=\"rl\" x=\"220\" y=\"135\">A</text><rect class=\"rg\" data-i=\"1\" x=\"300\" y=\"18\" width=\"110\" height=\"55\"/><text class=\"rl\" x=\"350\" y=\"50\">B</text><rect class=\"rg\" data-i=\"2\" x=\"60\" y=\"195\" width=\"105\" height=\"45\"/><text class=\"rl\" x=\"108\" y=\"222\">C</text><rect class=\"rg\" data-i=\"3\" x=\"410\" y=\"14\" width=\"45\" height=\"40\"/><text class=\"rl\" x=\"428\" y=\"38\">D</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"300\" y=\"278\">— Before Mitigation</text><text class=\"lab\" x=\"300\" y=\"292\" fill=\"#E11D48\">— After Mitigation</text></svg>","prompts":null,"accept":null,"acceptA":null,"caseId":null,"emMap":null,"pdSentence":null,"id":944,"t":"HS","dm":"process","ap":"predictive","ch":"Al Saeed Authored — v8","ex":"Al Saeed 2026","q":"Click in the correct spot: the region of the S-curve where the mitigation produced the LARGEST reduction in cumulative probability of cost overrun.","o":["Region A — the steep mid-range around $7,000–$8,000 where the curves diverge most","Region B — the upper tail above $9,000 where both curves converge near 100%","Region C — the lower tail below $6,000 where both curves are near 0%","Region D — the extreme right where the curves meet"],"c":[0],"f":"The mitigation's effect is greatest where the vertical gap between the 'before' and 'after' curves is widest — the steep middle of the S-curve. At both tails the curves converge (near 0% and near 100%), so the reduction there is minimal."}];
